        StaticBook("*Co-Op Taverns*The Waterfell (Lore)", "jeddeliso", "The Waterfell is a beautiful tavern infront of the Al'Khazar gates Owned and ran by Jed Goldrush, who happens to be the head of Co-Op businesses The Waterfell happen to be not just a shop, but something that Jed Goldrush has dreamt of in his dreams to show to people, what being a true halfling be , the love for nature while still being a heart of a human The Waterfell is one of the cheapest, high quality taverns you could find in Aegis! In this place you should find the true fun of nature, with the overflow of water to the green lushes of nature. The Waterfell is one of the most nature loving tavern you could find!", ""),
        StaticBook("*Cuc'mucy's Adventures*", "cucmucy", "I started out in the Cloud Temple Of Aegis, From there I walked into the Sanhar Not Knowing where I was going from there.  Not knowing one day I would be a Warlord, only to fall back to recruit again. After awhile I guess I seemed to disappear to people, neither here nor there and so I gave up on the Guardians.;;", ""),
        StaticBook("*Damp, torn parchment with a black feather protruding from the pages.*", "Xanivic", "The 'Eye'. It always watches. It always haunts. Unseen, furtive as can be. \n The light has died, left not a spark. \n You will now descend into the lifeless dark. ( The ink begins to fade as you read the eerie text.. )", ""),
        StaticBook("*Deamonic scribilings*", "Blundermore", "The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end time s will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The e nd times will come. The end times will come. The end times will come. The end times will c ome. The end times will come. the end times will come. The end times will come. The end timed will come. He spoke to me... but i will not go back. no never. He spoke to me and i listened. Why did i listen? He smiled as he said that one scentence. *random scriblings* oh god... He spoke to me. About flames and fire. this land is doomed... like my home land. It is too late. He is already here... Forgiveness will not save me. Perhaps it is fate? Fate might be the truth that I do not want to hear... Before the end we will meet again? Who will i meet? My brothers? Or... oh gods... not him! no t him again! I will not go back. no. Never again... you fool... you can not escape me so easily... what? did i just write that? ne.., never mind... just a slip of the brain... I must be getting worked up over nothing. oh come now Blundermore.... You know it was me... No. I WILL NOT GO BACK! NEVER\"! *there are holes where someone has stabbed a quill through the book*", ""),
