        StaticBook("100 High -Rules", "AutarchCosmos", "How to play 100 High\n Step 1. Place your bet (Give the slips you bet to the dealer.)\n Step 2. Roll a 1000 sided die.\n Step 3. Look at your score. \n - Score lower than 700, You lose.\n - Score between 700 and 900, You win.\n - Score equal to 900 or above, You win double your bet.\n Step 4. Collect your winnings! (Not guaranteed to win every round.)", ""),
        StaticBook("100 Ways to Klomp", "MuckyD121", "1. 'It From Behind 2. If it be skeleton trap It n Corner and It it fast 3. If Pigman, go underwater agh attack from under 4. If Blaze, bring to water and Klomp! 5. If Zombie, it it fast agh it 'ont 'it lat 6. If Big Slime, Arch it, or klomp n run, -repeat- 7. If Small slime 'it it it ont even urt ya! 8. If in Arena, stay quick! 9. Kill small slimes a lot 10. Small slimes = exp agh minas easy... After all this you should have leveled in attacking 11. Make a Better Zult, Lusk, Armour Follow steps 1-10 over and Over Graudually Lat will get better Lusks, Zults agh Armour and will Klomp Edery TIN! Dabu faw Elpin lat!", ""),
        StaticBook("101 ways to cook bread", "TehLulu", "The best way to cook bread, as well all know, is in an oven. But there are many types of ovens, like brick ovens. Also, the temperature is important! If you cook it too hot it burns, if its too low it doesn't rise But temperature is important, also is how long you cook it. Here is a simple bread recipe. 3 cups wheats, 1 crafting table. Add the wheat to the crafting table in a horizontal fashion. Remove bread from the table. You have bread now! Current developments: There is a threat agains the Queen. There may not be one against the orc leader. There may be one agains the High Prince The Queen has been informed. The Queen's Bodyguard, Kayle, has apparently turned, having been arrested in the Isles the other night. It appears her other former bodyguard may be a threat to her as well. Elvador the Elf has a spy in the \"guild\" which our enemies are in. This spy is his brother, the only info he had to offer was that an attack would come in 1 month ((1 week IRL)) and that the enemies sought to open a portal. Apparently, the enemies wish a portal opened to get to the zombies inside it, and slay them. We will be approaching the Dwarves through an associate of mine concerning this matter The main problem is, according to our sources, Elvador is a member of the Dark Brotherhood Whom he claimed was simply a myth when Lafthi brought it up. We've decided to take all knowledge he feeds us with a grain of salt. No doubt there is a genuine threat against the Queen with her made ex guards But it is yet to be seen if there is a threat against anyone else. If there is, it could lead to the downfall of all of Aegis unless contained. *There are a bit of splattered, dark stains across this page* I've grown weak from the travel, but it is worth it, to ensure the safety of others'. Dalejin will be sending a man undercover with the enemies, who may or may not be the Dark Brotherhood. It has been confirmed that many ex-pathfinders, ex-rangers, and etc may be involved as the Pathfinders recently had a large number of deserters. And the Rangers were \"released\" from service. I find it odd that no dwarves seem to be involved or threatened in this yes I will have to speak to Legionnaire Rinscher as soon as I may End, the first day of this mess.", ""),
        StaticBook("12 Up -Rules", "AutarchCosmos", "How to play 12 Up\n Step 1. Pick a number from 14-18\n Step 2. Place your bet.\n Step 3. Roll a 6 sided die until your total is over 12.\n Step 4. If the total you reach is 13 you loose your bet.\n Step 5. If your total is equal to your chosen number, You win the bet.\n Step 6. If any other total is reached, noone wins or loses, You get your bet back.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("1367", "Novel", "Ranovak\nIt started on a dark night, the shadows had shroded the path and i knew I wasnt going anywhere\n It was too late", ""),
        StaticBook("17th of Amber Cold 1324: King's Road", "Jerry_Man", "Elindor patrolled king's road\nAn orc highwayman was holding up an elf. Same orc seen later ((mcname HolyRane or similar)) attempting to take a heavily armoured guard captive. Be aware on King's Rd near Alras. \nAlso sighted a couple men with diamond swords and iron armour attempting to rob travellers. Skilled swordsmen and organised. Take caution while on patrol. \n \nThe city of Aeriel is in dissarray. A tomb that displays signs of Iblees was discovered under the temple. I have recorded the insignia on the wall but the town appears to be locked up for the duration of a 'cleansing'.", ""),
        StaticBook("1st Generation Ancelime Family", "theKYLAN", "", ""),
        StaticBook("2387283", "Saviordude", "", ""),
        StaticBook("254 230 5818", "pugsy", "", ""),
        StaticBook("278391", "Saviordude", "", ""),
        StaticBook("3/4 of a Day with my Spirit", "Toastersaurus", "Icos tells me of how he feels every person and being that flows with him. He shows me how he feels and how to flow. He shows me the way he moves. He teaches me to be one with the water around us. I learn that water is very calm put powerful. I learn of the times he has stopped people from bad acts by using his force against then. Yeah your shout woke me from my meditation erase yeah your shout woke me from my meditation", ""),
        StaticBook("3094032", "Saviordude", "", ""),
        StaticBook("3872349", "Saviordude", "Can your hear it? The voices in the winds? War is coming. Soon, Aegis will be thrown into conflict the likes of which have never been seen before. On one side shall stand the descendants, the mortal races. Led by the Wizard, they shall stand united or fall. On the other side shall stand the Undead, the servants of Iblees. Guided by his fist, they shall swarm the land with their dark magic, killing anything that gets in their way, They will sweep through our kingdoms, an unstoppable juggernaunt. But there is hope. We must rise together and join as one. We must gather our arms, and muster any remaining courage we might have. So I ask you, reader, are you ready? Are you going to be among those who will banish the undead from this realm? \nAre you a hero?", ""),
        StaticBook("4th of July 2011", "Respiren", "And so it decreed that they should eat cake... and lo, it was not a lie.", ""),
        StaticBook("5th of Malin's Welcome", "Bursho", "The day was nice, beautiful in Snowy Fields. The snow glistened from the sun and even some winter birds chirped. As you looked towards the sky the clouds where as white as the fresh snow, but it was off. The air around the day seemed.... stiff, stagant almost. I was in my home, part of the Wolverine's forward base. When i was returning home, i heard it. Thunder cracked through the air as the sky became as dark as pitch. They were there when i came back to snowy fields, and a battle was rumbling by the gate. As the undead advanced they shot forth great balls of fire and pillars of lightning. The humans pushed forth from the gate thoughm and spilt their blood. I ran into the gate when this happened, and all hell had broken loose. It was chaos, everyone was yelling and running, even the wizards and templar. As the day continued, it became night, and more battles lashed out from the darkness. I dare say though, that the 5th of Malins Welcome shall be remebered as the Hold off. It is no the 8th, and this town is ruined, great spires have risen forth and spews of lava erupt from the ground.", ""),
        StaticBook("7829", "Saviordude", "Reader, heed my word for the age of dwarves is upon us! From the depths of Aegis a voice calls to me, telling me of what has and what will. Truely, we are creatures of the earth, and it is the earth to which we must turn out worship. But forsake not the trees, for even the tallest oak has it's roots dug deep into the soil. For it is the earth from which all life did come, and it is the earth to which all life must pay it's respects. Gather your fellows, and tell them of the call of the depths, for it is that which will save them. Cast out not the elves, nor the humans or the orcs. Though they be born of the surface, even they are children of the depths. They shall join us in our tribute to the stone, and to the fountain for life. For even the cloud temple draws upon the water of life and the magma of death, which together birth the stone of life. Go forth, my children, and spread the word of the call of the depths, and rejoice in it's embrace!", ""),
        StaticBook("8092409", "Saviordude", "A paladin is graceful, and will protect his allies with his life if need be. A paladin has humility, and understand to be truely great one must remain humble. A paladin is merciful, and will never willingly hurt a creature who is not evil. A paladin is peaceful, and will hold himself in a manner according to god's wishes. A paladin is prudent, and is aware of the strength of his allies, never placing them in a situation where they could be greatly harmed. A paladin is pure, and holds himself to a strict standard: Do no evil, lest ye become it. A paladin has temperance, and displays self-restraint in all their actions. A paladin is honest, and will never tell a grevious lie. A paladin is honorable, and holds himself to a high standard of combat. A paladin is an agent of justice, and most hold the law up to it's fullest extent. A paladin is patient, and will never rush in without thinking. A paladin has zeal, and must never turn down an honorable challenge.", ""),
        StaticBook("873782", "Saviordude", "A paladin is graceful, and will protect his ies with his life.", ""),
