        StaticBook("A warning...", "Ever", "Let your Brawn friend know that next time, I will not hesitate gutting him on my altar and eating his innards, should he choose to follow me to my residence again. I WILL have your blood upon my altar, know this... There...is no peace for you...you are damned...", ""),
        StaticBook("A Warriors View", "mason9108", "Well this book is made out to all the aspiring young battle field commanders. The first thing you should know, Is that not everyone is going to like you. So you need to win respect among your troops. \n There are a number of things you can do to gain respect among your troops. Here are some examples, Fight alongside you men, Buy them good weapons and ale. Things of tha t nature. During times of rest, if there is a problem among your men let them fight it out. it vents of steam Lastly remember to keep your men well stocked up on weapons. An armed soldier is a living soldier", ""),
        StaticBook("A Waterlogged Journal", "ilikepiefoo", "", ""),
        StaticBook("A wet book", "Alectriciti", "My journeys are long, the travels are far. The places I visit are very bizarre. Although I sounds great, like such a delight. My journeys are dreadful. Only darkness, no light. \n \n   I enter the city, filled with beauty and grace. But none of that mattered when I saw your face. A human of beauty, a wonderful fox. She stared out the window, looking at the docks. \n \n What happened right then, I can't quite explain.  I lost sense of guilt, sorrow and pain. My life's brand new chapter, it started that day. But as I reached for her heart, she pulled it away. \n \n    She was with another. A human in fact. Eyes teared up immensely, and I can't even act! \n \n I tried to escape, pretend it never occurred. Yet she stopped me in the water with just one single word. \n \n I know it occurred. I know he's with her. But it drives me INSANE to know she's so pure. \n \n And elf and a woman. Does it sound right? I love her. I do. I continue to fight! \n \n What I want to say next, I can't put in words. So I won't even try. Just know that Rhisereld always has my abundant love. That will never change. No matter how torn apart I become.  \n \n I want to pursue her, yet nowhere to look. Yet I stand here in the rain with this terrible book.", ""),
        StaticBook("A Wizard's Staff", "silco97", "A wizard's staff has a knob on the end it will never buckle, it never will bend he cherishes it and calls it his freind, and he frequently takes it in hand. \nA wizard's staff is his source of power.  He checks up on it every hour on the hour and he's never suprised when it turns to flower.  The fairest throughout all the land \nThe staff of a wizard can do mightly deeds.  It protects him from harm and attends to his needs, provides him with banquates upon which he feeds and potions on which he gets canned. Whenever a wizard is lonely or sad or feeling dejected, or puzzled, or mad, he turns to his staff ,and things don't seem so bad.  By is he never trepanned \nThe staff of a wizard is dear to his heart the source and succour of his magic art. They travel together, are never apart, a relationship few understand. \nThe wizard is rarley of heroic build were it not for his staff, he would surly be killed. Be deamons or monsters his blood would be spilled all over the pitless sand. \nA wizard in thought, word, and deed should be chaste if he is not, he's considered disgraced although in his dreams he often embraced by ladies both lossom and tanned. \nThe staff of a wizard is polished with care.  He anoints it with spices unguent rare,  Bedecks it silver and jewels most fair, and feast days he is japanned. \nA wizard when young has a staff that is small.  It's puny and weak, ineffective withal. It grows with his power until it stands tall as his fame and his glory expand. \nThe staff of a wizard can hold many spells for finding lost objects or dowsing new wells for banishing demons to bottomless hells or brining them back on demand. A wizard's staff can do manifold tricks to puzzle the nobles and fuddle the hicks it rescues the wizard from many a fix.  it is totally at his command. \nWhen a wizard is old, and is starting to fade he looks on his staff that with cunning he made. The crown of his life and the tools of his trade and tohether they make their last stand.", ""),
        StaticBook("A Worn Letter", "Groundhawg", "Hail Friend. \n \n \n I hope this letter finds you in good health. As I have just discovered something of yours. \n \n You never told me you were a ruler of a town... Aye friend, I have come across Deku in my travels. I was terribly confused when signs read \"Flynn's house\" I explored the town, your house. I failed to force the chest locks in your house there, but I did manage to force the lock on the furnace dome, breaking into the underhomes of the place I saw the rooms for the nobles' dogs, I saw the farms, and in fact I harvested the wheat and reeds. This note is written on your paper.. I explored the place thoroughly before breaking myself out. \n \n After cooking dinner in your aboveground home, I set off. Back to Al'Khazar, where I now sit likely drinking ale, by the time you read this. Though, I should get to the point of this message. \n \n Do you ever visit Deku? Is it still functioning? Could I find myself a part of this.. Brotherhood of yours? I honestly doubt Deku is still a functioning town, but I figured it's worth asking you about. \n \n \n Best regards friend. \n \n Gorund", ""),
        StaticBook("A Zombie's Obituary", "SapphireShard", "BRAAAINNNSSSS.... BRAIIINNNSSS... NEED... BRAINNSSSS.... *dribble covers the page*", ""),
        StaticBook("A_Mysterious_Scroll", "Riizu", "You...have been chosen...begin your path...to Ascension.", ""),
        StaticBook("AAAAAAAAAAAH", "regisnex", "hello there.... AHHH! CREEPER!!!!! Creeper goes boom..... D:", ""),
        StaticBook("Aaron's Final Words", "Xeniith", "These are my last farewells and apologies to those who played an important role in my life. My lost loves... My lost friends... My lost family, and home. I bid my careful farewells to all of you.... And to all of you I apologize. I apologize for the misery I brought upon you and your people. I apologize  for the lives I could have saved... But didn't. And most of all, I apologize for the darkness I brought upon this land. If you are reading this, it's unlikely you ever knew me... But merely heard the alias... The Lone Hunter.", ""),
        StaticBook("Aaron's Journal", "Xeniith", "Day 1 in Aegis: I recently arrived in Aegis, the people here seem to be very strange. There are very few who seem down to Earth. It seems there everyone is always trying to be the tough guy. I hate people who act as if they're hardening by physical and mental pain when there's real people who have been.... People like me, who have endured all of the worst and endure it every day. My mind is slowly drifting to pieces because of Xeniith, I want him out!  Day 5 in Aegis: I recently met a kind, yet naive young elf named Rattalyn. She seems so full of energy and life that it almost makes me forget my sorrows. If only I could. Day 15 in Aegis: I can't forget her, no matter what... I think I'm in love with her. I've never felt this way since I first met Alysia... I must declare my love for her soon, I can't keep it in anymore. Day 32 in Aegis: I told her what I felt, only for her to say that she didn't feel the same way that I did. I feel it again, the same thing I felt when I left Alysia. It's terrible. Day 42 in Aegis: Not long ago, I met Rattalyn's friend Torok, only to find that he is the one that Rattalyn loves. I feel so much rage inside of me right now, I can't stand it! I feel like I've lost something I've worked all of my life for. <Many pages have been torn out> Day 124 in Aegis: I feel so empty inside, I've lost Rattalyn, and my friend Whitesoul now. There's just... Nothing left for me anymore. There is no home for me. No place. Day 154 in Aegis: Sora. That's her name. The Sora I know... And have fallen in love with. I never thought I'd get over my lost loves... But here I am again. She seems just like me, her tortured life so similar to mine. It seemed as if it was love at first sight, and that's almost true. Day 193 in Aegis: I have proposed our marriage to Sora, and she accepted! We are to be married soon, our love will last forever. My sorrows are over now, so I have no reason to write this journal anymore. Day 234 in Aegis: Sora has disappeared, the love of my life, gone, again! When will this end? I think I'm just... Done living. I seem to have no reason left to live. I need to think about the actions I will take next. Day 283 in Aegis: I recently met with Xeniith again, and he suggested I become stronger... And darker. He wanted me to change myself, but I can't bring myself to a darker self. I still care about him, though, I can't stop that. He's just a confused person. Sometimes I regret removing him, though. Day 300 in Aegis: I lost yet another love of my life, Abreal. I promised her that our paths would meet again, but I didn't know what I was saying. I've been through enough in my life, and the Earth and sky beckon me. They pull me apart, and I can't take it anymore. I am going to die. If anyone is reading this, don't bother with your pity, because I'm gone now. <The rest of the page is covered in a blood-signature>", ""),
        StaticBook("Aaron's Journal - Page 1327", "Xeniith", "I can never forget the horrifying, bone-chilling day in which my family was murdered on. I don't think I'll ever be able to get over what happened. Ever since then, I lost my voice and started seeing these.... Horrifying demons.", ""),
        StaticBook("Aaron's Journal - Page 1376", "Xeniith", "The princess is safe from harm, all thanks to me, but why do I still feel so empty? I thought doing something for the greater good would cure my illness, but no. I don't think it can be fixed.  [[ Wtf", ""),
        StaticBook("Aaron's Journal - Page 1386", "Xeniith", "I lost everything of mine to bandits. I killed off most of them, while the others scuttled away with all of my gear. I feel proud of my astound defence... But I still feel empty inside.", ""),
        StaticBook("Aaron's Personal Diary", "Dinosaurx", "Ahad, 1st of the Secon seed, 1341 \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Abaddon's Journal", "JustinMC98", "Today was a good day I met an elven lady named Dom. I also gathered supplies for the clan. Tommorrow I shall take them to the keep if all goes well. \n Today I made it to Kal'Urguan I had to walk through the rain, but it was worth it. I love the smell of fresh ale! Tommorrow I should make it to the keep. \n Today I finally made it to the keep. It was a grueling trip in the hot sun. I have no idea what tommorrow brings, but as I write this I see lighting. I hope the undead aren't at it again. \n Today I went back to my home in the wilds. I was attacked by several extremely fast pigmen . I was lucky the monks found me to revive me. I have also noticed alot more pigmen around. I hope that is not a sign the undead will strike. \n today we built a mote around in front of the keep. We are still workin on it but it should be nice. I hope we can get it done tommorrow.", ""),
        StaticBook("Abreal's application to become town Doctor", "friar5", "Hello, Emberhard. This is an appliaction to become town Doctor, Please read. I would like to become Doctor, because I enjoy helping people, and I have alot of food, and supplies. And we dont even have a Doctor, yet... So, yes, Requesting to become town Doctor, thankyou.", ""),
        StaticBook("Abreal's Orders", "Darkdragon274", "Our base will be located near the city as an Inn. Gather dark wood, pine leaves, stone and sandstone \n Once I know the land is able to be used, construction will begin, and the base will be made under it.  \n -Relgard \n P.S. How refined are your spartan skills?", ""),
        StaticBook("Abreal?", "nikias_1996", "Dear Abreal what did I do wrong? I have noticed that you have bought a new home Why won't you live with me anymore? Is there something that i have done wrong? PLease tell me or write an awnser, My hart is broken. I need to know why you have left me. Yours truely Eledyr", ""),
        StaticBook("Abreals Citizen I.D.", "friar5", "Name: Abreal Sparta ||| Sex: Female || Criminal Record: Breaking a mans ribs with a Sparta Punch. || Age: 113 || Time as Citizen:çà Oops, 1 day || And thats it. DONE.", ""),
        StaticBook("Acceptance", "Angelus_Obscurus", "Congratulations you are now well on your way on changing the world for the better. Now that you have proven yourself in our hardest physical course, You can now step fourth and do what's right, speak this to a leader \n \n \"I am here to protect Aegis in these dark times, I am now fully prepared to deal with any problem in Aegis.\"", ""),
