        StaticBook("Agiths Personal Log", "Agith", "Day 1 I must leave the safety of the fortress, the general has offered me a chance to make a few coin, and to solve a mystery found in a map. The map has replicas, and is carried by the undead. I believe they are of either an undead town...Or a human town by the look of the buildings. I will be logging each day of my adventure...Until I return home. \n Lukas, the High advisor assisted me and recommended me to phog, I'll head there to see if he knows anything of the map. Day 7 I, with the help of Vangaurd Colonel Relyt, have found the location The map is of a section of laurelin.", ""),
