        StaticBook("Aiden's diary", "LukeSkyFoker", "Note- This is a rewritten version, with fixed grammar, capitalization and punctuation. \nI heard a woman calling for help down in the sewers. I went down to investigate. I felt like something was following me. Just when i realized it, I was knocked in the head. I was able to make out a humanoid shape but it didn't seem like a human. I woke up with a headache and a  broken leg. I called for help and am waiting for it now. If I die, please read this book and tell the King and the city about the danger of the sewer. Hopefully, they will do something about it....", ""),
        StaticBook("Ailston Bank Now Open!", "RHcrow", "Safe and secure storage in Ailston. Come see why people all over Aegis store their rare goods with us.  Prices starting at 200 Minas for permanant chest protecti n. contact Nitholiak VonSchlichten ((RHcrow))", ""),
        StaticBook("Aio's Journal", "EhMehLeigh", "I have just recently found this new city. They call it New Terriko. So far I have only met two citizens. One was a kind dwarf whose name I believe is Raldok. The other is the commander of a militia group they have called the \"Wolveriens.\" He goes by the name of Commander Stonebeard. He was the first I met here. He gave me the job of farming and feeding his militia. Although I do not agree with the use of violence, it is work, protection, and a free home. It is raining now. I have been working for the past week without seeing anyone. I am worried that not many people live here. I must go work now. *Aio* \"The One With Mixed Blood\"    \nNew Day \nI met the Mayor today. He seems nice, but sadly he is going to be building his own city farm. However, the dwarf, Raldok is his name yes I am certain now, and I will be allowed to remain here with our farm. :It is raining again. I must go work. *Aio \"The One With Mixed Blood\"", ""),
        StaticBook("Air, Fire, Earth, Water, and Darkness.", "Volanare", "The spirit of Air wasn't very polite, should that be an issue. He threatened to kill me should I not give him an offering, and thus I sacrificed an ender pearl. After such, he would politely speak to me. He explained his interest in the seven skies, for he himself had no clue what it was. He dislikes most of the races. They cause pollution, he said. He also has his own personal discrimination towards humans in general, for what reason I cannot desc ripe . Fire was incredibly humble, and considered me as an equal. We shared some very similiar views on life, politics, and everyday situations. He dislikes water as it in a natural enity, but considers himself good friends with water in persona lity. Earth was very hesitant to speak to me. His voice sounded like two rocks grinded together to produce noise. Speaking to him was easier after time, and he explains how lonely he was. He told me how the only people who ever visited him were dwarves, and he was getting sick of them. He personally loves elves, and resents that the elves are more swift. He seemed to disagree with everything I said, but I didn't take it personal. Water was beuitifull. She looked like one of the finest beings in Aegis. Completely nude too, so it was hard to look away. Hmm I couldn't really concintrate on what she was saying, so I had to try the trick that Akeron taught m me by communication through hand. She explained her interest in Nyraids, and how she wished they'd exist. She didn't like any of the other races, or specifically any males in general? She didn't say much more than that, so I continued to darkness. Darkness was truely mysterious. He didn't wish to reveal himself to me, primarely for his own intertainment. Not quite. Now hes telling me that he's doing this for personal reasons. I don't think he likes me, but it isn't a big deal. He looked extremely tired, and appaered in an human form.", ""),
        StaticBook("Airent", "Carnivore91", "Airent, a spirit of Earth. When I first summoned it I learned it was a she. It was a tough fight to do so though and I almost turned into stone. I shall pray to her to learn more. She is very small. She showed me herself today. She has long braded hair. It's of orange color, the typical amoung Dwarven Females. I will continue to pray to learn her story. Been a few weeks, she is steadfast in making me wait. It happened! Today She told be that she grew up in the lands far far to the West. Said her people were a different type of Dwarf, they lived above ground. Said they only went under to get what they need and then returned to the top. She grew up with this and accepted it, but heard storys that others lived down there. So she wanted to see this, she went on an adventure to meet other Dwarf Clans. She was to the entrance when  a big rock fell and crushed her. She was very angry at the Earth for going this, but her spirit turned to Earth. She now tries to protect people from having this happen to them.", ""),
        StaticBook("Airion pay slip", "WOOSH10001", "Golden Harvest Pay-slip\nAirion\n10/12/2011\nSigned Overseer Max", ""),
        StaticBook("Airion's Poem", "duramon", "Roses are Red violets are blue I will never get married to a man.So goodbye you strange creature....", ""),
        StaticBook("Airion.", "Spinzir", "My name is Airion. I have a vow of silence.", ""),
        StaticBook("Airions Sacred Diary.", "Spinzir", "Today, Ahad, 15th of The Grand Harvest, 1321 I have given all of my wealth away to the poor. I have spend my whole day praying in the church. I have spend most of my time, helping the poor citizens of Al'Khazar. Given food to those who need it, Helped those who i can. It has been raining very much, By everyday The Undead are getting closer to attack. Yesterday i found a small town in the wilds called Horizon, i've been thinking about moving in it.    Me and my friend, Mike have been traveling to The Twin Towers. We have entered the dungeon of Aemon & Daemon. We found nothing and decided to head back to Al'Khazar. Me and Mike decided to get a room from a taven in Al'Khazar. I was walking down the streets of Al'Khazar, i found Acolyte Shoi and a man who was taken over by a demon. I got arrested for running on roofs. Kamees, 19th of The Grand Harvest, 1321 The Acolyte bailed me out. I think i would be dead if she wouldn't have. There was a big fight between Acolyte Shoi and the demon. The fight went into an underground hole of netherrack and soulsand. Today, me and Mike found a group of people being mugged. After we went through a bit of searching, we found out it was the undead. He attacked us, we almost got killed. Mike informed the guards, right now we are on our way to Haven. The beacons of temple are lit. The festival of Krug has begun. We have found the road to Haven and have started walking. I will write next when we reach Haven. We have arrived at Aeriel. We met a man, he told us about a plague that is coming from Al'Khazar. The town of Aeriel seems to be empty. We have found the town of Kar'Alf There seems to be no one here. The town feels creepy and unsecure, i have a feeling that someone might come from behind of me when i turn my back. We arrive at the great walls of Haven. We found the inner city. There is no one here. We walked all the way from Al'Khazar  for nothing... Me and Mike, finally got a room from Dawn's Inn. Now we are going to Alliston. We found a sign saying the ruins of Alliston, i think Alliston was attacked, we can't help them. Right now We are trying to find Ascended. We had absolutely no succes finding the Ascended. Right now we are going back to Haven. We are planning on making a small house in the wilds near it. Right now we are on our way as i write this. We are going by the minecart tracks. The rails were broken for some parts. I'm back at Al'Khazar, i heard the Rangers talk about killing the King. The Guard asked me of information, I told him what i knew, for now. I walked back to the King's Cross.I found the ghost of Princess Alice, she is dead. I heard a conversation of this... He, they said he was going to use something for evil deeds. And that he has something to do with the undead. They also mentioned that they work at a Fort. The man they mentioned, was Cedrick. They also mentioned the fort is tainted. They want this Cedrick Dead. The fort is Fort Norodrun. They are going to investigate it. The man who needs to stop him is a human, has a brown beard, red shirt with white under it. Black pants. They almost catched me, Good thing i got away. They are going to Ambush Cedrick in a fort. There is lots of going on about the King. I saw a man in dark robes inside Al'Khazar. A ranger told him its not allowed. The man didn't seem to care. The Ranger told the Robed man to leave the city  He still didn't care.  It was starting to get into a fight. The Ranger said he would arrest him. But he is only a ranger. His robes changed, They are now white. The person is a monk, named John. He was a monk 20 years ago. There are two halfs the real one, John. And the Evil one with dark robes. He said the evil soul came from a pentagram. The soul has taken over John's body. The Evil half is dangerous, He needs to be taken care of, quickly. I can not fight him. I only have a sword. I found people with swords in the gatehouse, they were having an argument.. I sence a great battle before me, and the people of Aegis... I'm heading towards Al'Khazar! I found Brett spying on people , i don't think he is a good King. Spying on citizens. Two men asked me if i would want to join the Rangers, i refused. Shortly after i heard lightning . That all lightning some time ago...It was from Crimson Wale...Its in ruins. I have made a vow not to speak loudly. Mike made me join the Guardians....They put me on gate duty... They threatened to put me in the dungeon or kill me. I have became an Assassin. I found a castle in danger undead are attacking. We surrounded the tower of the undead. He was slain. And peace is back to the castle..Diamonds were flying out of his body. Every race was told to find their King. I heard Some Redskye and Majester talking about torturing poor soul In an underground cavern. A man took majester to a cottage.", ""),
        StaticBook("Aisos's Journal", "TheMineyMan99", "Day 1: The town is coming nicely, we have 5 residents as of now, including me and my uncle. There is, Me, Aalto, Ares, Morek, Zerion, and MAYBE a new girl! I'll report on this tommorow.   The woman isn't staying, but some one is leaving... We leave Silverside today, the dwarves can have it. As much as I want to, I may no longer live here. Ares has betrayed us, and once I find him, he will pay the price. We have come across my old friend james. He is giving us a home and a job. \n It turns out We didn't actually stay with Bryce and James, we went with another friend of mine, Dalejin. He has spent millions on building a city deep in the wilderness. I don't know if it will be very popular because of it's distance from the rest of Aegis. But he just keeps on building, and I admire him for that. A good trait indeed! \n I don't know what else to do, so I'll just write in here. I should have said this story earlier, but I didn't deem it important. at the time. I'll tell you the story of Ares. \n Ares and I met about five years ago. I had asked him if he had a home, and offered him to live near me. He built a GIANT house, but that's not really important to the story. What matters was he was my first citizen. He and I grew together, and eventual competed for the place of the mayor. I forfeited because I deemed him a worthy mayor at the time. \n I couldn't have been more wrong. Eventually, he went mad, and accused me of \"disrespecting\" him. He tried to put me out of my home, but my other citizens came to my rescue. He was put back into place, and I remained in my home. He left shortly after. As I was traveling to Alkhzar, for no particular reason, I bumped into him. I confronted him, as a friend. He made it ugly, and turned it into a fight. I tried to get him to settle for a vote for mayor. He refused and continued to goad me. eventual I gave in and fought him. It was brother to brother, fist to fist. Eventually, I won the battle and took over his position as mayor. not long after, the dwarves came... They demanded money, or else they would talk over the town. I pleed for help from Ares, and he came, but not to help. I told him I would give him everything if he could help save my town, I even gave him the funds for the dwarves. Soon after, he robbed me. I couldn't have been more humiliated. He stabbed out my eye , and he stabbed out my dignity. \n Well, Aalto accidentally screwed up something and dropped his soulstone. Now he has teleported all the way back to Silverside. This really annoys me because now I have to find a way to get him back here. I'm going to leave the book here so I don't lose it on the road. \n I've found Aalto, and we are back in town. He's been making fun of my room, but I don't listen to him. \n \n It's been a while since I wrote in here, so I decided I should. I have a feeling, inside my gut, I don't know what it is, but I first had it when I set eyes on the elf Kuseran. I have no idea what to make of this, it's so strange and new... It's like butterflys, flying around in my stomach, and then fluttering up into my head. I don't know if it's love... or what it is, but I like it. \n I went to see the Nawari Gypsies today, and got my fortune told. The man told me to keep track of what I want, and that I shouldn't fear, for help was on the way, but I'm not in trouble. He also told me for my love to not let dissapointments get in the way of my happiness, and that jealousy messes with your reason. I don't know what he meant by that, but I should soon find out.", ""),
        StaticBook("AIT Advertisement", "Jerry_Man", "Are you looking for quality education? Aegis Institute of Technology has opened its doors for the first round of teaching. Classes are available in\n WAR TACTICS\nHISTORY\nPHYSICS AND REDSTONE \n((Apply now on the forums to start studying before the end of the year)) \n Get Educated!", ""),
