        StaticBook("Alexander ideas and other things", "megajosh20", "first thing first is that the oren guard are usless. because there don't have a jail and they can't really cuff people. I think the gm should have people that hire and make them build the city for them. i am planing to make city. the heart the will the holy tree it will have glowsont core. all the home will be on the branch or the root or under neath the roots. one more thing about the gurads this that they don't get payed.", ""),
        StaticBook("alexander journal", "megajosh20", "3 day ago i join the guard it kind of fun of a job some times. one day i got patrol out side of the castle and the sweers. i saw a town in the sweers it was crazy the day after there was riot it was very bad that the wizard had to come. the man who caused it was whitespot1 today all the gaurd had to get alot of people off the roof after we got the people off the roofs there lightning at the caslte i went in side XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX there nothing in the caslte at all but the lightning kind of creep me out little i got  my first diamond sword before the lightning i have not seen grimbeard for couple of day now. i got a new dog that make up for losing my diamond sword i got new daimond sword now i met this girl named dawn . i think she is very mice and hot. i going to quit my job as a guard. i am run out money i am going to have to find real job .", ""),
        StaticBook("Alexanders Journals.", "MuffinSpankz", "Everyday Strife seems to change.. i would really love to help him but i do not know how. Not a day goes past without me thinkin' about him and his damned brother,. I have to find him some permanent treatment. Maybe something to do with the enderpearls? I will have to look into it further. Azure... the beautiful little thing hit diamond today. She let me mine all 4 peices. I am so happy! Tried my luck in the mines today... didnt turn out well... she seems to have a keen eye for the better materials. Ahh... my cousin arrives soon. Quite excited actually, havent seen him in years! It seems he has never lived in trees. Hes more of a cave dwarf i assume. I like to mine, but living underground is not my thing actually.  erase  Just had a look into the new home i will be sharing with Aielos. The place is just great, i love it here in the trees. This place is also close to work, which is another perk aswell, I will not need a room in the inn any longer. I am going to help Aielos expand the place as soon as possible, so il be off. Me days in the mines grow tireless. I aint findin' nothin'. Scratch that, just found gold. Days have gone by since I wrote in this diary. Alot has happened. Everyday.. the undead.. Attack with no warning.. Even after their loss at the keep. I believe they are trying to use all they have for a final attack.", ""),
        StaticBook("Alexis_Fletcher:_Journal.", "YINNY", "", ""),
