        StaticBook("Algors Jornal", "williewonka01", "Algor in saddness and depression starts a jornal to speak of his thoughts. Day 1: Just days ago Algor was forced to leave his town Kal Teran for the dwarfs did not want a new town.  He leaves it taking only his valubles as he leaves a small tear drips down his left ch eek. Hail sir Hail Sir Whats next for Algor even he does not know. He travels with his wolf dwarfy in search of his calling \n \n The only good thing is he is still a member of the dwarf High Council. But that can not last long. Algor begins to feel scared as suicide thought go through his brain. Even turning to the dark side of Aegis and being evil has been thought of. He feels worthless as he walks about the streets with nothing to do but think. He walks buy his old shop in Kal Rog and feels happiness in his memories. Algor walks by the shopping area in Outer Kal Urgan. He starts selling soem of his items and feels at home again. Algor starts getting angry his ideas stolen he gets credit fer nothing. All that he has done fer his Kingdom is stolen. He feels his blood rushing and his heart beating fast. If no one will respect and know him fer all his good. Then soon they will all know him fer his evil. Algor looks to become the most feared dwarf in Aegis. No one will have the power to stop him. He begins to plot his evil. Writing down lists of people whom he must pay revenge. thouhg he still feels the anger he does not feel to put it too use Algors sits in his tent for teh army and thinks He would lose so much and could gain so little He thinks of all the dwarfs whom have hurt him but all those who he has enjoyed> He seeks nothing but fear and minas to a great exstent. While writting this he feels ignored unwanted with no reason to be ere. Though he has lost so much minas time and items but for no gain. I want to be able to controll my own destony not let others take it from me. I feel such power and freedom maybe this is my destony. Maybe all this rejection is a sign As the power begins to build he starts becoming rude liek it was natural. There is no going back one step and Im gone. It could work out or not.", ""),
        StaticBook("Algors life", "williewonka01", "Algor is a Dwarf but he lives in a human setllement called Whisper Isle. He Works as a salesmen in Kal'rog.", ""),
        StaticBook("Algrim Test 1", "williewonka01", "1. Ta see the beaty ov the world develope. \n 2. King Perea 3. Winterfell 4. King Edmund \n 5. Th' Arcane Mage", ""),
        StaticBook("Algrim's Journal", "williewonka01", "It started when a good friend Kilgrim saved me from the taint that was forced upon me. He gave me a potion, he was the only un willing ta help. Kilgrim was a hero in my eyes the only dwarf who cared. I idolized the old dwarf he was my mentor. This came ta him asking me ta complete a few trials. \n After this I did the trials, it was not easy but I was able to complete them.", ""),
        StaticBook("Alice's Wish", "Ivrae", "Alice is mad at the mean people who hurt Valian, she wants them to die!", ""),
        StaticBook("Alk'hazar patrol", "Ratemenatorz59", "I met a man. Aerog, I believe. Seemed very drunk, wounded too Taken to Dawns in to recover. I don't see anything suspicious, it seems that the people are hiding something. The city seems clear, no trouble.", ""),
        StaticBook("Alkahar.", "Tyrellius", "Asea' SAl, Dog jenal. Take this", ""),
        StaticBook("Alkenaar's Journal", "ForhavuMahea", "Throughout my travels, I have been unsure of my position in the fight for good and evil . If you are reading this, I'm either dead or my mission is complete.  Hopefully the latter. Of course, the hope of that is fading. It's hard to remember where it began. My, evilness, for lack of a better word. Some say I was possessed.  I feel thats just an excuse.  I know what I did. And I feel like I must continue  doing it. For what, I do not know. It is a need in my heart, in my corrupted soul, that longs for the pain and torture. I wish not for my mind to be twisted in such ways, but I have no control. I once believed I could rule the world. That is a silly objective now, but I still follow it in heart. \n Maybe my hopes can one day be fufilled. Do I follow Iblees? Perhaps.  But I'm not sure.  I have met friends, and by worshiping Iblees, I ensure their death and destruction. \n If you read this, and suspect I am still alive, you are wrong.  Either way, completing my mission or dying, both will leave me dead. Please remember Alkenaar, son of Ragnak.  Make him known. Farewell, Aegis.  I may yet have a destiny of greatness. Where... I do not know.   -Alkenaar", ""),
        StaticBook("Alkhazar Defence", "Reckreation", "The north wall is strong but would be the most likely to be attacked, a cannon could be place in 3 places around the north gate the mlitart war could have piston lever doors to protect the area. a self building wall could close the door of the military", ""),
