        StaticBook("Allied Intelligence Agency", "darkdladety", "You have been invited to join the AIA. You must first understand what we are and what we fight for. The most important thing you need to know is that we are a secret organization. You will not tell anyone you are in this organization, it will not be in your name. The next thing you must know is that we are not a police force. We do not patrol the streets and we do not fight for the good of the four nations, Elf, Human, Dwarf, and Orc. We don't influence or focus on what happens between them. \n We fight only one cause, to protect Aegis from the Undead. We stay to the shadow. We keep our ears to the ground and our heads down. We do all in our power to slow their advance on this world. All members of this organization are elite killers or exellent decievers that live their lives but we are all ready to stand up and fight against the undead if the time comes. \n We focus mainly on intelegence gathering, espionage and assassination of key tagets.", ""),
