        StaticBook("Allix's Journal", "Sode1", "today i helped a man his name was Elnir he seems familiar in a strange way i helped him find pine I Have now travelled to oren in search of my friend The dwarf I met a dwarf who new him he said that they where ambushed by skeletons and he was wounded but my friend perhaps had survived, but he did not know his fate i am now resting at the top of a lighthouse , tommorow i travel back to my friend Elnir in hope to meet the high prince ,i am planning something big a coup against the human king i need to help syn get to a high place in government , then i must recruit some people i trust but the thing that will most be inportant is how we execute the assasination , syn will be backing up from a political side i will be one of the assasins , then... we just get the hell out of there . Its been a week since our plan started if we pull this off i will help banok and syn and hope fully  the high prince in many ways some humans are just like orcs killers. thieves. liars. all the qualities of the bastards tha t killed my grandfather and the village in a week's time Our journey will begin.", ""),
