        StaticBook("Alone at Port", "Jallentime", "A crimson sky gives way to night\nWhile young men pace back and forth\nThe moon is rising to their delight\nAnd a dark deep tide swallows the shore \n\nThe gentle moon starts her ascent\nAnd sailors dance in the wondrous light\nA young man starts his familiar descent\nThe ships will stay and forget their fight\nA life at sea can be great fun\nBut also a fight for your life\nBut all can rest, the day is done\nTill' mornings familiar strife", ""),
