        StaticBook("Amoungst the traitors", "Timayame", "Here is some information I have gathered while in Alkhazar after the rebellion  While in the oren sewers I stubled upon two suspicous men.. one by the name of Lykos Dackon and the other was a blind seer. The Seer ran off to do somthing and Lykos began speaking about Brett taking the throne, after bragging about how many of our men he killed he spoke of of gathering a group of settlers and moving out to the borders of the east. he mentioned \"taking the throne back\" and he said the thervings are going to help him reach his goals. During our chat he couldn't stop talking about how great this land was. he mentioned a mine that hasn't been touched yet, and he spoke of how well hidden it is... I decietfully befriendd him and told him I would come along with him to his town. Soon him and several of his followers will march out of oren along with the thervings. It would be the perfect time to strike the traitors down and prevent any futher resistance...", ""),
