        StaticBook("Amrod's theories.", "agentroboboy", "This i the book of Amrod's theories! Theorie 1: My first theory is that everything in aegis is made out a tiny blocks so small you cannot see them. Infact so small that every block is made up of more than 200,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000 of them. Theory 2: My next theorie is a bit of a counter to the other! Every block is not made out of squares at all! They are made out of triangles! Or even out of blocks that go into smaller blocks and on wards! Theory 3: This is a theory about the the sun and onwards! You see the sun don't you and the moon and you think that they go around the world dont you. But really it is alot more complex. We go around the moon! and the sun goes around us! No wait the other way round. Also all the stars we see are the same as out sun but smaller or bigger! They are just further away so they look tiny.", ""),
