        StaticBook("An Addicted Gambler Mind!", "gombie", "We Are today here with an Addicted Gambler called Mak. Mak's father learned him to Gamble to earn money. Mak earned a little with the gambling they needed to earn as much money as they can, because he's father could keep running their own mill! Mak got broke through Gambling he steals now money from he's Mother. Mak says he's father also putted him on drinking ale! Every coin Mak get's got spended out at the Casino quickly. One day Mak will get rich through gambling he said. We will see if that happens this book wil Continu. Nope were done It will continu! As i'm Telling Mak i'm done writing the book, I asked him if he wanna reads it. Mak answers me with No! time to drink first. Will he ever be undone be this addicted gambling thing? In the Next book we will Ask the Casino Owner some Questions.", ""),
        StaticBook("An Addicted Gamblers Mind 2", "gombie", "Hello, Today i'm sitting at the Ocean Casino with the two owners Raak and Loma . Okay I asked the owners about how many addicted drinkers and gamblers they have on an normal day. They answered me like 6 poeple and then Drak Said something. We were both looking at an drunk elf who hurted himself! I asked them if they even got in trouble in the Casino. They answered me that they were robbed a few days ago! We had an Talk and suddenly i ran quickly to the bartender to ask him some questions. I asked him to tell something about he's customers. He answered me that there all drunk now and that he's hired and he sold alot of ale! As i'm talking forward to our Bartender Tamar we heard Glass getting broke. As we see all Drunken customers outside they started a fight! The poeple at the Casino are so drunk i couldn't even continu talking with them. Perhaps i'll come some other day and hope there sobered up! haha. Thats all thank you . This will be continued haha", ""),
