        StaticBook("Anarchy Knight", "Naksa13", "Naksa the anarchy knight did not always have malicious intentions. When Prince Flefal of the elves lied and acussed him of something wrong, he decided the elven army had some corruption. He formed the Anarchy Knights to exploit that corruption and try to caouse wars betwwen races. No wars have been caused yet,but they clan is still starting . What Anarchy Knights forms into may very well shaoe the server.", ""),
