        StaticBook("Animus Medeo", "darkjames", "Lets begin with this, My name is Merrigan Von Dizeo, I'm the great MetalMancer , The Newest and most powerful unique wizard in our times. , When you create a golem, You must have in mind a few matters.  Do not fear the magic of the  Golems , as this magic is unique and powerful, and the Allomancy Rules over Other Magic. An Allomancer is a great Metal Mage, who was instructed first as a craftsman and then as a Mage. Now Lets go over the steps to create a golem. \n \n First Step- Get a Willingly Person for the surgery \n \n Second step- Gather 100 Ingots of Iron and 20 of Gold, and have a Magical Allomancer's Staff.", ""),
        StaticBook("Annora", "Nanomatrix", "Annora, i think i made a big mistake, leavign here, and proposing to kai. She is a wounderfull girl, but i think, she could not cope with a mute, or someone who goes to war... I shoudl of stayed, and one day, proposed to you, but it is to late for that now, as i am not sure if i will survive these's injureie's.. If i die, please remember that, even through you did not love me, i loved you.....", ""),
