        StaticBook("Annora's Baby name", "Alectriciti", "Dear Annora. It is to my belief that your new born beautiful baby should be named Serenitee. It's a lot like Serenity, only spelled differently. Tell me what you think. Oh, and Akorta and I made a deal where I must stay seventeen blocks away from Serenitee. I don't blame him. Good luck recovering!", ""),
        StaticBook("Anonymous Inscripted Texts", "Xanivic", "= Introduction = As I walked the White Road, I noticed a few stray parchments that were resting on the damp ground. Picking them up, they nearly fell apart. I quickly rushed back to my home, and began recording these anonymous texts. \n = Inscripted Texts = \n 'Bandvi norla avey junv. Hau parlkeh simal li poyta. Purnun iu jaxal lamen. Hafew bengird zaei jeut norp. Avey )( kanaim vifdoj. VIDAJ iu ret. VIDAJ. Kih galo norel kih. Lacodek yeum Writu Manen peug. Iu )( hafe turen opel. \"NORLA AVEY!\" eu cirfid. \"Fus, Roh, Dahh.' Acin norel iu lamoif. \"Aley bastia...\".", ""),
        StaticBook("Anore Stormhammer's Will", "anorexichippo", "I have no money....", ""),
        StaticBook("Anore's Travels", "anorexichippo", "Day 42 I have found this strange floating island in the sky there is water poaring from it, and there is a huge Temple on top of it. \nDay 43 I have decided to continue on my journey I have found a path of torches I have decided to follow it. \nDay 45 I have followed this path for two days now and still have met no end this better lead me somewhere I am growing short on food. \nDay 47 This is horrible I think the path of torches I was following was made by someone as a way to their house it wasn't to a city or anything! then what could that temple be? \nDay 49 I am back at the floating temple. I see someone on top of it I think he is a Sage I am going to talk to him this may be my last entry for I do not know what will happen", ""),
        StaticBook("Anore_Stormhammer's Journal", "anorexichippo", "Day 1 - I have decided to start a journal for I am growing old and I often forget things I have offically set up two Legion Bases one near the city of Kal'Rog and another near Kal'Aras which is a dwarven Coloney I am trying to decide who I should promote to Legion_Officer to control Fort Gold and Fort Iron currently I am running Fort Iron near Kal'Rog and Fort Gold is currently being created \nDay 2 - I am very happy with the new king though I 'ave heard he has aquired  a Curse. This curse makes everything 'e touches turn to gold most dwarves think its not a curse but 'e would beg to differ. I has made him unable to do many of his daily tasks he 'as me sympathy while 'e copes with his curse maybe the wizard can help 'im \nDay 3 - I 'ad picked up a journal today it was from a dwarf of Kal'Thazar a dwarven city in the north. It mentioned something about a undead scorge and how many people died the whole city was destroyed", ""),
        StaticBook("Another Book", "AllenTheGreat", "This is another book, it has words in it, but you still can't read them...", ""),
