        StaticBook("Artice 1: Section: 4a", "Lomaticc", "The Oren Guard have been talks of many criticism over the last decade. Many believe the Guards of Oren are un fit to defend the Kingdom of Akhazar As big of a Kingdom Al'Khazar is, the Number of Guards is always growing, but for good cause? \n The ever growing recruits bring more uncertainty as to whether the guards are fully equipped, knowledgeable of the laws of the land and can handle situations like the Undead or Banditry in the city. \n Despite this, The King of Oren, King Edmund Sheffield has dedicated his time to promote from within. giving the guards of Oren respectable authoritative figures to be role models \n The Undead attacks have been growing in numbers, as have the increase in the power of the Guards of Oren. Prisons are looking full, executions are at an all time high and the guards seem to be less nervous and confused when an undead strolls into Oren. \n \n With the City of Alkhazar, I'm Reporter Loma.", ""),
