        StaticBook("Arunis' Will", "loliwannaplay", "No thank you. If you are reading this, then I am most likely no longer in the plains of the living. \n 1. Give Mork and Zoe the Inn. \n 2. Tell the Ravens, Thank you. For all the help they have been. \n 3. This is for the Ravens also. Continue protecting friends. \n 4. And I wish you all a wonderful life. \n Im sorry it ended like this, theres nothing for me here besides Zoe, and she is better off Without me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Arya", "cgsphinx", "Arya is the spirit of kindness and generousness. She is the child of orc and Aengul. She prayed to her ancestors to heal her sick orc father and was offered a place in the spirit world after sacreficing herself to safe her father through shamatic magic. Appropriatly she is the spirit that embodies healing and sacrefice. She blesses those who love their clan and protect its elders and children. as offer she enjoys fresh milk and candles.", ""),
