        StaticBook("Ashkae Jago", "firespirit44", "Name: Ashkae Jao \n Race: Human \n Age/Gender: ?/Male \n SKills: Swordsmanship \n Captain of the guards, only below Felix. Bethroned to the late Princess Aliciana, and has been wallowing in despair for a while. He does not appear to be very acive as a guard, but is around Dawn's bakery. He seems to have established a new love with a female dark elf called Claire. He does not appear to show any qualities with the guards. Was suspected in undead plot with Lady Atriana, now undead. Along with Lt.Hayden.", ""),
