        StaticBook("Assassin's Guidelines", "Jexdane", "1) When on a mission, stealth is your greates ally. Do not be seen.  \n 2) First priority is to roll the assassination. Weapons are a last resort. \n 3) Jumping while sprinting speeds you up significantly. Use it to your advantage. \n 4) Never be afraid of heights. A leap of faith could save your life. \n 5) If you'll be seen assassinating the person, prepare your escape ahead of time. \n 6) Have a small house in as many cities as possible. Having supplies everywhere is priceless. \n 7) Webs are your best friend. They prevent escape and look professional. \n 8) Don't wear anything suspicious, like a hood. Look like everyone else. \n 9) When gathering intelligence, remember to record EVERYTHING you hear. \n 10) Nothing is true, everything is permitted.", ""),
