        StaticBook("Assassin's log", "moop123", "3 orcs have been chasing me for a long time now They chased me into the Holmes base and after ages of talkking I have managed to escape I am going to my brothers old Base i will ask them for help . no one was there to help me so i am agin going to attepmt enterance of the Orc nation. i have questioned meany travelers of the where abouts of Throdo Therving none have given me any info ............................................................................................. Name: Throdo Therving        Last seen: Oren Last seen: Kramaroe i have met a man in Oren by the name of Albrecht Therving and he asks alot of questions I am to get a warrant from the king to arrest Throdo he is in his majisty's service i have met up with the prince and he can see the eargency of this matter i might be close to getting this criminal Last seen: Al'Kazar", ""),
