        StaticBook("Auot Journal", "BobNorton", "Day 1: i was walkin to da IA base when i saw a pigman so i killed him dead , then i went into da base and i was confronted by an old guildmate , im thinkin on quittin this guild, dey dont appreciate me. any way, the day before, a nice elf girl saved me from Bog, the Orc Robber. he was scary, but she was really brave. she's an elf named Julia_Archer, i see her write in her diary sometimes. its too bad she has a mate. dis ends da day 1. Day 2: i showed off mah orcish dance skillz to anoda orc it was alot of funs , den i wents to da wilds but da bad man in the hood freatened me again im not scared of him do, cuz he is weak , only weak man wear hood, he is shy , i use this as advantage Day 2: End Day 3: da warlord and warlordess took down da IA base. i helped dem, den i made a cactus garden , den i was promoted for da cactus garden to prick (lol) it makes sense cuz cactuses anywayzz i want to plant a cactus in my home but it be too small maybe when i can afford bigger one i will plant i will keep it for now tho, i grew it in the cactus garden Day 3: End Day 4: I was attacked by Bog again. I feel bad for him. Day 4: End Day 5: i want to try to help bog i feel bad for da guy he seems so lonely, but i dont know how i can help maybe, i can consult a shaman Day 5: End Day 6: A ruude humie was callin me and mah bruddah Thore stoopid, so i roughed 'im up. He was reall scarred, so he ran far far away , I sure tought that humie! Day 6: End Day 7: I traveled to da Al'Khazaar, and i explored da city it was really neat, but im scared because no one liked me dey called me savage, but i not savage. i want a house der, it is nice. Day 7: End Day 8: i dont wanna help bog no longer, he broke into my home and locked himself in , we got him out, but now i dont care if he's crazy. i want him dead Day 8: End Day 9: Der was da elf and he was insultinn us orks. so i chase him to woods and klomp him ded. heehee. Day 9: End Day 25: dis be last entry, i done lots over past. i see da IA base tored down. i travel to great kingdoms. and i even earn more minas to buy da biggest houses. but i am tired of writing in dis. if ya readin dis, i probably dead. Day 25: End", ""),
