        StaticBook("Barahir", "fabian9696", "The house of Barahir is old, but not noble . The most famous is the head architect, Dûn. He was a half-dwarf and was left alone when he was 15 . He then fought the undead for 10 years on then became an architect of Oren . He later bacame the head architect and stayed so for over 60 years. at the age of 37 he got a son he named him Dûn just like him self. The kid had a easy time growing up and lived quite well . When his father died he got money but he needed a work and started to work for the Oren guard where he know is a full guard. The house of Barahir started as dwarfs, they where amongst the first to walk the land of Aegis", ""),
        StaticBook("Baron Stormhammers Journal", "Jordan1921", "Hail, this shall be a journal of my adventures. \n Day 1: Today I saw the grand halls of Kal'urguan for the first time. Thier mighty stole pillars and fierce lava was a wonder to behold.", ""),
        StaticBook("Baron_Stormhammers journal", "Jordan1921", "Hail, This shall be a journal of me life and everything that happend in it Day 1 Today I first say the grand halls of kal'urguan, its mighty stone pillars and fierce lava w was a wonder. \n Day 2 I got a home in the temporary housing, I hid my chest because I have heard so many stori", ""),
