        StaticBook("Beyond_Shores", "x_I_AM_DEADLY_x", "This morning i awoke to sound of waves, crashing relentlesly against the sandy beaches of this new land. I ascended from our temporal cave and examined the outside area, looking for any sign of life, or pre-existance. As i made my way through the sandy hatch i browsed my surroundings.  It seems i had misread my previous look around, and i noticed smaller settlements around the area. When i approached, most looked abbandoned, But with signs of previous life. \n As i returned to my temporary home, i tended to my crops and wrote a new entry to my journal. The night was long, and the sound of rain pounded agaisnt the sand above. As i lay in my bed, i thought about the following morning. It had been decided that me, and my newly allianced friend would go explore foreign shores, and have a look at a castle, which at first glance, looked almost, abbandoned. \n The castle was empty, Not even signs of previous life existed. \n We decided it was about time we started on our war camp. We erected huts made of sandstone, and filled them with chests and beds. Ready for our new members", ""),
        StaticBook("Bible", "WheatleyLabs777", "", ""),
