        StaticBook("Big Bucks In Sanhar ?", "siikshotzz", "What Ive Realised In the last few days Is That Certian shops make more  Than Others such as Yahg's Rare Materials make's the most in whole of Sanhar. Then the one that makes no money is Sanhar Deals , due to them not selling, no one wonts to buy from them. In SanJezal , Sandy Estates Store Is the one better than Yahgs!  It Has Great Deals and Great Repairs At a cheap price! But isnt making Money because its not known . And Because Of that they should Re-Locate To a more ' Popular' spot. Its Location at the Moment is Located in the Sandy Estates Apartment Block. Which Isnt A good Place To set up a Store As It could bother The Residents.", ""),
