        StaticBook("Bloddar's addiction", "dsdevil", "Today, i was walking in Krugmar, when a greenskin came to me , and asked me if I wanted to try a wonderful new thing that he had discovered. He brougth me into a drug store in krugmar, and tossed me some sugar. The moment I snorted it, everything became magical arround me. This is when my addiction started. \n Day 17 : I took alot of sugar last night and apparently, I went crazy arround the shad'rin fort. Codrik and Flare told me that I was trapping them and stealling there gold. I was also locking the doors of there houses trapping them inside or not letting them get in . Codrik knocked me out and when I woke up, he told me about what  I did. \n day 32: I snorted some sugar whit my god old twin, Arthus \n Day 56: Me and my buddies went over to the white raven base . I snorted some sugar there, and a few of them joined me! It became a party! Day 76 : Im starting to get depressions. Im always depressed and the world arround me is  gloomy. My friends have told me that the sugar was causing it, but i couldn't keep myself away  from it . \n Last Entry: I am Bloddar's son Thorak writing this last entry into the book. My father went into battle with one of the black hand memebers. Little that he knew, one of his allies from the Shad'rin was part of the Black Hand. As Bloddar was figthing the orc from the black hand all along the kings road , a man stopped the fight. Nalfein , a member of the shad'rin, sneeked behind Bloddar and stabbed him in the back. Bloddar died of betreyal! To this day, all Shad'rin members know that Nalfein is a Black hand memeber and that he  should not be trusted. R.I.P. Father.", ""),
