        StaticBook("Bloody Pigmen!: A Guide to Swordfighting the Undead", "Gjon3", "So, you want to hunt undead and monsters? You want to protect yourself when travelling during the night? Aye, this book is guaranteed to be for everyone, whether you be a merchant, guard, tailor, blacksmith, tailor, barkeep, farmer. or even a lowly peasant, this book is for YOU. It includes the basics on swordfighting zombie pigmen, zombies, skeletons, and spiders. \n                    -NOTE- \nThis book only has information on fighting Zombie Pigmen, Zombies, Skeletons, and spiders, not the organized followers of Iblees. Please think this through before storming into an undead fortress and yelling in my face about how my tactics don't work when you die. \n \n    ((Read the rest on the Survival Guide forums!))", ""),
