        StaticBook("Bob's jorunal 2", "Yay5089", "My friend Ambros gave me a new journal Due to the undead takeing my last one.I hope it is still out there and not burnt. ... A giant slime has attacked our house. whenever it hit me it sent me FLYING back atleast i had a cap on to protect me a bit.But now its ruined. ... a bunch of pigmen appeared!", ""),
        StaticBook("Bob's journal", "Yay5089", "I have bought this book in the great kingdom of oren.I did something \"not so good here\" but i think they have  froggoten.How do i know? I walked through the front gate wi without being stopped I am currently writeing this on a boat with a captain named Borald stareing at me. Maybe he dosent like me.I have went through much just to get here and i do not have track of where my friends are.This leaves me alone with no help.Though i have thier gifts such as an i ron sword i only have seven arrows,A leather cap that i spider dropped ((Maybe he swallowed it??)) And a myterious yellow stone that i was born with. The town is very quite today.I wonder what is wrong help The undead are comeing What will we do? I do not know I have also found a strange map from a zombie while adventureing But what matters more.Is the invasion. I wonder what the nether looks like. Is it covered in fire and lava with demonish creatures dwelling in it? I am afriad.But all i can do now is arm myself When i went it was all a fake. That was silly... Yet unforgiveing after we got back and began to think it was fake.It turned night.This must be a sign.Or we just arrived late I have decided to make this more orginized hopefuly when i die someone will pick up this journal and hopefuly not burn it.It will grow old and have memories of the past hopefuly. \"The arguement\" a Lieutenant and a guard are argueing.Just noting it down ((Possible shortest chapter ever)) I have picked up an adventure with a Mysterious adventurer.We are heading to a strange lang my parthner mysteriously dissapered.When i decided to come back a guard on the watch tower said \"Name and buissness \"Ma'm\"\" Of course i am not a woman ... I have just met the wandering wizard.Not much we just shared a quick hello. ... I joined a group of people who sit on a roof near the gate of oren. ... Im going to die.I am asking the townsfolk of Oren for pork but it seems they dont have any. Its been fun writeing this journal.Hopefuly they dont throw it into the sea.All of my hard work will of gone to waste, ... I was hoping across the buildings as i fell through into the alleys .I was knocked out but temple monks brought me to ageis and revived me I knew i had to get back.The only thing i had was the yellow stone that i was born with I picked it up and it telported me to Oren where i found my items lying in the alley With that.I am hopeing to learn more about magic.I hear it is controlled by a wand I am hoping to find one ... I wanted to follow some guards.But they whouldent let me.They say that if they see me again they will arrest me.I dont like guards. ... I have managed to craft my own staff.Problom is. I cannot unleash its power. I will ask others for help. ... I have joined a man.I promised to work for him and in return we will give me food and shelter.He also says he knows some people that can help me with magic . I can't wait to see what i can do with magic. ... I have met an archmage.He has told me to become a mage i must stand out of the crowd or complete a dungeon.He cannot tell me its location but i found one.I Hope this first dungeon isnt my last.", ""),
