        StaticBook("Bone's Journal", "mdhegs", "Well...Im not sure how to start. Today Was pretty crazy. Mummy did...odd things. Then I smoked my redstone. hehe. Pok didnt like that. He kicked....my love sach. It hurt Very bad! Day-2 Today was crazy! I...well had ale...It didnt go well. I about drown. But Gorund saved me! But! I learned a few more techy stuff! I also fixed poks voice! It was very gross but, very very fun . haha I hope life goes this well all the time Day-3 Well nothing really happened today. Just made a \"new\" base. For my redstone stuff. Oh! I found a little some thing that makes me feel...at ease. Its my redstone puffer! When I use it my brain...thinks...I wont stop thinking...It goes crazy. I get ideas like every 5min! its crazy. But nobody thinks it helps me. They all think its killing me....But really its not. Breaking news: Haha! I got mummy to drink ale....She is really funny with it. day-3 Hehe...Today I found out new things to put in my puffer! Apples make me remember old happy stuff! i love my puffer. da..y-4 ...so...Sleepy....Bread..puffer...no...goo...... Day-5 Today is pok's Birthday! Im going to get him the best birthday present ever. Today I took my hat off! My face...scared mummy. Oh well. I like it off. Day-6 Today we are going to Boney Bay. I can't wait! Mummy is going to come to! I love it when Mummy comes . Pok find his other mummy! She didn't really remember him. day-7 I found a funny face man . He tell funny jokes! Day-8 Well...Nothing really happened today. Just a normal day. Day-8. Well...today was very bad. I got my faceburnt off. But mummy saved me. The weird this is. I dont feel healed. I feel a darkness in me. I dont know what to do", "")
