        StaticBook("Book of Dark Magicks", "Amortik1996", "*As you open the book you hear a faint scream*  \n In the practices of Amaelith-. *The rest of the page is smeared with blood* \n \n \n *As your eyes peer down the page, you hear faint whispers, \"I . . . . was . . . . p-pure . . . . once\" the voice stops and you begin to hear sounds of swords battling. * In his research he found out how to bind yourself to someone's sou- *The ink on this page appears to be worn out* \n  *More whispers come, but this time they grow in strength, \"You . . . . WILL . . . . obey . . \" the voice pauses then you hear it scream, \"Slaughter them!\" The voice echos inside your head. Then it appears once more, \"I . . . sought . . . for . . . balance . . . \" The voice suddenly disappears, finally you notice that the words are written with blood, and pages have been torn.*", ""),
