        StaticBook("Book of Goldbeard", "Angrygorillaman", "Long ago I lived deep in the caverns of a cave I cant even remember. There were my parents; Caspian and Skullcrusher. My father was an Officer for the Imperial Army of Aegis. My mother was a medic who tended to the wounded and aided the deeply sick. Both of them were kind and wonderful people who always were there to help out others.  Finally there was his brother Karr who was'nt as you would call kind. Karr was nasty to most people and was always getting into fight. However Goldbeard's future would soon flip as a giant plague struck the land killing his parents and other harmless souls. Immediately Karr grabbed his supplies and headed North, never to be seen again. Goldbeard knew there was nothing more he could do as to just do the same. He grabbed all the remaining supplies he had left on him and headed out to find a true place to call home. After months of traveling he finially found a place to call home...Aegis .", ""),
