        StaticBook("Book of Healing: The Mind", "WOOSH10001", "From the Golden Harvest Library \n    There are many afflictions that can harm one's mind ranging from insanity to amnesia. Many plants and minerals from around Aegis can be used to cure certain ailments. \n Insanity for example, is often well managed through herbal means. Pumpkin and melon seeds relieve insanity from many people . More severe cases can sometimes be fixed by shocking therapy. For the criminally insane.. lobotomies have been performed with great success. \n Amnesia is another problem that a healer may commonly have to deal with. Cures start with potions of a minimal strengt h. Ranging to stronger potions with more rare ingredients.", ""),
