        StaticBook("Book Of Spells : Novice", "Plizga123", "Aus Eis : Summons A chilly feeling in the room you are in. Cannot be used outside. \n Wunden Heilen: Heals a small Flesh wound. Swachen Shield : Protects you from one Stone/wood Sword attack. Cooldown : one minute. \n Mir Zum Tod : Destroys your soul. (( /suicide )) Use in-case of interrogation. Your soul will lose 30 minutes of memory. \n Ewarmen : Heats up the room you are in. (Not killer hot) Verborgen : You slip into the shadows; hidden. ((must use roll 15, opponent uses /roll 20. )) \n Ratte : summons small rat, which could cause a distraction. ((Note, for all these magiks, you must /roll 20 then set name to Magic and /roll 20. If you don't do so, It is power gaming. )) ((It is roll 15 if you use a stick, and roll 20 if you use gold hoe.)) ((you can also cast small passive spells like a speed spell.  ))", ""),
