        StaticBook("Book of yameir", "Megaman765", "The name which discuses an iblees follower yameir a god of parasotes also the causer of the g ood pain. The followers of yameir usually appear like drug addicts craveing for the gifts of mutations from yameir which is the source of the glorious good pain Yameirs parasite like nature is either undesireable or not his deamonic parasites can either enhance on strenth by mutaion or curse them for life.. on my journey to aegis I was assaulted by a yameir follower he was a hulking brute he was hop e no more of those are in aegis. there is no good or evil but order and chaos yameir is between both what ever needs him most. GLORY TO YAMEIR GLORY TO THE GOOD PAIN!", ""),
        StaticBook("Book Of Zults", "MuckyD121", "As lat all now, Zults are used for klompin Monsters, or other creatures. Such as Breedurs, Stowts, Twiggies agh Alfins. Zults be faster at klompin tins Than da bare hand, so de Zult is very useful indead. \n De Wooden Zult! \n De wooden Zult is de Nubhoshest Zult in da World! It Will brake after 60 kills agh it is dery weak! It can be made wid sticks agh planks, by a skilled crafter agh latslef if lat can learn. It be dery sensitive agh can break dery quickly if you strong man! But Lat need to train wid something to be better wid Zults so Wooden Zult is ya Starter. \n De Stone Zult! \n De Stone Zult be de Second Worst Zult in de world! It Be quite weak agh will brake after 132 klompins! If lat be strong dis be wrong sword, but lat need to train wid suntin better dan Wood. So de Stone Zult is Better dan Wooden Zult. \n De Iron Zult! \n De Iron Zult be de Third Best Zult in de World! It be strong, fast nd takes 251 klompin's before dis Badboy breaks! If lat strong dis be good Zult for lat, but der be better Zults out der! Lat still gotta train wid better Zults den Da Wooden Zult, agh Stone Zult. \n De Diamond Zult! \n De Diamond Zult be de Second Best Zult inn de World! It be Dery Strong, Dery Fast agh takes 781 good klompin's before It Breaks! Dis Zult er is da BadBoi of Zults, but if lat is better wid swords... dis tin will neder Break! Lat as to train wid sometin much better dan Wood, Stone agh Iron Zults to be da best! \n De Golden Zult!!! \n De Golden Zult de nomber Ash best Zult in da whole world!  It be Lightning fast, amazingly strong agh will neder break opefully if lat is good, wid da swords. It be de Best klompin Zult in de world agh can sell for dery high prices. Da Only oder way to obtain ash of des is ta get a rare drop from de Pigman, or craft ash. Lat need to be dery good Blacksmith to craft ash of des Amazin Zults. \n Zult Histori! \n De Zult is a Nubhosh ranged Weapon, Zults are nub as good as arrows... Unless it be da Diamond or Golden Zult which be much better dan de Arrow! Zults Wid enchantements may be dery usefull but alas me nub know how de, enchantaments work, as me as never had de fortunate luck to have de Enchantment Table. \n De End! \n By Gwarc_Wolfbone, Runt of da Urk Army.", ""),
