        StaticBook("Brad's NoteBook", "Plizga123", "Hmm. Slay creatures. Buy a permit to Oren Mine. Profit Rent Due 10/27 The base X -4324 Z -2957 Be prepared. Day 2 I left the clan, I dont want to be evil. I have applied for the Oren Guard. I am awaiting a responce. Looking at houses. Prices will be listed.", ""),
        StaticBook("Bradford's Journal", "Plizga123", "Hello... who ever is reading this. My name is Bradford, and as the title says, this is.... My Journal. \n I'll start when I was young. I grew up in a small town, in Eastern Aegis. I grew up with my mother and father, along with other families in the village. I grew up there for most of my childhood. My father died when I was 14. It was sad, but I still had my mom... \n At the age of 20 I set out for Oren, more exact Al\"khazar. \n I joined the guard, and rised to Sarge, but I found out how corrupt they were. I quit, and moved to New Alstion after a friend, Romanen Thidorn, showed me the town. I met a few people here, A woman named Keziah, her husband Ior, The blacksmith Edgar, and Kilopo, some random guy. \n - A hand-drawn picture of New Alstion is shown here- \n A few months afterwards, I was taught magic by a man who I will not name. He taught me many types of magic, and I fear he will be killed if his name is found. I practiced for years, and I still haven't mastered it all... I am content with what I have . \n - A picture of a mage, with a flame in one hand, and some water floating in the other is shown.- \n Itnan, 2nd of The Deep Cold, 1339 \n I thought I would put the date in here as-well... My friends in town have been acting suspicious lately.. Romanen and I are trying to  figure out what it is. I became priest of New Alstion, but we don't have many weddings, so I am free to do as I please most of the time. \n -A picture of New Alstion Church is shown- \n Kamees, 5th of The Deep Cold, 1339 \n I need to kill someone. His name is Boiendl. I just know I need to end him... He is.. different \n There seem to have been bandits around Galahar, I will stay alert there.", ""),
