        StaticBook("Caden Cathaldus", "ZazarusDious", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Caden Cathaldus's Journal.", "Caden_Cathaldus", "Hail! If you are reading this (which most of you will) then you will hear of my view, within my group (yet to be named at the time of this writing) and about my search for the man who a hit on my family. For more details read Sillion Luthais's story on the groups backstories. but this will be written, sometimes as things happen, sometimes after. Don't worry, this isnt a diary, where I write EVERYTHING that happens. In my journal, I only write about important things, or at least whats important to me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cailexaner's Journal: Page III", "LukeSkyFoker", "Me and Vashyron became close friends as we worked together. We has some customers. Some bought rooms and we got lots of money. One day, a druid came. He asked for a job and I asked my boss. He said it would be okay to have just one more employee. While Vashyron and boss was away, me and the druid became good friends. His name was Lynx. We fished together. After a few days, a hooded man, who seems familiar, and an orc came by. They asked us to come into their mansion. Lynx whispered to me that they were undead so we became cautious. Lynx had a plan, we would go inside and investigate with extreme caution. He said we would get out of there when we were in danger. We came in and they locked the doors. We both grabbed the hilt on our swords. Little did we know that the undead were very powerful. They told Lynx to go up in the room and they locked him in. They then forced me to go to the basement. They interrogated me and I refused to answer. They said they would crush me in the room if I didn't answer. Lynx sudden came out of nowhere. He said he had blown the door off. They forcefully subdued him and shoved him into a room. I was scared. They told us it was time for us to die. The hooded man told the orc to activate it. After a few seconds, I felt excruciating pain and I blacked out almost instantly. I woke up in a bed with some healers tending to me. I tried to find Lynx but I couldn't find him. I returned to the inn and found Vashyron and boss. I told them what happened and they told me to not ever trust people like that or people with hooded robes. I went back to working as a farmer in the inn.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cailexaner's Journal: Part I", "LukeSkyFoker", "I had a family. Father, Mother, Brother. We were miners and farmers.  We were poor but we managed to have adequate money and food. I learned to farm and mine.  \n  When I was around 20, my parents passed away due to old age. Me and my brother worked together. We found this large cave and so we called some friends to help us out. I agreed to pay them half the ores and minerals I got. We split up and I went with my friend's friend. He looked poor, worse than me. Me and him went to another split and found some gold! Then we got tons of iron and coal! After a few more minutes of mining, we took a break. I felt something hard hit my head and I saw my partner with a pipe in the back of me. I passed out right after that. I woke up outside of the mine and my friends were tending to my head injury. I asked him what happened and they said that I was found on the ground unconsious.  They said that I looked like I was robbed and my partner was nowhere to be found. I made one prediction. He probbly robbed me after knockning me out. Me and my friends ran home and found our house ransacked with my brother, dead on the ground. I was full of rage and sorrow. I got all my belongings and traveled to a far away place and will swear revenge on the man who did this.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cailexaner's Journal: Part II", "LukeSkyFoker", "After many days of travelling, I came across a small  village. It was Whisper Isles. I stayed there for a while to rest and eat. After a few hours at Whisper Isles, I went off and found my self in Al'Khazar. I spent some time there and decided I needed a job. I found a dock and decided to go fishing. A young man came and we exchanged names. He was Tiberius conDoin. He owned an inn which was named The Rusty Hook. He said the dock was part of the inn so I asked him if I could use the dock to fish. He said yes and so we became friends. I asked him if I could be a fisher and a farmer at his inn. He said he needed some employees. I became a worker and had a job. I had adequate pay and a good shelter. We owned a wheat farm, a sugar cane farm and a tree farm.  I was a very hard worker and was paid very well. One day, a person came and he wanted a job. He became a fisher and farmer like me. We became close friends as we always helped each other out. His name was Vashyron.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cailexaner's Journal: Part IV", "LukeSkyFoker", "We were running out of coal. We had tons of logs. I learned from boss that wood can be burned into charcoal, which is the same thing as coal. I burned about thousands of logs and he paid me very well. One day, I was searching through the stores of Al'Khazar. and found a shop willing to pay a lot for charcoal. I immediately went back to the inn and got all my charcoal. I got thousands of minas! I was rich.  I saved the money up for diamonds. We got lots of ingredients for our foods. \nAfter a few months of prosperity, Al'khazar announced a cake party. I attended and I got a ton of cakes! I got back and told boss. We stocked up on the cake. Suddenly, I heard lightning. I told boss that I would be back. I ran back to investigate with some armor, a sword and some food. Al'khazar was under attack by the undead! I followed the group and we pushed back the undead. We followed them into Snowy Fields. We found this obsidian fort with lava. It was the undead's fort. We all charged forward and mowed down all the zombies. I cut and sliced and dodged and it was very bloody. After a few hours of fighting, the battle was over. The undead retreated and we took the fort. We destroyed it. Al'khazar has survived an attack and have destroyed the enemy! I returned to Al'khazar, full of triumph and I felt a lot better holding a sword. It felt like I have gotten used to using a sword. I return to the inn and told boss what happened. He congradulated me. It was a normal day again. Something new came up. We made a discovvery of farming melons. Cows, and chicken were now very useful because someone found their meat to be edible and delicious.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cake Time!", "DoctorTinman", "A wonderful haiku about the joys of cake: Cake is so yummy. It's delicious and simple. Stuff that beastly face.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cake!", "Lastchance2099", "Cake! By Bastion Ingrediants you will need. 1 Egg; 2 Sugar; 3 Wheat; 3 Milk; Directions: First place your 3 wheat. Second, Add one cup of sugar, followed by your egg, and a second cup of sugar. Lastly, add your 3 buckets of Milk. Congratulations You have made Cake! Be carerful where you put it though, Cake sets very well. ***FIN***", ""),
        StaticBook("Caleb the III Journal", "CommanderCaleb", "Day 1 of the Nical things went smooth, getting complaints though isnt fun We hope to set up better contact with our new freinds other then the close by enemys we went and scouted on our city is doing good, taxes must be incrased we are in det help text Day two the Nical is under attack, monks and now the orcs we need to set up better defensive and hope these mercs will come the nical is in great danger we must fix somthing I must be going", ""),
        StaticBook("Call of Nature", "martinvilla822", "In the light of the mist. Fairies beat their wings. Keeping time to the bard. As he sings of the past. And they frolic so lithely. Through silver-iced leaves. Keeping time. At the edge of the earth. Ancient tongues speak of prophecies. And they weave in the dusk. The strongest of spells. That shimmer green, crystal blue. Pearl jade against the stars. In the night we all watch as we see nature's acts. And its wonders. As the trees grow and Animals wander. As we see how the worlds calls of nature's magic.", ""),
