        StaticBook("Captain Vane's Childhood", "Volutional", "It began in the Cloud Temple, as all does. Vane was born, to both parents, and a brother. He was born with the name Masicus Albrea. He later changed his name to suit himself. *The rest of the book seems blurred by water...", ""),
        StaticBook("Captain's Log", "Nabbasan", "Captain's Log Itan, 23rd of The Second Seed, 1325  This is the first entry of Knight Argos Tho'lagg  . Today I broke my legs after jumping from the crow's nest on my shop. the S.S. Arya , however I do not recall the event. I do however remember jumping off because I went through Arya's bookshelf, and found a diary entry, talking about how she like me as a friend, but would rather be just friends", ""),
        StaticBook("Captains Ideas", "dirtryhary", "Imagine Raiders Across a vast sea called norscans They would worship evil gods not aegis They would each have a ship or they would be disgraced the lore would be theyre bastards whores etc of each race there would be 3 tribes for each god help firts tribe led by a woman banner is red speckeled with black they are the most kind and most sophistacated they will pillage and leave very quickly theyll be called something second tribe they are down right evil banner pure black with one orange in the middle they have no towns they rape pillage and sacrafice they are the largest 3rd tribe they are a stupid race and are very weak and have no banner but they are the only ones with shamns and once they get slaves the slaves must serve wizard if your intrested ill add more lore ok heres in depth lore! after aegis was created a whore son grew to 7ft he was banished for killing and raping he was thown in a boat with 3 other companions 2 girl they reached a land not found by man and made off spring under the solace the babies grew quick after 100 years there was an imense civil war there were 3 sides one woman wanted to stay in her lands and prosper and build a 5 ft man wanted to stay and learn fabled shisladu (magic) the last man ofspring of the 7ft man (khaldrog) wanted to revenge his great great grandpa he had atleast 100 men and wanted to set off his father arived in a small raft why not build bigger? long ships once khal dorgo won he started the first of the ships years later many yeas ( aka now) the norscans are growing tired of there land and set sail to avenge there creator they would have no alies they would war evryone BUT we alll must rp this is all ooc", ""),
        StaticBook("Carnush's Diary", "Carnush", "Day 1244, \n I fear that soon the forest will be gone and the balance of nature will be lost. With half of the forest cut down soon the forest temple will become corrupt. When the forest temple becomes corrupt the corruption will spread to the rest of the forest. I can see now that the world tree is trying its hardest to save it. I can see it is getting struggling to save what it can and it self. I fear with the lose of the forest's balance it will corrupt the other balances. These are dark times and I only fear the worst head with the forest gone and the ascended sag e gone. \n \n -Carnush \n \n P.s I my illness seems to be getting worse as days gone on. I only hope if  I can find a cure soon.", ""),
        StaticBook("Case 01 Tavern Theft", "Lastchance2099", "Today, July 9th 2011 (PST) local inn Arks Tavern was robbed. \n Ark: \"There are two clues as to who did it.\" The first clue was a sign left upstairs, that  read \"possessions taken by struggling guild\" However, Ark himself listed a man named Goblin as a potential suspect, saying \"We used to be Inn coowners before he left and started up the rival 'Goblins Inn', now he has threatened me and this inn many times.\" I began to leave the crimescene when I saw a man crouched at the entrance to the inn. After saying Hello he immediatley began to sprint off. I yelled halt however he continued to flee. after chasing him for several minutes I was able to retrieve his information. Chracter name: Devor MC Name: daverdare. \n Unable to catch him I proceeded to Goblin Inn. Another strange thing, it was closed for renovations, and renamed \"John and James Inn\" The entire place was protected, however Martin and I found our way in through the roof. Nothing suspicious, however I found a diamond pickaxe and 5 sticks laying near a crafting table. This is proof that someone was there less than five minutes before us. I left a sign notifying them of Goblins position. Also, I'm going to add Devor to the wanted list for fleeing a crime scene. If it turns out that Goblin is innocent, I will begin scouting out all of the local guilds. While we have only had problems with The Cripson guild, I do not believe that they are the type to leave a sign. As for the things taken from the inn, it seems to mostly be wheat", ""),
        StaticBook("Case_1", "ZacArgolas", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Case_2", "ZacArgolas", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Casimer", "SirPwnzalot700", "Hello Casimer I ahve been delayed with my Quest to get recommendations and I may not be able to send those supplie Though I will Now I am leaving this will Animeius to give to you Farewell Mind giving this to him when he comes", ""),
        StaticBook("Castle Building", "Ansh98", "You stumble across a beautiful kingdom. On the outskirts of the kingdom, you notice tall castle walls. You think, \"Where is this castle that these walls are protecting?\" Walking further into the kingdom you notice a castle that look well protected. However, you think to yourself, \"Say, I can do much better!\" Great!  We will surely need you in the Castle Building team! Castle builders tend to work well with the Defensive building as they both requre creative minds. \n Reccommended for anyone who builds giant structures and have creative minds. Dean challenges vary from creating a large castle to creating tall castle walls. \n \n Have a thing for dominating buildings in a city? Then join the Castle Building team and build on!", ""),
        StaticBook("Castle Specifications", "Pepernoot", "-Dining Hall\n  -Kitchen\n-Barracks for the pages\n-Master bedroom for the Knight Commander\n  -Study\n \nIn the basement.\n-Small Armoury\n-Dungeon", ""),
        StaticBook("Casualty Loh", "coastercam0", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Casus' Journal", "OniHonoo", "After many days of training, OniKenji and I were finally accepted into the Wardens. Training in the Crucible has been a tough task, but we must prevail. We have achieved our next rank.  Both of us were promoted to Eternal Gaurds.", ""),
        StaticBook("Catalog of Artifacts", "Hwaldar", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Catalog:Creatures", "Hwaldar", "Zombies: Magically raisen corpses. They usually do not use weapons,but carry old armour.  They are slow,and burn at sunlight. Travel with caution,as they tend to ambush you. \n Skeletons:Magically raisen rotten bones.  They normally ambush travelers at night with Bows. Caution is advised.They DO burn in sunlight. \n Spiders:Magic-imbued overgrown vermin. Are fast,can climb structures,and sometimes poisonous. They turn neutral at day. It is advised to use bow and arrows against them. \n Creepers:Rare Orc-spawn kind,which lives in Sulphur Caverns. They can explode,if you are too close. Bow and Arrows are the best to defeat them. \n Sheep:A perfect source of wool. Can be found in different colours. \n Pigs:A perfect source of meat. \n Squids:A perfect source of Ink.  Can only be found underwater. \n Chickens:A perfect source of feathers and eggs. \n Cows:A perfect source of leather and milk. Beware:Unsafe use to milk can cause you to become drunk! \n \n NOTE:Chickens,Pigs,Cows and Squids never attack You.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cataris Tale", "nachotp", "Eldar is A book writter Eldar is quite Strong Cataris will suffer. He was ordered by the prince. The book will be in My hands. I'm Sure Cataris Must go now, He thinks he is preppared but he doesnt seem sure. Cataris brother, Elgon, Will be here. I am with Cataris, Ogland and the Prince, We have a Quest! Capture Malkoi, he knows about us, he maybe an undead supporter We will Capture him! We will tell the Guards to catch him, We will bring him to the Barracks , I will go with Cataris when is Daylight , We are gonig now! We need him catched, He tries to Steal My business I tricked Him! He thinks is an offer! I'm sure we will get him He is in a Corner, THe prince approaches. we have him under pressure, He feels threathed, He tried to write down what is going on, He says He will tell the undead He escaped! our perfect plan is tearing off! Soulstone just made his perfect mo ve. He is with the dwarves by now, Cataris and James Will probably go there. The real book that started this one has gone, THe elven prince Lost it! WE have Splited, Cataris is going to find Elder, We found him again! wandering in the streets , we will take hi mto jail Doing Private work is hard. We are near the jail. He trapped himself moving a lever, Not sure what he wants, he wants to play so me sort of game, Flickering the door, someone appeared , a helper, The overlord! We have him! he is under jail! Such a travesy Eldar was a bandit, he told someone that he thought was undead that he stopped supporting them.", ""),
        StaticBook("Cataris' Journal", "Archmage_Cataris", "Ill start of with my history: My mother was a whore and i was the twin brother of Elgon \n At the age of 9, Elgon was taken North with a nobleman to squire for him so i was left behind and on my 10th name day my mother was found dead without knowing my father i was bound to be dead on the streets  An old man took me in and made me his steward and i travelled south with him \n He was a mysterious man with a large collection of strange books of which i would stay up to read On my 22nd name day the old man was over 107 years old and died peacefully in his sleep that is a very very brief history of me. \n My Mage Trials \n The first trial was fairly confusing... the question wasn't straight forward but i succeeded \n The 2nd was easy, but it made me angry... but i have to control my anger \n The 3rd was simple... Choose an Element, i chose Earth \n \n Notable Events: \n I was at the battle of Kal' byrst and was atop the roof fighting side by side with Native and the Ascended as we slew the Undead and i was at the battle of Al' khazar and tried to save the civilians by helping them into the keep... but the keep exploded in fire and i was cut down with the rest of the civilians... but the monks saved me \n \n Titles/Previous Titles: Lt. of the Oren Guard in Al'khazar, Watchmen of Winterfell, Commander of The Lost Ones and finally now Mage \n \n Notes: Some thieves tried to rob me and kill me, Ha! They failed... i came back with some warriors and friends to deal with them and the thieves were cut down and their base alight in fire \n \n A man came into Al' khazar talking of Undead up in the hills so i followed him and we snuck into a house and saw from the mountaintop a undead group They then turned their heads towards us! They saw us They stormed up the mountain and barged through the houses door My friend ran for it while another was executed They Undead knew i was also here but i had torn the floorboards apart and hid underneath it I heard them talk and there were alot of them and soon i could hear them saying \"See! theres some men over there i think they might attack\" I heard the battle commence so i climbed out of my hidey-hole and charged I had the element of surprise, they thought i was gone Fighting alongside Ogland and Brett Pearea we were able to kill them and drive them off \n \n I heard lightning while i was in the Mages Tower, i went to investigate Turns out the abandoned orc encampent near Snowy Fields Was under control by the Undead and many men and women were fighting for it I climbed into the encampent while most stayed outside i climbed through the roof of a hut and found two men badly wounded i was able to heal them some but not as much as i would have liked Turns out an Ascended betrayed his fellows and turned against them he then joined the Undead We fought for a long time till the Undead were happy with their kills I saw men men go up in flames and die then But afterwards i had a chat with \"Bell\" she told me Slayer told her bout me I then walked with Prince Toren to Al' Khazar were he had some lunch And i walked back to the Mages Tower \n \n I have heard some strange news, Hwaldar kicked from the mages guild and Bell being the new Archmage tho i have not had it confirmed yet So alot has happened i have forgotten to write of late \n \n Recent events: Hwaldar plans to overtake the mages guild and Nitholiak turns out to be a undead spy but an unwillingy one I confronted him and he was forced into it and entirely not his fault I was also at the battle near Snowy Fields and aided a few injured And am now currently building a Guild House for A.L.E and also Bell is the new Archmage Me, Bell & Everard went to Kal' Byrst and stopped all the lava there \n \n Im sorry journal but this is it, Im throwing you away", ""),
        StaticBook("cave of the redskins", "sad555", "Not long ago, in the land of beatiful Aegis, and in the Northern forests of Aegis, there was a cave, a cave believed to contain many treasures and many secrets which are untold and undiscovered by any living. My father was a passionate tresure hunter, who always seek the mysteries of this world me, his son was his forced apprentice. One day, some fellow treasure hunters came to our house and mentioned about a cave, untouched by human hands, nor elf's nor dwarf's, so with them we marched together to the cave it was that cave i mentioned in the beginning, a cave in the Northern Kingdom. when we entered to the cave, there was a sudden breeze, a cursed feeling touched to me but as soon as my fellows saw the golds and diamonds, they ignored the cursed feeling and began to dig, dig and dig... for a few days we dig, dig and dig. I was the only one who was nervous of the atmosphere of the cave. And i was right! They should have listened to me! in the 7th night of our excavation, some strange voices began to wander There were hot streams flowing througth the holes Then we saw them! Red-skinned people with red eyes... They shouted, yelled and shrieked on us. we dropped our pickaxes and began to race to the exit They were too fast! As we run, only me and father stayed alive, and a final blow hit him too he died in front of my eyes! but i could'nt mourn or stop for him, i was terrified greatly... with my sword i repelled some of their claws and in the end i could get out they did not chase me out of the cave, but one of them stood near the entrance he was wearing a hooded cape, his eyes were red and he was smiling.... AN EVIL SMILE! Then he whispered 'The clouds shall be gathered, the Sun shall be gone!' i was terrified and fell to the ground... i have lost everything and the most importantly, my father!.... Then as soon as i regained my consicuous, i raced to Oren there i have foun Lord John, a very noble and helpful Guardsman But in the cave, there was nothing... At least i could find my father's corpse. i dug a grave for him, at the entrance of the cave... I hope his spirit will reach to the halls of our merciful God... Since that day, i entered to the cave many times, to find some answers, but there was none... It was an empty place. Those redskins were a dream? Or i should say a nightmare? if so, how could my father died?... Now i have a little hut near the cave. And i will dedicate my life to uncover this cave's mystery... by Temer.", ""),
        StaticBook("Caveat to Hermits", "Respiren", "He who is unable to live in society, or who has no need because he is sufficient for himself, must be either a beast or a god. \n - Archdruid Aristotle", ""),
        StaticBook("Cease and Desist - Masonic Guild", "Vardak", "Under investigation immediately, all actions of the Masonic guild will stop effective immediately. \nFailure to do so will result in the removal of land, guild rights and wanted posters all over Oren Terms of Surrender. You must give up all rights to the guild to the King, Edmund. and the Queen, Ivrae. \nYou will also be put on trial for your crimes, including \nSupporting the Undead. \nHiding true Identity to obtain a guild to operate the \"Black Hand\" from your guild base. \nConspiracy to commit Treson. \nAttempted murder on the High Constable Vardak Ciantar. \nAttempted Murder on his Fiancee, Decora. \nAll has been written, and signed, the signatures below \nHigh Constable Vardak Ciantar.", ""),
        StaticBook("Celebration Speech", "123devmo321", "Welcome all, to the re-opening of our beloved church. All of Aegis has been through awful times, with the undead lurking about, and tensions rasing within the factions. But the light of Aerial has always shone through. Look around, the cities still stand, and we fend off the hordes with more ease every day. This Church will represent that light that allows us to peirce through the evils in this world. And it is an honor to open the doors for all who wish to be guided in the light of Aerial. Light be with you all.", ""),
        StaticBook("Celistine", "GoldenGFX", "Celistine is an aquatic city, founded by Latsi. He started the process of making the city himself, but many friends came along and help in the build. The main builder, Karatzo, started with the construction of the barracks.", ""),
        StaticBook("Celistine", "123devmo321", "Celistine, the beautiful city on a lake. This magnificent place was founded by Latsi.  He was joined by others who sought the same goal as himself, to create a safe-haven where people can live and trade in peace. Celistine was designed to keep those who enter safe from all evil's of the world. With a world plunging into violence, there needs to be a place where people can enjoy the peaceful wonders of life and stay away from the burdens of Aegis.", ""),
        StaticBook("Celistine Military Protocal First Edition", "preet3203", "help replace oldtext Welcome", ""),
        StaticBook("Celistine Vol. 1", "Da_Emperors", "I write today to tell you that Celistine is not a city, but that of a Hellspawn hole. They are harboring undead. Now this may be a brief first volume but in my time there you will understand its not safe. The City has undead lords there. Lord Fryste and Wrothgar (allenthegreat) live there. They have been spoted multiple times there and have spoken on issues there. Besides that they have stocked up large amounts of Gold recently in case of a attack. Myself helping them when i was a Captain of the Minions. There may not be ties between the Queen and Undead but they share a relation. The Queen Cassie may not have 100% ties with the undead yet but she has realtions. Battles take place where i saw the Undead there. In the City. Get this from the Book that the city is not peaceful. It is Evil. It is Undead.", ""),
        StaticBook("Central's Gone!", "Zombiebillybob", "", ""),
        StaticBook("CentralGuard's Journal", "CentralGuard", "Hello, if you are reading this, than you have  found my dead body, or i gave you a coppy, anyways enjoy! \n \n \n \n Day 1 \n Today i helped Hiebe make a trench .  Made a fountan for a courtyard in the guard housing. This will also let me gather water. Also started to make the \"factory\" aria of guard housing, coming along well. \n \n Day 2 \n Ah, today was a verry speshal day, i met up with my old friend, Rasun... i havent told you of him have it? well lets begin at the start ...  It was my first day, the day i was created, i had finaly reached kal'urguan, and wat a good city it was!!! so i look around and i see a sign that says jobs avalable, see rasun, and i think ok i need a job. so i go find him and ask for a job, simple and got the job. he wasnt rilly my friend untill he saw me working alone for about nine hours, so we whent out and i bought a lot of ale. we had such a good time that day. \n \n Day 3 \n Of corse, following a happy day has to be a sad day, barly anyone is at the gates, so im all alone working again. Ah this day is having a better turnout than i thought three guards showed up!! Today ended with me almost dieing from hypothermia, but getting alot of snow!!!! \n \n Day 4 \n Today, started out like a normal day, but ened up in me making more of the wall, and getting minas for it to :) \n \n Day 5 \n I am sorry about this jurnal, but i cant tell you the event of today, tis gust to secret to get you, forgive me. \n \n Day 6 \n today... today is a bad day for all of use. The undead have invaded, and Kal'Urguan is on high alert, i odnt know how long it will last. \n \n day.. 10? \n i have left my job as a guard, after seeing what the king did", ""),
        StaticBook("CentralGuard's Jurnal", "CentralGuard", "=Ahad, 8th of The Deep Cold, 1320= Hail to all that want to read this, this is my second diary, as my first one was stolen \n =Tolta, 31st of The Grand Harvest, 1322 \n This night has been..... unplesant to say the least, on top of the Alras cliff i saw the undead overlord looking strait at me and then he was gone in a flash, not to be seen.", ""),
        StaticBook("CentralGuard's logbook ((EDT Time))", "CentralGuard", "Saterday 8:54- 9:48 \nSunday: 12:00am (ish)- 3:20", ""),
        StaticBook("CentralGuard's LogBook (EDT)", "CentralGuard", "\n Thursday: 9:10- \n 9:58", ""),
        StaticBook("Cerberus' Notepad", "WizardInACan", "Kamees, 5th of Suns Smile, 1338 I have successfully created a prototype flyer. A name has not been decided. It flys 20 horses high, its speed is slow. I hope to be flying in it very s soon. It runs on what I call motor movement. By design it is very powerful. read notes from Clavis motor notes. Will Forrestin believes I can do this, lets hope he is right. If this works cities will be in the sky. I will be known as the greatest inventor of all time. My crossbow is a failure. It is useless and slow, I thought it would work but it does not. Evil men want my creations. I cannot let them have my creations. This notepad must be kept safe. For now I am good and safe. They are coming for me. Today I have made the motor run on steam instead of coal, a great success!", ""),
        StaticBook("Cerlos' Journal, Volume I", "Pepernoot", "Greetings dear reader, if you read this it must mean someone has taken this journal from me, or I have passed away. \n As you are reading this, I think you are a person who is interested in all kinds of books, I am too.. \n \n My name is, or was, Cerlos, I arrived in these land when I was the age of twenty. When I first arrived here, I found Al'Khazar on my travels, and made some minas there But I was looking for a place to call home. I travelled far North, to Alstion, and bought a house there, for quite a low price, but the low price was for a reason I didn't know of. \n I started having second thoughts when the undead kept attacking Snowy Fields, but they moved faster then I thought. One day, when I wasn't in Alstion, the undead marched towards the towns in the north. I lost everything I owned to them. But, after some journeys I bought an apartement near Al'Khazar, and found the joy of reading and collecting books. Not a long time after that I travelled far to the west, to Lunavara, and gathered there the largest collection of books Aegis has ever seen. But just collecting books was not enough for me. I wanted to spread knowledge around Aegis, and helped setting up the Laurelin library. After a few years I met Gaius Marius in Al'Khazar, he had heard of my book collecting craze, and offered me a place in Nuremberg to build my own library, and live my life as a scholar, unconstrained from the small minds in Oren, and free to write and research what I want to. \n \n I hope are still reading this, sorry if I have bored you. From now on my journals will be about my findings about Aegis, and my research off the world itself. \n \n -Cerlos, 7th of The Deep Cold, 1320", ""),
        StaticBook("Cerlos' Journal, Volume II, findings about falling.", "Pepernoot", "The first thing I wanted to research is why objects fall. This is not only theoretical, and because of my curiosity, it also has a practical use. For example in archery and using catapults. \n \n \n I have build. a tall research tower for testing, results will follow soon. \n \n -Cerlos, 7th of The Deep Cold, 1320 \n \n \n First results. \n I did some testing, and made a setup where I could drop stuff on a detection plate from 18 blocks high. \n The results were the following: \n Average falling time: 3.1 seconds. \n  Average speed: about 6 blocks per second (bps) \n I will test different heights later. \n \n -Cerlos, 18th of Snows Maiden, 1320 \n \n \n Scrap those last results... I have reason to believe they are not reliable... I need to make the falling height higher, eighteen blocks are not enough to find good conclusive results. I will work on calculating distances and angles while the pit is being dug deeper. \n \n -Cerlos, 9th of the First Seed, 1321", ""),
        StaticBook("Cerlos' Journal, Volume III", "Pepernoot", "A lot of things have happened in the last year.\n I hired an assitant in Al'Khazar, Henry, but the Order would not let him in...\n Eventually I managed to let them give him access to my library, but when working on the tower, I fell and nearly broke my leg. When I woke up again, Henry was missing, and they acted like they didn't know where he was. I knew they must have killed, or tried to kill him. So I moved all my books out of Nuremburg, via a secret tunnel, and set the remains of the library on fire. I didn't want to have my knowledge fall into their murderous hands. A few days later, I found Henry, he was rescued by the monks in the Temple. \n \n After a few days, I started on my own library, and started building it with his help. We met a boy named Joseph where we were building, and he helped us out. In the last months of 1321 the building was finished, and it was time to move my collection. This took us a few weeks, but when it was finally finished, it was a magnificent sight. I have met more friends here, and hope to do more research. \n \n -Cerlos, 20th of The Amber Cold, 1322", ""),
        StaticBook("Cerlos' Surplus Supplies Flyer", "Pepernoot", "Hail! \nMy surplus store is your cheapest store in Al'Khazar, I constantly change my prices to beat every competitor!\n Current deals are: \n Netherrack, 30 minas \nIron ingots, 24m \nWool, 7m Pumpkins, 30m \nPumpkin seeds, 50m\n \n You can find the store above the grand fountain, near the Keep of Al'Khazar!\n \nHappy shopping!", ""),
        StaticBook("Cerrawin, an Undead Supporter", "edronos", "This is a notice and inquiry into the execution and elimination of a captured Undead supporter, Cerrawin Menethil. His crimes are as follows: \n Mischeif wtihin city limits \n Theft and armed robbery \n Murder \n Treason against the Kingdom of Oren \n Plotting the rape of Kal'Alras, prevented by recent nation and capital status \n Cerrawin was a resident of Alstion, close to where the Undead have founded their new stronghold. He has worked as a logger, merchant, and sell sword , but these vocations were fronts to vanguard his dark work. His allegience with the Undead is long-lasting, and a heinous crime that goes without saying. On behalf of Aegis and the unfortunate victims of his crimes, I ask that he be executed.", ""),
