        StaticBook("Changeling", "MrZombez", "\n The gallows tree is straight and tall \n Save for every jutting limb... \n And from a spot across the road \n I watched the tortured legs of him \n Who dangled there... \n The hangman laughed, \n So merry was the sight withal \n The hangman's daughter, standing near, \n Was lovely as a waterfall; \n Her yellow hair streamed over her  \n Her symmetry was starkly limned... \n I loathed and loved her, and it seemed \n Her scarlet roses glowed and dimmed \n As my wild eyes upon her fed \n   \n Her glance was free and bold, I thought... \n Our tryst was secret, when the dark \n Had fallen, where the corpse hung taut \n In the red moon... \n The cursed babe \n Was hideous as Hell, and we \n Shrieked as we knew the twisted face \n Of him that decked the gallows tree.", ""),
        StaticBook("Chaos Begins", "saromon50", "Joma, 20th of The Deep Cold, 1326.  I am comming forth... Chaos is comming.  Today was the first day that I have noticed a change in me.  Chaos is stirring inside me...  I think something is comming that is not me, somthing completely different. I am writing this journal to record what happens after this point, if I will even remain in control. I sometimes know what I am doing, what I want... Simply power, like I have always wanted. But other times... Other times I don't know what I am doing, I want something completely different . I don't want power, or control.  It is the exact opposite. I want chaos.  Choas.  *writing suddenly becomes difficult to read* I am Chaos!  There is nothing but me!  Nothing more perfect! I will consume the world!  Even Iblees does not know what Chaos is able to do... *writting once agains becomes clear* No...No! I wont let him take over...  \n Tolta, 24th of The Deep Cold, 1326 I have begun to accept the one known as Chaos, he is me, and I  now understand what he wants .  He wishes to bring chaos to the world, be it in the form of destruction, or only deception.  However, I think that    he will succeed.  He is powerful, and very smart... I don't think anything can stop him. \n Irba, 32nd of Malins Welcome, 1326  I have let Chaos take complete control me...  Korbec is still here, but his intentions are gone.  completely controlled by the Choas inide him. *writing once agian becomes very difficult to read* It is time.  Chaos will win.  None of the gods can stop me now.  My army will grow... All will be consumed by Chaos... Tolta, 3rd of The First Seed, 1327  The Wardens have flet my touch. The will be the first to fall to the power of Chaos...", ""),
