        StaticBook("Charred Book", "Lagomorphia", "This book seems to have gone through a lot of abuse in its time. It has several bootprints over its covers, severe crinkling to the pages from being underwater, several different shades of blood caked onto it in places, tears in the pages, a large dark patch where an ink bottle has been spilt over it, and severe fire damage, as if someone has attempted to destroy it entirely. \n The strangest thing about this book is, despite its clear use, there is no writing in it whatsoever. It seems completely blank when you first look at it; the entirety of its text is the unintelligble foreign markings that form the title on the front. \n [[If you recieve this book somehow, please /tell lagomorphia ingame or send Lagomorphia a PM on the forums]]", ""),
