        StaticBook("Cloud temple", "Royced", "The cloud temple is a historical fortress that rest in peace, away from all sign of life in Aegis. It is the primary spot where the king's or Oren would reside in time of great need, or in severe warfare conditions between an unfightable fortress. Cloud temple also once was the home of Count Valkmore, whom dissapeared several hundred years ago. It was said that Count Vlakmore was the origonal creator of the temple, in hope that Aegis would forgive him for commiting an ungly sin.", ""),
