        StaticBook("Code of the Enderkind", "Adagea", ".*In this book is contained the writings of a strange and foreign hand. The script is curly and flowing, often looping into itself just to strike outwards to the next word or letter. Accompanying the alien text are pictures, drawn around the words like heiroglyphics, and sometimes even taking up entire pages with intricate and detailed designs that might just hold the key to understanding the the meaning of the book. .*", ""),
        StaticBook("Codex of War", "Harv0kz", "At this point in time, Aegis seems to have fallen apart. Those who names themselves \"soldiers\" only fight for profit and money nowdays. That is the lower bulk. The higher ranking take no more, no less, but fight blindly, for their Nation. The final few, fight for all. Fight for Aegis. Fight for the people. \nThere is no way we can stand idle while we shred each other to pieces. This Book, I write to chronicle my thoughts on the perfect warrior. A walking weapon, one who fights with sublime percision, or brute force. One, who takes no chance with death. It could be one that has faced death in the face, or one with enough", ""),
        StaticBook("Codrik's Journal", "Shadowninji", "Irba, 4th of the Grand Harvest, 1332 - First Entry:   I am here at he Shad'Rin Outpost in The Verge.  The creatures here are extremely Hostile and agressive, they have trapped me inside my house and I have no means of escape, I fear I might starve to death, for I am ru nning out of food.  I might try to tunnle to our store house and get some food. wish me luck!", ""),
