    private fun _AEGIS_6(): List<StaticBook> = listOf(
        StaticBook("Collgrins Story", "collgrin", "Collgrins story is about his troubles, strengths, Family, Clan and War. He went from Job to Job. Home to Home but now only sold in da Collgrins \"bookies\" does it give a inside look on his life \nnarrated by Collgrin \n When i was born I looked like a strong willed fighter my Shaman Friend once said to Meh. he knew my parents and dey were not evil nor were they traitors but they grew very old and had Me and my Uknown Twin were born they were supposed ta be executed for growing weak and slowing down da hunt So my parents split me and my brother up and left my brother under a bridge now if i knew wether it was on purpose i wish i could saya but da memorys of dis come from da shaman magic \n Soon i Run from my Parents and track my way back to da bridge their i was captured by Bandits. they soon took me to slave trade meet where i was goin to ba sold to da rich there i gathered all my strength i could and sliced through da wooden cage and ran out of da cave un noticed \n I survived da fights and battles later to come from bandits and other races and learned da basics of tree cutting and crafting and had dwarfs teach meh how to craft a pure iron sword at age 13 da travels brought great fortune but as i grew older less i remembered of da past \n one Night i traveled with a caravan of Goblins on their way to Sanhar their i met a shaman named Elder Krink \n He took me to his place where he told me all of the begginings of the trouble to da bitter end of when my parents dropped my brudda \n written and told by Elder Collgrin", ""),
        StaticBook("Colors of Fall", "Jallentime", "\nLeaves are in the Sky\nColoring the Air\nThey've shriveled up and died\n The cold they just can't bare \nNow on the ground they lie\nCrumbling away to dust\nThe forest floor is dyed\nSummer has finally hushed", ""),
        StaticBook("Combat log", "jessbot", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Combat Tactics 101 By Sir_Jack", "jackmonkey76", "combat is very important in out lands without it we stand no chance in the world as the years go by fighting is every where wars battles riots undead attacks and without the skill of a bow ao a sword you will not last long that is why this book is made . A sword is ment for close combat where your enemys are all around you a sword is very fast and deadly you can take out many enemys with just a couple of slashes. If you enemy has a sword try to stay behind him or to his side so you can hit him but he cant hit you back . Bows a bow is ment for long range attack to keep your enemy away and hopefully kill them at the same time and always stay by cover so you will be safe if they shoot back you will be safe and remember to have a plan before battle because charging into battle with no plan will most likely get you killed strategy is always a good idea. By Sir_Jack hail", ""),
