        StaticBook("Commands", "TheImpulseHQ", "wait, use htis letter Ser Delcius, a History of Lies All those other books are fake, they make up great stories about Ser Hortar, what they dont know is he *the page is ripped in this place* and that caused Ser Adgar to Flee to Hariel Castle, and there he *blood stains* but that is not all, for he *teeth marks* and at that moment, Delcius stormed in and slew him, and *blood is sprayed on this last page*", ""),
        StaticBook("Commands for shops", "fiercedragon", "/money pay [name] [amount] So that you may be payed or buy from another person.", ""),
        StaticBook("Communion with Spirits", "Respiren", "It is written that spirits once roamed the land, immaterial they could yet be seen, though never touched or heard. Fools slighted these spirits, only to have them linger, to cause mischief. Wise men learned to detect with these spirits through a dance known as 'Communion with spirits.' The dwarves also have a so-named rite. It however is not to be confused with the above. Being more concerned with mead than the supernatural. \n And so it was decreed on the 4th of July that all should drink ale and eat cake...and lo it was not a lie. \nIt is known to Druids that one may commune with unseen spirits by asking their true name.", ""),
        StaticBook("Completed Exorcism", "Ratemenatorz59", "Ibra, 11th of The Deep Cold, 1339 1330, mispelled. An elven girl, looked 10 years old. Possesed by demon. She lay in her bed,almost lifeless. Her pupils, dissolving. She cast a fiery blaze through the house, her brothers room, destroyed. I commanded her, I said \"I come in thy name of Aeriel, repent, repent to her!\" She responded, her voice changed, \"I... I am the one who dwells within..\" \"Speaketh thy name, Demon.\" I fired back a glare. \"I shall not!\" \"Then thou shall be left in eternal light, shine your light, M'lady! \" The demon left, but the girl had died in 3 hours time.. -The writings of the Exocist, rin..", ""),
        StaticBook("Completed:Cleaning room for market district", "LuckyToShoot", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Completed:Reed Farm!", "LuckyToShoot", "I had expanded the farm!A new farm!It's full of Reeeeeds!It's on the second floor! Go and check it out!", ""),
        StaticBook("Concerning the Crow", "Zefmc", "I Know little about the black crow but I don't like what they've done . I had a house in the city and it also had it's signs removed. They also seem to have put up rules of the city. They have no authority", ""),
        StaticBook("Concerning the Kotf Irba, 25th of Malins Welcome, 1307", "xXWOLVERINEXx", "Today I talked to general WeighLeigh of the Kotf . He told me he has not yet talked to Sgt Gais. I proceeded to tell him that if he ever needed our services to find us . I also helped defend Snowy fields from an undead attack. Snowy fields is however lost.", ""),
        StaticBook("conDoin Army", "NapaseT", "The conDoin army is a brand new army founded by Cataris (Archmage_Cataris), nonetheless we are are still strong.  We are an army that protects Aegis from all threats, Undead, Bandits, Rebels,  ect. Our army has positions you can choose. (Soldier, builder, blacksmith, ect.) Within those positions there are ranks you can get promoted up to, for example the soldier you start up as a recruit but as you work hard in the army you get promoted to a  private, then a corporal, and so on. In order to get in the army you must go on the forums (www .lordofthecraft.net/forum) and then under the section guilds youll find our army and you can simply apply.", ""),
        StaticBook("Conell's Biography", "xChocoTacox", "Conell was born 16 years ago. He was once a happy and joyful person. His mother was a quiet person, she mostly kept to her books. Her books dealt mostly with magic, which she took a great liking to. His father was a simple miner and woodcutter, but he was great with a bow. This small family lived in a forest far away from the cities, in a log cabin. Everything was perfect for Conell, he had fun playing with forest animals. But one day Conell got curious when he found one of his mother's books. She had told him to stay away from her books which she hid in her room. She said they had a mysterious power that he could never comprehend. Well Conell was young, and curious so he took the book and ran into the forest. He climbed into a tree, then made sure no one else was around. He opened to a random page and read: Teleportal ang aking mag kaaway ang. Conell: \"What that does that mean?\" Then a beam struck the ground... Conell ran back to his home with the book, scared for his life. He wasn't sure exactly where it struck, he just ran. When he got home he ran into the house, then to his parents room. There was a faint glow coming from their room before he entered. Right as he entered the room the glow dissapeared and his parents were gone. He panicked, then ran out the house calling their names.. He turned back around to see his house...gone...nothing stood there. He ran to where his house once stood, crying for the loss of his only family. He remembered the book he took from his mother's room, and looked for it. He found the book under the tree where he had read the single line. Now, pages were torn from the book, so he quickly looked up the author's name. He frantically searched, but the author's name had been smudged out. All he could read from the name was the letter a. So he set out on his journey into the dark, alone. Where was he headed? Anywhere that would lead to his parents. ...", ""),
        StaticBook("Confusion", "Cookie9000", "The wierdest thing happened today. Not something like a pink sheep, but someone named Gabriel Ubel walked to our gates, he was very nice, but his last name reminded me of someone... Someone I have at the tip of my tongue, yet cant remember... He is quite wierd, he even has two diffrent colored eyes, he tried to buy a house here, but doesnt have the money, I tried to offer him some, but yet he refused... Who would refuse free money? To make matters worse, when I asked about his diffrent colored eyes he quickly said \"None of your buissness, child.\" and ran off It makes a person wonder... - Alanor Hedgewell", ""),
        StaticBook("Congradulations!!", "chas5511", "Congradulations! You have recieved a Rose of Death! This means..You. Will die. In the next week. Goo d luck!", ""),
        StaticBook("Connor the Sweet", "kaikookoo", "Dear Connor. You are far too kind and sweet to me but for that I love you. No matter what you do, I'll always feel that way; whether you were to run away from me or were with another. You have so many good qualities it's hard not to care  for you. You're so brave and strong! Caring and sweet.  \n   Dear sweet Connor.", ""),
