        StaticBook("Cookbook: Volume I", "Meet2012", "Bread: Crafted by placing three pieces of wheat horizontally along the bottow of the crafting table grid.  Can be stacked up 64 pieces. Heals three hearts. \n Meat: All types of meat are prepared the same way: heated on a stove until cooked thoroughly. Uncooked meats give the consumer a 30% chance of contracting food poisoning.  Cooked meats also fufill more hunger. \n Mushroom Stew:  Crafted by placing a wooden bowl on the bottom-middle square of the crafting table, and placing one brown and one red mushroom (In any order) directly above it. Mushroom stew cannot be stacked.  Heals 4 hearts. \n Cookies: Crafted by placing one cocoa bean on the bottom middle space of the crafting grid , and placing a piece of wheat on both sides of it horizontally. Can be stacked in groups of eight.  Heals 1 heart.", ""),
        StaticBook("COOKIE!", "sirbubbley", "i want a cookie. i need a cookie. ill kill for a cookie. i killed for a cookie. i am dead now... but i got my cookie! i made a book", ""),
        StaticBook("Cookies", "gandalfthepwnage", "blargh erase  The world of Ageis is falling into an era of great peril and danger.  Just earlier today, I was attacked by a group of bandits on my to Oren! In oren there was an aura of great disscuss and worry.  Men sat and talked about trouble in the north. Guards stood on edge always ready to march out to battle. Anyone who looks out into the masses can see strange hooded figures prowling through the t crowds Every where you turn you see betrayl..I thought I knew an orc.  An orc by the name of Gaarag. That orc now murders and kills for he is an undead. On my way to Kraemore I encountered more bandits, luckily they were stopped . The world is falling into a time of darkness and the races squabble over pointless matters now is the time for action. the world of ageis must unite if we are to stnand against this undead horde", ""),
        StaticBook("Cookies!", "cowsgopoo", "Hey there! It's Winston here, and a lot of people have been asking how to make cookies . Well, I didn't really know the recipe, till I got drunk one day, but it's rather easy all you need to do, is put wheat on the left, coa coa beans in the middle, and another bundle of wheat on the right! Then, you just throw that inside the furnace ,and you wait till the dough becomes golden! \n Eat it quick now.... It's best when it's hot!", ""),
        StaticBook("Cooking basics", "redbaron", "\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Cooking for Dummies", "Elchraum", "Recipe: Grilled Porkchops\n Step 1: Place Porkchop in Furnace \nStep 2: Place Combustible Material in Furnace \nStep 3: Wait Ten Seconds \n   And Enjoy!", ""),
        StaticBook("Cooking Recipes", "Fluffy5", "1. Mushroom Stew: 1 Red Mushroom, 1 Brown Mushroom and a Bowl", ""),
        StaticBook("coolomancp's Journal", "coolomancp", "Today I bought this book from Kanrath, I am super happy about this and will plan to write more even though I will have shifts to do so that is all for today.  12/12/2011 Today has been rough going around so far with making sure my fake eye stays in place but it does not matter right now and I must now go. today is still hard, being a spy was hard too! I was almost cought but luckily I am ok and safe. ~~LONG LIVE THE UNDEAD~~  \n 13/12/2011 today is a crazy day, I have been cut from the military so I plan on becoming a undead! ALL HAIL IBLEES! This mortal world is no fun what so ever! They have no idea how pissed I am. Goodbye Alras!", ""),
