        StaticBook("Copy of Liber Mortuorum Originally by Redbaron", "Domainoft", "Veteres de magia undead est arcanum est. Etiam sit amet urna urna, ignis et necromantia. Multi non intelligunt undead. Sunt magis perniciosos hominibus. In mentes corrumpantur. Quamvis potentia sit quidam famelici. Iblees maledictio robustissimas, et quis vult difficultatem resistendi. Iblees primum loquitur de virtute. Multi in virtute et ductu multa diligentibus eam. Omnibus invadit me primum conjecti sunt per altitudinem undead amounts of balls fulgur et ignis. Dein, cum mortales ductu adepto propinquus. Et summone inferna ministros.", ""),
        StaticBook("copy of the map", "Sultan_Mogroka", "Top secotion depicts a large ocean, filled with craggy islans and the occasional red skull and crossbones. A curvy red line drops from the top of the page, winding around and avoiing the islands and the skulls, then disppearing off the left sie of the page. Tornn on the let and top sides, on the bottom of the page near the left side, you can barely make out the following: find a new land but beware flee from ing compared cursed, so beware Her you go. (fuck) how do I erse al ine.)", ""),
