        StaticBook("Correspondence between Tend'el and Ademas", "Cloudheart", "To Ademas, \n \nDear Friend, about three nights ago I finished work on the path through the mountain for you. I hope this makes passage safer for you. I also hid the path behind some trees, so you'd have the option of privacy. Please write back soon, \n \nYour friend, Tend'el", ""),
        StaticBook("corrution", "Kesh40", "hello sir/ma'm. My name is Kahn and I have unearthed some disturbing and cruel evidence against your guards I uncovered this evidence by illegal means but it had to be done. I found a guards report about the crimes in Oren over the last ear over half of them were stated that there was no reason. for jailing these people. I find this disturbing as It means innocent people are being jailed an/or executed for purely a grud ge related incident. Thank ye. Kahn i am done help", ""),
