        StaticBook("Curse those spiders! Well i survived thank aegis i did.", "jibtherandom", "I have found the objects but Vanya is nowhere tobe found! Curses! Its been a while i sppose i should talk about the battle of alras since not many know I was walking towards the markets along the kings road to find some food for me when i found monsters pouring out the nether portal take in the knowledge of the great books in the libary", ""),
        StaticBook("Cursed Chains", "Desires", "A circle of redstone is required for this spell. A symbal of Alchemist, water, fire, dark and light. In the middle should lay a headless body, as the missing head represents the spirit's missing maw. It's missing expression for life itself. With every death that happens in range of the circle, the spirit will grow in strength, letting the spirit's grip onto it's prey stronger. If the spirit has five lives, the captivator will die. String the body with chains onto the wall, let it bleed out and keep the victom of the Cursed Chains in the room for a year. The spirit of Chains will come and claim the prize, surpressing what power they use. The chains will break the weilders limbs if said power is used. Enough ignorance, the spirit will possess the body and crush the victom's frame to nothing.", ""),
        StaticBook("Customer Records", "TehLulu", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Da 'umie Translation", "Alex_Pan", "((This is the story of how Aerog'Lur The Great became universally known as the strongest glad iator in all of Krugmar. The story starts with a normal day in Sanhar. The orcs of Sanhar had gather ed at Craotor's Inn. We were very drunk and having a good time. An elf in the inn thought we were being too loud, so the elf hit me in the stomach as hard as he could. \"YOU!\", I said, \"THE ELF HIT ME!\". So I challenged th e elf to a fight in the pit ourside Sanhar. All the orcs came to watch me fight the elf. We stood on opposite sides of the pit, and Dominus Craotor refereed the fight. The fight star ted and I used the combo, 'Left, right, uppercut'. The stupid elf dropped to the floor, dead. I lick ed the blood from his neck and spread the blood over my head to show off my prowess. Then, I pissed on his skull. All the orcs cheered me on for killed the elf. However, the Domi nus got jealous - unbelievable, right? Craotor got jealous because I was so popular after winning. S o, Craotor challenged me to a fight. I didn't want to fight him because he's a big orc, but he challanged me, so I had to fight him. So we went into the pit. But first, we got drunk , and then we fought. So we fought for a while with no clear winner, but I was pretty sure I had the upper-hand. With the combo 'Left jab, left jab, right hook, left hook, right roundhouse kick' he fell to the ground, barely breathing. I licked the blood off his face and apoligized for b eating him up. I was so excited because I beat Craotor, and Craotor beat the Rex, so that means I'm the best fighter in all of Krugmar! After the fight, I got many females... Surprise ending ; )", ""),
