        StaticBook("Da Epic Book!", "sirbubbley", "Come to Tailion's Slot Machine the best gambling ring around. you can win easy moeny and have a good timme. jsut come on down to Laurlein and hit the marketplace and find the Mossy Cobblestone stall t ake the lift down take a left and start gambling", ""),
        StaticBook("Da Histury o' Fort Tythus", "loopmoploop", "Many, many seasonz ago. Dere wuz a guild called de I.A. De tuupid' I.A. built dere base about 50 stepz away frum Sanhar. So it wuz on Ork land Wargoth Mogroka demanded a triboot frum  de I.A. Bud dey refuse ta pay . De Orkz. Wid sum elp' frum our twiggy allies. Klomped all de I.A. in da base n' tuuk it . De Krughai tear down de I.A. base n' make it nubmure. Den de I.A. leada demand de tuff' dat de base made of. We say nub. So e' runz like coward. Den we build a great Sandstone fort where de old I.A. base wuz. Wargoth Mogroka name de place, \"Fort Tythus\". So dat be da histury o' Fort Tythus. DA END. Diz buuk be by Rannulf lat twig ((oops)) me make for lat grr))", ""),
        StaticBook("Da instructinz of da mian castleheata 2", "Eltyer", "II: Whud to do when? Situation I: Da machine stopped pumpin' Solution I: Dere be a lever located just besides da pumpin' mechanism. Hit da lever two or one time, da machine will get reset. And den it starts up gain.", ""),
        StaticBook("Da instructionz of da main castleheata", "Eltyer", "Nud led it explode. I: Whud parts are whud? II: Whud to do when? I: If ye walk up to da heata, you see left da main heata of da palace. Dis be a fire dat should be on at all timez, or da machine will stop. Bisidz dat dere is da pumpin' machine, dis makes all da water go 'round da palace. To keep da cold places hot. Bazicly dis pumpin' mechanism will flow da hot water round da palace. Dis be da last piece , here be da cool water dat got back from da circulation round da palace. Dis water be waitin to be warmed up again. Diz was da first instruction book, please read da second one. 'Whud to do when'", ""),
