        StaticBook("Da Mad Orc", "BobNorton", "In da orc city, der be many orcs but one of dem be standin out He called Bog He be a craaaazy orc he tried ta rob me, auot it was a scary time, but a nice elf girl saved me she is nice so now i be warnin da others about dis orc Authors Note: I wrote this for Auot, as he cannot write.", ""),
