        StaticBook("DA RUNT HANDY BOOK", "mason9108", "so lat tink he be toguh enough for da krughai eh?", ""),
        StaticBook("Daemon Creators.", "Galoi", "Observance of Daemons There are others besides the living in this world. We call them the undead. Or did rather. They vanished a long time ago but they were pre-dated by a more sinister evil . The Daemons. In the begining there were only the Daemons. All else you hear is lies. There were no benevolant gods in the starting times, only the Daemons. The Daemons wrote the world in their minds and it sprang to life. The Daemon world was filled with horrors we cannot fathom, yet it was beutiful in its intricitie. All was more or less peaceful until the Aedra were born. The cast down the Daemon's and took their people as their own. Spreading false proficies and profanities against the Daemon creators. [ The writing is too broken up after this} [You leave the book back and return to your journey, burdened by its knowledge.] [Sure that there is more to be learned, you decide to seek out the books author]", ""),
        StaticBook("Daevis' Journal", "MilanS12", "Day 1: I have managed to gather a large sum of money by selling dark wood and flint. To Prince Native actually. He knows good deals. I'm starting to become very fond of him. Good person he is. But a bit strange too. \nDay 2: I am now currently in hiding, smelting my ore. I actually found a dungeon, and with luck, was able to dig further down Aegis. Normally rocks get hard and are practically unbreakable, but not this time. I think someone had a permit there. They did not place a sign or anything, it was just a hole I bumped into and just randomly started digging. It's been a long day, I've searched for Prince Native everywhere and was unable to find him. But I'll find him eventually - and sell all the things I've managed to collect from the cave. Oh man, I'm going to be rich!", ""),
        StaticBook("Dagoth's Journal", "dagothagahnim", "Entry 1: I have been back at the White Raven sanctuary for a week now, and things are going well.  I have shaken off the influence from the Ender Pearl, I don't hear its voice in my head anymore. There is a terrible thunderstorm overhead right now, much like the one when I first found that damn Pearl.  I am not worried though, it is gone for good, I threw it into the lava of the flying citadel . I don't know exactly how long I was stumbling around while under the Pearl's influence, but I have estimated it to be around a month.  I found shrines to Iblees with my handwriting, and I have no mem ory of making them.  I tore them down, 3 in all, but I don't know if there are more. That is NOT the man I am, and I am confident I have the mental capacity to resist such a posession in the future.  I will begin keeping journals every now and then so I can reflect on them, and if my behavior becomes eratic, the writings should give me and others warning. I am Dagoth Agahnim, I am proud to be a Dragoon, and prouder still to be my own man.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dah Black 'and: List o' membas", "deavs", "Dis be all dah skah dat I believe are in dah black 'and, just ta be clear, dah Black 'and is a cult dat serves Ibilees. An' dat it hard to tell dah difference between minion skah, Black 'and skah, and just people dat work wit dah undead sometimes, but dey all be skah, so lat should klomp on sight. ASH: MITHAS. Mithas is a blonde 'uman mage. 'e is a skah dat is not to be messed with, 'e is real triksy. Nub believe 'im if 'e say dat 'e is insane. 'e just stab lat in dah back if lat help 'im. I believe dat 'e is dah apprentice of a 'uman wit white 'air who likes to carry a blue staf. Sidenote about Mithas: 'e is a cannibal, so don't lat be suprised when he tries to bite lat, also Mithas be good wit' a gold sword. TWO EOIN. Eoin 'as worked wit' Mithas an' Lucas Black. 'as been described asa \"treachous bitch, who stole pieces of my soul\" -Throdo Therving. Now nub sure if she actually did do voodoo on 'is soul, but lat should be careful anyway.", ""),
        StaticBook("Daily Gossip", "Charles_Grimlie", "The Daily Gossip is property of the Barley Brew Emporium... Hello Macdaddy here brining you todays Gossip and news! Sounds of thunder continue to emanate from Oren! The possibility of another undead attack may be hig h! So be on the look out for hooded figures bearing gold encrusted staves... In other news Kramroe has suffered a recent blow from a unknown source! Civilians are asked to collect their items and goods. As buildings fall under their own weight! And in local Gossip what was the true cause of the bastard son of King Syrio's death? Some say he yelled that the king didn't love him and he jumped after! Off of the newly constructed Dwarvern Hall's pillars... Locals said that the kid was a snod and rude so no one attended the funeral after. This was The Daily Gossip! Remeber to tell your friends of the Barely Brew Emporium!", ""),
        StaticBook("Daily Gossip #2", "Charles_Grimlie", "This is the Daily Gossip Again Brought to you by the Barley Brew Emporium! Written by Barman Macdaddy. A mysterious force caused a casual patron of the Barley Brew Emporium to fall out of his bed last night, and into his own fire place! Luckly he survived the encounter with the fire to tell the tale... Ok done! Ah perfect! Wow! *Holds out writing tools... You dont mind if I write this down correct? You dont mind me writting this down correct? help Hrmm... And what town is this? They dont! I have heard of another one...", ""),
        StaticBook("Daily Gossip #2 Edit 1", "Charles_Grimlie", "This is the Daily Gossip Again Brought to you by the Barley Brew Emporium! Written by Barman Macdaddy. A patron of the barley brew recently decided to try out our new drink without Proper testing! The patron quickly lit on fire! Lucky he survived the sudden combustion. In turn we dedicated this new brew to him and called it the Inferno... This is not available to the public due to it's... Flammable capability! In other news things go bump in the night in Alras. As folk have started getting busy! Luckly we wont be mentioning their names. We where surprised by the interesting rooms they where taking action in... And to be honest me and the king had a few good laughs. Welcome! Good eh?", ""),
        StaticBook("Daily Oasis", "459pm", "Date: 10/17/11 WALL BEING BUILT: today we started work on the wall the town voted and cose Tolkiens wall, its made from redwood, so the town bank is now perchasing LOTS of redwood so if you have time in your day, go chop redwood. UNDEAD RAIDS DRIVE UP FOOD PRICES: the price of bread has gone up allot in major citys over the last few weeks, because farmers are scared to go farm! Most of them have had there crops burned by undead and are hoping for a comback this year. THE DAYILY DROP: Zombiee's drop dead fish? allarently! now when you kill a zombiee there is a chance it will drop a dead fish apon death! ADDVERSISEMENTS: Ebs Tavern just oppend! come enjoy amazing ale from Elbs secret brew!", ""),
        StaticBook("Dairy of Silvermein", "ZazarusDious", "Thar be some days I wish I was with me old clan. Bu' fate is cruel and yet we grow strong frem it. \n \n Last o' me clan and yet I still live. A blessin' frem de creator or per'aps just a delay from my trip to the deapest of de neather. I live in a new land now, friendleh dwarves here. Fer de most part. Meh new home of Kal'Urguan.", ""),
        StaticBook("dairy page 1", "Nigthhealz", "dairy", ""),
        StaticBook("Dalejin to Queen Dawn", "Priority", "Dalejin says that the attack will be in one months time. (OOC: 1 Week RL). \n This journal can be used by me to pass messages on to you from Dalejin. As well we have learned you are to be the first target.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dalfare's autobiography", "dalfare", "My name is dalfare, and this is my story : i was born a lowly orc peasent my father was a common thief, and my mother killed herself the day after i was born it was a hard life, but i got through it, my aspiration in life is now to make a dark guild,e for damned one's like me, i learnt to tame spiders, and now they are my friends, i have come far in this life, and have finnaly reached a wealth i have now started on my aspiration, and hope that others like me can to i have started down the path of evil, wishing that i was one of the undead that plague the lands, If only, If only, my mother, hadn't died, i might have found peace in my solemn life My father, a thief, nor my best friend, a rat. i wish to find sanctuary, It's saddening now, but i have no regrets, for all of my friends, they are here with me\\ i will help others, upon their journeeeey", ""),
        StaticBook("Dalfare's quote's", "dalfare", "First quote- hoorah for the moon, for it may bring my friends rest and my enemy's peace", ""),
        StaticBook("damage the casters soul the most. Some of the most infamous curses in history are direct", "Eric_Armadillo", "curses. They take effect brieflybut powerfully. \n \n Halfchronic curses are cast like direct curses but have much longer-lasting effects. Only few curses are meant to be halfchronic curses. More often than not a direct curse becomes a halfchronic curse by being used impropper or with a lack of resolve or need, leaving the victims body or soul scared, be it a wound refusing to heal or a loss of memory.\n \nthe only halfchronic curse I dare to mention here is the Carnivora-curse, eating away the victim's body slowly but painfully. \n \nThe creation of curses: \n", ""),
