        StaticBook("Dawn Perea", "firespirit44", "Name: Dawn Perea \n Race: Human \n Age/Gender: 28, Female \n Skills: Baker \n Dawn Perea, once known as Queen Dawn, married to King Pampo. Since his fall, she became a baker of Dawn's bakery by the Al Khazar port. It was a very lucrative business, she was able to buy her own island abit South West of Al Khazar, living with Connor and Hempshine. She was one of the contender's of the throne when Edmund died. She rounded up support for herself to battle with Gaius Marius, another contender for the throne. But Prince Enor stepped in, and rightfulyl claimed the throne. This has left bitter rivalry between the 2 factions. Lady Dawn Perea now resides in Winterfell and strives for its population.", ""),
