        StaticBook("Day 3", "ChromeWolf", "Day 3,I'm starting to take note on what I've done.\nSo far My friend has made this ok for us to live in. I've have found another dog,still........", ""),
        StaticBook("Day in and day out the medics try to revive the High Guardian while monitoring his health but", "callum2357", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Day in the life of a dwarf in Al'Khazar", "blah_1123", "I met the king today, nice man, helpful when he can be. I asked him for a job in politics.... Got asked to produce stone for construction... Not quite what I had hoped for. I've earned a fair few minas now from it though, i'm getting to know him a bit better, hopefully that means I will be able to get a better job in future. \n No respone on my application for the guard yet. There's a feast on saturday, guess I won't be going.", ""),
