        StaticBook("Day One", "U_Shankopotamus", "We have found a small island in the woods. Darius and I began Constructing a house and Gaurdtower .", ""),
        StaticBook("Day one on my on whisper isle", "Bourebro", "UNDEAD! they must be purged!", ""),
        StaticBook("day one we set up camp in a cave. and got some iron", "colin1389", "we plan to go to the hell gate and seel it so the undead", ""),
        StaticBook("Day One: Strength", "BannanaToYou", "Hmm, I feel wierd, as if something is taking my mind over. I might have to find a doctor, but for now I must check upon my farm and my cattle.", ""),
        StaticBook("Day XI", "Leopled1", "Today i spoke to decora. She had managed to get out of the house. But only for a short while Her eyes gazed into mine with relief. But i knew she would get pulled back. I was scared... Scared for her, and that she may be there the rest of her life. I watch each day Hoping that there is some spirit left in the slaver, And that he will free her from his grasp. But they are just wishes. Dreams. In this case, they are a myth to me. But i must have hope. Faith, and she will come home. one day.", ""),
        StaticBook("Day XII", "Leopled1", "Today. Today i watched the house. For hours. Hoping she would walk out free of the clutches of there prison. Each hour that passed by the sun, Had felt like another part of my life was ripped Away. I gave up hope. But i saw her in the window. She looked back. And i cried for her And walked away. I had to walk away from the image in the mirror. Because it will never meet me to touch my hand. The thought of never feeling her hand again made me burst into sadness. So then, The day had ended.", ""),
        StaticBook("Day zero. I set off walking with only my trusty iron sword.", "boodilly", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Dayereth's Journal", "outasync44", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Days of darkness", "stiason", "The void, a place of darkness and peace. I know this place well. I have met a beautiful elf who has the powers to control the mind. She has opened my mind, seen my darkest demons and still talks to me. it would seem that I have found someone who I can truely talk to. I have so longed for someone who knows what is like to be truely alone as I have been. This elf even helped me face my fears of my evils inside and has given me the power and the will to control my darker form that threatens to consume me and all those who I care for including her. I have experienced something that is unlike anything I have known of yet. the feeling of being needed. I feel as if I have a reason to stay alive. a reason to want to exist. These are dark days that we live in and I fear that even the life of an elf like me could be cut short at any moment. I now know what it is to fear death. I fear not the aspect but the result on others who knew and cared for me. I have found many that I could call my friends and I feel less alone than I once felt. Now I feel as if I can live to face the world with a purpose. a purpose to protect those who I care for at the cost of my life. I have taken many oaths to protect all. I feel as if I now understand the true measure of these oaths. I am not to just throw away my life to protect others. I am to use the life I am given to help protect others and return to those who care. Just months ago I was not sure if I would live another day and did not really care if I did or not. So much can change in such a short time. In these days of darkness we must all find the desire to live or perish trying. for what is living without a purpose. We all must find our own reason to live and fight. To protect that which matters to us and to always fight, not just to help and die, but to return to those who we truely care about.", ""),
        StaticBook("DayWalker Records", "Pravino", "Name: Tuktuk \n Rank: SunWalker \n \n Name: Pravino \n Rank: Diplomat \n \n Name: Brinjolf \n Rank: DayWalker \n \n Name: Milarol \n Rank: DayWalker \n \n Name: Ien_Renijh \n DayWalker \n \n Name: Tybalt \n Rank: TorchWalker", ""),
        StaticBook("Dazen's Sicarius Journal", "Vicentee", "Day 1: I have become a Sicarius, and am learning more about Talun.  It is quite a nice little town, and I am learning more about the locals. \n Day 2: Today, I received a contract to help a citizen build a house. Quite simple. I earned 500 minas after the contract.", ""),
        StaticBook("De jurnal ov Harnokk", "JAGoMAN", "Me 'avent dun enyfing today for nao, bot me be guin tu bee staetinn dat wi need en spa ur poo blic pul ur bof tu de caunsil ov Kal'Bryst. me is seein de sonn raysin, suun anoder day. \n Day 2. \n De furst fing me did wus tu kill en kreepur en un skillentun frum de kreepur me gut en coel en un airon whajl ffrum de skillentun me gut arros \n middnaight ov day 2: me 'avent dun enyfin nao ekzept faundin aot moor aboot dees buks", ""),
        StaticBook("De Longitudine - Cerlos", "Pepernoot", "Greetings reader. I am Cerlos, a scholar currently living West of Al'Khazar. In this book I will explain how to calulate distances, using two known distances, which intersect eachother at a straight angle. \n Lets take the example of a triangle, with two straight edges of lengths three and four. We know the length of the third edge is five. You can measure this. But how do we know what the length is when we have different numbers? To explain this, I will have to teach you an old formula, which always give the right length. To understand this I will first have to explain some things first. \n \n Squaring numbers. \n A square of a number is the number of squares that are in an area of a square with both edges of the same length. For example the square of one. If you have a square with two sides length one, the area is one. Next the square of two, if you have a square of sides two in length, the area is four squares. To continue the square of three, which is an area of nine squares. \n \n There is also a way to revert the squaring of a number. The square root. \n The way to know these is remembering the squares of numbers. For example the square root of an area of twenty-five is five, because five squared is twenty-five. \n \n Now we can use these to calculate the distances! \n Let's take our example, the two lengths of three and four. To calculate the diagonal length, we take the squares of both numbers, add them, and take the square root of that number. So that would be nine and sixteen, adding these makes twentyfive. Take the square root of twentyfive, and you have the length, five!", "")
    )

    private fun _AEGIS_7(): List<StaticBook> = listOf(
        StaticBook("De Ridiculous things ye Witness", "ZazarusDious", "Bovine Cavalry Detachement - Orc Named Raid. and an unknown UAC soldier.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dealing with Dwarfs", "xzpepijnzx", "By Rivell Gordian \n ____________________ \n Dwarves are, without question, the most abhorring spawn of Aegis. They spend their lives burrowing through rocks and mud, before returning home to poison themselves with too much ale and poorly cooked meat. Of course, like many civilized men I'd much rather avoid dealing with dwarves altogether, but even I cannot deny the necessity of talking to dwarves every now and then. \n If you ever have the misfortune of such an event, I would advise you to keep to the following pointers: \n - Never allow a dwarf to consume beer within your house. Despite the hair, passed out dwarf does not make convenient carpet. \n - If a dwarf sees something breakable, he has to smash it. If he sees something that isn't breakable , he'll consider it a challenge and try to smash it for hours on end. Keep all possessions on a safe distance from all dwarves (the top shelf will do.) \n - Do not let any dwarves sit on your best furniture. If possible, cover all seats with rags and say it's fashion. \n -Never, under ANY circumstances, no matter how applicable it is, use the phrase 'be the bigger man'", ""),
        StaticBook("Dean Challenging", "Ansh98", "Many believe that they have the skill to become a Dean. Deans are the highest rank in the Oasis Crafters.  There is only 1 Dean per category. Deans have the right to assign their category a project. Deans are equipped with mighty power \n Deans are very respected, however, they can be challenged. When Deans are challenged and the Dean accepts, with a founder's approvel, the competition ma y begin. The competition will be judged by one/both of the founders.  The founder will issue what the  competiters are to make. \n If the challenger succeeds in defeating the Dean, the challenger will be  crowned Dean of his/her category. However, if they challenger loses the competition, the challenger must wait 30 ((IRL)) days to challenge once again. Good luck to all challengers and build on!", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Ademas,", "xChocoTacox", "If you find this, I am already gone...to where? Who knows... I feel as if I have been nothing but a burden lately so I have left... Farewell in all of your upcoming journeys...good-bye friend...", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Alethion", "Rhisereld", "\nLove is blind, but I can see \nSee it move inside of me \nCalm my beast, cut this tail \nBlunt this tooth and trim this nail \nDarkness unfold, weather turn \nHold my heart or I'll soon learn \nSweet companion of my heart \nKeep your wits, don't heed the dart \nSay goodbye to a smouldering hearth \nI lead you down a dangerous path \nNotch an arrow, string your bow \nFollow me and you'll soon know \nI wondered why your eyes turned grey \nInto Death's maw I made my way \nI spat in your face and left you behind \nBut still you wouldn't leave my mind \nGet out of my face, get out of my sight!    \nI won't walk thin ice to survive this night  \nFrom corruption's end you pulled me back \nDeflected, softened, dodged my attack \nYou gave me your love and I took it to hold \nReturning to blaze the night untold \nSo now I wonder, purity clad \nIs goodness really all that bad?", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Alys", "SpazmaticSniper", "Alys, I am sorry for what i said. It was wrong of me, I should of learned from the last time. If you can find it in your heart to forgive me, I am sorry. I dont want to make you mad, or upset I care about you. You know that. But if you dont want to speak to me for a while I understand From your Friend (Hopefully still) Torok Got A letter but.. cant find her to  give it to her (( that last line was mistake and ooc. forget it please :D ))", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Alys", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "You are invited to Lenson and Arya's wedding sunday 20.11.2011 13.00, Hope you can come! (you know where it is)  From Lenson and Arya! <3", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Annora", "Nanomatrix", "Sometimes, lips are sealed, tongue is tied, sometimes, hands can't reach, the feelings are locked, Into these eyes, read the words unsaid, the feelings not laid, plunge deeply into my heart, every time, love is there, love is there... Love you Annorra!", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Argos", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "you are invited in Lenson and Arya's Wedding sunday 20.11.2011 13.00, Hope you can come,Meet up in dawn's bakery 15 minutes before the wedding From Arya and Lenson", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Ariana, you might not remember me but we meet up north a few weeks ago.", "Domainoft", "I am in search of a few books of elvish History and was curious if you have a copy that I might copy in turn. I checked the library and in front of our fair city and both shelfs were empty of there contents. Please send word when you recieve this either way Thank you, -Dom ((Domainoft))", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Ashley", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "You are invited in Lenson and Arya's Wedding sunday 20.11.2011 13.00, hope you can come . Meet up in Dawn's Bakery 15 minutes before                    From Arya and Lenson", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Dawn", "pcgeek61995", "Dearest Dwan Perea Former Queen of Oren,\n I am sorry for the behavior of some men in your bakery today I tried my best to help out but alas it didn't all go so well. But that is not why I am Writing you.\n I truely love visiting your Tavern or Bakery it feels like a bit of both and was hoping I could work here. Either as a erand guy body guard roudyness neutrulizer or general helper. \n ((Your place has the best RP ever i love coming here and spending time with you and hempy :) )) \n I thought writing a letter would be better so we didn't get interrupted by others or others also rapidly applied for jobs \n Sincerely ~Raghnok Stonebeard of House Silvermein  .*next to his name is a wax seal featuring a silver bar and a red bird", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Diary Today i have locked my chest and doors i am so happy", "Blind_Bird", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Douglas Mackay", "Alectriciti", "I do hope you don't mind me searching through your house. I was awfully hungry. But I couldn't help but notice the ale you stored away underneath the bookshelves. I can smell that stuff from miles away. I hope you don't mind me taking one bucket of ale. \n ~Alethion", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Dusty", "corlark", "Dusty, its Dad. If you are reading this, your mom and I are dead. You are going to be sent to an orp orphanage but dont worry. Keep the things I gave you close, and hopefully you get adopted. I gave you: This book I told you not to read until you thought it was the right time, I gave you the map with places ive hidden some things you may need, ive given you my sword that I used in the war. Dusty, I love you. Goodbye, son.", ""),
        StaticBook("dear father", "nikias_1996", "dear father you probally don't know me but i do know you. my mother told me evrything about you. ow where are my manners my name is Gilleas vonlichtenstein and i am your son. i was born 8 months after mom left you at the time that i m writing this i am 19 . mother died and i wish to know who my father is i know that it is you and i would like to meet you. if you wan't the same just write an answer and but the book in a chest outside of the keep of the white ravens greetings Gilleas von lichtenstein", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Father", "ggt3416", "I know you had to leave... I just hate the timing. Things have only taken a turn for the worse after you departed. Zyn has just told me that Thral admitted he had a demon in him, and that he also loves another. She says he's going to leave for several years to find a cure. My poor sister, she's in shambles. \n I can't say I'm doing much better. Voak and I had another fight. Except this time, he says he doesn't love me anymore. I would have left Malinor if it were not for my son. I can't just get up and leave Aylir, even if it's extremely painful to see Voak. Aylir is a smart boy. He's already speaking little words such as \"Momma\", \"Papa\" and \"Fwiend.\"\n I wish you were here, father. How many years has it been? Do return safely to us..", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Gefan and Rozia", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "You are invited in Lenson and Arya's wedding saturday 12.11.2011 13.00, hope you can come.Meet up in Dawn's Bakery 15 minutes before the wedding           From Arya and Lenson", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear High Prince", "kittenaid", "High Prince, I hope you're well. I wished to leave you a note as I have not seen you  for some time. I have heard of wars and wish you are safe. I do worry. \n I do not quite know what to write so maybe I should be honest and say I do miss you when you are not around. Every time somebody asks for the High Prince I cannot help but smile at your name. I planted the flower you game me not too long ago in the plantpot in this room, so it will stay safe. \n I wish you safe travels Dear High Prince, Lirinya~", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Indelwehn", "Minnan1", "The Undead are attacking once again, I have no choice but to help Bircalin and my friends at war against them. If I don't return...I want you to know that I'll be always at your side for when you need me.... \n I Love you, take care of Eowehn and Arya....Take care of yourself.... \n \n -Aedan", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Josef,", "everblue2er101", "I do not know what to say, really, other than the truth. First, my dear, I want you to know that I am safe, as are your sisters. But James... There was an attack on the village by monsters a few days ago. I was in the fields, and James was in his shop. The monsters came so quickly and with such force that we were all taken by surprise. The fields were sieged, and I escaped after beating corpses with my hoe. I found your sisters and we fled to the forest. When we returned, we found the village destroyed, with bodies everywhere. The butcher tells me that James grabbed his bow and did all that he could. He only fell when one of those fire flinging beasts got near him. Flora and Tabitha joined the battle near the end as well. We are safe now in a town nearby. Please, do come see me soon. Your sisters probably will move. I hope that you are safe. Stay strong. Love, Mother.   \n PS Your father may have fallen, but not in vain. You and your sisters can still avenge him... \n PS Your father may have fallen, but not in vain. You and your sisters can still avenge him...", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Kai", "Nanomatrix", "Sorry about the date, it was probebly not as exciting as you may have wished, i can understand if you rather a man who can talk, but any way, i thought you may of enjoyed the veiw as i live thing's like that, but that may just be because ican not speak, i enjoy what i can. Kai, I will be marching off to war soon, as i am not sure when it is or wether i will survive, I jsut wish to say, that i Love you, and if i am to perish, i will be watching over you from Aerial's kingdom. Love you Kai.... Your's truly, Karter", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear King Syrio We would like to include you in a act for The Knighting Of Sir_Wyvernos", "patato12", "And Bito Please Read The script Which will be given to you also sincerly James ((patato12)) Please see me if you wish to preform oh hi", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Len", "Vardak", "I personally am sending this letter to you in regards to the wedding celebration. If there has been progress made in letting us use beautiful Dunwood for the party. Please seek me out \nSigned Vardak, Oren Military Advisor.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Leon", "DecoLamb", "\nMy Dear Leon... I managed to sneak away for a moment when Jacksent me off to collected wood Hoever you were away.. I'm glad to see the fort has held up well though I took a moment to lay in the bed and rest, it was much warmer than the bed there... I miss you so very much... I hope that the higher ups come more often to see Jack And thusly, see me. If I can jsut work my way up the line, I'm sure I can do something! Who knows.. I might become Queen of the Undead at the end of all this, and turn the evil into something of useful good I must go now.. I hope this letter finds you well. I miss you every so much... \n-Decora", ""),
        StaticBook("DEAR MR ORK", "greeneggsnham555", "I AM SORRY I WAS RUDE AND I WONT DO IT AGAIN. Logan", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Mr. Orc", "greeneggsnham555", "Bastion is a  Bastiard", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Mulien we go griefed and robbed, if anything is missing from your chests", "dalfare", "Dear Mulien We got griefed and robbed, if anything is missing from your chests thats why your stuff is missing, if any is. From Dalfare", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Nightmare:", "Bloodnight", "Deal with it, I'm a higher rank than you, You need to treat with me respect, Not ignorance. *Throws the book at nightmare.. \"Read it.\"", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Orison", "calvinnok", "Hey budd, \nIt's me, Noku, As I found that the server will be fully reset (except inventory), in two months, I got all my items back into the inventory and will NOT online until the server rese t, I wroth this letter to inform you about this, sorry that I can't help you look after your farm. I also left one copy of my guild profile in this chest, se you in the new world host. \nNoku \n1/11 (real date)", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Persephone", "Alectriciti", "I cannot tell you how sorry I am. I feel the best way to show an apology is to spend time on it. So I will write to you. You are the most fearless girl I know. You are kind, gentle, and beautiful. I guess, you could say, you're the essence of the perfect girl. You are perfection. And I have ruined you. I can no longer ask you to forgive me. Please know, I wish to protect you... \n \n \n \n \n \n \n With all my heart... \n \n \n ~Alethion Celebtaurë", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Polcari", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "You are invited in Lenson and Arya's Wedding Saturday 12.11.2011 13.00, Hope you can come .Meet up in Dawn's Bakery 15 minutes before the Wedding                    From Arya and Lenson", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Rakin", "emberhard", "Hey, its been a while and I was thinking it is about time you moved out. I mean I would be more Willing to let you stay if you were actualy around more often and apeared to be working your way out , but you don't appear to be doing much of anything, I just wanted to Tell you, and give you time to get your things together, and your things in order. \n I',m trying to say this in the nicest way possible but I fear it is not coming out that way.... \n signed Emberhard \n ps Please place a responce to this in my mailbox, If you do not respond swiftly, I will take action.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Reader", "Alectriciti", "By the time you see this book, I will be gone. I'm not coming back here. I have built a compass and am headed back home to Al'khazar, to my fiancé, Rhisereld. I do hope she's okay. Please help yourself to anything in this house. You're welcome to make it as your own, but please do not destroy it. Farewell, stay safe out here. I've left an extra compass in this chest if you ever become lost. Use it wisely.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Rhisereld", "Alectriciti", "I cannot believe what I have done. I don't know why I did it, or exactly what happened. \n \n I broke my promise that was stored in our vows. I looked at another with lustful eyes. The enemy attacked me in a weak spot. The weakest spot I have is you. Cataris attacked me, and he's ruining me. I don't want him to ruin us though. We have-", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear rose", "assassin296", "Dear princess Rose you may not know me but we have met befor       i need your assistants something is wrong with me i feel something evil taking over me you are the only one that can and will help me you are the purist of heart of any one in all of aegis please i need your help Yours Truly   Sir_John", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Salmeer", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "You are invited in Lenson and Arya's Wedding saturday 12.11.2011 13.00, Hope you can come.Meet up in Dawn's Bakery 15 minutes before the wedding From Arya and Lenson", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Servina", "Auvreaeath", "Dear Servina, \nI do not know if the life of a traveler is my life, I am a Warden.. A Protect", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Sir, we The DarkFang's require your assistance as an ally against the Guardians,", "xxXHunterXxx", "lol", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Tend'el", "Ep152", "Hello Tend'el, \n \n I have traveled to the snowy wasteland of Astion and back looking for answers. I think I have discovered how I can rid myself of this curse. But first I must find some of the most powerful templars. But before that, I'm going to need your help. I cannot discuss it in this letter. I must talk to you in private. I have been at the cloud temple a lot lately. Go there some time and I may be there. Then we can discuss my plans. I will see you there my friend. \n \n Sincerely, \n  Ademas \n \n P.S. If you wish to reply, do not bring it to my mailbox as I am currently unable to visit my own home.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Valzar", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "You are invited to Lenson and Arya's wedding saturday 12.11.2011 13.00, hope you can come.Meet up in \"Dawn's Bakery\" in Laurelin 15 minutes before the wedding starts From Arya and Lenson           And by the way you are allowed to take with you some near friends", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear your Grace", "PineappleWizard", "Dear your Highness", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear your Highness", "PineappleWizard", "Me and my brother Klargus may have found an apt solution too the threat of possible undead attack at our fair city. We have been developing a weapon that could be installed at the front and rear gates of the city.We would be honoured if you accepted council with us, our invention could bolster the cities defences significantly. For this demonstation we many need to borrow 20 redstone, but this will be returned after the demonstration. We hope you have the time to read this , my lord Long live the king . Your's sincerely, Hrothgar and Klargus", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear Zoe", "nikias_1996", "dear zoe i am afraid that i jah to go. But wwhen i get back i really wan't to hear all about the story that you where going to tell me. Greetings Heril", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear, Mitchell", "Dacripla99", "Hey its Amber, I bought a house in Laurin. Its near the gate.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear, Mr. Orc", "greeneggsnham555", "Bastion is making me write this book because I was 'rude' to you. I wasn't. You spit on my boot, than offered me some Halfling Soup.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear, Mr. Ork", "greeneggsnham555", "I am writing this to explain to bastion why I was being 'rude' to you. First: You aproached me and Spit on my boot. Second: You offered me some 'Halfling' Soup, as you must know is incredably repusive to humans. Third: After I asked you to leave you refused and said you were going to follow me because you were 'bored' Are you happy 'Sir'? I suppose not.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dear, Valian...", "Desires", "To say I'm without fear, it wouldn't be true, I'm afraid of sickness, humilation, like anyone, I have dreams, but I've learned to hide them, To protect myself. From fullfillment, all happiness, Attract's the Fate's anger. They are sisters, savages-- In the end they have no emotion but envy.. I shall break from my shell and speak to you with these quivering lips, opening my melted iced heart.. I.. do have feelings of love to you.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dearest Ventraux", "professorshields", "If you are reading this I have passed away. Atached with this letter is my final gift to you. It is my most prized iteam, my staff I Ventraux, Have the ability to use magic. When I forst brought you in you were an average dwaft child. Average. But as you grew it would seem you staarted to harness the mystical essence I gave off Started to consume it. Be one with it. That is why I leave you my staff so that when I go my legasy lives on in you. Learn to use the staff Ventraux. Leasrn to harnis it's power, and use it for the good of aegis .Use it to fight back the Undead and help our people. With you even in death: Alister", ""),
        StaticBook("Dearhisereld", "Alectriciti", "There's so much I want to say but I don't need to. For the time being, I can't have anyone follow me. When that happens, destruction follows. I'm content knowing you're safe. :) \n Let me remind you something you should know. I mean this so honestly. And I don't mean to brag or praise myself, but no one will love you like I have. Not until they realize what it's like to fight for something they desire to keep safe. Not until they realize that at any moment, they could die, living their life on the edge, risking it all. I did that for you. I'm very proud of it, yes. It's one of the few things I'm proud of. Now that you're safe, I feel I can leave you and Natheus in peace. I only get in the way. Love is patient, kind, selfless, pure, infinite, never-ending, peaceful, merciful and just. Now... hah. I know I've said it before, it's cliché i'll admit. So I won't mention it here. I feel everyone knows I've become over-emotional over you. Even you know that. But how can I help myself when I gave my life to save you? There was nothing I could do to prevent myself, alright? Now I'm going underground to stop the undead. I respect now the times you told me not to follow you. I do ask of you not to do the same.  Not that you- \n *this page has been torn out* \n \n \n \n \n \n \n *this page has also been torn out... you see where the ink sank through on the next page* \n \n \n \n \n ...me with that last poem... ...intertwined hearts... ...find anyone who will... ...as I. Can't you... ...pigman riding a cow... ...no end to my... ...silly love story. Again... ...good life, both of... \n \n \n ~Aleth...", ""),
        StaticBook("Dearrrrhisereld", "Alectriciti", "There's so much I want to say but you probably won't bother reading. This will be a quick one. Many of our friends think I'm over emotional. You may even think the same. But do you not realize how fragile life is? I feel like you took it for granted when I saved your life. You told me yourself, what I was writing was preventing you from joining the undead. I risked my life for you! Gave my life for you. But that doesn't make me a hero, no. You've seen through me. You know I wanted something in return. That is you. I do want you Rhisereld. I don't want to be known as a selfish elf... But knowing your safe with Natheus now is enough. I did my job. But I'm going underground now. I'm sure you remember all the times I chased after you when you told me not to. I can learn to respect that. Let me tell you this. Natheus will never love you as much as I did. Not until he realizes what it's like to be living every moment of his LIFE protecting the one he loves. Not until he realizes that at any moment, he could be destroyed by the undead. Natheus is a good guy. I see why you like him. Every moment around you two pains me. Because I wanted something out of it. I do want you! I want you so badly so madly so much! To make sure you're safe! I- *this page has been torn out* \n \n \n \n \n \n \n take us alive. Before I leave, let me tell you the truth. Let me tell you what love is. Love is patient, kind, gentle, selfless, pure, perfect, NEVER-FAILING. Love, love is what saved your life. It was... needless to say, my love. It's stuck in my memory, every- *this page has also been torn out* \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n *let's face it, the rest of this book has been torn out... but you faintly see words where the ink sank through the pages...* \n \n \n You are reaching... ...intertwined as one... ...lust for death... ...help you anymore... ...as much as i... ...pigman riding a cow... ...natheus and you have a.... ...life. i love... \n \n \n *you're not quite sure what the \"Pigman riding a cow\" was all about... but you find this on the last page...* \n \n \n \n \n \n I went far for you. *scibbles out: \"it wasn't worth it\"*...... it was SO worth it. No one will ever love you like I have. Smile and relax.  Farewell.", ""),
        StaticBook("Death", "Telandriel", "Death is something that happens to us all, sooner or later. So let's enjoy life as it is and don't worry.", ""),
