        StaticBook("Death is near", "Bazza546", "i can feel death cold hand on my shoulder im not sure how long i have left to write this the orc who stabbed me musty have put some sort of posion on his blade i can feel it making its way around my body to everyone reading this i hope..............*the rest is just scribbles and bloody*", ""),
        StaticBook("death list", "hayden34666", "ALL OF OREN!", ""),
        StaticBook("Death Magic", "SimplePancake", "Death Magicians (Or more commanly known as Necromancers) are magic users who harness the power of  the dead to make themselves more powerful. most people avoid these magicians because they feel that their power is a vile kind, and should not be  used. But we, as worshipers of the mighty undead, use this power to the greatest advantage we can. Being able to summon wave after wave of undead monsters is a power almost every necromancer dreams of. But, being able to use that power comes at a cost, for you shall be despised by every living being. Though, it doesn't make much of a difference, because all mortals fear the name Black Hand.", ""),
