        StaticBook("Death Wish", "Killzar", "If you are reading this, then I am probably dead. I have lived a long life and am an honorable person. Please, make a grave where you found this book and use a sign that says R.I.P. Killzar The Fancy Son.", ""),
        StaticBook("Death's breath", "moop123", "", ""),
        StaticBook("death's embrace", "sconn", "Humanity is a mess and the only way to get  rid of it is by death.w Take your own life and you will be rewarded in the afterlife. When the undead win they will resurect you and you will become a pure and powerfull being. Do that and you will be saved of your body and this world. Today you can die peacufully. But tommorow the undead will come. Save yourself of the pain and sorrow in this life. Take your life and be resurected.", ""),
