        StaticBook("Debt", "Sevenfournine", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Declaration of Marriage.", "deanofantastico", "A time of merriment draws near. Love blossoms in the unlikeliest of places. Met fleeing his town from those who would slay, torture or taint him, passing upon the most fortunate of meetings. from those who would slay, torture or taint him, passing upon the most fortunate of meetings. It is with great happiness and relief that I write down this news upon this tattered parchment.  \n \n  I, Robin Drake of Winterfell, am to be married to Miss Luka in the near future. The ceremony will take place at Winterfell though what date still remains unclear. \n \n \n Signed - Robin Drake", ""),
        StaticBook("Decline", "Ever", "Ya caught me in one o' me drunken stupors, it's my fault really. Yer offer seemed good ta me, so I followed. Lucas Black, if ya know him, as expelled yer \"cousin\" from my body. There is one god I server, that being Iblees. Should you contact me again, I'll burn that home of yours down. Signed: Ever, the voice of reason.", ""),
        StaticBook("Decora", "char615", "apparently im an assanugget i love you", ""),
        StaticBook("Decora", "XxDukesterxX", "She is the Warmth from the Sun", ""),
        StaticBook("Decora", "firespirit44", "Name: Decora\n Race: Human\n Age/Gender: ?/Female\n Owner of the Silvershade Manor, past slave to a hooded man called Jack. Hates a orc called Ugg. Liberated herself from salvery. Married to orc Vardak Ciantar, is expected to have babies soon. Many ex-BH members visit the manor. Threat level is high.", ""),
        StaticBook("Decora's Journal", "DecoLamb", "Day One:    Why did I ever think he was trustworthy? Why did I ever think Jack would understand? He showed me kindness that one night... I was foolish to ever think it would happen again... If only he had listened.. He would have had me in my entirety, simply for that one small boon. All I had wanted was a night or two away to sleep in peace, I would have done anything for that I would have even called him 'Master'. I would have even called him 'God' should he have requested, such was my desperation. I was a fool to think that his kindness was real It was only a cruel trick... \nDay Two: I have decided to leave. Guraim continues to abuse me, and Jack is never here. He had told Botar that he would protect me from the world itself, yet he does not I no longer care. I will either die roaming as I should have, or die fighting for it. I will escape this darkness, one way or another. I will -not- remain alone like this! If only Jack would have listened... I would have served him completly. I would have done anything. But now I will give nothing. Jack, if you ever read this. This was all your doing.", ""),
        StaticBook("Decora. You are safe. With me.", "Leopled1", "Decora. The name brings a rush through my body, and heart. everytime i see her face. The voice that speaks to me everyday, has been with me every day since i came to aegis We have journeyed the lands, In search of a place to call home. Untill we came across a small, abandoned fort. We had been there for months. We had expanded, Designed, and made it just perfect for us to live in. A few weeks afterwards, Decora found a man. A man she could love and cherish . But something inside me felt empty. As if another part of my life was snapped away And thrown away out into the harsh wilds of the world. And then. Something happened. Something that i never thought would hurt me More than my father disaperring. The undead, had told her lies. Lies that would have her enslaved for ever. There words were \"If you work with us, We will save oren from the undead hordes!!\" She had been mind controlled.. Into telling me lies aswell.. So she was not hurt. The undead had enslaved her for themselves. They did not care for oren, or the humans. I had missed her. I had missed her with my entire soul. I had felt that life wasn't worth living after she was taken. what hurt the most. Is she was in view of my home, on the island i was to call my paradise. Everyday. I would watch over, To see if she was staring back at me. Telling me she will be home soon. But still i wait. Still i wait for her to return to me. So i can say the same lines i always do. Decora. You... are safe... With me. But i guess i have broken that promise to her now I had destroyed all i said. And for that, I am no man.", ""),
        StaticBook("Dedicant Daniceyl's Nature poem", "jpiroden", "Nature speak's to us. With its calm, soft blowing breeze. I respond to it. \"Nature speak's to us, with its calm solft blowing breeze. I respond to it\" Perfect!", ""),
        StaticBook("Dedicant Daniceyl's Ode to Nature", "jpiroden", "Oh Nature, you speak to be through your ever calming wind Your children speak to you as well, willing to accept your out streched arms To care and protect your gifts you granted us Such as your fields of wheat, and your beatiful blooming flowers, or you over hanging vines a bove Oh Nature, 'Tis our duty to love and protect you and your ever growing world. Oh Nature.", ""),
