        StaticBook("Del of Aralaius - Part 1", "Jallentime", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Delaselva", "Jallentime", "The doctor says there is nothing we can do for her. I have tried everything I can to cure my mother of this sickness, but to no avail. The winter has been harsh, it's true, but Pneumonia symptoms in an Elf?", ""),
        StaticBook("Delaselva of Kramoroe", "Jallentime", "The last thing the Elders tell us in this world is just how cruel and unfair it can be. They drown us in their music and occupy us with pretty festivals while the world around us crumbles into the abyss! (Anyone know how to spell Laurelein?)", ""),
        StaticBook("Delaselva's Journal", "Jallentime", "Ever since the dissolution of the Vanguard Kramoroe has been a bit of a punching bag for the Undead and Bandits. I have went on several diplomatic missions to Alk'hazar to petition for aid for quite a while now but to absolutely no avail. The Oren guard itself is rather disorganized at this point in time, the Guard captain himself is almost never around to hear my pleas. As such I really doubt he has heard ANY of my pleas. Freaking humans. \n  A wonderful idea swam into my head today! Kind of like a tropical parasite. Oh darn these blasted analogies hold on while I get my thoughts together. \nAnyway I was thinking about the political situation in Kramroe earlier today;  oh wait you'll probably see it in a book later. Why am I writing like  someone besides me is going to read this? Oh because they probably are. Bastards. \nI saw a couple of bandits attack a dwarf today, I ran to Oren to get help from the guard and to my amazement two of them came out immediately, their names are Zebana and John. We found the dwarf's sword in the water next to the King's road; probably didnt end well for him. I forgot to mention that one of the bandits chased me halfway to Oren didn't I? Since they undoubtedly know my name I had the guards escort me back to Alkhazar, where I will stay a while until they're hopefully arrested or preferrably dead. The guard, Zebana, was extrememly interested in the situation so we talked quite a bit inside Dawn's Tavern, where he personally helped me tell off a fellow scholar who didn't approve of my controversial research. We eventually went back to his home in the VonSchilichten Inn where we discussed the locations of a few Undead fort locations and the politics of Kramoroe and Oren. After several hours of chatting he invited me to take copies of the books in his collection, most of which were are about the Undead, and one in Particular that is written in a strange and foreign language. I strongly believe I have the resources to decipher this book, once I return to Kramoroe.   \nIt's been almost a year since I last wrote in this journal, I have been preoccupied with many very distressing matters. I can summarize it all with the irony of the last paragraph's last sentence:  Kramoroe is gone, destroyed, obliterated.", ""),
        StaticBook("Delfyr's Poem", "Timayame", "Winds are blowing The sun is glowing The earth's sweet love nurtures the trees sweet aroma in the breeze takes me to a place far away from Iblees . many moons have come, many moons have passed In a place of solitude, I erase my troubled past please leave gentlemen", ""),
        StaticBook("Deliver this to the captain", "Demonxerov2", "Captain, there is a traitor amongst you. Xero is a undead supporter because he helped guriam and helped elder escape. please arrest him when possible.", ""),
        StaticBook("Deliver this to the captain of the gaurd", "Demonxerov2", "I hope that xero doesnt read this. now if you are a captain, order your gaurds to arrest xero. he is a undead supporter. he helped elder and such.", ""),
        StaticBook("Demetrius Broad file", "Aandie", "Name: Demetrius Broad Alrite.. where ye come from originally?", ""),
        StaticBook("Demon encounters", "Lexperiments", "I'm xperiencing a demon encounter right now This is quickly-written He's escaping! The demon is silent, posessing an elf.. Chasing it right now. It just dissapeared. The man was sane just last night... Then he went away... His sanity died, and the demon took over. The man's name is Ademas. He wanted to get Bell to heal him... She was not there. The demon-man reappeared. I'm writing quickly. A demonc scream just erupted from the previous elf... Me and 3 others, one being a shaman, have trapped him... The other two are his followers. They all are trying to stop the demon inside him. I'm scribbling down this encounter right now. We're jsut south of Laurelin, in the desert near hte path I created long ago between the elven and dwarven nations. The orc shaman has an idea on what to do. The shaman made me give the demon a stick. He wants the demon to draw. I'm writing as this happens. The demon threw the stick at one of his followers. this is too fast to do much. I can't be very organized. The demon jumped on top of a small tower. It is made of sand. The demon wrote some randomw ord in the sand,  then jumped off a cliff and died. I retrieved his items and finished this. The encounter is over. \n \n I'm now remembering a past demon encounter It was from the first week I was in Kal'urguan. A demon named Herobrine had appeared out of nowhere; Me and a few other dwarves captured it. The wizard himself came to prove it was a demon. We tested lava, fire, drowning, and everything else possible to kill it. It survived, and we used it as a petting zoo. Yes, a petting zoo. A lot of drunk dwarves turned the cage into a petting zoo. It dissapeared a few days later randomly.", ""),
        StaticBook("Demon's Heart", "lotteje13", "may thee take my heart do thee love me or not? I will take thee heart and take your life thee may die and I will stay...", ""),
        StaticBook("Deputy Assignment Log #1 - Relgard", "Darkdragon274", "3/Tolta/1326. Target: Sparrow. Goal: Find information on Wrath and his Base. Started: Raven Base. Destination: North Laurelin Talked to some locals, no sign of sparrow. Encountered the prince.    7/SunsSmile/1326 No sign of Sparrow. Other Ravens caught another Iblees-Worshipper. He will be questioned soon. Mission Ended 7/SunsSmile/1326", ""),
