        StaticBook("Diary", "SimonRJ", "Saphora and me was monster hunting and we got some iron and have fun. Today I found out of at Algoda is from Sweden.. And i got a new house:D", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "pandalex12", "Day 1: It is my first day joining the guards which I came to join to find leads of the my par ents death which was caused by the creatures of the wild which people say are the orcs but soon of late I see these creatures of night and am starting to have dreams of necromancers controling them but it is only a dream. \nDay 2 It is a normal day of patrolling the path towards Whisper isle and after I returned fellow Maximus explained to me that the barracks were being remodeled by the prince and so I wait till the next day... \nDay 3 I am joined by the prince who made a new plot for our barracks and it is much more bigger , I can't wait for the outcomes! However something has been bothering me. We encountered the rangers and they claim our barracks as their base and as we were about to fight them they retreated into the wild before I showed them my rage, then the prince reported them to the higher ups to exile them from the world of aegis. After that I knew I needed training so I embarked on a side trip to fight these creatures of night and maybe if I am lucky I will find a lead on my parents death.", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "Plazmotech", "Today, i bought a 'ome fer 100 minas! As the home was from some chum who abonded it, i got lotsa cob -ble for ALL FREE im reading a book Wanna read it ((right click... hic!", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "VonEbs", "Writ this day August 8th Vonebs, High Elf I write from my tree palace, located in the Wilds. I am slowly amassing a fortune, in which I will use to buy a plot in Malinor or Alras. I have not chosen yet, but I wish to live among fellow elves. I am hoping to buy a mining permit, so that I may amass materiel to build tools and grow rich. Well, that is all for now. Vonebs", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "RustyJusty123", "I have been bitten by an undead and im not sure what to do. Ive had bad side effects and im getting tired a lot. I tried using medicine but it doesnt seem to fix it. Im not sure if I will last much longer. But I pray to Sithis that he will save me. I pray..  \n Its been a while now and I still feel the same. Maybe nothing will happen but I am not sure.", ""),
        StaticBook("diary", "nuttyy3", "dear diary, it has been my forst day in my new home, and im loving it! All the nice people in the whisper isles are so friendly, and i also found an old friend, i hope i get to settle in more and get a job as   a guard replace forst first", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "PilotAce1812", "My Friend VonEbs was picked to be the queens bodyguard Hopefully he does not get to bored I made another bow today and they look better and better the more I make them I wish I was picked for more covert operations then full on battles \n Survival Tip # 1 A tip to fighting the creatures of Ageis is to hit them with one attack then rush them with uneding quick attacks a trick for dealing with pigmen is place cob web to slow them down \n Vonebs gets the same rank as me and for somereason thinks he is better then me I hate when people lie about things They've done \"oh i took on 10 people when it was jsut me \"\" I feel I am the only real soldier in this place other then the officers I want to go on some spying missions \n A person by the name of halepheon was looking for me i wonder why I snuck past atleast an army of undead today and i noticed something strange they seem to be gathering weapons and resources and brainwashing people", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "Grayslayer", "Life seems very queit here. I seem to be guarding the gates at luarilen a lot and its very boring. I need to find a job or somthing as a warden that pays. A lot of new people have joined and yet I seem to be stuck as an EternalGuard when do I get promoted. A man was add to the wanted bored And I have been out looking for him I hope I get him. Because I hear there Is a reward and that might solve my minas problem. At least for now \n I finished my history to day but I managed to mess up the ending so I will see if I can get some to re-write it for me or I will start again. \nI got a misson today I must protect Soriuss Natives wife to be. But I Have to find her first. As well as me both Huwel and Ebs are guarding her as well so hopfully she will be safe . \n Also I think Blackthorn found this book and thats why he gave me a harder job. Hopfully we do well so I can prove my self I will have no honour left if I fail. \nToday was very exciting we where guarding the gate when the wanted man ahowed up. Both Huwel and I tried to stop him but he ran. Then a elf named Luke_Starglow captured him then he got out again and Arana showed up and together we got him and I killed him. We became friends with Luke and went back to camp. We where all rewarded reciving 1000 minas each. We then had a drink to our success when the undead attacked. We all charged out to fight them it was a mess everything was being distroyed and there where dead bodies every where. After a long struggle there where only a few left and some of the undead began to sweep the city as one cam passed I stuck my blade in him and killed him. But I had given away my position and two other undead came and blasted me in the chest. A part from that most of it is hazy and I can't remember any more. \nAlso somthing funny happened to day I showed Arana my parents necklace and a word glowed on it it was Aldaelon. I wonder what it means we are going to try and find out more. ;; I have'nt written anything down for some time now because not much has happend till now. First we have the rescent battle the Wardens where called to aid the Orcs in a battle against the undead. We got there and prepared for the oncoming wave we had plans the archers where sent to the roof and given supplys of arrows. The swordsman went down to a secret tunnel and waited to ambush the undead from the rear of the army. When the signal was given to come out we rushed out to attack them but they knew we where there before we where out in the open so so we where struck down. I am unsure how the rest went but we won the battle. ;; Now just the other day the Wardens where called as a demon attacked us we rushed to the gates and saw the best and chased it to its lare it captured some druids and we went to free them. The High Prince and our highborn where the ones to catch him and and our Highborn was the one that killed the best. \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "trymster100", "Today I entered this world for real! Just by killing one pigman i got 50 Minas!", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "Andreskiller21", "Help  erase", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "markdalgaard", "I meet Dark knight in the city. He was being chased by some guards, i stepped in to help him. It wasent allowed to wear a dark robe. When the guards left i followed him to the gate and asked him if he wanted to talk. He did and we walked to a boat, inside the boat we began to talk about a important matter. When we were done, we walked up agian and spotted one of the guards. The dark knight drew his sword and would have killed him if it wasent because of me. I calmed him down and we went on to my fort. Inside he spotted all the possibilities of my fort. We made a deal and now im writing this diary. End of day 1    Dark knight and i had a small talk about trust, we can trust each other. And if i couldent, then we are all dead. Update: I found a squid spassing around in the basement.", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "skinner452", "Dear diary,\nToday I found someone I love... His name is Brian. He is a beautiful ascended, and I will marry him in the future.", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary", "Die442931", "\n  This book belongs to Samuel_Birchcraft. \n The undead are attacking! lightning bolts are coming down killing women and children. hopefully im not going to die! But if I do please give this book to Discordian. I am not going to battle the undead because I have poor weapons. \n Everyone is hiding except..... for the ascended. why would the undead want to attack now?  I hear the shouting of the men getting ready to battle the undead. I see the undead flying all over the city! The undead forces are burning the city.", ""),
