        StaticBook("Diary 1", "DJogdog", "5/July/11 Today I went on a hunt for mobs, at first I couldn't find any. But today I have killed 69 mobs. I also bought 12 books. Not much else to report so far. I bought the books from Eastborn Wayward_Druid_Respiren has told me to meet him in the druid's grtto when I hae collected 1 of each mushroom for a reward. How stange. for a reward. How strange.", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary 1", "braner321", "Day 1: I have gone in search of the mysterious Bell... An hour after my seacr, I found her li ving amung the Elves of Laurelin. She filled me in on some basic stuff. We then went to The Human Capital that starts  a K. She had recieved urgent word from her friend John . It turned out to be a false call and we made our way back. Along the way we stopped at an Oren town and were confronted by   Isblee's worshipers. I jumped to protect Bell, but she ordered me to  run. I ran back to the Elven town. She came back eventually. We then prepared for an atatck. The attack never came and me and bell went to a quiet palce to talk. I had some quetions to ask her and she answered them. We were then inturuped by Cripson. he revealed his evil plans or something of the sort. We then walked away but he continually pestered us. The High-Prince came. After a long talk, he banished him. A mighty warrior was there to back us up. After he left, I introduced myself to the Prince. He welcomed me and told me that housing  will be provided when it is built.", ""),
