        StaticBook("Diary of a Woodcutter", "Zeddicus_zolius", "I've created a new homestead for myself in the cold Wilderness. Not even a tree in my line of si ght. I will have to plant the few saplings I brought along in hope of getting wood for my fir es. What troubles me is that I must plant them far from my shelter so that noone may accedentally find my hiding. This has happened before and my paranoia is growing.", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary of Aleksis Kivi, 1", "Aandie", "Hey, this book is to be my diary, for daily logs. So I can read it, laugh, shed a tear and remember what has happened to me and what not.", ""),
