        StaticBook("diary of events", "Garretto13696", "I am Revan and these are events of my life, starting at the abandoning of Stormhold \n I arose one morning to find that my friends house had been destroyed and the weat farm had been robbed. I waited for days for my friend to return, he did not. \n So I left Storms End and headed back to Leawinn...", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary Of James", "Andreskiller21", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary of life in the Nether", "Gwonam_Blaze", "Day 1 \n \n I entered the Nether via portal today, thinking I would find something interesting to continue my research with. However, a large, floating face destroyed the portal, and I have no means of creating the portal once more. It's safe to say, I am destined to stay here and die... I've found what appears to be the home of another person, though there appears to be no other life within the Nether other than the flying faces and the pigmen have long since escaped the Nether and live upon the surface world. I will have to stay here for the rest of my time... \n \n Day 3 \n \n The only form of sustanance I have found is a glowing red plant with a large sac full of puss. It doesn't taste very nice, but I must do what I must to survive... I've noticed the red puss makes for a good source of hydration. Every now and then, I keep thinking I see another being walking about outside of the safe room. It's most probably just me being paranoid \n \n Day 5 \n \n Time has been hard so far, as this strange plant I have found, although grows fast, it only grows  in small quantities. I think the flying ones know where I am hiding, as I am constantly hearing their loud shreiks followed by explosions. I keep thinking I see that figure again, but it can't be real, that would be ridiculous... wouldn't it? \n \n Day 10 \n \n I am now very hungry and afraid. The faces are relentless to find me, and that figure keeps appearing closer every time I see him. \" There must be a way to escape! \" I think to myself, but I keep forgetting... there is none... \n \n Dáu 18 \n \n HE ISG HERKE! HO IS INDIFE MY HOESE! PLPEASE LIRD, HEIP ME! \n \n ENIRBOREHENIRBOREHENIRBOREHENIRBOREHENIRBOREHENIRBOREHENIRBOREH", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary of Orgulas", "jessbot", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary of Scribe Duvain", "Javelberg", "*smiles", ""),
        StaticBook("Diary of Thaern Stormtide", "w1lll", "We seem to have uncovered a traiter within our ranks; High Constable Felix himself. He accused me of torturing a suspect, which I have not done, and was acting very suspicious about a confirmed Undead safehouse within the military district itself. The only way it could have got there is through Felix allowing it to be built, and he wanted us to leave the building as soon as we enter -ed it . It seems he is trying to hide something. ((The entry ends here.))", ""),
        StaticBook("Dies Irae", "Baronvo", "Dreaded day, that day of ire, \n help", ""),
        StaticBook("Different Path", "gombie", "Poeple are born under the Noble's, Others are born under the commons. Those who are Noble's are mostly an Guard, Lord,Or an other highranked in the world. As common poeple are men in the Wilderness are Being Bandits. Other common poeple are wandering merchants and trade their goods for an living. Then you have the poeple who are homeless are Travell the world.", ""),
