        StaticBook("Diplomatic terms with Nical", "Groobs03", "I just Tried to speak to Nical for an alliance with them, not set in stone because i was going to as k you, but just to see where they stand on the issue. Well i must say i could not be more annoyed with them at the moment . When we finally sat down to talk, they kept getting distracted by petty things and at one point we were called invaluable when the orcs attacked, [which may i remind you is the fight where we were t he reason Wrath wasnt a factor in that fight] as far as im concerned the Nical Empire can go fuck themselves but maybe thats just because im annoy ed with them right now. The meeting ended with me saying, when you are prepared to speak diplomatically come find me. I'm not taking that insult too kindly though, If they think we are worthless then i vote we don't he lp them when it comes down to it. Just wondering your thoughts on this \n -Groobs", ""),
        StaticBook("Diplomats Log ((Nov.6th))", "blackhawk77g", "A supposed slaver was being questioned by Lady Vulena.  I was found and questioned by the high lord... So I left... and continued listening..  The man was arrested after a long chat  There is no way out.. There is no exit..", ""),
        StaticBook("Diplomats Log ((Sunday, Oct.9, 2011))", "blackhawk77g", "Wraths Clutch: Dwarves lead by the Lord Marhshall were marching around the area. ((Told to leave by GM Brian)) A thief has snuck into the Wardens fort sometime today through a hidden tunnel. The Wardens are moving from their fort near the Clutch. They believe the Dwarves do not want them here, which is the truth for many Dwarves. The Wardens believe it is our land. The Wardens will be leaving within a week (In game days).  \n      I returned to the elven fort with the Archbishop and a gaurd by the name of  Valen. We confirmed the same findings I had found earlier.  The elves are unhappy about us taking \"their\" land and are possibly ready to go to war. Although I highly doubt war is feasible for them  at the current time. Any of ye experienced at buildin a fort?   \n \n Oren: The rebellion is still strong Iblees is frequently atacking with large waves of undead. The castle has become overun with undead. The citizens and armies of Aegis are slowly reclaiming it. The castle invasion was only a diversion. While we stormed the castle, the city was atacked once again.", ""),
        StaticBook("diray of kaine", "kainesun", "hello my name is kaine i am a part of the Holmes detectivs force i have a lot of money hello again its me just got back from a long and boring patrol out at Oren aprentley the rana hi its kaine just got back from a escort mission to the city of Oren. Hay its me kaine agian arrrr the un dead are coming this week and i just wasted money on a sh op OH now the Rangers whant to be peacfull this hole place is going to hell this is importent the prince was attacked today i dont no why but i have a strange felling the prince lied to u s Hay its me kaine agine Callum locked up sum crazy guy today cuppel more days till the undead come and im no prepeard dam but i need not worrie the acendits also come as well rumoer has it that the undead are unstopabull and that thay can shot fier balls its kaine agian just saw these two girls come to our bace asking for some one who we did not know ok war is oficile il be shiped out soon im taking this diary with me and my sword. Check Lisr; amouer sword food maps yep its all here oh i cnat stand the rangers thay piss me off real bad sometims. YAY the war is off for some rason but yes i dont have to go to war. I still have to wait till the undead come o man thay are going to be hard hay its me kaine oh this day has been boring not many of the squad was on so i whent out on l a patrole arested an ork to day for hitting on of our former men hay its me kaine im slowly making my money back i have 1547.53 at the moment oh i need more hay its me kaine we finidhed building the fort and we got relly durnk i had about 2 ale hey its me kaine im in my privat bar at the moment it verry good Hay its me again the undead are here and were compleatly disorginized", ""),
        StaticBook("Directions to Montego", "SHiLLySiT", "To get to Montego, one must first travel from Oren in the direction of the ocean. Once you find a castle with green flags, travel behind it for about 50 blocks or so. Make a sharp right and keep heading along this path for awhile. Soon you will see a wooden tower with glowstone on top of it. This is your beacon and Montego will be hard to miss. A cobblestone wall surrounds the city. Good luck, traveler and I hope to see you soon. P.S. A road will be constructed soon to make travel easier.", ""),
        StaticBook("directions.  Go north to Winterfell.  head East.  estate is past the guard towers and", "RHcrow", "on a wooded hill with a mausoleum", ""),
        StaticBook("Dirty Pamhlet", "rocketteam", "title Dirty paper Dirty Paper", ""),
        StaticBook("Dirty paper", "rocketteam", "Galahar is corrupt, it overtaxes its people to the point of starvation whilst they sit in halls laden with food and opulence This tryanny can not stand any longer! Being the last stronghold of Human Power outside of Alras, they are not fit nor nessecary to rule people of galahar rise up and reclaim your whats rightfully yours! for help in this endouver, find us around galahar, you will know it's us..... freedom freinds. -~&~-", ""),
        StaticBook("Disappearing Spell", "Quinn2", "To disappear momentarily from one's current location, a few steps are required. First one must ESCAPE reality, step outside the realm of possibilities. Second one must DISCONNECT themselves from the present. After those steps are complete you willl have successfully disappeared. To reappear you must willl yourself to join the game of life. You must accept that there are MULTIPLE PLAYERS. You must CONNECT yourself back to the reality of Aegis. Finally you willl reappear as yourself in Aegis. It should be noted that while you have disappeared you will no longer be able to speak or hear.", ""),
        StaticBook("Discordian's Journal", "TheWoWMasta", "3rd of Grand Harvest. \n Secured a chest at Weathere.d Point. \n It's behind the reeds, under the sand.  \n I still have all my food and tools. \n Going to continue fishing today! It's hard!  \n \n  4th of Grand Harvest. \n Met with Janna and Samuel in town. \n Also found Faustus! Our new friend.  \n Taking myself to the docks to fish. \n My chest is doing well, not stolen yet. \n \n 5th of Grand Harvest. \n Spent the whole day fishing. \n Only have 7 fish. \n Very dissapointed with the catch in this area. \n Going to sell my wares at the city. \n \n  6th of Grand Harvest. \n Travelled to the far north of Aegis. \n Met a very stubborn druid. \n Faustus is lost in the snow, we were seperated. \n Killed many undead creatures. \n \n 8th of Grand Harvest. \n Going into the wilds to hunt. creatures. \n Placing diary in storage chest in case of death. \n Wish me luck! \n \n \n \n  PASSAGE MISSING \n \n  \n \n  \n 14th of Grand Harvest. \n Slaughtered many monsters. \n Samuel, my apprentice, has been fishing. \n Faustus is out harvesting redwood. \n Still planning where. to build a house. \n \n  16th of Grand Harvest \n Guard duty at AlKhazar. \n Hoping to get paid for this soon. \n I really want to buy a house!  \n I have started saving my Minas. \n \n 17th of Grand Harvest  \n Guard duty at AlKhazar, still. \n Witnessed a battle between two guards. \n A ranger and Gatekeeper. \n I was watching from the tower. \n \n 19th of Grand Harvest \n Guard duty at AlKhazar. \n Going to be asked to be payed. \n I've done so much of this! ((over 12 hours IRL)) \n Hopefully a nice sum of money! \n \n 19th of Grand Harvest. \n A grand battle happened today! \n I was on patrol and I found.. \n Ascended and undead having a battle! \n It was hectic! I was badly wounded. \n In the end, the constable sent us away. \n 20th of Grand Harvest \n I'm on the Guard recruitment test! \n There are two others. \n This should be fun!  \n The obstacle course was my favourite test! \n I am very hungry now. \n  21st of Grand Harvest \n It has been an EXTREMELY long day. \n I'm doing guard duty. \n Hopefully Felix will see i've done much work soon. \n It is very quiet here. in AlKhazar. \n  \n 22nd of Grand Harvest \n Guard duty at AlKhazar. \n Killed a pigman today! \n Delicious loot.. \n Sirieus and I are going to buy a house. \n \n \n 23rd of Grand Harvest. \n Got lost in Kal'Alras today. \n Almost starved to death. \n Now Im doing guard duty at AlKhazar. \n Long day ahead. \n  24th of Grand Harvest \n Guard Duty at AlKhazar. \n  Felix and the Sargeant were here.. \n Very dull, not much going on. \n Sanirus is here with me. \n \n  29th of Grand Harvest  \n Guard duty at AlKhazar \n The King and Queen are here! \n We have two new guards on the wall. \n I have a lot of food today. \n \n 30th of Grand Harvest \n Spent the entire day harvesting flint. \n I'm almost ready for the great pigmen hunt. \n My arrows will serve me well! \n Looking forward to the huge loots. \n \n 31st of Grand Harvest \n Went looking in the north for Cassandraland. \n Ended up getting lost. \n Night is falling, time to head home. \n Maybe I should hunt some pigmen.. \n \n 33rd of Grand Harvest \n Done nothing today. \n Sitting around AlKhazar looking at flowers. \n Hopefully I will find some pigmen soon. \n My wallet is getting empty.. \n \n 7th of Suns Smile \n Today I harvested some sugar cane. \n I made many books! \n Eventually I will write in these books. \n For now though, I keep them in my chest. \n \n 14th of Suns Smile \n Trapped in a shack in the North. \n Looking for Cassandraland. \n  I'm near winterfell.. I think. \n It's day, I wish it were night. \n \n  22nd of Suns Smile \n Spent many days in the wild. \n No gain, however. \n Have returned to Oren for food. \n I wrote a letter to Felix. \n Applying to join the guard. \n 26th of Suns Smile \n Killed another pigman today! \n Getting more confident with the bow. \n Still waiting for results on my application.. \n I bought an Iron Pickaxe, bad mistake. \n \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Discount Members Card", "RHcrow", "Bar Patron Codrik is to recieve discount on Ale.  2minas a mug. 1 minas with a mug. -Nitholi", ""),
        StaticBook("Discovered Locations", "Minnan1", "Abandoned Eastern Tower: \n \n Located near the road to Raven Hold, this tower needs a lot of hard work to return it into its Old Glory. \n \nPlans: \n \nLaurelin's Vault: A Time capsule in case Laurelin is attacked by the undead, the ruins have a big underground complex. This could work for both a underground Laurelin or a Time Capsule... \n \n Abandoned Tower near Al'Khazar: \n \nThis tower seemed to be the HQ of an old organization long lost. \n \nPlans: No Further Ideas.", ""),
