        StaticBook("Donto's Journal", "doomtnt", "Today I took Blue Dog out with me as I went lumberjacking. I met up with Valor and we went hunting. After hunting we headed back but found an odd black creature that jdropped a weird pearl. Later on I took a wooden hoe and copied what I saw the ascended do with their staffs. I tried but nothing worked so I gave up an put it away.", ""),
        StaticBook("Donuur", "cgsphinx", "Donuur is one of the oldest spirits in the orcish myths of shamanism. He stands for valor and vigilance, A good spirit who appears infront of you when he judges a war fought for justice. His blessing is a sign that both you and your enemy have valid reasons to fight the upcomming battle or war. Ironicly enough he does not enjoy weapons. As Donuur is also the spiritual embodiment of a healthy mind and body. He is also not clever for a spirit. Wise yes, but you can outwit him. Dirty your hands and meditate without weapons in your hut. He will think you are a follower of the hand. Fighting battles with only your fists. Mind that if Donuur ever finds out about this he will crush all your ties with the spirit world. If anything bring at least one contestant to said war or battle to please Donuur. Not to mention his blessing is stronger with fists. Above all else. Fight without doubt, fight to win and fight for honor. Donuur will be at your side. As offers to him bring sands of the desert and juice of a cactus.", ""),
