        StaticBook("E'lizhath's Journal", "DRAGON117op", "I have been wondering around for almost a year now and i dont now what to do   I have been waiting to become a Warden for some time now. I have waited for someone from the HQ to let me in so i can talk to someone so i can be recruited. \n I have just meet the Princess Indelwehn. she is the most beautiful lady i have ever seen.", ""),
