        StaticBook("E.M.O. Song", "ErcMan", "E is for Emotional, ruins everybody's day. M is for Miserable people. O is for On the Darkside 'cause we have some fresh cookies. COOKIES :)!", ""),
        StaticBook("Earth", "Undeelad", "Earth, the very element of LIFE! Plants of the earth and dirt are one of the most peaceful epics of Aegis Flowers,watermelons,pumpkins, all so very valuable I have a garden growing wheat,watermelons,and even sugar cane. Lor'Tur Bruh'mar.", ""),
