        StaticBook("Eating Well in Aegis", "everblue2er101", "\n  The land of Aegis is full of taverns, bars, pubs and farms designed to keep the citizens full and free from hunger. This constitutes a large part of the economy of all nations. All people, from the lowest sewer-dwellers to the great Kings, must keep themselves fed.", ""),
