        StaticBook("Ebs' Notes on Archaelogy", "VonEbs", "Wolves appear to be drawn to the inner pool. They swim in it for longer then is normally obse rved in canines.\n Dug down into one of the huts, and found a root cellar. Grain residue on the floor, plus some worn wool blankets of a green hue.", ""),
        StaticBook("Edmund Sheffield is a lazy, ignorant king!", "erlend0501", "Edmund Sheffield, Oren's king, former Senechal, Is a terrible king. All he cares about, is himself. He demands large amount of gold as tax, which he only spends on himself. If he continues to rule the land as he does, then the war will be over. The undead will win. Sheffield need to step down from his throne! All the gold should be spent on the people and the defence of oren. Not a new bathtub. This madness must end! But fear not, my firend. There is a solution. A coup. Good people of Oren. This is the time to act! I made a propoganda. help help erase erase Take a look anyway", ""),
