        StaticBook("Elessar Eluch's Diary", "TDarkC", "___Ibra, 11th of The Grand Harvest, 1332___          I have now finished the building of the  wheat farm and I will go to bed now. \n \n We have named our tree The Old Feltheral and we have found out that we have a new  naibor who we think is an elf. \n ___Tolta, 31st of The Grand harvest, 1322___ Today, or yesterday I don't know. I went to Laurin and fought with my fellow elves  and I defended it from Queen Casandra how attacked it from the Nether with  undeads and ghasts. She shot firebolts, and I returned with arrows.  We won and she dissapeared, a medic human helped me and Leka to recover.   \n ___Tolta,3rd of The First Seed, 1323___          This was a time ago, but someone tried to burn down The Old Feltheral, our new guard had a nap  just then, but we finaly got the fire out and the tree is selfhealing. Now its back to normal.", ""),
