        StaticBook("Elf life", "lukewins", "I am an honest elf . I enjoy travelling and my favourite city is Oren when the king there got fired and lost his job and the queen took over i lost my job too I had nowhere to live because i couldnt pay the rent and I now rummage in dumpsters for food I'm soooooo hungry I am writing this so that whoever gets it will know not only a king can lose his job in an election I saw my co workers die before my eyes as the orcs slaughtered them when they asked for food and when they died of hunger in know it is only a matter time before i die, and this book is passed down from who found to anothe until it reached you you must pass it on let aegis know the cruelty of the orcs, and new kings and queesns written by lukewins", ""),
