        StaticBook("Ella's guide to being a Guard", "Ellacohed", "In this book you will learn my tips on being a Guard . \n Tip 1: Listen to your Captain because if you don't you will get in trouble. \nTip 2 Be nice but firm. Be nice to all citizens but be firm when needed . Be firm on people not following the laws. \nTip 3 Enjoy being a Guard: If you don't enjoy it, why are you one? Have fun with your job and still take it serious.", ""),
