        StaticBook("Entropy: My Findings", "XBLxSNAZZLEZ", "Entropy Spells are directly linked to the life force, and mind of a person. The Spells I have found I hope to learn in the future, without too many negative effects to myself. \n These are the spells I have found: \n Disorient - Confuses the target, sending mental manipulative thoughts to the target for a short time. \n Sleep: Hostile targets become drowsy, and if their mental stability is low enough, they fall into a sleep. \n Horror: The target cowers in fear, unable to move for a short period of time. The target may not be able to think as the normally would during this spell. \n Living Nightmare: Still awake, targets are trapped in a state of confusion and panic. They randomly attack other enemies, become stunned, or even become the caster's ally, if mental stability is low enough. \n On to the Weakness Spells: \n Paralyze: Caster drains a target's energy, paralyzing it unless it's physical resistance is strong enough. \n Mass Paralysis: All targets in an area are paralyzed for a short time. \n Life Energy Spells: \n Drain Life: Drains the Life of a target, healing the caster. It takes a long time to perfect this spell, with no negative effects on the caster. \n Curse of Mortality: The target weakens, and after a long time, begins to age rapidly, unless the caster is interrupted. \n This is my list of spells, wish me luck. -Salamandra", ""),
        StaticBook("Entry 1", "Loreq", "I traveled to this land not knowing what to expect... I traveled a long distance, for 5 years I was only ten when I left home my parents died when i was 2 months, my abusive uncle took me in he beat me until i got strong enought to strike him myself! its because of him my goal is the better than he was to make my parents proud! so i found a castle along my way and took refuge and became a gaurd! over time I became a Paladin of the Holy Order I have seen many things...many Dark things on my travel... I was scared... but now i am not i fought somthing so dark it was unbearable i killed it... i got a black orb i have yet to know what to do with it...", ""),
        StaticBook("Entry One", "NairOG", "In the future I will be writing few books. It will be about the reacent developed tactical defences of the city. \nWriting books is the only way to leave something behind. Yesterday I ahve invited Saint Daniel to a meal and told him about the scout reacent reports.", ""),
        StaticBook("Eowehn's Journal #1", "CamouFranky", "Kamees, 12th of The First Seed, 1328 \n  Mommy had been kidnapped and pushed off a large wall. Ebs saved her from dieing. Dad came a couple weeks ago to check on her. She grows an addiction to flesh, which deeply troubles me. I hope she doesn't turn into one of those disgusting, moronic zombies.   I wished Bircalin was my dad.", ""),
        StaticBook("Epic Quotes Of The Gods", "isienmai", "\"I'm swimding, I'm swimding!\" -Isienmai \n\"I'm being, swumd away!\" -Gzomyndzor \n\"Sorry. You're not a crop.\" -Gzomyndzor \n\"I thought you were a sheep.\" -Gzomyndzor \n \"I can milk it twice!\" -Gzomyndzor \n\"I R Chicken!\" -Gzomyndzor \n \"I think an animal may have landed on me.\" -Isienmai \n \"Don't eat it by the way.\" -Gzomyndzor \n \"Burn the truth! Burn the truth!\" -Gzomyndzor", ""),
