        StaticBook("fail", "Willizl33t", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Faldors Journal", "picklesickel", "The dark brother hood We were almost attacked by the undead they are so interesting I know it sounds strang but i w ant to meet there overloard/comander theres just something about them", ""),
        StaticBook("Fall of Kramoroe", "Zombieslaughter", "ive awoken in my fortress, im not sure what has happened, but the walls seem unstable and there is masonry everywhere. was i knocked out? \n there is heavy damage to the structure... something horrible must have happened... \n im trapped! sealed in! the exit to the lower levels has collapsed! i must dig... with my bear hands... \n the fortress is in ruins... and there are orcs swarming the place! i have ordered them to explain themselves and i do not like what i hear... the undead have decimated Kramoroe! there is nothing left, they say. i must investigate these claims. the staircase is luckily undamaged, but the ground floor is in ruins, the upper 3 have been obliterated! \n it was my sworn duty to defend the sandy streets of Kramoroe. i, have failed. the city is in ruins, few original buildings still intact. as i write this, i am standing in a storm of activity as orcs and humans fight over the scraps of my town and fortress. i am ashamed. \n i hear tales that humans had attacked before the undead did, and that the orcs came after for the spoils. ive also heard tales that several townsfolk survived. \n i am leaving the ruins, never to return. i will find my companions and attempt to rebuild elsewhere. \n they are found! though not in the sense i had expected. they have become traveling... merchants? jypsies? i know not, but i cannot live as such, in a tent, hiding from the undead. it is against my nature, and i shall not have it!", ""),
        StaticBook("Falling Again(A Comedy)", "StandUnited", "Without the slightest thought, I walked on, and ended up falling, for the 6th time... I felt like my legs were somehow floating on air, being pushed by a breeze. Like the stupid idiot I am, I looked down to see myself falling. How did I not realize that? Luckily my stupidity got me somwhere, as I fell into Water. After I swam to a small Island, I was completely amazed at what I was seeing. Many homes made out of coconuts,(not sure how that was done), with eyes painted on the outsid e I came to the conclusion, that natives were living here. Wait, of course there is natives living here! What blubbering idiot makes a house of of coconut? Anyway, I was approached by something disturbing... Naked, tann skinned women. The Fact is, I am a woman myself. They started hugging me, and that scared the living crap out of me... I smiled at them, and then immediately started running away. As I ran, there was a bananna peel. Yes, a bananna peel on some random Island. WHAT THE HECK! I slipped on it and ended up falling head first into a man. Which was worse than the women.. It seemed it was disrespectful, because he conked me out with his Voodoo Staff. Which was pretty much a wooden board with a creeper face on it. Instantly I woke up. I realized I was in my bed, still surronded by the creepers trying to get out of my house. Yes, they were in my house, trying to get out, wierd huh? Its not like I smell bad... \"sniffs\" \"gags\" On that wierd note, I decided to take a walk, right when I walked outside, I fell off some random cliff that appeared randomly. And then I knew, this may be my life forever. The Same thing, happening over, and over again. \"audience boos\" HEY SHUT UP, ITS A GOOD BOOK.", ""),
        StaticBook("False Idolization", "alex612", "Ibless Is A False Idol That Is Working For His Own Sucsess While Not Caring About Who he kills,Whether undead or Mortal,And His Wordhipers Are helping Bring The End Of Aegis.", ""),
        StaticBook("Farewell", "SpazmaticSniper", "Dear Alys, I wish to say Farewell, for i am going on the road. I have deserted the IC after recent e events. I made a donnated any money made by the fiends at IC to the inn in hopes to keep it running But now i must leave, I do hope to see you again in my travels, But this world may have different pl plans Your Friend Torok", ""),
        StaticBook("Farewell", "CrazyBlueBannana", "I have had much fun and delight here but it is my time to leave. I am now At Aeriel's Keep working as a Knight against the evil of Ibbles. Please send me 1500 minas for my house and shop. Whatecer you find in my hous eis your but I would like some minas for my house and shop because I spent 3200 minas and I would like 1500. If you dont send any money, so be it, But if you care, please send. You might see me again. Im not too far. Dont come look for me. I hope our paths meet up again. Goodbye my friends. -knight_James_Blue", ""),
