        StaticBook("Fer Stronghold", "CaptainRedHead", "Stronghold, Could ye Make 'un book about th' Permission of Every Guard? \n ( Rookies & Regular's ) \n \n I Gave ye th' book th' write it in, It be in th' Chest \n If Ye be done or 'aving problems or Questions, Please Tell me \n Fer Anyone Else Reading dis book, Put It BACK in th' Chest!!! \n \n Regards \n \n Broski~", ""),
        StaticBook("Ferin's Journal", "putipmup", "---------Day 1------------- Today I collected roses for Aerovine. It took a while, considering how rare they are. I took two hours, but found 38 roses. I realized at one rose that one rose could never be enough to give to someone as beautiful as her. So I found another. But two wasn't enough either. So I found five. But, I then realized that no roses could equal her beauty. Which brings me to the thirty eight i have now. -----------Day 2------------------ My love wasn't at Al'Khazar. I mailed her. I hope she responds --------------Day 3----------------- I am getting a cake for my love, because roses are not enough. But I'm not just going to buy one. I am going to sit in the open with a chicken and wait for an egg. I found a chicken, and i have sat here for quite a while. No egg, but i will not give up. Its raining now. Not exactly what was planned, but I can stand it. I'm no whimp to rain. The rain has stopped. I have tried to contact Aerovine once again. I can't stop thinking of her. She could've died in the undead attack, and I wouldn't know. That is one thing i think about. ----------Day 4---------------- The chicken hasn't been productive. Today is Joma, the 27th of The Amber Cold, and this chicken isn't being nice. Well, I had 38 roses, but i gave some to Hempshine to smoke, so now only 35.", ""),
        StaticBook("fff", "kulcris", "sd", ""),
