        StaticBook("Follow the way of Aeriel", "Ratemenatorz59", "Walk in the light. Do not betray you're Kind. And support the ascended. Do not be impartial Respect peace and authority And achieve a motive to Live a human, and die a hero You can all do that.", ""),
