        StaticBook("Foods & Things", "redbaron", "\n What we sell. \n We sell you swords and food for your fighting against the undead!  We sell iron and soon diamond swords, Bread, and mushroom soup!  stock up to defeat the enemys plagueing the north! Defend aegis. \n Where we are located. \n we are located near in the alrasian trading tent!  Just look for the Green and yellow colours that give away that its a mage guild shop! \n \n Come down and stock up for your fighting and training! this is the shop to buy from. Come to alkhazar and get your undead slaying on!", ""),
        StaticBook("Foods of Aegis", "SunfishBob", "Greetings! my name is Trevino. I am a cook on a ship know'n as the Maid Maddy, and before I Die, I need to have a claim to fame, so this is my recipie book. I hope you enjoy them. \n Mushroom stew Mushroom stew, is an easy dish to prepare, and is also very tasty! First, you will need a bowl, a red mushroom and a brown mushroom.  Take both mushrooms, and place on above the other, above the bowl. Then take your soup from the magic crafting bench. Easy as pie!", ""),
        StaticBook("Fool Elves", "Tree_Hugger_34", "today I Went into laurelin with a pumpkin on my head and leather on me torso. I ran into some people that you think would know my voice by now. after all me complaining in the jail , but yet none of them have figured out if be me!! For i am rinscher!!!!! They have jailed me so many times. If i jailed someone that many times i could tell who he was by the smell of his pits! Well i just had to get some thoughts off me chest. Rinscher", ""),
