        StaticBook("For High Preist Hogarth", "Pj07", "Well my old friend, it seems that my time is at an end. I am ill and dying. I did not tell you this becuase I did not want the last years of our freindship saddened with the knowledge . But now is my time to go, and I wish you a happy life. And you never know, Perhaps we will see each other again. Farewell old friend. ~ Haldon of Aeriel", ""),
        StaticBook("For Indelwehn", "Minnan1", "For my only love... \n \n-Aedan", ""),
        StaticBook("For Ior's Eyes Only", "AnonymousMonster", "I can no longer live in denial.  I know your heart always has, and always will truly belong to Yahra, and that you can never love me or our children in the same way.  We wouldn't even be together if she were stil alive. Though it pains me to make this decision, I know it is what I must do for both of us to be happy. I am leaving with the children.  I don't know where we will go, but I must raise them with a father whose love for us is true.  Farewell, and be safe.  -Your Beloved", ""),
        StaticBook("For Keziah's Eyes Only", "fiendin", "I don't know what to do. I am in a mode of depression so deep that I can't even control myself. I do love Yahra but seeing the way you acted made me terribly sad. I have not told you this but the necklace I gave you contains my own blood to symbolize that I'm always with you so please never take it off. I gave you my wedding vows so that you never forget. I don't know what else to say so I'll leave it at that. Just please don't forget... me *tears on paper* -Ior Sullkyn", ""),
        StaticBook("For Kitty", "RossssM", "I apologise Kitty. Please forgive me. *Cries I promise not to hurt you again, ever. ~Felix Kitty", ""),
        StaticBook("For Pyper....", "krislove45", "Pyper, if yo uare readin this, then I am dead. I want you to know that it was probably Thork. As much as you'll want to not believe this, 'tis true. I want you to have my birds. All 581 of them. My raven is the closest to me, so she'll be the first to respond. You'll have to whistle to call one, though, not clap. I love you Pyper, and you're the best sister in the world. Love, Sadi", ""),
        StaticBook("For Sadi", "AlphaCentaurus", "When I gaze in rapturous admiration \n At your perfection and beauty \n And stare in wonder and longing \n At your swaying, feline grace, \n Oh, how it is better to remain silent \n Than attempt in total futility \n To describe the awe I feel \n About matters that speech is unable to express \n Or strive to convey in vain my wondrous elation, \n As I emmerse myself in your beautiful eyes \n And with utmost joy, tell you, \n Just how much I love you.", ""),
        StaticBook("For Shoi...", "Timayame", "\"Begin a new chapter in my life with you...\" Every waking moment your words echo through my mind. I turn over in my bed looking for you, but aren't there...", ""),
