        StaticBook("Full Guard Names", "hayden34666", "Janos(benny508)", ""),
        StaticBook("Future expectations", "Royced", "I have been keeping a secret gaze upon you, members of Talamn. I will soon be providing you elite protection under the King of Oren's domain, no longer shall you be opened to public thievery. I would also like to speak to the mayor about this. You do not know my name, but you will in due time. Farewell, friends.", ""),
        StaticBook("Gaarag's Diary", "charliescott123", "((Day 5 in Aeris)) I have traveled quite far since i started my adnveture. I have met a few people and started a buisness in selling sand.  I have alsobeen hierd by Grimbear to be a sand gaurd I have just encounterd my first undead siting.... They destroyed PhenixHold... no survivers. I have a house now were i can rest ...\n  hhmm UNDEAD just destroyed a city 3 mins ago \n I just showed Gabriel a evil castle/ fort and they are mugging people... im not sure why hes not caring surelly he wants whats best for his futor people... right???", ""),
        StaticBook("Gabriel", "charliescott123", "Gabriel is a hardworker but can be a bit of a hothead at time, ive hd a feeling that because im a orc he has had a secrate grudge on me and been wishing to banish me from this city a lon ...long time ago, waiting for me to ... slipp up.", ""),
        StaticBook("Gabriel Giffords Journal", "Bourebro", "Day 1 new barracks! my own office! ive been wanting that for a long time! i returned from my *vacation* or trip out in the wilds , undead have been attacking towns", ""),
        StaticBook("Gabriel's Life", "TheImpulseHQ", "Gabriel started life as- *Ale stain* Damnit, messed up the whole book He is also poopy and *Part is crossed out*", ""),
        StaticBook("Gadde Halgrims Journal", "Dokahn", "Day 1 Today I killed many monsters and acquired much loot On my way home I found a strange ruin in a patch of trees Being the adventurer I am, I investigated only to stumble upon much rare ores Upon filling my sack with ore I found a chest incased in stone I shall bring back a pick to help me open it tomorrow Day 2 By the name of God! I have found a glowing sword! I shall bring it to the Arch Druid at once! I cannot wait! The druid has found an inscription on the blade in an unknown language. He told me to come back later when he has deciphered the message Day 3 After much research he has concluded it to be of Aeungul decent I will need to seek out the mighty wizard for a translation! *Many pages have been destroyed beyond recognition* Day 43 I wish I never found this cursed blade! It seems to atract the most foul of creatures I've lost many people on my quest to find the wizard, and im giving up. I cast it into a lake, so it will never be found again! Mercy on the one who finds it!", ""),
        StaticBook("Gaining Entrance - Elven Vanguard", "Darkdragon274", "Mission Category: Shadow, Infiltration \n Group Size: 1 \n Location: North Laurelin \n Objective: Gain access to all major powers and keys of the Vanguard \n Notes: Do not Mention Relgard or the Spectres. \n *The final page is adorned with a red-inked Spectre Seal*", ""),
        StaticBook("Gaining Entrance - The Wardens", "Darkdragon274", "Mission Category: Shadow, Infiltration \n Group Size: 2 \n Location: West of Laurelin. Follow signs from Laurelin's Crossorads. \n Objective: Gain access to all major powers and keys of the Wardens \n Notes: Do not make too much contact with your partner. If you are exposed, do not even speak to y our partner. \n *The final page is adorned with a red-inked Spectre Seal*", ""),
        StaticBook("Galahar", "Pepernoot", "Galahar is a human settlement under Oren rule, recently founded on the ruins of Kramoroe. The town is growing fast, and the old desert has been made a fertile land with the help of the druids.", ""),
        StaticBook("Galahar Post - Suns Smile, 1337", "Pepernoot", "Editor: Cerlos Ithelias\n Articles written by: Cerlos and Laela Ithelias.\n \nPlease support the paper by buying one at our stand in Galhar,\n .\n Recent banditry in Galahar\n ------ \n In the last few months there has been an increase in banditry around Galahar, people are extorted daily for their minas, or even killed for their belongings.\nAs you would expect this is mostly the work of the uncivilized barbaric Orcs, and other scum like Dark Elves.\nI call to the Knights of Galahar and their pages to stop this filth from entering the town gates. Maybe they should even prevent these \"people\" from entering the Kingdom! \n   Orcish raids near Galahar\n ------\n It has been recently reported that an orcish war party has murdered a quantity of innocent Galahar citizens. These barbaric and horrific acts are most likely to cease if help from the Oren Guard was provided. Quoth a witness that a blockade of fifteen military soldiers should be installed in Galahar. Perhaps we ignite a simple solution; Stop the orcs to stop the murder. Orcs have proven themselves hostile and come in war parties attacking us on a regular basis. Why do we let them? \n False rumours of an undead attack \n------\n Today there was a rumour spread about an impending undead attack on Al'Khazar, even though there were no signs of it, the sky was clear, and there was no lightning to be seen or heard.\n A loyal guard of mine went to investigate it though, but as expected there were no undead. The rumour was apparently started by a man named Kane.\n People like him should be learned a lesson, I support the guards letting him rot in a cell, until he's gained some common sense. As far as I know this has not happened yet. Get on it, guards!", ""),
        StaticBook("Galahar Post - The First Seed, 1338", "Pepernoot", "Editor: Cerlos Ithelias\n Articles written by: Cerlos and Laela Ithelias.\n \n Please support the paper by buying one at our stand in Galahar. \n Second Edition.\n Ser Robert Banstir Murdered!\n------\n The noble Ser Robert Banstir, head of the Banstir family, and commander of the Knights, has been murdered my a, by Iblees possessed, Knight called Delcius. The Knights of Galahar are on a quest to get rid of Delcius once and for all. If you see them, please support their quest for righteousness. \n \n \n \n \n Black Hand are back. \n------\n Activities of the Black Hand have been sighted again. A mutilated body was found on the King's Road. These worshippers of Iblees should be eradicated before they do to much harm to the people of Oren. If you see suspicious activity report it to the guards or Knights immediately!\n \n \n \n \nMuggings by Kane\n------\n Kane, a well known bandit, has been spotted again, robbing a defenceless maiden of her minas on the King's Road. Kane is an elf with blood red eyes, and blond hair. Don't approach him without a weapon, and warn the local guards or Knights.\n \n------\nThis newspaper has been threatened!\n------\n The writers and sellers of this newspaper have been threatened by hypocritical orcs. These orcs say they're not like the others, but still want to \"klomp\" humans for speaking what's on their mind. This shouldn't be news to most people, but to the others that weren't convinced: Here's your proof that all orcs are violent scum and shouldn't be allowed entry into the Kingdom. Tell your local leaders about this today, before you're victim of one of the orc raids!", ""),
        StaticBook("Galahar Uprising", "CONORDUDE8", "*You find this note fluttering around, you pick it up. The author is Unknown.* \n Galahar was taken Unrightfully. and stupidly. The people are in Distress. \n It is time for a change.", ""),
        StaticBook("Galahar's Revolt.", "CONORDUDE8", "*The authors name does not seem to appear here.* \n Galahar, is Weak. It is a city we can not trust. \nThe citizens of Kramaroe where shunned aside, as they knocked it down.\n It is time, for us to make a change. The king is weak. and the council is weak. We must Bring back Kramoroe. \n Let us Replace the KING! Bring back Kramaroe! and Bring forth a new leadership for Oren! \nJoin the fight for freedom!", ""),
        StaticBook("Galath's Journal", "malicoreman", ".write Ahad, 29th The first seed, year 1330 YesterDay was \"Halloween\" a Human celebration but it appears to be Very popular (( by yester day... IRL)) Today, the day After Halloween is the day i was created here... in Aegis i hope that today will be amazing. but back to the party, the Celebration, we Elves were invited to the festivities, infact the first City to take part in the Celebration Was our very own Laurelin! oh it was Fantastic! Then With in a few hours time we moved on to the next City, It Was Alras!!! The Celebration there was even more spectacular But among the festival patrons, There She was, A beauty among beauties I finaly worked up a nerve to speak to her there in the party Her voice, So sweet and maliflouis We spoke for a while, i introduced my self, and she did as well, Her name, her Title Duchess Brianna... A human... a beautiful Human Later we parted for a bit, just to enjoy the festivities, After i won a Few events and claimed my prizes, i decided to share some of the things i won i shared with her a few golden apples and a lapiz block she looked greatful but before we knew it the Festival had ended, we said our goodbyes and parted, tis a shame i may never again have the chance to speak to here again... If only i could... maybe i can... scratch that... i think ill stop, i need a home... or a room... ... i finaly have a room over a Dawns boarding . i have decent sized room, i heard from  few conversations around the streets about a guild called \"White Ravens\"", ""),
        StaticBook("Galaths journal", "malicoreman", "my first day here... in aegis it is an amazing place, so full of hustle and bustle but yet it does have issues. ;; the \"undead\" launch their attacks against the world i was wandering the roads then suddenly zombies, and lightning!. Luckily their were other cit izens around and they called to arms it was a amazing how fast they reacted with them protecting like that it makes me feel a tad bit safer i found a rally of warriors against the undead we attacked and we have failed, we created a few bunkers and are hiding ... waiting... may god help us all...", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroth", "AutarchCosmos", "Name: Galroth Lanry ((HideInTheDark))\n Age: 21\n He can FARM at a moderate level.\n He can MINE at an advanced level.\n He can FIGHT at a moderate level.\n He can read and write.\n Note: He can use a bow.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroth Pay-slip", "WOOSH10001", "Golden Harvest Pay-slip\n Guard Galroth\n 10/24/2011\n Signed Overseer Maximus\n For creating stairs and gathering wool", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroth payslip", "ParagonWarrior", "Golden Harvest PaySlip \n7th October \nGalroth \nSigned Pikel Boldshoulder", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroth Payslip", "WOOSH10001", "Golden Harvest Pay-slip\n Guard Galroth\n 10/14/11\n Signed Overseer Maximus", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroth Payslip", "sam2far9", "Golden Harvest Pay-Slip \n Galroth \n 16th October \n Signed Lylth Sylvaris", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroth Silas Lanry", "HideInTheDark", "Generally a passive person, Galroth Lanry has always shied away from combat. \n \n However, times have changed. \n \n Since the death of his father, his only known relative, Galroth has wandered the lonely roads and paths of Aegis, looking for a meaning to his existance, and a deeper insight into who his parents actually were. \n \n He recently arrived in the Great City of Alkhazar, and it was there he heard about the Golden Harvest  and has since become one of their number. At the age of 21, Galroth intends to continue his employment under Lord Richards, and learn as much as he can about Farming, so that he may one day have a farm, and a future of his own.", ""),
        StaticBook("Galroths Payslip", "ParagonWarrior", "Golden Harvest Payslip  \n30th October \nGalroth \nSigned Pikel Boldshoulder", ""),
        StaticBook("Garret's Introduction to the Wilds", "patthebakr", "\n I seem to have been able to create some books out of sugarcane. This book shall chronicle the events that I have been forced into so far. My new home is near Laurelin, the city of elves. I have made a few friends: \n Conell, a very trusting and young elf, sometimes I fear for him and his eagerness \n Bawapy, i honestly don't know much about this fellow, escept he has a borderline fetish for cacti, honestly hate the prickly bastards myself, always scratching and poking at you. he may be related to Conell, they do look similar, always wears a mask though. \n Ademas, only other human living in these parts, seems lonely. He is quite mysterious, and i have heard talk of him being cursed, doesn't come from Oren, either. \n Tend'el, owner of a local inn, a very wise elf, he seems to know plenty about the magics and dark arts, but he is a kind fellow. \n Laetri, The only woman amongst the group, she is a fairly new resident, and wonders around often. \nThey live in a place they call Wilder Farms, basically a small indent in a mountain. It contains their mansion, a huge mine, an abandoned home, and a general store along with the farms. It is located just northwest of Laurelin, near Tend'el's Inn. I am here to escape society, I will not make the same mistake twice. Untill the world forgets me, this will be my sanctuary. I think that as long as I keep here and limit my trips to Oren, I shall be fine. \n I believe that, due to recent events, i have been forgotten. The King has died in battle, and soon after a new person will be crowned. This Unfortunate death seems to have aided me, three days after the king's death, I was able to easyily enter Al'Khazar. Either they have forgotten me or the guards have gotten sloppier.", ""),
        StaticBook("Gary", "pugsy", "254 230 5818", ""),
        StaticBook("Gauntlet Winner !", "shiftnative", "You've defeated the mighty gauntlet! Congratulations! Bring this book to the High Prince for your reward !", ""),
        StaticBook("Gaurdians", "jackmonkey76", "We are the gaurdians noble heros who fight for the good of aegis and fight against the evil of aegis but a dark time has come over the gaurdians a time of chaos where we turn against each other brother versus brother leader versus leader a civel war as you may say are leader Adain is banished we do not no who to lok up to will we all split apart under difrent leaders or will we be one again we must take action or we could be attacked at our weakest we must choice a new leader one to lead us to victory and to gives us pride and hope and to give us honour we must hurry on who we will give our trust and faith who will lead us to battle and victory someone we will give our lives for someone we will be proud of dieing for someone brave someone with wisdom and honour someone with faith. We Are The Gaurdians We Will Prevale.By Corpral Jack text but now we have fallen we are no more we are all gone...", ""),
        StaticBook("Gay people", "jammer562", "gay people like to look at penis 8======D", ""),
        StaticBook("Gazing Above", "Slayer15855", "Gazing Above \n \n \n \n Transcribed by Arcane Mage \n The Moon Stars:", ""),
        StaticBook("Gec", "MythMaster26", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Gems", "machinegunliam", "Coal-1  Iron- 20  Gold-30 Lapis- 7  Diamond-150 Redstone Dust-1", ""),
        StaticBook("Genealogy of the Whitestorm Family", "Awackypenguin", "Grandparents: Aren Whitestorm Jr. (Human, deceased) Karin (Human/Elf, deceased)                                  Parents: Flavias Whitestrom (Human, Deceased (?) ) Diana Lumenis (Human, Deceased)                         Children of Diana and Flavias : Hawk Whitestorm (Human, Living) Jayius Whitestorm (Human/Ascended, Living) Torok Whitestorm (Human, Living) Aren Whitestorm Jr. (Human, Living)", ""),
        StaticBook("General", "latias232", "All generals have to obey to Argalas cause this is his plot. when you not obey you will be punished.", ""),
        StaticBook("General Faeron's Diary", "Safioro", "Hm... Ah. I just found out that the old farmer that worked here suddenly vanished. Odd, I know. Well, After a long day here, there has been no success with the bread sales... Dissappointing. Headin' back to the guild. Hope nothin's gone wrong. Day 2: Just saw some squids in the water. Cute little buggers. Just turned day now... Alright Gorn. I don't care about the weather! Goodness me. There we are, I'm here. There's a man shouting outside. Better see who it is. Vogorn just asked me te go minin' with him. Hah! Askin a Dwarf if he wants te mine? Just proposed a plan to Vogorn. We need armor. And weapons. We'll be getting money for the permits. Man, we really need this money. It's a wonder how we got along so well without mining. Just ran into a man that helped me find the Wardens. Time to seek out their corruption. Got some more meat fer Vogorn. Very far south now. This had better be worth it. Ah, found the road again. I was worried fer a second. Aww sheit. I really got meself into it this time. I snuck into the Warden's gates. Then i killed one of em! I could get arrested fer that! I should ask Bryce or James aboot it. Decided te turn on the guild. That no good pack o' wellies. Also... There's a man with two souls here. I have decided to write information on any strange people I meet on my adventures. I must get this information to the King. Lord Bryce keeps on attempting to contact me. He seeks my guilt. *You see one line scribbled repeatedly* \"I will not let him do it...\" More... Treats...", ""),
        StaticBook("General's Notes", "Safioro", "Today I found Vogorn and a few new recruits. Ah... So nice ta live here. Also, earlier this week, I helped ally us with another guild. I overheard Bob_Stonefoot talking to a few druids... I'll investigate further.", ""),
        StaticBook("getting lost", "shiftnative", "Lost, lost... being lost. its not a loss to be so lost.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ghilbre's Journal", "GilbertIkah", "I can write! Amazing! I can actually write! my hands are steady! I can hold a quill! \n Last night I dreamt that I had walked with all the spirits of the four races... They told me that that the hate that I believed shattered peace was nonexistent, that peace is a matter of self, not nation. And I saw all four of the first men! First I was greeted by Krug, he called me son and squeezed my fist in his huge hand...", ""),
        StaticBook("Ghost", "StandUnited", "Hello I am Kayle Seek, I am not sure how I become like this. Hello I am Kayle Seek, I am not sure how I became like this.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ghost Communication Thanks for that Relyt.", "StandUnited", "Thanks for this relyt. I was wondering, if I could get some bread, since its the only thing i can eat. Ah thank you Relyt, it seems that I am stuck this way for a while until the priest can fix it \n Well I must be off, see you later. \n Hey, when you see the queen or king, tell them of what has happened.", ""),
        StaticBook("gids", "djurreman", "typ bij een nieuw boek .write om de titel te maken dan waneer je de titel hebt gemaakt typ je weer .write om de woorden te schrijfen so maak je een boek", ""),
        StaticBook("Gift!", "Eltyer", "'Oi Ned, dis be fer ye. Thank ye fer borrowin' sum melon seeds. -Yazgurtan Gezmar", ""),
        StaticBook("Gillamir Nyel's Diary", "baehr86", "Our fort is finally set up.  It is the first time we have had a steady home in quite some time now.  I believe the walls we built are impenetrable by whatever Aegis throws at us. Yesterday after we finished our fort i went out looking for supplies.  I managed to get enough paper to write this.  I also managed to find a squid and a chicken.   These were amazing finds as they gave me what I needed to make a writing tool. After i went out on that expedition I gathersome wood from some nearby trees, and i made myself a sword.  I stayed outside the gates all night fighting many spiders. With all of the string i had and the wood i decided to make my own bow to fit me better than any I could have bought in Oren.  I made it slightly longer than Oren bows.   With this length it allows me to make accurate shots at great distances, which are not even attainable by the most expensive of bows.  I took my new bow out into the wilderness where i went on the search for some cows.  I managed to find 4 mighty bulls which gave me some of the toughest leather i have seen in my entire life.  I left the leather hanging from the gate for 5 days, and wrapped it around the area on the bow my hand would be on, as a grip.  Now i can use my bow as long as I want without having to worry about treating the wounds on my hands when i get home.  I travelled far back to The Cloud Temple of Aegis and blessed my bow in the spring water which flows through it.   Now that my bow is blessed i now call it Aeroghana, and believe it will be feared,  by all who have heard of the blood shed of the arrows fired by this mighty bow.  My ink is running low and i will not be able to write much more...", ""),
        StaticBook("Gillamir's Diary", "baehr86", "Today Argramir and I finally Created the walls to our new society.  These are impenetrable , by all the evils aegis has in it.  We have been working on gathering enough supplies for this fort for many years now, and i began to fear we would never gather enough stone. Carrying all of this stone to this area was a very difficult task and required many trips, to out orriginal tower. erase out original tower. help", ""),
        StaticBook("Gio Carminian", "AutarchCosmos", "Name: Gio Carminian ((racingbrother)) \nAge: 25\n He can FARM at a advanced level.\n He can't MINE.\n He can FIGHT at an advanced level.\n He can read and write.\n Note: Lost his brother in a war.\n Note: He wants to fight the undead.\n Note: He has an uncontrollable bladder.\n Note: He is quite good with redstone.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Gio Payslip", "ParagonWarrior", "Golden Harvest Pay-slip  \nGio \nSigned Pikel Boldshoulder \n7th October", ""),
        StaticBook("Gio's Journel", "racingbrother", "September 300- Today a lot happene, at the monostary of Aegis, a sage gathered about 180 mili militia to fight and eventually capture the undead base. Unfortuneatly the Undead retaliated, They destroyed the Orc town of Kramoroe. The main hall was burnt to the ground, and the city was molested of all once beauty . Well that's all that happened today, and it was a very big day, hopefully we can defeat the undead soon. hello?", ""),
        StaticBook("Gio's speech for Albrecht's funeral", "racingbrother", "Hey Not yet", ""),
        StaticBook("Giovanni Carminian's Resignation Letter", "racingbrother", "I Gio Carminian am writing this to any of my bosses to let you know I formally and reluctantly am quiting the Golden Harvest. I have had a great time here and hope to have equally good times in the future. The reason I'm resigning is the fact that the Golden Harvest has become the least of my priorities and I see no reason that I should be wasting my dorm as storage space. I am soon going to be buying a shop in Al'khazar, I work for the Therving Brother's Tavern and Inn, and am becoming a member of Nachemtoff. With all of these big things happening at the moment, I don't want to be wasting space for new, young and ambitious recruits like I was such a long time ago. I also don't want to disappoint you men and woman with my lack of work. To be honest, I have had great times here at the Golden Harvest, but it's time for me to move onto a new chapter in my book that I call life. I hope to stay in touch with you all, and wish every single one of you down to the newest recruit the best of future endevers. I hope we can continue our friendships and continue to visit and have long conversations with each other . ((lol wtf))", ""),
        StaticBook("Gjon", "Gjon3", "Name: Gjon \nRace: Human \nAge: 18  \nPosition: Footman", ""),
        StaticBook("Glamdring", "charliescott123", "A good man, maby a supporter of god, he owns a Newspaper HQ, And is nutral with me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Gloin", "_DrAwesome_", "i had applied o join The Knighs of he norh. I was egerly waiing for he leader o ge back  I applied to join The Knights Of The North. i was waiting for the leader to return", ""),
        StaticBook("Glylith", "firespirit44", "\n Race: Dwarf \n Age/Gender: 215, Male \n Skills: Swordsman \n Used to be the General of the Teutonic Order. Was demoted and left because he was too prideful and showed no leadership abilities. Viadar replaced him. Do not ever hire, contact, tell info unless he has valueble information.", ""),
        StaticBook("Gnash Journal", "Gjon3", "This is new journal. Want to forget everything that happened to Annie, but still keep memory of her in heart. Many things happen lately. Make many friends, found many new things, killed many monsters, found nice dogs. From now, will write everything down here. Not know much good language, but still remember spellings. Should have stayed home on that night. If I did, Annie would be alive, would have good spellings and be smart, and would be home with parents. First will write about first friend. Name is Aval. Very nice, been through much. We get along good. Second friend is Flower. Strange green man. Very nice though. Hope to make more friends, but many people think I am strange. Found three dogs in forest. Very nice. I was leader of pack, but dogs died on hunt. They hunted with me many times. Made graves for them. Names were Grarl, Furnander, and Grim. Hope they are happy in sky. Today learned about strange drink called ale. Taste funny, but is okay. Make me drop sword and bump into people. Don't know why people drink it. Also saw pretty girl in tavern. Had red hair and long ears. Think she is elf. Want her to like me, but no girls where parents lived except for Annie. Live far away from cities. Said they were bad and that we were self sufficient people. Killed many baddies on travels. Will stop writing now. Maybe write later. \nSee many happy people with friends. Am lonely. Miss wolfies. Would talk, but am very shy.", ""),
        StaticBook("Gnash's Journal", "Gjon3", "*Most of the book's contents are ripped out or unreadable. On the cover you can make out \"Gnash's Journal\" with difficulty. Who could Gnash be?*", ""),
        StaticBook("Goblin's Diary", "turret001", "This book is written by Goblin. ((turret001)) || Goblin's Inn! Where a wonderful life goes on. \"I remember first day on Aegis. I was like poor and robbed, than i found inn of Arkensald. Who is so kind and helpful human. I helped him 2 months, than he fired me because of the building i built in front of his shop. After that day, i promoised i will take my revenge. Now i'm running a Tavern named Goblin's Inn . I found another Goblin from my destroyed clan, now we are running this inn together, he is helpful. Thank god i am still alive. By the way, wizard seems like mentally retarded, he keeps saying we are just small orcs. SO HE IS? He is just a human but no, he is the greatest at all. Never mind. The End. Thanks for reading.", ""),
        StaticBook("Goblin's Diary", "TheCleaningCrew", "I opine that this city is one of the better ones I've lived in. The guards can be powerful angry and they have too many rules. The drunkards can get damn stupid. But at least this place won't disappear on me like the last one. At least I think it won't. It had better not. If it does I'll be greener than fifty guards, and so will all the other bodies who live here. Maybe even the guards'll be angry. But it probably does no good to think about it. It's unlikely ever to happen. \n I share this house with two other bodies. One of them never comes in. The other really is a body. No life left in that one. None but what his god gives him. I suppose I serve his god too, but I only do it because when that body was alive, we were friends. Good friends. I suppose we still are. He protects me from his kin as best he can. And I'm glad to still be with him. Even if he does tear folks apart every once in a while. \n This other housemate though...he better come in soon. His personal storage chest is spotless-clean. Nothing in it. And I'm running out of room. I'll probably have to invade that one's space a little. Besides, I'm older. I should have more space. Actually I guess I do, but not enough. And nobody better mess with my things either. Might be tempting though. Some of these belongings of mine are valuable. I built myself a statue today. Nothing special, just a zombie. But I got a sense of achievement from it. Maybe I've converted more to my friend's cause than I realize .", ""),
        StaticBook("Goblin's Inn", "turret001", "Goblin's inn, where beer and pork is always fresh!", ""),
        StaticBook("Goblin's Inn", "Briton1", "Room 15 Minas Mushroom Soup 7 Minas Any Fine Cooked Meats 5 minas Melon Or Apple 1.50 Minas Bread 2 minas Cookie 0.75 minas", ""),
        StaticBook("god thinks", "Demonxerov2", "many people can \"interpererit\" what god thinks, it doesnt make it true. in reality, you just have a man thats putting his words in a book and saying its god why would god need your dirty money for a holy war?", ""),
        StaticBook("Gods of Aegis", "Da_Emperors", "This volume will look over the gods of Aegis that have the largest force. To humans and many other Aeriel is the lady and Savior of this world.", ""),
        StaticBook("Going to wait until they figure out whats going on with a world reset due to 1.8 to build", "Jaknifed", "Lordstuff1", ""),
