    private fun _AEGIS_10(): List<StaticBook> = listOf(
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Handbook", "WOOSH10001", "This is the handbook of the Golden Harvest guards and recruits. The rules stated herein must be followed by all members. Failure to do so may result in expulsion from the guild. If you see a member breaking the rules, please report it to an officer for investigation.  \n Who we are: The Golden Harvest is a merchant organization that owns shops throughout the world of Aegis. \n\"Golden Harvest Bread is the best in all the land.\"\n We are also a military group, aiding the nearby city of Al'khazar in times of danger. \n \nRules: Live, breathe, and die by them. \nFollow all rules of the kingdom.\n \nLearn the chain of command. Follow the chain of command.\n \nLord Richards word is final. No exceptions.\n \nProtect the Lord's land and the Kingdom.\n \n  \n \nBehavior: Your code of conduct\n \nAlways wear uniform when on duty.\n \nDo not sell items found on the Lord's land without permission\n \nObey orders given by Officers\n \nRecruits will not give orders\n \nYou serve the Golden Harvest exclusively unless specifically permitted by Lord Richards\n \nDo not interrupt your superiors under reasonable circumstances\n \nYou may make reasonable modifications to your home within the space you are alloted. Be Reasonable !\n \n \n Things to do when there is nobody to assign you work\n \nHarvest wool\n \nHarvest wheat and make bread, make sure to put it in the chests and replant seeds\n \nMine for coal, iron, or other ores\n \nGive the guantlet a go, try and beat the whole course\n \n \n Note: Be on the look out! Evildoers are around and out to harm the Golden Harvest\n \nif these intruders do not respond or cooperate, kill them. The Lord's land is private property.\n \n \n Written by James Thatcher and Maximus\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Officers", "AutarchCosmos", "List of Officers\n Pikel Boldshoulder ((ParagonWarrior))\n Talen Boldshoulder ((AutarchCosmos)) Aye help", ""),
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Pay Slip", "AutarchCosmos", "Date: 8/10/11\n This pay-slip can only be redeemed at Golden Harvest", ""),
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Pay-slip", "AutarchCosmos", "INVALID!\n Three of these tokens can be redeemed at Golden Harvest HQ for two diamonds.\n This token has no monetary value and can only be used as a part of the Golden Harvest payment scheme. \nOnly one token can be issued per day. If you attempt to redeem more than one token with the same date only one will be accepted.\n \nThis token is not to be used in conjunction with any other Golden Harvest payment schemes.\n \n (c) Golden Harvest \n Note: this token will not be redeemable if INVALID! is written anywhere on the document.", ""),
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Recruits", "tuarzen007", "Miguel Cyrus ((razarer)) Razz Arkensin Kooka Duras Sivert Artizen Justin McHelder SUpplier: Thral'Mar Aleksis Kivi", ""),
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Security Manual", "ParagonWarrior", "As some of you may be aware of, the military side of your jobs has been a little slack. I now see th at this has to be addressed immediately. This manual should guide you in all matters regarding    the security of our base and your fellow guards. \n-No non Harvest employee other than the King may enter without permission. \n-Other people must have an invite in or a signed warrant from the King himself. \n  \n  \n-All non Harvest employees must be supervised at all times. \n-Visitors must be asked to remove all armor as well. \n-Anyone caught trying to enter without permission you shall arrest with force if nessecary. \n -You have the right to question suspects on our land and use force if they do not comply. \n  \n-All guards are expectected to wear their uniforms with in the compound. \n-A full set of armour and and weapons will be issued to every guard. You are expected to keep your equipment in working condition, within easy reach and replaced if broken or lost. \n-This manual will be updated in the future so keep it handy to reference.", ""),
        StaticBook("Golden Harvest Vision", "WOOSH10001", "The Golden Harvest of Aegis exists as a Mercantile Guild located to the west of Oren.\n The overarching goal of what the Harvest aims to be is a private supplier to the citys of Aegis The Harvest Provides services in land development, building, supplying, and even private military ai de Darian Pay-slip Golden Harvest Pay-slip\n Recruit Darian\n 10/13/11\n Signed Overseer Maximus", ""),
        StaticBook("Golem Book", "kevins87", "A Rolling Golem Gathers No Rust help \n What is Black And Blue And Is About To Show You The Definition Of Pain open gate", ""),
        StaticBook("Golem Primary commands", "luchian", "Dor lowa = Shut down Dor Higha = Start up Work only if used with special golden staff. \n No other then Thorik Braveaxe and Gotrek the high smith shall be allowed to modify the golem. Obey Thorik. - This is a supreem command. Will overrule anyother command but: The command to never harm a Dwarf unless the dwarf is Exiled or convicted of Evil or crimes. . \n \n \n  If sombody tries to Upgrade the golem or change somthing about it, And they arent Thorik or Gotrek then the golem can smash them.", ""),
        StaticBook("Golem Programming", "luchian", "- Thorik is master, Others can be added, But Thorik Braveaxe will always be Master. \n \n Only Gotrek and Thorik can modify the golem. \n \n     - If traded or a new master comes then the new master will be Secondary master after  Thorik \n The golem will be Constructing, But also a Guard golem for Thorik and the Guard. \n It will also be a wledge collector, So when the golem has nothing to do it will gather  Knowledge.   -Also the golem will assist in Torture of prisoners and Interrogation. \n   - The golem cannot hurt a dwarf, Unless the dwarf is a Exile or villan.   - It will also not hurt Kirrekith. \n \n The name of the golem is: Grey_Vigil", ""),
