        StaticBook("Guard Handbook", "Mystronghold", "YOU MUST READ THIS BOOK! \nDo not let any citizens into the guard area A sign is posted outside where they can't go If someone goes past that point and says they are a guard, check the guard index or check there skin to see if they are wearing the guards uniform If they do not agree to leave the guard area, you may use force on them or put them to prison for a whole ((Minecraft)) day. \n\nWhen on guard duty, you can guard the gates or patrol around the walls of outer Kal'Urguan   . When guarding the gate and if they are coming to Kal'Urguan please ask them for there name and there business for coming to this city. \n\nTo get paid you have to be on guard duty for one ((Real Life hour)) or more. When you want to collect your minas just ask me Stronghold.", ""),
