        StaticBook("Guardian of Winterfell: Edward Talbot's Journal", "William_Talbot", "((14/10/11)) Today we arrived for the First time to Winterfall, the old ghost town. My lord Pampo Perea and his wife Dawn Perea called the king to give us the rights to rebuild this land... The first place we took down was the huge Prision Tower at the center... Now I dont know what is my lord planing to do with the Plot where the tower was. ((30/11/11)) More than 2 months have been since our arrival to Winterfell... The town has changed quite a lot, Lord Pampo Perea is lost somewhere in the Wilderness, Lady Dawn got the charge of the leadership of the town, along with the new Steward, Robin Drake, who has been living in Winterfell a lot before our arrival. I like Robin, I think he is a good person, anyway . Before Lord Perea got lost he give me the charge of Winterfell Captain. I got realy confused about the job, but finaly ended acepting it. After some weeks Lady Dawn and Robin decided to change my work of Winterfell Captain and become their personal guard. I accepted the new job with happines, due I didnt liked my possition. Conrad took my place as Winterfell Captain and then Kais. I think Kais is a better Captain that I was. Anyway I took the job of personal guard for a week until one undead orc got into Winterfell, this orc was looking for Mr. Robin. I didnt let him kiddnapp Robin so I sacrificed my legs and one arm to get him out of Winterfell. Then Lady Dawn was kidnapped by the same orc and his Minion. King Enor and a lot of people help us get back Dawn before she was killed. Finaly Botar, a great guard and medic, healed and restored my legs and arm with a magical brew he prepared. In that moment I decided to take some vacations and get back to my hometown Quel'Thalas. When I camed back I discovered I wasnt Personal Guard anymore, and that Botar took my job, although I was a bit uppset at the beggining I realised Botar is not a bad person and that I was very irresponsable of leaving my work like nothing. Anyway Lady Dawn is safe and happy  ,and thats what matters. ((6/12/11)) Im quiting the WF guards today... I dont like how people are treating me. Ill just be a hunter for the town. Im not mad with Kais, Conrad or Vrol. Its just annoying how do I have to follow orders when Im a man not made to follow orders. I MAKE MY OWN ORDERS! So Im just leaving... Ill join to guard Dawn if needed or guard if possible. Other than that Im independent now. So they cant order me to go or not to go to the nether anymore. ((09/12/11)) My recent researchs about the undead magic have camed to a limit... Today I found a complete formula of immunation on the lighting magic. I've tested it. Today a huge storm arrived to winterfell. I decided to get over my roof. I drink the brew and was inmediatly stoken by lighting. I lose conciense for 2 minutes until I woke up. Alive. The experiment was a success, although I feel a bit dizzy and my head hurts. I'll rest now, but before I left my brewing stands on making more of that potion for a future battle.", ""),
