        StaticBook("Guarding can be boring.", "SuperCril", "My name is Galh. The book that you are reading is written because i was bored while guarding. This is one way to fill in your time if youre Guarding: Writing. Though you need some inspiration to write. and sometimes boringness can make inspiration remember that. Another way to stop being bored is to just do mine some. train some skills. but close to the gate so that if you are just havin' fun. you can still guard. because there is a guard bell. Farewell Oops my bad I talked to a civilian who wanted to leave. if you know any more ways to entertain your self while guarding. tell me. or edit the book yourself. it lays in Kal urguan. the Guarding house. I just now found out another Way. If you buy a shop or a stall close to the gate. you can lots of money and open the gate for peopel who want to enter. its done really quick. only if it is a busy day then it will be hard. because then you will have to stand there all day.", ""),
