        StaticBook("Guide to being a sucsessfull bookwriter.", "Royced", "Everyone want's to write a good book, it gives you a good name! Writing them is easy, if you know how. To begin writing a book, grab an empty book and say /write [INSERT TITLE HERE] With no [&]'s. After you write a title, you use /write to write the book. you can always use /write -erase [insert word here] to remove of a grammar mistake. if its very far into text, write /write -replace [insert text here] this may not be much of a book, but it should get you started with bookwriting. Another helpfull hint: You used to use /w to write, that doesn't work now. /w is Whisper. It's been a plesure, thank's.", ""),
