        StaticBook("HarvestGrd_Thogen", "Z9Ryan", "Thogen has worked well and completed numerous tasks set to him! He has placed torches around the area to prevent monster spawning. He has also tended to the crops and I have been informed that he has performed well for the other officers.", ""),
        StaticBook("Hascuri Waystar, Shadows And Sunlight", "ixTec", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Hastely written note", "DarkSoundwave", "By the time you have read this note I will either be freed from the weapon or it will have completly taken me over. Anora things have been getting worse and worse within the world. The undead attempted to invade Alras thankfully this time they were stopped before they could reach the palace. By the time you find me I may possibly be gone. Please meet me in the Viceroy's Great Hall. I'm starting to see things that arent natural. *the text changes from black to red* I win Bito. Anora if you want to speak with him you can go through me. I've always enjoyed watching mortals squirm in fear at their loved ones in pain and agony. Come to the estate unless you want him killed.", ""),
        StaticBook("Haven - City of Aenguls", "GoldenGFX", "\n Haven, the city of Aenguls, or Ascended. I am Latsi, and I have been able to go inside the magnificent city, and city it for myself. On the inside, there were a few hills, and a large house on the tallest one. There were two roads around the large hill, one going straight, and one that went left. I was lead down the path to the left, to their in-city docks. \n Near the docks, were many houses. I was told they were the houses of the ascended. I was lead inside one of the homes, it was a 3 story house, with a pool in the basement. The ascended that was leading me, crafted a few tools, and we continued on. \n We followed a path under a large naturaly formed archway, and I saw what seemed to be a large mongoose head. In the head, there was a stair case going down, and a staircase up. We went up, and at the top, there was a small hall. At the end of the hall, there was a large drop. I was told to trust that I would live, and I jumped. \n I fell down very far, and ended up being saved by water, but came out completely dry. There were two ways to go at the bottom, we went to the left, as there was not much to the right. On the left side, the first thing I saw was an extremly large tree. At the bottom of it was a pool of water, with a tree growing out of it. She showed me where shops were going to be, near the base of the tree, and then lead me inside. There was a staircase all the way to the top, and there was a sanctuary up there. I was told that this was the spot that the Sages would hang out. We went out of the tree, and went behind it to a wonderful looking building. Inside I was told that the bottom floor is where the Ascended trained. Apparently some days their training is hard, other times easy, and other times boring. She then lead me upstairs, where they had rows of bookcases. \n In the cases, there were books on everything! There was Skills to be learned, Magic, the History of the Undead, Ascended and Sages, and more! After spending a little more time there, we went back up to the surface. I got to meet another ascended as soon as we came back up. When we came up from below, I got to meet another ascended. Soon after, I left the city, and journeyed home. \n Known Ascended: \n > Nailena \n > Richard \n > Dolir", ""),
        StaticBook("Haven's Whereabouts", "monkeychez", "Every day, more and more visitors arrive past the gates of Haven. Curious to see what secrets lie behind the walls.... These adventurers take the long journey across the white road, to our lands, and gaze upon almost everything... The increasing visitors worries me somehow... Perhaps a sign of the Undad attacking soon? Mabe. Well, whenever they do attack, it was fortold by some strangers that they will either anex Laurelin, or Kal'Urguan. Lets just hope we can hold them off... Their numbers grow each day, and their power, their will... Is very strong.", ""),
        StaticBook("Hayden's Diary", "hayden34666", "Day one. depression has grasped me. wandering the land to find nothing but wilderness. will i ever find my treasure? will it still be there? i hope for the best but i feel as if im lost... \n day two. in the morning i set out fast. the night before i had been badly wounded by a mad dog, so it was very important that i found food . Each day seems to slow down to become an age. \n Day three. Finally i found my treasure! It was greater than i first remembered! \n Day four. I slowly wished i never found it as i needed something to do. \n Day five> i have decided on making myself a home though im not sure where to build it.", ""),
        StaticBook("Hazels Jornal", "Hazelnut006", "My jorney back to oren wasn't easy, I endured the harsh heat and cold, I'd given up waiting on my parents return, it was foolish of me to try, I had finnally gotten 3 years older than than I was the day my parents left, I had no clue how old I was, my parents, for some reason never told me, now I'm on my way back to the place I was born, it's my only hope now... Day 2, Journey home... I am hopelessly lost, I see an inn up ahead, I need to rest---", ""),
        StaticBook("Hazels Jornal2", "Hazelnut006", "Day 2, Journey home... lovely rest, I met nice people this morning, we chatted a bit and ate after the amazing food and interesting introductions I left for oren and finnally, I arrived. Oren changed, it was a bit scary, more gaurds, more houses...Time does fly doesn't it?  -help me... what do I do? There is no houses to buy in oren, I'm heading back to the free inn... I feel somewhat discouraged... I was hoping to buy a big nice house and settle down with a nice family growing around me... Where ever my parents are, I know that they still care...And that they would want me to grow up, happy, and safe.....", ""),
        StaticBook("Hazels Journal3", "Hazelnut006", "", ""),
        StaticBook("He comes...", "Ever", "Tha Corruptor comes...Mind yer place in this world like the rats ye are. Ya live, day'n 'n day out praisin' yer \"god\" Ariel...Fools! If yer lucky, maybe you'll be blessed by the taintin'... Or maybe you'll end up as a sacrifice fer the Unholy One! ((You don't know Ever wrote this, don't meta me. ))", ""),
