        StaticBook("Healing", "123trevmo321", "My foot was in major pain. It came to my attention that i had sprained it. Remarkably, Dedicant Lainadan came to my aid and succesfully heal me through concentration and power. I cant thank him enough. -Ice Druid Jameson her eyou are l", ""),
        StaticBook("Healing the Wounds - An Introductory into the Healing Arts", "Sir_Wyvernos", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Hearts that Harmonized", "Alectriciti", "This heart of mine is trying to speak. \n It's sending a message, why is it so meek? \n I lowered my shield, my self-control. \n It's her I seek.  \n \n \n \n It's raging inside, it want's to come out. \n How I laid my life down for her. \n I was ready for justice, her sorrow to end. \n It's her I love. \n \n \n Out of my mind, out of control. \n I've created a triangle. \n I regret many things. \n Holding her, I don't. \n \n \n The moment was infinite! \n The memory so short... \n A memory branded in my heart. \n Infused with elysian majesty, our hearts harmonized in a glorious tune: \n We are combined, our hearts intertwined, a gorgeous endeavor, our love is forever!", ""),
