        StaticBook("Hello, It is me Sparrow. I am returning!", "Monkey34512", "I know i havent been around very much. But i am right to let you know i WILL be around more often ! I want an update on your plan, next time we meet up. You will also need to fill me in on all the events that have happened recently. [[will the world reset? Will the undead be taken away? SO MANY QUESTIONSSSS IN RP AND OOC!!]] \nWell i will quit writing here. \nI do hope we meet up in the near future! \nThanks, \nYour Friend, \n-Sparrow-", ""),
        StaticBook("Hello.", "Shuness", "Erm.. I appear to have accidentally run into your labs while mining. I am truly sorry about this. My name is Shuness, the current owner (Mayor is a term that I do not like to use) of Terra, a town not far from here. I hope that you and I can coexist peacefully, and even help eachother out. That is, if your still here. I await a response.", ""),
