        StaticBook("Hempshine's Jounral (Circa July 16)", "Hempshine", "The 15th of Julia, \n Today I crafted a book, then went outside and ate a mushroom under a tree. Today was a good day. \n The 16th of Julia, \n Today I was really really upset as I thought I had lost my journal, which I was planning on writing in later. I was purely breathless when I saw my book through a grate in the Al'Khazar alleyway of doom. What a slumhole. So I wen't down to the sewer to retrieve my beloved book. As I am writing this, I am still in this smelly place.  I wish I had  more light than these blasted redstone torches!", ""),
