        StaticBook("hi", "sgtsomebody", "Chapter 1: Starting off as a guard seemed so easy All od my fellow dwarves were guards But when the undead showed up I felt like there was nothing us deads could do, but run. Earlier today The undead attacked Aerial most of the guards came and tryed to help te'm, but when we got there, the city was done with them. we came not short after the undead left, about 5 of us, the best of the guards. all dressed in iron armour, diamond or iron sword. But most of them were hurt, and we never even got to see the undead We just came back, and the guards are protecting the great dwarven capital strongly. Ye? ye cancel Aye? Thats all we heard, ten enemies came realized how many of us there was and they finally left. we are still waiting for an undead attack High chance we are the next on there god damn list. I dont know if i will be dead in the next five minutes, as my body shivers even thinking about the u ndead", ""),
