        StaticBook("Hold on tight", "ikeyman232", "\n As I stand in the wind, \n I see the what it seems, the whole world, \n The flowers float in the wind, \n Singing a happy harmonic tune, \n Hoping from tree to tree, \n I feel like I'm flying, floating in the wind, \n As I fly, grabbing flower and more, \n I hear the tune of flowers drop, \n The sad, sad song sung, dramatic and strong, \n The happy tune, be never more, \n Flowers fall, and the land dies, \n Why, oh why? \n The dark moon shines loud and bright, \n Just hold on tight, hold on tight, \n The sun comes out, battering down the walls, \n Smiting undead, leaving nothing but bone, \n This cycle happens day and night, \n Just hold on tight, hold on tight, \n  \n Just hold on... All throughout the night.", ""),
        StaticBook("Holmes Lyle Greenburrow", "Dr_Lyle", "My Personality: This cannot be explained, it changes depending on the situation, making me a very effective diplomat. Generally I have the same attitude as any Halfling, fiesty yet peaceful, er... unless im pissed off ... Anyway there is no way to describe my personality, because even i dont know what it really is . \n \n Goals: My goals are fairly straight foreward, I want to help make the Holmes as successful as it can be, and then when i am of an old age, like....60 or hin', I want to retire to the quiet town of Dunwood, where i can tend the fields and drink as much ale as I like . \n As for the job I would like to do, I would, of course, like to be Deputy or Colonel, However , I realize that that is not a likely thing, so my hopes are to be the Head Diplomat or  something in that section. \n  \n \n  P.S. As ye already know, i will help you whenever and however I can. \n Sincerely, Lyle Greenburrow", ""),
