        StaticBook("Holmes_Molta", "WizardInACan", "Holmes_Molta I few my personality as humble, but strict. I respect authority, but I see myself as selfish. My goals are to have a pet wolf, and to be a great warrior one day. I would enjoy finally beating Greed in a battle, or inslaving him for eternity. done And I also would like to be the Head Detective...eventually", ""),
        StaticBook("Holmes_Val", "MinerzMight", "I am unusually kind for an orc, I dislike fighting and am good at sorting out conflicts, I respect those who are higher rank than me but will correct them if it is neccessary.  \n My goals are to help the holmes and the whole of Aegis in any way possible, to stop conflict when it arises and to one day become the High Shaman. \n Of course i would like to have the job of Deputy or Colonel but as that is unrealistic I would like Head Diplomat. \n \n Sincerely, Val \n P.S. As you already know I enjoy sorting out ranks and rules, and will help you in any way I can regardless of rank.", ""),
        StaticBook("Holy Bible", "TylerIsBored", "1 In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth. 2 And the earth was without form, and void; and darkness was upon the face of the deep. And the Spirit of God moved upon the face of the waters . 3 And God said, Let there be light: and there was light. 4 And God saw the light, that it was good", ""),
        StaticBook("Holy Bible", "Jarhead90", "The Holy Bible of Christ There was darkness. Then on the seventh day God created the world. He made the trees the grass the stone. He made all animals and us people. He also made Orcs and Dwafs. The assended is gods angels. The undead and dead creatures are Satans demons. Satan is a ex angle sent out of heven by god. Christ is our god Christ Bless this church and this village and its peoples ;; Amen", ""),
