        StaticBook("Home Building", "Ansh98", "You most likely live in one of these. It provides shelter for you. Poor would love it, the rich has too many of it. Home building is an essential division in the Oasis Crafters. We take pride in offering our clients the best of the best. If you love building houses, we would love for you to join this division. \n Reccommended for members who have had prior experience in building elegant houses. Also reccommended for members who built houses for others in need of shelter. Dean challenges would mostly consist of making the most splendid looking house that is not determined by size. Want to be a key factor of the Oasis Crafters?  Then join the Home Building division and build on!", ""),
