        StaticBook("Homosexual: Mork", "Burkester", "There once was a man named mork, he was a very hated man even by the people of his own guild. At the age of 25 Mork was living in his parents basement and had no friends. In his free time he would masturbate to Male Woodelfs have sex, this was a very odd desire to watch so he never had any friends. Some how over the next 10 years he ended up into the White Ravens where still he is hated and ridiculed for his weird behavior. He also has a gay brother named zoe who dates men in the desguise of a woman for his own desire. This is the story of that gay man Mork who is still to this day hated for his annoyingness and other things that he does. One day he will die a lonely death and he will not be remembered. The end of Homosexual: Mork", ""),
