        StaticBook("Hood's Report", "sniperking90100", "I traveled to my home and when I arrived I found a large tower made of a black and red stone. Strangly I thought I've seen them before   I traveled forth to the tower and was abused by a great number of undead.  salutes and returns to his new home. I fought them and was put to my current state. Luckily the local area was covered in snow and I seal my wounds with the cold matrial. I then traveled back here with my what belongings I had with me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Hooded man cult", "SethGull", "I have descoverd the hooded man cult, lead by Jack the hood. they worship a undead by the name of Dalik i have met him and he seems to be powerful, but i am too far south for the to find me. I hope. For now I will wait to see what happend for they have forced me into hidding because i have attemped to expose them, so far i have contacted the gaurdians but no relpie so far. i leat a message with o ne of their recruits. I hope he tells the captain of the gaurdians to contact me soon. or their may not be much chance for oren. Sighned Der'dwar.", ""),
        StaticBook("Hope for Spring", "SerahLove", "Gloomily, he looks up and sighs at the sky, \n Where birds soar and clouds fly,  \n None, save Robin, really knows why. \n \n After the solemn autumn, comes the winter frost, \n And by the crackling fire, Robin sits, \n Thinking of things so dear that he has lost. \n \n Perhaps, someday, the people say, \n When the snow clears and winter has gone, \n  In dear Robin's heart, spring will have finally come.", ""),
