        StaticBook("How did I escape from an Undead - By Noku", "calvinnok", "That day was cloudy, I was walking along the King's Road When I passed by Kramoroe, A dwarf with a hood appeared I reconized the symbol on his back It was an Undead! Then he started to attack me I was shot by lightning and chased by skeletons I grabbed my sword and dragged thier heads off After that I started running back to Oren Remember, When you see an Undead, Just run backwards And... Never pass by Kramoroe!!! ~The End~", ""),
