        StaticBook("How sexy is Helgar?", "123devmo321", "Helgar is the sexiest dwarf alive. Look at that candy ass! Scrumptios! I just want to lick his balls off. I mean look at them. OH GOD! His tits! So.... EPIC! I wonder what his dad looks like, bet he's not half as sexy is this beast. Wow, I just glanced over at Fast, he looks like a walking, talking, peice of shit. I hope he burns, only the sexy survive!", ""),
        StaticBook("how shall we tell blaedr of this? this is a hard time now.", "stiason", "can ye tell me what has happened to the sages? why has blaedr and candle come out of hiding? have they decided to stand up against Ibelees outright or are they trying to inspire courage? and how can I become a guardian of the sages? I am sorry for so many questions but I am very worried for master candle and master blaedr ever since master arcadius died. I have been very depressed due to the fact that he was a good friend of mine. he trusted me and let in to his private affairs in the keep. He knew of my abilities and trusted me. I wish I could have taken his place. now I will not let another friend die, especially not my idol or his brothers who has been protected by ye. I have seen Candle as an Idol and wish to help him.", ""),
        StaticBook("How Te Join Ye Cripsons", "AcrylicFuzion", "Aye, It be Cripson, If ye found t'is book, ye be chosen by Iblees. Come join the Cripsons! We be evil, and are bringing Aegis to dark places! We hope ye come, Only if yer pure evil, ye may join, whisper to me if yer interested! ((OOC: MC Name AcrylicFuzion))", ""),
