        StaticBook("Humans", "DefunctDivine", "What a tragic tale, we the short lived humans. Our kingdom is flawed. The poor live in the bowels of the city, confined to the sewers, while a large amount .  of our population, even those with sizable money, cannot find housing. While it's true that monarchy allows for a less corrupt system of government, it doesn't", ""),
        StaticBook("Humans", "AfroDave", "A morally neutral race, created from the very sands of the earth mixed with the water and lava from the two cavers of the Temple. Neither Good or Evil, but susceptible to both. Humans stand from heights of 4ft to 7ft, they are the most adaptable to changes in the environment. Although they do not have innate hatred towards any of the other races they are better friends with the Elves whom they trade frequently, there are humans more at home in the huts of Orcs or the caves of Dwarves ,as a diplomatic people they sledom make life long enemies but usually make life long friends .HUmans are also able to learn magic, as they do not suffer any natural resistances or weaknesses to it. haha No kicked. damn it Gonna burn this book. This is a test book just wanted to type something SO now it's going to be destroyed", ""),
