        StaticBook("Huwel's tale.", "huwbert98", "I looked up coughing,my vision lurred. I looked around hearing only the sound of fire and watched as ash fell like snow. I tried to move ut my legs wouldn't oey me.She turned and fled. I cryed out to Respiren ut he wasn't there. .Slowly my world faded to lack....This is my story. Huwel stood are-footed on a soft red wool floor.he sat watching the fire-place. He turned to see his friend and cousin Turin. Huwel smiled and said \"Hello Turin hows things\" .Turin is a good guy he's my rother in arms and cousin in the warden we share a house and share many traits.We oth agree that when your off-duty to enjoy yourself ecause you'll neve r know when it could end.... Interlude:Somethings I never certain.... \n \n \n Chapter 2 : 3 months later.....Turin and Jena are now getting married! I have travelled around the Aegis and now long for the sea....Thank you Turin and Jena I will come ack soon.. \n \n Pleases keep my room how it was and write your own tale...Jeerim I may never meet you  but I hope I will remember life is short so enjoy it.....", ""),
