        StaticBook("I.A. Promotion Ceremony", "bryce141", "Bryce: We are gathered here today, James: To celebrate the hard work of (NAme) \n Bryce He has proven himself well overhis time here \n James: And he has proven himself worthy \n Bryce In all areas \n James: and that is why, \n Bryce Our guild comes togather read Bryce: We are here \n James: (name) do u swear \n BRyce to uphold our guild \n James: And contribute to it \n Bryce And protect it with all your might? \n (person answers) \n James then we porclaim you \n Bryce: A New (position) of the I.A. \n James May you uphold ur vows Bryce Welcome to the brotherhood \nAS JAmes goes and taps on sholder with sword \n\n Both: Long live The Guild", ""),
