        StaticBook("If...", "cometking123", "If I could see the world help each other, then It would be a better place . Alas, some things are not meant to be. Aeriel is hiding in the sky, the Undead of its followers stalk us at every turn, and the bloody Asce nded can do much, but it's just mobilized. I love Al' Khazar. I really do. How ever the council just sits there and get fat, and we suffer at the hands of ill-equipped guards Don't get me wrong, this is not a complaint, just a plea. The thing is, we can't move on unless three points are dealt with. The guard, the economy, and the goverment. This is my opinion, so you can just move on. But I recommend you read this book, because Al 'Khazar will be in ashes by the end of the year if yo u do not heed this warning . \n Where to start? I suppose we should start at the guards. The Oren Guard, I think, is one of the most valiant military groups around. They respond to complaints, and keep the peace, even when m ost people don't listen to them.", ""),
