        StaticBook("In Case Someone Captures Kramoroe's Library", "Jallentime", "Hello! If you are reading this book than you either stole this book, or stole the library. In either case I, the librarian, have written this guide to running the library smoothly. The main chest at the top of the stairs contains copies of the entire library. That is all you need to know, remember that I hate you. Deeply.", ""),
