        StaticBook("Itnam, 16th of Snows Maiden, 1323", "Dalejin", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Ivestigateion journal", "Megaman765", "I have begun my investigation of the potentail heresy among the gaurds. Former captain vardak whom is now a traitor has possively corrupted the kings gaurds and i mu st see the corrupted . I have meet Bortar an old friend of mine as well as vardaks i chated with him he seems pure but still will keep me eye on him i still must find the king or his relitives to give me a list of gaurds perhaps ai can sort them out. Frowmans journal... i have gained audiance with the foa but have no commanders at the moment i belive the king is available i shall speak with him imediately. I have gained permission for authority by the king this shall aid me greatly however im still being hunted by some assasins. i was droped in lava but.. i swam out... what could this mean luck ore power.. The only other survivor was a dark elve which does not suprise me but the supriseing aspect was when i lived could i be... no... its not possible. i figured out whom the traitor was it was no gaurd Bortar my good friend was.. the one i thou innocent.. he will die as well i must tell the king the only one whom knows is another gaurd. I found out he was not fully turned but i must find him before he betrays the people now... i was told by a gaurd sgt that a gaurd called tharn can help me i will find him. it appears vardak was pure the whole time.. but bortar.. iam certain imust find this man. The people of alras told me the harvest gaurd are pure however the masonic guild they have taken their place therefor twisting opinons now i must learn of this masonic guild It seems vardak has a demonic alter ego must look further.. I found bortar no taint i was lied to.. I conclude this case with vardaks dangorus split personalitys and was unable to corrupt the gaurd due to vardaks remaining will... case closed my new case will be the finding of the masonic guild witch remains a problum for the people o aegis. Case 2 Masonic guild hunt.. I have searched for hours for the Masonic guild remnants for the reason of them being a reasource to the black hand for quite awhile now. I had followed one whom i reconized into new terra a strong presence of crime was commited th e area.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ivrae", "Hempshine", "You suck", ""),
        StaticBook("Ivrae's Diary.", "Ivrae", "Day 1, well I'm not quite sure where to start.. But I feel the need to begin to document the happenings of my life, in hopes that I can further develop this great kingdom and pass down my knowledge to the next of the advisors. \n Although I feel the need to write how I came upon my position, I shall not this position I shall not for my own reasons, however strange they may be so I shall begin with todays happenings, construction of the Keep is going well I've done what I can to my office and room and have taken some time to relax. \n The 'guildmaster' Ogland? Oglaf?, I dont remember returned today, second time I've caught him and his apprentice in the off limits areas of the Keep, they seem to think that I'm arrogant and rude by telling them to leave an area with unsupported archways overhead. Well, I for one would not like to be blamed for their crushed bodies should the mortar decide to give way, but I may not care all that much... Moving along, there was an event at the arena today, some woman won surprisingly I didn't care much for the details as I was busy rebuilding the ranks of nobility .", ""),
