        StaticBook("Jacks Journal", "jackmonkey76", "nical now controls zafus's base he may have thought it was a good idea but it was a horrible mistake they brought dishonour to his land the started wars with more guilds then they have men orks elves even men. There empire will soon fall and I dont want to fall with them so I got refuge at the north knighs the leader is my oldest friend casmir I am now safe and can continue my studies I hope soon nical falls so this will all be over help the black cross are after me I need help I have spent many days running from them and fighting I am now in oren getting ready to head north. I have no idea what I will find up there but I must take the chance. There is nothing left for me here my friends have all gone so in hope I will find a new life up north. I made my way back to oren and to the cloud temple there i went threw the protal to the verge cucmucy lead by cucmucy we headed off to find zafus's base but we got lost", ""),
        StaticBook("Jail Journal", "anorexichippo", "Day 1 - I have to pee and they dont gimme no angel soft \nDay 2 - I wet the bed and its soaked though it is quite warm at night \nDay 3 - I heard a guy in the cell next to me get raped yesterday The rapist was Riizu \nDay 4 - I found a crayon and I drew a friend on the wall but when I peed he washed off \nDay 5 - I was having a pillo fight with myself and I lost \nDay 6 - I had a friend put in the cell for 1 minute I felt like I wasn't alone anymore then he left.... \nDay 7 - The Guards are making fun of me \nDay 8 - I am having a staring contest with the redstone torch I think Im winning. \nDay 9 - Still Winning!! \nDay 10 - I think it blinked I do not know.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jak'nia: Essential for Killing", "PaxKivimae", "------This Book is for the use of Shamans------- ---It is used for those who wish to learn home to effetively kill anyone who opposes your rule, or who posses something you desire. The essential for magic is the golden hoe, and with this you may begin you must prepare gunpower and the blood of a zombie after this, you must prepare a summoning circle useing the blood. To do this you must create a circle of gunpowder. Then add an oval of Runic letter saying \"Ta Si No Ki Su Ge Po Mi Ze Qi\" Once this you must enter the circle and place your soul stone. Then draw your golden hoe, known as a Syche of Sorcery. After that you must utter the phase \"Boku Wa Kami\" -=- Chapter 2 Now you will feal a surge though your body, you must not move and rechant the line. Soon you will see a red light emanating from the power, and the runes will turn black. Now chant \"Aki Ti Me Wei Jai\", And a line of cuts will appear on your head. That will spell in Tanin Characters \"Death Mage\" Now as the circle dies out, step out, you now posses the power of an ascended. -=- Chapter 3 Now here are the spells you can cast: Rak Ni Ka: Summon Undead Horde :Na Kin Ra: Steal Lifeforce ;Ta Pae Rwa; Curse with Blindness ;Tan Yui Ru; Curse with Paralysis ;Tyu Pai No; Eye of Medusa ;Nai Funa Ka; Blast of Darkness -----Secret Magic----- Wai Fia Tia Ai; Kills target; Ri No Tai No Sai; Curse with Pain; Dai'Ki \n: Curse of the Undead", ""),
        StaticBook("Jak's Expedition", "Jakbenimble", "This is a tale of how Jak travelled the strange northern reaches of Aegis. \n On his first day, Jak gathered his equipment and set out north from SnowyFields. The further north he went, the warmer the climate became. Soon there was no snow in sight. He came upon an archipelago due north of SnowyFields, there were several houses. They all appeared long deserted. Jak hunted the ruins for supplies and once again, turned north. \n Day two, Jak tamed a wolf cub to follow him around. But it was soon killed by the undead that are so common in the north. Jak stumbled across a trail of torches that led him further north. Soon enough, the climate grew very warm and Jak sheltered in a small isolated house. He did not have to worry about water when he reached the northern deserts, they were surrounded by lakes of clear fresh water. Soon enough, Jak saw no more torches, and knew he was going as far north as man had ever tried befor e \n He eventually came to a halt, some ominous force was halting his progress. The journey had lasted nearly a month, and Jak was glad to build a boat and row back south. Oh. But that is not the end of Jak's travels.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jake's Draiy", "Stephen1969", "Day 1 Today i become human so i am makeing a daryi(jounle)) if you read this get the hell out of my room now to what to say I am waiting for miss faylen to get back she is so cute that i love her alot \n It has been a long time shince i wrote but i do not see the harm for now I am getting weak a bit i feel weak falling apart and breaking it feels like pain more then lave burning my skin i hope it ends soon im glad im with miss faylen it makes me happy i just hope that i can stay longer then i sould If i can i would be happy but i fear somethings about miss faylen. . . If she goes or shes hates me at times or anything. . . i feel weaker then i did before i feel like im being Torn from the inside i hope i will be fi ne", ""),
        StaticBook("James Thatcher", "tuarzen007", "James Thatcher, child of Jon and Atricia,is a Northerner from Al'Khazar. His child hood consisted of goign to school and working in his fathers shop. His brother Michael, older by several years, was on his way to fight in the arena when he disappeare d . Shortly after this happened, Atricia was killed by a Thug who tried to rob her. Jon then killed himself leaving James alone, desperate and out of money. James then continued to lie off the streets for several years, finding scraps of food and finding very little Mina on the floor. James was then approached by Harvest Officer Heimdall, who offered him a job. James was taken in by the Golden Harvest at the age of 24. Now he is working as a guard for Lord Richard Goldens and is trying to make back his parents mon ey  so he can once again live in Al'Khazar.", ""),
