        StaticBook("Journal re: Gold Staves", "Nalayna", "This journal is to help me keep track of the gold staves that Selena (JCQuinn) let me use while farming. In doing so this also does a wondrous thing and repairs the mana within the stave. Originally Selena donated 11 staves, I have returned 7. That left me with 4. Selena then passed me another 10, making my current total 14.", ""),
