        StaticBook("Journal: My adventure in Aegis.", "CrazyBlueBannana", "Day 1: Its been hard to find a job. i have Tried to find one but none have come up. I have decided to head to Alkazar to look there. I will pack and head out tomorow. Day 2: I started down the road to Oren, when an orc starts chasing me. I soon escaped. I entered Alkazar and waited by the fountain. Soon a man named Justin_Longfello Came. He was offering a job as a farmhand. I resisted because it was a farmhand job. But soon i decided to take the job.", ""),
        StaticBook("Journal_of_Raghnok", "pcgeek61995", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Journals of Sidreal of treetop", "smokintek", "Day 1. Well I've been asked to write my thoughts and adventures down. Not sure how to  proceed so I suppose I'll start out with something simple.  My name is Sidreal of Treetop. I am a human that owns a small farm outside Lauralin.  I build seige weapons as a hobby. I am also fortunate enough to be dating a wonderful elven innkeeper.  She is far to good to m e.  Earlier today I was at her inn and we were talking when we saw fires erupt in southern  Lauralin. Reflexivly we ran to the cities aid.  For the better part of an hour we battled  the undead that were laying siege to the city.  I did little fighting but I was able to slay a ghast at around 40 meters as it tried to burn the city.  After the battle we joined the fire crews and like everyone else I did my share. One thing I have not mentioned yet is my fear of hights.  The ghasts were not kind enough to light ground fires.", ""),
