        StaticBook("Journey of the South", "abxyxx", "Today I gathered my gear and head down the road going south. I found a city that is being built but the road ended there so i went on foot . \n I found a traveller today, we decided to travel together. But when we were setting up the tent, a monster came and killed him. I ran and continued \n I dont know where i am now, but i see a castle. \n I walked closer and saw its ruins of a castle, what could do this much damage. \n Last night i kept hearing load noises. Im turning around. this is too dangerous.", ""),
        StaticBook("Journey of the Wandering", "X01", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Journey Thru Aegis", "krislove45", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Journey Thru Aegis Vol. I *ORIGINAL*", "krislove45", "Well, I tried a go at the Gauntlet of Laurelin. I failed miserably. Also, I met a man today. He had red eyes and was wearing red and black... I think he was an undead. He and another elf were having an argument... The elf was thinking it was weird the man had red eyes. The elf said that red eyes are only on albinos. The man claimed to be an albino, he was just dipped in tar... He spends most of his time in the sun, too. He said he loves coming to Laurelin because of the trees... He had to be an undead. But why didn't he just kill me on the spot? I guess I didn't need to be sacrificed that day... Went on a mission with a guy named Diezel. It isn't finished yet, but we'll be continuing it tomorrow. After that, I traveled to Al'Khazar. There I met Princess Ariana. It was an exhilirating experiance. She took me to a special training arena. Before that however, we chatted for a bit. She also gave me \$3000 After I failed at the Gauntlet, the High Prince was acting weird...He laughed at the idea of the Undead! Then he was like Kill you..um? I don't think that is supposed to be happening... It scares me to think what could have happened to the High Prince. I don't know if I should report it  to the Princess... I might just be paranoid. I suppose I'll just go to the Orc's Civilization now. Anything I else I find will be in here... Wish me luck getting there.... Let's hope I can get some jumping training done. Not just jumping though. I also need to train myself in fighting. I am sure the-hold on Somebody started talking to me.... I am sure the orcs will appreciate me coming to their race in order to train in fighting. I didn't stay at the Orcs' place. Now, I go on the most dangerous journey I'm sure any elf has EVER been on! I am going on a search to find the Undead Civilization! I have come across a little 'town'. It just has some rooms and a fountain. I must search more I have found 2 different areas with civilization! One looks like a camp-out. Another looks like it could belong to Orcs. I am not sure if I should investigate. I will consult somebody at Laurelin as it turns nighttime! Apparently the Undead are active! What does it mean? I do not know what it means yet. I am forgetting about finding out what 'the Undead are active' means. Right now, I must see if I can contact her about the High Prince. I well tell her that I might just be paranoid. I don't know. The day is almost over....I meant to write Day 1 on here. Anyways, I am headed off to find the Dwarven Kingdom. I must find the bridge I took last time... Actually, now that I think about it, what I said was the most adventurous, was probably the most ridiculous and forbidden thing. Live and learn i suppose. I hope I can befriend the dwarves as well. It mgiht not be easy, but I'm sure it can be done! Once again, I have my way back to the Orc's! I think I remember where to go now! I must hurry! This journey will be quite dangerous at night...I must wait until dawn...No! This is not what she would do..*ponders* i will take the risk! i am not at the bridge, but I have found a castle relatively close to the Temple of Aegis... Should I investigate? I will! I am entering... It is apparently a- what was it? It is a Hermit Sactuary. Apparently made by Priest. I think I have found the bridge! Now to find the Dwarven Kingdom! This is so exhilirating! Another thing to add, I have admitted I am 11 to the Princess...She thinks I am mature for my age! It is an honor being her friend and helping her out. There is only one problem. I do not wish to go the wrong way, and I do not know which way the kingdom is...*sigh* I guess i will just go right...I hope I am right! I believe it is the right way. I can't help but feel unconfortable while I walk this road. I think it is because I know the Undead are probably more than the High Prince expects them to be. I wonder, are the Undead just a small amount of people who sacrifice us other creatures just for a god? Or are they just underestimated? I wonder how much pride the High Prince and if it will help in battle or not. Too much pride kills us. Too little leaves us nowhere. *sigh* I do not want to sound like I do not want him to be High Prince, I am just critical. That will get to me one of these days.. Anyways, onto the Dwarven Country! I am very certain that I am going the right way now! ngihtfall at the latest. i have gone back to Laurelin to get my sister so we may both go to the Dwarven Kingdom. I hav to find my sister who has no sense of descrition at all.....This might be a long day.. I found her, but we must go and rest for the night. I hope it will be an easy trip to the Dwarven Kingdom. I pray for no Undeads along our travels. Day 2     Well, my sister is not here. I shall go to the Dwarven Kingdom without her. I found the bridge much easier this time. Down the road I go.... I have that uncomfortable feeling again. It is nighttime and I come across Prince Toren once again. I met him at a farm a while back. Anyways, there was lightning. I hear the Undead can control it. The moon and the sun rise and set much quicker than usual. I've no idea why. Onto the Dwarven Kingdom! I hope they are friendly.... I have arrived at a giant archway. Behind it lays another bridge going into a giant castle made of cobblestone. It must be the Dwarven Kingdon, but alas, the gate is closed. 'Tis a shame I came all this way for a closed gate. I suppose I will wait until dawn. Maybe somebody will have the gate open then. I know 'tis not my business going toevery races's 'palace', but how else may I get information on the undead? The moon is going down, and 'tis approaching dawn. I hope sombody opens the gate. Let us hope the Dawrves are not hostile. Halfway through the morn. Nobody is here. I wonder how I will get in without exposing myself as a criminal or undead...*sigh* I cannot go back. 'Tis too late... I will observe my surroundings. Also, this just popped in my mind to write down, I have given Prince Toren a copy of this. Another thing, there were some 'foolishg orcs' at Laurelin. I don't know what that was about. It turns out that wha I thoguht to be the Dwarven Kingdom, is really a place of ,no. Not a place of. It is apparently called Herpistidae. Princess Ariana met me at the gate as I was observing my surroundings. We are in her favorite place, called Haven. It is the Tree of Life. Right now, a man is preparing to take show us their magic. I will stop writing for now in order to go with him (his name being Richard) and the Princess. 'Tis not the end of this 'chapter' however. It is now troubling me. The fact that the days are shorter, anyways. I must keep my guard up. It appears I have accidently found the Dwarven Kingdom! It is a boat ride from the docks at Laurelin. I will explore plenty of it. I just came across another elf. A rude one, to be honest. I wish I could meet a dwarf... I know that there are underground things, for the smoke from torches is going through the holes of the cement of the roads. I feel as if I have been here before. I am sure I have not, though. I had been there, sort of. There was a sensible reason I felt like I'd been there. i see a house. I think I'll check it out. I believe I saw a dwarf go into it as well. It is apparently an Inn. 'Tis apparently closed. That Inn has supposedly been closed for a while now...I saw an orc try to get into it. I think I'll have to go on a journey to the Orcs. The shortening of the day is worrying me...Is it the Undeads' doing? I do not know. I will have to find out more. There have been many Orcs....I wonder why they run through the Humans' living quarters? Another rude one... Quote of Peacekeeper Kayle: After that, I was raged in pain, so I headbutted the one holding me. I stabbed him and the other, and grabbed my walking stick and ran over here. The man i just quoted is telling Prince Toren of a story. i suppose about fighting Undead. Th e man came to make an alliance with us. I did not mean to eavesdrop, but I had to write that down. I must be going, before I am seen. I would not want to get on Prince Toren's bad side. An undead...In laurelin! He was apparently somebody's 'Cripson'. He killed Peacekeeper Kayle. It scares me to think what else he will do...He sacfrificed the poor Druid for Israbeel, I believe his name is. Journey Thru Aegis Vol I Ignore the Journey Thru Aegi Vol I, please. It was just a tester thing. There was a king who, earlier, tried t ostir up some trouble and said that the Undead was attacking the Humans I believe. After that, Princess Ariana took me to Ravenhold and let me buy a house. I still have 'mortgage' to pay. The Princess just made me a basement. Bless her. I am not religous, and I don't say things like that, but she is a very nice lady. After I get the house done and she has done all she is here for, I will try to get her to read my book. There is a crucial part that the Prince, High Prince, and Princess of Laurelin must know! However, the 1st part i got through rude eavesdropping, but when you are a writer like me, you cannot resist. I hope Prince Toren and Peacekeeper Kayle will not mind. I believe that the Princess is wating for me to fnish, so I'll leave it at here for NOW. Not today, NOW. title Journey Thru Aegis Volume I *ORGINAL* I just wrote what i will name the book now. Since it is the original, I included it in the title. Well, I must be going to bed for today. I had an exhilirating day. I should sleep well. But first, I shall tell the Princess G'Night. Good night, book. Write you in the morn. Day 3   Another man with red eyes. He did not kill me either, but I did run away...He wore leather armor and held an Iron sword. He had pale skin and seemed to have purple-ish hair... I just saw him in Laurelin... This is kind of worrying... Well, I told an Ascendant, and make myself look like a fool. I just want to-no. I don't know what i want to do now. I suppose i shall go to the Orcs. I have changed my mind. I am going to the humans and possibly the dwarves. I saw lightning crackle across the sky. It had to have been summoned. I can't go into a home, because I'd be safer outside... All these Undead are really putting me on edge... I feel like a fool...It seems that I can always run into and undead. A man in a black cloak was at the Humans' civilization. I should forget about it, shouldn't I? I don't know. After thinking for about a minute, I am going to go to Al'Khazar. I just met the strangest boy. He is polite for a boy, but it does not matter. I travel alone. I am off to Herpistidae, if I'm able to enter. I hav tried trvaling on the tree tops, and have found a crater I am telling you was not there I was just next to an Undead! It did not try to kill me, nor the princess! ((The Undead is helping her fix it...lol)) His MC name is MrZombez The undead chased me! I believe I lost him, or he got bored. I have come across a little town on my way to the Orcs. I do not know what race lives here, but the flag is yellow and black. I will explore s'more and try to find out anything I can about the undead. it turns out, this is an Orc city. I do not know the name, however. I have not been on in ages...I have heard there have been Undead attacks and the King of Oren died... I plan to go to Oren. Wish me luck! ((I have given up on the Day [number]) I am afraid I am finishing this book with these final words. I am not done writing, just done with this book.  There will be more Journey Through Aegis books, I am not done yet. Nor do I think I ever will be done. Now, to go hom and put this in a bookshelf.", ""),
        StaticBook("journey to snow field", "moop123", "Day 1: I'm only just getting equipt with armour,weponary and food. I hear around that area is where one on the majour undead fortresses is located. It was not long ago that the undead took over snow field. My aim is to enter snow field undetected and grab what loot i can! And now my journey begins ! I know not of the way to snow field i may be totaly un prepared hopfully if i ask around enough ill find someone willing to tag along with me. All i know is that snow field is located to the north of Aegis ,I dont have a full map of Aegis only a map of the centeral witch wont help much. Day 2: I have just left Laurelin and im on the road to Kal'urguan. Seconds ago i was attacked by a spider. I didnt think much of it. Also seconds ago rain had began to fall im in a public shelter. I'll just have to wait it out. Day 3: The rain has finally stoped so now i can continue my journey! It is night fall and i have stopped at the holms base,the only place safe. Day 4: It is just past midnight and im still inside the holms HQ. A freindly man called kaiyee has offered to come with me to snow field. Holms inspector Kai'yee that is! passing trough Kramoroe. Day 5: Have just entered Oren at the gate being inspected by a man called Frado_The_Normal. Didn't think much of it. Me and my freind Kai,yee here are now resting in to Oren inn. Now night fall all we can do for now is sleep. Since i havn't had a good one for almost a wee k! I was only just offered 2 games of Dice roll by a Oclovia. It is now just before mid night and my companion from the Holms has left. I will have to continue this journey alone. For now... Day 6: I was given directions by one Lord_Thunder of Oren. As far as i know it isnt far from here well that what thunder told me I'm now leaving Oren and following the river to a road to Snow field Night has now started to fall and I'm hiding out in an old abandoned ship. Its now midnight. Well its hard to tell because of the heavy rain and I'm still waiting out the night with no bed. Day 7: I'm still waiting out the night still with plenty of provisions. And in the distance i think i can see the river i am meant to follow. Still night meany zombies have made this ship a target and are boarding it to get to me however it is sunrise and they'll dissapear soon! i have stumbled upon a small village and I go into investigate. Looks like this place has been raided a LONG time ago and all who had lived here seemed to have left sadly. Day 8: I'm slightly lost and am trying to find the river Lord_Thunder had mesioned. Its the end of day 8 and I'm on the road to snoe field Day 9: A halfling made Donald. Or Kip im not sure told me the way to snow field while on the road. unknowing he would send me the rong way ! He was strange from the start ! He sent me to the undead fort ! I was lucky to not be spotted. And aftar this journey he will die. I got tpast the undead fort alive. All snow field residents were amazed ! Now in the Snow field inn Alive and well with few dents in my armour. I'm now going to bed to rest. Day 10: Tis the end of my journey. I wish. There is but 1 thing i have to do now. Get revenge on that halfling. But that can wait till next time. THE END", ""),
        StaticBook("journeys of Icarus", "mattr41018", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Journeys of Tharin - Book 1 - A Wandering", "WahooMan", "exit undo what commands ar efor books? clear x= 309  z = 1264", ""),
        StaticBook("Journeys Thru Aegis Vol III", "krislove45", "[Irba, 11th of The Suns Smile, 1325] 'Tis a a rainy night as I write this. I am at Dawn's at the moment. I have lost the second volume of my journals, but I shall do as much as I can to retrieve it. Apparently High Prince Native found it, but there was too much commotion to question him any further than that... Next time I see him, I shall ask again. I'll ask Lynx, Aval, Luke, bloody hell, I shall even ask Thork. Speaking of Thork, I saw him at the library the other day. Well, I was in the library and he got in my face. Before then, his 'Master' had been browsing. [Kamees, 12th of Suns Smile, 1325] Back on topic. His 'Master' had been called Nightmare. Thork was being very disrespectful towards me, which does ot surprise me in the least, but what did surprise me was how Nightmare could make him shut his trap. Nightmare kept calling me an \"exquisite woman\". Is that a compliment? I think it is...Oh well. I got to meet a demon about a month or two ago, too. His name is Anansi. Just like the relation between Zatazen and Verrenn, Anansi sort of lives in Luke. He claims he is the spider demon, and to be honest I do not doubt it. He has quite a thing against birds, which is sort of annoying... Everytime my raven flies to me, he'll be like \"Birds....\" Turns out, he had once fallen in love with a mortal. His sister did not like that, so she  sent some birds after the mortal and carried her away...What spooks me out is that Anansi has told me that I am just like his sister...Another thing. He claims he can read minds, yet I can block him out. I've been practicing with my birds, since they can read my emotions and mind just as I can read theirs. Oh, and it turns out Luke has been very suicidal-thinking lately...I shall go now. [Joma, 13th of Snows Maiden, 1325] So much is going on right now. There is an Undead attack going on, and I am just hiding in the sewers...I feel like such a wimp...I mean, I don't have a blade or bow, but, STILL! *sighs* I wonder why nobody uses the sewers as an attack route... [Itnan, 2nd of The First Seed, 1326] 'Tis been about a year now...I feel I shall be turning 14 soon... I saw my sister yesterday. We went to Al'Khazar. Speaking of going to Al'Khazar.... This man, I forget his name (I think 'twas Lodrick or something), asked me and my sister to go and have an ale with him. I said that my sister I do not drink ale. We do not! Ale messes with you head! [Tolta, 3rd of The First Seed, 1326] So, I said we had to go, but he said to wait.... I told my sister to go on ahead, and I waited. I could tell he was growing angry, and not just because he snarled...So, he asked me to go with him. I refused, saying I did not know him, yet he kept insisting it. At one point, he said that he knew me \"Darlin...\" That REALLY creeped me out... So, after he asked me to give him a chance, I said that I had to go, and that my friend was waiting. So then, he said Wait again, I kept running, and he tried to tackle me! I just kept running to Al'Khazar, too afraid to look back... Funny how I can get into so much trouble simply by walking and living...*shrugs* Oh well. Another thing that happened, I got to go on a date with Aval.... *sighs* He kept putting his arm around me...That felt pretty weird...ANother weird thing, Kendra is in love with Zatazen! And Zatazen is in love with her as well...What is love? I am not sure. I consider it to be like a hlaf-moon. Neither light nor dark, simply both. The weird thing is is that Thork claims to be in love with me, yet he is so disrespectful. I do not know why, but I guess he is just strange like that...Then, there's the fact that I am only 13, soon 14, and yet he is in his twenties, maybe thirties! *sighs* Speaking of troubles...Niko is here. He's turned evil. I shall stop writing here. [Kamees, 5th of The First Seed, 1326] Thork tried to make me stop from running to Laurelin. When this all blows over I shall actually write about it.  [Sabet, 35th of Malins Welcome, 1326] Fire......dying birds and wolves..... *you see that the page is torn out, with a bit of blood near the spine* [Itnan, 23rd of Snows Maiden, 1327] *the writing is shaky* I'm at the library...I think that my raven tore the last page out.... Most likely sent it to Shuness... *sighs* I wish I could see SoulSetas again...He's the scum who made me like this...I am studdering and shivering...I cannot remember much of what happened, but I shall write what I know:  I was talking to a dryad. It's like a druid but more powerful, to put it simply. I think I might just write a book on dryads. They are quite interesting. Back on topic. So, as I was talking to her, I heard a loud, evil laugh. All of a sudden, the trees all around us were ablaze...*the writing becomes even more shaky* I saw so many     dying animals. It was LITERALLY bloody hell...The dryads were screaming, the birds screeching, then, as I was on fire! Then I blacked out, and woke up in the ex-Snowyfields tower...  That is all I can remember...I suppose I shall just start on my book about dryads...", ""),
        StaticBook("Journeys Thru Aegis Vol. II *ORIGINAL*", "krislove45", "[Joma, 34th of The Amber Coldd, 1316] So much has happened since I made the first volume...Let me get to the more important stuff. One, Latsi turned Undead. If I never explained this, Latsi was Undead in the place. Then, Bell (who is now dead) slayed him, 'turning him good'. Then, one time, Latsi asked me to meet him at Dawn's. He was a good friend so, suspecting nothing, I went to Dawn's and met him. 'Twas not a very good decision. He asked me to follow him, but was very vague when I asked where we were going. So, I followed him. Well, we passed by a 'murder scene'. Boney was in a locked house and being tortured. A man named Jack was slitting almost every part of his body. Except the throat. A dwarf by the name of Botar was freaking out and screaming violent threats to Jack. Latsi, only being a few yards away, was shouting at me to follow him. Afterwards, when everything had settled down, I confronted Latsi about what had just happened. He was complaining about my lack of following him. I protested that Boney was dying, and Latsi said something he normally would NEVER say. He said, \"Let him die!\" After days of thinking, I came to a conclusion that he must be Undead. The next time I saw him, my thoughts had been confirmed. He was trying to make John, the Druid, Undead. So, since he's my friend and I was NOT about to see him Undead, I yanked him away from Latsi. Latsi then turned his attention to me, after John had to leave. He tried a lot of different things, but my guard was up the whole time. I do not think Latsi will ever be able to bother me now, considering what a sage told me as I was talking to Shuness. His name was Arcadius. At first, when he had gone away after glancing at me sadly, I was confused. Now, I have realized that Arcadius was actually Latsi's mentor, I suppose is how you'd say it. The strange thing is that Latsi wants me to understand Undead, and I DO. I understand them well, but I absolutely do NOT approve of their 'reasons' to go off and join the Undead. The thing is, I do not know if I'm really on any side. I know we're weaker than the Undead. 'Tis all because the army leaders are usually just trying to gather up for the Undead to attack again, and when the armies DO try to do something, it's rash and violent, and doesn't work. I just wish some people had the patince that the Sphinx has....If he led the Undead, we would all be dead. Not joking. Now that you're caught up with that, there's more. About an dark elf named Thork. He says he loves me. He tried to kill me twice, tried to start a fight with my friend, threatened to kill that same friend, and now says he was possessed through all of it. I think love is a ridiculous thing, to be honest. Now, onto the present day. I am sitting on a specific tree that I like to get on to think. [Irba, 25th of Malins Welcome, 1316] I think I'll go get some sugarcanes. I need more books. [Sabet, 35th of Malins Welcome, 1316] I'm here at Dawn's Bakery in Al'Khazar with my sister. I was enjoying Dawn's, until Thork came...Pyper had to leave, so now Thork sits opposite of me as I write this. 'Tis very annoying...I suppose I'll have to just ignore him for now. I unparalyzed Thork, and I am not sure I should have. We'll just have to see what happens. [Kamees, 26th of The Second Seed, 1317] 'Tis a troubling time right now...I've developed a a studder, yet I've no idea how I did so...I just remember Thork...And Verrenn... [Itnan, 30th of The Second Seed, 1317] Hmm, I was almost killed by Thork today. erm..I guess it was actually Ragnor who tried. Thork managed to control Ragnor for a bit. My leg's wounded which is quite a bit of a problem. Trying to decide if I should let Thork out of paralyzation 'Tis quite a ahrd decision. He's pretty much begging. So far Thork has not tried to kill me again. This is the what... Third time he's done it? And it's all because I am foolish enough to follow him. Well, actually, he grabbed me, but, yeah he grabbed me. 'Tis not my foolishness....Or it is because I actually meet him someplace Bah, I do not know. [Irba, 32nd of The Second Seed, 1317] I am up north, trying to find a new place to explore... So far, I've found nothing... Wow, I've found a little cobblestone road with a few houses by it. I think I'll follow the road and see where it leads... ....I've found 'King Edmund's bridge.....'Tis a long one to walk. I suppose I shall go back to Laurelin now. [Ahad, 8th of The Grand Harvest, 1317] I am here with Lothiriel at Dawn's Bakery in Laurelin. She says she has to kill Thork..... [Joma, 34th of The Amber Cold, 1317] Thork has tried to kill me for the FOURTH TIME. Lothiriel will not be happy...Especially because she told me not to go near Thork... Alright, now for details. Verrenn told me he needed help because of Thork. So, I went to the beach by the keep. That's where he told me to go. So, when I got there, Thork was dragging Verrenn away from me. Well, technically 'twas Ragnor, but whatever. So, Ragnor attempted to drown him, while I was being nice to him to infuriate him. Eventually I got Verrenn out of the water, and dragged him to a safe spot. However, Ragnor managed to get a knife stuck in him. Ragnor tried to throw a knife into my chest, but I managed to dodge, then catch it. That made it the fourth time he tried to kill me. Thork now claims Ragnor isn't in him any more. 'Tis also what he claimed last time before trying to kill me. I'll have to look into this.... Oh, and who knew that a female, like myself, can attract so much attention when there are so many men drunk? I sure didn't. Well, live and learn not to go into Dawn's to write after some one shouts 'GO TO DAWN'S' or something like that.....*sighs* I am now back in Dawn's after all the drunkards have left...I am trying to figure out if I should trust what Thork says.... [Ahad, 8th of The Deep Cold, 1317] Thork, Verrenn, and some orc have gone off on a 'quest'. I worry for Verrenn, because who knows what Thork may do to him? [Sabet, 14th of The Deep Cold, 1317] Bloody Cassandra shoutin, \"Anyone wanting to come build in my new town, run for the north gate while hopping!\" Grr.....She needs to just, poof..... Alright, I am in Dawn's in Al'Khazar. I'm waiting for Lothiriel...Sort of worried to tell her about what happened with Thork...She will be absolutely infuriated when she finds out that Thork got away as well..... [Ahad, 15th of The Deep Cold, 1317] I am in Dawn's, talking to Lynx.....Still waiting for Lothiriel. [Itnan, 16th of The Deep Cold, 1317] I am meeting Lothiriel at Whisper Isles to talk... [Irba, 18th of The Deep Cold, 1317] I am at the Whispering Inn. 'Tis storytime, and Lothiriel is telling a story. the next one I shall record word for word in this journal, should there be a next one. And of course if I am not asked...Man, I hope I'm not... I hope another person has an intriguing story...I also hope Lothiriel does not ask me to come up and tell a story...I've only the story of my childhood and my journeys through Aegis... [Joma, 20th of The Deep Cold, 1317] I told Lothiriel about Thork, and she isn;t fazed by it.. I figured she would be infuriated, but I'm glad she is not... [Ahad, 29th of The Deep Col, 1317] Lothiriel finally came to a desicion to have me in Krugmar ,and so far 'tis turning out quite well. I am staying with an orc by the name of Thore. [Itnan, 30th of The Deep Cold, 1317] 'Tis quite nervous being around orcs...They tend to act like a dwarf when it comes to an elf who looks, in their opinion, pretty...I do not consider myself pretty, I don't! But the orcs tend to think otherwise... I speant the night in Thore's hut, and 'twas not that bad.. [Kamees, 33rd of The Deep Col, 1317] Verrenn claims that Iblees is coming...I do not believe him in the slightest. Since Thore has gone off hunting, I have decided to explore the Orcen realm in which I must live in for a while. [Tolta, 17th of Suns Smile, 1318] I have just returned from something important, and Thork [Ahad, 1st of The Grand Harvest, 1320] I am sorry I could not finish that last bit. I am now at Dawn's in Al'Khazar...Lothiriel may not be happy, but Ragnor/Thork know where I was anyways. [Itnan, 2nd of The Grand Harvest, 1320] I am getting help from the druids....Turning out well so farr.... [Irba, 4th of The Grand Harvest, 1320] I ran from the druids...To be honest, they weren't doing anything, which is fine with me. I am at Dawn's right now. Sort of scared, actually. I do not want Thork capturing me or anything...I have been lucky 4 times with not getting killed. The gods won't always make sure I am alive. I just hope he doesn't fid me...All of the things that have been happening lately have resulted in my being useless...All I can really think of my use is the use of making people protect me. I am sure that the Orc Warlord probably had better things to do than watch a little elf like me. I wish I knew what I'm good at. I am not good with alchemy, not good at fighting most of the time...All I have done lately is just hide. I want to try to train with strategy. I doubt anyone would bother teaching me...Ah well. No use mourning bout something so ridiculous. [Sabet, 28th of Suns Smile, 1320] I am at Dawn's...Just had an experience Thork a while ago.. At least I didn't get hurt...Nor did anyone else...To be honest, I miss Ragnor. However 'tis a great pleasure to be able to walk aaround without having to worry about the possibility of an evil spirit out to get me. Well, 'tis been eventful lately...Let's see where the gods take us now. [Ahad, 8th of The Deep Cold, 1320] I think I just had the worst run-in with Thork, as himself, that I have ever had...He tried to kill Will! I tried to get Thork stunned, but the guards just ran into the room he locked himself, in and pounced. It's so annoying feeling USELESS. The only thing I managed to do was heal Will...Afterwards...That's all I am ever able to do..  I hope I can become more useful soon. [Joma, 13th of The First Seed, 1321] Lothiriel appears to be in trouble. I do not know how...", ""),
        StaticBook("Journeys Thru Aegis Vol. III", "krislove45", "[Ahad, 29th pf Malins Welcome, 1324] I lost my second journal...So much has happened since then. I'll write down the things currently on my mind. Number One: A Demon, I forgot his name currently, thinks I have demon blood in me. Number Two: A man named Luke is in love with me... Number Three: A man named Kvothe seems to love me...Even gave me a rose... Those are some of the many things on my mind. The biggest thing on my mind is how quickly Oren almost fell about weeks ago. The King of Oren became Undead so quickly, the Sages turned against us, and the keep became pretty corrupted...There have been about 3 Undead attacks in the past few weeks... As I write this, I am at a city called Celestine. The man I mentioned earlier, named Kvothe, brought me here. I have to say, he can be sweet. Especially after he gave me a rose. He has asked me to settle down in Celestine, maybe even stay with him... I said \"That sounds good, I suppose.\" I do hope I can find my second volume of my journals.... I know I cannot stay on one topic, but it is just so much...I suppose I shall stop here. [Itnan, 9th of The Second Seed, 1325] I just got back to Laurelin from Celestine. I suppose I shall travel back to Al'Khazar. *sighs* I sure hope I can find my scond journal.. I am back at Dawn's...A friend of mine asked me a couple of days ago if I was marrying Lynx.. I swear, Claire is just going to keep that rumor up I guess. Not sure. 'Tis obvious they are in love with each other. He kept saying that he was NOT in love with me, for I am only 12. Honestly, I wonder why people care about age differences so much... I don't really get love. What is the point? I know it can make you happy sometimes, but what about when someone breaks your heart? Then you are stuck mourning. [Tolta, 10th of The Second Seed] I suddenly feel..older...I suppose I just turned 13. Anyways, back to the topic I started on Itnan. I consider love to be like the moon when 'tis a half-moon. 'Tis neither lightness nor dakrness. Simply both. I suppose I shall leave it at there for today. I am off to the Goblin's Inn...Wish me luck. [Irba, 11th of The Second Seed, 1325] I am at the Aegis library as I write this. I remember the name of the demon I mentioned earlier on. His name is Anansi, and he claims to be the Spider Demon. As much as I hate spiders, I'm glad of my connection with birds. Anansi says he has a sister that has a good connection with birds.  Anansi can read minds, but it turns out I've the ability to block him out. Anansi thinks I have a demonic blood in me... I highly doubt that, really... My father was no demon, and my mother, well...I do not know. [Kamees, 19th of The Second Seed, 1325] I am at Dawn's, as I write this. I was just at the library. Thork was there, as was a man named Nightmare. What amuses me, is that Nightmare seems to have control over Thork. Nightmare kept calling me exquisite. I forgot what that means...I think Pyper may have told me at one point...I cannot remember. I shall ask someone later. I suppose that I am waiting for Anansi to get back.", ""),
        StaticBook("Journies: A memoir", "Wanggubo", "", ""),
        StaticBook("jurnal", "blake11120", "", ""),
        StaticBook("jurnal of Arimm", "blake11120", "Day1: I was accepted to day into the Nawari camp. I chated with former prince native and lavant. after that I went to the underground caves and battled ccreatures to hone my skills with a battleaxe Day2: Lavaunt helped me build my tent and I helped Lvaunt build a new storage area. also high king siro gave me my 40,000 mina estate I have to ask lavaunt to help me build it..... deadmoore one of the camp memmbers killed himself today we made a crypt for him. It was extremely disderbing .I went to battle in the caves agin it is almost becoming a reglaur activity. Levant and I went to Alras today to get the demitions for my manor that I will sell. I am giving the profits to the camp. I also bought 5 stacks of iorn, im becoming rick agin. \n Day3: I found a person to train with me in the art of war his name is Bael he is not the best but im helping him. its always nice to have someone watching your back. I also starting writeing a book for growing and grooming a nice beard it will be a best seller. I saw a man running away from an udead so i saved he was using a pigman bone to kill the monster. what a fool! Theos back but he is being kind of an ass, I beat him in an arm wrestle and dislocated hisarm and tried fighting me but i won. then Bael my friend some how used magic and started flying, and theo tryed to kill him but i saved him and we dont know where theo is, ;; Day4: today I i chated to lavent about the stars and my iorn buiness is growing also a man attacked the camp and killed three of us. I also disded to pool my money with the camp thats about it for today", ""),
        StaticBook("Jus'ptan's Diary", "Jpenguin", "As I write this, I am  laurel I fear the undead, sudden people make guesses I am scared I made my way to Alkhazar, I fear the worst I saw some hooded men, with red eyes I don't thk he is acsended, as he didn't have the acsended robes I don't know if he was a war sat or not, but he was runng So I couldn't  followg h im I couldn't reach him, so it was troublg to see that There is war sats with hoods, so I didn't know but to be frightened of some  On a lighter note, there is many people barterg, so maybe me and my friend could fd a n to stay at This is where I stop for today, Goodbye diary I thought twice about stoppg for today I left oren, and now I am  Ravenhold Me and my friend Gladrator have been lookg for houses We havn't found anythg, but we have the funds We have seen too many thgs  oren We are alone  ravenhold It is very creepy and eerie I am scared worse now I heard people sayg Ravenhold was heavily populated Maybe it is a refuge town I hope it is, I hope no undead ambush us I only see one person, other than us The person we met at the gate, who says the same thg everytime I talk to him I went to laurel, and there is still nobody Except for the strange people, and animals It is quite different when no one is around I hope there is nothg wrong I got a race change, It feels different to be human, not elf I wonder what awaits me I don't remember much about beg elf, but I was I now feel like I am accepted    . I am going to stop this diary, and leave it for others to be found. I will start a new.", ""),
