        StaticBook("Kal'Urguan's Unity to All!", "Starsweeper", "This States that the Lord Marshall and Leader of the Army of Kal'Urguan states That it's armies will beh there ta help oren in the fight for the undead and WILL push them back to their evil lands! \n \n Lord Marshal Campington  \n Signed High Merchant Skaenye \n Signed Lord Baron Xavier", ""),
