        StaticBook("Kanoro's good bye for now", "EricTorchLighter", "I am sorry my friends, you have been kind to me since i first came i am sick of seeing people i know die, leave, and so on, Now it is my turn. i am leaving to seek power, money and many other things So good bye for now.....", ""),
        StaticBook("Kar'Lani Artifacts", "Hwaldar", "It is believed that the Undead had found an artifact of an old clan called \"Kar'Lani\" \nThe only known clue where to begin searching,is the old tombs of Winterfell. \nWe've sent searching parties,but none had returned \nMaybe the Artifact is cursed?", ""),
        StaticBook("Kara'Kumgor Security Report", "WOOSH10001", "Starting from outside front: \n The windows in the front of the second story should be filled with glass to deny entry.\n There is some evidence of tampering with the wall near the rear gate on the west side of estate\n \nThe front gate must be locked, Golden Harvest engineers can assist with this.\n \nMoving inside\n The front door should be locked\n  Switch should be removed from the gate to the vault when not in use. And gate should be left closed. Secret vault door should be rigged to be closed from the oustide as well as inside.   \nMust remove mine access to vault\n \nother mine access is also unsecured access to base\n \ngate from market must be locked such as prescribed above\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Karak's Last Will", "Uboob", "My son, I have not seen you in so long, and will not see you again. This is my will to you, I am giving you all that i own. My friend Rogorin is to look after you untill the age of 18, this may come quickly becuase of the curse. This curse is going to destroy the bloodline if it is not cured soon. My son there is many people in the town inwhich Rogorin is taking you too who i wish you to meet. There is the Mayor for one, he is a really nice human who you should get to like. There is also Jordan who was a good friend of mine and a hard worker at New Terriko. Also my son seek out you Uncle, His name is Hunk but watch out for him. My son i play a large role in New Terriko. I want you to aid them to the best of your abilitys. Once you are of age join the Wolverines, Groobs and Stonebeard are good men. Finish what i started at the market place. It is to be a wonderful place and my son be safe. Rogorin has the key to my belongings. You are intitled to EVERYTHING. Farewell my son.", ""),
        StaticBook("Karatzo, a bandit's story", "moozoom24", "A long long time ago, there was a bandit named, Karatzo. A name so feared even mentioning it would get you killed read", ""),
