        StaticBook("Karpaths_Adventures", "king_blackdeath1", "Log 1  \n I was in the dwarven kingdom when i met a chap named blackaxe he was well lets just say not the very friendly type. In my questioning of people i learned he was a general of the dwarves. A well known family . He gave me a mark that says C.B. on my neck also> its still there. I will never forget him but i will forgive him as i have told him mabey one day ill become as great as him when i become king who knows.  \n  \n Log 2 \n Today i met a nice young chap in the imabassy     he might have been part of this blackaxe family i heard about. They seem to be really popular. But he told me a grave thing about titus. He said he is now a Lord of the undead. I have had my suspicions of him being undead do to his biting he may have been a minion then. I shall investigate this immediently. \n \n Log 3 \n The rumor is pulling itself to be a fake. Titus is not a undead i really like my friend andne i will never spy on you again titus i swear unless the need is great enough. \n \n Log 4 \n I met a chap named rogan today when i was trapped in the gates of Kal,ugen his name is rogan a nice dwarf. Me and Rogan will mabey be partners one day in politics. Im still on the quest to beat the undead and unite all the factions under the dwarfs. Before i can accomplish this task i must learn the magic. We are heading to the humans kingdom to find a mage. \n \n Log 5 \n Today me and my new friend Rogan on our quest to find a mage guild. We figured the elfes would know magic better than anyone but the elf we asked said she diant then me a rogan just tool a break from finding a mage. Later that day we ran into some orcs with a hooded stranger with them. The orcs called him a elf. We followed them to a lair on the east side of the road to the humans kingdom. We dint aquire anything on our first trip and rogan has disappeared ((Logged out)) when i was going to leave they found me but i dint get caught. I will go back to see Rogans fait. \n \n Log 6 \n Today i met the dwarven king which i have never seen before. He was a hurry to do chap but was very friendly. I saw him about the guard out and he said i needed to find flynn. I hope hope i find him soon because i really want to do this. \n \n Log 7 \n    I joined the kal urguan army today called the legion. This is how my legacy will start as a private in the legion he was a fierce and brave soldier. if i can rank up here mabey i can get a spot on the council for my quest to become king. i also started eaves dropping on diplomatic conversations to get a feel of current events. We might go to war against the orcs for there bullying to dwarves. In my opinion if we go to war we should use spies in this war. We just went to war with the orcs  gimrik says. Im ready for this ill right about the wars progress in the next log. \n \n Log 8 \n Today we attacked krugmar the orcs home. The battle was long but we were fierce and brave. We did lose that though but we proved we are not to be underestimated. the war still rages on and i ave been promoted to Ironbreaker_Karpath most fitting title indeed. I ave given up on the mage thing because my legacy starts ere. I am taking my steps to becoming king. \n \n Log 9 \n Today i was promoted to Longbeard. I was waiting for this day to come. We seiged krugmar again also. we couldnt get passed the second gate though. It We tryied and tryied but we just couldnt get through. I even called the orcs a coward to try to get them to run across. They still wouldnt come out though so we just left. We will win the war tommorrow at the big battle. \n \n Log 10 \n", ""),
