        StaticBook("King Enor Sheffeild", "firespirit44", "Name: Enor Sheffield \n Age: 35 \n Gender: Male \n Abilities: Succesful merchant, Miner, Swordsmanship(?) \n Additional info: WildeBoy98, is trying to enrich Oren by doing what the elves did, repossessing a nd selling homes. Good job so far. But leading a army is unsure.", ""),
        StaticBook("King Enor's Assassination", "JTheCreator", "We will get him, oh we will. The plans have already been made, everyone is ready to do so. But we must catch him in the right moment. When to strike, King Mogroka? What shall we do? We surely don't want to lose all of our men, but we'll get Al'Khazar when they least expect it. We will get rid of that pesky human for you. Just make sure you pretend it's all okay, don't give away now! Make sure nobody knows.. We've got men from all races, and people working in Al'Khazar undercover to make it happen.. We will do this!", ""),
