        StaticBook("King Vach Hendrick's orders to Waynde", "SkeletorQ79", "\n These orders come directly from King Vach Hendrick of Agos. THESE ORDERS ARE FOR LIUTENANT WAYNDE OF THE BLUELIGHT CRUSADE ONLY \n Waynde, you know that the kingdom is growing and we are having to expand in order to  survive but we need allies and places to expand to ensure that we will survive. As your king, I am asking you to venture out into the uncharted areas of the world and find us land and allies. I know this is difficult to ask but it is of grave importance. \n When you find land leave a flag at the location. If you find another civilization however, I want you to do WHATEVER it takes to gain there friendship and send a letter or a ambassador from the other nation. \n Should these orders be found on the corpse of Liutenant Waynde send a report along with these orders back to Agos. \n May the light of the gods protect you Waynde.", ""),
