        StaticBook("King, Fix Your Problems", "muchoman798", "\nYour name has become synonymous with failure. Fix that.", ""),
        StaticBook("Kingcoovers personal book", "KINGCOOVER", "Kamees 26th, 1326 today I started this book. it is a book that will tell about my tales and explotes. my name is Max, and I am a knight. My friend rakker the orc is away at the moment but I expect his return soon. after having a run in with the undead I have found 13 blocks of strange black rock which I think is what they use for getting to that evil place they call a home. when rakker returns I will build the gate far from the village and activate it. Me Rakker and anyone we can get to help will raid that fort and fell the undead hoard, that is if all goes as planned, I must hide the book someone is comming. hello \n I have found an undead base and it was attacked by Soki the acended herself I even had a fight with the overlord before he ran The gate how ever was distroyed", ""),
        StaticBook("Kingdom Citizens", "Gunground", "Ventraux. Alvaska. Hawthorne. Animeus. Talos. Shuberry. Jekyll. Troliq. Right, I am writing a book documenting all new citizens. fffuuuuuu.  Wrong chat.", ""),
        StaticBook("Kingdom Hearts Ch 1: The story of Azura", "Reilock", "it was all dark when Azura regain his consciousness. His head hurts and he can barely see any thing he tried to recollect his memory wandering why he was in the dark room in the first place. However, nothing came up. He have no memory of anything except for his name and a flash memory of a girl he wondered to himself thinking \"who is this girl? and why am I here alone? \" Azura has a lot of question to ask. However, there was nobody to talk to or anything to read the room was absolutely empty. Not a single thing was present in that room except for Azura himself Slowly, Azura was able to adjust his sight to the surrounding. He can see vague images of the nearby walls and saw a door nearby .Carefully, he made his way through the door and slowly opens it .As he opened the door, a sudden burst of light came from the door and blinds his sight. Azura covered his eyes with his hand slowly recovering from the blinding lights .He could hear a voice from somewhere though he wasn't sure where it was from. As he slowly let go of his hand, he could see a shadow of a girl waving at him Azura wondered whether the girl was his savior. The only way for him to find out is to approach the girl. End of chapter 1", ""),
