        StaticBook("Kirrekith", "Chafferccino", "Kirrekith \n 232 \n Elf \n \n Kirrekith is a unknown entity. he appeared with the Braveaxes and has since then 'Infiltrated ' the Dwarf Kingdom and has so far proven not to be a hinderance. \n \n However he has also been very carefull not to speak of his past. I will be explaining in detail his past more in detail in the next book. \n (( The Authors name has been ripped off. I wonder why? ))", ""),
        StaticBook("Kitteh", "Bloodlest", "Kitteh es su nice, agh su pretteh. Bog es afrad dat he bi makin' her sad. Bog care bout' her, but afrad dat he es failin' her. Bog haz nut shuwn Kitteh, enyting' dat w uud imprezz her. Bog mut Kitteh en Dawn's Bakury. Out uf evrywun dat wuz dere', she treated Bog lik a person. She dudn't kick Bog out uf da shop lik ull da odda humiez did. She welcome Bog. Bog haz tu tink' uf a wey tu imprezz Kitteh, sumtin dat wuud mok her attracted tu Bog.", ""),
        StaticBook("Kitty Sutra", "MeGoRage", "Welcome to Kittysutra, a book about varius settings for kitty sex. Lets start with the basics. A \"Kitty style\": When the first kitteeh lies on her knees while the male puts himself behind her. The \"69KITTEH\": Kitty number 1 is lying on top of number 2 in a way that they can lick eachot her at the same time The \"KittySpoon\": Explains itself The \"Kittage\" alt. (Bondage): One of the kittens get tied up and the other one teases him. The \"2 kitt's 1 bowl\": I wont even tell, its to disgusting... The \"Backlegkitteh\": The \"Girl\"  kitty puts her backleg ontopof the \"Male\" kittys shoulder. The \"Walking KittyBarrow\": The malekitty grabs the backlegs of the other kitty. Then they walk while doing it. The \"Kittionary\": The kitty 1 Chooses a comfortable position on the ground, while the male lies on top of her. That was all but you can also test other things, such as \"The riding kitty\"", ""),
        StaticBook("Kjell_Irehearts will...", "Charles_Grimlie", "If yer readin dis... Dat means te monks 'avn't saved me frum death. Te reasun w'y be te death ov \"innocent\" orcs, whu Ah've rightfully butchered fer dey where te foe ov te war... Wittin dese contents Ah leave me tings tu a few folk... Me swords tu a feller named link. Me me guds, an riches tu Valon, including tweleve thousand minas, an finally me armor tu a feller named ron. Ah will remeber ye all, an Ah will wait fer ye all in te affer loife. Tanks tu all w'u fught God 'imself tu 'elp set me free.", ""),
        StaticBook("Knight Deed", "TheEdward", "Edward Archilles VI is to be a Knight as declared by King Edmund I. Showing Heroic deeds, I declare Edward to be Sir Edward of Oren. -King Edmund I", ""),
        StaticBook("Knight Jacob ((iamonapig))'s Application", "Ansh98", "1. What are your strengths and how will you apply them? \n \n A: I am a good builder, Swordsmanship, and a sort of free-running ability. \n \n Nobody is perfect.  What are your weaknesses? \n \n A: I am not good at: Talking people into an agreement, and I make stupid decisions. \n \n 3. Do you prefer building alone, or in a group?  Why? \n \n A: I prefer both. But when someone messus up in my group, I get really mad. I like both because building to me, is just building. \n \n 4. Why do you want to join this guild? \n \n A: Because I think it will be an awesome new experience. Up until now, I've not been invovled in anyway in any community. \n \n 5. What do you think the purpose of this guild is? \n \n A: I think it is to build. Also to get money. \n \n 6. Have you yet built anything in New Oasis or plan on doing so?  What is it? \n \n A: I plan on building a large farm, or maybe a shop so that I may support my self-income. \n \n 7. Who are the owners of this guild? \n \n A: Ansh98 and Justin Longfellow \n \n 8. Why did you choose this guild in particular? \n \n A: I chose this guild because I have actually never been in a guild before, so I want to try out this one. \n \n 9. Do you prefer building statues and monuments, or buildings and houses? \n \n A: I like building everything except for statues. I don't care much for statues. \n \n 10. On a scale of 1-10, how good of a builder would you consider yourself? \n \n A: Maybe a 6-7, but my buildings are of a \"Futuristic\" build.  But I can change. My friend \"Red Pilgrim\" is much better. I consider his work an 8-9. I'm just a wee bit close to my friend's building level/skills.", ""),
        StaticBook("Knights Log", "wingdude", "Day one:Lost in a tundra! I have been stuck in this tundra for 2 days i will be wrighting    Day:2 I  have found my way back to oren with my keeen sence of skills", ""),
        StaticBook("Knights of the keep", "tyking919", "There are those who fight for everything. Only for it to be lost. Great Warriors Fuck eachother FUck Shit Damn,  Curse your ass off.", ""),
        StaticBook("Knowledge", "OmtraSpectral", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Known minor spirits", "Lexperiments", "I know of a few minor spirits, and I shall list them here. I really shouldn't be writing this stuff down. Someone already got ahold of another one of my shaman books... ah well. \n One of the first spirits I have met is a stone spirit named Darak. I summoned him in the caves underground in my home with cactus paste. He is a harsh, stubborn spirit, similar to the dwarves in structure and personality. I conversed with him a bit, and he was happy to know a dwarf was a shaman. Darak agreed to help me when the time was needed. \n Another spirit was a fire spirit named Ferago, summoned with an ink sac in the deserts surrounding Kramoroe. Ferago was a very agressive spirit, eager to move forward. He was suprised and instantly on guard when he saw that a dwarf summoned him. I conversed with him, trying to cool his anger. When I finally convinced him I was a shaman, he settled down. I told him about how I wished to learn more about the spirits, and he agreed after a while to help me when there was something to BURN. \n The third spirit I met was a water spirit named Wilow. Wilow was a peaceful female spirit, similar to the spirit inside my staff Leaf. She appeared as a human made out of water when I used cactus paste to summon her in the waters next to Kal'urguan . We conversed for little time before we understood the peaceful intentions of each other, and she agreed to help me when I needed a spirit of water by my side. \n The fourth spirit I met is a wind spirit named Teraku. He is a nomadic spirit that I summoned on top of Shaman Zafus's tower high in the sky. I used dandelion paste to summon him, unlike the others. It blew away in the wind as I burned it, and Teraku appeared. He is constantly travelling, along with the winds of the world. He is more of a storm than a breeze spirit, more destructive than most of his brothers. He wants to make a difference in the world, though; so he agreed to join me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Kogash History", "Swgrclan", "(To be written)", ""),
        StaticBook("Kogash member list", "Swgrclan", "Leaders: Broxigar'Kogash, Ciar'Kogash, Thral'Mar Kogash.  Clan members: Cynaria'Kogash  Gohlrak'Kogash . Krugash'Kogash", ""),
        StaticBook("Kok'Bael's Diary", "Cowsgomooand", "Within the pages of this book you now hold in your hand, are my deepest, darkest secrets.  \n  \n Here is a list, of all the people who I have killed. \n  ~Pastor Judas", ""),
        StaticBook("Kolas the Austrilian Racoon", "eye5755", "helo? is any one there? yes my name is sora and i dont have much time to tell you about what has happened it is the year 1783 as i write this and the koloa's have taken over the world and rule side by side with the raccoons you are the chosen one... and you need to get the word out to the world to kill the kola's if you dont every race human,dwarf,elf, and orc alike will all...... be obliterated..... i must go they are comming... i will leave on the speech to text feature that we have in the feature MEN! hold up the door! Dont let them in! Sir! they have breached the back entrance... here they come men fire at will! you are the chosen ones...... asdfkjasdflkasjdglaksdf(deathly sounds)", ""),
        StaticBook("Kooka'Duras' Journal", "kookamooka", "Well De day I met da Dominius Crator He be sayin da Lur clan be lookin recruits Me like what me hear He say sa cities Sanhar and Sanjezal be bein' rebuilt Me be interested, ya. \n Me see da Shaman Gezmar also de day. He tell me I should seek training from a willing Shaman, dis sound good to me, I needa get back in touch wit de spirits. Met a nice elf called Rini today, dis be good day, ya. She be from da woods. undead attack 'er village she say. She be quite polite, but me expect dat from an elf, me guess. She not from Aegis she say, never been to da big Elf city Laurelin, or dat other one, me no even know da name, me never been. \n Da Dominus say me not to bow to oda orcs, he say we all equals. Me no bow no more, his words be wise. \n Me must find book with Krugmar Orc language. Me tribe speak differently, me no find book. \n Rini sent me a letter, we be meetin' at the Krugmar gates at Dawn Me met up with Rini, me hope we go on cool adventure, ya? \n toggle", ""),
        StaticBook("Kootry's Life Story", "HaVoC_aMz", "I am Kootry, One of the two leaders of the grand UAC. The UAC stands for the United Ageis Colation, I alongside Martin run the UAC. It is quiet difficult being a Owner of such a large group, But it is also very rewarding. As a child, I was never the richest Dwarf around, Nor was aye the poorest dwarf. I was always different in a way, A good way. But I had lots of fights with my parents. I never got along with me pap's nor me mom's. They would always come home drunk, with a bottle of ale in thir hand. I now realise why I can be such a heavy drinker at times. Around the are of 14, I Ran away from home. Text not found?", ""),
        StaticBook("KOTF Architypes.", "chas5511", "This system will be to enable our men for maximum use on what they truly wish to do. There will be many architypes which may end up being more. Knight, Contructer, Gaurd, and Recruiter. The Knight, will be an all around person who does anything that is required of him, for those who truly wish to be in the KOTF. This Architype will have ranks. Such as the ones we do now. A Constructer will soley be  to create things we ask of them. KOTF will be providing the main frame of materials.", ""),
        StaticBook("Kotor's Journal.", "SpazmaticSniper", "It is peculiar, I woke up this week and had skills that werent there before. I could weild a sword, and a Bow, yet never could before. It as if I have woken with a new spirit. I wish to find out what this means -Kotor. *Pages ripped out* I have gotten bored with this life In the wilds. And with my new found skills I would make a good soldier, Perhaps I will go find a military who needs a strong man to work for them. But these Nightmares... Memorys it seems, they *pages is torn* I cant sleep, I have theese odd dreams of people I dont know, in a Place I dont know. I must find help - Kotor I woke up in this temple... But I dont know who I am. This book belongs to a man named Kotor. Is that me? What is going on. I will write in this journal till I find out. The sign ahead says to Lauelin. I shall follow... But I feel light headed. - Kotor? Do you mind if I take a walk around? maybe if I see something Ill remember more... This place just. Just.. I feel like Ive been here.. something inside me says I have.", ""),
        StaticBook("Kraden's Jornal", "Kr4den", "Journal NO.", ""),
        StaticBook("Krag'Goromons journal", "tronan999", "dis be mah diary and me goins to write wat mees sees and ears day one: me bought meself an iron sword and met zerak(areontrade) he was a freshy so me elped we gots alongs justs feens and started to become friends one day a warboss told us some dwarfies bees attacking and we folloed im me was eager to klomp some stouts and bring glor toes krug and da uruks but dat battle was a bloodbath da umies betrayed us and many brave orc souls wer e lost we retreated back to da great nation of krug we be sad  about lost brudahs and da disgrace of krug wtih ours loss a few days later wees hear words dat we bees attacking da umies for being skahing traitors dat battle not be as fierce as da last one but lives were lost me tinks an undeads was aiding da umies me was knocked unconcious in dat battle and awoke in da cloud temple den a few more days later we attacks again and me and a few oter brudahs attempteds to rescue a uruk prisoner me tinks \n but we fells into a trap and were jailed but wees escaped and traveled back to krug and den me is here now in a uruk market place", ""),
        StaticBook("Kramoroe", "charliescott123", "In Kramoroe there is One Castle, Next to it three houses. One newspaper HQ The Inn for three brothers     Multiple entrances a lighthouse A dungen The towns structure is Sand based. Gabriels house The Nanders house Tailion's Home. House being sold for 1000 minas. Kramoroe Mine Lavants House Malcos Home Judas House A big Mine/Monsterspawner Kramoroe Libraru Reasourses room Town hall Altmans house Raffus's house ... many valubals. ((possut is aiming to make a daily paper)). hhhmmm ok yes.....", ""),
        StaticBook("Kramoroe", "Jallentime", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Kramoroe.", "DarkAngill", "As I sit here in Sanhar being poked and proded by each and every orc I begin to think. Kramore. A town that at first wasnt ment to be a town. The little town in the desert was at first a tiny building on the side of the road. A free inn that I ran by my self. Day in and day out I hunted for food and supplies to give out for free. I had alot of loveing people come in and stay. But there was one guy who came to me and stayed. His name was Malco. Malco helped out with the hunting and pretty much every thing else. Along the way we picked up another guy along with his brother. Their names were Yorick and Glorick. They seemed nice at first. But they latter turned on us. They knocked out Malco and I then proceded to steal our belongings. When we woke up the inn was a wreck and was mostly destroyed. We then decieded to move the inn closer to the human capital. Once we were set up we added a new member to our group. His name was Durin. He acted as a body gaurd but to me he was a trusted friend. When I was out hunting one day. Yorick and his brother attacked the inn yet again. I came back to a destroyed mess. We didnt know what to do. But when we heard word that yorick and his brother had been killed; we moved back to the old location of the first inn. After a few months of great business A guy named Levant came along. He wanted to set up a shop next to us. We thought why not and let him build it. A month passed before Levant threw out the idea of makeing the place into a town. After long thought we came to accept the idea and build a town. Thats how Kramoroe came to be. After so many years of great success as a town the librarian Delaselva started to have vissions of horible things. The Undead. He was scared and didnt know what to say. From his tower he saw them aproaching to attack. He ran out screaming to run and evacuate the town.   We couldnt do anything but sit and watch the town crumble to dust. That was the end of Kramoroe... :Sen   (theres a wet spot on the paper.)", ""),
        StaticBook("Krashnak Shaman Journal", "JJMCG", "Ma Spirit \n Ma spirit is a metal 'un \nDa spirits name is Dia'ron, it an' I 'ave been travelling togetha for about 3 years now. Dem years 'ave been \"brilliant\" \nDia'ron is a \"beautifull\" being, When in da \"Visual world\", he be made up of what looks like solid metal, he has no curves to da body, jus' straight top, an' legs. What is interetin' about 'im da mo st is dat he looks like he has a solid silver tongue, no \"imperfections\" anywhere. \n one of da most important ting about 'im tho is dat he is a metal spirit. If ya no idea how dis is important, den i will explain later, when i talk about da spirit ranks  \nMa spirit, though, has a \"tremendous\" abillity wit da otha spirits, He can seem to \"coerce\" dem He has so many different words, he uses dem whenever he can, \"apparently\" da silver tongue of a Metal spirit gives dem da abillity ta understand a word, know a word, and use dem words ta get anotha spirit onta dere sideof a \"arguement\". He believes in teachin', so 'e is teachin' me dem. \n  \n \nDa Spirit of da Air   \nI Started dis summoning, Like da way Lex taught meh, through placing a torch on a high area, with tha wind flowing around it. I thought tha perfect place would be da top of da palace. \nHolding my Staff in both hands I begin to chant towards Dia'ron. As I feel his presence I begin to call for his help in t ha way of summoning, He instantly helps me and turnd tha candle into a metal candle, It lets out a high sound, like a screaming baby pinkskin, but it is soft, and sounds good ta listen ta \nIn only a few momments tha wind starts ta grow stronga, than it calms down. I don't see a Spirit but I hear tha soft voice on tha wind. \n \"Hello Shaman, I am Wind Spirit Aire. What can I name you as?\" It asks. I reply", ""),
        StaticBook("Krashnak's metal spirit", "JJMCG", "Ug readers of this book This is an account of my spirit it wants to be called dia'ron it is teaching me the proper words for this book! anywya... it looks beautifull, it is a humanoid shape, but it is completely pointed and straight no curves anywhere and so cool to the touch it feels like the good side of the pillow whatever a pillow is... it is extremely defensive of me won't let any others spirits get to me unless i summon them, apparently i've tried everything to scratch it's... body but it's just impossible it's an amazing... diplomat with the other spirits, apparently as it is metal it is rare and the oth ers listen to it it's extremely dangerous when angry DON'T MAKE IT ANGRY! i ove it, Dia'ron i finished!", ""),
        StaticBook("Krashnak's Time In A Hole", "JJMCG", "It's nice down here Dia'ron says he can feel an iro vein near here I feel like me and Dia'ron can do anything, we are like one... orc thingy Dia'ron just told me the  collect term is \"shaman\", still don't get the point of \" and \" In fact i don't see the point of Grammar at all It's pretty funny, I Put random \"Capitol lettres\" in at points and Dia'ron gets mad The visions have come back... Always the same... ((the description of th vision has been torn from the book)) No! i never should of wrote this! No-one else shold fel my pain ((the last word has been scribbled out and rewritten at least ten tims Me and Dia'ron have been playing a game caled \"castles\" it's where you have to try and execute the e nemy's Warlord, and you can only move pieces in certain places, like the Warlord can only move one \" tile\" in any direction, a Runt can Move one block forward, (Tow on their first Move). the Siege engi ne can move Any number of spaces up or down, the Shaman can move \"diagonally\", and the Nob's can move in a wierd \"L\" shape, the final and most powerfull piece is the Elder, it can move in any u way, any number of tiles. I never one a signale game i see Lex", ""),
        StaticBook("Krashnak's travels", "JJMCG", "Finally startd tha book! well, first of all, ill go summon a Spirit, mabye an earthy one... I begin tha summoning with a torch. I say tha words ta bring out Dia'ron from ma Staff. After talking with Dia'ron he agrees to talk with me to an earth spirit I start tha chant for an eath spirit, burning cactus green iver the flame while Dia'ron slowly  Turning tha candle to metal   Tha earth started to shake \n Tha earth started ta... grow \n Tha earth became Alive \n Tha next is a recount of tha Talk between me and ta Earth spirit \"Greetings Shaman\" \n Greetings Earth Spirit  \n \"You can name me Dir'ok\" \n You can name me Krashnak, Greetings Dir'ok \n \"Greetings Krashnak, How can i serve?\" \n Just information, first of all, How do you talk to Dia'ron?  \n \"Your Spirit? , well, I'm talking to him right now, through your summoning torch  \n i dismiss tha spirit as Dia'ron believes that he wants ta keep some secrets from me  I started To walk down tha King's road today... His name was \"Vrogok\", He seems like a goodun . I will probaly be talking to 'im more often \n killed a Bandit. \n Was walking in Krugmar when ~I met Craotor, He was wantin' blood ,It was a good hunt, we walked down tha King's Road and found a 'umie, Craotor started talkin ' Da Spirits were with us, i could feel dem in da Ground, Da Tree's, Da air, They were Wit us \n ...especially Craotor \nDuring the talkin' a \"Squire\" appeared, Calling us \"bandits\", It ended up wit me, Craotor, a shaman, a orc, and a Dwarf fighting 2 weak 'umies It was fun, and Dia'ron liked it too \n I was travelling to see tha uman capitol today, It got interesting...  another orc, Bog, got into a mating ritual wit a girl, race forgotten, jus as it was about t o start, a Gaurd came along and stopped everything, Da spirits were appy eit the choice if ma tes though... \n Been trying to sell me wood, so far no success, can't find any shops buying, have way too much \n In Craotor's inn again as i write this book, good light, good ale, good fud Strange red orc won't leave meh alone \nWent to tha Prison of Oren, with Bog, Kitteh had gone crazy or something", ""),
        StaticBook("Kreegaia and Shu Athvec's Rules.", "shoeberrypie", "You may eat heartily, but you may not take or grief anything other than food. \n You may take shelter for as long as you like, and the mob traps damage the mobs before they reach you. If they manage to reach you, you can gather up their easy resources. Have fun!", ""),
        StaticBook("Krink's dream.", "GuhdarN", "\n \n I am dazed by this dream. I'm writing now just minutes after I awakened by a huge bang on the lowest floor, probably the door... \n After a while when I looked out to see where the moon was from my window I saw someone. Not far away from my neighbor's house and his face were hidden by his hood. He glared at me, the seconds felt like minutes... Eventually he turned and disappeared. \n \n Last night I had a dream. A nightmare... About my father. \n \n It was just like when it happened, when I killed him. I had no clue that it was a dream. But I saw the dream outside my mind, as if I was an observer who was not able to speak words. It was as if I were a spirit... I could see myself awakened by the screams of my defenseless brother in the dining room. I was able to follow myself; I saw how I was thinking how I would put a stop to this. \n I observed in my dream when I took a large piece of wood from the fireplace, how I thought that was the best idea to end this beatings by our father. \n \n I did not say a word, though it looked like the real me saw how I watched the event. It felt like the physical me was looking for eye contact with my \"spiritual me and when he did get eye contact with me, he nodded with it also looked like he grinned a bit. \n \n I was standing in the doorway when I watch this event that happened many decades ago. I had repressed it, also my age starts to play with my memory, I forget things easily now, but now after this dream I remember it as if it happened just some just a few days ago. I could see myself beating him in the back of his head... Repeatedly, he did not even see who was hitting him. I kept hitting my own father with the wood even when he was lying down lifeless. until my brother shouted that I would stop with verge of tears, I saw my brother in shock. \n \n As I remember my father was a very large orc, nearly four heads longer and wider than me by that time. And that he did not care about no one except himself.  Nonetheless after an entire childhood with beating... And worse. Maybe he was worth such a death? In my dream I saw myself say \"It has now been done, at last\" with a loud voice. He turned to my spiritual me and gave me a look, a look that was peaceful, eyes that smiled. I felt that I recognized those eyes, as if it was a different person, as if it was not me..? \n \n While I wrote the last sentence my candle was blown out by itself, I shivered,  it felt as if my spine was as cold as a breeze from the repossessed Snowy Fields.", ""),
        StaticBook("Krogath's Journal - Mastering Darkness", "_Player_2_", "\nEntry 1\n I have found a dark and deep room with no light i will meditate here until i can contact a Spirit of Darkness and then i will try to master, learn more about and also learn to control and gain power from Darkness. I will not stop meditation until i get in contact and master the element of Darkness \nEntry 2\n I hear whisper and faint calls but i am sure that none of these are the call of a spirit of Darkness, i have only started meditation but i can already tell that the spirits nearby are strong and if i am not careful may lose myself. \nEntry 3\n I have found the dark spirit but he seems to ignore me. He has told me \"you are not ready yet you must first become stronger.\" I will continue to meditate until he accepts me, i have not reached my goal yet, i cannot stop here, i will master the shadow element. \nEntry 4\n he is still neglecting me and ignoring my calls i have fallen into deeper meditation to awaken me from this dark slumber it will take strong hit to wake me up. I hope i am not awaken early from this meditation, i have not completed my goal i cant leave now i must continue \nEntry 5\n The spirit, he has slowly started to accept me so far he has said \"i am the Spirit of Darkness and if you really want to master my abilities you must first understand that i am the spirit of vengeance, murder, crime and obviously darkness. Many have failed on this path you are taking, many have died, many have given up half way and many tried to use me for evil things but you shaman, should know well that we spirits serve justice and will not harm the balance of nature, it is our duty to watch over the world, are you up for the challenge shaman?\" after i told him \" Yes i will master darkness, no matter what!\" he told me \" no matter what ey? very wll i shall be in contact soon, for now you need to gather more power\" \nEntry 6\n I did not hear anything from the Spirit of Darkness for about 6 months but i continued to strive forward and to gain more power. I heard a voice echo saying \" you are ready now, we shall begin\" \"listen carefully as i give you knowledge about Darkness, i am one of the harder spirits to master, Chaos and Death are 2 elements who share a familiar power with me.\" as he was talking i slowly felt my body being consumed so i tried to hold myself and then suddenly he laughed and said \"you are stronger than i thought, if you truly want to master me . you must first know what it means to live in Darkness, you must learn how it feels to always be in the darkness, i can teach all this but you must sacrifice something for me. Sacrifice both your eyes and become blind and see how it feels to be surrounded by constant darkness and to be in a empty space of nothing, you must understand that seeing is not always believing! that what you see is only a false illusion of the true image! are you ready for a world of darkness , shaman Krogath?\" i felt a chill go down my spine as i told him \"a sacrifice of eyesight is a small step to take for such power\" he then replied \"very well hold your arm and you staff out this may hurt for a second, this much power may be harmful so be careful, your meditation is complete you may wake up\" \nEntry 7\n I awoke from my meditation i could see nothing but i felt this strong power flowing through my veins, i must let the warlord and high shamans know", ""),
        StaticBook("Krogath's Meditation", "_Player_2_", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Krogaths gift", "_Player_2_", "ya 2 be a couple, ya ned a bigga bed", ""),
        StaticBook("Kronak", "_Player_2_", "I be a dark skined, evil looking, tall and brutal orc. Goblins fit in the palm of my hand. Many orcs have seen me as a dark and evil orc because of the large amount of blood ive spilled, the humans ive slain, the blood on my axe. \n my whole life i have been seeking revenge on the glob who took the life of my father . I just want to show all humans that living on your own with no family is a hard thing . i took the lives of many humans, short, tall, strong, weak, rich and poor, none stood a chance. I would enter their house and live nothing but a corpse and ashes from the houses remains most orcs told me ive been heading down the wrong road, becoming evil but all im doing is making my point to all the ugly humans who think they rule all the land . I am teaching them all a lesson. Very few attempted to assassinate me, even fewer tried to kill me, they knew they stood no chance, one slice and the slowly bleed to their death, and rot away on the edge of my axe they didnt know the power i had contained with in the axe, i dont know what my father had done to this axe but he left a note saying \"The axe be my gift before i die, it will protect you and make you stronger\" and he was right when he said this because no one stood a chance when i had my axe out \n the Warlord kicked my out of the nation saying \" Ya be givin ta orcs a bad name\" i left and after i had walked about a mile, all i remember is having 12 arrows shot into the back of my head at the exact same time, cutting into my armor and going straight through the back of my head", ""),
        StaticBook("Kronix's Journal", "eggerstimothyr", "MIDNIGHT DAY 1, I'm in treetop inn, taking a rest and drinking ale. I've been traveling for 2 days now, looking for my father and mom. I'm also in search for my house, which I forgot I had. Probably because of that one hangover..    \n Day 2, I'm traveling, I just ate, but I haven't had meh ale yet! I haven't had ale in 5 hours! That's way to much for a fat dwarf like me! \n Day 3, I've finally made it to my base, it's been 3 days until I've had my ale.. I think I'm going out soon. I wish to proceed to my old pals inn, near Aerial City. 'Ello! \n Day 4, I just had myself 4 drinks of ale! Boy, was that good.", ""),
        StaticBook("Krugmar Defense Plan", "Acornlad", "A Plan Written By: Nroca \nThis is a plan of action for defending Krugmar in the situation of an Undead Attack \nIf there is an undead attack upon Krugmar the main objective will be to defend the walls of Sanjezal, for this city is the most important and most valuable assest to the Orcs. \nThe Undead contain the ablilities to cast lightning, fireballs, summon dark creatures and teleport. This makes the undead very hard to get to attack. The undead in an attack will take the highest vantage point. In order to defend the city from being destroyed as soon as the attack starts we must move the soldiers to the walls and on top of the castle. This will leave our troops vulnerable to attacks, but in doing this, we will fair much better than being on the ground . Given that our soldiers are vulnerable, our troops must always be movin in order to avoid lightning attacks. If an undead were to summon dark creatures our soldiers must only attack if completely necessary, for it is much better to attack that which spawns the creatures than the creatures themselves. \nWhen soldiers are moving onto the walls, they must move quickly and move as fast as possible to the nearest undead. An undead is weakest up close for their attacks are much harder to aim and they cannot weild a sword for they are only rotting corpses . \n The undead if closed down upon will teleport, in order to make attacks from a further distance our soldiers must be armed with bows. The bows will cause minor damage, but they will push the undead further into the city, which is what is wanted. If the undead are pushed into the center of the city, they will be trapped within our walls and trapped between the soldiers around the castle and the soldiers along the wall. The soldiers on the castle must move as fast as possible to the top in order to kill any undead that moves themselves there. \nOnce the undead are within the walls, our soldiers can begin to close down upon them, the soldiers can not do this too quickly, for the undead will teleport away just as fast . With moving inwards towards the city, our soldiers will be able to attack from a distance and stop any undead that tries to teleport past them. \nWith the undead trapped our soldiers can finish them off much easier than in an open area. After our soldiers have moved in, we will break into groups of three and attack undead that still exists within our walls. \nIf this plan is to fail then, with great speed we must move our important weapons and items into the verge. It is recommended that if you have items within your homes that are not important for war and life, move them to the Orc Camp in the verge. \nMay Krug Give Us Strength \n-Nroca", ""),
        StaticBook("Krugmar Law", "drangob", "Unlawful murder is a punishable offence. Unlawful destruction of property is a punishable offence. Combat/fighting within city limits (excluding pre-approved gladiatorial arenas) is a punishable offense. Excessive harassment is a fine able offense (in certain conditions the harasses party may demand satisfaction in single combat). Repeated harrasment is a punishable offence.", ""),
        StaticBook("Krugmar scene (Tolta, 3rd of Suns Smile, 1341)", "Blackdragonhole", "Walking into Krugmar just to go to a small orc shop that sells best made arrows. While walking a Dwarf pushed me out of they way he was wearing the best armor ye can find. I ignored it and continued to the shop. Later Three more came by sprinting with armor. Somthing was up I followed them. They where located at the Castle area for orcs only. Soon enough watching the scene a Dwarf saw me. He started walking to me with a sword in his hand and armor from head to toe. I ran away for at that scene. At max of twenty Dwarfs were there in armor. I think I also heard the word Legion I believe that is part of the Drawfs Military. That tis all I know...", ""),
        StaticBook("Krugmar: Day one", "themuffinmasta", "Today is me first day in Krugmar. I have explored town and it is to expensive for me to livem in. I leave this sity and find small villige. I still have no money for house. I dig a big ho le to sleep in for da night. tomorrrow i hunt and build bigger home", ""),
        StaticBook("Krugmar: Day Two", "themuffinmasta", "I wake up and start hunt. I find some piggys and find strange green creature . It is no Orc, bit hace for legs and no arms, and it sound like snake. I thought it would fight me so i kill it. I also find cows and take skin for armor. I have half house now made of sandstone and will build much more tomorrow", ""),
        StaticBook("Kvothe's Mind", "AlphaCentaurus", "They're coming for me from everywhere and everyone knows me but the blood falls down   my cheeks and I don't know where to go why these conflicts circle around my head while they contemplate everything I've known showing my past like the leaves in a forest WHY WHY ARE THEY HERE? I know they want to kill me", ""),
        StaticBook("Lady Luna", "SnazzyEnglishman", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Laela's Journal", "fbPatty", "Sabet, 21st of Suns Smile, 1331\n I have arrived in Alras, not too many days after I left home.  I will try sending a letter to Sir Arthur, informing him of my whereabouts. \n My first day in Alras has been an interesting one.  I met a librarian by the name of C. Ithelias.  This honorable and very kind man has given me a job and a place to stay.  And what better a place to work than a library itself!  My new life is going wel.. \n And now I shall visit the old library to copy some books.  After that, perhaps venture aro und in Alras. \n Ahad, 22nd of Suns Smile, 1331 \n  Today, I experienced a very strange event.  An orc and alchemist were talking.  The orc, discussing alchemy, says there is more than meets the eye. He turned around, and on his back was the symbol of Iblees.  He promptly left, and the alchemist went to inform the guards. \n  Ahad, 29th of the Deep Cold, 1331 \n  While taking a walk around Alras, I ran into the High King Syrio.  A kind and respectable King he was,  Being a king, he was very busy.  And after the King left, I was greeted by a dwarf by the name of Omithiel.  He seemed to already heard of me, working at the library and such.  Such a comical thought.  We talked for a little about the library and such.  Before I left, the dwarf insisted that I call him Omi.  And I suppose that I what I shall call him from now on. \n Kamees, 4th of The Amber Cold, 1332 \n  Today I was peacefully reading in my room when I saw a man out the window.  There was a couple of guards there too.  The strange looking fellow starting shouting at me, and then fell off the wall!  My eyes widen, and I turn away from the window and continue reading.  Then just a few moments later the man's right outside my bedroom door,  and he's handing me a bag of sugar!  Soon after guards come trudging into the house taking the man away.  They kepy saying things like \"Sorry, madame\" and \"He's not right in the head...\"  Sir Wyvernos, who I had met on my first or second day in Alras, was there and explained that the man was not right in the head.  Quite an interesting day, I dare say. \n Itnan, 9th of The Amber Cold, 1332 \n", ""),
