        StaticBook("Lance Ulhric's Notebook", "InvincibleHawk", "(8/17/2011) Merchant Garrett states, \"The price of Minerals have decreased dramatically.\" He also added, \"Iron used to be 45 minas a bar, but now it is only 25 a bar in my store!\" (State of the Econ.) Overheard Advisor Chase taxing Dawn Perea and Hempshine for their Inn. It appears that they cannot afford to pay the tax, and he will be taking their Inn. I will question him when the arguement is done.", ""),
        StaticBook("Lance's Notebook", "InvincibleHawk", "(8/17/2011) Merchat Garrett has the cheapest iron prices! Garrett also says that Mineral Prices have lowered dramatically. THIS BOOK CONTAINS NO SECRETS! (I meant to throw it away!) So don't keep it! SECRET INFO: If you fall into the toilet in the VonSchlichten Inn you will be washed away to safety!", ""),
        StaticBook("lances last will", "danielbreen", "i lance magus leave all of my worldy posetions to my son daniel magus who i have only meet once which was when he was born the reason for this is because he was seperatord from me when the undead attack at his birth i belive his mother was killed i searched for him for one thousand ye ears if i ever die i want this to be carried out as my last will i leave all my minas my estates and my ansector power to my son though he is only half elf and half human i still love him as dearly just as i loved his mother i hope that he will live up to what i have left him and hopefully take my place in this word if i happen to leave it signed lance magus wittnessed by trouvo souvok baron of lunavara .............................................................................................';-;'", ""),
        StaticBook("Landscaping", "Ansh98", "Interested in landscaping are you? Great! Then shears must be your best friend! Landscapers work ideally with plants and walkways. They work hand and hand with Interior designers as they both depend on their own designs. \n This division is reccommended for creative minds who are very patient and tolerant. Dean challenges are alike interior designers and would mostly consist of hedges and statues to perfect the beauty of a building. \n Think you got what it takes to clean up the edges of a building? Then join the Landscaping division and build on!", ""),
        StaticBook("Large Alkazar House for sale!!!", "chase132", "Aye and crap A large house in alkazar is now for sale! The massive building is on sale for only 35k, and is situo", ""),
        StaticBook("Large House in Alkazar for Sale!!!", "chase132", "A new, large house in Alkazar is now for sale! This massive house is the largest house in all Alkazar, 3 stories high and is all for 35k! Those who want to improve their status in Alkazar would do well to buy this amazing house. Come by and take a look! Located near the Church in the cobblestone district, on the main road leading to the residential dis", ""),
        StaticBook("Last Note", "Syblix", "It's gone.. All gone! Sutch has fallen, as we all did.. Here, in my room I'm hiding this in my secret chest, along with the blueprints of castle.. May god be with you.. *there is blood on the pages.*", ""),
        StaticBook("Last Stand", "123devmo321", "They are everywhere, all around me. They trapped me in this... cage. They watch, and they watch. Sometimes they come in, but I hit them and they leave. They speak this odd language. I do not understand. They probably want to kill me. I do not know. Maybe even eat me.... Some of them are leaving, one seems to lead the others. He is the green one. There is also a blind one. And a woman. A beautiful, young woman. Why she works with them I do not know. But she seems nicer than the rest... Maybe she will let me free! I hope so, I cannot stand it in this cage. Maybe, if I try to kill them all.... I think I am becoming one... Is that what they are doing? transforming me? I begin to understand them, they speak of this \"John\"  fellow. OH GOD IT\"S HIDEOUS They brought down this... creature! It's white, it goes, bawk bawk bawk..... I'm so scared!", ""),
        StaticBook("Last Words", "Ratemenatorz59", "I always had the life of a normal respecting elf. With friends and loved ones. Now I walk in the dark with the place I belong. Farewell. - Niko", ""),
        StaticBook("LaTerre's Journal", "ikeyman232", "Day 1: Today I got a job at a man named Ebs's farm! I get payed 600Minas a week, with one day off. I farm his wheat everyday. And trust me, there is so much wheat, you could probably bake about 300 loaves of wheat! I really like it too! Farmng is my specialization... \n ,LaTerre \n Day 2: My friend Torak showed me a project he's working on. It's the Laurelin games. It's really nice. \nDay 3: Today I met a lovely Lady named Raddalyn. Shes quite pretty, but a little nervous ar ound some people. I like 'er. \nDay 13: Today I bought my first house! Yay!", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's First Book!", "GoldenGFX", "The Quick Brown Fox Jump Over The Lazy Dog\n The Quick Brown Fox Jumps Over The Lazy Dog The Quick Brown Fox Jumps Over The Lazy Doh \n The Quick Brown Fox Jumps OVer The Lazy Dog", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal", "GoldenGFX", "Today, I became an ascended. \n The life is great, except we are not supposed to leave Haven, it depresses me. \n I made my house finnaly! I think it looks great. \n Today I thought about why we have those big boats, with no crew.. and I also have been trying to find secrets in the city! I have only found one so far.. \n Becoming unamused in Haven.. not much to do anymore. \n I went against the Sage's word today, and left Haven. \n Many weeks have passed and I never returned to Haven.. and I don't plan on going back now.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #2", "GoldenGFX", "I have been enjoying life outside of Haven, and decided to write my journals with more prestige. The last one was fairly crumy, and childish almost. \n Today, I was in the Isles when a man in chainmail armour approached me. He asked me to follow him, which I did. We went into a treehouse near the isles.. where, he asked me a few questions. \n My Life Changed forever after.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #3", "GoldenGFX", "I have been working on completing my trials. \n The first one went well.. I just had to simply kill someone. I killed my old best friend, John. \n The second trial went better than planned.     \n  I had to tempt someone to evil.. and I chose my brother's son. It felt great.. and I began to be what Kaizo wanted me to be, to him. \n The third trial went much better than planned. I had been plotting to sacrifice Atriana of the Oren Guard. Instead.. I sacrificed King Edmund and Ivrae. \n The fourth trial was hard, I almost failed it. It was a large series of tests, but I will not get into it.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #4", "GoldenGFX", "Today.. is the day of the ceremony. I am not sure if I am ready yet. I am doing this.. so I can kill that Sage though. The Sage that killed Bell. \n \n I am leaving to go to the ceremony now.. *the paper has a wet spot, the size of a tear \n \n I am no longer myself. I am a new being. This power running through me is immense. I cannot wait to make that Sage suffer. The joy it will bring me is endless. I am never giving up this power, it is beyond belief. The only tie I had to this world was Bell, and now she is gone. So what I do doesn't matter anymore.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #5", "GoldenGFX", "We killed many today. Many of those smelly, greenskins. I have no memory of it, but I was told of it by on of the others. \n I have been sitting in the Nether, listening to the Ghasts scream. This is my life, and I am not sure if it is what I thought it would be. I have never come close to the oppertunity of killing that Sage, and my life seems pointless. \n \n I am going to stop writing for a while.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #6", "GoldenGFX", "Aegis hates me.  I cannot bear to live in this world any longer.. there is nothing for me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #7", "GoldenGFX", "I found something to keep me going, for now. Guraim told me that Lotheriel is Bell's daughter.. this could help change me. \n I confronted her, and she would not believe me. We talked about much.. and my thoughts of killing that Sage have changed. I wish this to end my suffering.. but how?", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's Journal #8", "GoldenGFX", "This may be my final Journal. I am going to ask Lotheriel if she knows what I can do. \n \n I must confront the Sage, Arcadius. He may be able to end me.. and take me out of this world. \n \n ... I am heading off to the FOA base.. with no return. \n \n Goodbye Aegis.. and in my last wish, give my belongings to.. *a paint spill blocks out the bottom right side of the book, possibly with more text underneath it.", ""),
        StaticBook("Latsi's lovely ass.", "123devmo321", "I cannot stop looking at it. It is like a magnet for my penis I don't know what to do! Gayness is frowned upon in Aegis. Since when do I like Latsi, What the hell! I cannot contain my feelings anymore.", ""),
