        StaticBook("Laws and Rules of Talamh", "lordnaylor", "These laws are aimed to keep the towns people safe, and to keep villans out \n Each law has a diffrent punisment  \n Follow the laws and we will get on fine  \n Laws:  Law: Do not Grief at All \n Punisment: Server ban \n Law No Theft \n Punishment: 100minas fine  -> ban \n Law: No murdering \n Punisment: Fine fo 400 minas and Exile from the town \n Law: No Farms in houses \n Punisment: 100minas per block And possible exile \n Law: Do not damage natural looks Punishment: Exile and 250 minas fine \n \n \n \n \n RULES\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n  Rules are things you SHOULD do but don't have to Rule 1: Work together -> only through team work will we expand \n Rule 2: Dont argue -> Keep the peace in the town, come to an arangement!   \n Rule 3: Do NOT enter peoples homes, farms or workspaces without permission Punishment 500 minas Fine and a 2 Real life day Exile !!!!!!", ""),
        StaticBook("Laws Of Libertas", "tomsim9611", "Law 1: No Stealing! Thiefs will be caught and dealt with without mercy. Law 2: No Murder or violence within the town walls. Self defence will be allowed however. Law 3: Respect all signs, if it says dont go somewhere don't go there. Also do not enter others' properties without their prior permission. Law 4: Respect the Founding Fathers of Libertas, they built the town and run it, so please respect them. Law 5: If a guard or Founding father arrests you you must obey or be killed on the spot. Law 5: Replant what you harvest, the farms we've made are public so please show respect for them and others that use them. yep there we go", ""),
