        StaticBook("Leaf", "Lexperiments", "Today I met the spirit imbued in my staff, a spirit of life, Leaf. I am writing what I learn from her here. \n Leaf is a peaceful spirit. She wants to heal and help people. Leaf wishes for no dstruction. She was horrified at the way I lost her, but forgive me because she knew I did not know what was going on. She believes shamans to be the peacekeepers of the world. Part of the reason she forgave me is because there are few shamans left, and she believes that there must be more to keep peace between the mortals and spirits. She only wishes for peace and little combat. I respect that in her. She is a great spirit, and I think we shall work well together.", ""),
