        StaticBook("leonardo's travels", "elfdaninja", "The second that god created me and put me into ageis, i knew that there was lot to explore ,so i ye ughr, spellin ant that good. ,so anyway the first thing i wanted to see was the mystical kingdom of oren. So i did then i got lost and kept travelling south, to Laurilin and then Kalrgan ,so that is in brief me travells . yesterday, i was wondering around whisper isles when the high priest came  to me for direct ions, so i guided hime out of the village. he needed to come back to oren, so I accompanied him. on the way, the undead started to emerge, so we raced back. So now im in oren admiring the views...", ""),
