        StaticBook("List o' undead.", "deavs", "Okee. I was gonna write dah hierarchey o' dah undead, but den I realized dat would be useless . Fo' ash, dah undead 'ave been goin through some changes. Un' change dat robe trim mean nuttin. Fo' two, Anytin I find out might be changed other den very basic tings. So I start wit dah basic Hierarchy den I will start dah list of Undead. Dah undead basically is ruled by a High-Prophet, and an Overlord. Everyash is below dem. Now ta start dah list. ASH: DAH HIGH PROPHET. I nub know 'is name. But I can tell lat what 'e look like. 'e likes to wear Black robes with Green an' Yello' trim. TWO: DAH OVERLORD. Dis un likes to wear Blue trim. THREE: PERDELEO: 'e is an undead recruiter. Nub know else. FOUR: WRATH: Dis is dah undead dat is dah most 'eard about. 'e is a crimelord an' 'ires most of dose who work fo' undead. Nub know much oda undead. [Will add more latta.]", ""),
        StaticBook("List of Authorised and Unauthorised People", "William_Talbot", "\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAuthorised People\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n: -Claire_Kitty (Desires)  -Lady Dawn (diggintildawn) -Robin_Drake (deanofantastico) -Connor (connorr1) -Hempshine (Hempshine) -Delfyr (Timayame) -Edward (William_Talbot) -Pampo Perea (mrperea) -Brett Perea (Brettdude20) -Enor (Wildeboy98) -Luna (Serahlove) -(All admins and Moderators wearing a proper skin) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  ;;;;;Unauthorised People;;;;; -Undead Cataris (Archmage_Cataris) -Undead in General -Orcs in General (Exp. Vrol, Urara, Mogroka, Vardak) -Hooded People ;;;;;Especial Cases;;;;; \n\n: -Enthreri (Enthreri) \"Need to be Watched while in the Town\" -Brutus (A_Pro_Dude) \"Need to be Watched while in the Town\"", ""),
        StaticBook("List of books needed!", "Pepernoot", "This is a list of books we still need for the Tris'Fal library: \n Volume 5 of \"Journal of a ...\" \n More copies of the Oren Regular (We only have #3 now) \n  We need a lot more that just these, but these are missing volumes in our collection. If you have any of these books, please contact Cerlos ((pepernoot)).", ""),
