        StaticBook("List of Missing Journals", "Pepernoot", "Travel Journal \nJournal of a former Something volume 4 \nRanger Crowley \nDragnok's Journal \nFaroth's Story \nGorelath's Journal \nThe Lost Town \nLothiriel's Exploration Notes \nKramoroe \nThe Visit from Master Iblees, Sparrow's Story \nTelandriel's Diary \nTelanir's Inventions \nThe Weak \nDragga \nLetter to Nel'Thok \nNecropolis \nNotona \nRaturm \nSayings of Archdruid Cicero \nScribe Pliny the Elder's Final Words \nThe Sayings of Druids \nThe War Hammer \nVrild \nDolir, The Ascended", ""),
        StaticBook("List of People", "halt99", "Ever - Protect. Winston - Protect. Lucas Black - Subdue. \"Earth\" - Eliminate. Will Forestin - Exterminate. Guards - Exterminate. Max - Eliminate. Auzem - Subdue. Eoin - Subdue. Philip - Exterminate at all costs. Philip - Lower leg. Man living next to Winston - Nose.", ""),
        StaticBook("List of recruits come by...", "Lastchance2099", "How many Dawn bakeries are there now? Cralt Tumingleaf ((CONORDUDE8)) An eccentric elf has come by, wishing to talk to seers.", ""),
