        StaticBook("List of Undead.", "deavs", "The hierarchy at moment is changin'. But basics still are same. Undead are ruled by High-Prophet and Overlord. One thing that I also must say is dat robe trim means nothing anymore. ONE HIGH-PROPHET: 'as yello' an' green robe trim. Rules with overlord. TWO OVERLORD: Blue robe trim, rules with High -prophet THREE: PERDELEO: Undead recruiter, recruited former undead Lirinya. FOUR: WRATH: Undead crime lord, hires most who work with undead.", ""),
