        StaticBook("Lithren's Request", "Minst46", "If any of you fool guards read this i will expect you to take it to the Captain. Captain, if you ever need an Elf at your side in battle, or to scout and kill high-value targets, find me and ill bring such a force down upon any foe, the very trees will shake. I will be an Honor to fight alongside you, or at your command, Sir. I shall not falter, nor shall i fail, neither shall i die, before my mission has ended.", ""),
        StaticBook("Living Anatomy", "Osafiny", "((This book is filled with lengthy paragraphs and hundreds of sketches of ever race in Ageis. As you continue to flip through the book, you notice that some sketches are grotesquely mutilated, andd the associated paragraphs detail how each injury was caused with frightening detail. \nThe further you read through the book the more violent the sketches become, and the related paragraphs and charts become colder and more sinister.  You begin to notice entire pages devoted to speculation about how certain body parts can be disected, injured, or crippled.", ""),
