        StaticBook("Locked", "emberhard", "I locked the chest, hopfully it worked and I didn't accidentaly lock you out.", ""),
        StaticBook("Lodrik_BloodBound's Journal", "ggteixeira", "Well its been a rough day today. I just recently got to be a general in the city of Aeriel. Then something horrible happened. The old king of the city  of Aeriel came back and kicked me and the new king out. We took a elf child and followed a long road to the wilderness. We were forced to dig a hole and live in it. I have built a pen for the child so he can be set down without being carried. Arion the new king who got kicked out by the old king has just set off to find milk for the child . I hope for alot better tomorrow End of day 1.", ""),
        StaticBook("Lodrik_BloodBounds Journal", "ggteixeira", "So its been so long I have arrived in the city Aeriel. I became the new General of its army but then terror struck the old king arrived and I was forced to move out of Aeriel with a few others. I am writing this journal to write my adventure in Aegis while I still live. This is the end of my first part but I swear I will write in this journal until I die. help I screamed Help out loud when I was attacked. help I said again Whie getting chased. Then the old lord of Aeriel saved me. stop I said it while I was about to get killed. Then It all went blank help", ""),
        StaticBook("Log", "Bastlzzz", "Keks", ""),
        StaticBook("log", "samsan99", "talen baort an ale and two rost chickens 20 minas aye, is some one burnin' adf", ""),
        StaticBook("Log ((Oct.10, 2011))", "blackhawk77g", "Met with Hogarth and Torak in the meeting chamber. Discussed the newly crowned king of Oren, Enor Sheffield . Hogarth was a strong supporter of Dawn, the previous Queen. Torak has no opinion on the matter. Torak has no knowledge of any current hate from the Wardens, due to our taking of \"their\" land. We ended the meeting with a serious game of tag. As I was walking through the city, I noticed the Black Axe clan is growing in size quite a bit. I also notified Head Guard Flyyn of the weak state of one of our sections of the wall. \n \n Note: A road should be built from the outdoor housing district to Grabthars Inn. The unused mining colony land that I pointed out as a possible location fer something.. That section of the wall should be made more secure \n \n I suppose that concludes my daily journal. Not much activity in the past few days that I've seen. ((Today)) General Info: The Kingdom of Oren is quite possibly the most active So ye dont know how to write?", ""),
        StaticBook("Log ((Oct.12, 2011))", "blackhawk77g", "On my way to Oren today, I found Wrath's Clutch to be void of life. The fort was completely torn down ((except for the front wall)) . When I reached Oren, I head a man mention something of a underground city within the sewers. I doubted him, untill I traveled into the sewers and found the city fer myself! ((Oh and there is a gate which leads to a bunch of diamond ore.. The GM's are mean :S))  While in Oren I also found my old friend's Jayius and Arcane. Jayius told me his Kal'Urguan shop makes little money compared to his shop in Oren. A general observation of mine while looking at notice boards throughout Oren and beyond is that many people are in need of jobs. Possibly we could create a sollution to the mass amount of people who need jobs, while fixing the activity problem with the inner city. Possibly a government funded program that gives jobs to those in need. It may be a good idea to discuss this at a later time with the king, but this is just an idea.", ""),
        StaticBook("Log 001", "Chafferccino", "", ""),
        StaticBook("log book", "Lord_Zack", "a wood elf name lirinya. found a guy named mylas ya", ""),
        StaticBook("Log Book", "Spotcho", "Tried looking for a new home after undead attack on Al'khazar. No luck yet Decided to create a walled farm and a mine, its is going slow and minimal iron at most. Most of the land as already be mined through. It doesnt help either that I can only mine at a certain degree, I am not the best miner in the world Thought I have made quite a sum in Minas through killing monsters Zombie pigmen are very dangerous though, I need to watch out for them Very little confrontation with others, except when I go to Al'khazar. There was a strange man though, he jumped of a nearby bridge and tried to strike me. Suddenly he vanished and I was alone. The most evilest monster is the Enderman. He is able to deflect my blows. I can only kill him with my bow and arrow. Of course arrows are hard to come by. It is night time, I will write in here again later", ""),
        StaticBook("Log Book of CentralGuard", "CentralGuard", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Log Book of CentralGuard's EDT", "CentralGuard", "mon: 12:33 - 2:33", ""),
        StaticBook("Log of a Hooded Man: Alexander", "Castellano", "My name is Alexander of Aegis, and this is my journal of day to day traveling \n \n \n \nDay one: I entered a place called \"Aegis\" and found I was at the Cloud Temple. as I looked around, I notcied people walking threw the forest.   As the night comes, I wonder what I will do for the night, I'm in a place called Laurlin, Or something another... But it is nice here. I might go out and hunt tonight. \nWhilist hunting tonight, I stumbled apon a place called The Wolves Lair. It said no tresspassing, so I didn't go in... But I got alot of supplises tonight.  As the night continues, My sword skills strengthen and I become more swift. I keep finding some pretty good supplise out of these... monsters. Again, as the night is over, I realised that hunting these green monsters called Creepers, and they are looting very important items, so, if you see one, Slay it! Anyways, I'm going to try and mine some minerals, I'll write back later. \n \n \n \nDay 2:  The sun just rose, and I still haven't found the place where I want to build my house.  Once I find it, I'll write again, until then... I've decided that I was going to start a little log cabin right outside of the human city, Oren.  I'll check back in later.. Until then. \nWell, night has fallen, and they have declined me from me building in their city, I must hunt now, but I will check back in soon... \nWell I'm back, and I just realised that it began to rain, so I stayed at an Inn and bought the biggest room for 1 night for 50 minas... What a ripoff... anyways, I'm gonna' get some sleep, check in when I wake up. \n \n Day 3: I've thought about joining the \"Guard of Oren\" it's a guild that protects Aegis.  I don't know.  I still don't know what I want to do.... I'll check in later. \n \n \n Day 4:  It seems that we are over here with Janik figuring stuff out with the dwarves. Janik is the leader of Deciples of Valor.  The guild I am in. I still don't know how I'm going to to presue my \"Pirate\" journey, but this is a good start.  I got a house too, anyways, check in later. \n \n \nDay 4: Our town has joined forces (And combining our town) with Kal'Alsre. The dwarves taught me a new skill called Skull Spitter and Tree Feller, they are Nice little guys, har har!  Well, I'm off to go mining, check in later! \n \n \nDay 5: I was encountered by the un-dead.  They made me kill someone, it was horrible.  Then the guy betrayed me, and try to slay me, but he didn't know I was still alive... Anyways, I found someone's place, and hit the jackpot... 4 iron swords.. anyways check back in tonight, until then! \n \n \nDay 5: I don't know what it is, but something has become to control me, and I really wish it would stop, this isn't the way my parents wanted me to live... I feel like doing evil things.. I don't know if I'll be checking in tonight or..... I must go! \n \n \nDay 6: Alright, this is bad... I made someone kill their friend, and I don't remember it.. I think something is wrong with me... The bright side is I got some new armor. Check in tonight... Bye! \n \n \nDay 7: The town people decided to let me build my own place, hope it's not to b ig or anything, even if it is, I can just pay it off. Goodbye for now! \n \n \nDay 9: I haven't wrote in a while, but I have left the deciples, they were no good. I must hurry and get out of this town, until then... \n \n \nDay 12: Woah, long time since I wrote.. I am begining to feel more and more evil everyday, It seems to be that the hatred that flows in my blood has gotten stronger. I have been training at a place outside of Oren... I know have a house here.. I hate living here, but it's actually not half bad, they will get what's coming though.. Until then, I must continue my wrath, goodbye for now... \n \n \nDay 14: I war has been declared in Alsiontown and I'm thinking about going to check it out. I feel the need in my veins that I need to go help...The Undead.. I must go now, goodbye! \n \n \nDay 15: I met a mysterious man in the sewers today, and he told me to kill someone, and after I was done to go to the \"X\" on the map, I think this is the begining of a new start for me. Ha Ha! I will prove myself, and I will not be made a fool of .  I'll be checking in after the \"Kill\" Until then. \n \n \nDay 16: The Un-Dead is letting me into their wrath, and I have completed the first 2 tasks. I'll be back later... \n \n \nDay 18: I have completed my last challenge, we sacrifised an orc, for Iblees Dinnger Well, I don't know what else to talk about, I'll check back when I get my answer. \n \n \nDay 22: I am a deccaying corpse and my soul has left my body, I'm an Undead... the other day, me and Fyrste did an attack on Al'Khazar and killed some guards, luckly I got away, but I did get a chance to use all my spells... I must get back to hell and complete my room.  Until then, may the Fallen One be with you... \n \n \nDay 33: I was imprisoned and am not allowed back at Al'Khazar.. My hatred in my veins is growing stronger... I hate Oren much more... The attack shall happen soon, and soon Oren will fall to the feet of the Undead, and we will prevale..  The attack as been planned. The next days to come, I will be doing more and more evil... More and more murdering... and training for the day I come back for Oren, and then... I reign apon them... Until then... \n \n \nDay 42: We had a war in Kal'Bryst... I sadly awoke in my crypt to see that I did not make i t . It sickens me to know that I have failed my Lord and Iblees..  My spirit is down, but I am not.  I am heading to Al'Khazar to see what it is like there. \n \n \nDay 51: I have been writing less and less, just because I'm starting a book on Necromancy. Even though I have been expelled from Al'Khazar, doesn't mean I can't own a house in the sewers. Ha Ha!  I have a two story home in the sewers.  But I must work on it! Until then . \n \n \nDay 53: I have two shops set up, one in the sewage lines, and one in the main city.  The one in Al'Khazar city is my main one.  It is a \"Fish Market\" but I black market trade a lot of my items.  Which is based on deception, which brings me closer to Iblees. My wrath is beginning to grow stronger and stronger everyday, nothing can stop me. \n \n \nDay 60: Woah, it has been a very long time since I have wrote, but good news. I have been promoted to Inquisitor of the Undead, and I already have my eye on a man named Bernard, he will be able to join very soon.  I am honored to be the Inquisitor, but now that I am, I don't have alot of time for writing, so in that case, I must go, I promise I will check back soon...  Oh, and I'm sure you have heard about the attacks on the cities. Ha!", ""),
        StaticBook("Log of a NoN Initiate Augor", "augor1", "Today I head north with the commander of our order. He is going to show me our new guild hall", ""),
        StaticBook("Log Of Augor NoN Initiate", "augor1", "Sabet,R7th of The Amber Cold, 1328- I plan on heading down into the mines to take care some o f the undead, Lumbering Corpses, Skeletal Archers and the likes . I have taken care of the undead threat for now.... After clearing out a large number of bea sts I return back to get back to work . I am hearing some lighting go off.... Lots of it Undead mayhem. Hmm? Hmm? So our main base were issues are taken care of?", ""),
        StaticBook("Log of Elessar", "MrGreenJellyBean", "Day 1-I have encountered many people today, most of them nice, but many foul. I feel the undead coming closer and closer to their goal. I stand in front of them, as do many others. We will not allow Oren, or Aegis for that matter, to be taken over. I feel as though I, as an individual am supposed to do something heroic... But the secrets and powers of Aegis will unveil themselves after time.", ""),
