        StaticBook("Logan's Boat intrappment log", "u000893", "Its been almost a year and im still stuck in this boat I have no way out and Ive run at of food there are no windows to escape thourgh All I wanted to know was what the guy was saying and then he put me in this boat I dont know where im headin or if were movin at all The sweet call if sleep calls I cant keep awake any longer Ive nearly run out of pages and I think the boats crashed and i still have no way out I hope that this final message makes it to my grandson named after me, Logan I hope that you are doing well and are married I hope that one day you return to Bigwater and inherit the family manor. The City has heard of your deeds and is impressed   , Logan ye people miss ye If ye ever find this return to Bigwater ye'r parents were killed by them elves, oh and make sure to bring them Black Axe with ye Goodbye, Logan and fare well to ye ((remeber that Logan's family dosent write very well)) *blood and water drench the rest of the paper *", ""),
