        StaticBook("Long time plans. Please read, Sillion.", "Caden_Cathaldus", "Gruol and I were thinking of long term plans. We have some gaurds for traveler's pass, and a famous bartender. But, we more or less, took your idea into play. We will build one BIG city, with one of us ruling over a part in the city. I was thinking about statues.", ""),
        StaticBook("Looking for Work: Highly skilled disguiser", "AlphaCentaurus", "Are you part of a guild? Have you ever wished to spy on an enemy, or assassinate a friend? Have you ever wanted to tangle up political machinations, but just haven't had the ability? \n Well, you're in luck. I'm an extremely talented man in the arts of impersonation. I can disguise myself as almost anyone you want, and can act in their stead. The possibilities are endless! \n Contact The Gentleman ((AlphaCentaurus)) today. Or maybe you'll be the next target.", ""),
        StaticBook("Looking into the face of the Father", "Leopled1", "A Father is a leader. And warrior. A braveheart of his own kind. Towards his child, He will die for them gracefully, And teach them all he knows. Th is all a fher is. But a fher who tres the child like it is just another human, Is no fher to be called one. I had a fher once. He sits in the front of my mind each day, As i think of him. How the wilds would be our haven, where he taught me the skills of life. and how i would grow up to be strong like him. Lorithan Lehywin was a brave man not just for me, but for all he knew. The orcs, would tack near by sometimes, and pillage villages. But they never took our cities, My fher would protect and defend them with his life. His skills with a bow were th of gods. He would strike and orc through the thro from  mile away. He was everything to me. and remains in my heart always. Today, if he was any different, i would not be the same man as i am and for that. I thank him for all he has done. If i could talk to him now. I would tell him, i have found someone to protect and spend my life with. To have a child who i can teach to be strong. If my father knew i had found someone now. He would be able to rest peacfully. R.I.P Lorithan Lehywin.", ""),
