        StaticBook("Love Poem", "Jallentime", "That red ribbon and her silky golden hair \nIt's enough to make anyone watch as she passes \nNever have I seen a woman so fair \nNever have I seen one as sweet as molasses \nBrianna, I believe her name be \nIn her suit, like that of a bunny", ""),
