after a day or two i asked himhe would need eny helpwith the tower and for two weeks i worked on the outside of the tower thinking when am i going to get down after that i found a nice guild to stay at i stayed for less than a 2 weeks .when i lived thare to get money we went camping and got to omost over 2k .after that i planed on geting my own house (witch im writeing this book at) i borrowed money from Centralguard a week later named arkenos. i now have my house and am looking forward to a knighting sarrowmony next week . i now sit in my house righting this vary book.", ""),
