        StaticBook("Lunar's Lullabies", "Crippledbaboon", "Little bird, little bird, why do you cry? Little bird, little bird, are you going to die? Little boy, little boy, I hurt my leg. *smiles", ""),
        StaticBook("Lunar_Druid_Bircalin's letter of resignation.", "Crippledbaboon", "Short and simple ( Kind of like me ) I'm resigning from the Druids. Do not be mistaken, I am not leaving due to any form of bitterness whatsoever. I resign due to a lack of importance. I have realised the Druids are no longer in need of my services, subsequently, I bid farewell to all the budding Druids, the Dedicants. I wish you all the best. I hope to see you all protecting nature to your highest degree. I shall like to remain a friend to the Druids if possible. I'd wish farewell to the Arch-Druids in this letter but I believe I can do so in person. Of course I will wish farewell to the Heirophants in person also. Farewell Druids ~Bircalin ~", ""),
        StaticBook("Lunavara Book list", "XSBurningKiller", "Date: Sabet, 7th of Suns Smile, 1327  \n History Section \n Human History: Siege Of Antioch, The Great War, The DarkBrotherhood, The History of the Whisper Isles, conDoin Army \n Elven History: Mayctor's Stand, On Elves, The History of Everal The First City of the Elves , The Druidic Order Volume 1 , The High Prince of Malinor and the story of Laurelin \n Orc History: The Battle of Sanhar \n Dwarf History: Kal'Manor Darfin, The Grand Cathedral of Kal'Uruguan \n Undead and Ascended History: The Myth of The Great War, Undead, Kar'Lani Artifacts , The Ascended and the Undead, Haven City of Renguls \n Bell's Journal: Risen Journal Volume 1, Journam of a Former Soldier Voluma II , Journal of a Former Soldier Volume III, Journam of a Former Someething Volume IV, Volume V -missing-, Journam of a Former Something Volume VI, Journal of a Something Volume VI VII*, Journal of a Coward Volume ?? \n Diaries and Journals: Todd's Journal, The Journey, Whidoc's Notes on Magic, Searching the paws, Observations of the Phantasmal N.vonSchlichten, Whidoc's Journal, Biodoc's Notes: The Mysterious Sword, Telandriel's Diary, Necropolis, Entering the Nether Fantasti, The War Hammer, The Elder Shaman Brevias, The Adventures of Gimblo, A Tale of Sorts Lance Ulhric, Royal Regrets, Orc Destiny, Ranger Crowley, Sanhar: Born of Blood, Interview with Heracles, A Gentleman's Proposal Baron vanRourke, Book of Yameir, My notes on Inwe Rivell Gordian, \"Diary 1\", Tib's lost journal Page XII, Undead Supporters Erunak, Hidden Locations Erunak , The Murder of Apollen, Rivell Gordians Journal Volume 1, Rivell Gordians Journal Volume II, Rivell Gordians Journal Volume III, Rivell Gordians Journal Volume IV, Sean's Journal, The Sayings of Druids Volume VII, Scribe Pliny the Elder's Final Words, Saying of Druid Mithrandir, Saying of Archdruid Clcero Volume III \n  World History: The Ancient History, A Transcription of the Ancient History of Aegis Volume I , A Journey Through Aegis Volume 1, Culture in the East Felus. \n Guides: Oren Guards......... oh Darn, The Grand Book of Greed's Hand aka Dice!, Monsters and How to Kill'em, The Guards Guide, Wilderness Survival Guide, Shaman Skills, Druidology What is a Druid?, A Halfing's Guide to Herbology, The Druid's Guide to Herbalism Volume II, 101 Ways to cook bread, Observations on Undead Magic, Plot Information, Survival Guide, Sword Styles Ambros, New Mansion Owner Guide, Guide to Tur;Evelon , Defending a Castle, The Art of the Ale, Potions and Alchemy:Dyes,  Arcance Power: Immobilize Spells, Arcane Power: Protectivr Charms,  Potions and Alchemy: Elixirs, Myths about the Undead, Medicine and Natural Ailments Ambros , The Art of Killing Undead, Monsters and their weakness, Dealing with Dwarves, The Druid's Siverspoon IV, Cake!, The Guard Recruit Handbook, Al'Khazar Rulebook,  The Druidic Arcanum Book of Spells \n Fiction:  Wizards of Aegis, Sonetto Volume 1 The Last Truth, Nirum,  Song of the Alchemist, Armor of Steel, Me'bog the Orc, Quotes and Poetry for a Wise man,  Ode to an Orkian Ore, The Ranger, Back to Base, Creep,  Drown my Sorrows, The Shadow's Peek and Dragon's Maw, Changeling, The Universe, Yeltur, The house on the hill, The Wolf and the writrt,  The Lost Ones Volume I, The Lost Ones Volume II, The Assassin,  Xero's Dark Past, Vincents Accident, The Horrors of Sleep,  The Guards Tale, The Legend of Pork, The End is Near, Song of Experience I, The Song of Nibelungs I:III How Siegfried came to Worms, Druidic Encouragement, The Wisdom of Druids, The Bard \n Newspapers: Sanhar Times, The Aegis Times Edition I, The Aegis Times Edition II, The Aegis Times Special Issue I, The Oren Regular Edition III", ""),
        StaticBook("Lunavara workers guild", "Martin123martin", "'Ello this be a message to all, if ye 'ave any worker that need doing such as farming, gathering mat materials, landscaping, building etc.. then be sure to contact the Lunavara workers guild Ye can send a hawk to either Grumdul (martin123martin), Dante (dantesol) Elessar (Rusty7x) if ye be interested 'ello this be a message to all, if ye 'ave any work that need doing then ye should contact the Lunav ara workers guild. We specialise in doing various jobs which can range from farmin', minin', landsca pin', buildin' etc. If ye wish to contact us then you can send a hawk to Grumdul (martin123martin),", ""),
        StaticBook("Lust", "Cookie9000", "I lust, not for money, nor fame I lust for power... I will do what it takes to be undead... I drool at the thought of being undead, I must get it I say, No matter the cost, I will make sure I become an undead, and cause terror and watch poor families die before my staff, I will laugh and prance and dance in their blood, sacrifice them all to Iblees, all for the power... As I write this, I shake, thinking of all the power, once I get it, Ill smite everyone I know and make them slowly die, a painful death of slowly bleeding out as I show them their heart and eat it whole, I shall, prevail. Even if I have to kill anybody, I will do it. No matter the cost. I hope you see this, family, Im doing this for you.... - Alanor Hedgewell", ""),
        StaticBook("Lynx Gwai", "firespirit44", "Name: Lynx Gwai (Roxses20) \n Race: Wood Elf \n Age/Gender: ?/Male \n Skills: Persistence \n Lynx was once a spy, for a order unknown of. During his missions, he made friends and fell in love Rhisereld, a woman being hunted by undead, bethroned to Alethion, leader of the Whispering Order. He has committed treason to the Teutonic Order, and has been hurt badly by them. He is known to have been a druid, a friend of Decora and Dawn. It appears he tries to hit on anything female. He is slow, persistence, stubborn, not quick with words, but is around dangerous people. Keep an eye on him.", ""),
        StaticBook("Lynx's journal", "Roxses20", "I have not been able to keep up woth my thoughts lately so i chose to write a journal of my thoughts . -i have lost interest with Rhise,she seems to still think her long lost boy friend is comeing back -A man named Gaarag talked to me today about a secret guild of in the woods he said if i gained his trust i could join. -I have done it!I gained his trust.We are leaveing for the guild today! -I was once known as saris,no i am not.I have made friends with the shadows and i now have the name Lynx -Spying in snowy fields has taken a toll on my body it is not use to being this cold. -The leader of the guild Gaius still seems to not trust me.How much i tried for him to...... -I went to battle some undead with Gaius and i saw the strangest thing...A beautiful girl......but her hand WAS MISSING ! -It has been awhile since i last wrote but i thought ii should start again.I saw the girl again and she has agreed to let me heal her hand..but she wants to do something first -Again it has been awhile but i will keep up to date now.I know have been asked to help the girl by a man named jack,she has been hearing a voice in her head.I...I just dont know if i could help -I...I...I think i am starting to like this girl.......i dont know why though its just to early to t ell -It seems i do have feelings for her...I just dont know how to express them -I keep trying to heal her but i fear the voice might not go away...... -I know know my feelings for her are true.I even try showing off by showing no pain when i heal -*blood spots are on this page and it is hard to read*To**y I **aled h** B** my ea*s are blee**** an d so are my eyes", ""),
        StaticBook("Lyric sheet to: Where them girls at by David Guetta", "monkeychez", "So many girls in here, where do i begin? I see this one, I'm bout to go in. Then she said \"I'm here with my friends\" She got me thinking, and thats when i said. Where them girls at? (x3) So go get them, we can all be   friends!  Flo Rida: Hey, bring it on baby, all your friends. You're the shit and i love that body.                                                         END OF VOLUME 1", ""),
        StaticBook("Lysaenai's Journal", "monkay98", "8/29 We got a home and Ive got a new journal book .Things are starting to look up . 8/30 Today I did alot of travelling there was a terrible storm, I was afraid the trees would catch fire we are now on the whispering isles after fighting a few monsters we decided to check out a to tomb. there was nothing in the tomb, it was all probably stolen by bandits weve found a  small oasis and are getting hydrated.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ma Journal", "MuckyD121", "Me make journal]", ""),
        StaticBook("Mae's Hunt", "Undeelad", "It was a lovely morning when I woke up in my home. SO I decided to grab my bow and arrows to hunt for some pigs and cows... But when I stepped outside, it began to rain. All hell broke loose on me. Hundreds of zombie pigmen were charging after me! I started shooting 3 arrows at once, killing 1 every hit! I couldnt keep it up, but when I ran into my home I closed the gates And just started throwing fire arrows in their faces. EAT IT PIGMEN! The End", ""),
        StaticBook("Maeghan", "Angrboden", "Maeghan. Or Maggie. Kai can call me Maggie. I like Kai.", ""),
        StaticBook("Maestren's Simple Theorys", "TomMeijer", "I've been wondering about the farm. Goldy made it my project and I haven't done a very good job. I've been trying my best but its not as effecient as I want it to be, or atleast it could be. There's so much I need to learn, but atleast we have food I am greatful for that. Although, I believe of a way that will increase farming effeciency, just maybe . I still need to think about it more and recall my tutors words. I think I have recalled a few of my tutor's words regarding the subject of plants. He told me that plants need light, water and something else.. In that case, light should be able to be underground, just the source is the problem. Water is easy enough to supply. With all of that accounted for, I could make the farm underground. I guess, I would need to test something like this, but sounds good. Another thing I've noticed is that bending down to pick up the wheat is tiresome. As well as that, I'm always afraid of trampling the crops. Maybe I should take this into account as well.", ""),
