        StaticBook("Maiavel's Resignation", "Maiavel", "\nHerein contains my resignation as Archdruid. I find that I am in need of exploring the worl d, to search for new texts, and to strengthen my abilities. I will retain my link with the grove in case of a circumstance where I am greatly needed. \nBright blessings to all of you, and may the Aspects guide, and protect, you.", ""),
