        StaticBook("Martin the Beloved", "ComradeRenzbro", "Twas Ahad, 22nd of Malins Welcome when Martins death finally set in.   Twas the quietest day in the base in a very long time indeed. No one wanted to say it but we all knew very well that dark days were upon us. Not just for the UAC, but for all of Aegis. We needed to come together as a whole from now on and put our petty differences aside and beat this foul beast called the Undead. read this sornof please sir i wrote a book about martin.", ""),
        StaticBook("Martin's Journal", "martinvilla822", "July 26 Been getting some good ratings from my book which is always good.   July 27 The Undead attacked orem me and the other towns folk fought them off. It was quite the battle many were killed in the fight but we lived thru the night we all got diamond swords for our bravery. July 28 I tried out the gauntlet challenge and it is hard. July 29 I have been getting some sort of telepathic messages from a necromancer. August 2 I attended the coronation of king Edmund alot of people were there. August 3 Had a meeting with the other holmes .I just learned that Kaine is now the leader of my rank which is annoying since i do alot of work here but bas dosnt see it. August 4 King Edmund is not as friendly as King Perea was sadly Perea was killed. August 5 Me,Bas and Vargorn went into the sewers today and found a hidden market . Me and the Oren guard went to the fort of the undead to fight it was quite the fight. Aragorn and the Chief have be around much more often than before. August 10 me and Yee both agree that Kaine is not fit to be head captain . since kaine just stays in his bar all day and barely does dirt. August 12 Finally finished my set of diamond armor August 19 Bastion is making a crazy test to decide our new ranks i mean what the hell. August 24 I have not written in this journal for a long time i had recently found a book containing a hit list one of which was a king it did not say which king though..... August 26 Alistion is up again August 27 I have discovered that the targets on the hitlist are all dwarves i have already found and told LongBeard,Maximus & The King only one i havnt found is Brutal. I am now also working part time at Tac & Co. as a courier. August 31 I have been chosen to be one of the new heads of the Holmes! September 3 Bas has plans to redesign bas and also the Vault! which is annoying for me. Sep 10 So far the members of my wing are me, yee and kaine. Pyro has not chosen  wing yet so I am hoping he chooses mine. September 12 I have recruited 2 new members Skor and Xavier xavier has joined my wing September 18 we got a new recruit Jack who apparently is a baker Oct 10 Its been awhile since I last wrote here with all the work I have been doing but I have to I think I have just gotten into a relationship thanks to Tom and Lynx. Her name is Ashley a very friendly elf met her while Me, Tom, and Lynx were acting like crazy people obessed with apples hehehe. I have to say I never would have Expected that I would find my first love thanks to playing a joke with my friends. Oct 14 I have gotten a house in Whisper Isle for me and Ashley to live in. I have also been planning on proposing to her. Novermber 13 It took awhile to do but I finally asked her.... and with such joy she said yes we are still planning the time,location and date of the marriage. Also I have chosen Midnus to be my BestMan. November 18 So far we have decided to have the wedding somewhere in Malinor either in Laurelin or the Sister City hopefully this wedding goes well. December 3 The wedding shall be in Laurelin while the Reception in the Sister city", ""),
        StaticBook("Martin's Medical Records", "martinvilla822", "Martin Ignatius Loyola                                       Current Age:37                                                     I have had a relativly good health .I have had a case of the flu when I was 12 when I was playing in the forest near my village. I have gotten some minor burns from some lightning during some undead attacks. And some 3rd degree burns during a fire in the village when i was 16 .Also a few battle scars. My heart's condition is pretty healthy.", ""),
        StaticBook("Martin's Personality", "martinvilla822", "Hello Bas this book is on my opinion on my personality and my goals.  Firstly I will tell you about my personality I am the kind of person who would treat others the same way they are treated. for example if person A treats me respectfully I will treat him respectfully .Also I would prefer having a bit of a short briefing on what we are doing before doing anything .I am the kind of person who would do anything to protect his friends and family. I am the kind who seeks to do action that will benifit my friends/faction which causes me to worry about issues from time to time such as that whole lost one's issue before. or when I feel like what  we are doing is not helping or benefiting us. I follow 4 personal values they are faith,trust.valor and honor. My goals are to earn respect to have the name Martin mean something.To be known as one you can depend on to be a reliable person. .And to make alot of life long friends and to be a person with a purpose not to be a nobody. This is the end of this little book thanks for reading it Bas    - Martin", ""),
        StaticBook("Masked", "Kiafry", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Material Removal", "Ansh98", "Take pride in obliterating stones with your pickaxe? What about slicing wood with your axe? Even shoveling up pesky dirt and sand? And the most subtle of them all, shearing up excess hedges? Then Material Removal is the division for you! Material Removal takes down unneccessary blocks instructed by the other divisions. Be sure to have a full set of tools with you! Reccommended for the buffest and burliest members with powerful tools! Dean Challenging will consist of the least amount of time to destroy a building. \n What do you say?  Are you the toughest of the tough? Then join the Material Removal division and build on!", ""),
