        StaticBook("Matthew Info Sheet", "guyplayingpc", "Name: AFF_Footman_Matthew Age: 18   Race: Human Gender: Male Follow me  aye Follow me Take the lift down In the main hall", ""),
        StaticBook("Maur UAC Book", "maur0821", "Today we lost a leader of da UAC Wango he fell to the darkness hopefully he see da light soon see da light and fight Iblees with us but he is lost to us now Day 2: Latsi was never evil he was a spy on da undead but something makes no sence Latsi made Wango a undead and did not tell him he was a spy? Well Wango is not a undead he a beliver but we fought so long along side each other To bad Kootry is gone he know what to do but for now Martin\"Old Leader\" is in command Martin has died today Our best leader die......*tear drop on book", ""),
        StaticBook("Maur WarBook", "maur0821", "Today i bacame a UAC. Day 2: I am at UAC outpost hope to go the base soon. Day 3 nothing to do It night time am think of kill some mosters to some money eveyone went away somewhere. Day 4: I lock myself outside the base The undead are very scary Day 5 i saw the undead i ran for my life Trying to find Kootry am lost right now I went out to get sand", ""),
