        StaticBook("Mavelus Vakir", "DefunctDivine", "'Tis only a pen name. M.V., however, are true initials. Mavelus Vakir, Your friendly stalker.", ""),
        StaticBook("Maverik's Guide to Monsters", "Todd877", "Zombie - Not so dangerous alone, but in groups they can be deadly. Slow-moving, they can be easily outrun in open areas. \n  Skeletons - similar to zombies, they attack at long range with their bow. Strafing runs are advised when taking this monster out. Also, try to take them out first. Spiders - fast and deadly, they can jump and climb walls and attack you from trees. Keep your distance, but zombies tactics are advised but with greater care. \n  Slimes - A cross between a spider and a zombie, they are slow but can jump and climb up walls or trees. They also divide when killed, while becomeing progressively smaller and weaker. They are great training for sword and axe weilders.  \n Blaze - a denzin of the nether brought here by Iblees, the Blaze is a medium threat. It can fly and shoot small fireballs at you. Three in a row to be exact . The trick is that they are vunerable after their attack. Immediately close in and kill the Blaze after it's attack. Another good pratice monster for fighters. \n Pigmen - a faster more powerful version of the zombie. Pigmen are very hard to kill in direct confrontation. But a archer on an elevated platform can kill multiple pigmen. A good target for archers and scouts.", ""),
        StaticBook("Max's Journal (abridged but long)", "WOOSH10001", "As a young child Maximus was sold into slavery by raiders who kidnapped him from his village. After years of servitude and secretly training himself for combat Max was able to  escape during a riot that he instigated. \nDuring his escape Max was able to rescue a fellow slave, the son of a wealthy Dwarven nobleman . Ater getting the Nobleman's son home safely he was offered a reward. Maximus chose to be educated so that he would never have to be as lowly as a slave every agai n. His education refined his building and fighting skills learned as a slave, and also taught him how to behave in the presence of royalty.\n After finishing school Maximus was at a loss as to what to do. Wandering  the streets of Aegis he one day found a recruiter for the Golden Harvest . Starting there as a miner, Max delivered any loads of ore from Raven Hold all the way to Alk'hazar for Lord Richards. This job was so dangerous thaMaximus considered it only a little better tha slavery. He was sent to the healers by monsters, bandits, and lava.. even thrown in jail for accusations of s orcery.\nAfter decades of service to Lord Richards, Max was promoted to Overseer  of The Harvest. In his old age Maximus started investigating other interestes that he had wh en younger. His previous connection with Ambros from teh OSRT led him to the Mages guild . Although Maximus was offered a leadership job originally, he wasnt in position to accept it at the time. However as the guild begain to reform he was accepted as te apprent ice to Guild Master Rilath. (to be continued as more happens)", ""),
        StaticBook("Max's Magic Experimentation", "WOOSH10001", "Day One: \n I've felt the energy that Mater Rilath harnessed at the Mages Tower in Alkhazar . Sitting in the attic of my Alk'Hazar shop I try to find ways to release this energy. By focusing very hard I can cause one hand to become very warm, and the other somewhat moist. \n I'll work on this more in the coming days. \n \n Day Two: \n Today I've made a bit of progress. My left hand is getting very hot.. And My right hand is able to forma considerable amount of condensation. \nWhen I press them together a bit of steam forms. I'd really like to learn to focus these energies. \n \n Day Three: \n I must confess that business matters we're pressing on day 3 and I had little time to train. \nI was still able to produce some steam when I had a moment to focus on it after supper. \n \n Day 4: \n Today I took it upon myself to create a place to train. The attic of the Golden Harvest Alk'Hazar shop has become a suitable lab. With a cases of books, work benches, and ingredient s. This took most of the day, I'll return to my skills after the weekend. \n \n Day 5: Today I spent a lot of time in my new lab, focusing as much energy as I could attain. \n Now when I press my hands together a cloud of steam forms. I am able to pull them apart and focus the steam between my palms. \n I wouldnt say my hard work is paying off just yet, but through dilligence I've achieved progress . \n I feel a breakthrough coming soon.. perhaps when Rilath takes me to the inside of the Alk'Hazar Mages tower.. \n \n Day Six: \n I was able to acquire some slimeballs today", ""),
        StaticBook("Maxwell's Log", "1997man", "As I wait for more people to join it seems that the Golden Sun is dead as I never see anyone anymor.", ""),
        StaticBook("May Break My Bones", "Charles_Grimlie", "Epilouge: Ah your back traveler! And I can see you've completed my last quest. Well now that you have a new handsome blade! I will require you to go out, and collect 5 [Bones] for me, you can find them on the bodies o f the skeletons, that roam around the dark woods... Good luck mate, and safe travels! \n Objective: Collect 5 [Bones] \n Rewards: 1 [Iron Sword], 250 [Minas]", ""),
        StaticBook("May the Woman who I seem to Fall for", "KarmaDelta", "I love May with all my heart but I dont know about her. I saw her a couple nights ago with that human lord. I already dispise of him. But when I saw them like that..... I just..... I dont know. I want to believe it was a lie but apart of me says its not. I just want to be with her just me and no one else. But I guess I cant have that now.... can I. I also recall when I came back from the woods all of them drinking together. I just kept walking with my head down. I walked past ignoring my lovely May. That hurt me alot to do that I then here them next door having some kind of sexual party of some sort while drunk or something....... I just thought me and her together..... was... well perfect. I loved her and I thought she loved me. I dont know May. Tell me..... what was going on between all of you..... I want an honest answer..... I really do enjoy enjoy you and treat you nice..... but I guess thats not enough.. is it. I want an answer just an answer for this. Just me and you privately. \n \n From Deltaro Black the one that truly loves you.", ""),
        StaticBook("Mayctor's leave", "shiftnative", "Mayctor was spotted in Laurelin North, and chased out of the city. A handful of Sentinels and On-Lookers chased him down road and eventually slew him. All of the fighters trudged back to Laurelins gate, pleased with their kill. As all of the elves talked amongst themselves outside the gates Mayctor was seen standing, just down the road from them wielding only a diamondsword. There was no fear in his eyes as he proclaimed \"I am exactly where I want to be\" Just  as the elves drawn their bows a cast of lightning struck between the trees between Mayctor, and the men. The sound bellowed through the forest and with a whirl of smoke, Mayctor had been summoned. To where, we're not sure.", ""),
        StaticBook("Mayctor's stand", "shiftnative", "Mayctor was spotten in Laurelin North, a few moons after his exile. He was chased out by a Sentinels and On-Lookers. They eventually caught up to him and killed him. All of the men", ""),
        StaticBook("Mayor box", "nikias_1996", "I really like the idea of these boxes it is indeed a good way to communicate with eachother . I also like the idea of the Idea box outside of the townw hall. And for the advertising of the city Those signs are a good idea i will also talk with seventh about other ways to  Make this town more popular (a post on the forum for example)) And if you have any more ideas don't be afraid  to contact me. Signed Eledyr Mayor of corvus Animus", ""),
        StaticBook("mayor in", "emberhard", "How do you like this idea? I have them outside my office as well, it will be a good way to comunicat e if we end up being on at different times Of course you are free to move these around as you wish, I wnated to put them in your office but I Could not find a good place in there. \n Just to inform you, I put up some direction signs to here outside the Eastern walls of laurin, but I would suggest a bit more advertiseing", ""),
