        StaticBook("me spirit diary", "mingsly", "When i was building me 'ouse i 'eard da spirits talking ta me. Dis was werid and i 'ad never 'eard dem before Dey told me dat dey only power dat i need was me fists. I asked \"Where are ja spirit dingy?\" . Da spirit appeared befure me and asked da cum inta me 'ouse . I said yub den he walked drough me locked duur. When we gut i dere i asked 'im huw i knew dat 'e was real. So 'e took a shiney uut uf da wall behind 'im. I gasped and said ta 'im \"JA really must be a spirit but why ja 'ere nuw?\" Da spirit giggled and told me dat \"Ja will gu un a adventure but ja will be 'ere ta lead da orcises. \" Dis made me cuunfused so i wuld da spirit \"Ja dings i cuuld becum da rex?\" Da spirit said nub and dat I would becum da elder shaman. Dis made me say \"nub. I will no be elder!\" Den da spirit vanished. Dis made me 'appy cause 'e was odd. Den anddur une came in. Dis une said dat I wuuld never becum a shaman so i 'it dis une befure 'e left. I den left da shuw me buuk to da shaman dat training me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Me story - part 1. Staring at the carnage, praying that the sun would never rise..", "Aandie", "Staring at the carnage, praying that the sun would never rise.. Living another day in disguise.. These feelings can't be right, lend me your courage to stand up and fight, on tonight.. Saddened man sings and hums.. \"Ooo-oooh, Stand up and fight\". The fighting rages on and on, to chenge me.. you must be strong.. I walk your land.. but dont belong, two hundred soldiers can't be wrong It's no fun but I've been here before.. I am far from home and I'm fighting our war Some are scared, others killing for fun, I killed a mother infront of her son Fight for honor, fight for your life.. Pray to God that our side is right.. Even though we won, I still may lose.. Until I make it home to you, me beloved Elser.. I see our mothers filled with tears.. Children grow up so fast where did those years go? .. Memories won't let you cry, unless I don't return tonight.. So many soldiers on the other side, I take their lives so they can't take mine.. Nobody tells me  the reasons we're here.. I have my weapons so there's nothing to fear.. Watching the death toll rise .. wondering how I am still alive.. Stranger's blood on my hands .. I have killed  I can.. There are no silent nights.. watching your brothers  die.. To destroy  their plans without no thought of me.. No thought of me.. No thought of me.. Saddened man hums once again his sad humn \"Ooooohhh...\" Walk the city lonely.. Memories that haunt are passing by.. A murderer walks your streets tonight.. Forgive me for my crimes.. don't forget that I was so yoooung .. Fought so scared  in the name of God and Country..", ""),
        StaticBook("Me'bog teh Orc! By Me!", "Unicornwrangler", "Once upon a time, there wuz did Orc. He wasn't very strong, but he got real strong! He got real strong cuz he ate lots of yummy Dwarfs! Den der wuz big battle. Me'bog fought in big battle! He won teh big battle! Then everyone luved him! All the girl Orcs wanted to kiss him! :THE END!", ""),
        StaticBook("Meagan File", "Shuness", "Target: Meagan the Vile. Crimes: Atempts at the king's life. Description: Meagan is female, with blue eyes, and black hair. Wears a cloak, black, red trim. Personal Notes: ...she seems... non hostile. Instead of trying to kill me and Red when we had her ca ptured, she ran. This could probably be a trick, but, I am ordering that, if she is captured, she is not to be harmed and instead to be handed to me for questioning. Current Status: Alive, I presume, but missing.", ""),
