        StaticBook("Message", "Royced", "Akeron is looking for Brevias, spread it on.", ""),
        StaticBook("Message", "sconn", "I have abandoned evil. I do not expect you to understand but i found a cure to your and my madness. If you are intrested message me back. If not never contact me again. And dont show up at my house unexpected. People might see you.", ""),
        StaticBook("Message fer th' king,", "BrutalBroski", "'ello King, I be tired of this, of you, and everyone els. \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Message for da Warlord.", "Goldrim", "We of the Mok'Nathal tribe, be invitin' you over for a feast, we have many of da red skin you want. Da place to be is, x -1272 z 1768 , we have many stuff to show ye' so come by da tribe, whenever da Warlord wants.", ""),
        StaticBook("Message for Dawn", "William_Talbot", "Hi Dawn! -Edward", ""),
        StaticBook("Message in a Bottle...", "whiteberry14", "The leter is old and some pages are mising... But you can read some Fragments... \"My dear wife and children! Im sorry! The undead are near... We cant afort anymore... they are getting through Kelistria's Walls! They will be here soon... If you read this... I wanted you to know I love you so much! I hope to see you again! I have to go! General Alexis is searching for me! And tell this to the Oren Guard... YOU MUST NOT TRY TO GET THROUGH THE UNDEAD LINES! THE TOWN IS DEAD NOW! IM KEEPING THE HOLY COMPASS! DONT TRY TO FIND THE COMPASS \" There is nothing more you can read...", ""),
        StaticBook("Message to Alys", "CamouFranky", "Ok Dear Alys, I'd like to cordially invite you to Dawn's Shop next to the Gauntlet at 7 on Wednesday. Please tell me if you want to do it earlier Thank you, Knight_Camou", ""),
        StaticBook("message to the guards", "sconn", "eze'kiel is a thief and a lier do not trust him.", ""),
        StaticBook("Message to the Seer", "SapphireShard", "Hello! I heard about you opening up a Fortune Telling business! Congratulations!", ""),
        StaticBook("Message-Box", "Dunhagen", "Please write down any messages, for city-officals or citizens.", ""),
        StaticBook("meu diário", "Mdroid", "dia 1 procuro uma casa nada ainda", ""),
        StaticBook("Micyn's Journal", "CoworkerJoe", "*Older entrees missing*  \n Construction on the Temple is going well but we had a problem with some Zombies. Nailena taking building into her hands      Ahad, 15th of The Amber Cold, 1309 \n *Next Entree* \n Joma, 20th of the Amber Cold, 1309 \n Temple structure almost complete and afterwards comes the Guard Barracks. Saw a Zombie Pigman in the temple almost killed me and Izz. Xero acting suspicous as usuall \n *Next entree* \n Kamees, 5th of Snow Maiden, 1309 \n Work on barracks going well and temple structure basicly complete . Nailena nowhere to be seen \n *Next Entree* \n Ahad, 15th of Snows Maiden, 1310 \n Finally found Journal been a while . Barracks almost complete need funacings and marked rooms .Temple almost complete too thinking about joining a guild or something . Havent seen Nailena in a while heard she joined a guild and so did Xero Well thats all for now \n *Next Entree* \n Itnan, 2nd of Malins Welcome, 1310 \n UNDEAD ATTACKING CAPITAL. GUARDING GATES. I HEAR LIGHTNING. ONE OF THE GUARDS WENT OUT TO FIGHT PROBABLY DEAD . MIGHT BE LAST TIME I WRITE IN THIS JOURNAL", ""),
        StaticBook("midnight Assassin's eternal contract", "egloman", "I promise my eternal faithfulness to the midnight assassins, signed", ""),
        StaticBook("midnight assassin's guild contract", "egloman", "i will allways be loyal to the guild, never leave the guild, or betray it signed Crow ,Prime, Rezolio", ""),
        StaticBook("Midnus Anarion", "doctordemento", "Midnus Deskoton Anarion \n Currently 378 \n I have had a reletivly healthy life. A case of the tunnel cough from my brother clausij when I was 8. A flu when i was 240 . And more recently more than a couple lightning strikes (around 7). The bolts caused 3rd degree burns temporary paralasys in the left leg and arm and a heart condition (controlled through an daily herb paste) . Since i was born on the night of a full moon, i am a moon elf and am sensitive to the sun.", ""),
        StaticBook("Mien Kampf", "Da_Emperors", "This book shows the stuggle of my life, for what i have done for Aegis. It started out when he was born in a Oren town. My life was gonig to be that of my forefathers. A knight or a Captain of the Guard however that all changed.......the night of the Undead . They came from everywhere, killing my friends and townsmen Soon they came to my family......they killed my father, Sir James and my mother Doctor Jessica of Alz. At the Age of 13 he worked in the swords acamedy. There he learned the art of war He began a passion of the blade and worked on mastering it for the rest of his life . Soon he began to work as a Squire . Sadly after a week time, the undead killed sir virkam He was confused and left alone, all was gone. only his brother Hawk was alive. I left my brother with the rangers and tryed to figure out my life. Leaveing my last family member was the hardest thing i had to find my path. and i did when i spoke with the ascended. They are wise people that will advize you to the greater good. They advized me to follow my goals. Then i left oren, i created this faction you found this book in. The Imperial Co. There we get into the stuggles of my Faction.", ""),
        StaticBook("Miguel", "AutarchCosmos", "Name: Miguel Corleone ((EvilerGoose))\n Age: 18\n He can FARM at an advanced level.\n He can't MINE.\n He can FIGHT at a moderate level.\n He can read and write.\n Note: Watch out for him flipping.\n Note: He is a good salesman.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Mike Foxtrot's Adventures Volume I", "bugiman11", "I remember, Not Long ago That i went trough the 3 Gates The First i did was to meet with my Elven Friend, Airion. We Headed towards the Great Kingdom of Oren In Search of Adventure And Wealth As Night Struck, Me And Airion Seperated in the City When we Met up the Next day, I had achevied Nothing. While airion had Gotten ahold of 2 Stacks of Diamonds. Not to be let out into a Bad start, Airion Gave me Half the Prize of his Deeds Chapter 2: Pok, And His Girl Shortly After I got the Diamonds, Airion Stood with a Sword faced towards an Orc. An Selfclaimed Son of the Princess, Although i did Not beleave my Eyes then It Turned Out to be The Princess's Son. Pok, His name was, And A Large crowd had gathered Around the Two. Words Spread around With hatred, But the Guards where quick, And Soon Airion and i Were looking fod An inn, To Spend the Night. Pok, The Orc, Showed me to the Local Inn, Dawns Bakery, Whom we Never Really Managed to get ahold of Now, While waiting for This Dawn, I overheard Pok talking with a \"Female\" What they where talking about will remain Secret, But Shortly after Everything Got quite Pok Got downstars and Asked if i Knew The female, Which ofCourse I did not. Chapter 3: Sewage, Undeads, And Princesses One day, While Looking around the Market, I had Just bought an Bow and a Bunch of Arrows I Saw a Dark looking Fellow, In Dark Robes and Purple trims, This did Not look like Hwalder, The mag e, While He asked where the King Lived, I did Not Respond, And then he Went down into the Sewers Ofcourse that could not be right, So i followed him Down there, Shamely, He had dissapered I Searched the Sewers Quite a While, And then i found a Strange Lit Up area There was a Staircase Which i followed, And Cobwebs and iron Bars Met me. Soon, THe Floor Stumbled below me, And a Voice Said \"Get Out\", It was the Princess I jumped Down to Her And She Told me to get out of the Keep, Surprised of my Location i Randomly Wal Walked The path Which i Thought was the Correct Soon Enough I was in the throne room, And again i was lost. I was Outside again when the Sun was going down, And i wondered who would be the Lucky one to live t there, After the King passes away. Chapter 4: Horizon, Pirates, Chills. Chapter 4: Ascended In the Sewers After I told Airion about my Meeting with the Princess and the Undead He decided to tell an ascended, Although As i Was drawn t both ascended and Undeads I would rather had skipped, But No, Aririon Dragged me and the Ascended Into the Sewer Down there, The Ascended Looked on the Passage to the Keep, And MNe and Airion Looked at a Hidden Do ock, After Airion was Arrested again, Threatend by Execution, The Ascended Whispered to the Lord That had Arrested him, That he Should be let off by a warning Cause he had given Them Vital Information Chapter 5: Horizon, Ships, Chills. II was Out Looking about In the Northern areas of the City And i noticed a Dwarf Jump over the walls Into the woods I decided to follow him, And i Found a Sunken Ship, With TNT And Chests Although the Ship seemed quite Looted, I decided to check it, And i found Bonemeal and Arrows, Score !, After i swam back to the Ship, I saw a Little Village, Horizon. Me and Airion Looked a Bit around,And Then i saw a Large Frigate But asoon as I Closed near it, The air Around me got Cold And i decided to Go back with airion Chapter 6: MUgging and Ibless. Me and Airion Where walking down the kings road, And we Saw 2 Ppeople robbing a person. We Both Flanked them,Telling them to Leave him alone. Soon Enough, An undead Appeared, And Said We Should  back away from The whorshippers, But We Refused The Sky was On Fire, And Lighting Roared around us, Cries and Bypassers Ran to Cover But We did Not Budge, Airion took a Leap to the water I Stood Trusty with My Bow At hand And Shoot at the Evil Undead Infront of me Soon Enough, THe undead had used all his Power on us, And Merely Scratched the Diamond Armour Airion Headeed towards the Haven, And I Went to Report to Sgt, Hayden, Poor man Went to patrol the Place with Iron Armour, He wouldnt Stand a Chance. Chapter 7: Plauge On the road to Haven, We Met City of Aegis, An Old man Met us, Asking if we Were Infected Infected of what We asked Unknowingly, And he Said a Plauge ahas come from around Al'Khazar He Must had Meant Ibless And His Corruption. Now We are going towards Haven, To Report our Kowing While walking the Long Road to haven Airion, Mentioned Where his Diamonds Were I have given majority of my Wealth to the poor, Only have i kept tmy sword, Staff, And Armour. Look! Yelled Airion And pointed to the Left, A Floating temple! While The Two Amazed Travelers Looked, Airion Yelled, \"ARE THERE ANY ASCENDED IN THE TEMPLE?\" But Afraid Not, The Travelers had to Continue Walking Until they reacdhed Haven The Explorers look Amazed On How many Buildings and ships are All this Way, Far from The Center Of Aegis As We Entered the City, We Were Amazed But As We entered the Inner City, Down in the Depths, We Found.. A tree So large that Even the Elven Kingdom Wouldnt had Seen Bigger A Cave So big, No Dwarf Would had Dug Bigger An Architecture So Well made, No human Would had Thought off So Secure, No Orc Would Ever Get trough With Brute Force We headed to haven to Find an Ascended to Help us against The undeads And We find a large City, Under Construction By the Sages This is, Truly, Haven Chapter 8: Haven Exploration Notable: HavenAcadamy Desc: Library. Learning Notable: Sign Desc: \"An Evil Sword was Cleansed here this Day\" Notable: Large Tree, HUGE Desc: Hollow, Huge Notable: Library, Large. Desc: Giant Library, perfect Architecture FurtherMore, Hidden Room, One Book \"Covonant of the Undead\" Furthermore, Scroll of aeriel, Record of The AScended Notable: Old Roman Type Water Carriers Notable: Large Pillars Notable: Large Bank/Apartment Structure Chapter 9: Head Home I've Completely Forgotten to Eat After BEing down there My Book has Now gone from Worthless to priceless, I feel Proud.. Been Traveling Allot, Combined with Outer and inner Havens Plots, There is Enough for Entire Aeg I just Stumbled Upon a Grave, What a Shame.. I Found an inn, \"Havens rest\", Shame its locked.. I Found a Neat Little garden, And a Symbol, Looks like the One In Al'Khazar Just Found the Docks, The Ships are Immense, They look Amazing Just saw the Luxery Cabins, If they are like that, I Wonder how the Cabins are *Shiver* Seems There are 3 Diffrent Ship Types, Green, Blue, Purple I Like the Blue one, Very Spacey, Captains Room is Bigger then the Luxery Cabins In the Purple S Seems like the green one is Named \"The Spirit of the Aengul\" Sadly Its The same as The Purple one, Luxery Cabins.. Sigh A Small Bank System Leading down into a Massive BEdrock Vault, Cool huh? No Sages around, Airion is Pissed.. Chapter 10: Alliston I Found a UAC Base, No idea What it means, But They say they need Help for Supplies For Alliston, One of the Northern Settlements, I'll Take a look. Airion Finnally got ahold of This Dawn, He bought the Luxery Suite, Seems like We are Splitting We Are Just headed for allistion Now, I got Tons of Supplies When we where Talking about Going to help Alliston Airion Finnaly got ahold of Dawn, The Inn Keeper, And we Finnaly got a Room As I am Writing this Me and airion are At the North gate, Ready to Take a look at Alliston And we see a Zombie Inside the Guard tower, Airion and I Quickly REalise him as a threat And Take him out, Airion Finds a Fish and eats it raw Off the zombies Corps. We Followed a path leading to Snowfields Ruins, We Took Rest in a Tower Airion Who had been here before said it was Hunted, I do not beleave in that Airion Showed me a Furnace thats been Cooking for ages How and Who Would use that, Is a Mystery for me. We Found a Sign Leading us to Ruins of Allstion, Our target perhaps? We Continued Down to Crimson vale, Airion Is trying to get inside We had No Luck Getting inside, But as Airion was Finding a way in i found a large tree like towe r, And we Traveled Upon the tree tops As we Entered a Cabin Owned by Dawn Perea, We wondered What did She do with a cabin Out here? So Close to the undead and The Northern After walking quite a While In the woods My armour had gotten quite Damaged I gotta find a Smith.. Cheaply.. Chapter 11: Winterfell Want to race to the Northern Gates? Said Airion, Even Though He is the Slowest Elf I nknow When we reached the Northern gates, We got an urge to see Winterfell, We Took the Road to King E dmunds Bridge, Nearing Winterfell, We See a large Tower Rising from the walls \"HELLO! ANYONE IN WINTERFELL?\" Shouted Airion, To the Deserted Place To Think This is Undead Now, NO SIgn of Struckle Leaving the Town of Winterfell and the Chill of Undeads, We Entered Sargoth Home of Nods At the Gate It said Comming Together is the Beginning Keeping together is Progress Working Together is Success As we Looked around We could not beleave our Eyes, Houses Were in Ruins Most Intact, But Many Broken, And Signs Of Struggle By looking at THe Amount of Houses, The Guards from Oren, And the Defences How could this Be Deserted? Reading the Signs on the NoticeBoards Suggest that an Strange Elf Was near And The Towns Folks Suggested for Natural Defences From the Trees Cause they Sences Evil was near Leaving trough the Main Gate, I Find the Remains of a Poor soul Finding Only His Soulstone, Which can never be taken away, Unless Death takes its toll Infront of the Dead Body Lies a Tower, As I enter the basement of this tower A revolting Sight Appears, Two Cell Like Rooms Each Having a Sign One Saying \"Blood For the Blood God\" And other \"Skulls for the Skull God\" Mayby This Person was not as Innocent as i Thought Chapter 12: Wilderness ME and Airion Decided to Spend Some Days In the WIld, Where We are Free of the Sound of Undeads And I can Write More Books, In Peace, Also to Strengten our Skills Airion Is Headed to The Haven Railway, I Found a Small Sewer Pasage Right outside Al'Khazar, Its Open, Amazing Nobody Is Using it To Get past the Gate I am Sure AIrion Would Love to Tell the ascended about this, I think he got a Crush on the First Acolyte We met As I am Writing This We are Traveling To Haven, We Decided to Make a House Nearby, Not Too Close, But Nearby, The Ride HEre is Quite Painless Exept for Railloss, But It seems to Run Smooth Now We just Entered the Snowy Bits, Haven Should be Close soon The Views Here are Amazing, Higher Up Then Walking we See Much more Seems Like the Ride Stops Pretty sudden Airion Is Looking At Haven for Sages, I Went to Explore for a Spot For Our House While Looking around I Found a Tent \"Use for Refuge from Ranger Solaren\" It said, I Wonder who that is Me and Airion Decided to Go back to Al'khazar, It was Too Far away from Civilzation What if Undeads Decided to Destroy the Entire World, And We Would not Know a Thing I Have Also Decided on Some Plans, A Fortress on the Outside A Castle on the Inside I Found a Strange Looking Fellow, Purple Eyes, He Looked like Something the Undead Dragged Out Of the Nether Itself He had Some Pearls On him, Looks Cheap.. There, Finished My House, Near the Village of Horizon I plan to Soon Make this into a Small Fortress, But for Now While My Resources are Low, I Must just lay low Chapter 12: Guardian Headquarters It Seems asif While I was Making a House Airion Was Out Fending off an Undead, Lucky.. When we Finnaly Met up again We Where at the Gaurdian HQ And We where in the Middle of a Deamon Cleansing What a Strange Sight.. I Could swear He was that Ibless Worshipper We Fended off From Mugging that Ranger Which Later On was Assisted by an Undead Chapter 13: End of Volume I Someone Took my stuff, I hoped for a Friendly Introduction, Turned Out Someone Took All My Diamond Gear, And Gave me a Puny Steel Sword Instead. Chapter 14: The Gods of Aegis THe Gods of Aegis has Spoken! The Ascended has Fled in Fear We, THE PEOPLE, Of Aegis, Must Now Defend ! Me and Airion is Now Headed towards Al'Khazar, In an attempt To Increase the Defence There We Must Fend off these Undeads Seeing as a Puny Fool has stolen My Stuff, I Have to Assist airion, Who already Is Poor In battle, Due to Many Encounters With Undeads and Pigmen I Hope I can be off assistance, I am a Good Archer, I can Land a few HEadshots", ""),
        StaticBook("Mike Foxtrot's Aegis, And Undead Threath", "bugiman11", "Chapter 1: The Castle, Of Old Relics Me and Airion Decided to check out The Orc Arenas Before we Even Entered the Large Orc Gates We saw MAss Lightning We ran as Quickly as we Could, And Soon we Reached a Large Castle Many Men Where around, And an undead was Casting Lightning and Fire From the Walls of the castle I saw Many Men Die there, Least i could do was take the Iron Platings Off a corpse, Poor soul When everything went quite, We went down to read the Signs \"*Name* Shop o Relics!\"  Chapter 2: OrcLands", ""),
