        StaticBook("Miscellaneous", "Ansh98", "The Miscellaneous Division consists of 5 different posititions. The 5 positions are: \n \n Guards \n Due Collectors \n Accountants \n Couriers \n Hunters \n \n To join the Miscellaneous Division, you need to be invited. DO NOT beg Deans or Founders for this division Invites are distributed by a Founder's preference. \n Guards have a great role in the building of a project. They keep the construction zone safe from monsters and thieves. \n Due Collectors keep record of every member's dues and collects them. \n The money is then handed to the Founders to contribute to the Guild. Due collectors receive a small portion of the dues as a salary. \n Accountants determine where the money from projects go towards. Read \"Job Payment\" for more information. \n Couriers deliver messages from member to member, client to member, and member to client. They are highly depended on when projects are occuring. Hunters are a mix of farmers and Guards. They actively patrol the area, killing any monsters or animals. The animal meat is either cooked by a hunter or farmer and distributed to workers. \n This position requies intelligent minds with great agility and strength. There are no Dean challenging in this category. Deans manage all positions similar to a general in an army. Think you're the best?  Prove it.  Build on.", ""),
