        StaticBook("Mork's journal", "friar7", "I have left my old home with a new elf friend and my brother Arnold. We will make a resort . cancle . The Mod is taking a while to arive, we must ask for permission to make the resort here. help we now own a block of land to start the inn! I am working on blacksmithing.....it isn't fun, but a rare and important skill! ;; i can't get a chicken for a pet, they won't exept my seeds, i hope they will soon. Oh no! The high prince might take our land to make a big forest! we must get him to build els we will try and make him keep us here. the inn is going great! im practising swords so i can defend myself and others, its not hard", ""),
