        StaticBook("Morks Dream diary", "friar7", "okay, so i had this dream, kyle was being eat by fire ants while i ate pudding on alvaskas throne and then triloq came in \"what do you think ur doing?\" i said \"umm, sorry sir........\" but he grew very angry \"why didn't you tell me there was pudding!?\" then he sicked the fire ants on me.....and i woke up with beads of sweat on my face what does this mean? that if i take advantage of others they shall resent me for it? most likely. valuable lesson learned, never give triloq personal fire ants, bad idea and also kill kyle with fire ants, it would be very cool, but enough about that. i had my dream again, it keeps coming back, arunis hanging himself.....it is awful he just looks at me, all teary eyed, then jumps it just gets worse, even worse then when i saw it actualy happen, more dramatic poor mr.lezar, zoe dosn't talk about him er anything, she even asked me if shank or torch liked her, just sad....... lesson i learned: you cannot change the past....even if you hang yourself , i also learned to never put a suacide device in a public area, especially around emotionly wrecked suacidal people. god, i wish it would stop! i hate this dream!", ""),
