        StaticBook("Mournstone Family Member list", "darkjames", "-SnazzyEnglishman [Rerowin] -empirerebel [Aval] -darkjames [Vikram] The Mournstone family is a proud family of the south of Oren, Vikram was the founder of the family Rerowin is his brother, and proud high elf, he is the only pure elf in the mournstone Aval is the Son of Vikram, a proud hunter, he can survive alone and he has good leadership. Mariomixer[Sarim] Is the Uncle of Vikram :Luiginova[Tamara] is the Father of Vikram, a knight of oren Darkjames[second][Vàlrik] Is the youngest son of Tamara, And prefers farming than Battle.", ""),
