        StaticBook("My Book of thoughts", "sparten4ever92", "I cannot speak anymore It saddens me It makes me so sad I cannot tell mommy I lover her I can't tell BOne I'm sorry I heard I can talk in ten years. Silly Bone think he can build me a throat but I know he can't. I can't talk It hurts to giggle And All I do is whimper. I never can talk to Bone While I'm young/ I tink Bone hates me/ I am so sad. This place I am in now. It is terrible. I only like Bone's tree house I like to play in Bone's Study too! Bone is so smart I wish I could be that smart But I'm a dummy head. I accidentally broke his flashy lighty thingy he might be mad at me! I hope Bone comes soon I was just attacked by four whole skeletons! I beat dem up doh! Bone best brother He is the best So smart and nice I love Bone And new Body Guard is real nice! I make a copy of dis now! I love bookies They are great! I like juicey tingsh two! I like dem caushe they make me feel happy!... hic! I love eating apples too! I mix my juice with my apples too! it makes it taste good! People but it for minas too!... hic! New Guard is REAL nice. I like him more than Book Man! Bone going to fix me! *nods I met grandpop King Edmund today I must write this in my journal Mommy plays with elfie tingy naked and likes touching it! EWWWWWW Here BOne I made dis book too for ya! Book man!", ""),
        StaticBook("My Brewing Experiments", "Pepernoot", "This is exciting! My first time trying to brew an ale. I have bought brewing equipement, and have started the first brew. I will leave it to ferment for a day. \n -Cerlos, 23rd of The Amber Cold. 1322\n \n The first experiment was a failure. The ale tasted foul, and the colour was off... \nI will have to try something different next time.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Buisness idea/request for land", "emberhard", "Ok, remember when I asked for larger shop plots? Well my idea is not just for personal gain, it would also be a service to the community. It was for a library/mail system/Document storage/maps/etc I do not expect to get this land for free, but I will need a good amount, as I would like it to look good, and what I have in mind for it would also need a good amount of room. I would say about the room I would need would be about 2 meduim sized lots put together, and that is asuming I would be alowed several stories. \n think about it \n signed Emberhard", ""),
        StaticBook("My Cell", "ComradeRenzbro", "<Day ?> I have no clue how long I've been down here, probably about 3 days. The Undead and their minions constantly torture me and give me no hope of escape. From what my captors have told me there is a battle waging up on the surface for my freedom. The cell I'm in is a terrifying place indeed...", ""),
        StaticBook("My Current State", "KarmaDelta", "I dont know what to do with my life anymore. \n \n It seems that I lost the one thing keeping me bound to this world. I save her and she changes. The moves on without me onto another. That is not fair at all to me. I dont think anyone can fill the void that she left in my heart. I could find another but it may never be the same. \n \n Some days ago I stood atop the highest tree I can find in Laurelin, I wanted to jump. To end it there. I problably would never even get attention that way anyways so why not I take my life. I feel that there are some in this world that I wish to kill. Like that Tekaro and Aedan. I wish to have them jailed and tortured. I dont want them living. They took the one thing precious in my life away from me. I want blood in exchange. But I dont know if I can handle it. \n \n I may just either end my life, kill them if I could, or find another to fill the whole. She was the first women I loved and she said her old body was a lie. It leaves me dissapointed. And I hope whoever reads this knows 1 thing. \n \n It is to not do anything bad when your fiance changes and leaves you for another in the amount of time it took to help her. It is not worth it. Ill just find another for now. If I could atleast. All I ask for is happiness and I cant have it. \n \n Some world we line in.", ""),
        StaticBook("My dairy", "pandalex12", "As I looked at the dead bodies of my parents I started to look at the dark figures, their cloaks smelt like rot and there were green and I thought it was the orcs who murdered my parents so I took all the supplies and then embarked to Al'khazar to obtain information on the orcs however on my way I visited the orcs land and an friendly orc told me that they never been to those lands, I didn't believe him but as night drew near these dark \"creatures\" started to appear and I went to fight them however I got attacked hard and I saw \"The light\" but then the same kind orc came to my aid and defeated them and at that moment I believed they never killed my family and he told me it was not best to stay here so he gave his farewell and I left for Al'khazar. How do you write another paragraph for the book? (Take away that bit) \nDay 2: I made it to Al'khazar but just barely, I had just fought some more creatures but I didn't have any sword experience so I had to run but I was bleeding by the time I made it there and I collasped at the barrack doors. Just as I thought my journey had ended a guard by the name of Quelandor opened the doors and he took me in and tended to my wounds but he could see my fear of the dark creatures so he told me that he would help me hone my skills so we adventured to a island call Whisper Isle where he left me to fight and stepped in when my life was in danger. It was then time to call it a night so we travelled back to Al'khazar. \nDay 3: We continued training Okay...can we go to the Halfling village? (Take away that) on Whisper Isle but however when we was travelling back we encountered a horde of dark creatures . Quelandor tried to fight them off but he was killed and in my rage I crushed all of them and after when I was mourning a strange friendly light came down and told me that he is under the monks care and they would save his life and when we met up at the barracks and he greeted me to the general who was called Giffords and requested that I joined the guards but it was rejected due to lack of space . \nDay 4: I was just sitting on the steps of the crumbly barracks but then a figure turned up and asked what I was doing but before I could say anything he introduced himself as the prince which got me in shock and he requested that I show him my sword skills and then wehn I fought those creatures he was impresses and asked if I could join the guards which I happily accepted . \nDay 5: The first day of my job as a guard which my father was , I was ordered to patrol over and over again but at the same time I defeated many creatures that I was tired out and lay on the road but then I was assisted by a group called Holmes who taught me the meaning of justice and evil. \nDay 6: I was walking down like usual down the roads and I am confronted by bandits, thick leather all over who ask me for money but when I said \"Nay\" they attacked me but I managed to fight them off which resulted in one of them stabbed in the chest and I felt sad that people could turn out like this. \nDay 7 I found a house within the city district which I only had enough minas to buy so it was impossible to buy but a friend from the same village as me came along and helped me construct the insides of the house, I wasn't expecting his arrival and soon we went mining which allowed us to gain a new arsenal of weapons but when we splitted up I lost him but I found a note telling me he was finding a friend called L'Chuck who he said owned a mine where they could collect alot of ores. \n(The dairy doesn't continue until day 15) \nDay 15: I got used to the routines of my job but then I heard a loud rackus at the gates to which I hear an conversation between King Perea and an Dwarven king about the Dwarfs demanding iron as someone from our race robbed them after a long discussion the dwarves broke down our gate, climbed up the ladders and pounded us with their axes, many people were killed and we fought back and I managed to slay most of those dwarves which eventually led us to victory but the guards had to clean out the bloody gore in the square , I then came to realise that war was not a way to sort out our problems , it was just people's hearts lusting for war and blood shed. \nDay 16: After awhile the war got out of my head by when I was patrolling these bandits attacked me but I wasn't in the mood so I slaughtered them and then reported them to general Giffords who told me they were followers of the undead which gave me an thought that they killed my family but as I got outside I saw one of them, cloaked but with his revealing face with the smell of rot , I knew he had to die but just as I drew my sword he warped behind me and slashed me on the back, I cut his stomach with my sword by he regenarated and I realised I needed magic to harm him and why my father lost so easily but I knew he would die if I stabbed him in the heart so I proceeded, enduring his attacks and which ended with us stabbing each other...(blood splatters on page) \nDay ?? I woke up with no memory of who I was until a person who claimed to be a monk cast this nice feeling aura around me which suddenly gave me my memory back to which he also revived me back into the world of Aegis however he said he couldn't save my parents because he was temporarily disabled by saving my life alone and told me to look for \"true\" before he just vanished. \"True peace that is\". \nDay 17: I am now resting from the undead injury which the monk could not heal , which was a scar on one of my eyes from that cursed undead. I continue the day patrolling which I was halted to come to the gate to \"chack\" (Checks) on something which when I was making my way I could smell the same foul rot that was on the undead that defeated me so I started increasing my pace . I made it to the gates and we have been informed of an undead attack on Al'khazar but they seem to not be able to use their powerful magic yet which means that we could only beat them, not slaughter them or anything. We opened the gates and few guards attacked the undead supporters while I took lead and attacked the one that was undead which when I stabbed disapearred and drop his equipment which was soon donated for greater good but I also realised it was the undead who murdered my parents and that I would need to obtain the power of magic to oppose against their cause however I knew with all my experience we as a single race can't beat them alone. \n(Absent for 3 days) Day 20: The undead have became stronger and now have the power to control some kind of dark magic so we humans trying to obtain peace and revenge for the king they killed a day ago attacked their keep in the north where it was rumored to hold the sacred portal to the \"Nether\". We charged in but was later victim of their magic that pierced through the chest of multiple soldiers because we thought it would be easy to nullify their magic but without our allies we could not obtain victory, I would have to master the ancient ways of magic and with allies that could do the same we would be able to match them and their ways of evil and destroy their evil realm, the nether... \nDay 21: Nothing much has happened on this day and I was just guarding the gate until I heard this strange fellow shout \"For iblees\" and to which he lured some guard to the plot that was once Stoneleaf village and there we encountered another pair of iblees follower which are known as want to be undead people and an undead standing on a high tree-top, we began fighting the followers to which two guards were slain by the lightning and razor sharp blades and I slain one follower and soon became overwhelmed and defeated but as I saw the blood leaking out of my imobolized body, the undead and his left over supporter left me to rot and once again I began to hear the voice of god or should I say the godlike monks who once again saved me with their soothing aura that wrapped itself around my torn up body and it began mending the bones and my outer layer together, I was yet again saved...", ""),
        StaticBook("My dary", "gustaz", "my diary , I have joined the warden And the first days were kinda weird but now its good", ""),
        StaticBook("My departure", "Nanomatrix", "Due to, to recent event's, i am going to go live with, someone who i know i can trust . You guy's have been extreemly helpfull and caring, but i feel i have out stayed my welcome. To anora, check the mailbox i put into the wall, Akorta, have a good time friend, Alectriciti i hope that your's and Rhisereld's weding goes to plan, and that their is no awfull thing's that happen... and to you all, This is the mute, Karter saying goodbye, for now, and possibly forever .....", ""),
        StaticBook("My Diary", "TheDragonKing2", "Day One: Found a Guard in need of supply's, so i supplyed him with armor and a sword. \n Day Two: \n Oren's main city is being rebuilt. I am planing on buying one of the new homes", ""),
        StaticBook("My Diary", "Alectriciti", "Years ago, my father and mother were killed by an unknown group on the outskirts of Laurellin. I was left with my brother who looked after me for awhile. We were both torn apart! He avenged their death by killing who he thought were the murderers. But his hunch was nowhere close to the reality of the situation. As he was being judged by the council, in order for him to aviod being banished from Laurellin, he blamed everything on me, he told the judges that I was the one who killed the men. I was banished from Laurellin. I wandered in the wilds for five years. Laurellin had also made this known to the Kingdom of Oren that I was A dangerous threat to humans and elves. I was living in misery. I wandered and wandered, looking for signs of live or peace. All I found was suffering. I had, one day, fallen into a deep hole that had connections to a mine. The mines were massive, and I didn't think I would ever get out. I was in there for two days, yelling for help, but no one could hear me. I curled up in a dark corner, ready to die. I began to close my eyes for rest, but I heard a masked man calling me. He said \"I am here for you, follow my voice.\" But the sound wasn't audible around me, it was a sound in my head. I followed that sound and it led me out of those mines successfully! I reached the top, it was at the Laurellin mines. I had met the masked man. His name was Akorta. We became best friends. Since then, I have started this diary to write all the wonderful memories I have had. ... \n Akorta helped me back into Laurellin, my brother had vanished. And everything is fine now! Akorta and I are headed off to see the city of Al'Khazar in Oren. Ow! We were just ambushed by the undead! What are those things!? I did not like it at all, we better make it to Al'Khazar safetly. Here we are, Al'Khazar. The place is amazing! I met the hooded stranger... he's talking to Akorta and I about the undead. There are a lot of interesting things he's telling us. He's being so kind as to take us to his house for the night. Note: Be well armed and prepare to fight! Dawn's Bakery, I love that place. Soups are very cheap. And... the soups are very delicious. I had just met a woman, Rhisereld. She's absolutely beautiful. Akorta and I are off on a small adventure to defeat the undead! The chase begins! I defeated an undead! Akorta defeated one shortly after, but someone stole the staff he should have been rewarded with... Back at Al'Khazar. I'm taking Rhisereld on a journey to see Laurellin! Akorta and I will escort her saftely. The undead are attacking. I swore to defend Rhisereld with my life! Akorta went off to fight the undead, and apparently it got messy. It is now over. Akorta, Rhisereld and I are headed off to a new village! Rhisereld, Akorta and I are moving into the village! Rhisereld's brother decided to tag along as well. I'm so happy I'm surrounded by friends. Growing awfully close to Rhisereld. I really do like her. \n A lot has happened since I last wrote in this diary! Akorta has had terrible things happen to him. And he has turned to being a mercenary. He's asked me to join him, but I have no choice but to decline. Especially because of my friends here at home. I would hate to do that to them, especially my best friend Rhisereld.  Rhisereld and I are here, i'm telling her the bad news About Akorta. He told me she's already with someone. I don't know what to say to that now. I want to love her, hold her, and cherish her with everything I have. Protect her with my life. Although I'll admit, deep inside I find it somewhat wrong to fall in love with a human. I just, can't help myself. This is going to be hard. I can't be selfish. But as long as I can, I will fight for what's right. Even if it means I don't get the perfect mistress in the end. Rhisereld, if you ever read this, I hope you realize it's not your fault. I just can't be around someone who I want to be with but can't. This happens to me all the time... and it's painful. I hope we meet again, but when I get my head straight. I will miss you. So very much.  \n \n A lot has happened since I last wrote in this. I never knew you'd become undead. I thought you were trying to save Natheus. But what you did will only destroy him. I will miss Rhisereld more than ever before, because the Rhisereld I knew is gone. I will never be the same. This is turning me into someone I've never wanted to become. \n There's still hope for Rhisereld! \n I know she's not gone completely! I just hope it's not too late. She's with the undead, they filled her with hate! I'm sounding like a poet, I need to shut up, get on my feet. Make sure they are gone, and destroyed in defeat! I know Rhisereld isn't interested in me. I'm just an elf. But there's nothing she can do about how I care for her. Absolutely NOTHING. No matter how many times she attacks me, spits in my face.... kicks me to the ground. Beats me with everythign she has, tries to make me hurt, suffer, scream in agony. .. As long as I live, she will have no choice but to deal with me! Diary, thanks for letting me rant to you. I'm going to get Rhisereld back. I know she wants to be bad, but I won't let her! For there is so much good left inside her. I've seen it, experienced it. She's a wonderful person. And by knowing that, I can fight hard. Get torn apart by whatever the undead throw at me. A tug of war between the undead and me. That's what it is. I'm outnumbered... Only Rhisereld can choose. I may be wasting my time. ....... *erases that last sentence* She's worth it.", ""),
        StaticBook("My diary", "jeremybombed", "Well today i sat in a library , Sat on a ladder, Sat on a bed, Sat on a chest, Sat on a workbench what else can i sit on? Today i saw an undead, it was scary, he attacked us with zombies and pigmen", ""),
        StaticBook("My diary", "Pepernoot", "Hello diary I made a lot of money today! I still have a lot of supplies, so I could open my own shop soon \n", ""),
        StaticBook("My Diary", "carrots084", "Dear Diary, today I went mining, and farming, I can't wait for day again. Oops, i need to Sleep. I'm nearly dead. Ahhh... haven' been writing lately, but now Skills are in, and I am a level 10 black smith!!! I am a level 21 mining, and I can make bridges and gates! Yay. I am so happy. I love making bridges. That is all :):):):):)", ""),
