        StaticBook("My final days.. Made by Niko.", "Ratemenatorz59", "It is a few days before my death, I stand before Al'khazar, singing praises to Iblees . The wind blowing on me, moving my cloak. It seems I have been forgotten, my friends, they do not know me. I grow weary as the night passes, I find no shelter. I instead decide to live on the roof, nothing more, nothing less. As I walked through the road, a guard spotted me. I was instantly taken to prison, I was accused as an undead, I was beaten. They have decided to burn me, they walk me to the town square. They put a torch over my head, I will die.", ""),
        StaticBook("my first stry", "Qwertyasdman", "I try to rite betta evryday", ""),
        StaticBook("My Fondest Memories", "XxDukesterxX", "Well Decora, Where do I start? You have truelly broken my heart. We used to kiss like we didn't care, But know I try but Decora's not there. Remember the day when we first met?, You where a beautiful, Lovely, kind Silhouette. I asked to help you and protect you for a while, And then it lead to a Long Love tale. Months went buy of Kissing and Flirting, And my oh my, you kept hurting. My heart had never thought to parry, Which is why I then asked to Marry. You looked at me with your twinkling brown eyes and said, We shall be together until one be dead. We moved into a home Big and beautiful, But after some time it was no longer fruitful. The dead took you and locked you away, and you grew weaker day after day. I tried and I pushed but it was not Sucessful, And then things began to be a Little Eventful. Your Memories where blank and no longer there, And you gave up on me in the Manor over there. You shouted and you screamed Leave me Alone! So I went away with no Back-bone. Hope had been lost she now hated me, And now i'm alone begging with Plead. Don't you remember? Your Lorian of Old?, If you do not then I shall not be told. I wish you happiness in the Darkness of Hell, I just wanted to here that loud Wedding Bell. Lorian_The_Lonely.", ""),
