        StaticBook("My Journal in the Verge", "omar1296", "As I was walkin' I found a mysterious portal. After a long decision i decided te go in. I entered a dark place, almost completely devoid of life. I could see nothing at all. I walked on, dodging monsters as they passed. I reached stairs , and climbed them . I was surprised te find a group of people who were getting ready to explore . I went with dem, and we arrived at a barred area. Thee bars were to strong te break, but I tried te find a way in. When I looked back, everyone was gone. I walked around helplessly, and found a stranger who has been hospitable to me. We wandered around, though we should've made shelter. We got attacked by a pigman, and he didnt survive. I have been on the run for days after that, getting attacked by monsters. I came across someone, and he took me to a castle of some sort. He treated my wounds and provided me with shelter. People came and went, and it's time i went too.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Journal of Tings!", "sparten4ever92", "Me and Bone are brothers. My mommy is Princess Aliciana She is mean sometimes but pretty and loving. *She pushed me down a stairs yesterday It hurt alot I like to write and Book man said it good for me So I do it. BOne fixed my voice I like BOne da best he is best brother ever ch I love Bona and Mommy and Book Guy and Librarian Man and Grandpop king a lot.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Journey", "leirfald", "Headed out from Laurelin and went east until I came to the new Warden Outpost. Stayed out the night in the cave where I mined some coal when I made my first shelter. I am headed further East to new lands, and hopefully undiscovered forests. On the 31st of Suns Smile, 1308 I dug into the earth to escape the dangers of the Night... I hear the zombies and skeletons outside...making ungodly sounds...I pray for daylight. Came upon a natural evation in the landscape, this will be my new home. I have started building a house up in the trees....home is where the trees are..an elven proverb.. I am tending the nature around me...replanting trees..praying for those I claim. I am making offerings to the mother daily, I am hereby fasting until my home is done . \nI believe I have been planting the 2 trees for every one I fell and the Mother has seen kindly on me; I found an underground spring, the freshest and clearest water. No wonder the trees around here are growing so nicely. I have started eating again, I had a feast, ate 6 apples in one sitting. I am stuffed. I am now sitting in silence. Silence is a rare thing now that he undead have started coming to my doorstep. They seem to be attracted by the telling signs of my daytime activites. Yesterday I almost fell to my death fending off a zombie . as a countermeasure I have now made two 2 meter high \"walls\" outside my tree. I am hoping this will keep them away. On a positive note, I have planted 4 trees on my roof...my very own little tree top \"garden\". It is where I go early in the morning to meet the sunrise. It's getting late, I am turning in. \n Itnan, 9th of The Amber Cold, 1308 \n I am happy and content here in Nae'leh Emereld Tower...but I am getting lonely. I long for some company...maybe I should head towards Laurelin again, I am afraid I am neglecting my Ravenhold Guard duties, yet maybe I can share this place with my brothers-in-arms. \n After watching the sun rise and set these past few days I realise I have mistaken my earlier geographical directions. I went south from Laurelin, not east! Had I not figured it out I would surely have been lost in the wilds. \n \n \n I am done writing in this book for now...will write more when I can spare the time. \n started my journey back home today. Can't believe it's been a whole year I've been gone. Heading straight north I have now laid quite alot of ground under my feet. I'm tired. Found shelter in a tree, I hope it'll keep me away from harm. it's the night of the 31st of Suns Smile, 1309 \n On my second day of travel, continuing north, I came to my old shelter just north of serpentridge. If I head east I should come upon the Warden Fort. I shall spend the night here. Started going east, was met by skeletons. Damned if I am going to die when I am so close to home. A spider has found my shelter, I can hear it outside. Should I not survive... \n If someone should find this book, I am Aegnor Felagund, wanderer of the wilds...actually inhabitant of the wilds. I have learned much this past year, and should it be my last I am happy to say that it has been one of the best of my 287 here in Aegis. \n \n ... - End of Journey - ...", ""),
        StaticBook("My Journey", "Condorf", "I have finally established myself as a farmer and a hunter", ""),
        StaticBook("My Journey of Aegis", "Ruakik", "Today I vist Oren. It is cold there, and I find a strange helmet outside the capital. Being stupid, I slide it on, and now find it diffucult to take off. I wrote a song today. \n Oh, the birds! The Mountains! The soaring wind! Who doesn't want, Freedom within! -Endsong. Today, I explored most of Oren, even venturing into the North. I felt a chill up my spine, and decided to turn around, knowing undead might be near. Though something compelled me to move forward... something dark and cold. I resisted the urge, and spun rapidly, escaping a spider as I went. Today I found myself stranded in the middle of a frozen wasteland. Not knowing what to do, I picked up a piece of ice and threw it, in frustration. I then heard the most vile, ear bleeding sound I had ever heard. I went to investigate, finding the strangest creature under the ice. It had tentacles, four mouths, and a horn on it's head. I fear for Aegis if this creature is the spawn of an undead corruption. I made a short visit to Kal'Uruguan today, and I came upon a pecilier sight. I saw a Dwarf forging a giant axe, one that struck a chord of violence in my Goblin heart. The axe was pitch black, and a tinge of blue run throughout it. Maybe one day I could learn to forge with such mastery. On this day, I went wandering through the Northern reaches of Oren again, embracing the snow that I now find so wonderful and cold. Today I sit by a large pond, marveling the water's beauty. A pig sits across from me, and I realize I have not eaten in a few days. Taking my sword to it, I slaughtered the pig and ate my meal. While this might seem a menial, pointless thing to point out... I find it strange that I felt no remorse, and simply killed the animal. I still have the helmet on, and for some reason, I am beginning to hear whispers in my mind. This cannot be good, though it might be the fact the helm is muffling my hearing. : This is now two weeks after I have left the Grove (( MC TIME )) I have been confused as an undead a few time, with this dark helmet on. My ties with nature are beginning to wane slightly. I've no idea why. I now feel this strong pulling to anything cold. I feel detached from my past, as if I should start anew. I shall change my name to Kuroth. I shall begin to tell people this is my name, as no one can really tell if I am lying about this. Perhaps one day I will be Ruakik again. I shall head back to Laurelin today, not to the Grove, but to appreciate it;s beauty. While I hate to admit it, a sudden greed has come upon me for minas. I visited Salion's bar today, and then looked at the Undead ruins. The ones of the once evil city, that is now cobble, mossystone, and water. I killed a few zombies today. I came across a strange fair today. I got the helmet off. I think I should return to the Druids now, as I have seen alot.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Journey Through Aegis And Beyond", "dacorn123", "so... would i be taught by the laurelin guildmaster? archmage, may i have another book", ""),
        StaticBook("My journey Through Aiges: Tree Top Inn", "Whiteterrain", "It was a tough journey in the beggining. But I made it through, and found a \"home\". Lirinya (the ladylord) was very kind and invited me to stay. I felt really welcomed.  I had a mission here, it was by helping the village grow in wealth and power. I knew I am doing a little part in power by being in this village, but I wasn't so sure in wealth. My goal is to improve on the wealth part.  Today I have expirienced my first argument. It was with Alexander, I'm pretty sure he doesn't like Orcs. I don't blame him, Orcs have the power and skill to beat a small community like this one. He told me and tried to escort me out of this place but i denied I stood right infront of him and his sword and took it like a man. Soon Larinya helped me out. He told Alexander to back off but he denied. I tried to stay as calm as possible but at the same time defend myself. As Larinya escorted him away from me I made a sign and set it on a tree near the entrance saying \"Stay civil or get out\" After I'm done posting the sign Alexander came up to me and told me he was sorry, I forgived him. I was lucky to get out of that situation easily but I will encounter another problem like that and maybe it might be worse. anyways after that scene I walked pass the bulletin board with all the owner name on. I saw Alexander's name on and I was shocked. I treated him with disrespect, and him and his crew build this place. I felt bad, but luckly we made up. \n Today I build a trade shop near the lake. I'm planning to raise money for villages like this one. Now is about 7:00pm and tommorow I'm going to collect LOADS of wood It has been the next day and I collected loads of wood, made a trading shop. Now I need to spread the word of the trade market maybe to the paper boy. That's  one task, the other I need to get lots of wood chicken egg, milk and sugar canes It has been the next day when I discovered something weird. My chest that was locked and hidden with my wood supplies are gone! Later during the day I walked back to my room and discovered that someone had left my door opened! I'm not sure who but I'm pretty sure that this person also stole the paintings that I placed behind my chair. As I walked towards the chair I found that someone or something tried to burn my house! Maloha had found out that Azure wasn't a pretty girl and instead Azure was a guy.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Journey to the Nether", "ariczzz1892", "Finally. After two days and two nights of walking i reached the city of the Undead in the North \nI can't find an entrance to the city, so i will continue traveling north. Maybe i will find the Portal there.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Kills. To be assassinated.", "BannanaToYou", "Cerberus(WizardInACan)) Deceased \n High Constable Of Alras ((Sir_Wyrvernos)) Deceased \n High King Syrio ((MediocreGamge)) Partially Damaged \n Random Man ((N/A)) Deceased \n Random Man ((N/A)) Deceased \n Orc ((N/A)) Deceased \n Elf ((N/A)) Deceased \nRothius ((Rothius)) Deceased", ""),
        StaticBook("My Lady", "TheRedNinja", "I have never tired of love for you, my Lady, nor will I while I live: but hatred of my self has reached its end, and I am weary of continual weeping: and I'd rather have a plain stone sepulchre, than your name be written as author of my hurt, on some marble: where my body's laid without my spirit, that might still remain with you. So, if a heart full of loving loyalty can satisfy you, without causing harm, favour me now by granting mercy. If your disdain wanders some other way seeking to be sated, and finds nothing worthy: then Love and I will receive sufficient thanks. My love...Ivrae", ""),
        StaticBook("My last act as General", "Angelus_Obscurus", "I know that I left suddenly, and since it was so suddenly I forgot to be a successor to my role as General of the Whispering Order, So I choose... Rhisereld, She will stay on as the General of the Order until he dying breaths. \n : That is all, \n \n ~Akorta", ""),
        StaticBook("my last words", "WaZeBoomBox", "this is to all my friends and my family. i am probably already dead if you are reading this . If not then dont bother looking for me , i have or been killed by an assasin of Quazar or i have killed myself", ""),
        StaticBook("My Lfe at Crater Lake Village", "baigoth", "Today i was travaling to a town or village for a place to life and be safe from the undead intell i sore a big black shadow coming strate to me, i got my sword and when i was about to swing my iron sword i sore that the big black shadow was my freind Vistaug. Vistaug is a big breen orc that loves to smash undead heads and is the bravist orc i ever seen before in my life. Vistaug wanted to tell me something and he said \"Bagoth i want you to help me start and make a village with me because no humand would want to join a orc village so i need a humand like yourself to join and help run the village so what do you say?\" \"ok,\" i said puting my sword away \" ill help you with starting the village.\" \" good,\" said Vistaug with a smail on his big green face \"I am happy to see you wanna join my village wellcome abord my humand frend.\"", ""),
        StaticBook("My life", "Onslaughted", "I lived in a small village out in the wild with my family in a nice farmhouse. Intill one day a gang of orcs invaded the village! Burning the houses as the walk by and kill read", ""),
        StaticBook("My Life", "hayden34666", "Deep in the ocean, and cast away. \n Where innocence is burned in flames \n A million mile from home, I'm walking ahead \n I'm frozen to the bones, I am.. \n A soldier on my own, I don't know the way \n I'm riding the Heights of shame \n I'm waiting for the call, the hand on the chest \n I'm ready for the fight, and fate \n The sound of iron shocks is stuck in my head, \n The thunder of the drums dicates \n The rhythm of the falls, the number of dead's \n The rising of the horns, ahead \n From the dawn of time to the end of days \n I will have to run, away \n I want to feel the pain and the bitter taste \n Of blood on my lips again \n This deadly burst of snow is burning my hands, \n I'm frozen to the bones, I am \n A million mile from home, I'm walking away \n I can't remember your eyes, your face. \n Though your name, remains. \n x-1965 \n Y 65 \n Z-195 \n F 2 \n Bah! some writings i made in my past...", ""),
        StaticBook("My Life", "Aerolus", "My first two years I grew up in the Great Orc City, where I was abandoned by my parents. I was found by a young girl, just 14, and she cared for me for a while. But one day, she just.. Disappeared. A Royal Guard took caring for me, and he took my up to I Indelwhen's Tower, and just pushed me off. Luckily for me, I landed in the river. I was all battered, bruised, and hungry. I floated down the river, and was discovered by Sal, the Mage Teacher. He took me to Prince Ebs, where Ebs cared for me until now. This book. It's my life. Yes, Oops this isn't my journal.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Life", "starkiller2010", "My name is Aquilus and I am the only survivor of an old village near the millitary village of Winterfell. As a kid, I have been beaten up and tortured by Orc troops who came to my village in search  for   an old relic who once belonged to the Monks of the Temple of Aegis. They killed everbody except for prisoners and me. I do not know why they spared me, but I know that one day I will have my revenge so that my parents  have not died in vain...", ""),
