        StaticBook("My Secret Diary", "Vaquxine", "Today I met a man named availer. He was sexy. To be continued ... My keyboard is loud. This is my book :). I'm excited with this to... I'm going to make the magic plugin myself, it will be epic :). Can't wait to start working on it ;D. They see me rolling... They codinggg This book is on sale for 1000 minas a copy. Contact Vaquxine. (High_Shaman_Or'gok).", ""),
        StaticBook("My sincere apolgies.", "xNoTiiFy", "Dear King Enor, My friends and I came in here earlier. While you were in a very important meeting. I apolgize for disrupting such, and figured I'd give you this apology letter. Best wishes. - Head Dragon Slayer.", ""),
