        StaticBook("My story", "monkeyop", "I was a large baby for a human. i was given the name Soap becease i would always chush soap Then one day i was captured by Orces and was taken to there kingdom where i grew up When i became an adult i was treated as a human and a orc so i was going to ally humans and orces But on the way we were attacked by flying devils the Undead! out of the 100 that had come only 20 survived. and the orces blamed me for the attack and so i was banished now he lives in an area call KoTF ready to kill you at any moment what are you doing no i can now someone is a dumb fuck", ""),
        StaticBook("My Story", "mattr41018", "I, am an elf. At first, I was a High elf, The most galant and magical of them all. But was not to last, an evil witch, store my powers, and tturned me into this... A dark elf, purple skin, red eyes, I look like I might be evil. Some fear me, some hate me, but why does it have to BE me? Why couldn't it have been any random elf wizard? Why me? what did I do? I need to figure this out . I never wanted to have this happen... All i wanted was to be normal. The power came with the race... But now, I can't even cast a spell... Why...", ""),
        StaticBook("my story", "200122", "my store my store one time i was runing home and i went boom. and i did not exsplod i flow throw the sky and played the dead dance. at tnhe momet i woke op from bed and was not dead or geting healed by the monks. and i played outside a long time with my brother jack wenterstof.", ""),
        StaticBook("My story", "moop123", "Welcome to my story... I Orethy am a common dark elf poor and homless and this is how i got to become the power i am today !", ""),
        StaticBook("My Story.", "Leopled1", "My life. it has been made of so many things. The very beggining was even hard. Harder than i knew. because i was only a baby. On that dark night, My mother had passed away after giving birth. My father was forced to raise me on his own, With the loss of a loved one My father, Lorithin, Was a strong man. A brave elf from the far reaches of Islindar He had lived in Islindar the whole of his life. Trying to keep a well being for him and my mother. But all that he had after my mothers passing, was me. As i grew up. I had to learn the basics of life. To walk and talk, Understand and learn more I do not remember. But i know that i learnt fast. At an early age. my father taught me the way of using a bow. I was first taught the basics. \"What is a bow\"  I learn't the special tecniques that my father had mastered over the years. And grow into becoming a true huntsman of the wilds. But i didn't use my bow only for the hunting of day to day life At times, Me and my father had to fend orcs. Blood thirsty, Ravaging orcs. But that, was in my later life. Everything i had learnt was out of my father I knew no other person than him, As we lived out far from cities and villages, in a little hut on our own", ""),
        StaticBook("My Strange Acting....", "gombie", "Today, i was so thirsty... But not the normal kind of being thirsty... I ran into the wilds going frenzy. My eyes turned black and i couldn't controll myself. im thirsty... Is the only thing i remembered when a dead sheep covered in blood was infront of me. I was shocked but i wasn't thirsty anymore i didn't know what i did... With blood over my clothes and hands i washed myself at a nearby river. The other morning i couldn't even go into the sunlight it burned on my skin. what i did.", ""),
        StaticBook("My suggestions", "saromon50", "get the darn place regioned to avoid greifers! XD just my 2 cents", ""),
        StaticBook("My Suggestions for Initiate Promotions", "OniHonoo", "1:  Initiate Wildthorn (RP).  hellyeahz (MC). 2: Initiate Rodwen (RP).  om_bananas (MC).", ""),
        StaticBook("My Sweetheart", "itechify", "So often when I am embracing you, \nIt seems that you exist in this world \nonly because of me and I exist because of you. \nIt's not easy to wander in this world \nand not lose one's way, \nbut the greatest happiness of all \nis in giving joy to one's beloved. \nAnd if the king can have his throne, \nand if the bird can have his Spring nest, \nand God can have his heaven, \nthen I, my sweetheart, I can have you!", ""),
        StaticBook("My thoughts", "monkeychez", "", ""),
        StaticBook("My thoughts", "om_bananas", "It is not often that I choose to chanel my thoughts through writing. However today I am makin g and excpetion. Whist heading to oren I chanced upon a group of uruks taking tolls along the road from humans. I of course realized that this was a result of the recent attack on Kramroe decided I would help them both to ensure peace with the uruks and to make sure justice was done to the humans. Later of course one of the humans we had taxed came back with a group of soldiers who immdiatly attacked us upo sight. We engaged them and with the strength of the orks and my sword and bow we drove them back. However that day was the first time I took a life. No not the life od an animal a human  three in in fact. It was an odd feeling knowing I was able to best three in combat. During during the battle it actually seemed quite exhilerating. But nearing the end of battle I realized the full implactions of what I had done and I have yet to decide if what I feel is pride or sorrow \n Rodwen Eternal Guard of the Wardens", "")
    )

