        StaticBook("My travels In the mountains.", "boodilly", "Day zero. I set out walking about noon with only my trusty iron sword for protectinon. \n \n   First day. As I am walking I see a cave about the perfect size to be a home; exactly as I had imagined. I settle in and make basic items like torches, a furnace, a workbench, food, and a sleeping mat. \n Day 2. I walk outside and am stunned to find a foul slime nearby. I decide to stay away. I start a small mine in hopes of finding iron .", ""),
        StaticBook("My undead encounters", "similan", "yesterday a elf showed up near my house with a sword and armour. I asked where he was going and he said there where undead near So I asked how did he knew that he said that the the thunder sounds where from undead magic and they where on rampage! He asked if he could store some valubale stuff here and I asked if I could come with him (not knowing the power of undead magic) he said yes. So i grabbed my sword and took off When we arrived at the battle i saw many wounded soldiers but no undead! I asked whee they where but they said they dind't know! Then in a split second a thunderbolt apears and hits me and some other people! I was lucky not to be om fire but some of them where. Then i saw undead i trided to flee but there it was again the thunderbolt! this time it hit me. When i waked up i saw the monks of the cloud temple. They said that i was in pretty bad state but there magic helped me. When i was on my way to my house I saw the undead battle. I was still weakend so i hid next to some guards. I was almost ready to run for it when BOOM the guard house was on fire! The guards where running to the guard house while some warriors and knights came to defeat the undead. They drove the undead back to there tainted realm and I could go home and sleep.", ""),
        StaticBook("My Undead kill list", "brodz1", "today Me and a orc killed two suspected undead. We made them enter Al'Kazar, one died from the exposure to the taint but the other wasnt harmed, we quickly changed that. They both wore dark robes and one had cursed us in a strange language... \n I've gone out to look for more undead... got attacked by three pig zombies that burst into flamng beast!", ""),
        StaticBook("My Villainous Adventures", "brent42817", "\n So far I have not become a villain. I will write when I do", ""),
        StaticBook("My Vision", "Bgrape", "I had a vision. It happened when I encountered the undead's base. The first vision was of the land torn apart by the hands of Iblees and his legion of the undead. The second was of five warriors standing up to Iblees and the undead. One of the warriors was an elf Another was a dwarf, then a human, an orc, and finally a pale faced man. All of this happened while I had fainted in front of the great druid tree. From Demor Novee.", ""),
        StaticBook("My_growing_suspicions", "Houstonruss", "I have recently contacted several members of this town And I have a splitting sense I have been living with the undead... While mining one day, I stubled upon a small room underground, It was a holder to an extremely interesting peice... A book, With the location of an undead base. Maybe it was picked up and placed there by a mortal- for they saw it as important. Maybe it was placed by the writer.... An eveil soul.... Or lastly, I am going insane....... ..   .          . (last page of book is ripped out))", ""),
