        StaticBook("Mylas' Diary", "Architecus", "Today, I went on a walk. I saw Two Ebs, I ran away. I then cried for about 20 minutes. And now I'm in lightning. WHAT WAS  THAT? Lighting is scary.", ""),
        StaticBook("MyMind", "12igon6", "Hello future self.  Or anybody reading this book. I will proceed to write down what comes to my head as I go on along guard duty now. The world around me is showing its true colors. As I sit here now I know that underneath Aegis's Golden exterior, is a blackened center. The UAC has been breached not only from the lower ranks. But from the upper in the case of Latsi and Wango. I am loyal and true to the UAC and the Ascended.  But should my heart blacken I wish to say that I am truly sorry to hear of this. I wish to say that I don't know what we are going to do.  Im a lost sheep with a shepard sway ing But I know our goal, I know we will succeed. The undead will fall.  They will be sent right to the bowels of hell. Wango is like Brutus to me. He was my friend.  My comrade, my companion. E tu brute?  I believe thats the feeling.  \\ I will make sure that his head is planted right on the front gate of Haven. And his body cut and placed on stakes, then sent to each capitol. I am not an enemy you want.  I will hunt you down.  I am Implacabilis, I am ferinus, Do not forget this. On a lighter note I hope that the future reader, be it me or another.  Have a good day. Well Martin is dead.  Kootry has resigned. Sornof is Governor.  The whole world is honesly fucked to hell. Well, im the new General for the UAC. Im hopefully going to change this place, for the better of everyone.", ""),
        StaticBook("Myst, A History", "Volutional", "Born and raised in Al Kazar, Myst is a calm Seer, in search for someone. Ofcourse he won't publisize his search for them, but he said that only. it is believed he has a power to know when evil is afoot, and other such senses. Myst was blind since birth, but knows what the land looks like, through feel. (You may use this as it isn't META) He Also uses the forgotten tower near Oren", ""),
        StaticBook("Mysterious Book", "BannanaToYou", "You will be assassinated in the upcoming week, hope you can live with the thaught of dying   . \n Any time and day I could strike, the time is yours, Use it wisely.... *You shiver*", ""),
