        StaticBook("Mysterious note", "Ep152", "Here, friend. Take these clothes. They will guide you. Stay strong. \n \n I am and was always still with you. \n \n *In the chest you also find some new armor*", ""),
        StaticBook("Mysterious' journal", "funkymonk195", "Day 1: \n Hi, my name Baragodor and this is my journal of my adventures in the world of Aegis. Everyone calls me mysterious for some reason and no one actually knows my real name which is Baragodor. \n \n We start my adventure in Alkhazar, the Human capitol. I'm a Human and my house is in Alstion town which is to the north of Alkhazar. I'm going there now actually. just waiting for the guards to open the gate.  Off i go. I'm in my house now. I'm gonna go to bed now, i have a splitting headache.", ""),
