        StaticBook("Note", "Afro_Panda", "We have left pork for you. Klargus & Hrothgar", ""),
        StaticBook("Note", "Archmage_Cataris", "Hello friends, I have just currently gone to my house near Winterfell to pack this up. Ill be back shortly! - Cataris conDoin", ""),
        StaticBook("Note", "a98x", "Dear Petyr, My name is Arnh Junns.  I recently corresponded with you about the upcoming DunFest.  I have set up a small home on the outskirts of town.  I hope you will approve of this.  I stuck with the architecture you already have. Please write back to me or send a bird if you can.  Signed, Arnh Junns (a98x)", ""),
