        StaticBook("Note For Hysagi", "GeneralKaun", "I can only get on maybe wendsday or the weekend, And may I have that room?", ""),
        StaticBook("Note for the King", "w1lll", "Your Highness, I have discovered an Undead fort of some kind to the north of the Wall of the North. Signed, Oren Sgt. Thaern.", ""),
        StaticBook("Note for Valon", "DarkSoundwave", "If anyone harms ya please let me know. I'll gladly lock em away and ensure an execution. Kjell please give this to Valon when she comes out.", ""),
        StaticBook("Note from Delaselva", "Jallentime", "I was wandering around the Verge and found your house out here. Left you some iron in this chest.", ""),
        StaticBook("Note from Gjon", "Gjon3", "Kamees, 19th of The Grand Harvest, 1321 \nTo whom it may concern, \nIf you are reading this, then I, Gjon, am most likely dead. I have gone out to avenge my family. I thank everyone at AFF who helped me, but now I must go. I have left some things in these chests for you to make use of. Farewell, friends. \nYour friend, \nGjon", ""),
        StaticBook("Note from Milamber", "Cowsgomooand", "Friends, I write this note with haste as I am currently besiged by the terrors of the night . \n \n I have arrived back from my travels to dicsover Al'Khazar in ruins, broken by the might of the undead. \n I will attempt to seek out  Kal'Urguan to take refuge there with the Dwarves. \n \n Seek me there. \n \n Signed, Milamber -Tolta, 24th of The First Seed, 1339", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to aedan", "Botar", "Im sorry for the pills to have a bad effect... need more tests. Do not worry the effects will wear off soon. Again Im sorry, things will get better Your friend, Botar", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to Ciar", "DecoLamb", "When you open this chest I probably wont be around... I want you to have everything inside its all yours... Dont show or tell broxigar I dont think he would like me giving you all of this. I've had my eyes on you for quite sometime since we've first met, and I must say I'm slowly growing fond of you.. I know you're with broxigar, but I fear that I cannot control my lust for you. Enjoy these gifts I hope to see you soon -Delfyr", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to Elindor", "duramon", "Dear Elindor in future do NOT remove structures on the inns land Without the express permission of a landlord and knowing all the facts Especially if said structure is made of obviously expensive materials. That was a quarter-built Dog Kennel for my Dogs and MY soon to be home. You are not a landlord and the area is magically sealed so that only Landlords and people we add to the seal can build if anything is there its there for a reason and you do not have the authority to even touch them. Yours Sincerly - A very angry Strife", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to Fae", "moop123", "Dear Fae, \n     Would you like to go on a \"date\" some time ? there is no one els i have found like you on my journeys I think a bite to eat a a bar would be fun. \n Yours seceriliy Leoni Johonas", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to freya", "Botar", "right This is a note for freya from botar blackrock... for her eyes only freya the situation has gotten worse.. me and a scout name dante have found out that the undead are useing decora for bait.. lureing people to there deaths trying to save her we need to talk out a place for vardak was about to rush the place before i found him we need a plan.. we need a army.. come talk to me", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to Rattalyn", "Xeniith", "It seems you're going to be joining the Wardens. This means our paths end soon. I can't take being away from you, and it seems that it's going to be all too common. It's likely for the best, not that you even need me around, seeing as you don't care about me   the way I do to you. Until our paths meet again.", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to Shoi", "Sairia", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to Strife", "Jerry_Man", "I do apologise for dismantling it. As I said I still have the materials somewhere safe for you. The structure in progress looked like graffiti as only one wall was erected. I didn't think that area was protected as it is behind the storage room which is unprotected. From my perspective it looked like someone's initials. I look forward to seeing the finished doghouse.", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to the King, from Tarus", "IlumTarus", "Dear King Enor, \n I write to you know, inquiring on any openings in the Oren Government for someone like me... To serve his people with higher purpose and resolve.  I am willing to do any task or trial of character or person in order to achieve my ambitions as a member of the Oren Government. \n Cheers and good day, Eze'kiel Tarus.", ""),
        StaticBook("Note to White Haired Elf and the Noble Warriors of the North", "Sairia", "Dear Nice People, Thank  you so much for taking me into your home to allow me to be around your lovely crops and the Tree of Life. I have felt very welcome until recent events have occured in the farms at the mighty keep in the north. I feel like I am no longer wanted or needed around you or your crops. I felt singled out in an act of attrocious attacks upon nature. for those that do not know my farms and I have been the victim of two heinous crimes against nature. The first being the removal and replanting of the trees in the tree farm, but instead of trees in one spot, they left a ginormous mushroom. This act had effected me so much that apparently I blacked out hunting down the person who did the act. This was unacceptable because apparently I hit a friend, this is unacceptable as to I am somewhat a pacifist. Second act was someone came into the wheat farm and plucked out not one spot of dirt, as if it were an accident, but knocked out several, and placed cobblestone in its place. they even left a sign stating how \"the lands appeared trampled or tampered with\" This act literally made me cry and forced myself into seclusion in the room below the tree farm. So I feel that I am no longer wanted here amongst you all, if this is not the case I do not know where you will find me. maybe in the wilds somewhere or alone in some big city lost, alone and cold. I am sorry for any wrongs I did to anyone that would make them act in such away. Farewell and goodluck - Aleryn", ""),
        StaticBook("Note's", "Juggernogg", "Shops door left open MAKE SURE TO CLOSE IT", ""),
        StaticBook("Notebook fer Everythin'", "ljcrzynfree19", "Apallo wants 3rd tu th' right in poor 'ousin (Apallo123)", ""),
        StaticBook("Notebook: Maegen Case", "Shuness", "This is my first case as a Miltia, and... well, it's an interesting one. Maegen.. baptism by fire in deed. Well, look at the case file in my library for facts, here's my observations. As it is stated in the file, she seems.. nonhostile, unwilling to kill. I know she probably could ha ve killed me, but she ran instead. Why is that, I wonder..? Has a brother. According to Hayden, durring her escape, Maegen's brother appeared. It ended with the two escaping together. He wears the same robes as her. Perhaps he can be a witness?", ""),
        StaticBook("Notes", "pugsy", "Note to self: Find way to get golden staff. help Editing my skin? Dont use mine! unless it looks diffrent", ""),
        StaticBook("Notes", "Slayer15855", "Crowe-2000 2x basements trade district \n NiNjAxR3M1Xx 500M for leftover basement. \n Hwaldar is showing signs of corruption... \n and slayer saw him for who he was, the foul spawn of the undead god... He fought the taint of evil seeping into his bones... He shouted \"the light of god will protect us!\" \"your evli taint will not spread!\" all the while the foul beast reaked its evil spirit across the land, and Slayer could see what was to come. The time of all lifes test was just to come. \n Grygon ownes 3,000 Minas", ""),
