        StaticBook("Notes", "mdhegs", "The S.S.A. . Secret spies ageis . This is Bone's Field notes. 1. 3 Armed men killed a ascended right before me, One was named guraim. 2. Now three men are trying to take a woman. Guraim was just killed. I am following the men. It seems like they have taken the woman. The woman has blond hair and she looks to be a elf The men just got in a fight with two more guys. This is getting out of hand. They went to Wraths keep, I think the girl is a slave. Three men took the blond girl into the keep, This could be bad. I must help. ...I lost her, Should could be any where. I must find her. I found her in al'khazar, Safe and sound. Case 2:Closed~~~~~", ""),
