        StaticBook("Notes", "Chrome_", "Will told me not to see Jade. I'll remember that. I remember alot of things, Will . I trust Jade with my life. I would glady follow her to my death. I would do the same for Will too. The only problem is that they're against eachother. If I had to pick between the both of them? I'll save that for another time.  My client ran off into the distance. Mission accomplished? Wyrix - 1,000", ""),
