        StaticBook("Notes from Agent", "RHcrow", "Few things \n Ascended plan to rally guilds/armies to lay seige to fort near kramaroe. \n Fort apparently owned by Vrograk. \n I am invited to set up a supply shop near the basecamp when seige occurs. \n Great Business Venture.  Shall make tens of thousands. Agent will inform me of time when ascended plan to seige. Will need to pack wagon \n", ""),
