        StaticBook("Notes on the Imperial Coalition", "Pepernoot", "General: Malachi \n Ambassador: Theofratus \n Lord of the Keep: Arrim \n \n Their fort lies to the east of Laurelin, near the road to the Sister City.", ""),
        StaticBook("Notes To My Brother", "GoldenGFX", "Leon, this is everything I want you to know about me. \n We never got to know each other, but I have watched over you. ~ I was an ascended, I had to blood of an Aengul, you may too. ~ I was a minion of the undead early on ~ Later on, I joined them, which is what I am now. ~ If you have any questions about me, there are two people you should ask, Lotheriel, and Arcadius ~ You could also ask the undead prophet, Vex, he new much about me ~ I leave to you my wealth, a house in south west luarelin, and my things. Ask the prophet for them, ~ I highly suggejest you do not join the undead if you can. It doesn't say who it is from..", ""),
