        StaticBook("OOC Eriks day at the restraunt", "bondb", "I was in the restraunt the other day when i suddenly realized I desperately needed to pass gass. The music was really, really loud, so i timed my gas to the beat of the music. After a couple of songs, i started to feel better. I finished my ale and noticed everybody was looking at me.... then i suddenly realized i was listening to my ipod bahahah", ""),
        StaticBook("OOC to Rhisereld", "Alectriciti", "Hello my friend. I thought I'd write this now incase I forget. Good job on finding this book! I'm not sure what real life future holds at the moment. Life is about to get busy though. College starts tomorrow and i'll probably have little or no time to play on this server. The adventures of Alethion and Rhisereld have been good ones. They're definitely not over I hope! I like to think about what happened to our characters. And apply it to the real world. There are literal dark pathes that will ruin people. Getting out will usually require something special like what happened to Rhisereld. Anyway, I could ramble on about that. I want to commend you for your extraordinary roleplay behavior. It's skill you have there. :) It's just like a good book, or a movie. There's suspense and anticipation the whole way through. And honestly, it draws me into it just like a good story should. I was hoping things ended the way they did, and very content with how it happened. We crafted a wonderful story, my friend. Not just you and I, of course, everyone played a part. There's so much more I could say about this but i've rambled long enough. I want to stay friends and keep in touch with you, you're cool! I'll get time here and there to get on the server, and hopefully you'll be one. I'll leave writings when I can. Maybe Alethion will write more poems or songs. Better ones anyway (he needs practice!). That's all. See you! \n ~Alec", ""),
