        StaticBook("Operation Golden Dancer", "Canadianwarrior", "Mission objective: To intercept and secure the \"Mark\". To prevent possible escape of the mark and to limit civilian contact.\n Mission execution: The operators will be split into three units.\n 1. The Muscle: Tasked to intercept the Mark, make contact and complete the primary objective.\n 2. The Block: Tasked with limiting civilian movement in the theatre of operations  and to offer direct support to unit three.\n 3. The Net: To prevent escape of the Mark if \"the Muscle\" fails in their primary objective.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Operation Undead", "Psiop412", "Groobs and I decided to scout the undead base in the North, We eventually got into the base. I stole one of the undead books that might be useful to the people. But while sneaking through the base, Groobs and I stumbled across a Secret Entrance. This Entrance will get us inside the undead base, and its underground. i checked out the spire and inside the middle of it there is a lever. The Lever im not sure as to what it does, but with this information i believe we can win the fight. Groobs and i will record the location of the entrance and make sure to cover tracks. I will return straight to the camp and wait for General Stonebeard for i fear this information is the most important gathered yet. There were two followers once we got in, but im not sure they will keep quiet. There names are Tamara and Fyrste.", ""),
        StaticBook("Opinion on Druids", "ggt3416", "Disguised as a traveler woman, I waited beneath the Druid Welcome Tent in the Verge for a stranger to come along. After speaking to a few people who had no idea who the Druids are, a human with knowledge of the Druids' existence finally stumbled upon the tent. When asked what his idea of Druids was, he replied, \"Druids are a nature based circle of forest protectors who use magic to help nature.\" On his opinion of Druids, the human admitted that he did not have a liking for them because a Druid had watched a battle between him and a dark elf without intervening.", ""),
