        StaticBook("Orc Dictionary", "meanking", "Ug-Hail Throm'ka-Formal greeting, Yub-Yes Nub-No Gug'ye-goodbye Lat-You Rulg-Thanks Blah-Talk Gruk-Understand Dabu-Yes, My plesure Bubhosh-Big/great snaga-slave Nubhosh-Small/bad Buub-Pig Pushdug-Stinky Glob-Fool Klomp-Attack/kill Flat-Dead Blarg-Home Brudda-Krugma orc. Stowts-Dwarfs Twiggies-Elves Squeal-Halflings Ummies-Humans Skah-Curseword Agh-And Buurz-Dark Mojo-Magic Krimp-Control somebody Uzg-World Goi-City Lusk-Axe Zult-sword Stik-Staff Now here is the Numbers : 1-ash 2-Dub 3-Gakh 4-Futh 5-H 6-H'ash 7-H'dub 8-H'Gakh 9-H'Futh 10-HH This Book was for people not knowing what the orcs say, if you come accros this book, Please do not abuse it. Thank ye' Chaecus~", ""),
