        StaticBook("Orc Vs Zombie", "MuckyD121", "Ash day far far away, der live a Orc who 'as a runt in da Army \n Ash day de Orc left is city Sanjezal to Find ome wood \n De orc went out far away agh got good agh lost, Da Orc got ambushed by undead. Zombies were everywhere, but da fearless runt, took out is Zult and slashed edery Zombie. Da Orc, slashed da last bit of flesh da zombies add on da crusty Boda. Da Orc slashed is way through edery Zombie intill 'E ad no energy left. But den fromoutta nub were He gathers strength agh Klomps Da Last Ord. *Naw dat was a Good Klompin' De End!", ""),
        StaticBook("Orc Warlands Report", "Xight", "The orcs have been hostile lately, as I obserbed upon entering their lands. As I approached the capital of the Orc kingdom, I was shot many angry glares at.  The orcs have grown very versatile and are planning some sort of raid, of where I do not know . They're moral has been high these days, with the raid upon Al'khazar somewhat successful, and another that the warlords are planning. The orcs are very ferocious now, clearly enraged by my presence in their lands and it is due to this hostility, that my report must end here... \n \n Xight's report to Zoe", ""),
        StaticBook("Orc'd", "DefunctDivine", "Orcs, the world's favourite race... They run around comically and are generally the best thing to happen to aegis since the aengul. One particular orc, Urara, I will chronicle in this story...  She has been burned badly by scarring, but still perseveres, showcasing the brute strength of these mighty orcs .\n She has gone so far as to pride herself on this scar, and boasts her strength, which I do not doubt in any way.  Our heroine is a member of the orcish army, and is easily able to dominate the lesser males of her race. \n Our story begins with the war of Oren... \n Urara had been searching for the warlord in the city of Al'khazar,  for she felt an obligation, and stormed the city, searching for the strong orc warlord, Mogroka. Finally, after a few unsuccessful attempts, Urara gave up, and was greeted by an elf, who she was under the impression of being a female. This led to some awkwardness when both she and her friend Thore'Gorkil rubbed the uncomfortable elf's hair down. The elf Identified himself as Delphyr, and the crowd around this group grew slightly larger, while the battle-hardened orcs ran rampart through the city.       .", ""),
        StaticBook("Orcish Alphabet", "Sevenfournine", "Arg, Bar, Co, Dub, Erga, Fo, Gra, He, Igo, Jura, Koh, Loc, Meka, Nota, Ogar, Peh, Qra, Ra , Shak, Tar, Ugo, Veg, Wor, Xudo, Yba, Zeb", ""),
        StaticBook("Orcish Speechcraft", "jdetterline", "\n The owner of this book was purchased from Uggg \n The owner of this book hereby inherits all abilities of the Orcish Speechcraft \n Orcish Speechcraft or what passes for speechcraft are hereby passed along to the owner.", ""),
        StaticBook("Orcish Wit and Wisdom", "Ned_Lud", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Orcish words", "drangob", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Orcs", "Jarhead90", "I have been studying this Orc creatures. They are pure savages. Four of them riped a whole family into peices. Poor souls... \n I think if I deal with the Orcs I shall find more information about the Undead. text I saw them west of my home...Covered in blood..There had to have been gallons on them. I ran towards them with my sword drewn. With one swift strike I decapitated the smallest. Then I moved onto the elder. He was gigatic. His breathe had the stench of death and blood. I thought about my old village. With that fury and rage I killed the Orc and took his iron. With his iron I made my first strong sword. I had a witch enchant it so I would become stronger. ;; It is the day after. A huge storm has became upon me. I see smoke in the distance. Then I see him an Undead lord. I grab my bow and arrows. I drop to the ground. I am as still as water. I pull back my bow. Aiming at the Undead's head. I let go as swift as the wind. Then I black out. I open my eyes and he is gone. Forever gone. My chance for revenge and I blew it. ;; I will find the Undead's camp and I will kill every last one. I can promise you that.", ""),
