        StaticBook("Order's From the King", "langstondog", "I Belin King of Dwarfs order Gliof to collect taxes for the war that's about to start He is given permisson to collect taxes from all dwarfs in the kingdom that will be 100 minas", ""),
        StaticBook("Orders from the king", "TheRedNinja", "All guards are to leave High Commander Storm's base and his men alone we are now at peace with them. /Sign King Edmund Sheffield", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren", "Darksalvo", "The Kindom of Oren is the great kindom of the humans, situated at north of the Aegis temple . Is lead by King Pampeo Perea and by his wife, Queen Dawn. The princes of the kingdom are Rhonin and Brett Perea. The main city of the kingdom is Alk'Hazar, the other city are Whisper Isles and Winterfell", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren", "Jackbjossi", "We watch the city as it trembles, \nright before our eyes. \nThe cities fall in scrambles, \nBut Oren never dies. \n \n \n \n Warriors of the south and north, \nall stand their ground right here. \nWhen our forces join and all march forth, \nThe Undead shall know who to fear. \n \n \nThe king and knights together they stand, \nThe gods are on our side. \n Together Oren shall reclaim it's land, \n And there'll be nowhere to hide. \n \n \nThe rangers fight for freedom, and the guardsmen do for Oren, \nAll the will be remembered to march against the beast, \nDefending this world from the foreign, \nUndead not the least.", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren", "blackhawk77g", "The Kingdom of Oren is quite possibly the most lively and active of all of the kingdoms.  The beacon of hope fer all humans and the barrier between the undead and and the rest of Aegis. Oren will stand the test of time as the nation of trade, war, and prosperity. \n \n ((Oct.10, 2011)) \n King Enor Sheffield has been crowned king of Oren. \n \n ((Oct.12, 2011)) \n A city exists in the sewers near the market district in Oren. Oren has been called better for traders by Jayius, a trader who owns shops in both cities. The Undead atacked Oren, which resulted in damage to Dawn's  Bakery.  The undead then spread to several other cities.", ""),
        StaticBook("oren", "bondb", "High constable felix tryd to kill me", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren", "Plizga123", "Author : Unknown \n Oren is a vast place, this book is a small guide on how to thrive. Sure. You may think you know it all. Welcome! Welcome! this book will show you, you don't! First, yo- mu-t g-__ o th (the rest of the book is unreadable.", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren architect", "fabian9696", "Oren the capital of oren. It has grew alot under the past 1000 years but it still have the same typr of architecture. The tubor style. The tudor style is simple but yet elegant. It's a mix of logs and cloth. noone knows  where it was invented. But all sources points to Alkhazar. But to build a house costs alot of cloth and cloth is not easy to obtain in that amount . But yet we allow to obtain it. ---------------Architects-------------- We architects have built in alkhazar for a long time. We are some of the best in the world of Aegis. When thunder was head architect the building of the castle began. but none of the architects help insteed th eking hired foregin workers for it. We architects insteed built a houses. When the castle was around 30% done Thunder quit as head architec and I became head architect. I then started to build alot of houses in the new sector. I also helped the king with the harbor and with removing old structures outside oren. At that point Alkhazar was on the top of its beuty. The storages was full and houses became more but they still stayed elegant. Later when the kings son Enor took the throne after his father left he fired me. After that alkhazar has been going downwards in beuty. Now with the new part the city is looking worse then it ever did. The houses is not elegant anymore and there is farms amongest the houses. If Alkhazar ever will get as beuty as it once were the hole new area has to be rebuilt Not by the new architects but the old, the classic once. But that will never happend. To build a house like the old ones you have to put love and time on it and not haste thru the building.", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren Founder's Grave -1294,107", "Riznam", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren Guard Handbook", "Jon021", "Congratulations on your recruitment, new guard recruit of Oren. This book will help you make it in the Oren Guard, by giving you instruction in everything pertaining to the Oren Guard. \n The first things you need to know are the ranks. \n Guard Recruit: this indicates that you are a new recruit to the guard. \n Guard: this is someone who has served enough time to become a normal guard. \n Guard Veteran: this is someone who has been on the guard long enough to potentially become a seargent. \n Seargent: this is the first rank who can give orders to lesser ranks, such as: recruits, guards, veterans. \n Lieutenent: this person is high enough rank to recruit people to the guard. He/she only takes orders from the captain. \n Captain: this is the highest rank on the guard. He/she has the power to recruit, give orders to everyone under him/her. \n Now that you know the ranks, you can know about the next most important thing: duties. \n gate duty: the most basic of duties: opening the gate for people leaving. The entry protocol is slightly different. When someone you don't recognize approaches tell them to state their name and business. If their name is not on the wanted lists inside the guard house, you may let them in. If their name is on the wanted list, do not let them in. \n Patrol: when you patrol, you go to the destination ordered and return. When you return, report your findings to your superiors. \n Battle: rarely, your superiors will tell you to prepare for battle. Your superiors will lead you to the battle. When you are in battle just follow your superior's orders and you should be fine. \n There are a few laws in Oren that all guards should know about. Breaking any of these laws is a punishable offense, and should be treated as such. \n Sword drawn in city: the punishment for this offense is normally just a warning; however, if there is a repeated offense, you may fine the offender 50 minas. \n A non-guard in the guardhouse: this is punishable by a fine of 300 minas and a second offense by death. \n Resisting arrest: If an offender resists arrest, you may kill or jail the offender. \n Assaulting a guard: this offense is only punishable by death. \n A copy of the Oren Guard Handbook should be given to all guards and new recruits. \n Written by: Oren Seargent Jon Evaglno Edited by: Lord Gabriel Hightower, Oren Lieutenent Atriana Descartes", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren Guard List", "hayden34666", "Tarl Cabot (georgebg) Janos (benny508) Killzar (Killzar)", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren Guard List", "Cerilean", "---Officers--- \n High Constable Felix (RossssM) \n Captain Hayden (Hayden34666) \n Captain Huron (Onslaughted) \n Lieutenant Thaern (w1lll) \n Sergeant Ceril (Cerilean) \n Sergeant Tamara (luiginova) \n Sergeant Bradford (Plizga123) \n \n ---Guards--- \n \n Oren Guard Ella \n Oren Guard Mystogan (Pandalex12) \n Oren Guard Zod (jr4life24) \n Oren Bowman Johnny (jdsd) \n OPEN SLOT 1 \n OPEN SLOT 2 \n Oren Guard Kashi (lord_kashi) \n Oren Guard Sorrok (sorrok) \n \n ---Recruits--- \n \n Recruit Torque \n Recruit Dun (fabian9696) \n Recruit Edward \n Recruit Silent (silent_slayer) \n Recruit Jack \n Recruit Oneith (kingspiral) \n Recruit Rinru (sbenning)", ""),
        StaticBook("Oren Guard List", "Blundermore", "This Book contains the list of all active members within the Oren Guard. \n High Constable of Oren: \n Felix \n  ((RossssM)) \n \n Captains: \n Captain Hayden \n ((Hayden34666)) \n \n Captain Huron \n ((onslaughted)) \n \n Lieutenants: \n Lieutenant Thaern \n ((w1ll)) \n \n Sargents: \n Sargent Ceril \n ((cerilean)) \n \n Oren Guards: \n Ella ((Ella)) \n \n Mystogan ((pandalex12)) \n \n Zod ((ir4ife24)) \n \n Johnny ((Johnny)) \n \n \n Tamara ((luiginova)) \n Bradford ((Bradford)) \n \n Kashi ((lord_kashi)) \n \n sorrok ((sorrok)) \n Oren Rec. Officer: \n Jerald_Grududa ((Blundermore)) \n \n Recruits: \n \n Torque \n \n Dun \n \n Edward \n \n Silent \n \n Jack \n \n Oneith \n \n Akthar", ""),
