        StaticBook("Patrol report Kramoroe:", "Ratemenatorz59", "In Kramoroe there was no bandits but there was some familiar undead that I have met before. There is a man named Wrath who is walking around that town alot. And it is very usual. That is all I found... But 1 more thing. The man named wrath had armor and was not dressed like an undead. Though I encountered him before with a golden hoe  and summoned zombies at me. That's how I know. Guard duty report: No bandits or wanted or undead or worshippers of iblees. That's all. Fletcher. nevermined that last line", "")
