        StaticBook("Physics Research", "Telanir", "Property of: Telinir \n Telinir's Research on physics and gravity. Gravity: Everything appears to stay locked in place except for sand and gravel. This could be a result of huge MF interference. Items and various objects seem to always fall down. They can be carried by water but when going down are not altered in speed. It seems to fall at the same speed no matter what the object is. \n Physics: Solid blocks like dirt and stone seem to hold the player up no matter how they are supported. Even if the block is in mid-air. (Definite MF interference).", ""),
