        StaticBook("Pigmen a documentation", "Kamberli", "Pigmen are created by the undead. The undead tryed to make a strong soldier for their armies. So they startet to use black magic on pigs. But nothing really works. The most died immediately, the pigs who survived, became malformations and were useless. But one day a storm rise up on the sky. A thunderbolt hit a pig whit malformations and it starts to burn, but it didn't died, it gets to be a pigman! Now the undead startet to hit the pigs whit malformations whit thunderbolt and startet to creat their army and send them out to terrorize the races of Aegis. They were everywhere and the sun did't hurts them. So the wandering wizard speeks a powerful spell to ban them from Aegis. But the undead magic is strong, so they stay on Aegis but now they can't live in the daylight.", ""),
