        StaticBook("Places of Worship in Aegis", "Bubbli", "I have begun to survey the places of worship in this land they call Aegis. I have only just begun, I have visited just a few places at the moment. \n A city the mortals call Kal'Alras have begun const ruction on a rather large cathedral. I will be visiting it quite often. To ensure it is teaching the proper lore and writings and future of this world. Another I have found is in a capital in the land of Oren. A also large chapel indeed, baring the insignia that rests on the Temple of Aegis. Which al so brings me to the that. The Temple of Aegis. This one I will stay away from for the time being. And lastly, I have come across two small churches that run along the \"Kings Road\" as they call it. T hese will be first. They will pose no problems for me. I plan to expand my searches a bit more south . To see what I come across. I will add more on a later date.", ""),
