        StaticBook("Plans For Fionn", "Ranovak", "Fionn: a wonderful, quiet hamlet in the middle of the verge. It was formerly a fort for the wardens but not since the plagues of spiders, slimes and endless nights. Now it's a peaceful place for resting and such. With the guidance of the council I think everything will turn out great. \n Plans \n We need to make the place attractive. We need to finish the walls, the districts, make it more colourful, and stick to a theme. We need to give the town focus. And a place for anyone to relax. I will plan out the following districts: Residential District, Entertainment District, Business District, and Production District. We also need lore and a library. Maybe that's just my old scribe self speaking.", ""),
