        StaticBook("Plants", "Saadiya", "The plump melons rise from the ground, The vines lightly drooping from the ceiling, the smell of the freshly turned soil. I wake up to see these wonderful things. They are the joy, the pride of my life.  \n The joy of plants is the giving. I like to give, they are a much more kind race, and I look to them for learning. This is my life, my whole, my love. Plants.", ""),
