        StaticBook("Plizga123's Journal", "Plizga123", "This is Brad_Plizga's Journal. today, day 1, I walked to the kingdom of Oren. I am trying to find a job. I hope I can find one soon, because to buy a house, I need Minas. This is the end for now. See you on day 2. I now rent a house in Therving Brothers Inn Day 2- Im traveling North, to find my guilds base. I hope its worth it. Its chilli' up here. Didn't bring me heavy jacket. I left the guild. I have applied for Oren Guard. I hop I am accepted! Last night, the humans reclaimed Kramoroe. But, in the verbal reclaim, a war struck out. we are now at war, with the orcs. \n I still haven't recieved word if I was accepted on the guard yet... I sure hope I am. \n Today, I am doing stuff, wars, blah blah, yeah. Tommorrow I get to see if im in the Guard! I sure hope I am. It would be nice. \n Today, Malins welcome, I am just talking to people, as usual. I am also killing monsters for Mina's. I am low on them right now. \n The thervings are creepy...... Very creepy. I am now an Oren Guard Recruit, Im glad! \n Today I am going to depart for the Verge. It's all the talk now-a-days. Al'khazar is empty because of it. Must be good reason....", ""),
        StaticBook("Plot Information", "Dalejin", "Informants \n Elvador-Confirmed by Diplomat Lafthi to be of the Dark Brotherhood Elvador's Undercover Spy, is in fact his brother, name unknown. \nBell- Former Guard of the Whispering Isles, first to inform me of the plot, her informant is Elvador. Has contacts with the Dwarves and Elves. Works closely with Diplomat Lafthi of the Elven city Laurelin, under the High Prince Native. \n Conspirators \n John- Believed to be involved, but as of now I have no hard information tying him to the plot. He is a former Ranger and former Body Guard of the Queen. He was exiled for saying he would kill the Queen. \n Elvador- He is a confirmed Dark Brotherhood member by Diplomat Lafthi, suspisions stand that he is in on the job, no hard information can be confirmed and he seems to be our only precise informant from the Guild. \n Valliant Brazzer- May be his IGN name, sorry for metagaming if it is. I do not know much about him but he is said to be a confirmed member of the guild and is the recruiter of Elvador's mole any other information is unknown. \n Groups Affiliated \n Ex Rangers- Believed to be a driving force in the Guild. They were disbanded just before the Plot was organized. They attempted to join the Pathfinders in Laurelin, but were turned down. \n Ex Pathfinders- The best swordsmen of Laurelin. A number of the split after the Rangers were declined to join them. The split was just before the plot was discovered. They are rumored to have confirmed bandits in their midst. \n A Split from the Orc Legion involved in an attack on the Riverside Guild as well Whispering Isles. \n Plot \n The first confirmed part of the plot is to be an attempted kidnapping of Queen Dawn of Oren. How they plan to do this is unknown. \n Another stage is to take out the leader of the Orcs, what point this serves is unknown. Perhaps to gain a foothold with control of the Orcs and use them in a future attack. \n As well there was talk of them attempting to attack and take out the High Prince of the Elves. To what purpose this serves I do not know. \n The most recent discovery in the plot is that their attempting to uncover a portal. For access to launching an attack on the Undead, a fabled race that has been unseen sinc Iblees walked the lands. \n As of now that is all the information that I have on this matter. I shall fill in more as I learn more and will send a dove to inform you of new updates in the journal. \n Banok Gray informed me today that Bell hired him to watch the High Guardian of the Sentinals. I refused him any information having not heard from Lady Bell on the matter. He seemed rather persistant and nosey. Perhaps he is with us, or perhaps he is one of the conspirators and is attempting to see how much we know. \n Reports have come in that High Guardian Maycto of the Sentinals is in line with Iblees. Some even claim to be able to confirm that he is worshiping Iblees. What this means we do not know. It has also been confirmed that new conspirators have arisen. Elvador is the leader of the Dark Brotherhood and we expect the attack to come from him. Second is a' woman namied Kamiera. I know nothing on this one. Next is Relok. Again nothing is known of him by me. And the last is Leokin Yoleri, Elvador's brother and is the same bandit who was arrested in Whispering Isles. This is what I have heard and what I can confirm since last we spoke. The Pathfinders are working with High Prince Native to uncover who the spy is that has infiltrated the Elven Council. They have not enough information to support and accusation as of yet. But they are looking into it. Banok Gray is with us. He is spying on the HIgh Guardian along with Lady Bell. We are not to contact her in public.", ""),
