        StaticBook("Postal Info", "emberhard", "Postal rates- \n In City 5m \n Within elven Kingdom 15m \n Trans Kingdom 30m \n Directions- \n Use a book in which to write you letter, The title should be \"To X From X\"\" \n The First PAge should be detailed instructions on where and to whom you would like the letter delivered and when I say detailed I mean REALLY BLOODY DETAILED. There should be intructions on what you would like us to do if we are unable to find the place or person in question \n After that Pay the specified amount, Wirte the actual letter and place it in the outbox. \n To pay do /sendminas emberhard <amount> \n If we find ourselfs completly unable to send you mail you will recive a 90% refund! YAY!", ""),
