        StaticBook("Prayers to Aeriel", "sprintindwarf", "In this book you will be tought ways used to pray at altar, on your own or in a confessional. You always remember the acronym ACTS. ACTS stands for Adoration, Confession, Thanksgiving, and Supplimation. this means that first your adore Aeriel in all greatness. After you give adoration, you confess your wrong doings. Then, you give thanks to everything Aeriel has done for you. Finally, you tell Aeriel what you ask, and your prayer may be answered if it is for the right Following these guidelines, you can pray resting asure you are covering all grounds.", ""),
