        StaticBook("Prime's Request", "Darthull", "Hey bastion board said to write a book about what we would see ourselves being in the holmes. I personally would like to be some sort of authority figure in the holmes. I feel more or less that people listen to me and respect what i have to say. A lot of holmes already follow my directions even if they are the same rank or a higher rank then me. I feel like this has to do how i uphold my character and the way he is has always been the leader type. So some sort of high ranking authority head would be my request i realise the ultimate desicon Is yours and of course i respect that and if i sound to bold, dont hesitate to put me in some low rank. I wouldnt mind just being in the holmes and assisting you guys is good enough for me! ((I would also like to note i ran a server with 50+ people on 24/7 so i do demand respect from time   text to time its a old habit. My point is im a good leader and always have been people are text drawn to what i say and respect it. So just a idea if i had a choice i would be a leader", ""),
