        StaticBook("Prince Of Destuctions Jurnal", "Thaddeus12", "it started when the verge had open for all how needed to get away from the undead. Then while i went to get food to feed my new and fresh foresst kingdom,I met a man named chaos . he asked me what would i do if he could give me the power to destro agias. that day i side i would kill my nemesis and destroy all who got in the way. after all of that i told him i have a kingdom we can stay at and take overthe verge he side veary nice and what do you plan to do with this kingdom, I side i wanted to take over the entire ver ge starting with the humans. then move up to orks then dwafs in thare caves but i side to him to leave the elvs alone i care for my race . now we are up to date are roads are geting veary good and we have mines wells and a garden for food , we are also starting on houses and the keep whare the millatary and king will  stay well its been about 5 days sense i last rote so i desided to, thares not mutch to do when you are locked in a tree waiting for the sun to rise for the last few days iv been mineing out cobble to make my wall stronger. iv also been collecting and steeling bones to get lots of dogs i now have 6 dogs they all have names but thare are to many to say, av also been makeing my (RP) mine for the mine to look good. av also been killing some mostly from towns, and monsters. its like i always say when in dout kill every body * LAGHTHS*", ""),
        StaticBook("prison conduct", "Sykora87", "\n Step one: take a prisoner to an open cell and lock the door Step two: Write on the sign above them \"IN USE\" \n Step Three: Write the time u put him/her in there and the time they need to get out. \n Step Four: Feed the prisoner and wait til time to release. \n RULES \n Dont Kill unless instructed to \n Dont Forget u locked him in there (or log off with out telling anyone he/shes in there)", ""),
