        StaticBook("Project Omega Plans", "Jon021", "Project Omega is a lava dispensing system designed for installation in gates. It uses an internal piston and redstone system to dispense lava. Unfortunately, the cleaning mechanism is still a prototype. It uses a piston system to raise the floor. here are the basics of the system sir?", ""),
        StaticBook("Promise of The Setting Sun", "TomMeijer", "You promised me we'd stay for the sunset, and when the moon shines through the darkness, we would find the path that leads us home and on the path maybe... You'ld sing me a song. Promise me that you'll always be there, hold my hand if ever I'm real scared, help me stand up tall if I fall down, help me laugh away all my bluest days. Oh, how could you promise that you'd always be there, why'd you have to go away somewhere, every morning into every night you watch over me like the sun in the sky, am I all alone or standing in your light, maybe I could... Maybe, sing you a song... Tonight.. You promise me we'd stay for the sunset...", ""),
        StaticBook("Proof Of Healing", "Ranovak", "I, Amras'Tullum of the Wardens, have been healed by Dedicant Lainadan. His healing was successful and I haven't felt this good in ages. I aprove him as a druid.", ""),
        StaticBook("Proof of healing", "menchin", "A Dedicant , Dedicant Laiandan , has healed my wound. A knife wound.", ""),
        StaticBook("Propaganda", "everblue2er101", "This rebellion has honor and dignity on the line Enor has allowed the north and Al'Khazar to fall to the Undead . He has proven to follow the path of Edmund. Oren has been reduced to Galahar. The other races do not support Enor. The people will realize that this is for the best Enor will NOT be harmed except in the case of severe resistance from his guards A new King will be put on the throne who is willing to fight for Oren, reclaim the northern cities and fight the Undead . How do we know that Enor does not continue to support his father?", ""),
        StaticBook("Prophecy of Eden", "SapphireShard", "and so, he who finds the  he has travelled far fought many enemies some friends, some villians beyond compare but no challenge is more worthy than You shall find the first at the place where Deserts weep, orcs do sleep, and cactuses tower over wastelands deep", ""),
        StaticBook("proposal for new internal wall for Al'khazar", "TheRedNinja", "Al'khazar's inner wall is undefendable in its current state this was proved a week ago. The wall is too low for guards to stand a chance agaisnt attackers. Its gatehouse consists of nothing more then a small door way. Now I propose a new inner wall and gatehouse be constructed so the guards can protect the public. I Aldric Vaughan can complete this task for 20,000 minas. If You agree I would redo the wall from the keep to the warf and build a new gateway. I would supply my own materials, labor and have a workshop large enough to finish such a project. The price is small compared to the lives of the citizens of Al'khazar. Feel free to contact me with questions or if you would like to carry out the contract. *Signed Aldric Vaughan", ""),
        StaticBook("Proposal: Supreme Rule", "GavLan", "\n As you begin to surround yourself with more enlightened individuals, you will find your power decreasing, in all due respects. These new men are intelectual and ready to control YOUR kingdom. I propose we write a set of bills, including your sovereignty over this Kingdom, and your supreme rule over your council. I ask this for it seems you have no acts in place, and Alras is in absolute freedom. If you think the writing not needed, I can assure you I can write, and you can sign. I pray you understand what I intend to say, and will continue forward with these plans. \nYour humble servant, \nRolf' Barfoot", ""),
        StaticBook("Proposition to the King- Cataris conDoin", "Archmage_Cataris", "Hello your Grace, When i came to propose my thoughts and ideas to you, you were busy lost in thought. I have written them down in this book. \n \n On Matters of the Guard - \n I have noticed you have guard in your keep to protect you all, but its widely known the Oren Guard are lacking... Brains and experience to say it kindly. I propose to you have a Royal Guard, the Elve have just established one for their Princess and Princesses", ""),
