        StaticBook("quest for a pumpkin", "megajosh20", "i was get ready to look for a pumpkin. so i got my iron sword, axe, food, and a full set of leather . i sayed bye to everyone not tell anyone what i was doing. i went right out of warden base. i travel far and long intill i saw a lava pit so stop there. i start choping down the tree so i could make a little base. When i was about to go to sleep i starting hearing some moaning sound. i pick my iron sword and step outside. To see a group of zombies around my tent. so i start slashing the  zombies. i layed down my sword. I was so sleepy i passes out . i woke to the moring sun and blood all over me. when i trip over a vine i almost fell in to the lava pit. so i deside to go back to the warden base. i got to my tent and jump on the bed. i start think who will i find a pumpkin. but i remember that this one shop in oren . so i ran out of my tent and i pick up my sword. i ran long the path for long time. I stop at a inn. they had pretty good bed and free food too. I had good time, but i was still think about my pumpkin. when the sun was up i did not stop to eat. I ran to the new oren gate. i used to work for them a bit, but it just for the money so i could buy a home. But back to the story. Ran up to the shop i could not remember the shop name. i think the shop is run by hempshine. He was a big hippy, but a cool guy. he allway had good deals. so got my pumpkins and left oren. when i got the warden base i talk to quazat about haveing pumpkin for the headgear for the gaurds. he told me to take off the pumpkin and no. then felore would take off her pumpkin and got demoted. it was fun who i gave quazar a pumpkin then start wearing it. it was so fun, everyone laughing. so i that the story of the my pumpkin .", ""),
        StaticBook("Quest No1 LVL Recruit", "patato12", "This shalt be thee's first quest Your mission Is to bring 2 stacks of Wheat or Melon and Bring it to the one who assigned this Task After you will have two days to Deiver it to the needy Make sure you have proven you farmed this before distibuteing Then come to Quest Master and report in Your next Quest will be Much more difficult and a Possible reward Hmm ((then no..))", ""),
        StaticBook("Quest:Nalgar's Gem", "darkjames", "Goal: \n Find the way to Free Nalgar[Vikram] of his curse and free Vikram \n to do so, first, get 10 Enderpearls, Freshly obtained, and 1 soulsand. \n Then...Get 2 netherrack and a stack of Birchwood log...get 2 Iron Ingots aswell. \n after this is done, Go back to the grave and Speak to Nalgar.", ""),
