        StaticBook("Quote Reqested by Gus VonSchlichten", "RHcrow", "Hail.  We request a quote on how much 640 chicken breast would cost us. Please Contact Gustav VonSchlichten.  (scribbled note: Not Nitholiak or Mattiaus PLEASE)", ""),
        StaticBook("Quotes and poetry for a wise man.", "whoppering", "This book is composed out of a few quotes/poetry sentences by the \"Reformed Church of Aegis and nearby districts\" Hopefully you will appreciate it, and donate to our church. For more information read our Yearbook. \n \n # Love is not a feeling. Its an act of your will.\n # If your problem is bigger than your God, you are serving the wrong God.\n # The distance between a problem and a solution, is the distance between your knees and the floor.\n # Love: You can build an house. Or sink a dead body.\n # Peace. It does not mean to be in a place where there is no trouble, noise, or hard work. It means to be in the midst of those things and still be calm in your heart.\n # Seven days without prayer makes one weak\n # A man with one watch knows what time it is; a man with two watches is never quite sure.\n # There's more to the truth than just the facts.\n # Seeking is not always the way to find.\n # Nature is the time-vesture of God that reveals Him to the wise, and hides Him from the foolish.\n # The study of Aegis Gods Word, is the secret discipline which has formed the greatest characters .\n # I was once a skeptic but was converted by the two missionaries on either side of my nose.\n # Knock on the sky and listen to the sound.\n # I dont know what the future holds. But I know who holds it!\n # When it thunders, the bandit becomes honest.\n # The wandering soul cant find our God for the same reason that a bandit cant find a police officer.\n # The obstacle is the path. \n # Prayer is an effort of will.\n # Churches and chapels would not so often be empty if ministers would take heed what they preach as well as how they preach.\n # Life is fragile. Handle with prayer.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Qwerts jurni", "Qwertyasdman", "today i waz at Oren I met a nise Oren gard he waz on a roof. he sed that he did not now where to get string and now i rite words then I met tha captan hoo show me tha mines. \n Tomoro I wil go to Dwarf capitle \nToday I went to the clowd tempal and walked arowned a bit. I then went to the tavern. I buy 4 ale and then was happy but afta I was sick! \n Today I went to Dwarven capital and I got som wheat from the fahhm. Then i lernt how to make ale! now i am drunk . \n Today I went bak to frends and now I hav a smify. I allso hav a lot of weet, now wee tri to make cake! Today I feeel sik. i had tooo muc ale. Today i meet a new person! his name is Dale he is a dwarf like me! today i helpd frends get wud, yay!", ""),
