        StaticBook("Ragnar's Diary", "zaczac013", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Raickoz's log book.", "Conster_monster", "It seems guards don't get pad. 've been a guard for a whle now but  havnt been pad. I'm leavng the guard to fnd a new way to earn money. \n \n Alethon s a good frend but  can't keep track of were he lves because he doesnt stay n one place. \n \n I've found a new way to earn money. kllng monster s good but hard way to earn mnas I have qute a collecton of leather the monsters seem to carry now. \n \n I now lve n Alethons house n Al'khazar but t's better then sleepng n the  streets. Alethon has ths new frend... well  thnk shes closer than frend called Rhse now. They seem to lke each over alot.  would be surprsed f they splt. \n \n Rhse has been hangng around these people lately but t's no problem because she  can look after herself. \n \n I can't remember. I woke n Alethons house wth a wound on my head. When  try to remember what happened my head hurts. All  can remember s a dark hood and the sound of dggng. \n \n Rhse has ths person stalkng her. He wears ths black hood and constantly calls her names. The obvously hate each over but the man puts me on the edge. \n \n My head hurts so much.  woke up on the floor agan but ths tme on a brck floor. 'm sttng down havng a rest but  can't seem to fgure out what happened. ths s just lke last tme. \n \n I havn't seen Rhse snce  woke up on the floor. maby t has somethng to do wth  t.  \n \n Today I saw a man climbing on roofs. he was wearing a black hood that concealed his  face... I'll investigate this man later. \n \n This world is grim, life is dim. lifes a challenge... \n \n Death stalks you in shadows. \n \n I'm still searching for Rhise but she seems to be no were. It's like shes hidding... \n \n  All these ignorant people taking everything they have in their life for granted if only i could teach them!! Just walking through town i have the strongest urge to steal. all this food and goods are to expensive for me to buy. but maby i shouldn't pay for it... I was collecting mushrooms under the house when i saw a hole in the wall hidden. I went to investigate and it turns out it's connected to the sewers... This could be advantage. \n \n I havn't seen the hooded man for a while but i bet hes still after me. hunting me... \n \n I am poor... i can't seem to find a good way to earn money, there has to be a way. is there? \n \n I shall -text is here has been erased- that would be brilliant... \n \n Note. Burn this book to keep it away from people. \n \n There are bad people out there that do contracts to kill people or spy on them maybe i should do that to... it's a good way to earn money. \n \n I wouldn't matter much if i just Took some stuff from people they wouldn't need it. \n The wounds on my head are healing but my head still hurts every now and then. it's going away... Slowly. \n \n I saw the man in the black hood writting in a book... but before i could talk to him he ran. hes probably writting something about me in that book... \n If only i could make these people know what it is like to go hungry and sleep on in the streets. \n \n    \n i think my writting skills are increasing! \n \n My name is no longer Raick for my new name is -The rest of the book has been removed-", ""),
        StaticBook("Rakin's Journal", "arctichenry", "day one: \n today I just finished getting mauled by zombies and almost starveing . ;; \n Day two: Today I killed my first person today, A lonely straggler who had stolen this book and was just plain annoying. he had stolen this book, and his fother, the oric, thought he hadnt. I knew better, so his fauther allowed us to have a fist fight which I won. I havent seen him yet, but I know he will be around sometime soon... day 2.1 \n day 2.1 ((today we had a massave rollback)). a good half of my farm was shaved off, I gess the gods are angry yet again. I do hope that this is only tempary ((rollback due to memory leak in the master server, will probaly be fixed)) I was getting mine and axedently took yours and didnt think to check before I placed it", ""),
        StaticBook("Rakin's WR ID", "arctichenry", "Rakin (last name unknown), male \n", ""),
