        StaticBook("Read This Book", "Minnan1", "29 years ago, while exploring the forest near Serpent's Ridge, I stepped into a ruined tower built by the side of a hill. This building was an abandoned Watchtower, raided by the orcs many centuries ago. \n The old, crippled walls could hardly keep the building standing. I ventured into the tower for curiosity and found an underground complex. There was a huge dark room with a small safe house in the middle. This room was used to train, the sentinel's chests still had their names along with some old armour and weapons. \n During many months, I would go there and kill monsters, keeping the entrance secret. \n \nWhen I met the love of my life, Indelwehn, I had to show her this place. We soon came up with ideas for a secret strike team for the good of Malinor, maybe turning the complex which extended many miles into our headquarters or location. \n We showed the Tunnels and the idea to High Prince Native, he seemed interested and called Highborn BlackThorn so he would keep the idea in mind. \n BlackThorn was a corrupt, preponderant and selfish bastard. He feared the strike team, which was being called Mythic Night at the moment, would become stronger and better than the Wardens; therefore, he managed to convince Native to change his mind and call it a dead project. \n \n \n A week after that incident, the tunnels were sealed, the gates closed and the watchtower demolished... \n Not so long ago, while walking around the area, I noticed a small hole next to the hill. Curious as I am, I went inside and found the main safe house intact. My biggest surprise was finding a bed, chests and signs of someone living there too. \n I remembered the old days and how we had failed to make this strike team possible. 29 years after those times, with BlackThorn dead and the tunnels found, the dream seems a lot like a possibility. \n I, Aedan, share this knowledge with you, for maybe you might be able to succeed in what I failed to do. \n You may ask for my help, for I know this kingdom better than anyone and being the original creator of the Mythic Night. Make in mind that, after 20 years, Indelwehn and I are no longer married. Ask for her aid at your own risk... \n [[P:D: I did not steal anything. Just so you can sleep well :P ]]", ""),
