        StaticBook("reasons why you may have been arrested", "durzio", "your in a cell,congratulations. your parents always knew youd end up here  . heres some things you probably did to end up right where they expected: 1.killing someone 2.stealing something 3.metagaming 4.powergaming 5.tresspassing 6.refusing to follow warden orders (i.e. we say halt,you keep running) 7.acting against malinor (i,e, treason,sedition,endangering malinor in anyway) 8.troublesome misconduct (i.e. getting too drunk in public,being obnoxious,etc.) 9.possesion of illegal items (i.e. mobspawners,fire blocks,etc) and finnaly 10. innapropriate behavior (i.e. cybering,excesive swearing,etc.) if your reading this,you did one of those things.its almost guarenteed. the Wardens will deal with you appropriatly. enjoy your stay.", ""),
