        StaticBook("Rebellion Personel -Relgard", "Darkdragon274", "Here are the names and callnames of all members of Relgard's Rebellion. \nRelgard ((Darkdragon274)) \n Duncan Amell ((Lord_Zack)) \n Mork Yohom ((Friar7)) \n Adreal ((Friar5))     \nEdren ((Solokill))  \n Cael'Que -Info- ((Jexdane))", ""),
