        StaticBook("Recent Spirits", "Lexperiments", "I have met four elmeental spirits recently. One for each of the Human Alchmeical elmeents. \n The first is a fire spirit named Karo I summoned in the desrts of Kramoroe with an ink sac. \n He is a fiery, destructive spirit who would do anything to burn something. After finding out I was a shaman, he agreed to help me when there was something to be BURNED. \n The second spirit I summoned was an earth spirit named Badal. I summoned him in my underground cave with cactus dye. \n He is dwarf-like in stature and personality, short, strong-willed, stubborn, and strong. He was happy to know a dwarf was a shaman and soon agreed to help me when I needed the earth. \n The third spirit I summoned was a wind spirit named Yurk. I summoned him with dandelion paste atop Shaman Zafus's tower. the paste blew into the wind as he appeared as a human with no legs, and instead a tail of wind. He was more of a storm than breeze spirit - more destructive than peaceful. He was a nomadic spirit that wanted to travel and interact with the mortal world, so he agreed to help me when I needed him. \n The fourth spirit, a spirit of water, was named Hasha. She was a peaceful spirit, much like the spirit inside my staff, Leaf. I summoned her in the waters next to Sanhar and Whisper Isles with cactus dye. She easily understood my peaceful intentions and joined my cause for when she was needed. \n In my path to shamanism, I will need these four spirits.. Kado of fire, Badal of earth, Yurk of wind, and Hasha of water... I wonder what exactly shall happen soon...", ""),
