        StaticBook("Recruit Cyrus", "AutarchCosmos", "Name: Cyrus ((Razarer))\n Age: 21\n  He can FARM at a basic level. \nHe can FIGHT at an advanced level. \nHe can MINE at a moderate level.    \n \nHe can read and write. \nNote: He wants to learn magic.", ""),
