        StaticBook("Rekkers journal", "Al3xcog", "Ukee iz gunna be written da tings dat happens ta me in dis book Since I started written dis some theif stole kah good armour that i put in the chest in mah c chest in da barracks, I dun know who did dis but im gunna find da dumbie dat did it! Irba, 11h of Suns Smile, 1341 I been klompin sum of da new creatures dat are poppin up everywhere, da senjezal walls are in Infested wiff dem! Dese new shadow ones dat are taller dan da urks are hard ta klomp agh des nuw ones dat shoot fire drop des rods dat I dun know what ta use fer Kamees, 12th of Suns Smile, 1341 I been earin bout dese nuw tings called potions frum a shara i knuw he says dat dey can make ur enemies flat ur make you strongah ur fastah! I gotta get enuff shinies ta buy some from im but i dunn know were ta get a job ur even a house in krugmar, I been getting tired of sleepin in da barracks ur outside when da ater ur locked Joma, 34th of The Deep Cold, 1341 Ih been tryin ta learn bout des nuw potions but I cant find anytin guud to make putions into, which iz why Im goin unting", ""),
