        StaticBook("Relguard's Mission Log", "Darkdragon274", "31/SecondSeed/1326 No real mission yet. Going with Duncan to patrol, and gather resources. \n 35/SecondSeed/1326 Allowed to assist Duncan on mission in Kal'Urgain. Hopefully just a bas sic information trip, but combat might be possible. \n 9/SunsSmile/1326 We have to break into the warden's base a spring a jailbreak... fun.", ""),
