        StaticBook("Rent Agreement for: Shop #3", "ymgoblinae", "As this property is defined as a \"Rental\", there are certain rules and procedures one must fo llow in order to keep the Deed the Shop. \n1. No destroying blocks without owners permission. \n2. No illegal activity on the property, period. \n3. Maintain a decent customer satisfaction level. \n4. Be kind and courteous to neighbors and citizens. \n5. Agree to home inspection at the owners discretion. \n6. ALL protected chests, signs or any other mechanic must be accessible by owner. \n7. Owner may revoke the deed at any time throughout your rental. \n8. Failure to stay within payment will result in revoking the deed and losing all property. \n9. No Undead inside the property at any time. \n10. If you get arrested (Banned) contact me immediately to arrange future plans. \n By purchasing the deed and paying the down payment, you hereby agree to all rules. \n DO NOT LOSE THIS DEED. THIS IS THE ONLY WAY TO PROVE ACTUAL RENTAL OWNERSHIP.", ""),
