        StaticBook("Residence Logbook", "_Earendil_", "Irba, 32nd of The Grand harvest, 1321 \n Arrived back in Ravenhold after a long journey to the Haven and attending to business as usal in Laurelin. how do you delete in a book? how do you delete from a book?", ""),
