        StaticBook("Resignation Letter: Edward Talbot", "William_Talbot", "Dear Kais    : \n\n Please accept this resignation letter from Winterfell Guards as Winterfell Guard. \n\n: Thank you so much for the time I spend at Winterfell Guards. I have worked with a lot of great and talented people, and also have many oportunities to grow and increase my skills and career. Ill never forget my time in Winterfell. \n\n All the best, \n\n Edward_Talbot", ""),
