        StaticBook("Return", "mercury199", "forward : to all who read my work's I would like to appologize I have been slacking in my writing as other matters have taken precendence over this. In a breif passage I will tell you \nIt started a while ago the town of Elesmera had just gotten it's rots down and appointed me as it's leader. I had many meetings with the high prince and eventualy we setteled upon a decent agreement, settingme at my new title of Thane, Later through my meditation I grew closer to the forest, I learned the horrible secret it held of a great beauty know as Kaelari. she was the mother of the trees daughter and protector of the forest. She lived in a birch tree I Planted and grew from a sapling. She was the forest and had the greatest beauty such that she surpassed all mortals. but she was unyeilding cold, calculating and even at time vicious But she did give me one thing, a small son named Daedr. What joy I have had in raising him. But she grew restless and saw too many flaws in mortals, so she decided to .... correct them. She planned to make some of these mortals immortal and then kill all whoopposed her, for who can hope to compete with the forest. She told me over her plan and I could not let it happen so I went to my freind and begged her help. But she turned me away beleiving me to be insane So I did the only thing I could I felled the tree, and while the sap was still spilling forth tourched it. Of course this greatly angered her so as with most things a battle ensued. In the end I stabbed her through the heart and she died in my arms. I hope my readers and freinds can forgive me for my absense from the world in the past and for the leave i am about to take.", ""),
