        StaticBook("Revenge", "Cookie9000", "I will get the finest thing my life, the reason I live, Revenge, not for me, but for my parents They were burnt to a crisp by undead, and I had to watch them slowly die by my own eyes when I was 7. I will get it, if I have to kill my commander, comrades, or even myself, I will do it, my life was made only because of this, and I shall not stop until the avenge is done, so if you are reading this, that means I am dead, behind you or I finally got the sweet revenge and ran to my family's secret oasis where I will live my life, with a lifetime of supplies and food, that is my story. - Alanor Hedgewell.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rezaraptor", "friar5", "The Rezaraptor. You may have not heard of it. That wouldnt suprise me, few do know about the mercyless beasts. Rezaraptors have the body of a normal raptor, but much larger. They are a pale grey with red stripes on their backs, and have razor sharp claws, and teeth. Their eye's are vertical, like a snakes, and they have nostrils, like a snake. They also have venom in their fangs, and on the tip of their tail, a sharp blade like a knife with v -enom that paralyses their victim to their lair. ---The Rezaraptor's Lair--- Their lair is like this. It has a fake sun, with grass and trees. The rezaraptors get this wood, and build a empty Ranch. Then they go to the surface, and sniff out the extremely rare Unicorn. They take these down to their Lair and breed them, so that the Rezaraptor has a Unicorn Ranch. Then, at theright moment, it will Eat the unicorn meat, and drink the blood, witch tastes like Cranberry juice. Only one Rezarapter has ever been killed by Man. It was a full moon, and the very night that a Rezaraptor came out to look for unicorns, and hunt. A party of ten hunters quietly Whent about the woods killing any animal they could see. Then, they saw a rather large Animal, they thought it was a bear, so they shot it, then came from it a horrible yell. It ran into the bushes, so two men approached it, weapons ready. When they got to the bush, nothing was to be seen. They walked up a little bit more, suddenly  they saw something very fast, and sharp whip at them, one of the peoples necks were cut open and the other screamed and ran to the group, saying there was a monster over in the bush, and it had eaten Bob. The others laughed, (they did not belive him) so they all whent over to the bush. They did not return. Only the one remained, bow ready The \"Monster\" jumped out of the bushes, and the man shot a arrow into its throat. The Rezaraptor gave a horrible yell and fell to the ground. The man carried it back with his Horses. The hide of the beast got him quite alot of money, and the meat was delightful. Chapter 3 This part is about the Rezaraptors Childhood. They are born in their parents cave. For 2 years, they breastfead from their mothers milk. On their 3'rd year, They start feeding on Unicorn flesh, and blood.  When they are 8, they go and seek out a cave, and a family of their own. The End. If you have any questions, please ask me! Goodbye.", ""),
