        StaticBook("Rigrud's Diary", "Crippledpope", "Aedan came to us today, An '' Ayleid '' Supposed Ancient Elf from before time began. He came Claiming to bring great news, all he told us was of a friend he had made, an undead. I fear for us all now, It seems that snowyfields was not the end, only just the beginning. - 9th of The First Seed Or I can write it now I have to re-write it >.>", ""),
        StaticBook("Rigrud's note to Thurgo", "Crippledpope", "Hello, My name is Rigrud, I am a new recruit in The Knights of The North. Although you do not know me, I am requesting that you take me on as your apprentice. I am of dwarven blood, and I fell that I could make a great apprentice, If only you'd give me the opportunity. Please at least consider my offer, and thank you for your time.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rilath Ilwindior: An Autobiography", "ShadowGunX", "On the day I was born, my Because of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.ather, Wywern, killed my mother and kept me Because of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.or himselBecause of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.. My Because of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.ather kept me prisoner in our house Because of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.or most oBecause of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him. my liBecause of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.e. 583 years oBecause of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him. it to be exact. OBecause of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him. course it wasn't all bad. I did gain a better education then I could've without him. \n Because of him I learned magic. The highlight of my miserable life with him.", ""),
