        StaticBook("rinscher's Journal", "Tree_Hugger_34", "Day 1: As i sit in this chair in front of me house. I cant help but wonder... Why am i here i sit here every once in a while and try to figure things out. i cannot put my finger on it though What is my purpose here in aegis? to be a guard? To be a criminal? Or a mass murderer I have yet to decide what to do with my life There are so many choices. Yet not one can fill me empty heart Perhaps i need a gal. Wellt thats my thoughts for today. Day 2: I met this gal not too long ago, i believe her name was bell She was as beautiful as could be She could be the answer to me problem. but i do not know if she is right for me. well we will find out in due time. Day 3:", ""),
