        StaticBook("Riznam's Book of Corrds.", "Riznam", "I would like to start off with saying i am of little to now responsiability of the circultion of this book . The only way this book will leave my body is in my death. Now with that said lets begin. ;Ferox Legio -255,-374 ;Sanhar -339,-257 ;Kal'Urguan -407,84 Valor Guild House -961,280 ;Kramoroe -982,93 ;Cloud Temple -149,33 ;Kal'Urguan -407,570 ;Whisper Isle -510,7 ;AlKhazar -1277,84 ;Theivin Aengul Casion -662,32 Laurelin 1,99 ;Temple of Horen -1295,-106 ;Arican's Kal'Rog Store -419,259 Dreizel and Arican's Elven Store 139,152", ""),
