        StaticBook("Roads Go Ever Ever On", "MrZombez", "\nRoads go ever ever on, \nOver rock and under tree \nBy caves where never sun has shone \nBy streams that never find the sea \nOver snow by winter sown \n \nAnd through merry flowers of June \nOver grass and over stone \nAnd under mountains in the moon \nRoads go ever ever on \nUnder cloud and under star \nYet feet that wandering have gone \nTurn at last to home afar \nEyes that fire and sword have seen \nAnd horror in the halls of stone \nLook at last on meadows green \nAnd trees and hills they long have known", ""),
        StaticBook("Roamin' Orcs", "TEEbrown", "It 'as come to me attention that thar be many moar orcs roamin' around ever since tha evil queen started attackin' all tha cities. \n One notable occation of this be when a group of us dwarves whar tryin' ta bring in a bandit orc named Vulgrak. Me and a few of me Blackaxe brethern was thar 'elpin out.  Then tha lad just started shoutin'! A band of roamin' orcs was passin' by and 'eard tha lad's pleas. Tha orcs instantly rallied behind 'im before they 'eard tha charges that Vulgrak 'ad. They demanded that we 'and 'im over ta them, but we weren't about ta just 'and a bandit over! \n After much arguin', we came ta an agreement. Orik would fight Vulgrak. If Orik won, we get ta take Vulgrak back ta Kal'Urguan. If Vulgrak won, 'e would be free ta go. \n Tha fight was short and brutal, but ta Orik's misfortune, 'e lost tha fight. Us dwarves 'eld are 'eads in shame. But tha orcs warn't finished. No, they be wantin' moar fightin'. Almost minutes after tha orcs beat Orik, they be yellin' murder and death upon us. Most of us dwarves left cause we whar clearly outnumbered about three orcs per dwarf. \n I 'adn't known what become of them other dwarves, but do 'ear this. These orcs arn't goin' anywhar, their bloodlust be growin' and becomin' moar savage. We need ta rally behind our fellow dwares and 'elp them out no matter what tha situation! Fer Urguan!", ""),
        StaticBook("Robbing Victims II", "G79", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Rockwalker log", "dinnermahboi", "I joined I.A. Today, i hope ill fit the job.     The lord bryce is a nice guy. Everyone here is nice as a matter of fact . These undead though, I've seen them. There much more powerfull than people make them out to be. I just hope i don't lose my head, or any other body part for that matter.", ""),
        StaticBook("RodNerver's Journey", "ttwesten", "hello this is my journal for what has happend after the Druids said to wait for a sign . when i got out of the druids tree in the elf city i went on a journey with a friend we went to ravenhood to see what was there to my surprize there were druids homes there so the builder of raven let us in to have a look i was surprize to see that it was my dream home in a big tree with mushrooms everywere anyway after that the builder showed us there open tree farm so i stayed there for a while chopping down redwood trees but i replanted all the saplings i got so there is even more trees there then before with the remaining saplings i had i planted them all over the land i also went on to find another place but i could only find a mushroom farm which them reminded me about all the apples and mellon i collected. when i got all the mushrooms beside 5 or 6 i made mushroom soup out of nearly all of them i planted the rest in the room i am staying in just outside the elf city. then i was going out to travel agian by myself this time going north to my village that got burnt down. yes my elf village was in human territorry. anyway on the way i was almost at the forest and to my anger i found an undead fortress right were the village was right in the middle i was so angry and shocked that i ran back to the inn im staying in. just in time  to when the undead saw me and stuck lightning in my face i don't know if that was a secret fortress but i might of so when i got back to the inn i made a small farm in the back i have stayed there ever since and when it was time to harvest i realised that i needed some power just a bit more power so i had to become a druid and then i rememberd that they did not accept me the first time so i waited a while i went to bed and when i woke up i was in a tree still in the night with the moon shone on top of me and then i was suddenly woke up in bed and i thort that could be the sign but i did not trust it so i went off not bothering about it then i went outside and then i saw a zombie i went over to it and it did not hurt me so then the sign of the moon must of been the sign the druids were talking about so then i started to write this journal on the adventure i had and i am going to give this journal to the druids to see if they might accept me after reading this story i had i am going to wonder if the druids will accept me and i hope they do and that was the sign they were talking about.         so i went back to the druid tree and no one was there so i went back to traveling and planting saplings every were that had none (i like to plant redwood saplings) so when i was planting them i saw a big tree so i went in it the tree was to the north when i went in the tree i saw an undead i walked back a bit wondering if he built the place and wanted me to leave he started to follow me out and he struck lightning in my way it missed me just so i started to run since i had nothing besides saplings and a hoe on me so i ran away as fast as i could while he was shooting lightning at me i ran and found a small house and ran inside there were many people so i think the undead retreted a short while later i left the house and went back to the inn im staying at i told them about this story and they were shocked the next night i was walking down past the keep i peeked inside and they were fighting someone and i looked closer and it was the same undead from before i shot an arrow at him he turned around looked at me then started shooting lightning at me i ran agian but this time back to the elf city to the druids tree but when i close to entering the gates i was stuck so i limped my way over to the tree and i found Rukik he tried to heal me but he did not have that much skill in herbs and medicens. i went back to inn andrested in my bed when i woke up i had a dream to make a mini mellon farm so i did a few days later the keep was under attack agian by the same undead i shot another arrow at him and he looked at me and then retreated for some stange reason and i have been wonderin why ever sincfe a couple of days past and in the sun light i herd thunder so i went back to the keep and no undead was there and then we kept hearing the sounds agian and agian for the rest of the day this is were i end this part of the book i'm going back to the druids tree to see if Petyr is there to see if i can become there aprentence if there not there then i guess i have to keep traveling and write of my tails . the druid i am looking for called Petyr was not there so i went on a journey with my friends to Al'Khazar i was on my way when this rude lady wanted me to see my face at the gate then she yelled out that i was undead for refusing to show her so i left i was outside the front gate when there was a jail break from two gards trying to stop the crook i was trying to help but he got away i thort i was safe when he suddenly jumped out of the water and killed me when i was writting my journal he was to quick for me and killed me luckly the monkes were traveling on the path and saw me bleeding to death they did there treatment on me and i was feeling better i happy that they saved me but they would not give some of my stuff back like my bow and arrows since they are agenst wepons. but after talking to them they said i can keep my bow that was crafted by my father and it was very important to me so they gave it to me and droped me back off at Al'Khaza front gate were the rude lady still says im un undead i just arived back at the inn to find that the keep next to it might be working for the undead they have been attacked many times from them but i have seen nor the m or the undead actully die they could be the workers for them doing there bidding giveing them information they are the I_C and they do creep me out a bit since i went over when they were fighting the undead but they said it was an intuder but when the person came out it was one of them then i saw at the back a person going down the stairs to the exit the I_C did not do anything even when they said they are allies with us. i supect the undead has people all around the land doing there bidding but i think the I_C is there main inforamation people i am going to see if the druids are in so im going to there tree in Lauerlin  . today the undead was attacking the I_C and then something came to me that the undead were not attacking them but the forest and the inn and still the I_C did not help but sit there and run away there is a sign on the inn's door that says if ever attacked the I_C will come to help but they did nothing to help us. the battle is now over and the I_C are cheering even know that me and some of my friends were the only ones fighting the undead all the I_C did was run away what good protection they gave us . the I_C has decleard war agenst the inn for no reason then they tell us its there land even know it was ours intill they built the fortress of theres they now say its theres and they all started to kill the inn people including me they shouted join us or die. so we are waiting to see what will happen we have started to talk but this will not be rezolved so easily now Stife is trying to talk to the I_C to see if they can settle this the war has ended thanks to Strife he has talked to the I_C and they agree but they will stay and so will we i was traveling through the elf city when i found a stucture being bilt i met some nice fellows who help me try to kill a pigmen i was wondering was they were building and it was a arena for a game were you shoot people with a bow to try to win they don't know the prizes yet but i have been thinking it would be good since there will be skill shooters and fast people i am already hoping this will be a fun arena type game . i have been far acrross the land and made myself a sadle so now i am trying to find a cow it can give me a refrshing beverage of milk if i need some when i get thirsty. i just rode an cow and i loved it i rubbed the cows back and it seemed to like it since it did a very nice carmling mooo but i had to get off it and go some were else since i could not ride the cow and controll it as i wish i could i set out to find another way so i went on without it and traveld further away till i was at a nice castle no one was there so i walked in the castle looked very nice and has nice furniture but i think it needs more mushrroms around in places but i do not worry about that to much so i'm going back to the inn to see if anything has happend. I went bed that night and when i opened my eyes i was in the forest at night there was a bit of an open area i saw someone walk slowly past the trees she came out in the open area and i saw it was the mother of druids Cerridwen she walked up to me ever so slowly planting saplings behind here she came right up to my face and kissed me on the cheek i closed my eyes when she did and when i oppend them she was gorn and all that was there was the forest and the moon shinning like the sun on me i woke up after that and said softly to myself that must of been the sign the druids must of wanted me to see and what they said i had to see so i am going to the druid tree to see if i am right. lightning but no rain suddenly stuck Laurelin no one has herd of what happend some say it was the undead but some say its a natural apperance no one knows anything but that. the druid was not there so i walked out of the tree and i saw a big crowed of people i went there and it was an undead recruting place they were talking about the overlord and they saw me and said join us or die so i asked them if they were undead and they said aye so i ran and told the high prince he went over to the place were i saw them and they were gorn so he went to find a small army of elfs and orcs he then went over to an undead base and attacked it his army has fallen and the orcs to i went and someone told me that everyone died including the prince i was shocked and i blame myself for there deaths i hope he was saved by the monks just found out the prince has lived i am so relived about it so now i don't feel the guilt about letting him go to war i hope to see him and give him some food for resting as the war with the undead and the high prince and his army died but the prince got saved by monks that were there some people made it out but some did not they died on the bettle field and not  1 undead was killed. i have just got a not that Commander jay from the I_C was doing all the bad stuff there so only him and no one else is to blame the I_C is alright but commander Jay has made an stan d. so he lied to Oren the people in it trusted him then he lied so now Oren has raged war agenst agenst  the I_C and kill commander jay if they find him!. today i went to Al'Khaza and i was met by a rude orc who was insulting me and fighting with me so i reported him to the gards and all they did was just watch then i left the orcs sight i pushed passed him and went to the gates so i did the same and yelled at him back and then just walked off. (why does something always happen to me when i go to this city) the queen attacked the elf city and took the lives of some and coward out after that but she does return and soon she will die i just met up with the high prince and i gave him some gifts they were a diamond sword a stack of mellons and cooked food he forgives me and respecks me a bit more then before now he knows that i am his reporter to tell him if any grave or food news hits the land i shal only report to the Royal family of the elves about this most of the time the prince i will report to him soon about some more news i was just at the druids grove and they were having a wedding. after the wedding druid petyr was there i asked to talk to him but the other druids told me to get out and there not accepting anymore decicant's i have been shaterd since i only started to write this journal since of that now i am no one so i have ran away from inn and might not ever return there or to the elven city i will have to live alown by myself like how it was when i lost my village watching everyone die before me and i was alwon by myself for so many years and when i found the druids they accepted me as a friend and i realised thats what friends were like and then they put me back down to this state of action so i shall travell far and long and hope for the best for me.", ""),
        StaticBook("RodNerver's travels- Treetop inn", "ttwesten", "The treetop inn is a inn that is free no cost you can stay there for how long you like without being charged any minas the lardlords are on nearly all the time and they are all very nice the building is made out of wooden planks wood leaves and glass its actully next to the I_C fort you can find the inn right next to the elf city down the path i have stayed at the inn for a while now and there all nice and its cozy inside anyone is welcome and it is recomended to check it out its really a nice in even the High prince Native says so he gave the inn gifts so you know it must be good but there is more to this inn then it seems in the inn there has been so many twisted storylines and started a storyline there has been many moments were you just wanted to stay and do stuff around there with the I_C builing right next to it there has been wars with the undead so its good for thrill seekers and adventures i am writing this book right in the middle of the war i actully got hit by lightning by the undead. i have now ran back to the inn and finishing the book anyway the inn is just amazing on how it does all these things to people and there storylines it has mine and many others the inn has so much to give but people just don't see it the inn is cozy to elves and other races. the treetop inn has impresed the high prince and princess of the elves he has said he would fight for the inn if it was in bad condition the elves know of this in as the best one they went to and over 9/10 people have said at least it was free and fun a storyline has changed so much that the person forgot about it and stayed at the inn he loved it so much with the storylines the people do not try to changed it but follow there own and people just get involed and stay or leave with there whole storyline changed the inn might be small but it is big on the inside it goes under ground and above it if the landlords say so you can expand your room to 2x as big as before you can go up down or the sides   or even join up with someones elses room to and then expand it if they are all ok if you ask first of corse the landlords lock your chest so only you can open them and take the stuff out but rules do apply here that you have to stay cival and no fighting in the inn no breaking other peoples stuff or stealing it you meet great people here someone even found love i have met friends here and now we travel together and fight together if a person living in the inn gets hurt by another player who is living in the in and is just in the area the people in the inn will join together and hurt them back the tree top inn is a wonderful place to check out and have a look and stay i sugest comeing here right away after reading this and just have fun remember everything  is free and the high prince said this is a cozy place to stay in. strife im done with the book ~RodNerver", ""),
        StaticBook("Rodrick's Journal Vol.1", "MrZombez", "Day 1 \n These cages in Winterfell are tight ones. These dogs they call Lords think that holding me here will change my ways. That these walls will break me. Phillip, my brother I hope that you are well. The darkness surrounds me, and with it I embrace my fate. They will leave me here, brother, leave me here to rot. They know not of our plights, of how we struggled just to eat just once a day. Mother always looked so proud when we brought home moldy bread from the other urchins shacks. How we felt the emptiness everyday, both mind and body. And the Old Man, the brute that we were blood bound to. Do you remember the beatings brother? How he would let out his anger on not only us , but Mother as well? I still feel the pain on the scars he left. I suppose his only gift to us was the numbness. you and mother again. \n Day 14, Midnight \n*illegible scribbles They are watching brother, they know that I know. I have been writing down their words, their secrets. I know of their sins, and how they shall be punished. They moved me, brother, to a smaller cell. They reduced the height, forcing me into a a moss infested cell. I heard the guards talking, this is their plan. They want this ,the moisture, the purpose is to make me rot faster. My leg, brother, my leg has already begun. Green as the plants that surround me. The Priest called it gangreen, but what do they know anyway? We never believed in those lies, and I never will. The thought that others would bow to something they have never seen or heard drives me insane . The darkness comes, brother, it is my only friend here.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rodrick's Journal Vol.2", "MrZombez", "Day 56, Hour 14, Minute 56 \nHow could you leave me to die like this brother? The hours I have spent here, serving your \nsentence.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rodwem Information Sheet", "guyplayingpc", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Rog'nar's Journal", "Klucha6", "\nYear 1300  \nI finally moved from my old village - Grontor When I was travelling towards Sanjezal I decided to rest at the nearest town, it was Sanhar Here I met the local architect - Tirok He   trusted me and gave me key to the small house in the village  That's how I started living here But something was wrong at the beginning. me in this town - everyone here was a warrior The thing was that I always considered myself to be smarter than my brothers Instead of wielding an axes I'd rather read a book about great ancestors Other orcs always thought that I'm kinda strange because I was talking like I wasn't one of them That's because as a kid I was sent to the olny university in whole Krugmar, which was conducted by the most intelligent people of all orcs - the shamans And if I'm writing about shamans I must mention about Brevias Elder Shaman of Sanhar which noted that I'm not like the other orcs in the village \n<big ink stain on the paper>  \nYear 1306 \nToday I will start my first task at the beginning. Brevias Hope It won't be so hard as I heard Ok First I had to gather things with spiritual value, like medallions That was pretty easy at the beginning. the first step After that we had a long journey, far away from Sanjezal When we were in the wilds the first test has came I had to lure a spirit to my   body. I didn't know what happened but my master said I was possesed as everyone at the beginning. My second test has came quickly after the first one. I had to summon another spirit. I did and the possesion happened again as Brevias said. But that speaks well about my spiritual  soul. When we ended this part Brevias planted sapling in the ground and we started meditating to call a spirit into it. We've done it succesfully and the tree started to grow. When it has fully grown he harvested it and made my first shaman staff of it's wood. After that we came back to Sanhar and appointed next spiritual meeting. \nYear 1307 \nMy master - Brevias is gone. I haven't seen him for about half of year. That was hard time for me. Everything is against me. All shamans were about to unite by order of Thyst. Unfortunately day before the meeting he died from the hand of Rex. Now I have to search for another master which will probably be Tre'bok who already have few apprentices. In my free time I'm helping Gorefang and Tirok with their building problems. Yesterday I have met wizard woman - Bell who told me to contact her soon as she will be around Krugmar capital - Sanjezal. I'm looking forward to join the mage guild and continue the spiritual education.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rogash's Journal", "Volutional", "Tolta, 10th Of Snows Maiden 1327", ""),
        StaticBook("Rogers Recon Client Records/Invoices", "Sandy_Bandit", "Saint Daniel Inn request Invoice\n\n The Saint has ordered a plot in the far wilds in a lush forest for his Inn placement. \n \nDay one of work I locate and draft sketches to show Daniel of my findings. The Saint is pleased and I return to retrive him from Al'khazar to lead him to his land. The long travel forced us to take a number of rest stops. One of which in the legendary halfling village of Dunwood to wait out the night and storm. At day break we set out again. On the fourth boat trip we land at a cove that I had found to be a beautiful and habitable location but since it was not a lush forest it was not for Daniel. His plot was only five miles on from that point but he told me then and there that he was happy with the small forest near the cove so I did not argue. \n \n Distance of Travel: 36 miles\nResources Used: Iron Armor broken, six boats , stack of porchops, 64 arrows exausted.\nDanger Factor (scale Blue-Red):  Orange \nMaps Crafted: one \nTotal: 1500 Minas", ""),
        StaticBook("Rolf's Journal", "LordChubb", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Romeo and Reylts Plan", "Sykora87", "x 860 z 788 the X is a negitive", ""),
        StaticBook("Rookie Guard Handbook", "Mystronghold", "Rookies get paid 40 minas ((Real Life Hours)) \nHere is how you get paid. You can either guard the gate or patrol the walls . \nIf you are a new guard you will be supervised and be shown around the headquarters and city. Also rookies will be training at the training facility alot so be prepared physically and mentally. \nAll rookies should read all of the books because you will be tested soon.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rookie Guards Training Index", "Mystronghold", "In order to become a full guard you have to pass the guard training. \n\n \n First, you have to read all of the books in the guard headquarters. \n \nSecond, you will be in the Army training district on there obstacle course to be showing us your skills. \n \nThird, you will be on gate duty, with either me or one of the regular guards supervising you. \n \nIf you pass all of the three steps you will become a regular full time guard.", ""),
        StaticBook("Room 2 key", "jacksonsp1170", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Room Appeal", "sprintindwarf", "This is Templar Noble Ezekiel. I am writing this about the conditions of my quarters. I find it rather small, I squeeze around everything just to get around. with permission I would like to expand my room. The area to the left facing my room is open, I could expand there. Thank you for taking your time to read over this - Ezekiel", ""),
        StaticBook("Room Price", "shoeberrypie", "Hello Sir,\n I would like to buy that last room you have upstairs.\n Might 2,500 minas be enough?", ""),
        StaticBook("Room Prices", "rabidmongoose", "Rooms are rented for 50 mina a week contact Hiruko (rabidmongoose) to rent a room . Rooms 1, 2, 3, and 4 are available", ""),
        StaticBook("Room Reservation", "Archmage_Cataris", "ooc:   Minecraft Name: 123trevmo321,   RP name: Jameson Top floor VIP room with balcony, has sign above it", ""),
        StaticBook("Roots of Life", "Coopra", "Holding up the souls of it's inhabitants, \nNature is a root of life. \nKeeping us all alive, \nLike a soldier's knife. \nLike fire without oxygen, \nNature came before us all. \n If it goes, \nMan will fall.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rose's_Diary", "Puggles891", "Day 1\n I arrived at my new job at the monastery. I repaired the windows and fixed up the cactus farm. I also planted some seeds in the garden This job wasn't as \"excited\" as I hoped it would be. Day 2\n Today I secretly left the monastary. I found my way to Alras. It started to get dark so I found a quiet place to write my diary. I probably will try to make my way back to the monastery in the morning. I hope no one catches me. Day 3\n I was kicked out of the monestary today. I might have stole a little from the chest. Now I met a man named James. Now we are looking for our other friend. Entry 4\n We couldn't find the other dwarf. So I showed James to the monestary and we rested. We will continue to have an adventure together. I hope he still wants to go on an adventure with me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rough Book", "Willizl33t", "Entry 1: Today I met him... Memory...so blurred. My neck...hurts. I thirst...for...for blood... \n \n Entry 2: I killed a man today. An innocent...man. Dead! It made me feel...awful, until I tasted his blood! It was so nice... \n \n Entry 3: We met up with another of our \"bloodline\" today. His name is Laevil. My thirst..it has returned even stronger... It must be quenched... It WILL be quenched! \n \n *The writing turns un-neat and looks like scribbles* Entry 4: It has been afew days, I have drunk some more blood. It tastes so...good! I was shown to the manor today, and I now have a room there... \n \n Entry 5: I was sent out to investigate some lightning... It was glorious! When I arrived there a fight had just been won against some \"Ice Demon\". There was bodies of the dead. I did not feed off of them, though. No! I met up with Vladmir, and we slayed a man, an ASCENDED! I have taken vials of his blood. Later on, we slew his friend who wanted revenge! It was glorious, 2 bodies. And the blood...it was so good! \n \n Entry 6: Today I led a young child out into the wilderness, a boy of 12! I told him of treasure and temples. Being a gullable child, he believe me and followed me! I didn't kill him, no, I harvested him. I will go back for more later, if I can find him. I cut him, and sapped the blood from his veins into vials. Then, I carried him to Al'khazar, and dumped him. He couldn't remember a thing! His blood...it tasted so...fresh. \n \n Entry 7: Laevil! Where is he? He has gone, disappeared. Dead. Now, we are the only 2 left! \n Entry 8: Vladmir... is dead! I am the last of my kind. I am the last of The Bloodline. Those damned Dwarves got him... I will get revenge... REVENGE!", ""),
        StaticBook("Rowan (sooIner)", "HideInTheDark", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Court", "markdalgaard", "Alice's have a certain amount of magic power. The princess is slowly gaining my trust. Valian returned from his travel badly wounded. Valian came back badly wounded, he was attacked by Dwarfs. He and Alice's was dragged to a dungon, Alice was freed. Chris was the dwarf and Steve. Dretzi and Aidan is trying to become spys. The princess Is insane. The princess have been drugged", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Elven Auction House", "TheGiver17", "The Royal Elven Auction House will be celebrating it's Grand Opening on ((September 8th)). The auction house will have its first auction sometime on that day. The auction house is located outside of the Laurelin walls near the Sister City. In order to reach the auction house, start at the main gates of Laurelin. Inside you will see a message board. Turn right here and follow the path going up. keep following the road, passing the post office, until you arrive at the Laurelin Crossroads . Stand in the middle of the crossroads and turn right. you will see two signs saying to Laurelin and West Laurelin. Head forward and arrive at a split. Follow the path that leads to West Laurelin and Ravenhold. By following the path you will come upon a sign that says to Ravenhold and Serpent's Ridge. Follow that path, not the one to Kal 'Urguan. Now you will see a sign a little ways ahead leading you along a path that will take you to: Ravehold, Sister City, Serpent's Ridge, and, if you follow the other directional signs, the Warden's Base. you will arrive at another cross with signs leading to the Warden Base, Laurelin Southwest, and the Sister City, or the other road leading outside the walls. Take this path outside. Continuing straight you will arrive at another split. You can take the right path leading to Serpent's Ridge and Ravenhold, or you can turn left to arrive in the Sister City. Head into the Sister City and you will find many split paths . You need to follow the left most path, the one closest to the Laurelin Walls. keep going straight along this road and you will arrive at a sign pointing you in the direction of the Warden Base, and the Royal Elven Auction House. at the bottom of the stairs on this path turn left and go under the Laurelin Transit System. As you pass around the next corner you will find, situated over the water, the Royal Elven Auction House. If you wish to participate in the auctions that we hold daily, you must read all of the rules we have written on the rule boards outside the entrance. Thank you for taking your time to read this, and I hope you arrive safely and enjoy your time here.", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Invitation", "SerahLove", "Greetings. You are cordially invited to the wedding ceremony of King Enor Sheffield and Lady Luna Wildewyn of fair Wildewyn Wood.   \n The ceremony is to take place in the harbor located in Eastern Laurelin, near the Laurelin marketplace.", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Issues", "muchoman798", "\nFor obvious reasons, I am not disclosing my name on this pamphlet. \nThe King is letting our nation fall into a state of fear from the Undead. Many of you fear them, but do you know why? \nBecause the King does not pay or train his guards. They are not motivated and willing to desert. Because the King would rather build a tower on his own Keep for his safety using Oren's wealth than pay the guard or bolster the walls. Because the King would leave holes in the walls of Al'Khazar that the Undead can just waltz through. Because the King would let Snowy Fields not be rebuilt just so we can \"treat it like a museum.\" \nBecause the King would have us all day to save himself. \nDo not stand for this. \n~ L", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Problems", "muchoman798", "\nFor obvious reasons, I am not disclosing my name on this pamphlet. \nMany of you have seen the Undead roaming the streets of Al'Khazar. Don't worry, this is all under the King's orders. That is right. The King has let a treaty be drawn with the Undead. What does it let them do? \n They can wakl the streets of Oren unmoletsted. We cannot attack them, and we cannot stop them from freely walking in Al'Khazar. This is ridiculous. \n What else? The King would rather spend his money building another tower on his safe keep. But have you noticed the issues in the city? The walls are not present in the farming section of the town. The Northern gate is not manned. The guard is not paid. Bandits enter the city freely. There is a further list of the offenses. They keep on going. \n Do not stand for this. Revolt. ~ L  Thank you.", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Problems", "HappyJackington", "I am not disclosing my name in this pamphlet fo obvious reasons. \nThe Kingdom of Oren is not safe, we all know this, but many of us do not know why. There are many reasons indeed but I can tell you the largest one. Its name is Poor  Leadership. Can any of you tell me you did not prosper under King Perea? A single one of you? Can you not tell me that he has made you more safe and secure? Now I have another question. Can you tell me that King Edmund has done anything to make you m ore safe? \nHere is a list of his many achievements: \n-He has built a tower on his personal Keep using National money. \nOh, sorry, I guess it is not a list. Just a mere statement, but there is a list of things he didn't do: \n-Leaves the Northern Gate unmanned. \n- Leaves the guards unpaid and untrained. This makes them desert. \n-Leaves the wall with gaps in the Harbor. \n-Leaves the sewers undefended. \n-Leaves Snowy Fields a deserted city, just like his guard posts. \nDoes this list make you happy? Does it make you feel safe? It is the kings fault. \nDo not stand for this. \n~L", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Regrets", "muchoman798", "\n Do any of you think the King does a good job? Or are you uninformed of what he has been doing? Well, I will tell you what he is doing. \nHe built a tower on his keep's wall. This will keep him safe, but not the people of Al'Khazar or the people of Oren. There are holes all over the wall, there are guards who are not paid, there are gates that are left open and unmanned.  \n Now we are left unsafe. There are gaps all over the walls. But do you want to know what is worse? The King has accepted a treaty of peace with the Undead. Sounds good, right? No. There are terms to this deal. They get to walk around the cities of Oren unmolested and the Guard cannot hurt them. This is terrible. They should be killed on sight.Not only are they allowed to walk into the cities, they are able to get in otherwise. \n Do not stand for this, fight back. \n ~ L", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Regrets", "HappyJackington", "For obvious reasons, I am not disclosing my name on this pamphlet. \nSnowy feilds was a grand city... It is a tragedy that it was lost... A few men, lead by Vardak fought to defend it, but they were unable.. The King was not there, but he sent Vardak in his place. That is not enough. He should have fought with us to save that great city.  Our morale would have been higher, and Snowy Fields saved. \nDo you think he regrets not fighting there. I don't. I know he doesn't. The King just cares about his own safety, not that of his people. Look at that new tower on his Personal Keep. The money could have paid the guards, could have strengthened the walls of Al\"Khazar (which have many holes). And what is worse? The King does not think we should re-build Snowy Fields. He thinks it should be left there as \"a reminder to the people.\" would a greater reminder not be to restore the homes and gibe ther people their lives back? \nDo not stand for this \n~L", ""),
        StaticBook("Royal Seal and excusion", "Desires", "Evern is excuse to the chicken's keep for one day. - Signed and dated by Alician Redwood.", ""),
        StaticBook("Royers Journal.", "digdog7789", "Being a shaman is hard and a challenging process.This is my journal on becoming one. Day 1:I got my tier 1 staff today.Im very excited getting it. Day 2:I found a golden staff in a chest and keeping it until tier 4. Day 3:Me and Zorkis are working on the meeting room today. Day 4:Omnom has went off to collect his mighty gold staff.hes excited.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ruakik's Resignation", "Ruakik", "Everything around here is changing, and I do not deal well with change. I have decided to leave. I do not expect to be missed much, as I was never around. Best of wishes to all of you.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ruakik's Tempororay Leave", "Ruakik", "Today I have decided I will be going on leave from the Druids. I lurk around the tree, with no clear purpose, far too much. I have decided to take up being a Bard, to pass de time. I shall travel around Aegis, singing my songs, and will return every once in a while. By no means is dis permanent, and I will probably come back to da Grove after a short while. However, I would like to retain  the ownership of my rooms.", ""),
        StaticBook("rude awakernings", "harryscott123", "i awoke in the middle of a forest 4 dwarves butchered ... gaarag is not here i did this ........... DAY 2   a courier of the king was dead on my floor better clear up the mess im losing control ,i nealy attacked gaarag the other day im ............. doomed NO i cant of its not posible i was only alone with him for a second i .... killed my older brother, gaarag cant find out that would be bad.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rudik Bronzefists Diary - Deliver back to him for a prize!", "Rokhazula", "These may be my final words, if they are... Then you have most likely found this book. This book is the last testemant from my words, and my words alone. Continue reading if you wish to know more, if you don't then I doubt you have the strength to continue.. It all started as if it was a normal day, working on the fields as I normally had, living off the la -nd, our walls were high and our spirits strong until.. They came. The rotten flesh consumed bodies of once great heroes, turnt into madness as they destroyed everything in their path, it was a massacre, we fought strong but died a worthy death, most of us that is, we tried to fight it was to no avail, we lost more than we killed. The minions of the undead were tough, tougher than we had fought as they pillaged and destroyed this village us dwarves tried to retreat underground, it was to late. The undead had rounded us up as they started at us with an evil gaze, I myself was up on the hill, staring over the situation as they killed them off, one by one. It was a bad dream I thought I was wrong, the killing continued into nights end, battered corpses and burnt bodies lay scattered over the land, this was not a worthy land like it once was, it was a blood bath.. So, now I leave after that grusome event, to the land of Kul'Urguan. Hopefully, I have friends still there, if anyone reads this book find me and deliver it at once, you must give it to me. You must!", ""),
        StaticBook("Rufio's Journal", "Gousby", "Irba, 25th of the First Seed, 1328\n \n We finally arrived at the Nordic encampment! It's small but it's still new.. The place looks great though lads. I hope the journey was worth it. \n \n Itnan, 3rd of the Second Seed, 1328 \n \n I've met Vigleiven. The head architect 'ere in the Nordic encampment. Shift fella. Don't know if I trus' him. He seems like a suspicious lad. I'll keep my eyes on 'em. \n \n Itnan, 23rd of The Second Seed, 1328 \n \n Red Fist guild tried the Norsemen.. We put that lad in his place. Made 'em walk away. I'm certain it won't be the last of 'em. But we'll see.. when the plan happens.. they'll know of the norsemen. ~~~~~~~~~~~~ \n The lad apologized. But he doesn't understan' who he crossed. His lackey Jack, challenged Ayre. Don't think it'll turn out well.", ""),
        StaticBook("Rule 34", "char615", "dont do rule 34 its very bad bad and fluttershy will cream at you aaaahhhhh.... Ponygraphic is bad dont do drugs reece fartid :P", ""),
        StaticBook("Rule Boook draft.", "hayden34666", "Staying on roof, first warning, second fine of 50 minas, third Jail // Drawn sword in public, first warning, second fine of 50 , third jail. hood, first taken off , second escorted out of city // Assaulting a guard 100 minas // resisting this is death entering the guardhouse, first warning, second 50 minas fine, third jail vandilising,first 65 minas fine, second jail thats 75 for the above* treason, jail till kings orders/execution (depends on how bad it was) theft, things need to be given back until that they are under arrest, failure to do this will result in a fine on the value of the things which were stolen. *of the valie of the things* value* ///  being undead=death((/torture if tarl gets a villian app)) causing trouble, first warning, second jail (where it says assaulting a guard I mean assaulting anyone) Attempted murder, fine 500 minas Failure to pay=long term jail sentence", ""),
