        StaticBook("Scribe Assistant Interview", "Ranovak", "Icarus \n *Writes notes into book I personally love books, my whole life I try to devote to gaining new knowledge, reading is one of the ways I do that. \n 2. I will scour the earth to find new books. I will tend to the different facilities here, and if I fine a very special book, I will bring it to you. 3. It is impossible... the purly awe-striking way Aegians write, just leaves me speechless. I would never be able to put it in words. But please try... Says astounding \n Wrote 2 books \n No expectations, enjoy no matter what Wouldnt change anything \n Casus \n Loves to read loads of books. Studied enchantment and potions Patience No problem searching for books. book hunting, organizing, warden informing Deeply woven into very intricate stories Place reader ina position of understanding DID NOT write anything because minas problem but loves to write. Just to be able to write to help and entertain wardens add more books \n Onikenji loves stories and story-telling about adventures. would love to be part of science department Expects book-hunting, writing. Literature is not always written, they are stories, found and written about. Expand once its filled up \n Durzio \n enjoy testing my ming and reading Studied tactics as a youngling see reports, update, expand leisure books Expects to write reports and books literature would be written works of people, seperated into many genres Change lack of books. Written books: True", ""),
