        StaticBook("Sean's Journal", "VonEbs", "1st Itnan of Malin's Welcome\n Today, Perenele had a beautiful baby duaghter. She will become known throughout the land as Flora. Sge takes after her mother, a dark Elf, even though my twins and other daughter take after me. \n 2nd Sabet of The Second Seed\n Flora has grown so much. Her Brown hair is long, and her blue eyes are like the Ocean. She has appeared to have developed a way to communicate with Maxie, our families Wolfhound. \n 4th Tolta of The Grand \n Maxie has died this dau. Flora is not taking it well... She howls whenever she can. She loved that dog so much. \n 2nd Itnan of Sun's Smile\n Flora has gone missing! We are all searching, but not a clue has been found. \n Third Itnan of Sun's Smile\n We found her blanket today, slightly chewed on with wolf slobber all over it. We have to give up the search. Wolves have probably eaten her... *tears cover the remaining words. \n 4th Tolta of Sun's Smile\n Her funeral was today. Perenelle is sick with grief. Sam and Nicolas blame themselves for her disapearance. Read this  -help", ""),
        StaticBook("Search for Fae", "moop123", "can i have a book sir ? is what i said. I asked for the book so that i could document my search for Fae . Fae if your reading this now i have obviously found you . I have come to take you up on seeing you again . Well this is my story . I am currently looking for Snowy field witch is apparently where you live . I know I'm not far I'm following the signs A guard in Oren told me your town was taken over by the undead . I feared the wrst . I went searching for you strait away i wish for no harm to come to you . After looking in the Ruins of Crimson Vale I could not ind you . I would have to search els where . I am now in Al'khazar . It hase been weeks now . I'm going to have to file a missing person report with the Al'khazar Guards . I can not find you in Al'Khazar so now i must search Kal'Urguan . ~Clear", ""),
        StaticBook("Searching the paws", "nachotp", "I started this jorney to find a wolf even though I am badly hurt, Nights seem eternal there is no sign of life, not even a Chicken or a cow, In my journey I saw an old village , abandoned in a forgotten island with no sign of life , I decided to explore tihs old village, there was nothing in, just empty souls and night comes again, trying to stop me for search him , the wolf \n I'm Hungry but I need a shelter While I was wrtting this I found a lava source, creepy stuff. Sunrise! Thanks god I see the sun shine again! my enemies are dying! but I still can't see a wolf. \n I found some abandoned hideouts and houses, no food in them, I am still Hungry. I found the sea, with a gravel beach, pretty landscape, Great! Pigs! I can eat now! Much better now, I should keep walking, I see some ruins, I should explore them, There where chest but nothing on them, damn, I have no resources for this. \n But I just can't give up, I already started and night is coming again, just to brake my progress, I will stay in the ruins, Doing some research, someone was here about 5 minutes ago and he did a staircase, I hope he/she helps me, I yelled but noneone answer, I am alone. \n Near the ruins I found a crater, big crater, this spider meat isn't tasty at all, but I can't decide what to eat now, Sun shines again! It is time to continue, pig meat is tasty, I am not hungry anymore wait! there are some arrows here, someone is near! I see a village! I hope that I get help! A village above the ocean, weird idea, no sign of life, I am still alone I will keep waling, I see a big landmass, I see a bridge and farms, hope there is someone there, Night strikes again, There was just devastation, lifeless land, nothing. \n and the sun rises again, wanting me to find the wolf. \n You know what a grass desert is? I know now, someone destryoed an entire forest it seems I tamed a pig, just not to be lonely, if I don't eat him first. \n I found some walls, nothing much in there, until I found a chest with food! and resources! I am happy, I see a forest far, I am full with energy, exploring will be easy! and my energy ends up with the night coming. Some skeleteons are fighting against each other I shouldn't be near, 1 saw me, he is coming, I have to fight! he is dead now, He dropped some arrows, how usefull, and the morning begins! someone was here! he dided or dropped some things! There is a lot of tall grass, people haven't been here a lot, I found a perfectly shaped tree, almost manmade, Night will be here soon. \n Fire is a good companion, It kills very fast, Sugar canes, haven't seen them before in this trip, there are no more signs of another human being, Wait! I see more arrows! he may be near! false alarm, I am still lonely, and the night is here I found clay, interesting, it is pretty rare, What is that? it is orange, never seen that before I think, I should get closer, Pumkins! very rare pumkins! amazing discovery! More clay! and so the night strikes again, more lava I guess, I see something birght in the dark, yes! more lava. \n What a beautiful morning, it gives me hope to continue finding him, There was some dropped flowers! maybe I am not alone! signs of someone was here! leather pants, flowers dropped! I will hide in this tree for the night, it seems safer here, I will explore the forest tomorrow, maybe I see something. \n More dropped flowers, interesting, Incredible! a floating island! I will try to go up! The view from here is amazing, really pretty landscape, guess what! more lava! interesting, there is no tall grass in here I think I see a lot of pumkins! around 6 I guess, I am getting near 7! A planted sapling! someone has been here before! I see a house! it may be abandoned, you never know! some arrows near it, someone defenitly lives here! mmm... someone has been here recently but the house is being built I found the map of a village! don't recognize it though well I stayed the night there, sun is rising soon, I found some iron and made me a compass, I know where I walk now! And sun wasn't rising, sun was hiding. \n someone chopped a tree soon! and so the night came again, wishing that I stop, but me saying no, \n I don't know if it was a dream or something, I vuilt a boat and I got in, I was in the lake when I started falling into a void getting damaged then suddenly I appeared in the coast, next to the crafting bench, badly hurt, and now the sun is rising again More arrows on the floor, someone fighted here before interesting, I am on the house I saw before I am coming home, I found a house, let me see what is in it There wasn't much but I have food now, and the snow is annoying, hard to walk, Interesting, I found some signs, about some journal, Brodek wrote it, I found a building in development, no owner, no objects, Oh my god! someone did a huge room, with dirt expecting grass to grow! very interesting hardwork wow a castle! Incredible I have to go near it, what could I find, all this place is forgotten, but I should take a look, why not? it was a town called Besarn, but maybe it was forgotten, nothing in it and I see a building, looks big I will explore it too you know, Why not? I see a boat, but I should keep walking wow I am in a town now, noneone is in here, is like a dessert I should search for names, well one is Arbez wait I see someone this place is huge They have a huge arena! I found another town, next to sandy town, I should keep walking oh my god!, I reached the Cloud temple! and so I got back home with empty hands.", ""),
        StaticBook("Seasons", "SerahLove", "The shades of Autumn remind me of the rose red color of your brilliant, sparkling eyes and the deep brown hue of your soft windswept hair. As I stare at the beauty of the falling leaves as they dance ever so gracefully moments before they reach the ground, I find myself thinking of nothing and no one but you. \n The gentle summer brings to mind the life and warmth you exude. You are the sun that nurtures everthing around you and the light that graces this world with your pleasant golden glow. When all is cold and hopeless, and all I feel is sorrow, I search for you and call out your name. In you, I find strength. \n The fresh flowers of spring call to mind your fragrance that fills the air and that crisp, clear laughter of yours that brings peace and clarity to my soul. Many flowers, of all shapes, colors and sizes, bloom in the spring, but yours are the only colors my eyes and my heart long to see. \n And winter is every day that I am not with you.", ""),
