        StaticBook("secret message", "sconn", "to archmage cataris. meet me at the al'khazar sewers at 4 o'clock. We will discuss the attack on oren. if im not there find me in the magetower. I have also sent you a book in which we have a recruitment letter i have alreada startet to spread the recruitment books around random people. if you wish to join Iblees's followers come to the sewers today at 4 o'clock tell that to everyone that wants to join", ""),
