        StaticBook("Secret of the Mages", "Slayer15855", "Away in lands far lies an ancient secret, buried in history, shrouded in mystery. The keepsake of the mages; past and present... \n Withheld in a deceptive case, ancient and ruined... Holds within its perilous depths a power  beyond measure, deep in the womb of the world you will find it... \n It holds the knowlege of the world, ancient to modern, evil and good... all dengerous... It holds the power of life and death, none who enter leave the same. \n At the end of the road, under lighted sky and deepest dark lies the power. The choice the keep it within or destroy it will change the fate of all man for ever... \n Beware the tower! The deceptive case, in it awaits the power, but left not to take, but to win. The greedy will fall, the cautious will cower, there are only a chosen few who have the will to claim the power; others will bow to their will. \n The journey only begins here; it is but a start to the end of all ends, power beyond power... This journey begins where your journey began...", ""),
        StaticBook("Secret's of Talmah", "alien1workshop1", "Many things have been going on within the city that others have not seen it seems. The members of the city dont realize that I am part of all secret activity going on within the city . There has been underground labs and farms, made by Telinir and I, used for tesing . Although the testing of the suit and ITCD are coming along well, there are still many problems. This book must be kept hidden from the others, as it was stolen from Shamus. I am not fond of my theivish ways coming back to haunt me, but I cannot help it. clear", ""),
        StaticBook("Security Improvements", "123devmo321", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Security Improvements.", "123devmo321", "1 The docks. Docks need a 3 high wall around them so people cannot simply dodge the gate. \n \n 2. The Sewers. Sewer exits need to simply be made into a gate, and closed, anyone can enter the city like this, and we can't waste guards patrolling the sewers. \n \n 3. Gatehouse. The gatehouse needs some simple improvements, a window on the first floor, where the gate is operated, to look outside, would be perfect. We also need to make the guard house have a higher tower, so we can see around the city more efficiantly.", ""),
