        StaticBook("Segomo's Journal:", "Bloodnight", "Day one: Today i moved into a house with an alchemist in Aegis.. One of the only ones to state that He seems like a strange man, I will be on my guard when around him, Although his intentions may be d Darker", ""),
        StaticBook("Self Notes", "160126", "1. My birthday is,      Sabet, 12th of Suns Smile, 1312. \n \n", ""),
        StaticBook("selfur", "_Player_2_", "I am a Tall elf, who lives alone in the woods, ive never cut my hair or my beard, ive lived trying to grow the laggest tree possible it was my goal to create a nation full of trees i would redirect river currents so i could water my trees i created massive forrests and many large trees but i was never statisfied, so i looked for the greatest and the most pure of all waters, so i started to travel looking for a source . At each and every stop i planted trees and created huge trees, i felt like i was getting closer to the water source i was looking for because the trees i planted were becoming larger the more east i head the larger the trees get \n i started to notice that the more animals that were in the area, the larger the trees would become. They would grow and grow, then i saw a waterfall, the greatest, clearest waterfall i have ever encountered i put my hand in the water and i just felt a flow of massive energy go through me , this was it, this was the water i was looking for , i planted a sappling and  i fed it water from this new water source the tree didnt even take time to grow it just bounced up and grew, the more water i gave the bigger it became, i started to create a massive forrest but i realised that the trees had started to change color, from a light wood to a dark brown wood. the tree started to grow stronger, a draw me to it it seemed to be taking my life out of me, the tree grew stronger and started to consume my power .  I started to age at incredable speed, so i leaned against the tree and smiled as i slowly started to become dust and fade away . I have achieved my life long goal, i was happy, it was over", ""),
