        StaticBook("Sen's Dignity Part 2", "Brokencrowe", "Sen, you are an amazing Lover. I mean... When we're together, alone in that little bed of yours; the feeling is just so... I can't even describe it in words. I Love you for all your tight, rollin Elvan muscles, and that cute little... -parts of the pages are ripped- I just need to tell you one thing... You are one cheap, jerk. You didn't even buy me dinner. And you thought you could take me to the bed without paying?! What nerve. Oh... And thanks for the wallet... That you may or may not have given to me willingly.", ""),
