        StaticBook("Several Useful Cantrips For Calming The Mind", "Cowsgomooand", "These simple cantrips can be used to ready the   \n mind for spellcasting . \n ============================================= \n \n Exsisto Sedo - A more simple one for less skilled  \n users. \n \n Ego To Order Pacis - This one is more challenging  \n but has a greater effect. \n \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Sewer's for my Shelter", "EvilerGoose", "To get this book to write in I had to scam someone for sugar canes, Sugar Canes! How Pity . Sleeping in the sewers isnt that bad its the smell and knowing that you have to fish in tha Later. This Diary Is about my Daily Life, the Daily life of Miguel Corleone.                                                   Day 1 Winter. Today I got my book to write. It's freezing, Its winter, and its been raining all night. I still cant get any jobs and im s living in the sewers! I need a Home and a Plan! Yes ive been wrting Its my diary of being Homeless Day2 Winter. Today I was in Dawn's Bakery talking to my friend Airion. I also bought myself A hat! Day3 Winter. I just found a house with unprotected chests, i stole some of the stuff. Its a Good Day for Miguel! Day 4. Nothing Much happened today but i did climb some house's. Day 5 Winter My Luck is getting better i got some money and found a load of stuff, Great! Day 7 Winter. Nothing has happened but I did see someone snooping around the city. Day 8 Winter. The Cold is getting to me and it won't stop raining, I need to buy a Flat! Day 8 Winter. I have paid for a Trip to Laurien city of Elves. it is a fine city and its not Winter! But now i am low on money and need to find a place to get some money Today i got a Job as a Harvest worker, i am no longer Jobless or Homeless! I drank to My acheivement! Day 26 Winter, the End Day 32 Winter. My job hasn't taken off, I think i will leave infact. If you have noticed I have missed some days out, In those days I met some people including Dawn and Robin_Darke Its going well. Day 34 Winter. Im trying to shift this Redstone but it is very Hard, like no one wants it. Day 34 Winter. Today i have sold no produce and I need to sell it soon. Day 36 Winter, Ive left the city to see if i can sell my produce. Reminder Look out for Charl otte Rae Today, i was selling my wares to a charming chap named Wallace. A young bread boy was mugged by those horrible people in the mushroom hut!", ""),
