        StaticBook("SHAMAN GUDELINES", "Unicornwrangler", "So you want to be a Shaman, eh? Well to become intiated as a Shaman , you must first spend 2 days and 2 nights in the forest. Alone. You do this so you can become one with the Natural forces in our world. After this is done , talk to the Elder Shaman, or the Dominus Shaman.", ""),
