        StaticBook("Snowy feilds secrect entrance", "dirtryhary", "Dear holy undead of the nether i know youll kill me when you se me so i wrote this book i know where theres a secrect entrance to snowy fields if youre intrested wait 5 minutes after you read this then sumon lightning then ill know and ill ocme to you to show you the secrect entrance into snowy fields singed by Boak and i do know the entrance dear holy undead", ""),
        StaticBook("Snowy Fields", "Ratemenatorz59", "1st day: We raided the undead fort and failed. war was declared on the keep Alerting other soldiers. But they same outcome came about. We hid underground in our campground. Then that's when they summoned undead into it. The UAC had lost men. But the ascended supported us as accomplices. Day 2: We lost the battle. And many high ranks died. Also the hooded died. If only the undead didn't have lightning. O the power to summon zombies and skeletons. Farewell.", ""),
        StaticBook("Snowy Fields Base Design", "Starsweeper", "Flag Design wyby wbbb wyby base 12x10 height 5 fence back and 5along 3 high then 2 high fence piece ontop of snow wait", ""),
        StaticBook("Snowy fields guild hall", "redbaron", "The story behind the guild hall in snowy fields is much different then others. As to somes suprise the guild hall was built before it was inducted into the mages guild. The reason it was built was because of the owners of the town (tarannon and zerragon) had discovered ancient ascended ruins.  In this ruins, that were under the town itself they found a wall with much writing on it and what looked to be magic script on the wall. This led them to build the town in the first place, and in time the guild hall. Tarannon and zerragon hoped to find someone to run and manage it when they met a man named Ogland. it was many some years before he officialy became the leader of the guild. They thought he could scribe this magic script and find this long lost ascended magic. With the Arcane Mages approval Ogland began to go to work. A library was built and Ogland sat there for many days.  Trying to find its meaning.  Rumour has it he is still there to this day.  Trying to figure out this riddle the ascended left on the ancient wall.", ""),
        StaticBook("So you wanna be a \"Regular\"? (Info Book)", "InvincibleHawk", "So as the title suggests, you want to become a Regular at our fine establishment do ya? Well I am assuming before you sign that document you want some good old fashioned info? Am I right? Well here it is... INTRODUCING... The VonSchlichten \"Regular\" Membership! This new membership option will allow you to claim THREE mugs of ale a night, for \"free\"! (Game Day)", "")
    )

