        StaticBook("So you want to be a \"Regular\"?", "InvincibleHawk", "So I'm assuming by the fact that you are reading this.. you have heard about our place? What?! You haven't? Well let me give you a little background information before we begin!", ""),
        StaticBook("So you want to be a \"Regular\"? (Info Book)", "InvincibleHawk", "If you have answered the title with a \"yes\", then you are in for a treat! However, I have to give you some info before you sign up right? So here it is!", ""),
        StaticBook("So you want to be a Shaman", "cgsphinx", "It is a honorable path brother! It takes more than muscles to communicate with the spirits and it takes a lot of effort to study herbalism and alchemy too. Let's start with the requirements aside from a healthy body and a strong mind. +Spiritual Atunement+ One needs to be able to look past the veil of life and nature. worry not, only very few are born with this, once you learn enough herbalism you can strengthen this ability", ""),
        StaticBook("Sold Items", "Charlie22", "Iron Ingots 18 for 360 minas \n Bookcase 64 for 300 minas \n Iron Ingot 10 for 250 minas \n Iron Ingot  for 360 minas \n Iron Ingot 24 for 360 minas  \n Leather Pants 1 for 40 minas \n Leather Helmet 1 for 40 minas \n Melon 128 for 140 minas \n Iron Sword 1 for 70 minas \n Iron Sword 1 for 70 minas \n Iron Armor Set 1 for 1000 minas \n Leather Armor Set 1 for 200 minas \n Iron Armor Set 1 for 800 minas \n Lwather Armor Set 1 for 200 minas \n Egg 4 for 200 minas \n Chain armor set 1 for 200 minas \n Iron armor set 1 for 950 minas", ""),
        StaticBook("Soldier Ghost", "DaWIggasss", "i bled for you--would you for me? I blessed a skin in blazing fuel then took a arrow in a duel of 'He or i do die.' i often question 'why' Do you? my country was my like to give would you for country cease to live? Sinking in a mire of death you have no choice so while you're still alive. Rejoice! I cried in failure did you care? and as i waned, were you aware of what i did? fighting for aegis  while you hid behind your comfort back at home? Still relaxed? My wife and child are fading at the tomb.", ""),
        StaticBook("Soldiers Joy", "silco97", "This be an old son written for bored soldiers. \nFirst I thought a snake had got me it happened dreadful quick. T'was a sword bit me leg, right off", ""),
        StaticBook("Some a' Da Greatest Orc Songs EVA! By: Rannulf", "loopmoploop", ": Once in da' lands of Krugmar! A long long time ago! Da Orcs fought, and died for their leader! Krug the almighty Orc up high! He was da greatest leada' eva! may da' father Krug, rise up high! \n Da' tale of Bein'lur \n his clan was wiped out, by da Doms His breda's head chopped right off! so he marched down ta da Rax, an told em' lemme at em' right now After da great war da rex made him Dominius! An honer which he took with pride! he killed da riversder clowns!So Snahar was den born! He died fightin' Iblees spawn, all were, so proud. Bein now lays with da mighty Krug up in, a cloud. \n Tythus' Downfall \n Da day after old Bein' died, all of da Orcs. Dey got fead up with Tuthus, yes dey did! Mogroka and Gorefang challenged him! To the death! He was struck down by a battle axe like a sissy man! Long live Mogroka and Gorefang!", ""),
