        StaticBook("Sornof the Avenger", "sparten4ever92", "Sornof was born on the 22nd of November in the world of Aegis. Early years Were filled with great joy as the young Orc learned the ways of the Hunt and began His studies of war and weaponry. every night his mother would tell him the stories of s ome of the great heroes and ached one day to become one. Then one day in mid summer. the small Orc camp he lived in was attacked by strange pig creatures. All of his fellow peopl e were killed. Then their Leader spoke. Hatred seething from every little word he spoke. \"Ibless will return the man said. And our hordes will destroy you fiflth\" Im writing a book And it ok oops lol back to the story excuse that. Now where were we? Yes, He then killed the shaman of the camp and laughed while Sornof hid behind an old tree. Then the ruler left leaving nothing but fire i his wake. To be continued in next book.", ""),
