        StaticBook("spread the message of Rogan", "Smithy_Boy", "if you are reading this then you are holding my book. after you have read the final message pass this book to someone you know . this book will travel far and wide u til it eventually reaches me again . please follow these instructions correctly and pass the book along. But first you should read my message.     My name is Rogan, you shall know my name. If you meet me tell me you've read my book . This book is not just a book it is a test. A test of a persons character. maybe this book will not return to me, but if you are the one who does not pass on this boo m", ""),
