        StaticBook("Strange Book", "luchian", "*In between the books you see a strange book, You drag it out and reads it* \n I have found you atlast. One by one you will all fall, And in a few weeks you will see That even in between your ranks... There is a traitor. \n Not even the sages can keep you alive from me. The ghost shall Become just what he claims to be. And Callum You will be tortured in the most Vile ways.   *You shiver and drop the book, You quickly pick it up and continues to read* \n At the end all that is left of you will be a pathetic and broken leader surrounded by the Bodies of those that has died.  a wierd letter at the end* \n   B *The book is signed with a letter at the end* \n B it out and reads it*   it out and read it out and reads - out and read it erase out and reads - out and read it", ""),
