        StaticBook("Strange Happenings", "alex612", "I Witnissed Some Orcs Burning Book At The Entrance I Witnessed Some Gaurds Attacking A Different Gaurd.As Far As I Could Tell They Were All Work ing For Oren", ""),
        StaticBook("Strange happenings of Sanhar", "Lexperiments", "I do not understand what has been going on.. Too many things are happening. The world is crumbling. I just don't understand.... *Lex seems to be messily jotting down his thoughts.* \n \n It all started... what, last year, two years ago? Everything was going well. I was living in AlKhazaar at the time.. I wasn't expecting much. But, next to Horen's Tomb, I found this book. I swear, I've told this story a million times. Anyways, I found a book. It told me about some Tree of Knowledge... I wondered what it was, and asked my friend who lived with the elves, Bell, if she knew about it. She said it was the main tree of Laurelin, and I set out immediately . I went there, and got the book from the library. It told of a tribe called the Kar'Lani and how they had an ancient cursed artifact in the winterfall tombs, which had been recently invaded by the Undead. I set out back to AlKhazaar immediately and told the queen. Others heard, and we made a search party. \n \n Crap, I hear thunder... anyways.. We got there and found another book. It said this: \"I hid it in AlKhazaar's fake father. His cold hands keep it safe. His cold heart keeps it safe.\" This stumped me and everyone else. The day now is Tolta, 31st of the Suns Smile, 1310, and I still don't understand it, even after I found it months after I found that book in the tombs. \"It\" was the artifact. My friend Nel'Thok, fellow shaman apprentice, is the one who found it. It was under my shaman master, Thyst's, house. A tomb of some man who is a lie. The Cursed Sword was with it. I finally had it. I finally had the treasure. \n \n A year later. I finally found someone who knew about the sword, and he was utter bullshit. Complete waste of my time. He started rambling about how Tur'Gash, the man from the tomb, was some great hero or some shit. Then why did no one know about him ? He rambled about how Iblees was a little boy from another world of carpenters, and how he ate three stones that made him evil. I mean, what kind of crap IS this? All he said about the sword is that it was cursed, and that it made me see hallucinations or something. Damn loonies. \n \n Anyways, that's the sword. Bein'lur is such an odd case, too. A while ago, I think last year in 1309, Bein started acting very strange. He gained the power of lightning, which only the most elite shamans can do, and Bein isn't even a shaman. A while later, he learned how to summon monsters, from zombies to skeletons to creepers... to giants. All this worried me a lot, but no one thought there was something wrong. No one but me. Well, and Tre'bok a little bit, but he was Bein's little teacher's pet. \n \n This year, around a month ago. Bein died. It was a sad day, and the orcs realized he WAS our leader, not the Rex. The Rex does nothing. He has not left his castle for years. So they rebelled. And I joined, too. Me and three others, the three being Gorkil, were talking at the camp when we heard Bein's voice, preaching at us to stop the rebellion. We refused, and he said he must stop it himself- and then, he started using lightning . He shot it down at the Rebel camp, burning and destroying. We tried to fight back, but there was no way we could. He continued using deadlier tools; he started shooting fireballs like the Undead, and summoned hordes of monsters. The four of us managed to survive. He started aiming fireballs for us, and all dodged them but me. I was harmed badly, and started to rage at the damn cowardly ghost, \"YOU COWARD! YOU FIGHT WITH NO WAY FOR US TO BEAT YOU! I AM MORE ORC THAN YOU, BEIN!\" He yelled at me.. to leave Krugmar. This pissed me off even more. He lit me on fire. I survived. He eventually gave up. He descended from the heavens, next to me, and spoke directly to me. He told me to \"do what's right\" and stop the revolution. He then dissapeared, leaving his staff behind. Fuck him. \n \n Brevias's death really saddens me. A while ago, before Lower Sanhar was even built, I was a good friend of Elder Shaman Brevias. He was the one who first showed me shamanism. I trusted him... but then he dissapeared, all that time ago. A few months ago I found out he had been turned undead. All trust I had for him was lost (though he was still pretty badass). And just after Bein's insane failed killing spree, he came to Sanhar. We talked for a while, before that damn Mogroka interrupted us and tried to kill Brevias. He dealt with Mogroka quickly, and we continued talking. He was horrified how everyone has been missing, and knows that someone needs to bring Krugmar back to its former glory. He said his final goodbyes, and sent his brother from the FAR east, Ragnok, to try to help. Ragnok isn't stupid, but he doesn't understand much about civillization. He's stubborn, too. It will take a long time to teach him.. \n \n Then there's that weird building right next to Sanhar. APPARENTLY it's a shaman guild, but no one would tell me about it until it is done, and it makes no sense. There is nothing orcish or shamanistic about it. It is made of wood and orange wool. It is stupid and unreasonable. And I also do not get why I could not know. Ah well. \n \n Thyst.. I miss Thyst. He was a great teacher, and one of the greatest Shamans who ever lived. He was master of the Arena and one of the high Shamans. No one could beat him. Except the Rex. Thyst had a spirit inside him. He was possessed, and could not help it. The spirit hungered for power constantly.. and it went too far. The spirit made Thyst challenge the Rex. He woke him up for his sleep of years, and challenged him. The Rex killed him in battle, and went back to sleep. Thyst was dead... Thyst was dead... *This page seems a bit soaked.* \n \n Everyone is dissapearing or dead. Shaggo has not been seen for months, though I heard Rogmarr say he was on some journey to the east. I have not seen Nel'Thok for months but some say they have. Tre'bok has been gone for over a year. I know he's alive.. but no one knows where he is. Thyst is dead. Brevias is gone forever. Bein is dead. I don't know where everyone has gone, but me and Rogmarr have been the only shamans around for at least months. I don't know what's happening or what is wrong. The healing fountain in Lower Sanhar has been drained of magic. The world is crumbling, bit by bit . \n Heroes need to come to the call of arms and save us all. \n \n /Written by Dwarf Shaman Lex on the 32nd of the Sun's Smile, 1310\\", ""),
        StaticBook("Strange text", "Pepernoot", "\"Op'em kan. len ioe Letho...\"", ""),
        StaticBook("Streets Of Gotham", "Jarhead90", "Ive been chaseing rumors way too much now a days... I heard that Batman is gone for good. And that Robin died in Iraq . I am Josh Drake the son of the third Robin Tim Drake. I have been watching Batman for five years. Studying his moves and patterns. This Bat is not the Bat I know. It is not Bruce Wayne. No one knows where he is. But I will find him until I do. I am The Batman! \n I walk the streets of Gotham undercover as a drug dealer. Watching my city's criminals. These people make me sick... I watch the men and women of the slums deal drugs,do prostitution, and kill for money. You would think by now the police would do something about this. But no. They are currupt. Every last one. The only good cop was Gordon. But he is long gone now. He died two years ago in a shooting by the Monarch Thearter.Everyone says the Joker killed him. But I think it was Jason Todd. Jason was meerly a boy when he died. Young and full of energy just like me. I would do anything to find out if he really did kill Gordon. But until that day only god will know. I stand ontop of the GCPD station watching this Hell hole of a city destroy itself. I can stop that ,but do I choose too? Yes. I try my hardest to be what Bruce was as Batman but for me theres no comparision. He was and will be the only Batman.", ""),
        StaticBook("Strife's Heart", "duramon", ".... Mystery, it clouds your form Ecstasy, it keeps us warm The dance has begun, with but us two I'll take your hand, I'll walk with you Take me to the depths in the sea of love Go with me further , never enough I'll breathe in your perfmued scent You intoxicate, invade my head.  Give in to your senses, here we go Follow me now, let your heart take control Our time is short, and death is nigh To mountains and peaks, we must fly leave life behind in our  own world Get away from it all, run with me, my pearl Forget all your troubles, walk in the  moonlight Gaze into my eyes, stay with me tonight. We need not fear, we must venture on Forsake loneliness, drink in our love's song Pure angel of dawn, you've stolen my heart You illuminate me, pierce the dark, Your purity , it leaves me numb Your beauty, where does it come from? I long to touch your smooth, soft skin To stroke your hair, give you everything. To pull you into my mebrace To hear you breathe, to see your face To feel your heart beat softly with mine To hold you tightly, leave reason behind To draw you in, to taste your kiss All heartbreak gone, nothing amiss I'd lose myself inside your eyes Stay in love forever mesmerized Run away with me, barefoot in the sand Walk by my side, rule all the lands Hear our hearts beating with love so wild Our heads spinning with passion, my child There's untamed joy we can't contain Hypnotizing ardor we can't explain I'm Romeo, will you be  Juliet? We can share a bond we'll never forget. We can clasp hands in the twilight Hold each other, day and night We can be alone, just me and you Our souls entwined, you know it's true We can do anything, if you'll take faith I'll protect you, I'll keep you safe We can be together eternally We can live forever - so come with me...for you are  my love. .You are Alpha and Omega, The begginning and The end and my love is yours eternally.", ""),
        StaticBook("strongholds to the north", "Eric_Armadillo", "There are three new buildings to the north. One is rectangular and located, where the undeads southern fortress was. It belongst to a Baron Juven, who seems to build his private palace there. just a few hundret meter north of that, behind the Oren northern Wall, lie two big ascended fortresses. The southern is rectangular and some kind of town, the northern is round with six towers around it. Most likel it is where the undeads round fortress was before. So the north belongs to the ascended now. the two northern fortresses are if the size of winterfell", ""),
