        StaticBook("Supply Order from Dawn Headquarters", "Hempshine", "By the order of High Chief Baker Dawn Perea, Dawn Inc. sends this list of demands of food stuffs and food suppy materials. The delivery of which shall be swift and effective. List as follows Twenty-one(21) stacks of Wheat \n fourty(40) prime Eggs \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Survival Guide", "Chrisld", "Do you want to survive in every area of the world? \n \n Here is a list of all you need to survive!   \n Basics: Wood: first thing is wood. It is one of the most usefull materials for making both tools and buildings. To get wood you must cut down trees. When you have cut down some trees you shouldd collect all the saplings and Replant the trees. That way you have an infinite source of wood! \n After collecting a bit of wood you shouldd begin to craft some tools. Cobblestone: You shouldd then collect some cobblestone. It is one of the best materials to build houses and other stuff with. Many people use cobblestone instead of wood to build with because it doesnt burn and it is harder to destroy. \n Shelter: Now to one of the most important parts. To survive at night. At night monsters come out and try to kill you! So before it gets dark you shouldd make a shelter. Make a house and remember to place some doors! If you make windows you shouldd put some glass in them or else monsters will attack you through the windows. \n Inventory: When your inventory gets full you shouldd put your items in a chest or just throw it into some lava. Items that hit lava will be lost forever so be careful! \n Food And Farming: When you get hungry you should get some porkchops. You get them by killing pigs. If you cook porkchops they heal 4 health instead of 1,5! If you like mining and and dont have time to look for pigs you should make a wheat farm. Destroy tall gras to find seeds and then use a hoe on some dirt or gras. Plant the seeds where you used the hoe. When it have fully grown you just smash it and you get wheat and seeds. Remember to replant the seeds! \n This book was written by: Saphora (Chrisld)", ""),
        StaticBook("Survival Guide Volume 1", "PilotAce1812", "The following paragraphs are tips and tricks to survive in the lands of ageis . This is the first volume out of 3. This book will give you tips and tricks on how to kill or hunt th e monsters and creatures of ageis \n Tip # 1 Always Walk around Ageis with a sword and armor is always nice too \n Tip # 2 Most creatures will be stunned momentarily after you strike them this is the oppourtunity to strike them again, In this process if done correctly you will never get hit", ""),
        StaticBook("Survival in Aegis", "thepizzaplac", "The first step in survival is wood .The key to everything is wood. So once you have wood you make an axe .To make an axe Turn the wood into wooden planks cancel YEs?", ""),
        StaticBook("Survival tips", "sosmooshi", "Chapter 1: Food and supplies An important thing you should have on you is food. Food like cooked pork, mushroom soup, and cooked fish If you get injured in anyway one of those foods will help you alot. If your thinking of going out in the dark and scavenging for minas then you should at least have a s sword It would be helpful if you had armor. Chapter 2: Mobs There are different mobs scattered throughout Aegis. Such as Spiders, Skeletons , Zombies and Pigmen. I would advise you to stay away from pigmen as much as you can they can do alot of damage Though if you kill a pigman you get a minimum of 50 minas. Chapter 3: Killing mobs. A good and smart way to kill mobs is to make a trap. A simple trap is a to did a 3x3 hole 3 blocks down and put a cactus in the middle. That will slowly kill any mobs. Then another way is with a series of water and lava or cactus. Another way to kill is did a 1x1 hole 2 blocks down and try to get the mob in. Then simlply slash the mob with your sword. This is the end to my short survival book,  ~Asden~", ""),
        StaticBook("Surviving", "Dredcor", "I was at a meeting of several orcs and some elves today. They were speaking of the relation orcs had with other nations and of the Undead and the eggs they stole. I yearn to join the undead, they are my best chance to survive. However, I still must either find the Necronomicon or attract their attention.  \n Today I met an elf. His name is Altar and I think I might kill him. \n He said I could live with him. I thanked him and accepted his offer. It turned out the tower he lived in did not even have a proper roof. I will live with him until I am self-sufficient. I will possibly join the guild he speaks of that his brother runs. Once I have taken everything from them that I can, I will kill them. \n \n So far I have only contributed to this relationship. I have gotten very little from it. If this does not start paying off soon I will kill him and leave. \n \n I almost died today. I fell down what looked like an old mining shaft. I managed to survive though I was seriously injured. I eventually found my way close to the surface and dug the rest of the way out.  Today I decided to leave Altar's company. I went back to Krugmar and got tossed into the sewers. I hope I actually get a hut soon.", ""),
        StaticBook("Surviving the Northern Plains", "deanofantastico", "Surviving the northern plains beyond settlements such as SnowyFields and Winterfell Surviving the northern plains beyond settlements such as SnowyFields and Winterfell", ""),
        StaticBook("Surviving the Undead", "Ranovak", "Yes?", ""),
        StaticBook("Suspect \"Vulgrak\"", "Jallentime", "I am currently running for my life down the King's road to Alkhazar. There is a man named \"Vulgrak\" who wears dark robes and has a golden staff. A friend of his told him to get an Ascended to cleanse him, and he went nuts! Along with the fact that he wears dark robes and just sent one of his so called, \"minions\" to kill me ( My arm is still bleeding damn it!) This man is either tainted or a full blown undead. I am sure of it!", ""),
