        StaticBook("Tactics", "Ratemenatorz59", "To governer sornof and captain vardak: Our teams of swordsmen aren't enough for the undead We should try out bows and arrows and rain them on the walls. Where they stay. If we go into the keep we will burn. So we can rain arrows in the fort to affect them in damage without us getting hurt. The swordsmen soldiers are to attack the hordes of summoned undead. And the sages and the ascended will infiltrate the undead keep and attack there. So it is a 3 way battle The walls and arrows, The hordes and swords, and the ascended vs undead in the back. Please use this tactic if it is useful.", ""),
