        StaticBook("Taken from chests.", "iohnoh", "\n Name, What, How mutch. \n Iohnoh, Wood, 8 Planks. \n 1 1/2 stacks Cactus \n 1 1/2 stacks White wool \n 1 stack White wool \n 5 stacks of Planks \n I used nearly all the wood, all the coal. \n I put everything in the Misc. chest, and unless yoiu want more this is now finished \n Excluding the interior, that is up to your tastes \n If you take something please add your name too. ~ iohnoh", ""),
        StaticBook("Taking first steps", "Blackdragonhole", "In the wilds I saw many things. Grassy feild endless snow new trees that were discovered As I continued I saw buildings that looked abandoned old villages that are ghost towns Many places seem old but interesting but they dont show anything that interested me. The best I could see was the endless trees and extoic places that held life. Nature seems to be a beacon of hope to me. I shall become one day part of it. I will find a way to become more intuned with nature. May Nature speak for us all.", ""),
        StaticBook("Taking Tolls", "om_bananas", "This book is writte regardinga recent skirmish involving humans, orks, and a few elves. It began as an ordianary day. I was heading to oren to gather supplies to renovate my tent. when I came across a group of orks taking tolls along the road. Knowing we were ied with them I decided to ask them what was going on. One of them a Grunt I beleive told me they were taking back Kramroe. After a breif chat I decided that there cause was just and therefore decided I would help them. After about half a day of taking tolls of human passerbys I took a break for lunch. It was during this time that a man we had taken a toll from (150 mina) came by with a group of about ten human soldiers. who attacked our group of orks and elves. Of course not having an officer there I hesitated before joining the fray. However it was clear the orks needed assistance so I donned my armour and fought. Killing two humans with my bow and one with my bow. Eventuy we drove them back. But I fear my relations with the erase bow and one with my bow. Eventuy we drove them back but I fear my relations with the erase", ""),
