        StaticBook("Tar'rok's background", "MarioMixer", "Tar'rok is Sarim only hypnotised and cant remeber him: Tar'rok is a human transforming into a magical being he endures pain at this his human organs and blood is replaced as the hypnotist sub-consiously transmitted power to Tar'rok Tar'rok normally will feel tired and drowsy as he is not used to his new formed body Tar'rok has only one freind (hwaldar) secrently the one who hypnotised him Tar'rok has been very sick lately because he is only half-human now he has human emotions but magical organs and blood Tar'roks bllod is a deep black because oxegan is not keeping tar'rok alive magic is thats why it is constanly being thrown out of his body", ""),
