        StaticBook("Task List", "BenjaminKayEight", "move the book \"The Dark Brotherhood\" to history section \n ;; check the message center in laurelin north and take a log of the messages \n get an updated list of initiates from Leafwind and keep it in this room \nget a list of members from BlackThorn \n every now and again put the messages in the message room into the old messages book case", ""),
