        StaticBook("Tayldors Diary", "TWC7", "Dear Diary today was an adventerous day i met someone new his name is Nick he is an elf who likes to adventure and find out new things he is very amusing and cheery and likes to meet new people.", ""),
        StaticBook("Taylor?", "impymut", "I met her at Ark's End. She is a good friend. ((Full inventory?)) She is very friendly, but I'm not sure about the guardian part. Not in a legal sense. There's a few cheap homes in Laurelin, 4000 minas I think. I left because of the sign telling us to leave, it may not be as abandoned as we thought... Who is it, if you don't mind me asking?", ""),
        StaticBook("Teddys book of power", "Thaddeus12", "spell of night This spell will enable you two make yourself invisable incantatoe", ""),
        StaticBook("Teehee", "coastercam0", "I'm going to cut you up. I'm going to cut your family up. Bircalin. Murgraw. Indelwehn. I would watch your backs", ""),
        StaticBook("Teh Art o' Fightin'", "DwarfGuy45187", "By: Valen Starbreaker I'm tellin' ye 'ow to fight now, stop readin' if yer not a warrior . Now ta start with teh weapons, me personal favorite is an axe and that's what I'm tellin' ye 'ow ta use! Tah use an axe ye 'ave ta first train with tah Wooden Axe. Ta use teh Wooden Axe, ye 'ave to make it wiv three wooden planks and two sticks , after doin' that ye 'ave an axe! Almost done, now ye 'ave ta slash da orcs ta gain sem skill! 'kay, now ye 'ave ta keep advancin' and usin' things like Stone Axes and Iron Axes . Ta use teh axe ye 'ave ta swing teh Orcs in teh special places! That's teh true way ta use it .", ""),
        StaticBook("Telandriel's Diary", "Telandriel", "A few days ago, I lived on in the wilderniss. Together with my friend Bloodlest, also known as Bog. We tried to make our living there and get enough minas to buy a house. But it didn't work. When I returned to Laurelin, I met a druid. A very nice elf who seemed able to help me find a home. But then we figured out the cheapest house was 4000 minas, far too much for me. Then, a miracle happened. He decided to buy the biggest house and give me a room in it, just for my less than 1000 minas. I hope I can help him with something, to some sort of repay what he did for me. Now I'm sitting here, while it's raining outside. I'm thinking about getting a job. Becoming an architect or guard. Or maybe, a mailboy, so that I can see the world.", ""),
        StaticBook("Telanir's Book of Minas", "Telanir", "Property of: Telanir \n Transaction 1: Thondi(Quinton16): Cost: 250, Payed: 177, Left: 73. Desc: Plot of land for shop. Transaction 1: Payed off by Thondi. \n Transaction 2: Stas(Stas9394): Cost: 400, Payed: 0, Left: 400. Desc: Plot of land for living.", ""),
        StaticBook("Telanir's Diary", "Telanir", "Well, now that I've gotten sugar canes, I can make books! Fantastic I'l say. I've been searching for them for quite a while. I'm almost finished my guard tower as well, just need to add some glass. \n I've finished my tower! I think I might make a quick drop system for emergencies... \n Was promoted to High Ranger. Seems the Commander doesn't give a crap about books. Oh well.", ""),
        StaticBook("Telanir's Hazard Suit", "Telanir", "-CONFIDENTIAL- Property of: Telanir Description: The hazard suit is an invention made by Telanir. It is a protective case that surrounds the user. \n Material: It is made of leather for unrestricted movement and DCT3 for protection. \n Info: DCT3 is Diamond Coated Titanium 3 s Specifications: HZv1.7 (Hazard Suit version 1.7) \n Installations: \n #1: Mobility Enhancer - Increased movement fluidity and decreases wasted energy. \n #2: Velocity Normalizer - Damage recieved from falling from heights reduced. \n #3: Output Energy Amplifier: Increases power in strikes and mining. \n #4: Underwater Breathing Kit - Allows for a short time increase when underwater. \n #5: Inertia Stabilizer - Increases balance and prevents unnessecary falls. \n #6: Escape Module - When in danger, the suit provides the quickest way to get to a safe locat ion \n #7 Built-in ITCD - Includes the ITCD inside the suit.", ""),
        StaticBook("Telanir's Inventions", "Telanir", "-CONFIDENTIAL- Property of: Telanir     \n #1: ITCD - InsTant Communications Device. Used for instant communication from large distances. \n #2: ITCD Transmitter - Small construction   built for improving signal distance for the ITCD. #3: Hazard Suit - See book on \"Hazard Suit by Telanir\" for more info.", ""),
        StaticBook("Telanir's Research", "Telanir", "-CONFIDENTIAL- Property of: Telanir \n Discovery 1: \"magic fragrance\", an invisible substance that is active during the day. During night the \"fragrance\" dissipates and is inactive. At dawn the \"fragrance\" starts acting up and is active. It has a noticeable effect on experiments. It seems to change events at random. For instance, the ITCD during night works fine. During the day it can behave strangely. The fragrance often acts upon things negatively. A gas pocket will explode rather than dissipate", ""),
        StaticBook("Telazark, A bandits haven", "kaixo", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Telperien's Journal", "Pieworship", "It was the first day out of the temple today, and wood is short. I feel kind of bad, but I went down to the elvish docks and chopped down the trees there. However, I have began to consider the arcitectural possibilities of my new home I am planning to build . I began to plot out what would be my house. After considering possibilities, I looked back into my race's design ideas. Everything seemed to point towards the idea of civilizations in the trees . I wandered for many days on end, without food or water, looking for a spot to construct a house in a densly wooded area.", "")
    )

    private fun _AEGIS_23(): List<StaticBook> = listOf(
        StaticBook("Template Book", "blackhawk77g", "General Info: This section should describe whatever the book is about. For example a brief summary of Wrath's clutch would be placed here inside of the Wrath's Clutch book. \n \n ((Log Addition Date, Ex: Oct.3, 2011)) Specific info from diplomats logs or other sources recieved that day. The source must be valid and trusted! If the source is not trusted, please note this before writing about the information given. \n \n Ye may continue from here by placing more information in the book as it is given by diplomats or told by other reliable sources. Make sure to date all information before writing. ((Skip two lines before writing a new dated section))", ""),
        StaticBook("Temple Crypt's Insignia", "Jerry_Man", "\nOOu Stratien\nMaount Tiouis\nEffrantoon\nSounTaen", ""),
