        StaticBook("Terdon Snow's Journal", "tehpuu", "I'm in a cave. Just killed a skeleton. I hear zombie pigmen outside. The sun is coming up. \n The pigmen were gone when I got out. Travelled awhile and found apples on the ground. \n Found ruins of a Castle. I'll go and investigate...", ""),
        StaticBook("Terrowin's last note", "Busenki", "Hello son. I have heard rumors of you looking for me. You are searching in vain, for this is my last note in this world. I am commiting suicide for my best friend in the world, Hysagi is giving up hope and possibly dying. If you are Gladnious, remeber I always wanted to take you with me. You were always strong and I know in my heart you never give up. I leave to you my Order of Knights- The Anima Templi in the service of Hogarth. Lead my crusaders well son. If you are Elvin, I always knew you were pure in heart and that you would give everything up to come with me and share my ups and downs with me. You are a loving and brave person. I leave to you the Anima Templi, in case gladnious didn't come or doesn't want it. If you are both here and both of you want the order, let the stronger prevail. Duel to the death and may fortune guide you, leading the Anima Templi. If nobody ever finds this note, or is found by a stranger, seek out these two sons of mine, and hand this over to him or them. If you decide not to, may the Nether consume you. I am Terrowin and I am leaving this world. Goodbye sons and goodbye friends.", ""),
