        StaticBook("Tharn's Diary", "fiercedragon", "If anyone is reading this I am dead. I will start off with the day I was captured from returning to Laurelin from Oren. I was aproaching a camp as I often take a path to avoid bandits. But as I aprroached the camp I noticed 3 people. I felt like I knew them , then one said something about the druids I only heard a little of i t. When one of them turned around and saw me then struck me with a poison. I fainted and when i woke up I was in a tent with a guard infront of me and my equipment was gone. I still felt dizzy from the poison I asked what was in the poison. He hit me over the head and said dont worry you'll find out soon enough when you start to puke your blood out. Not sure what to do I waited. when The guard switched shifts and went on patrol. The quard and one on break started talking about how the brotherhood would be proud of their capture of a druid. The guard on break said something about he must be off to tell the master of the capture and then I saw he had my equipment.", ""),
