        StaticBook("The (Un)Finished Tale", "RubberStamp", "They reclined in a grassy part of the garden; the encompassing mist parting just enough for them to see beyond the forest pines at the distant and unreachable glistening sea. The ocean breeze gently swirled around them and stirred their flaxen hair. It was a small respite and comfort for them - sitting beside one another like this. A rare insouciant smile graced her lips as she braided a windflower crown. The air was peaceful and silent, almost lazy. And for once they felt no dire urgency. \n Here, for now and this time, he was not the Hero and she was not the Princess. They were but lovers beneath the cerulean sky, whose titles and duties carried little weight. Upon the grass, beside her dearly beloved, she had no country to mind; no mother-queen to please and no insolent prince to wed. Likewise he, under the golden sun crowned by his paramour with a windflower circlet, had no malevolence to challenge; no demesne to save and no Princess to win. \n \"Tell me of us,\" he encouraged. \n She tilted her head slightly to one side as though to ask if he had forgotten. He smiled reassuringly at her for how could he ever forget? She grinned in an amused way, understanding it was her turn to spin a story - their personal fairytale. \"Once upon a time when our souls were first entwined, innumerable worlds ago when the realm was greener with new found life, and when we were young...,\" she began. \"There was a fair Lady and a valorous knight, whose love transcended even time...\"", ""),
        StaticBook("The 1st battle of the lightning rod", "henrya15", "Out of no w apeared a gaint obsidian rod .everyone was puzzled on what was going on when lightning struck it agian and again . Netherrack replaced the ground and the undead came making an obsidian wall around the rod. many ran in and attacked the undead. But they undead rained zombies and other monsters . The guardians offered protection in t fort from the undead. many accepted and fired arrows from the fort. Finally the undead used magic to freeze people in place they said leave or parish . Now the people are gathering and preparing for a second assult on the ugly lightning rod .soon it will fall! ?", ""),
        StaticBook("The 5 spirits of Stuff", "JJMCG", "Spirit numbr one: Aire Went on top of a mountain and placed down my candle i than asked Dia'ron to help, he did he just stood there for a bit than he covered the candle in metal, it was prett-- beautifull I thane began to think of an air spirit. One arrived It blew up the sand into a humaniod shape and stared It wasn't happy today Apparently the locol pond spirit had dumped him, for the river I found out his name was Ire, i dismissed it and left Spirit number tow: Earth For this one i want into a place of grassland i did the same as before and once again the candle turned into metal The earth spirit came quicker than Ire. This one was in a bad mood toooooo -what do you mean there's only supposed to be tow o's in toooooo. now look what you made me write, humph, is that even a word? anyway... it seems it got dumped by the pond spirit as well... uh-oh I got the name, Gra, and dismissed it and left Spirit number theree: zombie i saw a zombie so i thought i would find its spirit, i did same as before and got the metal candle ((the next page has been torn up, as if there was a fight when it was being written)) DON'T FIND THE SPIRIT OF A ZOMBIE! it came and started to attack Dia'ron i felt burning pain Dia'ron did something, he melted the candle, and the spirit left, no name. OH GOD, i think the spirit's coming back I'm going back, there's another spirit here stalking me, even Dia'ron's afraid ((the rest of the pages have been crumpled as if the book was closed hastily crushing the rest of it", ""),
        StaticBook("The Abstract Rose", "AlphaCentaurus", "*What follows are some half faded sketches of a rose, carefully done with expensive ink. Each one is captioned with a short description, and an accompanying poem.*", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventure of Kaneon the Wood Elf", "MamaLuigi412", "Kaneon is a Brave Elf who was kicked out of his family.  Living on his own in the wilds he was cautios where he went trying to build up his skills with a sword, and sneaking through caves early life for him was not easy.  Bravely roaming the lands by himself and making his own food, he finds a small cosy cave, so he desides to make a camp there, so he went of to collect some wood for a fireplace. but all he had was a sword to chop the trees down.  So he cut the wood into small sticks and carved a stable axe head, and tied them together with some rope.  Now with a proper axe he cut down a tree and made some big and little sticks for the fire.  When he found himself back at the cave he leaned the sticks together and picked up two stones and made a fire.  With the fire done he gets some more wood for a pick, while getting some more wood the sun goes down and the sky turns blue, he chops the wood faster.  Chopped six trees down he runs back to the cave and starting to build the wall, nervously looking around for monsters he spots two zombie pigmen, finishing the wall he jumps down with sweat coming from his head he wipes it off Sighing and lies down on the cold stone trying to sleep...  Kaneon Awakes Breathing heavily, knowing he is safe he lets off a huge sigh, he pick up his pick and feels the stone, he finds a soft spot and starts to mine slowly.  but then he hears footsteps on the cliff above he sneaks on top of the cliff, three orcs are standing at the edge looking for any sign of life.  Kaneon slips on the rock \"OWW!\" The orcs turn to look at a elf on sharp stones \"an Elf! take his belongings, Now!\" two orcs in Iron armor and swords search his pockets \"Empty...\" one of the orcs say the orc leader sighs \"uh fine leave him\" the orcs leave him in pain, he starts to crawl to his camp but then he gets nocked out by the orc with a mace in his hand \"hehe he wont wake up any time soon\" the orcs leave him nocked out on the floor ...  One week later he awakens inside a dwarfen inn, confused he goes around asking the dwarfs and found out that a Elf dropped him of here and left some food behind.  So he gets ready as the sun comes up with a Iron Sword Wich was left behind by the Elf and some armor, then he roams around the world, around five days travelling he finds himself at laurelin, but he had never heard of it before.  So he desides to look around but before he could a Dark Haired Elf comes up to him asking his name, \"Kaneon\" he said nervously the Elf Wonders, \"Kaneon... I know you'r Brother!\" the High Elf says \"I have a brother? but how?\" Kaneon Wonders \"You never knew?\" The elf said.  \"sorry I need to be going\" Kaneon runs of going out to find his brother.....  THE END", ""),
