        StaticBook("The Adventures at Night", "superdman2011", "Outside the boundries of Serpants Ridge lies enemies so willing to eat you such as giant spiders, zombie pigmen, zombies, and much more. Also you must look out for the people who wander around desperatly wanting food", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of a Fantastic Woman!", "olifudge", "seven A.M waking up in the morning Gotta be fresh, Gotta go downstairs Gotta have my bowl, gotta have cereal Seein' everything, the time is goin' Tickin' on and on, everybody's rushin' Gotta get down to the bus stop Gotta catch my bus, I see my friends! 1 sorry about ignoring you i needed my book back here", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures Of Dedicant Jonathan Part 1", "turbonerd714", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures Of Degathor", "SnazzyEnglishman", "As a young boy, Degathor always dreamt of being a hero. As a child he spent his time with the Oren Guards. He admired the work they put in everyday, without any thanks, yet most of all he just wanted to be one. To have the sword and armour, to go to war on enemies of his kingdom. To smite down any who oppose him. He wanted to be looked up to by children, to be admired by women, and for men to want to be him. Yet this was not the fate that was in store for him. Before Degathor turned 18, his parents were taken away from him. It was not uncommon for people to simply disappear in the times he was in. Some came back in a few days, others were never seen or heard of again. His parents fell into the latter category. Yet Degathor was prepared for this. He knew of his parents and the crimes they commited, but that is a story for another day. Degathor was prepared, he was 16 now, if he lied about his age he'd be able to join the guards. He'd made his mind up, tomorrow he'd enlist, for now he would eat then sleep. Degathor awoke late at night. Word must have gotten out that his parents were missing, as he could make out silhouette's through the window. They were shouting something, a name perhaps? Yes! It was a name. His name. He decided to head downstairs. His parents had told him that if he was ever in danger, to hear there. He'd be safe. He trusted them. Even when they weren't around, he'd be kept safe by them. edit page 5", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Elf_Nick", "Bambrick", "Once apon upo typo. Once upon a time there was a great elf called Nick.", ""),
        StaticBook("The adventures of Elrond The Bandit", "drdeath1992", "Back about Five years Ago I woke up in the Tempal Of Agies. I Thought where the hell amd I. The monk there said welcome to Agies Friend. when i walked out of the Tempal i met, who soon will be come my best friend. His Name Was Riznam . A dawf new to these lands like me. (I am An elf just to let yall know) He took me to a base Called RiverSide . I thought to Myself wow this is Great. Turns out i was Wrong. The First night there i went oh my First Raid . I was So happy That in got to Go. The rangers wernt though! to speed this up The rangers Died in battle while I made off with loot when we Returned to base Slayer_Thrent asked for the stuff i got as we Looked upon the loot a elven Pathfinder Showed up.((All hell breaks lose)) The pathfinder Demanded we surender. we did not and soon there was a war on our hands. We Fought off two raids Before Thrent Fell to Niso Blade and the rest of us Ran The next day we Burried his Body on the Grounds of Riverside tis was a sad day A few days Later The leader of the Camp (Gorn) told Riznam to go make a new out post I when with Riznam and we start to talk against Rebeling Against Gorn Within A week we Took Action and lead group of   Six men to riverside and Killed Loyal to Gorn and then I Took out Gorn myself ... or so i thought Riverside was ares/ We decided to Cut our loses We left riverside and attacked the orc capital", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Finiarel Alfakyn and Stia", "mercury199", "T'was in the year 1328 when I did first meet Stia. He wandered upon the path as does the fledgling bird upon the high branch. unsure of what is below or what to do should he fall. I was standing in the crossroads of Laurelin when he did ask me in a most pollite manner, \" Excuse me sir, could you lead me in the direction of the druid library ?\". I am a person of good nature so I did try to help him. Soon upon mine path on which I led him i did become lost. None the lest I continued to lead on. Eventually I did arrive at the druid grove and he thanked me for my  help. \" T'was mine pleasure\" I said, followed by my typical farewell; \" May the stars watch over you.\" I did think that would be the last I saw of this fledgeling but it t'was not. I went about my average tasks as usual, at that time i was still building mine estate, and had j ust written \"Poem of the ages\" . I entered into town one day to converse with the most striking Lirinya, when I did happen to cross paths with Sita. I greeted him but could remember where I had last seen him. I racked mine brain as this was most embarassing, but still could not remember. So I did the one thing left, I asked this fledgeling where I had crossed paths before with him, and he told me \" you t'were leading me to the druids grove. And as a wave crashing against the shore memort did return to me. I invited him to mine house as I could tell he likely did not have one, and offered him some food. He ate as if starved, and after his hunge sated, did eagerly assist me in the construction of mine house. We spoke then after we completed the first level. he told me his story, tis lengthy and I shall transcribe it later. he was on his way not longer after muttering about a druid test, t'was quite strange. Not too long later he did return and told me  of his quest. He needed to find Diamonds, but i could not help him with his quest. He left then leaving a not saying somthing close to \n I have left on a Journey, should I not return tell dusk I failed. \n It was a melancoly note, for I feared I would not see the hatchling again. But as fate would have it I did come across pages ripped from Prince natives diary and to Lirinya they took me. And there whom did I see but mine good freind Stia! i was overjoyed. he did not long later reveal his affection for Lirinya, but it pained me I had to inform him she was already taken. We wander Laurelin for sometime till I did get word from a human I had met some time ago. I made plans to meet with him at the Whispering Isle. Stia suggested the idea of a race and I though it a good one. he took the kings road, I however dove into the ocean and atempted to swim to mine destination but ran afoul of the Undead. Slaying six I fled and eventually did reach the Hollow Peach. Upon my arrival he did greet me saying he had waited ages. He was not head druid but he said he now was. He also divulged that 423 years had passed. I said \" enough with your foul jests I shall pay for the ale \" and in that inn i did write most of this novel. Till upon taking a break I did meet the most fair Anorra. But the undead drew near and we had to flee to our presant location.", ""),
        StaticBook("The adventures of Finiarel and Stia", "mercury199", "T'was Joma, the 34th of Mals welcome, 1328 when our tale did beg. It starts when for an unkown reason kdness of the heart reaches out to a fledglg druid. It was a cool night the stars shone bright      through the canopy of branches at the crossroads of Lauel.   imma start over Hail this book is random i strted writing it and it did not work out mispellings left and write", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Flapjack", "bullyreece", "It was a cold night...Little Flapjack was in his bed trying to sleep...but he couldn't He rised from his bed and walked along the boat hoping that his friend could aid him to sleep He asked \"Cap'ain K.Nuckles can I ya help me sleep\" Which he then replied \"Erm sure\" \n Flapjack could finally go to sleep...but as he was sleeping he heard a loud \"Bang\" in the night This awoke poor flapjack...engulfed with fear he woke up the captain and pointed to a direction The captain looked at little flapjack with disgust and said \"What are ya talkin' bout flap?\" \"Theres a monster...I heard a bang he is over there! I SWEAR!!\" Flapjack cried! Flapjack cowered up and ran towards the door and checked who was there \n It was nothing...Flapjack found nothing...THE END!", ""),
        StaticBook("The adventures of General Ferin.", "putipmup", "Today we depart for Laurelin, to recruit, with Thendian, Telinir, and Jace. A man walks just charged us on the main road, punching Thendian. We killed him easily and swiftly. He just came back a second time. This time he confronted us. He asked for a battle. We said no. He attacked. We killed him a second time.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Gimblo", "mrperea", "Volume One \nToday me and Lilly went on an expedition, we found what seemed to be an abandoned house.... hic! \nExcushe my drunken writing but I am shtill hungover from the event!... hic! \nThough the house was abandoned it was freshly built \nI could tell by the traces of saw dust I found around the home. \nMe and Lilly agreed the house was too close to dunwood, so the next day we proceeded to tear down the house. We had at it, and removed about half the house, we had a good lunch of pork . Though Lilly forgot to cook her pork chop, so I gave her mine. \nThe next day we came back and removed the rest of the house, this time Lilly was the one prepared! I had forgotten my axe, so I sat and watched while she worked. \nAfter the work was finished we ate our meals, and drank ale! I must have drank a little too much because before you knew it, I was going the wrong direction home. I saw a small pond and decided to go swimming, but it was much deeper then it looked, and I began to drown! \n Lilly drug me out of the water, and all the way home. The next day I woke up with a massive hangover! The end!", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Jerry the Spider", "Grygon", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The adventures of Lain and Alex", "DRainbowolf", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Maximus", "froyo17", "One sunny after noon i, maximus decided that i would head up north to see winterfell On my way I encouted the Old location of the UnK But it was not there anymore! looking through the ruins i found many exciting things So i returned home and stored them away for safekeeping I will be heading back north again soon help", ""),
        StaticBook("The adventures of Nitholiak", "XSilverWolfX", "Title The Adventures of Nitholiak's Toilet", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Psiop", "Psiop412", "Chapter 1 : Arrival \n So its pretty much starting over again since the Terriko was destroyed. Now its called New Terriko which is great, i helped Karkin build the Front Gate Entrance. The People here are also nice some more then others, like Josiah the blacksmith is an interesting character , Tempir is the Guard for the villiage, Jeremy the Locksmith is very well known and respected Karkin the Lord of course, and Groobs (Justin) my best friend and my roomate. Groobs and i finished our house today, it looks quite well Tempir liked our work so he made a duplicate of it which is also nice looking (not exact though haha). Groobs and I have a store with our other friend Ultrarucus but we found this Villiage, and he hasnt been around lately so we havent told him of the news . Went to bed, then woke up to see Danny fixing the Fountain. i decided to watch so if someone broke it again, i could fix it. He decided to make a new design  , and it looks amazing! Im enjoying the villiage, Groobs and i are part of another colony but something about this colony is more interesting and enjoyable, but the people here are really great ,some are wanting to get books from me i gladly give them to the people i like to read their stories. Im gladly helping the people, selling them some of my items for a cheap price. I know it'll go to great cause so i figured why not? The town expanded a bit from the original design, but in my honest opinion better being bigger, plus there wasnt that much room. \n Chapter 2: Onward though the night! \n Ive returned back to Terriko, for i spawned back at Aegis fully alive though. The people welcomed me as i walked though the front gate and many people were glad ive returned . Its been days since ive written and i have much to tell, ultrarucus is back i showed him the villiage he was impressed even happy to see we have a house now. The Undead has arrived from what i hear they are dangerous, people in the town have disappeared i havent heard from anyone as to where they went but im sure they will return. Atleast i hope they do, Groobs has collected quite the amount of loot from creepers and such. I have a Anvil that i'd be glad to have outside of our house but seeing how i cant trust some people i must keep it to myself and my friends.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of PyroFuzion", "PyroFuzion", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Richard the Great", "1337Sammiches", "Kiriko?", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Telioen", "ikeyman232", "Day 1: i did wake up in a temple. i saw monkes theres and they sad it was temple of agis. i Dont know where i am. im scared Day 2: i made my way to a place the place is caled malinour. i wonder if i will find friens ther i made my way to a place caled laurelina i think its laurlin. i stop by a place caled an \"inn\" tht place is caled treatop \"inn\". i meat someone ther. his name is hendrak, and wheres a green cape thing i tlak to him i alwayz aspireded to be an farmar. this was my chance! Day 3: i talkeded to hendrak and he got meh a job in the \"inn\" Day 4: My handwriting has improveded. I now know what a \"capital\" letter is. and a \"period\" One is at the begining of the sentences, and the other is at the end. My job is an farmer at the Treetop inn. I love my job. Hendrak is becoming one of my best of friends. Day 5: I've began to make more friends! I've met Alys, a Nice lady. Shes my first Lady-friend. Ive also became friends with another lasy, Lirinya. Dont know how to spell her name... help Day 6: Ive met a man named Torok. Hes very nice... and works for the IC. Day 29: I havent wrote in quite a while. So, Let me tell you. I have MANY stories. Recently I met a Princess, Indelwehn. Shes very nice. and VERY pretty. Please, help me, I think im in love.... Day 31 I met the Highprince Native today. He is very kind. Also, today, I fought the Undead! Many people died, and Im very sad, but I lived! very suprising! Today I also had to help Princess Indelwehn. I helped her alond with a man named Aedan, and Torok. I think the princess has gone a little mad, but I still think I love her... Day I dont know...: Today I helped Princess Indelwehn Spread word to Lauralin! the word was to not attack the undead... I also saw a Horrible sight. Men that converted to the undead, lined up. belivng they were going to be accepted. Every single one of thos men were killed by lighting. Minions killed by their masters... \n Well...I feel that I;ve wrote enough... I will continue on my travels, and adventure more. Farewell. EDIT: I am not going to right more, but..I have grave news...Today, Prince Natve died. I was with him and his ragtag army, but I stayed back... I told them all not go an attack the undead, work of Princess Indelwehn, They attacked anyway...They were all massacred... I was the one of the 2 to survive... \n Now I shall end my Writings...Too shaken up...Farewell...", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures of Thedas Riverwind, Part 1", "Willizl33t", "So my story begins as I, a travelling elf, go on a journey through all of Aegis! The first sight I came to was a vast desert and an amazing forest, the desert in the east, the forest in the west. The night was drawing ever closer, so I set up camp slightly in the desert, which was a mistake. Through the entire of the night, monsters stormed my tent, I fought for my life, and when the night finally ended, I feared for my safety, so I stashed all my treasure in a small opening in the cliff my tent was connected to. This was when I sealed it with stone, and continued forth. I was in the desert when I was approached by a band of Orcs, vicious, battle hungry Orcs. These Orcs demanded I leave their \"territory\", or risk death so, trying to stay out of danger, I left, but when I turned my back, the \"dominus\" (see The History and Culture of Orcs for more information on Orcish ranks) shouted \"attack!\" and the 5-6 Orcs killed me. Or so I, and they, thought! \n This is when I truly got to understand this force, what some may call God, some may call The Great One, but none know its true name, nor why it exists, or when it came to exist. Infact, there is so little knowledge about this diety, that some refuse to believe in it's existence. This diety was like a bright light, we could not see it, and it wasn't really white either, but its the only way for it to be explained in contrast of the void. Anyway, this \"diety\" caught me in my fall to death, and placed me in a temple known as The Cloud Temple of Aegis. That is what made me realise, realise how it was possible, realise there was still a chance! \n I knew that dark times were falling on the world, and as my family was killed when I was young, I had always wanted to prevent, and root out, evil at any cost. However I never knew how, or even if it was possible, but just a quick, ever so slight glimpse of this diety made me realise how, and I got the idea. It was like this diety had planted a seed in my mind, not literally, but mentally. A seed which grew, and as this \"seed\" got bigger, so did the idea I had. I was to start a group of knights, or templars if you like, who would give their time to helping others, stopping evil at any cost, and try to prevent the darkness coming upon the land of Aegis. \n This task seems like an impossible one at first glance, but if you break it down then it dosn't seem so hard! However, I had barely arrived in the land of Aegis and I was not very familliar with the land of it. So I took my first journey to Laurelin, city of elves, a place of tranquility and beauty.  \n On the road to Laurelin, I met many other travellers, elves, dwarves, humans, and even an orc! The journey was a small, eventless one, there is not much point writing about it. Only the fact that I could marvel at how the forests were so tranquil, so quiet, the only noises were caused by the wildlife and other travellers. Everybody was friendly enough, and when I got to Laurelin, I was amazed at its beauty, the great trees, standing so high above all the other trees, and the mother tree, what a sight! It was indeed an amazing sight, one I highly recommend you go to see in your life! \n A few days on, and I had gathered some basic resources. I set out to find a suitable location for the castle where me and my templars would live. And I found one. On the road to Raven Hold, when you enter the desert, look for a tower which has The Desert Star at the top of it, you go in the direction of the tower from the road to the sea. This is where it would be built in the ocean, with a bridge going to it. All I needed was a name, Zoraida Castle, Zoraida being a word in a lost language, meaning \"to purge evil\". This was when I began the construction, it took 17 days to complete it, but it was an amazing sight when it was complete, the symbol of The Cloud Temple at the top, the water, symbolizing life, and the lava, symbolizing death. Seperating them is obsidian, which you can decide what that represents. Now, the templars, we would call ourselves \"The Templars of The Cloud\". However, before I would allow myself to finish this, I had created a task for myself, a type of pilgrimage, where I must travel for 3 weeks, and all the things I acquire through my travels, I must give as an offering to this diety. You must understand, not all the templars have to do this, only I, as I was trying to create this group, and so I start my journey, and the first part of my adventures end.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventures Of Vashyron and Orphideus", "UndeadEd", "This is the true story of the Elf Vashyron and the human Orphideus.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Adventurs of zurakk", "HolyRane", "Bone into the wealthy orc family the Kaxils Zurakk and Vulgrak raided towns, created tolls even one day captured king syrio and held him for ransom . But... one day all hell broke lose Zurakk and Vulgrak had started the \"trials\" to become undead Mogroka had found out... after Vulgrak killed him of course.... well almost Hello?", ""),
        StaticBook("The Advenutres of Nitholiak's Toilet", "XSilverWolfX", "It was a boring night. I was resting at Nitholiak's Inn. I decided I would use the restroom. Too bad for me I fell in. If you are reading this, it means you fell in too, or you are a plummer. Have fun getting out.", ""),
        StaticBook("The advice of Dolir, Scribe of the Ascended", "Raziel_Farenhaal", "Tips on becoming ascended: 1. do not ask 2. if you see a sage, do not bug them just go about your usual business 3. it is best to help build Haven, it will get you noticed by them. 4. Study up on the sages and all the ascended lore, know what colors represent who, etc.", ""),
