        StaticBook("the Aegis Factions League is here!!", "Golden_Richards", "A new and exciting tournament league is almost ready to launch. Start getting your team ready. If you are part of a Guild or Faction that wants to prove you're the best, register today for the first season of the Aegis Factions League. Teams consist of 5-7 people and the League will commence when the Golden Harvest home Stadium is complete and 6 teams have registered. Join the League and show Aegis what you're made of. Each week winning team takes home huge cash prizes. Enquire in person at the Golden Harvest or send your enquiry by bird to Golden_Richards.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Aegis Healing Consortium: A Starters Guide", "Ohaythar121", "The AHC is a group dedicated to the healing, study, and help of Aegis. We're divided into three sections, on dedicated to healing and surgery one dedicated to the study of Aegis and it's inhabitants and one dedicated to the protection of the group, and the implementation of biomechanical augmentations \n We're currently based in the Verge, purely for the reason that we can help more people, more often. If you wish to learn more, speak to Sillion Luthais, Caden Cathaldus, or Valer D'Avore", ""),
        StaticBook("The aegis Rebels", "moop123", "We are a people who fight back. The Aegis empire are strong and will use anything to distract there people from what is reall y important. The people of Aegis wether they know it or not are treated like scumm by there rulers. The Rebels fight for the right of the people of Aegis. If you think your rebel material contact Leoni Johonas to oin. (( /msg moop123 i want to join the Rebels )) Tge location of our seacret hideout will be given to any applicants.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Aegis Times", "Victor214", "In this last friday, the Undeads Attacked laurelin with violent and brutal Attacks. help Help the people that lost their house with some Donations! The world need to be saved E-conomy : The Travel-SHop Plus-Mart closed because it failed!", ""),
        StaticBook("The Aegis Times - The truth about king Sheffield", "Bartinator", "Greetings, citizens of all the realms in Aegis. At first I want to thank you to invest your time and ofcourse your money, in this special issue of The Aegis Times Newspaper. \nAs many of you know, Snowy Fields has fallen, this is old news and I won't tell more about the details. Now why did Snowy Fields fall? Bad defences? Unprepared? No. It fell due to bad leadership. The lord of Snowy Fields did the best he could. But who then? Right, our king Edmund Sheffield. What did he do for Snowy Fields? Or what did he do at all? Nothing, atleast he is building a keep right now for his own. \nBut now, Alstion got attacked by undead hordes, and what did our king do? Nothing, like always. Luckely there are soldiers of Oren who have brains and use them to protect the North. Maybe you do not care about the North, but then you better should for your home's sake. If king Sheffield isn't going to change his policy then the undead will take whole Oren. First Snowy Fields, then Alstion and after that maybe even Al'Khazar. Even if you don't have a home, you'll feel it in your purse. Al'Khazar is the economy itself of the Human kingdom. And besides all this, a distribution house of this very newspaper lies in Alstion. If it will fall, then we won't be able to distribute that many newspapers anymore, and then the king might manipulate you with false promises. \nWe need a king which is capable of being a true leader. Which can't sleep at night because he is concerned about his citizens and falls asleep at day because he is leading the kingdom for the future of the citizens. King Sheffield is still able to change his policy, but then he needs to be quick, as a riot may occur. \nI'll end this message with a wish regarding the king, so he feels what the brave and true heroes of Oren felt when defending Snowy Fields, Alstion and other territories: Long live the king, in the nether! \nMore news about Alstion in issue Nr.4. \nBy purchasing this newspaper you accept our Terms & Conditions which are freely to read at any property of The Aegis Times Newspaper Company.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Aegis Times Newspaper - Terms & Conditions", "Bartinator", "Privacy: \nAll content written in our newspaper are discovered by our reporters based on facts, research or stories told by other people including opinions. Hereby The Aegis Times Newspaper Company is neutral and you are not allowed to sue us unless one of our employees has violated the rules regarding privacy. Such as trespassing private territory, information gained by threatening, theft,... \nCopyright: \nNo-one, but employees of The Aegis Times Newspaper Company, is allowed to copy, sell or distribute content of the company. According to the copyright rules, we are allowed to charge you up to 1500 Minas. Employees of The Aegis Times Newspaper Company are hereby allowed, if any illegal copies of the newspaper has found and proved as your property, to search your house, business and any other kind of properties.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Agreements....", "LuigiNova", "With the final deal of the property that is still pending that whoever was to buy the property They will be entitled to everything seen within the property and outside it For example; when the property is sold the previous owner has to only take witht them CHESTS only and no other source of materials from the sold house.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Al'Khazar Times", "browler4153", "In this special first edition of the newspaper we will have many special things for you! like: \n An Interview from the high prince of the Malinor Native! \n An interview from the Oren Guard Guard Captain Ashkae! \n Also a story about a popular restaurant Dawns Bakery! \n And the popular restaurant Therving brothers Tavern \n And finnally the location and story of the underground sewer city in al khazar! First up is the Interview of Prince Native: \n 1) Are you scared for the life of the elves? A) Absolutely, with the absence of the Ascended sages it would be foolish to think their lives arent at risk! \n 2) What is the elves relations with the undead/ascended? A) the elves respect the Ascended and get their protection, as far as the undead, we are obligated and hindered by them. \n 3) How is the relationship between elves and humans? A) Under our breath we dont care for the humans and we most likely wouldnt come to their aid if needed. 4) ((OOC How is it being a Developer for Lord of The Craft? A) Its great because the amount of positive feedback we get is outstanding! It also motivates us to work on the server more! \n 5) How large will the new continent be? A) The are will be about as big as the current continent but the cities will be about 1,200 blocks or more! \n 6) How powerful   will magic be? A) It will be less powerful so that it is not overkill but there will be plently of defensive spells and things.)) \n Next we will have the interview of Oren Guard Captain Ashkae \n 1) What exactly do you do here? A) I am the captain of the Oren guard, i oversee the operations, deal with promotions, ethics, basically how the guard is run! I am also trying to make the guards more friendly and respectful currently. \n 2) What do you do to repeat offenders? A) 1st crime is a warning, 2nd is fined. 3rd is jail, and murder is jail and possible execution. \n 3) What requirements are there to get into the guard? A) Well we ask that you have common knowledge, and arent looking to beat on your buddies. It is a duty that needs to be performed to protect the city and the people. Knowing how to wield an iron sword is required for higher rank than recruit . So basically you need Loyalty, A sense of duty, and the ability to fight. \n 4) How much is the pay? A) When your a recruit, nothing. but a guard is paid 500 a week ((RL week)) and it goes up from there, but there are only a few officer spots. We expect guards to work for pay, so those that show up only on pay day get nothing. \n 5) Are the guards recruiting? A) Yes, we take applications daily Handa deals with those. Applications should be made to him.((via the forums)) \n Next is the Story on Dawns bakery: \n Deep in Al'Khazar there is a bakery that has been there since the dawn of time and it has been very popular ever since! It was started by the Previous queen of Oren Dawn Perea. Many notable people have been to the bakery such as: The king and queen, who come often to the bakery. They are also very generous and sometimes gives out money or some food to the poor and the needy. Especially when they are new to Al'Khazar. The owner Dawn Perea says about her inspiration to start the bakery: \"it is something i have always wanted, since i was a little girl, i have always loved to cook, and i wanted to do that for as many people as i could. So shortly after coming to Al'Khazar and marrying the king, i opened up my first bakery, it was much smaller than the one i have today . The bakery does not only offer food though! They also offer up a few rooms in the bakery and a boarding house near the bakery.\"   \n next up is the Therving Inn and Tavern article! \n For about a year, there has been a everincreasingly popular tavern and inn in Al'Khazar and now it is getting bigger than ever. They bring in about 800-3000 minas per week, most made by room rentals. But they also sell Bread, pork chicken, steak, and stew. Also ale of course! They have 3 room types: A smaller room costing about 50 minas for a week, a large room for 100 per week, and a luxury room for 150 per week.  \n last but not least is the Article on the Underground Sewer city! \n There have been rumors going around for a while about a city inside the Al'Khazar sewers, some people believe it and others do not, well im here to tell you its true! and im going to tell you all about it! When you first see the city youll hardly notice its underground until you look up! Inside the city are multiple shops, and inn, a makeshift ship, and a few peoples homes. \n Thank you SO much for supporting our newspaper! Special thanks to the Therving brothers, Dawn from dawns bakery, High Prince Native, and Oren guard Captain Ashkae!", ""),
        StaticBook("The Alchemists Alamanc", "Juvens", "This is the Alchemists almanac, written by Juvens. Ye will find 'ere several receipes for special stews, ointments, herb packets and so on. This is secret knowledge. So keep in mind, not to share this knowledge with everybody ye meet!  We will start with a few smaller receipes. The first one will be the \"Jaffacake with herbs\" This is quiet simple, but the ingredients are hard to get. So, ye go get 2 packages of Wheat and 1 hand full of Cocoa beans. Ye simply mix them together at a kitchen workbench, attach some Herbs, and wait a few minutes. Afterwards ye may enjoy yer Jaffacake with Herbs. The next receipe is: \"Bread with herbbutter\" This receipe is simple aswell. Ye have to get the following ingredients: 3 packages of wheat, a bucket full of milk and some fresh herbs. Ye take the 3 packages to the kitchen workbench and bake a bread. Now ye take the milk, attach some herbs and hit it till it becomes butter. Now ye attach the herbbutter to the bread and enjoy the healing power of it! Now let's take a look at the \"Mushroomstew\". This is a medium receipe, since the ingredients, 2 sorts of mushrooms, are hard to get, without a farm. But okay, in the event you find 2 different sorts of 'shrooms, ye simply get a bowl, heat up some water and attach the 'shrooms. Let it cook for about 6 Minutes, and ye may enjoy a nice stew! Let's get to the hardest receipe I know, the \"Cake with herbs and extra sugar\" . This is the receipe, where the ingredients are very hard to get and the baking takes a while. But what you get for that, is a healthy and powerful cake. Ye need: 3 buckets full of fresh milk, 2 packages of sugar, one egg and 3 packages of wheat. And some fresh collected herbs. Ye go to yer kitchen workbench, mix them up, and bake the cake for about one hour. Afterwards let the cake cool down a bit and place it for everyone on a table. It will be tasty, healthy and even a good decoration. Let's go to the topic \"Curing of wounds\". There are many ways to heal wounds, magic, bandaging, herbalism and so on. We will simply use our receipes on the first pages, to heal wounds, since we have added a few herbs. If this doesn't help ye, to cure yer or the wounds of others, ye may have to consult a medic or healer. That's actually all of my knowledge about alchemy and I may add more later. But currently that's all I know. I hope ye could learn something about alchemy and how to cure wounds.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Alliance", "MrJakKiD", "Sens Codename- Sensanory .                 Levant Codename- Luca. Aye. Meeting No2 Explained about The Avengers. who we are groups ect.. Ok. Mayors nickname- Kane", ""),
        StaticBook("The Allience with the Theives", "Ken_Brandon", "We may have an alllience with a guild of theives that are to be soon setup. The leader is one of my former accociates. He is a swift, strong person. And I have great trust in him. he may also join the courier's group and assist the guild. ((One of my friends my join LotC and he wants to be a spy.))", ""),
