        StaticBook("The bible of Aegis", "moop123", "Aegis,the new land. Exploded into life with a violent birth, the land moulded with fiery lava ,mountains erected where the ground crashed unto itself. Below in the deep centre, the lava began to cool, minerals crystallised to form beautiful jewels and hardened metals. The world began to calm with the passing of centuries, the laboured breath of the earth blew across it's plentiful forests, beautiful meadows and parched desterts. A dynamic world, yet created for what purpose? To please the creator? Nay. One can only speculate the motive behind its birth. However, what the world of Aegis is, is a canvas.", ""),
