        StaticBook("The Birth of Kamoroe", "Sykora87", "Kamoroe Began when a group of travling Mechants came through a area and set up camp where they sold items to travlers on the way to oren. They Camped for a few weeks they soon decided that they like the location and Set up an inn for travlers to stay.  A merchant named Sen stayed for the building and decided he'd leave but befor he left he met a Sick elf by the name of malco so sen helped him Recover at the inn Malco who had come to like Sen decided he would Stay with Sen and help him with the inn .  Soon a dwarf named Yorck Came to stay at the inn Relizing that Sen and Malco Needed help he Stayed.  The inn Grew and for a While Sen and Malco Where happy but Yorck had a Darks side He turned on Malco and Sen chasing them out of the inn and he and his brother tore the inn down.  Sen alerted the rangers and they kill yorck and his brother but it was too late the inn was torn down.  Heart broken over the loss Sen and Malco Parted ways. but Malco wasn't gonna give up he Went back to the place the old inn once stood and he stated to rebuild.  Hearing the new Sen returned to The newly Finished in and reunited with his old friend Malco.  After Some time passed a human by the name of Levant arrived He offerd to open a shop. Sen and Malco Agreed to this, And after a Few short years The town of Kamoroe was born. with Malco as the mayor. \n THE END", ""),
