        StaticBook("The black plaque.", "Improvsior", "Many people are scared. But scared of what. Well they say they are scared of the undead. They are scared off attacks of the undead. Everything they see or hear lightning they are run to safety scared for something. I think the undead made everyone scared of the world. Of life. People run away scared for normal things. They think those things are caused by the undead. But it is just nature doing his thing. We should only be afraid when we see undead. We are so scared that our brain things that everything we pick up with our senses  are caused by the undead. People should control their brain again. And not be scared for anything. They should fight the undead. You should fight the undead! That undead scum is just a black plaque. It makes everyone scared. Do you wane be a scared man. Do you want to run away for things that aren't even there. Fight the undead! Don't let him control the people. Don't let him control your family ,your friend ,yourself! Join the war. Have you ever seen your family die. Have you ever lose everything you got. I have. You can prevent this. Leave your scary life. Join the fight. Remove the black plaque from your city ,your family. From your world! \n I guess you get it now. That you have to fight the undead. But who are you gone join. There are four different races for a reason. You could join the army of a nation. You may choose the army of your race. Or that from others. Or you join a guild. There are many tho. So wich guild are you gone join? I give you some advice. Don't join any army. Don't join any guild/ Just help people against the undead. That is what I do. I travel the world. Helping the people that need it. And so I help the people against the undead. Without getting involved in any other wars. I guess you thinking now. Why don't we all work together. Well many thought that too. Many have tried. Some people almost succeded. But they all failed. That is why there are four different nations. Not all people can work with eachother. So go now my friend/ Go and help the world. I will see you soon.", ""),
