        StaticBook("The Black Tome", "simonbane", "Iblees bind this soul to the void, Civilization will fall to the hand of fury All life will be broken, risen again from its rightful grave. Light will begin to fade, nothing will stand in our way. The life we live is now broken and cold. They will soon walk the earth, chaos will unfold. Our god, our saviour. Iblees will reign again. Amen.", ""),
