        StaticBook("the book of Herobrine", "SunfishBob", "day 1.Today, we have found an old shrine. It doesn't seem to look like any god we've heard of . Day 2. We have found that the shrine reacts strangely when connected to redstone, causing sliding blocks to move. Maybe its a puzzle? Day 3. We've discovered that if you power it with diferent frequencys, it sounds like talking ! Maybe it is a puzzle.. . Day 3. We've managed to hear what it is saying! \"Thou must stop this path you take, for thy are making a big mistake...\" Cryptic huh? Day 4. We have discovered a cavern under the shrine, but we have also heard strange noises down there like footsteps and breathing. A curse maybe? Day 5. We have dug under the shrine! We were just coming into the cavern when we heard a loud scream! And one of our explorers dropped dead! His eyes had gone a soulless white but apart from that, we didnt have a clue why.", ""),
