        StaticBook("The Book Of Leadership", "1997man", "If this is given to you then you are a very important person in the ET. I thank you personally. If you are the person this was given to then you will need to know how to train soldiers. First you must discipline them, keep them in order. Equip them with what they need. Keep them healthy. Place them strategically. Think before you act. Don't lose more than you gain. Be loyal to your leader. Actions speak louder than words. Remember that. there u are And to be a good leader you don't mind the quote \"there u are\" that was a typo.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Book of Life", "pogi400", "Happieness , Every man fights for this. Many search For years, never to find it Happieness is not somehting that can be found, it will only be found when it comes to you.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Book Of Lore-The Verge", "xXMrAkatoshXx", "The Verge is a unspeakable place full ofterrible monsters. It is populated by small towns and forts The monsters that acomedate this forbidding land include Ghast,Spiders,Cave Spiders and skeletons The people here can also be as cruel and determined as the demons that live here.", ""),
