        StaticBook("The Building of a Castle", "SuperZac", "I hated living in the orc-infested deserts. Dark sorcerers and bandits roamed free, and my go ods were stolen often. I traveled far in search of a home in one of the grand cities: Laurelin, Al'Khazar, even in t he Dwarven realms. Alas, the housing was so scarce I could find none. So, I packed up my valuables and headed into the more peaceful section of the wilds, the plains. I got to work right away quarrying stone and laying the foundation. The monsters here are many but weak so I had no problem fighting them off. After many days of hard labor, I was finished! The grand battlements imposing on the horizon sent a thrill through my heart. Now, I could finally settle down and record the stories in my head! I planted my stock of papyrus that I had scavenged in the western realms, and began pressing my paper and binding the books. Now, here I wait, writing stories until the day comes when I can open my own library in Laure lin.", ""),
