        StaticBook("The Dkaei: Terms of Service and User Agreement", "Sandonthefloor", "Version 1.0 \n------------------------- \n1. Knowledge of Information \nBy Picking up this book you are confirming that you have read and understood all text that is included in this book. \n------------------------- \n2. Property Loss \nThe storage center The Kal Urguan First National Bank and its owners are not responsible for any loss of damage or property to the owner of the secured crate via loss of donatorship, banishment from the game, or claims of stolen property of the proprietor of the storage center. The Storage center will not reimburse players for loss of items with money via the in game currency system or with similar valued items. If the items lost were from an attack by third parties or from the owner of the property, then the items will not be returned or reimbursed, and will be up to the player to retrieve their own items back.", ""),
