        StaticBook("The Hannibal Arvernan", "mercury199", "Forward : Arvernan was a small settlement that had members from the races of the Humans, Elfs, and Dwarfs. It had a population of nion 70 and a Monarch who at the time was a human nammed Gharvan. He was ussually a peacful and level headed leader but when set on a goal he was unyeilding.", ""),
        StaticBook("The happy Book", "JoeqMafia", "There was a man named Johnny! He worked at a bread factory, they make bread! He loved his job and was dating a woman named Lilly. They loved each other very much. So they got married and opened a bakory. They lived happily ever after! THE END!", ""),
        StaticBook("The Happy Halfling Pub Ale Menu", "Saviordude", "'Ere at the Happy Halfin' Pub, we 'ave several different ales, all brewed right 'ere at the pub. Ye can get a mug of any brew for 10 minas\n \n Oren Stout- Made with wheat from Oren, this is a perfect drink for the casual.\n Dwarven Ale- Made from hops grown in Kal'Urguan, this is a more robust ale, and is perfect for celebrating a battle with.\n Elven Mead- Made with Laurien Honey, this is a weaker drink. It's full of flavor though.\n Orcish Rum- Brewed in a sandstone container, this isn't for those who have a low tolerance for alcohol. It can knock the socks off of even a dwarf! \n John's Gambit- All of our brews mixed into one, don't say we didn't warn you. Named after a certain druid.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Happy Halfling Pub Menu", "Saviordude", "Welcome to tha Happy Halfin' Pub. Here be tha food we're sellin'. \n \n Stew- 15 minas\n Bread- 10 Minas\n A Piece of Meat- 15 Minas\n \n \n", ""),
        StaticBook("The Hatchet Killer", "Jarhead90", "Twas a cold,windy,night in a small town west of Arlas. When citizens herd screams coming from the William's recidence. Everyone always thought that family was a little bit strange. But they never thought strange enough to murder their own family. Back on that day Mr Williams, a lumber jack returned home more frusterated than usual. He yelled at his wife and their two daughters, Jill and Tesa. Jill was at the age of 6 and Tesa 16. Both loved there Dad so much they never thought he could kill anyone... Until it happend He was furious over any little thing. The tea wasnt hot enough,the dog wouldnt stop barking or the dumb broud of a wife wouldnt have sex because its too late. Ooooo... How angry he was. Mr Williams walked outside grabbed is small Hatchet with a firm grip and run back inside. Jill was asleep in her bed and at only seven pm. He grabbed a pillow from a nearby rocking chair and placed it ever so gently over her petite face. As vivcious as a bulldog he held the pillow down with her struggleing. Luckly for Mr Williams the pillow muffled the screams. Of his youngest child. Then he took the hatchet and slit her throat with one strike. Crimson blood raining upon his face. He enjoyed it. Every second of it. Then he licked his lips. Tasteing it. He loved the taste. So very much. Then it was into Tesa's room. He crept into her room hatchet in his left hand opening the door with his right. He wasnt quite enough, The Door screaked like nails on a chalk borad. Tesa awoke \"Daddy what is it? Its my bedtime ma said\". \"Dont worry honey your get plenty of rest\" Williams added. Then with a strike to the center of the skull she was dead. Mr Williams was now coverd in \"crimson gold\". Ahhh... How it tasted. It was like heaven on earth. Lastly, was the bitch. I tip toed into our bedroom and forcefully stuck my penis into her vagina. It felt so good inside. Kissing her boosum. Going in and out. Her screaming louder and louder. \"Cade, harder Cade oooooo do me harder\" She exclaimed while I went faster and faster. Then when I finally came inside her I pulled out grabbed my hatchet, and slit her throat. Then I decided to do her even though she was dead. But the thing is shes more beautiful dead. \n If you havent noticed by now I am Cade Joshua Williams. People call me the devil himself or the Killer. But you can call me..... \n The Hatcher Killer. HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA \n END", ""),
        StaticBook("The Haunted", "Crippledpope", "The first thing that hits you, is the dark. The never-ending darkness laid out before you. They say it drives men crazy, but the dark isen't even half of it. The screams, oh yes, the screams. The screams of tortured souls all gathered in one place, trapped between life and death, forever in the dark, waiting.. Waiting for what? Who knows. They talk to me somtimes, or rather, they whisper.. In the darkness, they call to me, try to claw at my skin. I can feel them knawing at my soul, I know I won't last long. Blood.. Blood. That's what they call for.. '' We are Everything and Nothing, we are the ones, The children of eternity '' Those damned words, they repeat and repeat, inside my head? Im not sure. I didn't realise it was so long. The tunnels, they seem never ending.. a maze of madness . They call me the '' walker '' The one to live forever and not live atall. The one to love, and never love. A wanderer, a stranger, to all that i meet. The spirits, they call to me, one by one... and one by one I fight them off. These walls.. These walls.. The darkness is blinding yet it has made me see better than ever before . And the silence, the silence tears at your mind.. I once was a man, a mortal like others ... A family, friends, I had it all.. Before that night. '' That night '' was the day I lost it all.. My home burned.. my people massacred.. Well, some where lucky, and were able to survive for a little while.. My family did not have that fortune. My wife was first, Torn apart by some sort of machine, it tore her limb from limb.. I just watched on in agony. And in that one moment.. When i looked into her eyes for the last time.. It seemed like the whole world was looking back at me ... thank ye' I heard from behind me, and with it a clapping noise . I turned to see a robed man.. Laughing at the remnants of my wife. The man stopped and stared at me.. And in his eyes, I saw the world I knew and loved.. Drowned by darkness . He tilted his head slightly, not taking his eyes from mine.. '' Yes, you'll do. '' and then, darkness. I was scared at first when I heard the voices.. But I grew to accept them as one accepts all changes in life. Occasionally, a voice echos from down the walls.. It calls to me, and I search for it.. Perhaps, there's someone else here, someone.. alive. 8 pages now .. of this damned book, Found it on some corpse, seems to write itself.. sort of a.. mind-reader? doesn't write everything I think though, only things worth jotting down. Strange. The voice is becoming stronger now, and now I question what it is I hear. It appears to be Music.. But I would not belive that in such a place as this you wan't to read my book? Well, here's a book if you get bored * weilds book", ""),
        StaticBook("The Hear of Krug.", "Carnivore91", "Lothi, keep this quite, I was lead by an Ancestor to the Heart. It told me I was a threat. It tried to reason out of it but no good. I shot me with a Fireball and then told me to bring the Shamans to it so it may Kill them. Then you and the Warlord and all of Krugmar, or it will corrupt us all. It claimed to be the force that corrupted Iblees. We are going to need everything to stop it. Ascended, Shamans, Druids, Mages... I don't know! I fear there are already a few corrupted... I don't know what to do! If the ancestors spirits are corrupted... Keep this to yourself for now. The spirit watches, keep it secret...", ""),
