        StaticBook("The Lost Elf", "krislove45", "There was an elf. Her name wasn't known then, and remains that way to this day. She had piercing blue eyes, and her blonde hair fell down her back like a flowing waterfall. She wore a vine around her write head, a green robe with leaves at the bottom, and shoes made of vine and leaves.   writing a book. Tis about an elf., The elf wielded a bow made of finely-carved, silver wood. On her back she wore a quiver of silver leather from a rare type of fox. Her arrows had heads of the sharpest flint, and tails of the lightest feather. She also had a special 'ability'. This elf could tame an good animal, no matter how wild.", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost gold!", "emkid", "Day1, I found my dad... yay! Oh and also my cousin _erase Days in the capital of the Dwarves were amazing. The ale, the banter and the women.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Lost Of  SnowyFields", "gombie", "A Long time ago in SnowyFields. We all remember the cold, And the Days Cutting wood was really hard. But when we all came back from our hard work we go inside our houses and sit at a big camp fire.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Lost Of Snowy Fields", "gombie", "It was another cold day in SnowyFields . All poeple were doing what they do everyday working and getting wood for the new houses. When The Day was Bright and the Sky blue you could say this was an normal day agian. Untill Tonight when we Heard Guards screaming and making everyone awake! When i got awake i didn't know what was happening. Mabye it was just alarm for some bandits who runned away and the guard awaked poeple to get them. But i wish it was.. As we heard the Guards talking about some Dark poeple running slowly towards the village with fire. I knew this wasn't good, I Dressed up and got me stuff out of me chest quickly. As We heared Thunder, Weird noises, We all standed together waiting. Untill an Captian came in and saying we had to get out of here. We were going with a Group of 20 poeple And a Soldier who leaded us to The City of Alkhazar. The roads were pretty Dark but nothing happened, Everyone was looking back and getting scared of these very loud thunders. As we got to Alkhazar we could stay at an old Barrack for an time but at that day i never really sle eped.", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost Of Snowy Fields..", "gombie", "How long is it ago when we lost snowy fields... Do we know the chill when we came to snowy fields and the happy thinking of warm bread at the days when it was so cold. Oh yes i remember snowyfields it was a nice place to get a rest. I remember how the big castle looks alike but one day... This day the sky was dark and the clouds were not pretty blue. As we saw in the dark an army of hooden poeple black and purple walking slowly towards us. As we heared the bell Raising alarm!! Everyone runned in fear... It was a big shock when you heared the big thunders. When poeple ran off guards waiting for the undead  thats how they call them. Undead poeple who have been dead before and forsaken. As we run off with a group of simple men and guards we followed the roads to a Big save castle. The castle is called Alkhazar, I remember at the roads when i saw back i heared the thunders and monster noises?? At that day i couldn't sleep at the inn i was so scared i never saw this in me life. Thats what i remember of the lost of SnowyFields i made it ah corporal", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost ones volume 3", "callum2357", "Day in and day out medics try to revive the High Guardian while monitoring his health but with no success they begin to lose faith. The people of the village are starting to talk about leaving the town, and the guards are beginning to lose hope that their commander will ever wake. Anarchy is starting to take place and everyone knows what part they will play in it. The first signs of the anarchy was just mere talkings but they escalated into stealing which grew into outright conflict. People were banished from the town and high walls were constructed to prevent the coming tide of war. The arch mage sensed that their was more coming than just war, there was an evil like no other that has begun its return. The outcasts of the village had begun a war and demanded that they surrender or they all die including the High Guardian. The Arch mage who had taken up temporary leadership had told the guards to stand their ground. With those words the outcasts attacked and managed to scale the palisades and kill a few of the guards before they were fried by lightning that was conjured by the arch mage. Outcasts had made it into the town and were killing whoever got in the way and were frantically searching for the High Guardian. The arch mage had told the medicsto take the High Guardian on a boat to the temple of aegis where the monks could look after him. One of the outcasts had spotted spotted the boat and fired an arrow which hit a medicin the chest and he fell into the dark abyss of the ocean. Alerted by the outcast others joined and luanched volley after volley  of arrows that filled the sky with black death raining down on them like razor hail. The medics jumped into the water and dragged the High Guardian to the shore where they counted their losses, five men had been killed leaving three left. These medics carried on to the temple where the monk could take care of the High Guadian. At whispering isles a great tsunami conjured by the arch mage destroyed the town and everyone in it. The three remaining medics could now rest but this was momentary as a couple of outcasts had found them and charged up the steps with swords raised. The medics jumped to their feet and one of them fell as a dagger flew straight and true hitting one in the chest. The other two medics charged down the stairs to meet the outcasts head on but their skills outmatched the medics and the medics were soon dead on the ground with sword wounds across their bodies the outcasts then advanced up the stairs only to meet their death as the High Guardian had awoken ,the water of life and the water from the fountain of immortality had the strength to revive the great one. Standing in horror the outcasts turned and ran for their lives but before they could get a few yards they fell to the ground with daggers protruding from their backs. The high Guardian made his way to whispering isles. The clue is below. (Near the water of life and the lava of death, the god of aegis watches the final book rest)", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost ones Volume 4", "callum2357", "The lost ones Volume Four clear", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost ones Volume One", "callum2357", "The lost ones has been around since the dawn of time itself. They have ensured peace and the balance of of evil and good are equal. From their secret fortress they conducted missions to purge the land of all things evil. They were 1000 strong and nothing could stop them from cleansing the land. They did not excpect however to be attacked from within, an apprentice known to his comrades as cleansing flame had become tainted and corrupt, although he did not know it yet. The following weeks would be filled with pain and suffering, loss and salvation. Cleansing flame had started to become tempted by Iblees again and although he still had control he was loosing it quickly. Knowing that the final day was upon them all CLeansing flame turned to his closest freind and ally, Callum the Frozen blade. Frozen Blade knew of only one way to stop the coming events but he did not tell his freind of the plan. The plan was to in the middle of the night kill cleansing flame, as this was the only sure way to ley his freind to rest at peace. The plan however failed as clensing flame leapt out of the shadows and pulled callum to the floor with a knife to his neck. Callum managed to struggle out of the hold but caught in the eye with the blade. When he turned around cleansing flame was gone. Knowing of the coming events he rallied the forces at the fortress to prepare for the final day. As dawn drew closer bringing along with it the final day, the brave soldiers manned their positions. Then it started with balls of magical hell fire fly over the walls and destroy houses and towers. \n The undead horde broke down the main gate and poured on through killing anyone who stood in their way. Captain Krashiun was in the front lines halting a horde of zombies from getting over the main street barricade. With this moment of peace Frozen blade led a squad of men through through the back alley way escorting people out of the fortress and into the forest so that they can hide. When Frozen blade made it back to the barricade he could not see any sign of the guards or the captain, all he could see was a flaming barricade destroyed by zombies who where now at the palace. Frozen blade watched from the rooftops as he saw the lifeless corpses of the High guardian, the council and the guards and captain all lying on the ground with cleansing flame standing with the orb of power in his hands. With one final act of desperation Frozen blade leapt of the roof and onto the floor infront of Cleansing flame. He then drove his sword through the tyrants heart and in a flash of light everything evil dissapeared. The last act of the Lost order was to scatter the Books of the order all across aegis. And legend has it that whoever finds all four volumes of the book and unlocks it's secrets can Join the order and cleanse the evil from the land once more. \n To find the second volume Solve the riddle (In the high city of laurelin stands, the tree of knowledge where the second book lands)", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost ones Volume Three", "callum2357", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost ones Volume Two", "callum2357", "The order 1000 strong had now been reduced to a few hundred. Callum the frozen blade had managed to save the little amount of people that remained. Without a leader they were lost so they created a small village in the whispering isles to live out the remainder of their lives but they still needed a leader. Frozen blade took up the mantle of High Guardian and made a council out of the people he thought could make a difference. The first act of the council was to send out scout parties to gather resources and try to establish contact. The first contact that was made was with the elves of laurelin and the scouts collected valuable information on farming. The scouts that found the dwarfs gathered information on mining, the scouts that reached the humans gathered information on scouting and fighting techniques and that they would become a problem in the future as they have the potential to become evil more than others. The scouts that found the nomadic orks were killed in the arena by ork gladiators, one scout managed to escape back to whispering isles but died the next day due to his injuries. With this knowledge High Guardian frozenblade established a growing town with a mine and farming capabilities along with a good defence. They expanded and kept dealing with the other nations until they were great freinds. The first battle that was to be had was at an elven city that had been overrun with orks. The battle cost many lives and High guardian Frozen Blade got a blade through the chest and across the stomach. The forces of the elves ,Dwarfs,Humans and the lost ones managed to destroy the orks and go back to their cities. In whispering isles High Guardian  Callum was laying in the hospital bleeding out and was close to death. The council rounded up there most trusted warriors to go back to the fortress and retrieve a goblet of water from the fountain of immortality. When they got back to the camp they gave the High Guardian the Goblet as he was moments away from death. The next day everyone waited outside the tent waiting to hear from the council, but the news was grave. The High Guardian was in a coma and was unable to be revived and for the next few days everyone was silent going about their duties and so it would remain, the Hope and Salvation that once filled all their hearts was shattered for the last time. \nThe clue lies below Along the highway this book travels now it rests beside the road", ""),
        StaticBook("The lost ship", "fabian9696", "For a long time ago before the time of the undead there was a ship. That ship was magical . it had a cargo worth more the a hole city. It carried some of the few survivors from the great Aengul race. It was the ship that would bring them back to the gods. But on the way there a great storm came in over it. The Evil gods wanted to stop teh ship. They managed to sunk the ship somewere out in the great oceans. The only known survivor is The Wandering Wizard (availer). He never tell anyone about the ship couse he still search for it. Sadly he forgot the locatio of the ship. If anyone find the ship he will be rich. Richer then anyone that walk the earth. The Wandering Wizard knows this and becouse of that not telling anyone about this ship. Nothing is known of the location of it. the only thing we know is the name of the ship. the name of it is The Great Eagle The great Eagle is laying at the seas waiting for someone to find it . It might wait forever. Or just one more day. who knows...", ""),
        StaticBook("the Lost town", "Zombieslaughter", "an old town, selected for... rather immorale reasons, that was abandoned long ago starting Kramoroe, our journey will lead to this lost cult-city . travel to the towns Grand market, traveling around the set of buildings. \n travel east, through the tunnel. at the Grand market entrance, turn due south, follow the road. travel the road to 'new Terriko'. Travel out the East entrance of new Terriko, taking shelter in the Dirt island just offshore. \n continue heading east. soon you shall reach the far shore. you will see to the norht a rather squared mountain. this mountain is a safehouse, a place of rest on your journey. head northeast at the mountain untill the floating city is sighted. \n this floating city has been looted and depleted down to its skeleton, trashed. \n we lost a good elf today... Delaselva, he was killed in the ruins of the floating city. overrun by pigmen and spiders, he fought well, to the end. we recovered his sword today, and venture on. northeast of the floating city is a shack. at the shack, head due east. soon you shall encounter another ocean. cross it, heading due east. \n a snowcapped hill shall greet you, at the top is a view of the town. legend tells of a treasure, buried beneath a dwarven grave. \n we shall explore these ruins now, and an account shall be made of their contents. \n we are not alone! there are others here! hidden, but signs of their occupation are everywh ere. \n the main body of the town is unremarkable, other than the graveyard, which has the tomb of a dwarf. i will not discern its contents or location of it, as i could not betray a fellow dwarf in such a manner... \n off in the distance lies twin towers. horrible things have happened inside, blasphemouse devices and mechanisms. this place is evil! surely the home of cultists, or worse! the town is too well presserved to be abandoned, too much loot left untouched. we shall leave this place, sooner than later, i hope. \n we spent the night behind the towers, in a large cavern so many trees... aah, the elves would not approve of the waste of wood.", ""),
        StaticBook("The love", "jens6851", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Love of My Life", "Pudclud", "I was once a lonely dwarf Who had no goals set forth I decided to risk my life Which was worth the cost of a wooden knife Our group neared the undead fortress of Casandra Land Where the darkness of the undead fanned We went into the great castle and approached the Queen       \n    replace We went into the great castle and approached the Queen -> We went into the great cast", ""),
        StaticBook("The Lunar Task", "Crippledbaboon", "The Lunar Task shall be one of courage, stealth, and resourcefullness.... Courage To prove one's courage, they must peform their task in the midst of danger.... To peform stealth they must have completed the task of courage.... One must become unseen whilst performing the task of courage.... They must not be found or heard whatsoever.... Finally, one must pefore the art of retrieval and resourcefullness.... They must retrieve certain objects within an allotted time.... Making the previous tasks more  .... \" Stressful \"", ""),
        StaticBook("The Lusty Elven Maid", "Tyber1231", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Mad Man", "AcrylicFuzion", "There was once a young man, his name was Cripson, he had 2 parents. His father was a drunk, and had killed himself, His mother was murdered He had went on, wandering in the wild for ages it seems...", ""),
        StaticBook("The Mage Chronicles", "Slayer15855", "The Mage Chronicles \n Volume 1 \n \n The Beginning \n In the beginning there was nothing, only the Void. But in the Void there was a light, or as close to what we call a light, which was the one God. In Void he crafted the world, our world; Ageis. But this is the ancient lore and you know it well... Now we diverge from ancient lore, to something somewhat missed, skiped over if you will; that of magic. \n The power that is known as magic, was brethed into the very fabric of the world at the same time as he breathed his existence into Man. It was entwined into the world, and could not exist segmented. So it came to pass with the barrier erected between the worlds of the living and dead, that the power of magic ceased to exist, in all but the few most powerful... \n But is was not to last. The evil power of Iblees broke the power of the barrier, and the worlds of the living and dead once more entwined... With the failing of the barrier magic once more seeped through the world, and the inhabitants of Ageis once more felt a tingle in their blood... \n So it was that the ancient power of magic was awakened in Man. Those with the power of foresight could see ahead a fork in the path; one to light, the other darkness... They could only hope that with this new found power the right decision would be made... \n \n The Mage Chronicles \n Volume 2 \n \n The Journey \n", ""),
        StaticBook("The Mage Chronicles v.1", "Slayer15855", "The Mage Chronicles \n       Volume 1 \n \n The Beginning In the beginning there was nothing, only void. Untill the one God crafted in void the place we now reside; Ageis.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Magic Dwarf", "jigg21", "j hh", ""),
        StaticBook("The Magic of Ascended -- Spells and Casting", "Da_Emperors", "The Ascended Magic is taken from the Blood of the Aengul. All are said to have the blood, its just not turn on for all. The Knowledge of this Magic takes much time to master. The Rage of Aengul is the flames that summons the power of Aeriel. However these are not to be used for purposes that are not Holy in the name of Aeriel. The Jail spell is used to hold back or trap someone for time. in combonation with the Flames it proves deadly. The Last of the Combat Spells is that of Blink. Blink can use the force around you to teleport some distance.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Maiden", "char615", "The Maiden, with her Brunette Hair, lights up the sky with her beauty... her name is April, i have only just met her with a friend called Rhise whom is also beautiful, but my eyes are set on April Her beauty cannot be described in words... My Jaw drops when i see her the flower in her hair is the Icing on the cake and her Sky-blue eyes Are an overwhelming sight to behold... she is leaving... more tommorow... \n She is back... standing next to the fountain, her eyes perfectly macthing the Clear blue water The way she walks... stunning... oo? she is offering a job... more tomorrow", ""),
        StaticBook("The Making of a Soul Tree", "Saviordude", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The man with no face", "Gwonam_Blaze", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Masonic Brethren", "swordcoast25", "Herein lies the tales of the founding of the Brethren. \n The stone. Cold. Hard. Heavy. To the masses, this is how the foundation of Aegis is revered. But the true Mason sees through this veil. The stone is strength. The stone is protection. The stone is life. \n The fathers of this world knew the value of the rock. They built this world with a substance able to withstand the test of time. Ancient ruins hold proof of this. Long after our days have passed, the stone will survive to tell our tales. Our battles. Our lives, and our deaths.", ""),
        StaticBook("the master chief", "Kingkiwionia", "the rank of Master Chief is the most repected rank besides general. the master cheif takes complete control wherever he is sent.Gets full access to everything and is asked to do special/secret tasks.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Meanderings of Xoltan", "nbrown4", "My tale is not one I recount with any zeal or fondness. I have been betrayed, deceived, disgraced. Banished from my home, cast down from my rank, stripped of my powers. I awoke from agony to find myself in the world of Aegis but it is not here that my tale begin", ""),
