        StaticBook("The Pigman", "BeardedVillain", "Zombie Pigman are very dangerous creatures that rise from the nether. They can also be summoned if a pig is hit with lightning. The pigman have about 10 hearts of health and should not be confronted without a full set of armour and a well-made sword", ""),
        StaticBook("The Pigman Theory", "ErcMan", "I, Arthus, have made a theory on how and why pigmen disappear in daylight. The reason is that since they live in the Nether, they are weakend by the sunlight so they had to find a way to escape before the sun killed them. The undead cracked a deal with the beasts. They were still alowed to attack at will but if they gave minas from each kill to the undead the undead in turn, would trasport them form the Neather to the Land of Ageis depending on the time of day. So that is my theory of the Pigmens abillity to teleport in the day. The End.", ""),
