        StaticBook("The Plan", "Charles_Grimlie", "Planned to be the largest hiest done by the Undead, and Caravan! With help from the Undead su pporters, step one meet with undead, tell about plan. step two aquire men to aid and raid! step three undead will create a distraction on one side of the city! step four supporters and caravan move in and start working step five locate chests, buildings, and other items with or made from gold step six steal! Kill anyone if necessary, if a army comes in to stop us, flee via metro and meet at a certain location such as casino or a locked and magick protected area. offer gold to undead, keep any other valuables!", ""),
        StaticBook("The Plann.", "deavs", "I was thinkin'. And I realized dat I get the most information out of other people. But the problem is dat with skah, they like to pretend not to be skah. So they will lie to you. So I got a potion maker to make a truth potion, to force them to tell the truth. That should make things easier. Because once you get one person. They reveal five more, so you can repeat dah process.   So dah basic plan is to capture a person, from me list of minions/black 'and/Undead associate den force dem to drink dah truth potion, then ask dem questions. I can contact dah skah, an' get me truth potion, an' you can just force dem to swallow the truth potion. Any questions about hierarchies, secret locations, and who you can trust will be answered. With this plan the undead are sure to fall.", ""),
        StaticBook("The planned Attack for Snowy fields, Date - 1314,2 years ago.", "Ratemenatorz59", "-By Niko As we place Palxia in it's ruins. We continue on our journey to destroy the place we've always wanted too Snowy Fields. It is Penetrable but has very high stand on defenses. That is the closest Town our fort is close to. Now we shall Obliterate it. Sink it in fire. And overcome their weak guards with Power. -Niko Hmmm....", ""),
