        StaticBook("The Restructuring of Kal'Urguan", "blackhawk77g", "It has come to the attention of the people of Kal'Urguan that the current system of having a king does not work . King Belin was a great king, but during his reign the high council, those that represent the citizens of Kal'Urguan, were not given any power. fter Belin tired of being king, lgrim took over the monarchy. lgrim was great, but once again the council had very limited power. The time of kings is over, Thorik, the new king of Kal'Urguan is a great man, but no one man can have power over the Dwarves. The winds of change must be strong, so hold fast citizens of egis. Join us in our crusade, cleanse the city of Kal'Urguan of its problems, and help us take back what is rightfull ours..   \n  \n  <>Anonymous Citizen of Kal'Urguan<>     \n Reprint this book brothers, as it will spread like wildfire.", ""),
