        StaticBook("The story of Father Eynon", "Benboboy", "Fater Eynon began is life in a kingdom to te sout of te world named Mal'teka. He was te arc bisop of te largest city named Gail. He ad loved is curc and city more tan anyting in te world, but tat was soon to cange... One fine evening in te city e was giving a wedding to a young couple wen a sudden sickly smell swept across te city, ten not moments later te ground started to open up before tem. Demons of many sapes and sizes crawled out of tese cracks and laid waste to te city. Most did not survive te attack, But Fater Eynon did. He ad fled to a nearby town known as Willow Falls, were tey greeted im and gave im selter, but it was not long before te demons started to spread out across Mal'teka killing all in teir pat, te town was destroyed and everyone wo did not leave was slain. Fater Eynon traveled wit a group of townsfolk for many moons, searcing for a place to go. Many died on teir travels all except two, Fater Eynon and a small dwarf, te dwarf defended te priest in a bandit attack and te Fater ran.    Fater Eynon never saw tat dwarf again and opes e is still alive. It was not muc later  when he started to grow weak, he stopped to rest by a tree and passed out. He woke up a few days later in a strange temple, the monks told him they had cared for him and that he was in a new kingdom known as Aegis, and that he was in the sacred temple of Aegis. The Father made the town Galahar his new home, but was shocked to find they did not have a church. He had the church built in the town and he became the first priest of Galahar. He traveled often to the keep of Aeriel to visit the ascended as they were as close as you could get to Aeriel, who he had worshipped his entire life. Eynon began to be known around the new kingdom, making new friends every day. He had continued his role as a priest even in this kingdom. One day when he was praying at the church in the human capital city, the undead attacked, killing so many before him. The ascended found him and took him to their keep before the city was completely destroyed. But the keep was no safer, it was not long before the undead would attack Aeriels keep. A few refugees found their way to the keep and Father Eynon was there to help them. With a few members of royalty including the king, a large group of warriors escorted us from the temple to Arlas where people were taking shelter from the taint of the undead... Father Eynon has never given up his faith, even though he has been through things no man should ever go through. This is my story, I hope this brings hope into your hearts, May Aeriel save us.....", ""),
        StaticBook("The story of Friendship", "Blandorthegreat", "\"Party on Wayne!\" \"party on Garth!\" THE END! ... bitch hey' read this", ""),
        StaticBook("The story of Griffin.", "SunfishBob", "Griffin never knew his parents. He was raised by a human pirate, known as Kofche, who was apparently, a friend of his fathers. He had many friends who were sailors, mutineers, and freeboothers and his cabin mathe, Jolly, who both fell in love. Griffin was taught all skills needed to be a pirate, such as sword fighting, looting, dual dagger fighting, etc. by Kofche and was by the age of 12, a great pirate known throughout the land. A year lather, in a sea battle, Jolly had been knocked off the side of the ship with a cannon much to the anger of Griffin, who turned into a tornado of blades aftherwards. About a month lather, His father fell ill, and died. He took to land afther that, an searched for his family and Jolly. He still has his skills as pirate, and though he has become good, at the worst of times, His pirate instincts brake out and take control.", ""),
