        StaticBook("The Teutonic Order", "gaiusmarius8", "Hidden in the forests of the East, an Order of Brethren led by Gaius Marius have founded a lovely to wn named Nuremburg, flocking courageous men of all races to stand as one against the Undead, Gaius h as enabled a new era of military reform that will allow the Teutons to pursue military campaigns ;; Gaius looks upon the men of Oren, Alras, Krugmar, and Kalras for support and to join", ""),
        StaticBook("The Thatcher Family History", "tuarzen007", "The Thatchers were a middle class family who lived in Al'Khazar. The parents, Jon and Atricia, both had jobs and were able to support ther families. Every thing was fine until Atricia died in a hunting accident and Jon then killed him self over the lose of his beloved wife. Their 2 children, James and Michael were forced to live on the streets unt il Michael developed a serious diseases and was forced to live with the monks. James wound up finding work several years later. He is now trying to regain the wealth that his family had. Michael is still ded ridden at the time of writing this. James Thatcher Help me and create some bookshelves please Help e and make some bookshelfs please", ""),
