        StaticBook("The Thoughts of Eirin", "gao252", "I am dissapointed. I came to the White Ravens for a job that needs you to think. All they have for a great mind like me is to be a librarian. Putting books in shelves doesn't take thought. To only think about the things I could do if I could be able to. I hope things take a turn for the better, I fear I might go mad if I don't put my mind to something.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Three Brothers", "Volutional", "There were once Three Brothers who were travelling across a lonely winding road, at twilight. In time, the brothers reached a river too deep to wade through, and too dangerous to swim across . However, these brothers were learned in the magical arts. They would simply wave their wands and a bridge would appear across the treacherous waters. They were halfway across when they encountered a hooded figure. And Death spoke to them. He felt cheated for travellers would usually had drowned in the river. But Death was cunning. He pretended to congratulate the Brothers upon their magic. And said to each they deserve a prize for being able to evade him. The Oldest brother, a combative man, asked for a wand more powerful than all could dream of. So Death crossed over to an Elder tree, and fashioned a wand from a branch that hung their. And then gave it to the Eldest of the Three.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Three Coins of Fate", "Dalejin", "Tis three brothers, of elders lore. Who's names are never spoke of never more. For they stood upon the shores, and watched the oceans roar.", ""),
        StaticBook("The time I killed Fitty Minn", "DarkAngill", "It was dark and the air was damp. I didnt know where I was. All I knew was I was in a chair and tied down. A figure of a man came into view. He had a rust colored beard and was wearing an eye patch. He walked up to me and told me something that Ill never forget. \"Do you really think you can get away with what you did? Im Fitty Minn and also the end of you\" He walked away in to the darkness. One of the ropes was loose around my arms. I heard the sounds of a ax being sharpend. My hand was free. I then started to untie the other ropes. When he came back to the chair... I was gone. What he didn't know was I was behind him with his verry ax. I then said. \" The end of me? Ha! \" Then I chopped off his head. I then ran down a corridor that led to a stairwell. Up the stairs was a door that led outside. On the other side was a long road leading to a town. I then finnished my journy by heading to the town and then home.", ""),
        StaticBook("The tomb of Krie", "redbaron", "\n the tomb of krie is the tomb of an ancient undead Inquisitor name krie. Nothing much is known about krie.  Some say he was more then just a inquisitor, but ibless right hand man. \n None of these reports are very likely though.  The tomb is rumoured to be somewhere near snowy fields. \n The doors are locked with think iron doors.  It's said there is a ancient evil in there. \n few make it out alive,  and those who do see a new perspective on life.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tomb of Ser Adgar", "TheImpulseHQ", "The Tom of Ser Adgar has been lost for centuries, but recent discoveries have pinpointed it to *the rest of the book has been scratched away*", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tome of Light", "Leopled1", "I - Holy Light I  ---Light guides paths only for the holy of all men and women. Light will haunt of the shadow in it receeding taint, Untill it has been overcome by the light itself. Light in the battles of the darkend forces will conqour, and win the victory of the new day .A single hymn shall be sang to those who defy the holy light these words spoken on the nights of the crusade are of this \"Holy light, Shine to the earth. Darkness that haunts the lands, be purged- The day of the paladin begins, This tome i hold shall end all tainted things\"  --Enwritten by Holy_Silverknight, Leondas of the SilverShade--", ""),
        StaticBook("The Torchkeepers Guide to the Galaxy", "jmesserschmidt", "Rule #1: Never speak out of group/private chat while within the Round Table. Rule #2: Do not talk about the Round Table with anyone outside the Elven High Council. Rule #3: Never travel in groups while entering/exiting the Round Table. Rule #4: Never speak of the matters we discuss with anyone outside of the High Council, unless otherwise given permission by the High Prince.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tower", "emberhard", "Mid way through construnction I recived orders from seventh to stop. He and Tuk patched theings up aparetnly. Well I dismantled it and here is about the share of recorces that was not mine. \n Signed Emberhard \n PS tell me if you have any other building jobs, I would be extreamly interested, I am an engineer after all!", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tower of Heroes", "TehLulu", "*You find a dust-ridden tome, the edges of the pages frayed and the spine falling apart at the seams , the words somehow still legible.*", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tower of Kramoroe", "Jallentime", "help", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tower of wrath: Info book", "Tassyk", "The Tower of Wrath is located very close to our district . It appears if you approach them a second time they will attack you . I have only seen 2 other Undead there appart from Wrath himself One of them (user: Battleme33) is a mage type. He uses lightning and a summon spell to take down his foes. The other came at me intending for a melee fight, with full iron armor and a iron sword . I think Wrath can also summon lightning, this is a problem since the only way to avoid it is by being head-deep in water . When I went up to them Wrath sent his minions after me, he doesn't want to fight. Although he does want to kill you with lightning. From what I learnt water is the best way to avoid the Undead. Not only does it stop the lightning but it slows the mobs the summoner summons, and the melee user can't sprint well in water They are also more intrested in us Wolverines. This is all the info i could collect. I ave been able to record their movements of battle in this book", ""),
        StaticBook("The Town Of Elesmera", "mercury199", "Elesmera is a small hamlet, with a population of 8. But at the rate it is currently growing  that number will soon be exceeded; I myself assume a population around 15 is what will be set teled on. Most of the inhabitants are too poor to live in the city or simply do not want to. Elesmera has two farms enough to feed all i't inhabitants and the woods never dry up as we make good use of them at hiding this town. We would happily share what we may with our neighbors a nd would gladly open trade. We have seen to that the orcs shall not attack our village nor any other race. We would be eternaly greateful should we be accepted into the mighty nation of  Malinor.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Traitor within the Dwarven Army", "TehLulu", "King Belin, \n I write this to you from the safety of the Mage's Tower. Once again, I have gotten involved in things beyond what I should. Here is what I have learned from my trips up north, to Snowy Fields.  Please do not take this lightly, but I believe a dwarf by the name of Balin Griffinhammer is a traitor. I was at Snowy Fields and heard a commotion many days ago. They were refusing to allow a dwarf entrance, saying he was a traitor and an undead supporter. They yelled his name as \"Griffin.\" From a spy I have who is involved with the undead I heard of another name. That there was a dwarven traitor by the name of \"Balin\" who was high-up in the Dwarven government. At the time I believed Griffin and Balin to be two seperate entities, but in truth they appear to be the same man. I confronted Balin at the Competition earlier and he claimed he went up North for training exercises and to \"help fight\". I believe this is a lie. I will leave up to you what you wish to do about this.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Travel to Nowhere.", "Improvsior", "It all started a year ago. It was just a morning like all mornings. I had to go to my farm. The weed need to be removed and made to bread. So I could make some minas again. It was me and myself here. All alone in the wilds. Farming in the morning and travelling in the afternoon. Like every other day I would come home late in the night at fall a sleep on the couch. Then I would start all over again. Every day I hope I won't get robbed by bandits. And today was the day. I got robbed. The bandits weren't very smart tho. They just robbed al my weed. They didn't took any minas or gold. The strange thing was. I didn't care for the weed. I asked myself. Why would I keep on living this life. I left a note while I knew that no one would ever read it. I didn't lock anything. I even left all my gold behind. Only took the minas. I started walking. I had to walk on the grass. I couldn't even afford a road to my house. When I reached a big road. I didn't know where I was. Then suddenly I saw some movement. I saw a shadow. The shadow became bigger and bigger. I what a tall man. It was an orc!", ""),
        StaticBook("the travel to oren", "djurreman", "im here at my house in laurelin preparing myself for the great travel to come im at the laurelin gate now and my first stop will be at the temple of Aegis traveling in the nicht wasent a good idea im going to wait till dawn here at the temple i levt the temple of Aegis this morning and i'm on my way to oren i have walked so far that we arived in the vilage of kramoroe avter a day travel i have came to the kingdom of oren im now in a city where i will stay for the nicht i'm still in oren and the city is wonderfull i love this place also it stardet raining bah! tomorow moring i will leave and travel to snowfield", ""),
        StaticBook("the travels of abovehill7 II", "abovehill7", "I was killed by a slime while writing this Curse Mr_Hobo to the pits of the nether. may he be fed to 1000s of undead and ripped apart in a shower of gore He waylaid me on the road and told me to give him all my money . He is a villain and shall be attacked on sight . this is why this is titled II . I wonder if I shall ever be claimed by the gruesome and awesome undead or the saintly ascended . zombies prowl the deserts It is unsafe I looked upon the magesty of the grey wardens court and theyr shining gate then I found a way into theyr fortress and thought about going in... I decided not to but I left a sign telling them of the way in I am traveling to haven people have built towers up to the road to haven rather disrespectfulw I saw my first patch of snow HAIL whoops", ""),
        StaticBook("The Travels Of Aldoki", "aldo000100", "Aldoki was a simple orc descending from the desolate and dryed up lands of Krugmar, He was 14 When he heard of a local who was starting a war camp not too far from his home he decided to Join the camp and quickly befriended the leader of the warband(Petri) Petri noticed how talented aldoki was in the art of politics, he took this into account and gave aldoki the Rank of Ambassador, From then on out aldoki was known as the ambassador Bu recently aldoki Has strayed being offered the position of Grand Ambassador at the UAC, He now lives at they'r Encampment Making sure he can visit petri and his men every now and again. FUCK YOU", ""),
        StaticBook("The Travels Of Aldoki Aldoki was a simple orc descending from the desolate and dryed up lands", "aldo000100", "Of krugmar It was then at that time that aldoki heard of a band of orcs who had set up a war camp outside his city he joined this camp and  quickly befriended the leader (Petri) Petri", ""),
        StaticBook("The Travels Of Amras'Tullum", "Ranovak", "\n Itnan, 30th of The Amber COld, 1336 \n I've decided that I should record my travels in this very book. This is so I can archive my memories if I were to ever lose them. help", ""),
        StaticBook("The Travels Of Ezio", "PakastainiPaul", "My Journey Begins At AlKhazar, Which Is The Place I Was Born. AlKhazar is a very crowded city with a lot of shops to sell ye goods or buy them. There has been a lot of talk about the Undead planning an attack on AlKhazar . This attack will most likely happen in the future. The exact Date i do not know but i have a felling that it is going to happen soon. How soon i do not know but when they come we will be prepared . But for now i must save my money to buy a house in this crowded city.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Travels of Leafwind: Volume 1", "TheGiver17", "Tolta, 10th of the Amber Cold, 1328 \n I have decided to begin recording a personal journal of my travels in the world of Aegis. Currently I am a Noble of the Wardens of Malinor, led by the Grandhighborn Quazar. The Wardens have had many, many problems recently from several individuals who have had qualms with our military practices. Just this week, a rebellion sprouted by an ex-Warden named Caden. He claims to have gathered many followers including the White Ravens, a few Druids, and possibly the Dwarves! Now this is definitely troubling news for us, because it causes many problems for us that we have to deal with, alongside several others.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Treasure Hunt", "Pepernoot", "On midday on the 11th of The First Seed, The Elven High Prince, Native, arrived in Al'Khazar, and told the people there that he knew where the pirate that stole the diamond king's cross, was. A band of warriors and other people quickly assambled, and the Prince lead them to the enormous pirate ship, which had hit the shore North West of Al'Khazar. The pirates were there, and the group was put to some trials, while being attacked by the pirate cannons. After some minutes of being pummeled, we finally reached the deck. A small batthe ensued, but the pirates were outnumbered about ten to one, so they did not stand a chance. After the captain had been defeated a treasure map was discovered, and the people hurried towards The king's cross where the Prince lead them to te location of the treasure. At the location was a sign, with on it the name of an ascended sage. This sage gave the Prince the diamonds to restore the King's Cross, and rewarded everyone with diamonds. \n \n -Cerlos, 12th of The First Seed. 1321", ""),
        StaticBook("The Treaty", "MythMaster26", "Signing this means you are in agreement that no war shall come between us EVER. Signing open the opr otunity for trade between us. Please sign below.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Treaty of AFF and The White Ravens", "ogedi", "This Treaty here by states that the AFF and The White Ravens agree to peace and unity for years to come. Signed by Alvaska Leader of The White Ravens Signed by Animeius Lord of the AFF Signed by Mathias of The White Ravens Signed by Levaticus General of AFF", ""),
        StaticBook("The Treaty of SilverShade - The Elves of Malinor.", "Vardak", "In order to balance and rebalance that of which has been shifted. I The Shadow Father Vardak Caoimeh offer this treaty as a sign of peace and understanding that The Elves of Malinor know true balance. \nShould they no longer seem balanced, we the SilverShade will come to them and discuss diplomatic acts to bring balance between two nations, or within their own race. Should there be a shift in power, the Silvershade will stand ready to Defend until a new leader is Found. At that time a new Treaty will be made, and they will be watched carefully to check for Inbalances within. We will stand Vigilant, and ready to assist. If diplomatic reasoning does not help and send our Shadowknights, who will assist in a more eventful manner. As it has been written, it has been spoken, The Silvershade stands ready, which ever side you pick. \nSigned ~ The Shadow Father Vardak Caoimeh \nSigned ~ The Shadow Mother Decora Luath Caoimeh", ""),
        StaticBook("The Treaty With The SHad'Rins", "firespirit44", "Irba, 25th of The First Seed, 1326 \n Due to miscommunications, King Enor has settled the arguement with the 2nd in command of the Shad'Rin. The Shad'Rin has promised their military allegiance if Oren attacks the orcs. But there is still that undead rumuor, and that fort next to it, The SHrouded....", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tree Building Competition!", "KarmaDelta", "Today Laurelin held the Tree Building Contest in Sister City. Many people came but few where able to get in. So far everyone is doing a great job and they all are working hard.   The winner gets minas and is able to be hired bu the High Prince himself to make fabulous trees for the contest .    There are many trees now and they all are turning out well. Some look the same as other but some look different! The different ones im sure will be a good choice. If they can pull it off that is. So far there are 2 trees that stand out to me and they are magnificent. Im sure these 2 would win together.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Tree of Life", "_Shoi_", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The trees rest firmly on the hills. A man appears. He is dirty with a long beard and robe.", "Blandorthegreat", "he is a druid. Diciple of the Earthmother. Why is he what he is? He beleives in the Earthmother's grand plan. Her original plan for all creatures to live equaly and only take what is needed. This man lives in a hole in the ground. He finds no need to cut down trees and defile the Earthmothers skin. Peace and coexistence", ""),
        StaticBook("The Trillion Memoirs", "Trilman", "I begin this book as a collection of my thoughts. I hope to read this back at the end of my journey. I hope to one day give it to my mother so she may know my journey. I also hope that, should I be unable, that another will read and deliver this book.    Today I reached Kramoroe. It is a dusty, rocky town with a huge library. There seems to be a road running through to a place covered in Trees. So majestic. Today I was full of excitement. The path is long but I have found Laurelin! The market in Laurelin is lush green and quiet. The elves are such a serene race.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Trisian's Lore", "Aceeri", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The True Book Of Our God", "hmqb", "The true god of Aegis is Moonchaga! He controls every ascecpt of our life from eating to sleeping. Moonchaga is unstoppable and his priests are granted with extrodinary powers! We must all worship Moonchage for his is the true god of all! The worshippers of Moonchaga must spread the wrod of his holiness and convert more! Together the masses of Moonchaga will create a grand temple! When Moonchaga is ready and enough people follow him he will descend from the heavens and come join us here! Moonchaga will grant all of his priests spots in his new world and destory everyone else. Everyone must join him or perish when he comes to the earth! Moonchaga is a not a forgiving god and looks down upon us as we are. If we do not worship him he will smite us from his land. We the people of Moonchaga will follow his every will! Moonchaga is the lord of all we must bow down. Lets us all raise our hands to the sky on every third day! As a ritual we will dance around the fire on this day! We will throw in saplings to appease our god, and gather in groups of prime numbers. If we do not do this then our god will be mad and we will suffer! Moonchaga is our lord and we will do his ritual, and you must too! Another thing he requires from us besides the ritual is the burning of one of his own. During the sapling burnings, the worshippers in groups of prime numbers will all choose one person to go into the fire themself and burn. In each prime number ritual one must die or Moonchaga will smite us all. All must hear the word of Moonchaga copy this book and spread it everywhere! Moonchaga's word must be heard! WIAt", ""),
        StaticBook("The true evil of the dark hand", "Austinpowers999", "Aye Krink Krink Being a slave I was in Sanhar; In the lower district I was walking along when a masked man held me with I was held with a diamond sword to neck; Told to follow or i'll die I followed this man into an underground part of sanhar I was thrown into a cell I was left with rotted meat and stale bread, I waited 3 days before I saw the orc again. he told me The Black hand were coming soon I had heard stories of them; rape followers of ibe", ""),
        StaticBook("THE TRUE HALOWEEN", "jens6851", "So you wanna know why we got Haloween? \n A day. Long time ago, its about that time when the first ascendeds and undeads showed up \n Four races meet. Thet where all travelers and was on there way home A Orc the strongest one in the whole nation \n An Elf a clever alchymist \n An Human who liked all things and wasent bad to anything And at last but not least a Dwarf who was the best miner in the world! \n \n So one day these four races, met at a cross road. Actually this cross road was going to be th e one who is in Laurelin. \n But the four races met there, they have all been on long travels and they all decided to sit down, eat and talk about there adventures \n They talked for a long time but suddenly a skeleton from Ibless attacked them they got there weapons and the human saved them.", ""),
        StaticBook("The true Iblees.", "octovian10", "You have been decieved. All of your life, you've been told false information. At the first mention of the Undead, you cower in fear. The thoughts that enter your mind are of death and blood-shed. The teachings of Iblees aren't to destroy all of Aegis. No, there's a larger purpose to his m essage/ Why destroy a land with no purpose, rendering it infertile? There isn't any. What do you want?", ""),
        StaticBook("The true meaning of Iblees.", "octovian10", "I'm not here to spread lies into you're mind, such as the Ascended do. I'm a preacher of the Fallen One, here to spread information which must be known. Hello. Yes? Right. ... fakfha", ""),
        StaticBook("The true story of Saving Queen Dawn", "CrazyBlueBannana", "Some of the names in this story are blanked out for some purposes.", ""),
        StaticBook("THE TRUTH", "pcgeek61995", "The undead are coming and the king is one of them. He plans our demise and consults with Ibleese him self", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth", "Alectriciti", "It was a terrible night for me. Natheus had returned to see Rhisereld. I can't help but write this in a book. No one is to find it. I had to clear my mind. I had gone through so much trouble for Rhisereld. I wanted her safe... But I couldn't live with myself knowing I'm bringing her pain. I left home for one night.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth", "Crippledpope", "Deltaro Sucks orcish testicles", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth", "123trevmo321", "So its the bitter truth about Dusk..I over heard her and Apollan talking about how she is \"changing\" and soon after they were discussing that.. they kissed and told eachother they were theirs.. now i was snooping around Apollans room and found something odd. A second room within his that said.. Dusks secret corner. I went in there and the entire room was made of netherrakk and soulsand. Now i do not have a conclusion here but a pretty solid idea. Dusk is turning evil and she knows it but takes comfort behind Apollan. BUT: this is all just a theory.....", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth", "TheImpulseHQ", "*Burn marks are all over the book* I do not have long, i did not betray the Order willingly, i was broken by magic, like.. *is scratched away* -ut i did find out how to kill Delcius, a Knight of Purity who must... His heart, and then with a soul gem use the... to finally kill Delcius, and not allow him to return I hope this information helps, remember to... *The book is cut off there*", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth of Tharor", "Tharor", "In the modern tounge, you may know me as \"Tharor.\" All who have met me, usually remember my eccentric manner. The behavior that was mentioned is directed towards the moon. I openly channel admiration bordering on love towards the moon. Still, I am in service to Lord Lucius Murmilllo even with the circumstances. I mostly scout, and preform odd jobs like collecting feathers. \nIt's a pretty normal life for me, except for one teensy little detail. I am not the day-dreaming man you think I am. My name in an old tounge my family used eras back, literally means: \"Black Rose.\" Yes, I said \"My family.\" I know my roots. The eccentrics who took me in were sent to do so. They told me of my parents, and how my name forced them to let me go. My name, in my family, curses the one who bears it. I'm doomed to be a rouge, for as long as Elven longevity allows. Doomed to forever be the highwayman glistening in the moonlight. I wore white clothing to keep guards from arresting me in this corrupt society. I powdered my hair to pass as a High Elf. It isn't that I'm not a High Elf, it's that brown hair isn't common amoungst Elves. \nPerhaps you're wondering: \"Why would your parents name you so, knowing that It curses you?\" Truth is, they had no choice.    After the curret Tharor dies, the familymust name a new one in the next 100 years. After the current Tharor dies, the family must name a new one in the next 100 years. the do not not, however, tradition states that they will perish and the family will be gone. I was the unlucky child that was born directly after my predecessor died. The family cursed me and destroyed all ties to me, so I could never find them. Even now, after I left my guardians they disappeared from records.  I will don the clothes handed down by tradition, and assume my role. \nTo Lord Lucius Murmillo: If you need me, I'll be around. \n Eternally, \n Tharor", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth of The Creeper", "darkdladety", "Most people believe that creepers are the devious spawn of the Nether, sent to the surface to terrorize human kind. Just because they explode when they near people, they are labeled evil. For this reason they are killed or fled from without a thought. \n The truth is that creepers are actually an extremely shy race of mutated starfish pigs. They aproach people in an attempt to start a conversavtion. They then get so scared because they lack the skills to communicate. Like you and me, when they get scared, their blood pressure, or water pressure goes up. Theirs just goes up so much that it causes their skin to turn white, then green then back to white. Finally after that the pressure in their water viens goes up so much that they explode. That is why they explode when you go near them, or they come near you. \n So next time you are walking through the woods and you see a creeper don't freak out, remember that they are more scared of you than you are of them. So cut them some slack, give them a break and all and all, live and let live.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth. -First Edition", "octovian10", "Harken to my tale, one which shall remove the lies that you've been made to believe. I'm a priest of Iblees, a man whom doesn't wish to harm you, not in the slightest. I wish to teach you of the Fallen One, and dispell the false information you've so long believed in. At the first mention of Iblees, your blood many have run cold, striken with fear. Death and pain are merely some of the images which may jump in your thoughts. I wish to change that. Think of Aegis as it is now, full of corrupted leaders, poverty, illness. Now, imagine a land where you didn't live in constant fear, lived in your own personal paradise. This is part of the teachings of Iblees, one which must don't know of, as it's buried under the false teachings of Aerial. Ask yourself this: What has Aerial or its followers accomplish for Aegis? What have they done for you? Ask yourself these questions for the next few minutes, than return.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth. -First Edition.", "octovian10", "I write this book to spread a message which must be known to the populace. Myself, am I preacher for the Fallen One. Don't be alarmed that my allegience is to Iblees; i'm not here to convert you. I've spent my time writing this work to dispell the lies that have been implanted in your min d. Hello.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Truth. -Second Edition", "octovian10", "", ""),
        StaticBook("The Twelve Ducks", "monkeychez", "Once on a time there was a Queen who was out driving, when there had been a new fall of snow in the winter; but when she had gone a little way, she began to bleed at the nose, and had to get out of her sledge. And so, as she stood there, leaning against the fence, and saw the red blood on the white snow, she fell a-thinking how", ""),
        StaticBook("The twisted tale of Dormain", "Caesar135", "", ""),
