        StaticBook("The visit from Master Iblees. Sparrow's Story", "Monkey34512", "One day, I was traveling Laurelin. This was around the first time I arrived in Aegis. I was suddenly summoned by a man named Iblees. I was spoken to but have no memory of what was said. Then i was put into a cell. It was made of red, hot, rock. I heard voices around me. I would ask questions like \"Where am i? Who are you?\" and i would get no reply. I was beginning to get frustrated. I sudenly shouted \"Who may i speak to about my release!?!\" At the moment i was summoned infront of a man. In a giant chamber. I then spoke to this man. All i recall from this conversation is that i called him Iblees after he told me his name and he had three men grab me and light my feet on fire . After i was able to put my feet in water i was then summoned again to the chambers. In the chambers, I was told to call him \"Master Iblees\", Since he was my new master. I told him i would refuse to let him command me. He then told me that it was not my choice. He was my father. I then asked him how it was possible. He never answered me. This annoyed me and set me into a rage. He then silenced me by locking me in a purple stoned room. When i was calm he let me roam around the building/castle/fort i was in. To this day i still have no idea of where that fort was or is. I'm now trying to fin any possible connection to Iblees i can. I need to speak to him once more. I need to know if he really is my father. I need to know who I really am. \nThanks for reading! \nTrue story \n-Sparrow-", ""),
        StaticBook("The void", "Crippledpope", "The first thing that strikes you, is the darkness. The never ending darkness stretched out before you, reaching untill the end of time, but all before you very eyes. I saw it all, The creation and destruction of existance itself, and all In the blink of an eye. At first, I was scared, I didn't know what had become of me, or what was to become of me now I was this... monster, or so I belived at the time. They called me Sin, devine retribution wrapped up in one being. A being bent on the destuction of everything it ever loved, all because noone else would. That's write, we new it was coming, we had so many chances to stop it. We had so many signs, so many chances that we just ignored and carried on with our pathetic mediocre lives. Our repetative routine, and an existance purely to pass on our DNA.. Pittifull. I wasn't a bad person, I didn't deserve what I have become, yet, I feel that it was necessary, I destroy the corruption in the world. Cleanse it of it's sin. Ironic, really, I destroy and take lives, to save and bring more life, purity but at a cost. I couldn't say I don't enjoy it, nor could I say I do, I don't even remember when it was like to express emotions. My mind is a blank, I have memories, memories of emotions, yet they do not create the same feeling now.. My mind is blank, A void. But before all this, I wasn't a monster, I wasn't a saint, either. I lived an ordinary life. The easiest way to put it, is, I died. I can't explain the feeling, of dying, perhaps because  There was no feeling.. Yet, there was, a small sense of relief, all the sorrow, and pain had left me, I was pure, and enlightened, no longer burdened by the world. A faint voice echoed through my soul. A calming voice, I trusted it. It convined me to embrace the light, let it take hold of my body.. And I did just that. It took what felt like eternity, but in reality, was few seconds. The pain, it tore through me, tearing my spirit apart.. But after the pain.. came none, I was immortal, and nothing would ever harm me again. Hm?", ""),
        StaticBook("The Void", "Snipergodx01", "Void Magic is a lost magical element branch which is very powerful. Void Magic is an element ehich does not focus on elemental Magic I.E. Fire, Water, Earth, Air Not many people are able to use Void magic, and most that try die. Void magic is the pureist magic, but to use it one must give it something of blood. Void spells are; Explosion, dispel, Illusion, Mind wipe, scrying, and haste. Once someone has master all of the skills of the void they are in full part of the void The Void can also be put into items and live there until used. There has been one one person to do so. But in her doing it she killed the one she loved Void Magic is a deadly force and using it without control will mean death to all near by Indeed", ""),
        StaticBook("The void Chp II", "Crippledpope", "I took just 16 minutes for the world, ever nation destroyed by my omnipotence. I turned the world from what was a war filled abyss of chaos.. To tranquility, a world so peacefull, even the garden of Eden would look pathetic to it. But I guess that's because it was devoiant of life, well, almost. There were a few surviors.. Whom had set up pathetic shelters for any living they found. Petty mortals, trying desperately to continue their petty existance. As I destroyed the last remants, my blood thirst grew, It seemed humanity was not enough, the billions of lives I have destroyed in moments and yet I was not satisfied. I had wondered what I had become. I thought I was a monster. The truth is, Im not a monster, Nor a bringer of death. I'm just the bridge, for those deemed worthy. For it is only in death, in which we finally acheive what we sought in life. Pain and sorrow melted away in an instant.. That who brings this, is not a monster.. More a divine being, A God.", ""),
        StaticBook("The VonSchlichten Inn Performance Stage Info Book", "InvincibleHawk", "Welcome to the VonSchlichten Inn Stage! Here we have various shows and acts for your pleasure! You can see the list of the acts below this bookshelf, and also when they perform. If you would like any information about a certain act, please contact Nitholiak VonSchlichten. ((RHcrow)) Also, you can contact our age, Crowley Falos ((XSilverWolfX)), to sign up your act at our theatre! We hope you enjoy the shows here at the VonSchlichten Inn!", ""),
        StaticBook("The VonSchlichten Membership Option", "InvincibleHawk", "This new feature will allow you to get THREE \"free\" ales per day! (Game Day) So you may ask, Lance, how do you make money on the ale here?! You already have a GREAT deal when you bring your own mugs! Well, this is true! HOWEVER, with NEW feature.. not only can you get the 1/2 off deal with your own mugs.. but you can even get the SPECIAL OFFER half off with your own mugs! That's right people! Bring your OWN mugs for your \"free\" ales that night and you can get HALF OFF your \"Regular\" Membership! So now you ask, how much will this cost? I answer.. NOT THAT MUCH! This option is so cheap.. that you will be SAVING money in no time! So without further delay, I give you... THE REGULAR MEMBERSHIP! \nBecome a Regular Today! Only 120 Minas! \nExtra special deal! Bring THREE mugs when you sign up for HALF OFF your sign up price! 60 minas! \nNotice: We are not responsible for any deaths caused by alcohol poisoning.. or the toilet.. \n \n((Please contact InvincibleHawk/Lance Ulhric to sign up!))", ""),
        StaticBook("The Wall", "Wloire", "Joma, 13th of the Amber Cold, 1306: \n It has been nearly two months since I began construction of the Wall. The outer frames near the desired height and I have reached from frozen lake in the west to ocean in the east. The harsh northern blizzards have been relentless and have hindered my work, however they have provided one boon: As ice accumulates along the walls it hardens and forms an extra barrier to defend the pass against future demon assaults. I believe I might even add ice to the structure myself when I have completed the frame. From up here one can almost see the end of the northern plains.\n  Ahad, 22nd of the Amber Cold, 1306: \n I am back in the mines, excavating more stone for The Wall's frame. It has been four days now I've spent in this darkness, it reminds me uncomfortably of a life long gone. Even down here I hear a treacherous thunderstorm growing in the Northwest. I have never been a religious man and yet I find myself praying to whichever god will listen that no demon scout comes upon The Wall this early in its creation. I can only hope the relentless blizzard will keep the wall camouflaged to prying eyes. I have just about all the stone I need. I will soon be returning North. \n", ""),
        StaticBook("The Wandering Scholar", "dyldo", "Contents: \n Ch1: Introduction To The Wandering Scholars \n Ch2: How To Survive \n \n Ch3: A brief synopsis of works by Wandering Scholars \n Ch4: Conclusion", ""),
        StaticBook("The Wandering Soldier", "KingToten", "All Accounts Of This Book Are Pure Fiction And Do Not Condon The Actions Of The Oren Naton . It Was A Warm Summer Day. Calm Breeze Was Blowing. It Was A Beuatiful Day When It All Went Wrong. It Seemed That The Undead Had Lied To The Dwarven Nation About A Plot Against The Human Nation. Supposedly There Was Going To Be A Overthrow Of The Goverment help", ""),
        StaticBook("The Wandering Soul", "WizardInACan", "NOTE* Actual accounts. A young man by the name of Moltazador was left wandering in a world fu ll of creatures and things he himself did not understand. Traveling as gypsy, he met the end of his boring life.", ""),
        StaticBook("The Wandering Warden", "paulgt", "I am a soldier on my own but I am not alone. I am singular but combined I am separate but together. I am gone but here. And I am a Warden. I'm a wandering man, I don't know the way. Through the trees I pass-but where's the day? The night has come and the dead will follow. They feed on sorrow and will not relent. The undead have come and will not repent. They have the full wrath of evil. The land is no longer safe for you or me. The wardens are the few who fight \n where do you stand? who do you follow? Who do you hail? Does darkness' greed draw you close? or does it seperate you? If you are pure of heart, you will fight untill the undead's last breath has been uttered. YOU will not relent! I wrote a book test GAD STOP READING", ""),
        StaticBook("The War", "CamouFranky", "He is catching up to me. I have to run. No time to think. As I run past the corner a large dwarf come out of nowhere with a gigantic hammer and strikes it at me. I dodge at a split second before the hammer brakes a side of the wall. I strike with my dagger, hitting him right in the heart and killing him instantly. I run outside to be greeted by a small platoon of Humans. \"Welcome back Private.\" said Seargent Fijork. \n Back at camp, I tell the story I had just witnessed. \"... then I striked the huge dwarf with my dagger, bringing him to the ground.\" I said. \"Wow! That's such a story!\" said my best friend Corporal Yerok. \"Well, I think if all of us were this good, the war would be over!\" I said. \"But not all of us are that talented.\" Yerok said. Throughout the night the two friends played cards until Dwarvern scouts were spotted on the edges of camp. The Dwarves were planning an attack. \n We here our officers scream \"Everyone put your gear on!\" I put on my Iron gear and bow . I got to my training days... \"Put your head down soldier!\" Screamed Seargent Fijork. \"You gotta get dirty in the mud if you wanna be a Oren Guard!\" He screamed to me. I cralled under the barbed wirer and killed the dummy with 3 arrows. \"Not bad for a private\" he said. \"Well, I'm no regular private. My parents died when I was a baby. My village was burned down when I was 15. I was forced to live in the wild with only my pet wolf for protection.\" \"Well, that's quite a story you got there private, but no king or queen will think your gonna be qualified for knight level with that sob story.\" I zoom back into reality.", ""),
        StaticBook("The War Hammer", "dirtryhary", "Once a Oren Templar fought rat men in the sewers! The warhammer served templar_Geo well and his power and grew....... Perea started a hard campain against the orcs in the opening fight Geo charged a orc batilion (Geos View) The orc with big tusk threw a cleave into a mans skull. i readyed my hammer i ran through a grobi (goblin) unit of spear throwers cleavng skulls left and right to get my enemy. Big tusk saw me and readyed his axe i jumped propelled by my legs to run right into big tusk i caved parryed his first atack and then side steped the return stroke i whirled my hammer over my head for momentum and struck. mucus and blood exploded from the bastards face (narrator) after five years of campaing the orcs threw a massive army at Geos small force Geo charged against the kings orders and lost 1000 milti and 300 loyal guards the king exiled Geo and gave his hammer to (cant say a name) (rob) Rob took the hammer and wanted to prove himself teh war hammer coruted him as well The War hammer corupts all The End", ""),
