        StaticBook("The War of Snowy Fields", "BIDZ180", "I had only recently arrived in Alstion, and knew that it was the town that I would settle into. The only downside to the city was the city across from it, the cursed city of Snowy Fields. The city had been captured and nearly destroyed by the evil forces of the undead. Anyone who dared walk in front of the city would be threatened or attacked. The threat of an invasion was high, and tensions were as well.  you like to read it so far Nym? What was that command again?", ""),
