        StaticBook("The_Story_Of_Edwin!", "HarrisonBitzis", "This, as the title might state clearly state, is the story of Edwin. NARROTOR: There once was a small hamlet, only known as \"The Hamlet\", As not many people lived here. Edwin was a citezin of this Hamlet, a very popular one at that! He was the strongest axeman in the. villiage . However, all was not well! ( DOnt say this, Test. ) -the lights brighten as the story begins.- EDWIN: Another boring old day in the mill.... I want to go kill some things! -Edwin lugs a sack of meal ( Wheat ) Around and drops it on the thick wooden floor. - VILLIAGER 1: Help! Help! The bakery is on fire! EDWIN: What!? MYSTERIOUS VOICE: You cant stop us! -laughs evilly.- JENNIFER: Hel-coughs- Heee... Hellp... -goes unconcious. - EDWIN: Whats going on!? -rushes over, axe in hand, prepared to chop up the villians. - MYSTERIOUS VOICE: Fool! -Blows Edwin back with a blast of scalding hot air. - -a bright arow hisses out of the darkness and strikes the figure in the chest!- EDWIN: Wah!? Whats going on!? wait, The girl! Hello? I cant see very well! -notices the figure begin to rise. Another arrow from the darkness arrives, killing the figure in a n uncanny matter. -", ""),
