        StaticBook("Thee Wool Merchant's Guide", "machinegunliam", "Thee best wool to gather is white wool. White wool can later be dyed to suit thee customer's order Don't be using valuable coco beans to create brown wool. If ye do, thee price will skyrocket. Natural brown sheep are common enough. Just sheer them. If possible, dye live sheep then sheer them. You will get more colored wool this way. If possible, dye sheep before sheering. Ye will get more colored wool this way.", ""),
