        StaticBook("these books have no meaning", "char615", "this book has no meaning.... GET OVER IT HO! i suck at spelling i decree that we burn this book \n FOREVERRRRR!!!!!", ""),
        StaticBook("These Feelings", "KarmaDelta", "Feelings are what makes someone a living being. There are many feelings some good and some bad. Those who harbor evil feelings like anger and hatred. It tells of the persons future as a future of evil doings. There are also good feelings like happiness and joy. Those kinds of feelings tell of a path that will be good. \n \n But no one can teach someone what feelings to go by. So things can be twisted. Thats why there are intermediate, or \"middle\" feelings. Thats what can make someone neutral. And to a suprise makes someone normal. \n \n I harbor both of them. Im a gentleman and a person that dabbles in hatred. I enjoy hatred and its side of evil more every passing day. Its because of... her. She made me feel like a good person but in a way show me the evil side of things. I enjoyed it...... so when something tragic to me happened I did not know what to do. \n \n So I asked her questions. She did not appear to like them. And when she said that the relationsh p was up to me..... I got to thinking. Should I stay with her and try and fix her problems... or forget her and kill her in the future. She can fight but I know im stronger. I dont know, I guess thats why I am neutral at this point. So feelings can corrupt or purify someone. No matter who they are. Remember that for whoever reads this. Think of which side you take. Will you take a side of good or the sode of evil? Its all up to you. \n \n But for me... it appears I have to make a hard choice. One of the hardests I have come in contac with. I wish I could have help but I guess I cant. So I will be deciding over a period of days over these \"feelings\". \n \n I hope that whoever is reading this knowss what they are doing. For I dont know at all. Im just one elf living in a tree and making his living everyday. I thank whoever had the time reading this. And may your feelings guide you onto the path you so choose.", ""),
