        StaticBook("This Is An Awesome Story", "connorr1", "One day a man named Swordsman_Connor walked into a city named Oren. This man knew no one at all he had no friends and knew of no one until... He walked around the whole city and found no one at all but then he walked into the local bakery and met a ton of new people inclued the Queen Dawn herself. So Swordsman_Connor got to know these nice people one was named John and he was a good and nice f riend to Connor. Then a couple days later a strange and funny man by the name of Hempshine walkst into the city. We all thought of him as strange at first but i got to know him and 2 days after w e were practically brothers.", ""),
