        StaticBook("This is my journal.", "Robbie995", "Today a strange orc arrived at the camp. However, i was suspicious as there wer at least 3 people on our beach. They turned out to be pathfinders/ we then traveled to Laurelin. Here we seeked out High Prince Native to see if they would accept us . As we talked to him he told us we were to interact with the people of Laurelin.", ""),
