        StaticBook("This is the Journal of FOA Captain Karter", "Nanomatrix", "This is the Journal of FOA Captain Karter, If you find this please burn it, or discard of it someway and seek out a lady name'd Annora, as if you have found this, i am deceased, and am walking the Silver road's of Aerial's kingdom, watching, waiting. When you find this lady, please tell her that i love her, and will be watching her from Aerial's kingdom, keeping her safe. And tell her to seek a man named Thysajaes Oli, a elf of malinor, and to tell him i have deceased. \n Day #1: A final Goodbye \n Today i left, the beautifull home, of Annora's, I spoke to her, and told her that i loved her, she did not feel the same way however, i was heart brokern, But i must do what is right for Aegis, and pull myself together and return to the fortress once know as the citadel, the men and woman of the FOA need me, to support them through these time's of hardship. I heard grave new's, the FOA will be marching to war soon, I am afraid that it may be my last, as it is against the undead but, i will not let the undead prevail, and make Aegis subject to their dark way's even if it mean's i may have to give my life to stop them. Atleast then, i will be with Aerial in her kingdom, waiting for the time that Aerial will need us to defend, the world once again.. that, is all for today that i will write. *you see a partially torn page, with drop's of blood on the edge's* \n I can not, stay awake with these injurie's, i am dieing, please take this book to Annora and her friend's, as they must know of my demi *the rest is to coverd in blood to read*", ""),
