        StaticBook("This is the tale of  Rob_Mills.", "boodilly", "Beggining as a lowly guard, he slowly began a life as a swordsman. After a few months in the guard, he joined the Holmes dectective agency. It was not long before he rose tothe rank of investigator. He also joined the Trisian organizaton as a recrute.", ""),
