        StaticBook("Thonax the story", "Thonax", "date: Irba, 25th of the second seed 1290  Today i was out in the woods with my mother. We were getting some herbs for her potion We were gathering those herbs becuse my big brother had a terrible cold and if he didn't get those herbs he would die It was a rainy day but we needed those herbs we found the herbs growing under a apple tree. Mother told me to stay away from the tree becuse it was a very old tree so she went under the tree by herself. when she was allmost done gathering the herbs  a lightning hit the tree right in the middle o of it. It was starting to fall down quickly. I was yelling:Get out of there the tree is going fall. but she didn't hear me  becue the rain was so loud. so she was crushed by the tree right infront of my eyes i couldn't bellive what i saw. I went to investegate if she had some how survived. but she didn't were she had been standing was just a pile of meat and crushed bones coverd in blood, but some how the herbs didn't get crushed so i took the basket with the herbs and ran home crying i told my father about what happend and my bigbrother got his potion but to what cost mother had died. father never did recoverd from that. years later Father jumpt of a cliff hey beeny wanna read some pages from my book that i am working on? ((sorry mixed", ""),
        StaticBook("Thoradin in Aegis", "tfortacos", "It was a cold night in the wilds, Hail Stroke down on the flat forest surface like meteors strike down on earth.There camped a group of explorers in a cave huddled up around a fire among the explorers was a young boy nearly around the age of 11 His name was Thoradin a Pure blood Northerner They headed down to the continent of Aegis.", ""),
        StaticBook("Thordrin Floops Log", "Floopster", "\n-Day 1:Me and The_Blind_Seer have set a goal for ourselves, we shall get the minas to get ourselves a nice home in the whispering isles to call our own . It will not be easy, but our dreams our set. Today we started saving minas right away! \n-day 2: Found the perfect house, to the left of the stone structure in middle of isles. We are saving up 40-50k minas for it, it has a balcony, 2 master bedrooms, and is on an actual island! This home is definetely our dream home. \n-day 3: Met a nice fellow in the isles, Midnus_Anarion, he was a tad tipsy however. if the neighbors are anything like him, this will be a nice neighborhood to live in . \n-Day 4: Today I pulled a prank on The_blind_seer, i covered his bed in glass! wait till he is tired and needs some sleep! I'm sure he will understand it was a joke, if not, well, the hell with that betch. Haha, im just kiddin, we are best friends, he will get over it eventually.", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorg Beregrim's Events Log", "lichtkang", "Pre-logs: Hrothgar and his brother passed here in search of a ruined fort to the east. Austin knew the way and led them to it. I couldn't follow, for there was an auction I had to attend in Kal'Urguan \n An Orc warlord of Krugmar came in Terriko, Mogroka'Gorkil. He demanded to see the mayor, as he required tribute. Apparently, he thinks Terriko is too close to the Orc capitol of Krugmar. Even though we explained him this town had been here long, he insisted. Some later, Austin, me (Thorg) and Blade went to see him in Krugmar, bringing write gifts. He was not in town, but when I spoke to Austin later he told me the deal was made and we are under Krugmar's protection. \n Long before I settled even in Kal'Urguan, where I had a small home for a short while, I went North, past Orin, in the Snowy fields. Apparently it was Undead territory... I should've known better! There, I met a small party of travellers, keen on rebuilding a fortress. As an Architect, I offered them my services and built the large, strong stone keep. No art, but nevertheless a fine piece of craftsmanship. When I ran out of stone and went to see the overseer, I stumbled in some people. They were talking to some Edagor, and were convincing him he should join the Black Hand. When they noticed me in the vicinity, a friend of the Black Hand members, an Undead Mage named Fyrste, sent fireballs and zombies at me! I survived by closing the gates, which didn't last long under the fireball attacks, and using the magic of the soulstone... I reported the events to Kal'Urguan's General and King. \n \n When I met up with Blade, after finally getting settled in Terriko, we set out to explore the surrounding towns. One of them was a Guardian castle, of the community of Tinra. The damn bastards! There was one guard there, when after a while he asked us to leave, he trapped us between the two gates, claiming he'd first close the gate behind us and then open the gate in front so we could get out. I smelled something fishy, when I realised what was going to happen and got to the edge of the in-between, the scoundrel opened a bridge below us, dropping us into the 'Cage of Shame'! We'll get them back someday... \n Logs: Blade got a letter yesterday, apparently Scott will be visiting us in Terriko soon! \n Some Aedin fellow visited us today, he was poor and needs shelter and a job but didn't have money to pay for accomodation. I showed him the inn and will stay quiet to Frenchie, so he doesn't have to pay. Were he rich i'd have passed on the money, but he's just some unlucky chap. I hope Frenchei or Austin are back soon so they can employ him! He seems like a decent enough chap... more than the orc who passed by a few months ago! \n I've been robbed! They stole the anvil and damaged my property. This town isn't safe, not worth the money I paid for this property at all! Aside from that, I haven't been paid for the walls or plaza yet. The way this is going, I might leave this town...", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorg Beregrim's Trade Log", "lichtkang", "Pre-logs: Blade banked 34 gold and a diamond sword. \n I stocked up iron, diamonds and arrows from Kal'Urguan to sell products here at higher prices. \n \n Logs: Sold 5 stacks of arrows to Bear, out of stock again. \n Blade deposited a broken pickaxe, repair asap!", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorik", "machinegunliam", "Reformation in? Darius, if ye see Thordon, may ye give t'is ta 'im? ((Srry fail lol))", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorin's Journal 1307", "joshlmr", "Irba, 4th of The Grand Harvest, 1307 Ah, today is a good day to be alive. I have put the finishing touches on my hotel! Thorin's Deep-Road Hotel, has a nice comfortable, earthy, ring to it. \nI may be but a young Dwarf of 87 years but I still know how to provide customer service!", ""),
        StaticBook("Thork_Halblood's Venture To The Nether", "MrJakKiD", "[Day One]- The first thing to do when going on a very dangerous outing like this is to PREPEARE for anything that may happen as anything can occur whilst in the wilds and for the extra dangerous mission in which i am embarking on I need LOTS of food as ive been told.. Anyone who isnt in the ranks of the Necromancers or Undead there innocent soul is sucked from there body by Iblees himself and ill be more immune if im at my strongest.. with a full belly! well.. I have a long journey ahead of me to reach the place im going too. So ill update this every day or two.......", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorknor's Life Journal", "MrJakKiD", "Bloodblades dead.. Im going to find A life in Aegis and find out who i am.. I have found my way into some Cloud Temple and the monks here are friendly! I have met a friend called Eridhian Longbow he has had a hard life like me. I believe we may become great friends (( im dead))", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorknor's Secret Journal", "MrJakKiD", "My master is dead.. I must travel to Aegis and find who i am!! [Entry Two]- I have found a small temple it is called The Cloud temple the monks there are friendly [Entry Three]- Today I met a guard called Niko.. He seems very friendly and possably my 1st true pal [Entry 4]- Wow it has been a while since i have last wrote in this so much has happned.. [Entry5]- I am now best of friends with Niko... And a girl named Sadi has joined us in our- friendship.. She has the most beautiful eyes i have ever seen.. They are like Mine accept she is no dark elf.. Amasing and so Rare.. [Entry 6] I feel strange i just ate a cookie off a woman named Cassandra An the crums on my hand are glowing a strange red colour [Entry7]- I feel so ill.. So Evil. No one can know of this.. Not even Niko or Sadi..", ""),
        StaticBook("Thorknors Life Journal", "MrJakKiD", "((go and get Sadi from laurelin))", ""),
