        StaticBook("title Attack on Oren", "G79", "Today on the 23rd of The Amber Cold, 1334, The Undead attacked the human city of Oren... The attack came without warning and the undead sent in hordes of enemies to try to capture the city. All of the races of Aegis, the Elves, Dwarves, Orcs, and Acsended sent in their armies to aid the race of man. The Dwarves who were closest to Oren sent in their armies first and killed off most of The Undead... Soon after, the Orc, and Elven Armies assaulted the Undead and drove them back . So they were defeated for the time being until the next attack...", ""),
