        StaticBook("title Documentation: Al'Khazar Guard Incident", "xXWOLVERINEXx", "After dealing with some trouble on our first assassination mission, we headed back to Al'Khazar . Our Dux Drifter was then walking into the city through the wrong entrance and was stoppe d. The guards demaned he pay a fine of 100 minas. They cuffed him and tried to make him pay or get arrested. He refused and so I got onto the roof and listened. After some time I asked Lance for his bow. I proceeded to snipe the guard three times. This distracted the guards and so we got away.", ""),
