        StaticBook("Title Savio Anatolio", "zachary31798", "This is The Story Of Savio, A Knight Of The Flame Saviowas attacked by a Bandit by the name of Maith, Maith nearly killed him. feeling that he was unprotected, he joined Knights Of The Flame, Where They stick together as Brothe", ""),
        StaticBook("title Scouting MoI", "Ahkrael", "Got it. On my way to the minion town The undead apparently have made an impressive home for their minions, I am surprised That they have stores and farms about, however I've noticed a few buildings are trapped with flaming rock.. (netherrack) And I can't get too close to certain rooms due to it New entry: Inside one of the minion huts lies signs with names of minions above their dorms The Names are: randok, Titus, Janux, Kevin, and Lodricks. Found interesting seemingly randomly palced blocks of the stone that catches fire, (netherack) Found... rock I cant mine.. (bedrock) How'd it get here... isn't this deep in earth and not on the s surface..? Random lava pool walkway on the surface, leads no where.. and can walk around it. Found something EXTREMELY interesting.. a private mine owned by the undead minions/.. they seem to c ollaborate on this mine and smelt ores for weapons most likely.. Note: Mine exactly like ours, pretty simple and basic, found Skeletons inside though and killed them Approximately 2 homes for minions.. 6 buildings in all... 1 store. Random boats behind our fort on the lake..? Way beyond the water behind our fort is a new building.. a fort, looks to not be made by minions or the dead. Another fort near this fort, with a water moat. built entirely of wood. I finished me scouting report on the minions", ""),
