        StaticBook("title Steve getting kicked out of M.V", "FishFr0g", "Steve getting kicked out of M.V Alright steve has been abusing his power just because he is FOunder of Mist veil The donation thing for 200 minas is a rip off you need (( real money )) to get protected which we're Working on it Whenever I do something that he doesn't want or not do something he wants He will say do it or im banished from M.V ITS RIDICULOUS Hes greedy fer minas as well the donation thing is just minas for him now We already have 3 citizens which are: Entropy, Nayr, Dongrim that want steve to be kicked out the problem is we need most citizens of Mist veil to agree If ye think if he gets kicked out ye will no longer have a locked chest thats not a problem Entropy is a locksmith as well he will be glad ta help ye out And if ye agree with me and this works I will be leader Which i will be fair ta ALL citizens of Mist veil Always thinking whats best fer the citizens and not just fer meself I will make this place look better and make it a friendly and FAIR enviroment So please agree with me on what i am doing ta get Steve permanently kicked out of Mist Veil Also since we destroyed all yer houses ta have a better landscape of this citeh We have most of yer supplie sin locked chests When we give ye back a plot ta build in a different place Everyone will have a fair amount of supplies ta build a house Basically like a starter kit with wood cobble building materials ETC> So please Agree with meh on getting steve kicked out thank ye fer reading thi this*", ""),
        StaticBook("title Tales Of Prospero", "Religious_Pie", "text In a realm far from here, Lies the Cities of Prospero. However, I say 'Far' With a major text exageration! For this land Isn't existing in Aegis, but In a world That have no Idea we text Exist! The very thought of other Humans, and other races is Enthralling for everyone! text But alas, We only know about these Men and Women From mis-transportions to the Nether, text Thus, we do not no anything about our culture or what their adaptations are like!", ""),
