        StaticBook("Title The Book Of Smith", "conorb", "He Woke On A Dark Dark Night, Alone In His Bedroom, He Hears Lightning From Out Side Then Screams, He Gets Up His Parents are gone. He Walks Outside And There They Are Dead Burned To A Crisp, He Takes Out His Small Wooden Sword And Promises That He Will To All In His Will To Kill And Destroy All Undead He Then Joins The Kal'urgun Guards And Army. Hes Done His Part In Both Of Them Hes Hilled Alot Of The Evil Hooded Men He Plans On Finding The Undead That Killed His Parents And Stabbing Him With His Own Diamond Sword Broski His Leader, Has Told Him To Be Strong And That One Day He Will Find The Man Smith Knows That He Will * Hand Broski a book", ""),
        StaticBook("title The Eyes Of Vardak. Begining.", "Vardak", "", ""),
        StaticBook("title The First Attempt", "LuigiNova", "Its fine Me and My brave and faithful companion set off up north past snowy fields to the scum we call the UNDEAD. The only things we had with us was stone swords and a stone pickaxe. ass attempting to gain access through main gates (BIG MISTAKE) We was interupting from our callings of ''OPEN the gates!'' by one of the Minions who was occupying the gatehouse. He Shouted out without even checking if we were Undead or not ''MORTALS! FEEL THE WRATH OF IBLEES!'' Summoning Zombies etc. which was the chapter of our seperation. As James (Snowy Feilds Captain) ran towards the horizon and I to the nearest cover, As i desperatly dug myself a small room and started to ((PM)) and call out for James. yes?", ""),
        StaticBook("title The Friendly Creeper", "Religious_Pie", "title Tales Of Prospero text A land far from here named Prospero exists, I say Far with a major exageration, For this text 2 Land is not existant in Ours, but in a Differential reality! The land however, is at text undo", ""),
        StaticBook("title The GRand Champion", "xXMrAkatoshXx", "", ""),
        StaticBook("title The GrandChampion", "xXMrAkatoshXx", "The grand champions story first started as a little boy His family was porn and barley had enough food to live", ""),
        StaticBook("Title The Holmes", "tyking919", "The Holmes who found this book um if you found this sorry but this is a messed up copy come find me adian at the holmes hq if you know anything about writing books", ""),
        StaticBook("title The Last Stand at Sentinel Tower", "darklordsmu", "text In the northern wastes, there is a aging ruin, a solemn sentinel on a lonely hill.", ""),
        StaticBook("title The Paragons Journey", "simidimi12", "Dezios, Myself and Raider left a day in the search of a perfect land where we can build a new guild. This is the story of are Journey. Dezios and I decided to head to Talun where we would continue from there to go north. But the night fell upon us and we built are campfire near Talun. Actually, Raider did not start the Journey with Dezios and I, he joined us after the first night. Our campfires we're built with fences defence so that no monsters can attacks us. Every night Dezios lighted up a fire for us to rest and get a sleep. Raider was always the ones staying up to guard. Since I was the oldest one, I had to rest more then them. We traveled for many days, maybe weeks. But we finally found the perfect place. We established are permanent base in a valley surrounded by montains. Montains that will soon have a name. This place was chosen by me, because montains offers us natural walls. Wich means, he do not have to build any fortification walls. We cleared the valley from all the trees it growed, and started to build. I remember the look in the eyes of Dezios everynight we spent outside. I saw fear in his eyes. I was also scared despite the fact we had fences to proect us.", ""),
        StaticBook("title The Quest For The Daimonds of Halfing Village", "bradley112", "Tis one bright early morining when i woke up.i was armoring up for a treck to oren knowing I armored my self . As i was leaving the gate I found Thordon_Braveaxe. I being good freinds with him i asked him to come along he gladly joined. As leaving outer Urugan we Noticed Beardling_Skippy chopping trees. He asked \"Were ye going\" I told him i was going to Oren on a trade mission he asked to come with us.He was getting bored with his trees. as we went to Oren we say captivating Buildings me being new to the road i ened up wandering off alot. Eventually we made it to Oren I made my trades and was about to leave when a strange man asked for s ome adventures. Me being the one who wanted to help the old man asked what was wrong he said there was treasure at a halfing village a ways away. i Agreed and Thordon and Skippy followed. Some ways down the road monsters appered they were dead in seconds. eventually we made it to the village the man said the treasure was in the hill close by . We dug in this hill and found a small cave with a good bit off spiders. Killing them all the man told us that the treasure was down a long hole by the lava. Skippy being a dwarf instantly dropped sand on the lava. Which in the long run cost's us time.An hour later we found a chest filled with diamonds and gold and minas evenlly dividing up the loot. The old man told us there was a catch we had to get back by ourselfs. He instantly disappered and we left back to oren . The trip back wasnt that long as the way there. We made it to kings road and came home to Urugan wealthy My name is Zack IronBar or ((Mc Name bradley112)) and this is my Story", ""),
        StaticBook("title The Story of the Carminian Brothers", "racingbrother", "My name, is Gio Carminian. I used to have a brother. He's gone now. He was my best friend, mentor, and teacher.", ""),
