        StaticBook("title The Wolf and the Writer. By Rayle Seek", "StandUnited", "", ""),
        StaticBook("title The wondering journal of Blundermore on the verge.", "Blundermore", "I have started on my wonder through this strange new land after i left the old temple. It was very dark but it reminded me of my home... Could it be? The lost outpost of the Grunvaruk? With this in mind I emerged from the darkness of the strange temple with my walking stick in hand. I stared across the old forest that layed before me. I walked these forests for a very long time. they where like the elven forests of aegis, But they're a lot darker. Like there is a meance that seems to enimate from the very trees... These trees are very old... They outlasted whatever was here before... There are ruins here. Very old and very broken, like me ha! I stumbled across what seems to be a very small church, no wait a chapel even. How strange.... Whoever was here they worshipped some sort of God or deihty... I have found whats seems to be the remmenants of a Grave. Aegis rest him or her. The weathered sign is very worn but it reads \"RIP, Duvan_Fuhray.\" Fuhray? a very strange last name. Maybe an explorer that made it here by ship and was left here perhaps? There are caverns here of the likes that I have never seen here! It stretches on beyond anything i could even see. There are so many rich minerals in this cavern. A shame I didn't bring a pickaxe with me... I would have taken some back with me. End of day one. Day two. <text> ((ignore that)) I have stumbled across a sheer Cliff face! I heads straight up with no foot holds to be seeng none the less i will begin to climb the mountain, maybe there is something of importance on t top of it? Time will tell but for HOLY AEGIS! I WAS JUST SET APON BY ONE OF THOSE DASTARDLY PIGMEN! If there is one thing I know of this land, it is not safe from the undead! their taint has spread to here as well! Of all places... With my sword in hand i will kill these vermine that plague these lands... There is a zombie coming towards me right now! Aegis it is hideous and foul smelling! it has been a long night... it will take more than 20 zombies and 5 pigmen to kill me! there seems to be an entrence on the side of the mountain... It seems very lavish.... but nether be this thunderstorm will not stop. I have two choices here... either stay in the rain... of wonder into the cave... CRIPES a thunderbolt just struct a tree near by me! into the cave then... End of day two. Day five. Three days I have been wondering these caves... they must span the entire island I have found daimonds! of all things to find in here! Day... thirteen... I... I do not know how long it has been.... it counted it as thirteen days in that pit but it might have been longer . I found a man dressed in a hood... weary of him I asked him of his name... He said he was a Battlemage. DAMNATION. A battlemage? And who else would he have been working than my Traitorous brother Flame. He joined the undead... Flame did and this young fool had no idea what he was getting himsel. himself)) into , I told him of what the Battlemages really where but he had no real idea that this was happe hppening)) happening))", ""),
