        StaticBook("title Welcome to Aeriel's Keep!", "Riizu", "Hello and welcome to Aeriel's Keep! Please make sure you follow these rules. 1. Never let someone in unless you are a guard 2. Follow all orders given by a Sage, or a leader of the FoA You are to understand your chests will be searched for contraband. As well as that, make sure to never break a wall should the wards fail. Thank you, and welcome to Aeriel's Keep!", ""),
