        StaticBook("To a druid and a druid only", "BKisKk", "This book is to a druid. If you are not a full Druid please put this book back down and let it be. If you happen to be a druid there should be two dogs next to you. I have completed an assigned challenge to find two wolven companions and have this book to show it. - Rufus (( BKisKk ))", ""),
        StaticBook("to a friend", "Megaman765", "I found the cryomancer and realized he was not the only awakened one due to his enhanced power i took its head and on my way to your estate i spoted a more powerful one it ignored me for n o reason i was wondering if you could figure out why. the cryoamncer i have right now does not speak to me but for now i must hide it wish me luck, Frowman", ""),
        StaticBook("To a Master Unknown.", "Domainoft", "Hail Master Hwaldar, Please forgive my disturbance into your room. I hope that this message finds you swiftly and in good condition. I like you have much interest in the magic of this world, and its secrets. I have recently uncovered more truths that I believe you will be most interested in hearing. Please visit Me on the Isle of the Wisp. It may prove difficult to find, but all worthy tasks are such. \n -Dom, Oracle of the Wisp.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Accept", "_Shoi_", "If you decided to accept this judgement. Your duty shall come before all. The people are our goal to protect against the undead. The encampment is to be tended to, the farms and food to be stock piled. To teach the FOA how to work with others as we as our own. To drive the Ascended back to the respect of the people. This does mean that our families may reside in the comfort of the encampment. But now is the time to remain close to the cities and draw strength. We cannot leave our people alone in the world for the chance to be captured, or worse. Killed. We are to be selfless people.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Airion", "_Shoi_", "You have been selected to attend the planting of the Tree of Life Sapling in the tower dedicated to the Sages whom joined Aeriel, may their memories be treasured in her children and the taint fall wea k in her children. [[10/24/2011 6-7 PM EST @ Enlighted FOA encampment]] Here take this", ""),
        StaticBook("To Akorta", "isagirl909", "Hello Akorta. Hello Akorta I am sorry for my absence as of late. I have been dealing with some old business but I promise you it is nothing to worry about. I was return to the Isles soon and hope to see all of you then.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Alethion & Rhisereld", "_Shoi_", "You have been selected to attend the event of the planting of the Tree of Life sapling in the honor of the Sages gone to Aeriel. May they watch over the hope and dreams of the children of Aegis. [[10/ 23/2011 6-7 PM EST @ Enlightened FOA Encampment]]", ""),
        StaticBook("To Alethion and Rhise.", "Angelus_Obscurus", "And everyone else. \n \n You all have made me so happy the last few months, happiness i have never felt words cannot express how much it pains me to write this.. but i have to leave. I am extremely happy with all of yous here in my life, but i just do not feel like i fit in. \n So this is why i have to leave, i have to go discover myself so far yous all have helped me so much.. but there is still alot more i have to discover. I will still make it to the wedding, but from now until then i do not know if yous will see me again. *The text is a little smudged due to small droplits of water.. or tears* \n I promiss you all i will return, and i ask your forgiveness for my sudden leave, i'm sorry i cannot stay to help with the whole Ar'Kelos problem but i just do not feel i am helping. I say again, i'll miss you all so much, will think of you all as the sun sets and rises. \n \n Farewell. ~Akorta", ""),
        StaticBook("To Alethion's Wife and Kids", "Alectriciti", "This is to Rhisereld, Zhotia, Vaelinor, Akorta, and Brett. I'm sure you're aware of what's happened at the order with the Undead. I figured you had escaped before I did. Please be aware that Annora has been tainted by the Undead and must be stopped. While I'm currently fleeing from the Isles, I do hope you are doing the same. We cannot let the Undead take the Order like this! Rhisereld, Zhotia, Vaelinor, I love you all so much. I hope you're safe. To everyone this book is adressed to, please meet me at Talamh as soon as possible. I'm staying with a friend at a house labeled, \"Joshua Wood\". Please be alert. The enemy wants to take us alive. They know we have weak spots. But never give up! I hope to see all of you soon. And please, help Annora. Pull her out of the undead like I did Rhisereld. We're not leaving anyone behind! \n Love, Alethion Celebtaurë", ""),
        StaticBook("To all my Friends", "Cloudheart", "by Tend'el \n \nI am sorry I have not visited, or wrote, or sent message. I have been so mercilessly busy, and I have wandered many a time to come see you all. Where have you all gone? Why have I not seen you in my travels? Please write back, any of you. My work in secrecy pains me, in that I cannot mingle with you all. I hope that soon all shall be revealed, and my vow of silence undone. \n \nWith the love of a friend, \nTend'el \n \nP.S. : I have recently discovered some entries in my family tree that are most interesting! I have also been traveling into and documenting the deep wilds of Aegis. Perhaps one day I may show you all images of my travels with an Orc. See you all soon: Conell, Ademas, Bawapy, and Laetri.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Annora", "Nanomatrix", "Due to, the recent event's i have to take my leave, You were one of my good friend's one of the only ones who could understand, that i was a mute, but was still capable of doing thing's for that, and many other reason's i belive i have fallen in love with you, Perhaps i will see you again, but if not, perhap's in the afterlife.... Your's truly Karter", ""),
        StaticBook("To Annora", "Angelus_Obscurus", "I cleaned your room, i think this means we'll now best friends \n \n *You see a poorly drawn picture of a happy face*", ""),
        StaticBook("To Annora", "Alectriciti", "Dear Annora. These recent events have really dealt a massive wound in the Order. My actions lacked self-control, and they have brought ruin to us. But we can fix this in the end. Keep up the good work, General.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Annora #2", "Angelus_Obscurus", "I'm glad that your okay and safe, When things start to settle down here again we should go on a trip somewhere again, maybe we'll finally be able to find some Dwarven Ale. \n \n ~Akorta.", ""),
        StaticBook("To anyone who reads this", "Minnan1", "I was informed during my travels that an old friend of mine lives in this adress, Aedan. He's a young Elf, blond long hair, light brown eyes, peaceful look and a wise elf. I plan on traveling there soon to meet him myself. If for some reason this is not his house, then I apologise. Please reply to Rincewind, The Mad Wizard at Whisper Isles... \n \n \nMost sincere apologies, depending on the situation. \n \n - Rincewind, The Mad Wizard.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Argos", "xXSweet_TearsXx", "Dear Argos I write this bok for you. book* but i am so glad tha i could stay in you boat ! It was funny but i have got my own house now. Its not far away from you house :D So we can visit each other :D I like you as a friend You are really nice !  So it have been nice really nice but cya hope you arent mad pleaz Answer!!!! From Arya <3 cya", ""),
        StaticBook("To Be a Bandit", "langstondog", "Keep away from guards or you may get arrested. Stay off the road if you can. Always have a back up plan. Be smart about who you choose don't choose a peasent!", ""),
        StaticBook("To Become a Diplomat", "patato12", "Hail Sir I am James ((patato12)) I wish To become a Dipomat for you I wish to become Diplomat to aurin Laurin I know Two diplomats In the Laurin Goverment And have known The other two for some time I am able to talk to the Other diplomats All the time Infact they prompted me to take the job Now I Talk to mr Native Often and was a recidnce their often And I think resolveing the issues between Us and Laurin would be Benificial I also have good friends in the Wardens The Army Of Malinor I also Know Hayden and Grimbeard Very well and Talk to them often I have always loved oren And I have never met the prison Nor do i plan on it I am very active and have spoken to your wife on these matters I have fought for you in many wars Even against my own people of Malinor when they attacked unjustly ((I have also supported You over forums)) So please consider me for the job and i will work with you well -Sincerly James ((patato12)) hmm", ""),
        StaticBook("To Become a Mage", "XBLxSNAZZLEZ", "There is much an apprentice must learn before becoming a Mage. Your Guild Master may send you on quests of sorts, but I prefer to study in the Library, the source of much information. Here, you can learn everything you need; The Elements, Self-Control, Mage Powers, and much more. This is the first part in become a Mage, studying. You need to learn all you can from your experiences and readings. Once an Elven Week has passed, possible longer, you will be asked to gather materials. These will be used to create your staff. The particular ingredients in your staff will cause a different outcome, than if you were to use different materials. This Staff you create will be specially connected with you, your spirit energy will be infused with the energy of the staff, thus the connection. Once you have earned your staff, you will become a Mage, and be given a job within the guild.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Botar", "DecoLamb", "Botar. I have had enough of everyone trying to save me. I would much like it if I was just left alone to tend to my new life. I have lost my children, and my love... I want nothing more than to be left alone. Please... I beg you.. just leave me be... \n -Decora You.. *tosses the book to Karl, 'Take that to Botar.\"", ""),
        StaticBook("To Brian", "anorexicelephant", "Glad to see your house is going well I am still lookin for one meself \n-Tom Oi! oi!", ""),
        StaticBook("To Charon", "tomsim9611", "Ahh Charon my cousin often spoke of you, i hope to talk with you in person soon i would like to help as much as i can in Libertas I intend to live here in Tom's old house, looking after his land, doing his duties at least until his son is old enough to take over signed William Jones", ""),
        StaticBook("To control The Gate", "xXMrAkatoshXx", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To Craft A Golem", "Lagomorphia", "\n A body of five blocks of stone, \n Ten ingots of iron for the bone, \n A heart of gold and also find, \n The sand of souls to form the mind. \n For nerves one needs ten lengths of wire, \n Then forge new life in blacksmith's fire.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Create A Staff", "XBLxSNAZZLEZ", "This is I, Salamandra, writing a personal journal on staff making. Today, I am going to attempt making my first staff! I watched Ambros create a staff for a Mage, i have the materials needed, so i'll see if I can create one as well! \n I know I need 3 Slimeballs, Sticks, and something to go on top.... I'll start with wood. Heading to the top of the Guild House to start... Well, here i go! \n I start by casting the Slimeballs into the fire I think...... \n Then, I threw the wood onto the land. \n Lastly, i threw the sticks in the water. \n Wow..... this looks embarrasingly wrong..... I'll try again. \n \n \n \n \n ~These are the Words that need be said by the Mage recieving a staff~ \n \"Shor tia myr, ai thysi sor mas\" \n And with those words, the bond between you and staff is created. May your new staff serve you well. \n Today, i found a book written by the Arcane Mage himself! It was in the Lab, in a bookshelf like all the alchemy books. It talked about his trip to the node.... and of a truly immense tower he constructed. I wonder if I will be able to go there someday..... that would be spectacular. He speaks of animals all around him, and enchantments on the tower, which I have no knowledge of. He talks of putting seals in the bouls of the tower......", ""),
        StaticBook("To Cyt", "Ever", "I'm not shur whether o' not ya heard tha commotion a couple o' nights ago. An assassin' broke 'n, attemptin' ta take me life. I 'ad ta kill him, though I'm shamed ta say how. I won't say exactly how. I'm taking a holiday to Al'Khazar to relax. I'm far too stressed to manage both the Forge and the shop. I hope you enjoy your room, and as I've said, feel free to send me a message if ya need annehthing.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Cyt, concering the events of the past few days.", "Ever", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To Decline", "_Shoi_", "If you decided to decline, your abilities will be removed and you may live your lives as the people that we protect. But be sure this is your choice for you will not be allowed to return to your duties as an ascended for your blood will be tainted with the sign of forbearance.  This will seal the abilities that Aeriel once offered you. This includes the link you once shared, the magic that once flowed, and the visions you once had with the ascended. Once this is choice is made, there will be no chance to return. This will be a permanent, you will never be allowed to return.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Dilara and Theragorn, From Gjon", "Gjon3", "I am leaving today on Irba, 18th of The Deep Cold, 1311 to build my own home. I thank you for everything you both did for me, but I need to go now. I don't want to make you think I am leeching. I like the idea of a permanent home and I am sure that you weren't thinking of keeping me for too long. I have left some things in the chest downstairs as a gift of my gratitude, though it is not much. \nThanks again. \nGjon", ""),
        StaticBook("To do list", "Jallentime", "Squire_Jay aided Kramoroe in our time of need against wrath, of his own will and not Orens. He is also a complete imbocile who has no opinion anymore. He stole our iron. Levant got the iron back.", ""),
        StaticBook("To do list:", "Angrygorillaman", "1 hi remove 1 hi", ""),
        StaticBook("To Do List:", "skippy369", "Get Money by killing hostile animals.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Emberhard", "friar7", "you should consider putting houses for sale on those empty plots, we need the villagers having more would take us far, we should expand. (those we get befor map change will most likely continue to live with the WR) ( the more we have, the better) with lots of care, Mork", ""),
        StaticBook("To Eoin", "Ever", "I couldn't delete the ext ;-;", ""),
        StaticBook("To Freya", "Vardak", "I'm sorry. I'm sorry I left this world before I could say all the things i wanted to to you. I know you must be sad, sorrowful and grieving, but I am not lost... I am able to come back... I need you to know that I did love you. That I fought to my last wink to my last bit of life. That I wanted to see you again, that I wanted to see us fight together and destroy the undead. \"Those who know true pain walk a merciless path of torment\" I'm sorry I left you.... I will return... I will have my life back.... I love you.... I truely do... This is my last words, hear out Tekaro for he holds my spirit and life essence. We may talk through Him if ye wish. \n Signed, Vardak Ciantar", ""),
        StaticBook("To Freya.", "Vardak", "I couldn't decide what to get you. So I got you a bit of everything. Enjoy! -Vardak Ciantar", ""),
        StaticBook("To Gideon, or other Ranger Leader", "Jerry_Man", "Lief-Montague (Rivendog) wishes to come into the Headquarters to improve security. I told him I will not take him, that it is not up to me. Please let him know if you can take him there or not.", ""),
        StaticBook("to Grendal", "xXMrAkatoshXx", "i cant hmm cannot put a book here yep i like chesse do you? now read it all the way back there? hail chuck norris", ""),
        StaticBook("To Hell and Back", "XxDukesterxX", "\"A fine thrust, a fine thrust Indeed\" I said as My Brother trained on the Training Dummy. \"Work a little more on your slashing then your Jabbing though\" I Continued. Then as My brother Continued, An old Elf friend ran past me in a hurry. \"Hello my good friend!\" I said as he hurried along. \"Why the hurry?\". \"Oh hello there Lorian, I didn't see you there\" He replied when it was Obvious he did. I looked him up and down trying to find clues on his hurrying. \"You still haven't Answered my Question friend, Why the hurry?\" I asked again. The Expression on his face Suddenly changed. \"There is some, Business, I must take Care of,\" He stuttered. I looked at him in Confusion.", ""),
        StaticBook("To High King from King of Oren", "TheRedNinja", "It has come to my attention that you have a territory that is clearly in Oren Kingdoms boundary . I know that you have been trying to expand as fast as you can, but you have flaged an area that i must dispute. I would like this resolved peacefully and without interference from Military action.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Immortality", "Steamrollx", "It was time to begin my journies to becoming an undead, I met him, the Inquisitor, he had me kill a women named 'Bell' this classified as my first task", ""),
        StaticBook("TO JOIN", "dalfare", "To join simply leave a sign at message board with name and details : then wait till your pm'd happy guilding!", ""),
        StaticBook("To Join the FFA", "sprintindwarf", "Titus_Obadiah((drumstick607)) Malichi((trevisdabomb))", ""),
        StaticBook("To Joining the Undead, A Guide", "simonbane", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To Julianna", "Angelus_Obscurus", "Dear Julianna. \n \n I've had to leave the Isles, I didn't want to, But... I had to, I'm... I'm sick, It pained me to leave you behind, to leave everyone behind... But if I had stayed I know I would of only caused more trouble. \n \n I'm sorry, If I could of stopped this I would of, Rhisereld will take good care of you, she is a great woman, extremely kind hearted. \n \n Julianna, Remember... Daddy will always love you. \n \n ~Akorta", ""),
        StaticBook("To kai", "Nanomatrix", "Kai, will i ever have a chance, or is my muteness, just to big of a burden. I will be fine if it is, but please tell me, as i would not like to go to war, without knowing, wether or not i have someone to come back to, or if i am wounded, someone who will care for me.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Keziah", "Roxses20", "Meet me out side as soon as you can, Lynx", ""),
        StaticBook("To Lucas Black", "Ever", "Yer the only one I know of that can help me. Ya see, while I was alone on the grounds o' me new inn, some mages approached me. I was coaxed into following them, and so I did, all the way to a home in Laurelin. They convinced me to take part in a ritual that gave my body to an apparition of one of their \"cousins\". I curse my drunkeness, if it were not for that, I wouldn't be in this perdicament. I ask tha ya perform some sort of ritual to expel this spirit that has taken residence in my body. The spirit's name is K'zin Rah'Shar, if that helps. The mages name was Ag'Na'Rok, and he had one with him named Tar'Rok. Please 'elp me mate. I feel by bein' tricked into, I have failed Iblees. I must prove my worthyness of this taint should you be able to expunge this spirit. Signed: Ever, Drunk Dwarf.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Maximus", "MrGrendel", "Ah. Great.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Me best buddy Rannulf", "mason9108", "So rannulf i fya get dis i 'ave passed on inta krugs land i just wanted to tell ya you where da closest ting i eva had to a friend enjoy da house and dont forget me", ""),
        StaticBook("To me Elser.. I am so far away..", "Aandie", "Never feared for anything, never shamed but never free.. A life that healed a broken heart with all that it could.. Lived a life so endlessly, saw beyond what others see.. I tried to heal your broken heart with all that I could.. Will you stay? Will you stay away forever? \n \n How do I live without the ones I love? Time still turns the pages of the book, it's burned Place and time always on my mind, I have so much to say but you're so far away.. \n \n Plans of what our futures hold, foolish lies of growing old.. It seems we're so invicible, the truth is so cold.. A final song, a last request, a perfect chapter laid to rest.. Now and then I try to find a place in my mind.. Where you can stay, you can stay awake forever.. \n \n Sleep tight, I'm not afraid.. The ones that we love are here with me... Lay away a place for me .. Because as soon as I am done, I'll be on my way.. To live eternally.. \n \n How do I live without the ones I love? Time still turns the pages of the book, it's burned Place and time always on my mind.. And the light you left remains but it's so hard to stay.. When I have so much to say and you're so far away.. \n \n I love you, you were ready.. The pain is strong enough despise.. But I'll see you when he lets me.. Your pain is gone, your hands are tied.. \n \n So far away.. and I need you to know..", ""),
        StaticBook("To Mi'love", "TheRedNinja", "d", ""),
        StaticBook("To Mork", "emberhard", "I have recetnly taken up brewing and here is what I think is my best batch yet! I allowed melons to ferment with it while it distilled in redwood barrels so it is sweeter and stronger than most brews, tell me what you think! Your the first to try it other than myself, I drank it and ended up selling plots of land while tripping over my own facial hair hope you like it! \n Signed Emberhard \n PS Please return the mug when your done.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Mork from Emberhard", "emberhard", "Hello Mork! Glad to see you! \n Now that I have said that Abreal informed me of you force being a bit... excesive NOT you! but more pacificaly theat of the new sherif, now tweather they are true are not I do not know as I was not there, but Abreal is a good. friend, so maybe have a word with the new guy. \n On another note, I belive you were working on a law book? could I get a copy of that, or get one started? That and could I get a copy of the IDs? I can provide a few blank books if need be. \nThanks! Emberhard \n IMPORTANT! it was not exactly the sherif, but it was one of the new guys.", ""),
        StaticBook("To My Beloved", "Eruza", "test delete", ""),
        StaticBook("To my Beloved...", "serenityonyx", "Apollan, if you read this, then I can assume that you have searched the Estate, I do not wish you to think I have forgotten my words to you, my love... I promised that I would claim your life, and although I may be gone, my promise will not be broken , for you see... I have placed an enchantment upon the webs that were woven in this place and as you've fought through them, you have been absorbing the effects of the spell , the poisons that were weaved into each silken thread, now run through your veins Apollan... \n I cannot give you an estimated time, although your body will soon succumb to the effects (weariness and hallucinations). I offer you one thing to save yourself, if you do not wish to join me... I cannot force upon you death, not now that I am gone. I have made a remedy, to counter the effects of the poision... If you drink it, you will live, but forget about me, us... Everything we shared. If you chose to die, I have placed a ring, a wedding token beside the phial... It is time that you Decide Apollan... Whether you wish to win, or lose the game.", ""),
        StaticBook("To my Brothers and Sisters..", "serenityonyx", "These last weeks, many things have brough such despair and overwhelming concern to my being, attacks on Aegis ever prevalant, the undead are soon to reach us... I can sense it.  My brothers, and my sisters - despite what has seemed a turbulent passage we've shared, I can not  deny, that I have cherished you all, as something akin to family. I am writing this book, as my final word to you all, for when you read this, I will be gone. I do not wish to see our forests burn; the destruction will overcome all life here, it was foreseen many moons ago by the Seer... And with the City of Alkhazar crippled by taint, it will not be long before the undead seek to demolish Laurelin, and Malinor in the wake of their rampage... I digress, however... These scribbled words, so full of idle rambling. \n I wish to leave my possession, in equal divide to the Inner Circle, do with them as you desire. To the Wayward Respiren, I wish to give you something I know you will enjoy greatly - I leave you Each and all the mushrooms and saplings that I have stored safely. I know you will take joy in such a gift. To Valas, I have watched you progess through the Order, and do see it fit that you claim the title of Arch Druid. And to Apollan... I leave my estate in your hands, and all that is within the compound. ... May the Aspects guide each of you, and may the forests be protected in your care... Usstan orn lle'warindos jal.", ""),
        StaticBook("To my buddy", "monkeychez", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To My Daughter", "isagirl909", "Julianna, \n \n I am writing this now before this battle because I want to leave you something to remember me by. I do not plan to die but...We are going against a tough opponent . I just want you to know that I love you more than life itself and I love your father just as much. If I die, I want you to know the truth of your parentage, since I never had that. I am your mother, Annora, Only Annora. \n I was born in the Al'khazar slums without a mina nor kin to my name, dropped off in some God-forsaken orphanage, which spit me out at five. \n It was a difficult life but I made due and realized I was a damn good hunter, which helped me as I g ot older. I meet many a good friend in my youth. But none so great as Akorta, Alethion, and Rhisereld. They all had their problems but I wouldn't have it any other way. They turned into the family I never had and always secretly wanted. Akorta though... He was more... He was an ass, scary, and dangerous when he was bored...Nether, he still is. But I love him all the same. He is your father. ;; \n Alethion and Rhise...Well, they have many stories they could tell you... Most of them getting kidnapped or corrupted... Watch yourself around them. They're moody sometimes... But they're generally nice people. Listen to Rhise. Mock Alethion and don't play with their children. \n Most importantly... I want you to watch yourself, honey. Watch your back, always have a weapon nearby, and always have a way out. Be careful who you trust but be loyal to those you do. Do what you know must be done, despite what anyone else might say. YOU are the one who runs your life. So live well. \n I love you, Julie. \n Know that if nothing else.", ""),
        StaticBook("To my dearest Moon...", "Indelwehn", "I know that you feel that you must do this, and I am not one to try and stop you . Just remember me. Remember me as you search for that axe. Remeber me as you step through that portal and into a workd of sadness. For I will think of you. Of your smile, and of your laugh, and how you never ever gave up on me. I will never give up on you. I will find you, when it is over. And we will see eeach othe r again. I love you Bircalin. I love you with all my heart and soul. ~Your one and only, Inde", ""),
        StaticBook("To My Lady", "Reilock", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To My Love, Bito", "Nalayna", "Dear Bito, My apologies for leaving this note...  I'm traveling back to Alras to see if I can get Gordok's blessing to return here and truly learn more about Aeriel. Not just to visit ya and ask the odd question.  With his blessing I can keep my position in Alras. Without his blessing I'll become a traitor as well. I think we both know that I won't be able to handle that as easily as you can. I'm hoping that you do not find this until after your trials which were to be today. I pray you succeed since you are so happy here. I shall return as soon as I can love. ---Anora Firmheart---", ""),
        StaticBook("To my Nephew", "VonEbs", "Hello! If you are reading this, then you know that I have died. But what I am going to tell you is how I died. I was pricked by a dagger in Al'Khazzar. When I woke up the next morning, all my hair had gone shock white, I went to see Ambros, and he said I had been cursed, and I was too far gone to save. The curse was an undead curse. You can't tell Felore because she will be crazed by revenge. I wanted to tell you, so you can have some closure. I hope your time in aegis will prove as full as mine was.", ""),
        StaticBook("To my only love", "Minnan1", "Indelwehn, I am sorry for leaving you alone, this wasn't meant to happen... \n \n Tell Arya I love her... If only I could come back to life... \n -Aedan \n \n Light bringer sends you this, says that it could help you bring someone back from death \n \n*You pick up the staff*", ""),
        StaticBook("To My Son....", "sprintindwarf", "We have won the battle, the keep was referbished, all is well i am with the sage and a few others. I feel strange, like i wont be returning. I know you will be passing through here in a day, hopefully you found this. If you did, i am dead. Im writeing this now, i dont trust the Councillor_Carrier women, if that is here real name. However, do not grieve, be strong. I would like a few things from you. you must enhieret my farm and home. Also, let others know i died nobally. last I would like you to continue my work as a ongoing fighter against undead. I dont care who you are with, I just want you to fight. you could follow in my steps if you wish. Just find Blaedr, an acolyte AND possibly still leader of the FOA, or talk to stronghold, head guard of Kal'Urgaun. they are both valiant, and I believe they would gladly except you and give you guidance. Please do this in memory. -Ezekiel Obadiah, Knight, Farmer thank you.....", ""),
        StaticBook("To my wife, Rhisereld", "Alectriciti", "*the book is empty, just a few scribbles*", ""),
        StaticBook("To Nel'thok", "TehLulu", "This is disturbing news indeed. The Heart itself claimed to have corrupted Iblees? How is this possible? I will believe your recount but I wish to see more of this myself. For now keep the others Shamans away from the Heart. If you wish I will notify the Druids of this. It is possible that the reason the Heart has demanded so many sacrifices in it's name is because it derives some power from them. For now, avoid making any sacrifices to it. I will keep this secret as I know you will. Otherwise I know not what to do. Keep an eye on the ancestors and the other Orcs.", ""),
        StaticBook("to people part 2", "mattpie", "i have just made a grat deal with the man in the town he has all so asked me if i wont to reant a house but i have to stop writeing now becouse the a piemen out of my door", ""),
        StaticBook("to people Part 3", "mattpie", "i have mined out same stone and made some tools now have to kill !!!!!!! ARRRRRRRR", ""),
        StaticBook("to people the pont less battle", "mattpie", "we had just arived to the old undead fort were there was sapost to be undead suportis but there was only and mean orc how was a miner i think i should keep an eye on that place mattpie out", ""),
        StaticBook("To Plat A Seed", "shiftnative", "To plant a seed, is to see. What it takes for life to be. To plant a seed you see Is to grow a tree a tree. I know not much, of the brotherhood. You speak of my endangerment, is this so? I will spend more time on this matter, and my word will reach your ears.", ""),
        StaticBook("to porsen", "mattpie", "i have been on the road for meany days now after they made me leve my new home in the wilds i am now i now am looking for work so i can get back home on the ship whith is were i lost all me money", ""),
        StaticBook("To Princess Indelwehn - From Sparrow", "Monkey34512", "Well i spent most of my money on this paper to write you this letter so here it goes.  I have decided since me and you have grown apart. I will leave you alone inless i need something or you need something . I think this is good. You told me i threw your husband off of a roof and although I NEVER remember doing this i will guess that i did and will leave you alone. You must hate looking at me anyway. I will live on my own. Yall do not need to say that yall are taking me in. I will stay at tur'elevon and continue life. I am sorry for pain i have caused. Hope you can forgive me one day. I am probably joining The Keepers and serve Wrath and his cause. [[ waiting for an accepted villain app]] Once again i am sorry and i think i have left out things in the letter but am not sure. I guess this is Farewell and i will leave you alone like i said inless i need something. Or you call for help or need me. Thanks for everything, and the love you have given me. Good-Bye, Sparrow.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Rannulf", "mason9108", "les go to da sanhar inn", ""),
        StaticBook("To Rhise", "Roxses20", "Dear Rhise i would like you to know I have feelings for you i have these feelings because 1.You are nice at times and mean when you need to be 2.I really like the way you act 3.you are very kind when you know people . These are things that come to the top of my mind.There are many otheres .If you wish to know them just ask .I know i could not do the things that your boy friend has done but give me a chance .please atlest consider it-Lynx", ""),
        StaticBook("To Rhisereld", "sgtteddybear59", "Remember... You made me do it... You changed me into this monster... It's all your fault!", ""),
        StaticBook("To Shoi the Ascended", "Alectriciti", "I wish to thank you again for your services to Aegis, and to my family. I've told you before, but it really means a lot. I will let my wife, Rhisereld, know of you and the curse you've removed. In return, here are some staves I've collected over my days from Undead. I hope they'll be useful. Thank you again \n ~Alethion Celebtaurë \n \n P.S. I hope you like sushi! If you don't, there are some apples.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Shrub", "emberhard", "I have your Iron in a safe. (if you give me your screen name I can protect your chests for you", ""),
        StaticBook("To Sinstrite", "Jaknifed", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To Sparrow, From Dom", "Domainoft", "I am not angry with you dear boy. For as you said it, you do not understand what has happened So I will tell you. Many nights ago when you followed me to my Isle, I showed you around. After we had talked for a long while and night turned to day, and day back to night. I had finished telling my story of the Blessed Sword, and you of your life. As I was reading through your story of how you came to recieve these blackouts and how your soul is taken from your body by Iblees without your concent. at that moment, you blacked out. I had a very long talk with your body, who wished to be called Sparrow as well. Even though he made it very clear that he was not you, He told me that Iblees himself directed him to come here and kill me. For a very many of reasons. One because of my escape from Wrath, two the Blessed Sword, three my becoming a living Oracle, which really irritated Iblees as the last one was his and named Prophet. these are troubling times, and the sages decided that the burden was to great to give me all the powers of the Oracle at once, They wished instead for me to learn them for myself. As a moral. \n I have killed many assassins before, but they have either been hired hands, or members of the Undead themselves. in either case I felt little remorse. You good boy are quite differant. I am torn between two words constantly, A battle I am afraid I lost the other day. But a battle I had to find out the answer to, The realm of Iblees is beyond my reach. Just as it was for the Prophet, yes even though the lived with Iblees he could not tell His destony to him. The other day, I binded your body to me. That it might do my biding here instead of Iblees Not something I knew would work, or expected to last very long. The fact that it did at all Give my hope strength that you might rise up to defeat your father. After some time the body and I were visted by a ghost from Iblees. I could not see the Spirit, but your body could and it spoke for it as well. Saying that If your body did not Kill me, your soul would be lost forever. I know quite a bit about Iblees, enough to tell you that he will not kill you unless he has lost all faith in you. I called his bluff and the spirit disapeared. I then set the body on a new \"focus\" I told it to go the wise druid Respiren, tell him of your taint and ask him for the Seed of Life. Shortly after this your spirit returned to its body, it was not me that did such but you. The power over your body is only in Ibless's hands as long as you let it be. I do not know what power your diamond necklace holds, only a small bit of information on how it was even created. I still think the best coarse for you and I is to seek Respiren and ask him for his guidance. Do not however go to another druid with details. I believe that Lord Native himself has been corrupted by Iblees, we must be very careful I recently learned that he had given a Golden Staff to a man known to deal with the Undead, in truth this man housed them in safety as they ploted. The giving of the staff Was in secret told only to a friend of his, who told it to me when I told him about his friends dealings, and showed him my proof. .\n I do not know how receptive Respiren will be toward helping us, I wish Hwaldar was still around. I will not remove my banishment from this Isle. For my safety and for yours I can not. I now know that they will not so easily discard your soul as they do many others. that Knowledge shall be a mighty weapon for us when the time comes. for now we must stay appart least they try and have your body do me harm. After reading this message you are to leave the Island and head East some distance. when the time comes and I beieve we can remove the taint I will come and find you. If you so choose to search for the answer yourself, Know that you put many lives at risk of your bodies evil. And If I see you on the Island I will take it as a sign that your body had again taken over, and smite you without delay, regreat, or remorse. \n \n Signed -Lady Dom, Oracle of Aegis", ""),
        StaticBook("To Sporadic", "Jerry_Man", "Burn this book when you've read it. We need to OOC discuss what happenned. I have a couple ideas but the dig will be very different for either one. \n \n1 The Dark Elves had a hunting party come after the camp and destroy it. \n2 The brigands went after a fountain of youth and abandoned the camp.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Tend'el", "Yervor", "Tend'el - I believe I am the first to receive your note. Much has happened the last time you were here. Most importantly, however, is that Ademas has passed onto the next life. He had long been suffering from a strange sickness given to him by the fallen one,  Iblees. He died peacefully in Bawapy's arms. We are all finding it difficult to get past the grief and shock. Felune, his sister, and I buried him near Bell here at Wilder Farm. I believe we will now try to seek out his son Gabriel, an aspiring blacksmith. I can only hope that the news of his father will not break the poor boy's spirit. \n We all hope to see you soon. \n  \n           Laetri", ""),
        StaticBook("To That Which We All Owe", "aaaa1188", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To the east", "shiftnative", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To the High Prince -Lafthi", "Rathriel", "Sir,\n If Bell is giving you this book it means I wasn't able to tell you in person. This plo t she is going to tell you about was uncovered by ourselves and others last night. If it succeeds then it could mean the downfall of the Humans Orcs and even ourselves. To make it worse the dark brotherhood is involved, but Bell will tell you that. I hope to be on soon. \n Your servant, \n Lafthi \n P.S. I am sorry this is all so sudden but you can put your full trust in Bell.", ""),
        StaticBook("To the leader o' the Orcs", "Ever", "Greetins. As ya know, yer men feel I'm too close to yer lands. I'd like to ask ya personally if there's anythin' I can do to keep this land. I'd like to open an inn, fer homes fer me mates 'n those needin' homes. I'm not a fighter, I don't want to do anneh fightin'. I'm not lookin' fer trouble. I respect you, yer mates, n' yer land. I'll try to keep my tennents doin' the same, should ya allow me to stay. If ya don't want me to stay, I'll go peacefully. (You'll just need to give me some time to move all my stuff out and change the mountain back to normal.) Thank ya fer readin' this: -Signed, Ever, the Drunken Dwarf. That mount, ober ther.", ""),
        StaticBook("To the Overlord", "GoldenGFX", "Overlord, I thank ye for reading this. I ask a favor of ye. I was removed from slavery, for undefined reasons. (( Something about Neko saying the army was too big )) I ask you though, if I could possibly have another chance at slavery, an exception. \n You might think, why would I let this scum back in? Well. I have been meditating in the wilds. I have been trying to contact Iblees, and he stained my robes and eyes with blood. (( I got my adv. evil app accepted )) I felt his power, and I have completley changed. I have been robbing those fools on the streets, killing them if they do not submit. I love Iblees, and I want to be a true follower, a slave of his will. Again, I thank ye.. for taking your time. I ask you get back to me. Send a raven, The bird will know where to go. (( /tell GoldenGFX )) P.S. I also have a few offerings to bring.", ""),
        StaticBook("To the Prophet.", "Ned_Lud", "It's me, Uzggoth Lud'Gorkil. Me is standing right in front of latz but latz cannot seem to se e or hear me.", ""),
        StaticBook("To the Shad'Rin", "_Shoi_", "You have been selected to attend the planting of the Tree of Life Sapling in the tower dedicated to the Sages whom joined Aeriel, may their memories be treasured in her children and the taint fall wea k in her children. [[10/24/2011 6-7 PM EST @ Enlighted FOA encampment]]", ""),
        StaticBook("To the sons of Krug", "Archmage_Cataris", "I need help, the power of Iblees keeps me forever chained here in my prison. \n The Lone Swordsmen... little is known, my people, they say he will come from the east \n I only preach of what Ka-hooli speaks \n In my time in this prison, i have had many visions from the great Ka-hooli \n The Iron Crown is adorned by that of which was once the Hero of Aegis, turne by the loss of his wife and daughter, Iblees now rules his soul \n Only the Lone Swordsman can free my, i will then finally rest with my wife in the eternal slumber. \n I know naught of whom he is, i only know what i see and hear, only that which Ka-hooli allows me to \n He is living, he has already been born upon Aegis. The Ancient God of Justince and Vengeance. Ka-hooli Your people think to call him an Aengul The Pearl of the Ender! These things hold great power, perhaps were you to get one, i could leave these ruins When Ka-hooli grants it, perhaps with the Pearl of the Ender you can call upon me \n My people claim this to be the symbol of Ka-hooli we use it for prayer, so he may avenge and bring justice for all", ""),
        StaticBook("To the Star", "SpamShok", "You are the star That beautiful light That shines upon my days And guides me through the night You are to me as the sun is to plants I thrive under your beautiful gaze If only you were mine... A goddess so divine If only you were mine Vanya, my beloved... Issbaner Til'Essof", ""),
        StaticBook("To the Undead City", "Jtheo2016", "Day 1: Guard_Rec._Luke and I set off on our journey to rescue our friends. They had attempted a journey to the Undead city and we were sure they would need . We brought with us food to last at least two or three days. \n Day 2: Luke and I have just reached a large body of water. We constructed two boats and began our trip across the water. \n Day 3: Once I reached the shore, I looked back in an attempt to see how far Luke was behind me. Luke was no where to be seen, and I assume his boat broke. Unfortunately, I had no time to search for him, and had to continue alone. \n Day 4: I found the Undead city, where I met up with Botar. We fought the undead valiantly, and I was begining to lose because of the lack of ale. There were five caualties., three by undead, two by lava.. \n Day 5: after fighting the entire day, we made camp and we relaxed. \nDay 6 The Undead bastards surounded the camp, and we were all forced to flee in diffrent directions. \n Day 7: I begin my journey back. I am in much danger, for all of my food is gone. \n Day 8: Too exhausted to write much. I had to break into a castle in order to get food. They only had a single apple. \n Day 9: I had to fend off three zombies and two skeletons. I sustained some injuries, and I must get shelter. \n Day 10: I found a small settlement, and the tenant gave me food. I am only a days journey from Alkhazar. \n Day 11: I am back at Alkhazar, but I do not see Botar or any of the group. I fear the worst. I end my journey and take on another one, finding an ale! \n Day 17: Botar is back! I can't beleive he is alive! I guess my journey wasn't a complete failure, except, where is Luke?  Coordiantes of the City: -4052, 83, 75", ""),
        StaticBook("To the Whispering Order", "Alectriciti", "My dear friends. Please meet with me soon. Archmage Cataris has been teaching me wonderful kinds of magic I cannot wait to share with you. I- Shit! Undead are here! And the two clowns! Please hurry! Cataris and I can't hold them off for long!", ""),
        StaticBook("To Thral'Mar", "_Shoi_", "You have been selected to attend the planting of the Tree of Life Sapling in the tower dedicated to the Sages whom joined Aeriel, may their memories be treasured in her children and the taint fall wea k in her children. [[10/24/2011 6-7 PM EST @ Enlighted FOA encampment]]", ""),
        StaticBook("To Timayame", "_Shoi_", "Dear Tim, I had my judgement and Aeriel enlightened my mind with ease, that the past is something to muke us w hom we are... I believe I am able to take Arathyn, and begin a new chapter in my life with you. I ho pe to see you soon. With Love, Shoi", ""),
        StaticBook("To Titus...", "people884", "This is your son. Arion Orion A.K.A Arion Obidaih he is a elf dwarf halfling... If you do not rememb oh", ""),
        StaticBook("To Uncle Raghnok and Grandy", "LuckyToShoot", "Well....I have been away for quite a long time,I went back to my hometown,I wasn't welcomed. The moment I arrived at home,I was greeted by an arrow shot right in front of me. Then I was surrounded by town guard,had no choice but I had to run away,and once again...wandering i ...in the wilds.I don't know if I should come back,but I did came back here,while both of you wasn't here.I'll be leaving soon...I have been asking myself lately.... am I really that scary?Am I truly a monster?Am I deserves no friendship from others? I don't know...Anyway,I will be leaving again,we shall meet again I guess...maybe...", ""),
        StaticBook("To Vanya", "SpamShok", "I you read this, I fell. I would like to express all the love I have to you But I have no time, for I must search for the ascended I have always loved you, remember that. Issbaner There, may I entrust this to you, lord? To be given to the Fey druid Vanya If I fall ((oops", ""),
        StaticBook("To Warlord Mogroka", "TehLulu", "Warlord, \n To put it bluntly, I apologize for the trouble I've caused. I'd like to explain, but I can't say too much. I could not let you kill the cloaked man from the other evening because I am regretfully, indebted t o him. The story, from the beginning, is that I arranged through him to meet the leader of the Black Hand. I wanted further information on them and to request they stop slaving practices (Which they claim to not have). Several members of the Black Hand first followed me back to Sanhar when I went there to investigate lightning strikes in the City. There they debated between themselves and other members that they met in the city on whether or not to kill me. The robed man from the other night stopped them by laying claim on my life; He said he would kill me if any of them did, which did save my life. Through certain means I have acquired the Black Hand's promise not to kill me. But I am still indebt ed to the robed man. I cannot explain the position I hold nor the laws I obey which cause me to honor this...exchange. But the robed man has requested, in exchange for saving me, that I save his life at a later, unspeci fied date. This is better than the alternative of paying back my debt through blood or...serving him as a slave . Please do not misunderstand my actions as helping the Black Hand. I do not side with them. But I can not side with anyone else, either. I wish I could explain, but I cannot. I will be avoiding Krugmar as to avoid bringing trouble back with me, and so you do not appear weak to the other orcs, worrying about some pathetic human girl all the time. \n \n Sincerely, \n Lothiriel", ""),
        StaticBook("To whom it may concern...", "Indelwehn", "I, Princess Indelwehn of Malinor,give permission for my friend Ar'Kelos to wear his robes while in Laurelin. If any trouble happens, please come to me. Many thanks. ~Indelwehn", ""),
        StaticBook("To Will Forestin", "Ever", "There is much to say in such a short amount of time... I have to keep this brief. Some \"men\" showed up at my inn. Bad things happened. That's all I can reveal. I may not be around too much... It all depends on some things I cannot reveal. I've included in this note some minas. Hopefully it should be enough to buy a round for  everyone. Remember, live happily 'n drink much ale. Ya never know when it's all gonna end... Signed, Ever.", ""),
        StaticBook("To Wise and Uncle Al", "isagirl909", "I am running away. Do not try to find me. I am going to find the mean undead bad guys and make they aplogize. For mommy and daddy and Uncle Al and Auntie Wise and Vael and the Isles and the Order and even Henry I love you very much and will see you soon after they aplogize. \n \n Love, Julie", ""),
        StaticBook("To Wise and Uncwle Awl", "isagirl909", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To you Gents, From Emberhard", "emberhard", "Thanks for keeping us in mind when you expanded your fort, looks briliant by the way! There may be a bit of a malfunction with the door however as I can't use it! \n Oh well, you may be seeing less of me out here, as with the fort done I have other duties that I must also tend to, but I will stop by every now and again! \n You can always send me a raven (/tell emberhard) \n White Raven, Mayor of Corvus Animus, Comander of Fort Ultimum Stabit, and your friend: \n Emberhard", ""),
        StaticBook("To Zyn", "Sinstrite", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To-do List", "Ranovak", "", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Bell", "Carnivore91", "help", ""),
        StaticBook("to: Leoso", "CentralGuard", "YOURE NOT MY SERVANT, STOP FOLOWING ME NO-ONE IN ALRAS HAS SERVANTS", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Lothi", "Carnivore91", "Lothi, Nel'thok here. I did not listen completely, but my head is cleared. I went back... I had to go back... I went just as night fell and I was able to look at most of the town. And got many, many names. There is Rhys which I thing is short for something. Seen Sam's house. Viadar had a home too, with a sign that said Warden of the North. Mcyn which is short again. Robert with the title Sariant. Darith was a name on a sign. Glylith on a home sign. Mirtok, with a bigger than average house. Hoochmiester Gaius Marius, which I assume is leader. Oren Marshalls Sam and Glylith, Sam for Archery, Gly for Infantry. Manoth Hale, head farmer. Gaarag, head spy master. Tesawa, head arms master. Teutonic Order was at the bottem of this board. Then a list of Military: Cataris, Sam, Kyle, Manoth, Conan, Schetten, Binlor, Praxedis, Darith, Arbelas. A few more things. Brutus was another name on a House. And the Sariant Knights Tavern was there, not to mention a Dawn's Bakery... Thats all I found, Hate that I went against you but it needed done. I plan to speak to Dawn about her shop, we are good friend and I visit her often. But besides that I will not speak to anyone else but you, we need solid proof this is an Oren town, which if is the true case, I worry about it being so close to Krugmar. Eventually more works will find it, and it will stir trouble. I will chat with you later, be safe friend.", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Lothi...", "Carnivore91", "The druid maybe, But i hate to corrupt someone else. I don't know what to do. An Army would do no good. Perhaps... The wizard? Do not know how high up to take it. Leaders of nations? Just not sure how to handle it. I fear for my life and everyone else too. We need more help...", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Mayor_Eledyr", "friar7", "sir, it is entirely up to you how we handle our registrations, as for the law book you want, i will set work on it right away PS: i might have it done by the time you read this. if so, check the rest of your mail, it should be inside the mail as well yours sincearly ~Mork Yohom ~Guard captain Head of Law ~Ahad, 22nd of The Second Seed, 1330", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Sparrow From: Wrath", "Meman46", "All rectuitment is left up to me and me alone. If anybody else is attempting to recruit report them to me immedietley. \nAs far as that elf goes, he is in squad one under Guraims command.", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Syrio From: Arkenos (kinda ooc)", "CentralGuard", "as you may or may not know lumas died(perma died) and after his death, i became the owner of his house, and was wondering if 1) i could become an owner of the regon (amh16) becuse im renting the house out, and it would be easyer for me to give them perms and 2) if you could remove his locked chest so that they are able to use it for there stuff  please right back if you are able to do this, or if you are not, i shal awate youre anser (i have a mailbox for the ancer to be sent)", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Wrath From: Sparrow", "Monkey34512", "Wrath, I have another question i have just thought of. Would you like me toharvest the wheat since people take to much. When i harvest i can just not take half and only take enough wheat for like 15 bread or i could take 1 stack (64wheat) . This is up to you and you will have to tell people. This was meerly an idea. \n Thanks for reading \n -Sparrow-", ""),
        StaticBook("To: Wrath From:Sparrow", "Monkey34512", "I write you this to ask you an important question and i wanted to write a book . Ok. Here is the Question : Why are all the minions and followers of Iblees in your clutch all the time? They chat ALL the time and basically spam chat. I get that they are helping Allen and all but that take up space that they dont need to take up. They have a new minion/follower everyday so i have to worry about not killing them. Also, I am putting in a request for you to extend the wheat farm. Add another section to the other side of it is what im asking. This would be highly appreciated . Thanks for reading this. -Sparrow- .  \n There is another person that showed up today [10-2-11] and i do not trust him . He is an elf, but he has no name . I know somepeople dont have names but he wont even think of one, or something for us to call 'em. We call 'em Elf and he is here often. He comes and goes as he pleases. I do not like this since many people could just say im with yall.... I will continue later. We are under attack! Ok war is still going on but Wrothgar is here and i will quickly finish this book. But anyway, They could say they were with us and get in and spy. I think undead followers should be locked up or not allowed in the clutch. I know undead are what we follow but to many people come and go as they please and this is dangerous for us . \nThanks again \n-Sparrow-", ""),
        StaticBook("To:Dom From: Sparrow", "Monkey34512", "If you are getting this then you know i was here.  sorry i came here after i was told not to. Im sure you know that i am here for a reason. That reason it to write this book. I would like you to let me be here. I would like you to let me learn my way of being summoned here. If you wish to deny me, I understand. I dont know why you killed me, but it must have been important . I hope you forgive me for whatever i did. And im sorry i cant remember.  You make me feel safe. I do wish very strongly you will not hate me. I am hated by most and my knowing that you are holy, I ask you forgive me. I know you will speak to me about me being here when i was told not to but i had to. \nPlease dont be angry with me forever \nI can only hope \n-Sparrow-", ""),
        StaticBook("To:S.A_Sgt._jackslayer From:S.A_High_Admiral_Storm", "Ghost_Storm", "hi What for I just made it for fun what for I just made it for fun Need to make a new one ok", ""),
        StaticBook("To:Sparrow From:Wrath", "Meman46", "I'll inform Guraims men and will probably build a board stating all the members in the guild on it. \n As far as the fort goes, we'll see if their hostile or not.", ""),
        StaticBook("To:Syrio From:Arkneos", "CentralGuard", "Hail king, in order of recent events i am sending this letter to see if there is a way to prevent the owner of the barly brew emporium from coming near me ((like a restraining order)). i am asking for this for two resons the first, wich i am most afraid of is on his widows i see bloody rags , these rags look like i made them, and i only make my own robes. If my suspition is correct that means he must of killed me . so if there is a way to keep him away from me, i would gladly apreceate it becuse i am starting to fear going into town, knowing he might be there", ""),
        StaticBook("Todd's Journal", "Archmage_Cataris", "Day 1\n I have just fled the city and i found a strange cave... There were beds and chests also there was a sign of whom the owners were \"Maith & Brum\"? Or something like that Anyway ill be staying here for the night i guess \nDay 5\n Ive been living in this cave for awhile now... I can hear creatures out there at night... They hiss and making gurgling noises... I am too scared to leave.... \nDay 17\n I have a good farm going at the moment from some seeds i found and i also found some meat I think i should be good for a couple of weeks... \n Day 36\n  I am hearing noises at night... They whisper my name... I am scared. I want to go back to the city, But they will hang me for a murderer... But i didnt mean to kill him \n Day 39\n I climbed a mountain to see the landscape... I saw a floating island! But the island was made of some demonic looking stone... It had castles upon it I could see men on the ramparts... Evil looking men... One turned in my direction and it seemed to pull me towards him... But i tripped and i snapped out of it and ran for it \n Day 42\n I know its \"them\" that are calling me... I must not go to them, Maybe i should? \n Day 45\n I want to see it again, I thirst to see it again... I must see it again \n Day 49\n My master calls... He tells me things... Dark things... Things to come... and things that will be mine, If i join them. \n Day 50\n They are coming for me! Help! I hear the branches snap outside! Help! Help! He- *Unrecognizable scribble*", ""),
        StaticBook("Token", "pengerz", "Roses are red, Violes are Blue. I suck a poetry, But I tried for you.", ""),
        StaticBook("Token of Appreciation from the Oren Guard", "SapphireShard", "This Book has been awarded to a person(s) who has shown courage and/or compassion to a member of the Oren Kingdom. May this person continue their honourable work. Here you go.", ""),
        StaticBook("Toll Laws of Kal'Urguan", "G79", "#1: Enemy factions may not pass Kal'Urguan when we are at war with em'. #2 Toll max is 500 minas #3 Do not toll allies", ""),
        StaticBook("Tolta 31st of The Second Seed", "busynarcissist", "Today I was setting up my research center after entering the new portal I had just established a suitable holding tank for an aqueous specimen, and was working on  a pen for \"my pigs\" (i.e some pigs nearby) when three or four men started killing my pigs I asked them what they were doing, and they proceeded to threaten me. they also said they were claiming my research center for their own lands Um, excuse me? um, excuse me? line I said, \"What are you doing?\" I was really quite angry they had killed my pigs .  They then began having a discussion about how they would eat me if they could, including what my eyes would taste like (I'd imagine they'd taste like any one elses??) Eventually they left, for some reason, so thinking myself safe I went back to work", ""),
        StaticBook("Tom's Journal", "andyboy124", "My Past: Now my past is a sad tale to tell . I grew up a very happy young boy. My father was in the Oren guard as a sergeant. Boy, how i admired him. As i got older we would practice dueling together. I got pretty darn good at too.  Then one night my father had to go on patrol. I waited for him so we could practice dueling again,but he never returned. We assumed he had been killed along with the rest of his men. I felt horrible. My mother went into a deep depression. She wouldnt cook food or keep the house clean. So i had to do these things myself. I was only 14 at the time so it wasnt easy. I had to get many jobs to get food. When i turned 17 my mother passed away. I couldnt stay in the house so i left. I took some food and my father's spare armor.I lived on the streets for a long time. I still had my many jobs to support myself. I helped the blacksmith and carpenter make things. I also helped tend to the town farm once and a while. When i turned 20 i applied for the guards. Sadly the captain just laughed at me. He thought i was just a young fool who knew nothing. I tried showing him my skills but he laughed even more. Both angry and sad i left the barracks. For the next few years i kept my jobs.By age 25 i had saved up 3000 minas. I knew i couldnt live like this forever so after a few weeks i set out in the world of Aegis. As i approached Oren i saw a few beggars.I kindly give the 3 of them all my money. They needed it more than i did so i felt really good about doing it. When i arrived in the city i saw the many sites i was told about. Men trying to sell things, guards patrolling the walls, and citizens roaming about. So i first went to join the guards, i spoke to the prince, filled out some papers,and i was in. Shortly after there was an attack on the city. It was one hell of a fight. Undead everywhere you turned.I met a man named Adam. He and i fought together. Sadly as we were fighting he was slain. I turned to help him but it was too late. He lay dead on the ground with an arrow in his back. I quickly killed the skeletan thatgot him. After the battle was over i was promoted to a real guard. In the days past i met many people. Many of them were gaurds. Captain grimbeard was my captain. He was a very good leader. After many weeks of gaurding the gate and patrolling i met Cataris. He and i would often talk about our lives while on gate duty. We also went on patrol together. As time went on we rose through the ranks. Cataris though, in my absents got the promotion. He became the lieutenant. I congratulated him on his good work. We grabbed a few ales after. Shortly after the promotion though Cataris never showed up. I looked for him all over the city. I feared he had been killed. So after a few months i had to leave the gaurd. No pay and the unorganization wasnt good. I wondered Aegis for a while just thinking about things. That was my past. Main Events: I was walking about snowy fields when suddenly i heard the thunder, It was loud and right over head. I walked into town to see a group of people gathering. When they saw me they questioned me about who i was and what i was doing. I said to them \"Look i was just passing through when i heard the thunder and saw the group.\" They let me be and i offered to help them out. I was told of the attack coming. So i suited up and got ready. We went out to the gates and saw a few undead there. They backed away so nothing happened. A few hours later i went toward the other direction. As i came out i saw a few people fighting. I rushed over and saw the undead moving in. I joined the fighting and helped push them back. After word myself and a few others scouted. We got real close to them, too close for that matter. They spotted us and unleashed thier horde. Zombies and lightning, too much to handle at that time so we turned back. After a few more hours they were back. The archamge helped us though. We charged forward and started to fight.As i was fighting i saw Bell get killed get  killed. I was going to go over there to get revenge, but at that time i was hot by lightning. I stumbled back and couldnt breathe. I fell in the snow as the battle raged on. When i awoke i saw the monks of the Cloud temple tending to me. I was lucky they had found me. If they didnt i would have died. After that i thanked them and carried on with my life. Main Event 2: One day as i was strolling down the King's road i saw a man. He asked me to come closer. He said he knew me, but i had no idea who he was. I found out real quick what he was doing. He was trying to rob me. I told him i had to be going, but he withdrew his sword. He said \"50 minas or die!\" I didnt want to so i acted quick. I ran into the King's mine and tried to lose him. Oh but he was fast. He was right behind me the whole time. I ran back up to the top. What i found was another bandit robbing another man in the same spot. Then 4 more bandits showed up. By then i knew i was trapped. Just then 3 men approached. I thought they were bandits, but no they were some memebers of a guild. They told the bandits to back off or else.The bandits of course didnt listen. They attacked the man. One of them was killed, so i picked up his sword and helped fight. It was a close call,bbut we had won.I thanked the last man left and continued my travels. As a went on i felt a sharp pain in my side. I looked down to see a gash bleeding on my thigh. I went into Kramoere and found some wool, which i made into cloth.I tied it around my wound. It stopped the bleeding, but i knew it wouldnt last, so i went to see the monks. They stiched my thigh back together. It hurt a bit, but it sure fixed the wound. As i left the temple  and went back into town, i heard word o f Cataris. I stopped and asked the high priest if he knew him. He said that Cataris was a mage. So Cataris was alive and in a guild. The next day i set out to find him.", ""),
        StaticBook("Tom's Torture Guide", "Charlie4vb", "*The book is old and the pages have faded*", ""),
        StaticBook("Tome of Ages", "501warhead", "Ak'ligid feltis umden kitk'yl \nTeh'neh Asil Tremen Ashengaurd Denuso \nKIL'EH YETGH FESTILUS OG'ON'US \nTkehn Quen Genitus Op'kelful \nBeware you those who cannot read, for this is your bane.", ""),
        StaticBook("Tomei", "Todd877", "Hi, I'm Tomei. My master seems to have misplaced me. Please post on the nearest public board (forum) that you have found me. From here on is Arcane Knowledge that no one but a master magic user should read. Again, don't read any farther. You still reading? Well then here are the spells. \n Vorpal Arrow - Summon a etheral arrow to smite your enemies with. ((Get a bow and some arrows the rest is obvious)) \n \n Fire Wall - Create a barrier of fire between you and your foes. Be warned, this will not stop arrows or other magic.", ""),
        StaticBook("Too Corrupt for you to see", "sgtteddybear59", "You were the one that kept me alive \n The one I wanted to hold forever \n I didin't know you would also be my weakness \n I have broken my own heart, so you may be set free \n Not even time will help ease this depression \n I am too corrupt for you to see, how much you ment to me   \n Even when you are so close, I can seem to hold you \n Something seems to burn inside this broken heart \n It's you that makes me love forever, it's you that makes me weak \n I try to fight this obsession, I try to break free", ""),
