        StaticBook("Tre'bok~THE ORC. THE LEGEND!", "Unicornwrangler", "Tre'bok. Warrior. Hunter. Builder. Writer. This is the biography of one of the greatest Orcs that have ever lived. So sit back, and enjoy! \n THE BEGGINING..... \n My childhood is sketchy, foggy, mostly due to the fact that during a raid on my city by a few rouge Dwarfs, I was bonked on my head trying to save my mother and father. But I do remeber the name of my fine city. it was called", ""),
