        StaticBook("Treco's Diary", "Treco", "Dear Diary. Today my day was really stressful. On mondays I have to go to school in the morning and in the afternoon. \nNow I'm here to tell you that I didn't talk to her today. Shit!!! \nToday I'll have to work in my mother's store, but I want to stay at home So if I invent a sickness, I would stay here! Good idea \nDear Diary", ""),
        StaticBook("Treebuilding", "ReaperT", "Treebuilding. An essential art for an elf to know if he is to build his own structures The first step is to find a good location. depending on your ideas, you may want to build your house by a mountain as a base structure, or you may want to find an empty field to build a house from scratch. However way you want to do it, you need to make a plan. \nWhen you make a plan, you need to take into account the surrounding area, the amount of resources on hand, and even the size of the structure.", ""),
