        StaticBook("Turning Dark", "123trevmo321", "I used to be a good man, or at least i thought i was. Just recently the Undead came and turned Aegis upside down. One day i was in Oren and out of nowhere a score of Undead came flying, shooting their demon- like lightning and magic. I DO NOT HAVE TIME TO WRITE IN THIS BOOK the dead point of this book is my story of me becomeing a follower of the Undead Lords!", ""),
