        StaticBook("Under The Mountain", "darthsnackums", "Under the Mountain of the Mystic Glen In sleeps the dark tome of the wild Dwarves. For he that finds the tome holds the key to riches beyond imagining. Neither Iron, Diamond, or Gold are to be found. Nor the blue Lapis Lazuli. The treasure found is far greater, and far darker.", ""),
