        StaticBook("Urgent message To Wrath", "Procelis", "Wrath! I hope the fish found ye well and you remember what  meant. This is about the whe robes in Oren, they are planning a large scale whipe of evil, starting wh W.C., and they're pulling out all the stops. You know what the fish means Wrath, remember , you must, if any of us are to survive. Farewell old friend, for I am in dangerous waters myself. Your old companion, Poclies.", ""),
        StaticBook("urgent report", "_edplayers", "report from the guild of the valve, king charles personal guild, to all leaders  in order of king charles himself, we guild of the valve have been entrusted with the building of kal'manor. kal'manor is to be a shelter for all races in case of a disaster . King charles himself will try to arrange a meeting when he has time . if thy has time too spare i will show thy were em safe heaven be , if not go to kal'urguan's guard post and take the bridge to the right befoe entering the gate . after a while thy will pass the statue of iblees on thy right side, and even further thy will pass trough a floating city, exit the city and look right fur thy will see kal'manor's tower . praise to the gods that thy will find the entrance to the vault", ""),
