        StaticBook("useful elven phrases (part 1 Greetings)", "mega_man10", "-------GREETINGS------- \n Good day - kyr pae\n How are you? - cyrin eisi o \n I'm fine thank you - ais tholi sal o \n What is your name - shar air os basti \n My name is ____ - tai basti air \n Nice to meet you - boli sai taer o \n Please - vaeri \n Thank you - sal o \n Your welcome - os shaelysti \n Yes - or \n No - bai \n Excuse me - aezeri ti \n I'm sorry - ais mysai \n Goodbye - kydia \n Help - caer \n Good morning - kyr tysol \n Good evening - kyr aelaelol \n Good night - lair bol \n I dont understand - ai pyl ialaesal \n With pleasure - shor vaeresi \n", ""),
        StaticBook("useful elven phrases for all occasions", "mega_man10", "-------GREETINGS------- \n Good day - kyr pae\n How are you? - cyrin eisi o \n I'm fine thank you - ais tholi sal o \n What is your name - shar air os basti \n My name is ____ - tai basti air \n Nice to meet you - boli sai taer o \n Please - vaeri \n Thank you - sal o \n Your welcome - os shaelysti \n Yes - or \n No - bai \n Excuse me - aezeri ti \n I'm sorry - ais mysai \n Goodbye - kydia \n Help - caer \n Good morning - kyr tysol \n Good evening - kyr aelaelol \n Good night - lair bol \n I dont understand - ai pyl ialaesal \n With pleasure - shor vaeresi \n", ""),
        StaticBook("Useful facts", "orishmark", "Useless facts", ""),
        StaticBook("Useless Facts!", "orishmark", "Did you know that an enderman can hold his/her breath for 43 minutes!", ""),
        StaticBook("Vabis' Journal", "vaba300", "Day One: Spent a lot of today simply exploring the dwarven city of Kal'Urgan I have confirmed what others say - the dwarves around here are practically barbarians I have concluded that, despite the fact that I am a dwarf, I cannot live here I'm taking the few supplies I gathered and moving off to the  Great Kingdom of Oren very soon I've amassed about 650 minas or so from pigmen As an inventory, I have a stack of logs and about 30 loaves of bread in my possession  currently, plus an iron sword and a few wooden tools    As a side note, the housing in Kal'Urgan is abhorrent  Don't go there -VY      Day Two:  I've arrived in the Kingdom of Oren, and I intend to purchase a quaint little apartment that's slightly underground.  I've paid a sum of 300 minas towards the total cost of 1,300 minas, meaning that I only owe 1,000 minas, which I now have in my possession, which I made while exploring the far north today. That was quite unnerving, actually. I passed through about six towns, all of which were completely devoid of life, with the occasional exception of a dog or a pig. The most unnerving part of it all was the last town I visited, extremely far in the north. I found a human corpse, surrounded by a large amount of the poor person's possessions. I cleaned the mess up a bit, but I couldn't get it all. I also got lost in a massive cave shortly before this. I saw so many diamonds... If only I could have gotten them. The place was absolutely infested with zombie pigmen. I came out with about 2,000 minas in total and a few pieces of loot, so I guess getting lost in there wasn't a total loss. \n  V.Y. \n \n \n \n Day Three: Today was extremely interesting. I did more traveling in the north, and I came  across a village that was populated. The people there were friendly, and I bought some things from them. The population of this town consisted mainly of humans and orcs, which were oddly friendly to  me. I did a lot of talking with a woman in the town, and she said that a bandit Elf woman with BROWN hair threatened to tell Krugmar that the little settlement was a threat. After I left, I continued to head north. After a time, I came to a floating Undead city. It was deserted, so I kept going. After traveling for some time, I came across the road that I followed from the tribe I was exiled from. As I continued walking, I felt a bizarre chill creep down my spine. I was forced to turn back. How will I ever know what became of my home... I'm exiled both by law and by my cowardice. I believe that something is physically preventing me from heading further. It felt like a  cold force to me.", ""),
        StaticBook("Vaelinor's Journal", "Conster_monster", "erase-all", ""),
        StaticBook("Val's JOurnel", "ValiantBrasser", "Day 1\" Today Zavandir made me write an entry in my hournle.", ""),
        StaticBook("Valandil's Journal", "ryno2", "Kamees, 5th of The Amber Cold, 1325 \n In Laurelin, observing the destruction done by the Undead attack. I hope I can see Princess Indelwehn today. Stomach hurts-probably that bad fish I ate earlier today. \n Kamees, 12th of Snows Maiden, 1325 \n Going to Oren to look around the shops, maybe find a good deal in the trading town. \n Irba, 25th of Snows Maiden, 1325 \n Got attacked by a pigman last night. thought I was dead-but then I woke up in a  temple. Strange. \n Got a new hunting knife today-lost the other one. \n Got drunk on ale over at Oren, probably made some bad decisions. Ale is best made fresh with good wheat. \n Kamees, 19th of The First Seed, 1326 \n Going over to Laurelin today, maybe see some action. Going over to the gypsy camp for trading-Laurelin was kind of empty. \n  \n Sabet, 35th of The Second Seed, 1326 \n Going over to Al'khazar today for some ale-tasty stuff. Got drunk in Al'khazar with friends, went a little crazy, angered the guards. Fun times. Attended a wedding, drank ale at the reception party. I may have seen a cat-woman naked, I'm not sure. \n Ahad, 22nd of Suns Smile, 1326 \n Heard about an attack earlier this week, though I wasn't there. Also heard rumors of an upcoming undead attack-not so sure about that, either. \n Tolta, 24th of Suns Smile, 1326 \n Found an abandoned farm near my base-still useful and full of plants. Great find. \n Joma, 20th of The Amber Cold, 1327 \n I have adopted a new identity-I am now the Hooded_Archer. Now I may remain hidden. \n Sabet, 7th of The Amber Cold, 1328 \n I resumed my old identity some time ago, after my fear was relieved. The other day I worked in a place called Celestine, heard it was once run by a mad person. The place was huge, part of it underground-the place where i worked at. Heard speak of a battle upcoming. Strange. Maybe this event will alleviate my boredom.", ""),
        StaticBook("Valas Grey", "urpenguin", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Valas's Journal", "urpenguin", "Since i have been promoted to Arch Druid. I feel that i should keep a journal. To make sure that everything in the order will not be lost. \n I guess i should tell how i took the positon as Arch druid. When Dusk and Apollan died. Dusks will named me to take her place. I must say i never did expect it. I allways looked at Dusk and Apollan as strong willed people who would not take death as easy as they did. Regardless they will both be missed greatly. \n As my first order as Arch druid i needed to appoint two others to aid in the order. I called a Moot to discuss who i should appoint. It was not an easy decision to make. I asked Darrian and John to aid me they both took the position without hesitation. \n Apollans will was found today. It named Makia as his replacement as Arch druid. I had to call another moot to figure out how to deal with the problem. Respiren shead some light on the entire subject. He called for a task to settle the argument. It was to Brew five Healing Potions. \n This job is taking its toll on me. What used to give me pleasure now gives me nothing. I have not been able to sleep for days. I do not know how much longer i can last. \n John has informed me of a Vision he has had. it was set in the grove. But everything was Dead Crops and all. There was a woman with torn Cloths and covered in blood. He told me to sleep and see if i get the same vision. After what he has told me i have no desire to sleep. But i must for the good of the order.... \n This Vison is unlike any i have ever seen before. It has terrifed me of what is to come. John tells me Petyr has also had this same Vision. I can only hope what i have seen does not come True.", ""),
        StaticBook("Valas's Poem of Nature", "urpenguin", "Water flowing in the rivers with elegance Silky flowers swaying in the wind animals all over this land blessed with the gift of living if the beauty of lifes giving this land is a temple we should worship not destroy with selfish humanity the oceans shatter my mind and deserts attack my heart these are all living peices of art", ""),
        StaticBook("Valenwood Real Estate", "DRAGON117op", "House 1: \n \nHouse 2: \n \nHouse 3: \n \nHouse 4: \n \nHouse 5: \n \nHouse 6: \n \nShop 1: \n \n \n \nShop 3: \n \nStall 1: \n \nStall 2: \n \nOffice 1: \n \n  Shop 2: \n \nElven 1:", ""),
        StaticBook("Valon's Diary", "Valon_Oakheart", "Dear Diary Today I got a crappy house yay better then living in the wilds where te creatures come out and kill poor unprepared people. O well sucks for them anyway I stored me stuff and went min'in for all sorts of gold and diamonds. After the death of my father by rocks cav'in in on him, min'in was hard at first but I got the hang of it after my first iron discovery. Day and night I would mine hope'in to catch a break and find iron so I could afford to get a piece of bread. To settle my stomach while I sleep on the cold stone floor. A bunch of us battled wit te undead many died I manged to get out with only a broken arm and a scare on my leg.", ""),
        StaticBook("Valon's Poetry", "Valon_Oakheart", "Rose's be red creepers be green yer face is so strange it looks like a bean! The zombies draw close but your not here, I fear that we cannot be. Your eye's are like the white of a skele but your heart is as big as a creeper blast. * looks around awkwardly umm can I think about it umm can I think about it", ""),
