        StaticBook("War Journal", "Kingalric3", "Finally! The High prince is making plans for war on Al'Khazar the Humans of Oren will feel the wrath of the elves they have taken advantage of for so long. I have been enlisted as a spy to keep and eye on the guards of their cities, after hearing their involvement in the fall of Alstion, their own city! The task ahead of me is a dangerous one but I must let my lords know of the tresonous humans' plans. The Undead and humans are in league i'm sure of it, why else would their \"King\" and the Undead Overlord and Prophet fall before the hands of one wizard? It seems their treachery knows no bounds. I do not speak treason to the human crown I speak patriotism to my elven council. For the glory of Malinor!", ""),
