        StaticBook("Warden Meeting II Notes", "Ranovak", "\n New Rank: Veteran Guard, promotions will be given out on the board \n Building Projects: Train station from Warden Base to Jail, move and expand tree farm, new tent sect. \n Diplomatic News: At war with humans, allies are orcs, weary of dwarves (not the best relations). High tension between many of the leaders. Lookout for undead as well as traitors. \n Other news and etc: READ THE RULES,initiates CANNOT arrest, Warden tournament where warden champion. Champion will be announced and represent wardens at contests. Also as an arena when one is commited to it as a punishment for their crimes. Wardens represented as a whole when not at base. Proud of this and prove each othe worthy. Wardens are the strongest guild. \n Promotions: Casus, OniKenji, Volas, Jayek, Elessar, Gwahir, Bayron are promoted to Veteran Guard. *nods solemnly. \n The Warden Champion is: Leafwind Yes casusÉ", ""),
