        StaticBook("Warden:Department of Knowledge", "Ranovak", "I, Noble Amras, wish to start this department in the wardens. It will be responsible for Archiving and researching knowledge such as alchemy and reports. The department will consist of two parts: the library and the lab. The library is the public portion and the lab the underground portion. Amras will overlook the project and will be called Head Scribe. A squad of 3+1 wardens will be part of the department. This will consist of one waywatcher and three guards. It will archive books of both entertainment and reports. The department will also make potions, do research on farming, animals, physics, and literature. The following people will be considered for the department: \n Head Scribe: Amras :; Assistant Scribe: Durzio Scholars: Casus, OniKenji, Elessar", ""),
        StaticBook("Wardens harassing me...", "saromon50", "The Wardens are now threatening me, and takeing what supplies I have left. The have given me no food, and I am left in the dark The accuse me of tresspassing when I am outside the gate, and say I threatend them! And now they take all of my armor and are handing it around to other members.", ""),
