        StaticBook("Watch out for the Banhammer", "CaptainRedHead", "My Name is Galh. And i was banned for X-Raying. Though i didnt X-Ray. but there isnt any way To prove it. So i went to the forums and asked for a unban at the Ban Appeals. I'm still kind of waiting for a anwser. But i kind of know. ShiftNative banned me. He is a GM. And he wont unban me because he still thinks that I am a X-Rayer. And now im desperate. i will tell the story how I am banned. I was mining in the Mines of the Grand Kal'Alras. but everywhere was mined. so i could hardly find any ores. but as i went deeper and farder into the mines, I found more ores. and then there was another big long walkway. You could also say stripmine, i randomly started mining on the side of the wall. and then i got to gravel, i seriously hate gravel. so i just dug beneeth it. and i got to diamond. 4 diamond. but i also got to bedrock so i just climbed up. and searched for another spot to dig. but then shiftnative saw that i left that little hole and that i got 4 diamond. and he thought that it was a x-Ray so we had a big discussion and then he just said.. (( BYE BYE :D )) (( Banhammer)) (( HAHA )) i really dont like him now he said that.  that is not nice though role play. and i know it was OOC but still thats not how you talk in this server. ecpesially not as a GM. I hope i will be unbanned so that i can enter this beautiful world again once. untill then. Farewell A Royal Guard of Kal' Urguan.. Galh", ""),
        StaticBook("Watching Alkhazar.", "Improvsior", "My name is Darfin. As mane people know I always stand near the Alkhaar main gate. In thie book I write all the things I see there. Since I stand here at the Alkhazar main gate were there some attacks of the undead. It all started with a guy named John. John was a Oren guard. When he suddenly got cursed by a fire. The fire at the orphanage. He possesed by dark magic. He vomited blood and was very aggresive. Many have tried to cure him. And so many have failed. Till it became uncontrolable. He got cured by guy in a black robe. When John was possesed. He was talking about a lord he had to serve. He walked to guys in purple robes asking them if they could help him out of his missary. Since guys in purple robes are seen as undead. He may be possesed by one of them. After John was cured. Hasn't he been spotted in Alkhazar. After this happening. Their wasn't any interesting. So i went with the guards on patrol. Till we met this strange guy in Whisper Isle. I same him with a other guy. Later we new that that other guy was an undead. After we met this guy. He became a recently visitor of Alkhazar. When he came he was always aking people to challenge him. No one really accepted it. Words that no one ever understanded. He spoke of. He said he was praying to Iblees. After many visits I asked his name. He said Cerrawin Menethil. When Cerrawin comes to the gate. Is he denied to enter. Somehow I always gets in the city. When he is not in Alkhazar he meets with an undead in whisper isle. I see him a lot on the king's road when I travel. About his undead friend. Sometimes he comes by. We have killed the undead many times. Also his supporter. But they keep coming. I noticed that the undead keep getting more and more supporters. But I never see any new undead. Maybe cause of rules. Or cause the undead uses the supporters as slaves. Also since the undead attacks Alkhazar in small numbers. After these small attacks there came a big one. The undead were attacking Alstion. When the guards arrived were they to late. The undead already demolished the gates. So the guards had to find in the center of the city. But they werent alone. The pathfinders, Guardians from Kal'Alras ,Pinrcess Arianna ,The Orcs and even the wizard himself came to help. It was a tough battle. But the Humand Kingdom came to a victory. Now Oren is preparing for another battle. And they will fight against the undead again. But who knows if they will succeed again? ;; I hope there will come a new book soon with more happenings and battles. I hope you liked the book. Their will be more books from me. About facts and tales. ;; (( I am sorry that I didn't use correct grammar all the time but I hope you understand it)", ""),
