        StaticBook("Water Flows", "Thistel", "Water Flows where no man dare go. \n Water flows in mystic lands unknown. \n Water flows on mountains covered by snow. \n Water is one but is never alone. \n \n Water roars as it crashes against ships. \n Water smiles as it touches parched lips. \n Water sighs as it sees the children grow old. \n Water frowns as it watches battles unfold. \n Water does no wish to see our unknown downfall. \n But water knows it will be there to see it all.", ""),
