        StaticBook("Were it so easy", "OmtraSpectral", "Alas the day hath come. Reflection and meditation cleanse my mind so, but resolute not I am. To learn and not want more, tis but against the nature of the dwarf, our greed protudes in our pride . Inner motives of greed underline my knowledge, ever so I have supped full of horrors. Ere I could resist, Undead greeted me in their realm. My curiosity twas aroused, for they spoke of matters unknown to thine own ear. For many it was power, others immortality. Unlike many my motives alone were unique and I entered wi th out the gift of fatality Why was this so... Time continues, its marvel unchangeable. All the remains , for Iblees or for Aeriel", ""),
        StaticBook("Wesley Sucks Dick", "Payne2225", "Wesley Gue, a lonely sort of fella, was walking down 5th avenue in Huntington, WV. He came upon a man sitting on the curb in very tattered clothing. He asked, \"My good man...are you alright? Is there anything I can do for you?\" The man replies in a very high pitched womanly voice, \"I got deez cheeeeezeburgers, man! I'll suck yo' dick!\" Wesley, who at first was freaked put by the man's outburst, eventually succomb to his lonely ways and let the man suck his shrimpy-ass dick. \nTo this very day, Wesley still dreams of that wonderful night he shared with a comeplete stranger. It makes him happy to relive that event during his daily shower. \nThe End.", ""),
