        StaticBook("What is Metagaming/PlayerKill", "turret001", "What is Metagaming/Playerkill Hello, I'm Goblin, writer of this book I would like to say this book is generally OOC \n Metagaming: Metagaming is using OOC information in IC situations \n OOC: Out of characther   |   IC: In Characther  \n \n  \n Playerkill. \n Playerkill is dieing basicially. But there is one rule. You will lose your recent memory, Your killer, Where were you, ETC. \n  \n Thanks for reading this book, hope it was helpful! \n Sincerely ; \n -Goblin.", ""),
        StaticBook("What is OOC | IC", "turret001", "Hello! This book is about usage of OOC and IC! \n -- IC \n IC is short type of  \"In Characther\", Which is you talk like your characther in minecraft. You are not allowed to use Smilies, 1337 speak, Lol,Wtf,OMG and ETc. IC Speak is like in Real life talking. \n -- Examples for IC talking. \n \"Hello Sir, How are you today!\" \n \"May i have an ale please.\" \n \"What time is it sir?\" \n \"Which way is going to Oren?\" \n And Many.", ""),
