        StaticBook("Wind", "Undeelad", "Wind, an element of Destruction and Peace. Such harmful winds can tear down the whole temple of Krug... And some winds bless the orcs of Sanhar. Wind is both disastrous and peaceful. My balcony surveys the wind always. LorThane brothren.", ""),
        StaticBook("Winter Comes(Poem)", "Blackdragonhole", "A sparkle of white falls from the sky Glistening right between your eyes It lands on your nose You feel the cold of it as you begin to shiver", ""),
        StaticBook("Winter Retreat", "SapphireShard", "This is our small rest post. Please enjoy it. -Freya, Gabriel", ""),
