        StaticBook("Word Of Jack Mercy", "Drakoranok", "We are children of chaos. The chil;dren... of chaos... Your next target The next soul that lies in the way of the path to visctory and ethernal corruption Lies in the blood of the ones who seem so kind. Messengers, traitors, men and women that need to die. Kill them. Kill the all. BEFORE ALL THAT!: The cities will fall... JACK!", ""),
