        StaticBook("Wut da spirits say ta me in da verge", "mingsly", "i be out of da cave and on a puny island", ""),
        StaticBook("wut da sprits said ta me (Glurg_Howdan)", "mingsly", "da spirt of da trees be speaking to me while i sit in da twiggy city. It be night and dere be noone dat i can see. Da spirit calls to me and tells me dat \"Being a shaman will be hard but take it serously and be a great shaman.\" i no know wut dis meant but while i was dinking da spirit spoke again. It said \"Life is hard but with the power of the spirits you will be harder\" at dis i giggled and da spirit left. I den left da twiggy city to fight some monsters. after dat i went to Krugmar when dey strated to talk again. dey said dings like \"Thunder is only powerful when you use it right\" and \"if things go wrong don't panic as the spirits are here\" i went to da rena and i saw dem sat on da cactuss dere was a green one dat giggled den fell off da cactus wit some ale in it's 'and den a blue one rose from da cactus and told me \"follow me orc\" i did as da spirit said and it took me to da slums in sanhar. in da slums da spirit took me to a hut dat said it was brugs hut. Den we went inside in dere was a bed. Da spirit told me to sleep and dat me dreams would tell me wut i wanted to know when i woke up da spirit 'ad gone but da dreams i 'ad 'ad were swimming in me mind .Me dreams 'ad been aload of swirling images of da wargoth in front of me mind. Dis 'ad panicked me but den it 'ad gone into me findin an nice orcsie wut i loved. Da orcsie 'ad been a male orcsie but dis did not worry me, but den da orcsie was killed by da elder shaman. Den i 'ad woken up like i wrote about earlier. I left da 'ut and didn't want ta sleep again. i went to da gypsy camp by da temple to talk to da spirits some more. dey were not dere or just did not want ta talk ta me so i left da camp to find dem again. i found a 'uge bridge dat looked really pretty in da sunset i could fell da spirits dere and da blue one told me to sleep again. as i slept i could 'ear 'igh voices telling me dings da only one dat i could remember said sumting like \"war is not the only answer but sometimes it's the best. Never shy away from it .Feel the power well from you and then unleash it on your enemies. They will not stand the bl ast.\" den dere was a scream but dats all i can remember.", ""),
