        StaticBook("Yorick's Information Log.", "OdinsGungnir", "Well, I've made it. Once I got to the Capital I quickly ran into most of the cities upper class, royalty and such. I also purchased arrows for the guild from Hempshines store. I recommend it, great service. Well well! I just ran in to Dralen! Funny to run into one of the guild here. Ok! Bad news! We've been attacked in the north. AGAIN! I've met with the resistance. the leader says he needs more men to help keep us safe, we need to rally the guild.", ""),
