        StaticBook("zoe", "Lord_Zack", "", ""),
        StaticBook("Zoe's Journal", "friar5", "Ibra, 18th of The First Seed, 1322 I have been named Headagent today, but not without cost. According to Seventh, because im top agent, im not supposed to have a partner. But I think he is just saying that because he wants a new job in the Ravens. The thing about being a lone agent is, its quite lonely work. So, im going to ask for a new Partner anyways. But it does feel good that I have some more authority! :D I wish Seventh was... a little more Romantic. He is planning on becoming a \"Stratagist\" Hope he's good at it, he proball will be. . Today Siaralinde joined the Guild. +1 girl = 3. Woot. Siar is going to be Seventh's new partner, I think, Hope Seventh dosent get any bad ideas with Siar.", ""),
        StaticBook("zombies blood", "bloodnrose", "Bloodnrose turned the corner of the tower he was in. The smell of decay was over powering but he knew he had to press on. He turned on more corner and met a zombie pigman. with sword drawn he rushed in. blood smeared the wall and sweat dripped from his nose as he reshethed hi s sword. \"i must find the general\", he said to himself.", ""),
        StaticBook("Zombies, a Therom", "Pizzafreak5", "The run-of-the-mill, typical, everyday creature, known as the Zombie, poses little threat, even in groups of four or five. They are easy to outrun, making their long reach worthless, and they are weak. It takes but a few good bashes with a good axe, or cuts with a fine sword, to destroy one of these 'monsters'. \n But how much besides how they fight do we know about them? What do they eat? How much do they eat? Do they even NEED to eat? Why do they burst into flames the moment the sun rises? Why do they chase anyone who aproaches them? Are they our own dead? Are they conjured? Do they live? Or are they hollow ,souless shells? \n Through writing this book I hope to establish some Hypothesii on this humble, overlooked, but certainly aggresive, perhaps truely evil creature we call, the Zombie. \n Zombies do not appear to eat. They kill, but they do not eat. They are not living in a sense. They are dead. They are dead, rotting, moving piles of flesh.", ""),
