        StaticBook("~ Archives & Records", "Xanivic", "---- First dy of my record keepings. It is 3 in the evening. I hve discovered  city tht goes by the nme Alrs. I remember hering bout its recent ttck from the Undeds. A locl Hlfling told me there ws no ttck, nd King Algrim of the Dwrven ntion hlted the rid of the wretched Undeds. \n - First dy of Itnn, 9th of Snows Miden, 1322 *Lter in the evening, 5.* \n o The whet fields here in Alrs re lrge nd helthy. \n o Only  few hrvesters/frmers work the fields. \n o The town, s I ws told by the Hlfling, is quite lrge. \n o Within the city wlls, the homes re beutiful. There re lush melon frms s well. \n o Much of the whet grown in the fields goes to the citizens within Alrs. \n - Tolta, 10th of Snows Miden, 1322 *Lter in the evening, 5.* \n o Mutiple clusters of lightning hve once gin struck Aegis. I believe this is the Undeds' work.. \n o It's striking repetitively. It's  form of intimidtion. \n - Tolta, 10th of Snows Miden, 1322 *Lter in the evening, 5.* \n o The town of Kromore ppers destroyed. \n o Flmes still burn throughout the town. \n o A few folk still live here. One of which questioned me why the town ppers destroyed. \n o The sun sets, the lightning perseveres. \n - Sbet, 14th of Snows Miden, 1322. * 9 t night. \n - Ahd, 15th of Snows Miden 1322. \n - Itnn, 16th of Snows Miden, 1322. * 10 PM. \n - It's round 11 PM on Itnn, 16th of Snows Miden, 1332. \n o Krgrum suffered  vicious ttck from Queen Cssndr nd her wretched Unded rmy. \n o Soon fter, the first Druid mrrige occured, tht I ttended. \n - Tolta, 17th of Snows Miden, 1322. \n ~Side Note - I don't believe the wedding is going to turn out s intended.. for some reson I feel for the worst. \n o My prediction ws right on the dot. The wedding ws interrupted by  minion of the Unded. He ws eventully slin yet he tried to convince others into merging with the Unded. \n o One mn ws lso rrested for commiting such  ridiculous crime. \n - Kmees, 19th of Snows Miden, 1322. *12 AM. \n - Jom, 20th of Snows Miden, 1332. * 1 AM. \n - Sbet, 21st of Snows Miden, 1332. * 2AM. \n o An elf ld cme pssing through. He ws heded to Dunwood. \n o The loction of Dunwood, ccording to the elf, is locted northwest of here. \n - Ahd, 22nd of Snows Miden, 1332. \n - Sbet, 14th of Mlins Welcome, 1322. * New dy. 10 AM. \n - Ahd, 15th of Mlins Welcome 1322. \n o In  nmeless town tht I live in, the owner mentioned there hve been predtor sightings. He believes they re wolves. \n o Lst night,  mn told me tht Von Hollow HIMSELF ws  werewolf. \n o Although, Hollow is in denil. \n o Only trces were found. \n o A werewolf ttck hppened twice. I ws ble to fend it off. \n o It seems he only lurks the town t night. \n - Itnn, N/A, 1322. * 11 AM. \n o Von Hollow is cting  bit strnge. \n o He doesn't pper in the villge when the best is bout. \n - Tolta, 17th of Mlins Welcome, 1322. * 12 PM. \n - Tolta, 17th of Mlins Welcome, 1322 * 1 PM. \n - Ibr, 18th of Mlins Welcome, 1322. \n - Kmees, 19th of Mlins Welcome, 1322. * 2 PM. \n o A figure, similr to the looks of n Unded, pssed through the town in serch of  runwy. \n o The Unded dropped  slve log tht I m plcing in the rchives. \n o The werewolf ttcks re frequent t night. \n - N/A \n o The dwrven king, Algrim, is getting mrried tody. \n o I chose not to ttend. \n - Sbet, 21st of Mlins Welcome, 1322. * 5 PM \n - N/A, 1322, 8 PM. \n o Multiple lightning strikes hve occured ner n Unded stronghold, one tht I hve fought t before. \n - Ahd 28th of The Second Seed, 1323. * 7 PM. \n o I ws unble to ctully see the occurnce for myself, but pprently there \n ws n Unded invsion t Klurugn. \n - Jom... the 13th... It's The Amber Cold, 1324. ( Auckes' voice sounds through your ers s you red on. ) \n o Tody, Jom, 13th of The Amber Cold, 1324... Oren held  n occurnce tht will forever be remembered, nd chrished. Tody is the beginning of everlsting hope mongst the people of Aegis. Aeril herself, s well s her children - The Sges, the Ascended - confronted the Unded lords, the superiors of their kind. Iblees' entity touched down, corrupting the city of Oren, nswering his minions' clls. Overlord Tyrion ws deemed unworthy nd ws devoured by the wretched Cssndr. \n o As I gzed upon the figures of the Unded, nd the Ascended, I felt the urge to somehow rise to some sort of power. Some sort of authority. amongst many people. It is unlike me to wish for such  a thing.  \n (( OOC: Side note* For some reason the text in the book is spontaneously becoming typos. ))", ""),
        StaticBook("~ The Outcast ~", "Xanivic", "\n As he wrote his entry, his mind scrambled, his body shivering. He could barely keep his pen still . His thoughts haunted him. Closing the jounral with anger, a tear streaked down his cheek. He couldn't withstand such cruelty, such judgement. \n \"My name is Auckes... and this is the life I had to endure...\" ------------- \n At a young age I had been left in a cabin, nearby Kragrum, the Orc war nation. Abandoned in the small cabin-like home, the only sound was the sound of the cries of the clouds, which pounded the roof. A small candle, lit near the door, hardly brightened the darkened interior of the cabin. The only other light was the glow of the moon that hung in the night sky, watching over me. The addition of my weeping to the rain seemed to have caused some sort of thump near the exterior of the cabin. My crying suddenly  halted as I pondered. A hooded stranger entered through the door, causing the candle's light to fade. The stranger stood tall. Dressed in mostly black leather armor. He walked towards the crib that I rested in.      My eyelids suddenly grew heavy. Nearly falling asleep, he picked me up and looked into my eyes. I felt sudden comfort. I soon fell asleep as the stranger covered me with a tattered cloth-like material, attempting to shield the rain.", ""),
        StaticBook("~ The Tasty Wolf Tavern Menu ~", "Xanivic", "\n o Shallowfield Chicken ( Cooked chicken in melon sauce. ) \n o Eagleson Beef ( Chef's Recipe: Beef cooked with wine and rose essence. ) \n o Porkchop Northern Style ( Fresh pork cooked with mushrooms. ) \n o Granny's Mushroom Soup ( The soup we all ate as children. ) \n o Crispy Bread ( The crispiest bread you'll find in all of Aegis! ) \n ----- Desserts ----- Juicy, Fresh Melons ( The tastiest melons around, grown here in Shallowfield. ) \n Delicious, Crispy Apples ( Carefully picked from the healthiest of all apple trees. ) \n - All meals ( Including an entree and a dessert ) cost 30 minas.", ""),
        StaticBook("~Elotre_Town_History~", "Houstonruss", "Elotre is a small Elf and Human town far outside of Laurelin, the town's founder is  La-tahl. La-tahl is an honest man, looking for a place to call his own. He was exploring one day and came upon a single tree on the top of a hill, the same tree in the center of town today. La-tahl made a small house near this tree and nurtured it to its size today He met several friends in the following two years, those friends then helped make this town into what it is today,-Elotre. The name was derived from distant Elven language as \"Little tree.\" Now 'Little tree' is a hotspot outside of Laurelin, with several unique flavours. ~Elotre history (pt.)~", ""),
        StaticBook("~Eoin's Journal~", "greenmilkweed", "~Sometimes life seems too quiet. . . Into paralyzing silence, Like the moonless dark meant to make me strong. . . \nFamiliar breaht of my old lies, Changed the color in my eyes. . . Soon he will perforate the fabric of the peaceful, by and by. . . Sorrow lasts through this night, I'll take this piece of him and hold for all eternity. . . For just one second I felt whole, as he flew right through me. . . Left alone with only reflections of the memory To face the ugly girl that's smothering me. . . Sitting closer than my pain, he knew each tear before it came. *You see a smothered, blurry splotch ruining some words, leaving drab ink.* \n \n \nSometimes I'm a selfish fake, You're always a true friend. I don't deserve you,  Because I'm not there for you. . . Please forgive me, again. . . *You see another blotch of blurry ink and words on the paper, caused by a tear.* \n I wan't to be there for you, someone you can come to. . . Swirling shades of blue. . . Runs deepar than my bones. . . Slow dancing in his eyes, Sun kisses the earth and I hush my urge to cry. . . *Again, you see another blotch of blurry ink on the paper.* \n \nBecause I hear the whispered words, In his masterpiece beautiful. . . 'I love you, too. . .' I want to be there for you, and be someone you can come to. . . The love runs deeper than my bones, I want to be there for you. . . \n *You see a few places in the knotting of the book, where paper has been torn out* I've been inspired. . . In the dark, oh in the dark. . . I hide myself, in the dark, in the dark. . . My flaws hide well here. . . Now I am mute, despite myself. . . Now all of them are gone. . . The silence overtakes me. . . The idle words forsake me. And I am left to face me. Now I'm held accountable, for every idle word. . . Curse the idle words! Forsaken here, by the dark. . . By the dark. . . *You see a place in the knotting where pages have been ripped out.* \nI saw the queen, Swam out below her star. . . Unseen beneath. Though I lifted up my hands to her, She never lifted me! Oh, Something's missing in me. . . I felt it deep within me,  as lovers left me to bleed, alone. . . \nDown here. . . Love wasn't meant to be. . . It wasn't meant to be. . . Love is vanity, it wasn't meant to be. . . Underneath the sun. . . It wasn't meant to be, All is vanity. . . \n *More pages are ripped out, leaving scars of tearing* \n . . . About how my heart was broken, hammers fall on all the pieces. . . I'm glad for one day of comfort, because I have suffered. . . \n *The next pages are scribbled in an unneat manner, non readable.*", ""),
