        StaticBook("~Thoughts of Lym~", "Lymdil", "I..i don't know who I am.. My..my purpose, the reason why.. It's..it is gone.. ..Thistledown.. ..Crimson Vale.. ..the Keep..   :  Lirinya, or Cara how her immortal friends call her, is the key to my futur and past. I hope that she will be able to help me figuring out who I am and what my purpose is. I've been sleeping for so long..", ""),
